msgid "Security"
msgstr "Slándáil"

msgid ""
"The security checks do not make your site secure. They do not audit code, do "
"intrusion detection, or do anything particularly complex. Rather, they help "
"perform an automated, low-hanging-fruit checklist, that can help you to "
"improve your site's security."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhéanann na seiceálacha slándála do shuíomh slán. Ní dhéanann siad "
"iniúchadh ar chód, ní dhéanann siad braite ionbhrúite, ná ní dhéanann siad "
"aon rud an-chasta. Ina ionad sin, cabhraíonn siad le seicliosta "
"uathoibrithe, torthaí íseal crochta a dhéanamh, a chabhróidh leat slándáil "
"do shuíomh a fheabhsú."

msgid ""
"Some of these checks may not be appropriate for your particular deployment "
"configuration. For instance, if you do your HTTP to HTTPS redirection in a "
"load balancer, it'd be irritating to be constantly warned about not having "
"enabled :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`. "
"Use :setting:`SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS` to silence unneeded checks."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir nach mbeidh cuid de na seiceálacha seo oiriúnach do do chumraíocht "
"imscartha áirithe. Mar shampla, má dhéanann tú d'atreorú HTTP go HTTPS i "
"gcothromaitheoir ualaigh, bheadh sé greannach rabhadh a thabhairt i gcónaí "
"faoi gan cumasú: setting: `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`. Úsáid: SETTING: "
"`SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS` chun seiceálacha neamhriachtanacha a thostú."

msgid ""
"The following checks are run if you use the :option:`check --deploy` option:"
msgstr ""
"Reáchtáiltear na seiceálacha seo a leanas má úsáideann tú an roghna:option: "
"`check --deploy`:"

msgid ""
"**security.W001**: You do not "
"have :class:`django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware` in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` so "
"the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`, :setting:`SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF`, :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`, :setting:`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY`, "
"and :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` settings will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W001**: Níl agat:class: `Django.middleware.securityMiddleware` i "
"d:setting: `MIDDLEWARE` mar sin an:setting: `SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`, :setting: "
"`SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF`, :setting: `SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`, :setting: "
"`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY`, agus:setting: `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` ní "
"bheidh aon éifeacht ag socruithe."

msgid ""
"**security.W002**: You do not "
"have :class:`django.middleware.clickjacking.XFrameOptionsMiddleware` in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`, so your pages will not be served with an ``'x-"
"frame-options'`` header. Unless there is a good reason for your site to be "
"served in a frame, you should consider enabling this header to help prevent "
"clickjacking attacks."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W002**: Níl agat:class: "
"`django.middleware.clickjacking.xframeOptionsMiddleware` i do: setting: "
"`MIDDLEWARE`, mar sin ní sheirbheálfar ceannteideal ``'x-frame-options'` do "
"leathanaigh. Mura bhfuil cúis mhaith ann le do shuíomh a sheirbheáil i "
"bhfráma, ba cheart duit smaoineamh ar an gceannteideal seo a chumasú chun "
"cabhrú le hionsaithe clickjacking a chosc."

msgid ""
"**security.W003**: You don't appear to be using Django's built-in cross-site "
"request forgery protection via the middleware "
"(:class:`django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware` is not in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`). Enabling the middleware is the safest approach "
"to ensure you don't leave any holes."
msgstr ""
"**Security.w003**: Ní cosúil go bhfuil tú ag úsáid cosaint bréagán iarratais "
"tras-láithreáin ionsuite Django tríd an middleware (:class: "
"`django.middleware.csrf.csrfViewMiddleware` níl i d:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`). "
"Is é an midleware a chumasú an cur chuige is sábháilte chun a chinntiú nach "
"bhfágann tú aon phoill."

msgid ""
"**security.W004**: You have not set a value for "
"the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS` setting. If your entire site is served "
"only over SSL, you may want to consider setting a value and "
"enabling :ref:`HTTP Strict Transport Security <http-strict-transport-"
"security>`. Be sure to read the documentation first; enabling HSTS "
"carelessly can cause serious, irreversible problems."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W004**: Níor shocraigh tú luach don socrú: setting: "
"`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`. <http-strict-transport-security>Mura ndéantar do "
"shuíomh iomlán a sheirbheáil ach thar SSL, b'fhéidir gur mhaith leat "
"smaoineamh ar luach a shocrú agus cumasú:ref: `HTTP Slándáil Iompair Docht "
"`. Bí cinnte an doiciméadú a léamh ar dtús; d'fhéadfadh fadhbanna "
"tromchúiseacha, dochúisithe a bheith ina chúis le"

msgid ""
"**security.W005**: You have not set "
"the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS` setting to ``True``. Without "
"this, your site is potentially vulnerable to attack via an insecure "
"connection to a subdomain. Only set this to ``True`` if you are certain that "
"all subdomains of your domain should be served exclusively via SSL."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W005**: Níor shocraigh tú an socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS` go ``True``. Gan seo, d'fhéadfadh do "
"shuíomh a bheith leochaileach d'ionsaí trí nasc neamhchinnte le fo-fhearann. "
"Socraigh é seo go “True” ach má tá tú cinnte gur chóir gach fofhearann de do "
"fhearann a sheirbheáil go heisiach trí SSL."

msgid ""
"**security.W006**: Your :setting:`SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF` setting is "
"not set to ``True``, so your pages will not be served with an ``'X-Content-"
"Type-Options: nosniff'`` header. You should consider enabling this header to "
"prevent the browser from identifying content types incorrectly."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W006**: Níl socrú do: SETTING: `SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF` "
"socraithe go ``True``, mar sin ní sheirbheálfar ceannteideal ``'X-Content-"
"Type-Options: nosniff`` do leathanaigh. Ba chóir duit smaoineamh ar an "
"gceannteideal seo a chumasú chun an brabhsálaí a chosc ó chineál"

msgid ""
"**security.W007**: Your ``SECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER`` setting is not set to "
"``True``, so your pages will not be served with an ``'X-XSS-Protection: 1; "
"mode=block'`` header. You should consider enabling this header to activate "
"the browser's XSS filtering and help prevent XSS attacks. *This check is "
"removed in Django 3.0 as the* ``X-XSS-Protection`` *header is no longer "
"honored by modern browsers.*"
msgstr ""
"**Security.W007**: Níl do shocrú ``SECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER`` socraithe go "
"``True``, mar sin ní sheirbheálfar ceannteideal ```X-XSS: 1; mod=bloc`` do "
"leathanaigh. Ba cheart duit smaoineamh ar an gceannteideal seo a chumasú "
"chun scagadh XSS an bhrabhsálaí a ghníomhachtú agus cuidiú le hi * Baintear "
"an seiceáil seo i Django 3.0 mar ní thuilleann brabhsálaí nua-aimseartha "
"onóir ar cheannteanntáir* ``X-XSS-Protection`` * a thuilleadh. *"

msgid ""
"**security.W008**: Your :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` setting is not set to "
"``True``. Unless your site should be available over both SSL and non-SSL "
"connections, you may want to either set this setting to ``True`` or "
"configure a load balancer or reverse-proxy server  to redirect all "
"connections to HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W008**: do: SETTING: Níl an socrú `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` socraithe "
"go ``True``. Mura chóir go mbeadh do shuíomh ar fáil thar naisc SSL agus "
"neamh-SSL araon, b'fhéidir gur mhaith leat an socrú seo a shocrú go ``True`` "
"nó cothromóir ualaigh nó freastalaí seachfhreastalaí seachfhreastalaí a "
"chumrú chun gach nasc a atreorú chuig HTTPS."

msgid ""
"**security.W009**: Your :setting:`SECRET_KEY` has less than 50 characters, "
"less than 5 unique characters, or it's prefixed with ``'django-insecure-'`` "
"indicating that it was generated automatically by Django. Please generate a "
"long and random value, otherwise many of Django's security-critical features "
"will be vulnerable to attack."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W009**: Tá níos lú ná 50 carachtar ag your:SETTING: `SECRET_KEY`, "
"níos lú ná 5 charachtar uathúla, nó tá sé réamhshocraithe le ``django-"
"insecure-'`` a léiríonn gur ghin Django é go huathoibríoch. Gin luach fada "
"randamach le do thoil, ar shlí eile beidh go leor de ghnéithe criticiúla "
"slándála Django leochaileach ó ionsaí."

msgid ""
"**security.W010**: You have :mod:`django.contrib.sessions` in "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` but you have not "
"set :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` to ``True``. Using a secure-only "
"session cookie makes it more difficult for network traffic sniffers to "
"hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W010**: Tá agat:mod: `django.contrib.sessions` i d:setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS` ach níl socraí:setting: `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` chuig "
"``True``. Má úsáideann fianán seisiúin slán amháin, bíonn sé níos deacra do "
"shniffers tráchta líonra seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W011**: You "
"have :class:`django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware` in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`, but you have not "
"set :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` to ``True``. Using a secure-only "
"session cookie makes it more difficult for network traffic sniffers to "
"hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W011**: Tá aicme: "
"`Django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware` agat:setting: "
"`MIDDLEWARE`, ach níl socraí:setting: `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` go `True``. Má "
"úsáideann fianán seisiúin slán amháin, bíonn sé níos deacra do shniffers "
"tráchta líonra seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W012**: :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` is not set to ``True``. "
"Using a secure-only session cookie makes it more difficult for network "
"traffic sniffers to hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.w012**: :setting: Níl `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` socraithe go "
"``True``. Má úsáideann fianán seisiúin slán amháin, bíonn sé níos deacra do "
"shniffers tráchta líonra seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W013**: You have :mod:`django.contrib.sessions` in "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`, but you have not "
"set :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` to ``True``. Using an ``HttpOnly`` "
"session cookie makes it more difficult for cross-site scripting attacks to "
"hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W013**: Tá agat:mod: `django.contrib.sessions` i d:setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS`, ach níl socraí:setting: `SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` go "
"``True``. Trí úsáid a bhaint as fianán seisiúin `HttpOnly`, bíonn sé níos "
"deacra d'ionsaithe scripteála tras-láithreáin seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W014**: You "
"have :class:`django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware` in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`, but you have not "
"set :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` to ``True``. Using an ``HttpOnly`` "
"session cookie makes it more difficult for cross-site scripting attacks to "
"hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W014**: Tá aicme: "
"`Django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware` agat:setting: "
"`MIDDLEWARE`, ach níl socraí:setting: `SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` chuig "
"`True``. Trí úsáid a bhaint as fianán seisiúin `HttpOnly`, bíonn sé níos "
"deacra d'ionsaithe scripteála tras-láithreáin seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W015**: :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` is not set to "
"``True``. Using an ``HttpOnly`` session cookie makes it more difficult for "
"cross-site scripting attacks to hijack user sessions."
msgstr ""
"**Security.w015**: :setting: Níl `SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` socraithe go "
"``True``. Trí úsáid a bhaint as fianán seisiúin `HttpOnly`, bíonn sé níos "
"deacra d'ionsaithe scripteála tras-láithreáin seisiúin úsáideora a fhuadadh."

msgid ""
"**security.W016**: :setting:`CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE` is not set to ``True``. "
"Using a secure-only CSRF cookie makes it more difficult for network traffic "
"sniffers to steal the CSRF token."
msgstr ""
"**Security.w016**: :setting: Níl `CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE` socraithe go ``True``. "
"Má úsáideann fianán CSRF slán amháin, bíonn sé níos deacra do shniffers "
"tráchta líonra an comhartha CSRF a ghoid."

msgid ""
"**security.W017**: :setting:`CSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` is not set to ``True``. "
"Using an ``HttpOnly`` CSRF cookie makes it more difficult for cross-site "
"scripting attacks to steal the CSRF token. *This check is removed in Django "
"1.11 as the* :setting:`CSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` *setting offers no practical "
"benefit.*"
msgstr ""
"**Security.w017**: :setting: Níl `CSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` socraithe go "
"``True``. Trí úsáid a bhaint as fianán CSRF ``HttpOnly`` bíonn sé níos "
"deacra d'ionsaithe scripteála tras-láithreáin an comhartha CSRF a ghoid. * "
"Baintear an seiceáil seo i Django 1.11 mar níl aon sochar praiticiúil ar "
"fáil an*:socrú: `CSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY` *. *"

msgid ""
"**security.W018**: You should not have :setting:`DEBUG` set to ``True`` in "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W018**: Níor chóir go mbeadh: socrú: `DEBUG` socraithe go "
"``True`` ag imscaradh."

msgid ""
"**security.W019**: You "
"have :class:`django.middleware.clickjacking.XFrameOptionsMiddleware` in "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`, but :setting:`X_FRAME_OPTIONS` is not set to "
"``'DENY'``. Unless there is a good reason for your site to serve other parts "
"of itself in a frame, you should change it to ``'DENY'``."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W019**: Tá agat:class: "
"`django.middleware.clickjacking.xframeOptionsMiddleware` i do: setting: "
"`MIDDLEWARE`, ac:setting: `X_FRAME_OPTIONS` socraithe go ``'DENY'`. Mura "
"bhfuil cúis mhaith ann le do shuíomh freastal ar chodanna eile de féin i "
"bhfráma, ba cheart duit é a athrú go ``DENY'`."

msgid ""
"**security.W020**: :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS` must not be empty in deployment."
msgstr ""
"**Security.w020**: :setting: Níor chóir go mbeadh `ALLOWED_HOSTS` folamh i "
"imscaradh."

msgid ""
"**security.W021**: You have not set the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` "
"setting to ``True``. Without this, your site cannot be submitted to the "
"browser preload list."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W021**: Níor shocraigh tú an socrú:setting: `SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` "
"go ``True``. Gan seo, ní féidir do shuíomh a chur isteach chuig liosta "
"réamhluchtaithe an bhrabhsálaí."

msgid ""
"**security.W022**: You have not set the :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` "
"setting. Without this, your site will not send a Referrer-Policy header. You "
"should consider enabling this header to protect user privacy."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W022**: Níor shocraigh tú an socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`. Gan seo, ní sheolfaidh do shuíomh ceannteideal "
"Atreora-Polasaí. Ba chóir duit smaoineamh ar an gceannteideal seo a chumasú "
"chun príobháide"

msgid ""
"**security.E023**: You have set the :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` "
"setting to an invalid value."
msgstr ""
"**SECURITY.E023**: Tá an socrú:setting: `SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` socraithe "
"agat go luach neamhbhailí."

msgid ""
"**security.E024**: You have set "
"the :setting:`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY` setting to an invalid value."
msgstr ""
"**SECURITY.E024**: Tá socrú agata:setting: "
"`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY` socraithe agat go luach neamhbhailí."

msgid ""
"**security.W025**: Your :setting:`SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS[n] "
"<SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS>` has less than 50 characters, less than 5 unique "
"characters, or it's prefixed with ``'django-insecure-'`` indicating that it "
"was generated automatically by Django. Please generate a long and random "
"value, otherwise many of Django's security-critical features will be "
"vulnerable to attack."
msgstr ""
"**Security.W025**: Tá níos lú ná <SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS>50 carachtar, níos lú "
"ná 5 charachtar uathúla ag your:SETTING: `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS [n] `, nó tá "
"sé réamhshocraithe le ``'django-insecure-'`` a léiríonn gur ghin Django é go "
"huathoibríoch. Gin luach fada randamach le do thoil, ar shlí eile beidh go "
"leor de ghnéithe criticiúla slándála Django leochaileach ó ionsaí."

msgid ""
"The following checks verify that your security-related settings are "
"correctly configured:"
msgstr ""
"Fíoraíonn na seiceálacha seo a leanas go bhfuil do shocruithe a bhaineann le "
"slándáil cumraithe i gceart"

msgid ""
"**security.E100**: ``DEFAULT_HASHING_ALGORITHM`` must be ``'sha1'`` or "
"``'sha256'``. *This check appeared in Django 3.1 and 3.2*."
msgstr ""
"**Security.e100**: caithfidh ```DEFAULT_HASHING_ALGORITHM`` a bheith "
"```sha1'`` nó ```sha256'`. * Bhí an seiceáil seo le feiceáil i Django 3.1 "
"agus 3.2*."

msgid ""
"**security.E101**: The CSRF failure view ``'path.to.view'`` does not take "
"the correct number of arguments."
msgstr ""
"**Security.E101**: Ní ghlacann an dearcadh teip CSRF ```path.to.view'` an "
"líon ceart argóintí."

msgid ""
"**security.E102**: The CSRF failure view ``'path.to.view'`` could not be "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"**Security.E102**: Ní fhéadfaí an dearcadh teip CSRF ```path.to.view'` a "
"allmhairiú."

msgid "Signals"
msgstr "Comharthaí"

msgid ""
"**signals.E001**: ``<handler>`` was connected to the ``<signal>`` signal "
"with a lazy reference to the sender ``<app label>.<model>``, but app ``<app "
"label>`` isn't installed or doesn't provide model ``<model>``."
msgstr ""
"<app label>**Signals.E001**: Bhí ```` ceangailte leis an g "
"<handler>comhartha ```` le tagairt leisciúil don seol <signal>tóir ``. "
"<model><model>``, ach níl an aip<app label>`` `suiteáilte nó ní "
"sholáthraíonn sé samhail ```."

msgid "Templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid"

msgid ""
"The following checks verify that your :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting is "
