msgid "Base views"
msgstr "Tuairimí bonn"

msgid ""
"The following three classes provide much of the functionality needed to "
"create Django views. You may think of them as *parent* views, which can be "
"used by themselves or inherited from. They may not provide all the "
"capabilities required for projects, in which case there are Mixins and "
"Generic class-based views."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn na trí rang seo a leanas cuid mhaith den fheidhmiúlacht a "
"theastaíonn chun radhairc Django a chruth Féadfaidh tú smaoineamh orthu mar "
"thuairimí tuismitheoir*, ar féidir leo féin a úsáid nó iad a oidhreacht "
"uathu. Ní fhéadfaidh siad na cumais go léir a theastaíonn le haghaidh "
"tionscadail a sholáthar, agus sa chás sin tá tuairimí Meascins agus "
"Cineálacha bunaithe ar aicme ann."

msgid ""
"Many of Django's built-in class-based views inherit from other class-based "
"views or various mixins. Because this inheritance chain is very important, "
"the ancestor classes are  documented under the section title of **Ancestors "
"(MRO)**. MRO is an acronym for Method Resolution Order."
msgstr ""
"Tá go leor de na tuairimí rang-bhunaithe ionsuite Django ag oidhreacht ó "
"thuairimí rang-bhunaithe eile nó meascáin éagsúla. Toisc go bhfuil an "
"slabhra oidhreachta seo an-tábhachtach, déantar na ranganna sinsear a "
"dhoiciméadú faoin teideal ranna**Sinsear (MRO) **. Is acrainm é MRO d'Ordú "
"Réitigh Modh."

msgid "``View``"
msgstr "``Amharc``"

msgid ""
