"class. It isn't strictly a generic view and thus can also be imported from "
"``django.views``."
msgstr ""
"An rang amharc bonn. Tá gach tuairim eile bunaithe ar rang-bhunaithe ag "
"oidhreacht ón rang bonn seo. Ní dearcadh cineálach é go docht agus dá bhrí "
"sin is féidir é a allmhairiú ó `django.views`."

