"arguments :ref:`captured from the URL pattern <how-django-processes-a-"
"request>` to the ``args`` and ``kwargs`` attributes, respectively. "
"Then :meth:`dispatch` is called."
msgstr ""
"<how-django-processes-a-request>Nuair a thugtar an radharc le linn an "
"timthriall iarrata/freagartha, sannann an modh:meth: `setup` an modh:class: "
"`~django.http.http.httpRequest` do thréith ``request`` an radharc, agus aon "
"argóintí seasaimh agus/nó eochairfhoir:ref: `gabhadh ón bpatrún URL` go dtí "
"na tréithe `args`` agus `kwargs`` faoi seach. Ansin: Meth: tugtar “seoladh”."

msgid ""
"If a ``View`` subclass defines asynchronous (``async def``) method handlers, "
"``as_view()`` will mark the returned callable as a coroutine function. An "
"``ImproperlyConfigured`` exception will be raised if both asynchronous "
"(``async def``) and synchronous (``def``) handlers are defined on a single "
"view-class."
msgstr ""
"Má shainmhíníonn fo-aicme ``View`` láimhseálaithe modh asincrónacha (``async "
"def``), marcálfaidh ``as_view () ``an glaoch ar ais mar fheidhm coroutine. "
"Ardófar eisceacht ``ImproperlyConfigured`` má shainmhínítear láimhseálaithe "
"asincrónach (``async def``) agus sioncrónach (`def``) araon ar rang amharc "
"amháin."

msgid "Performs key view initialization prior to :meth:`dispatch`."
msgstr "Déanann sé tionscnamh eochair radharc roimh: meth: `sheoladh `."

msgid ""
"Assigns the :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest` to the view's ``request`` "
"attribute, and any positional and/or keyword arguments :ref:`captured from "
"the URL pattern <how-django-processes-a-request>` to the ``args`` and "
"``kwargs`` attributes, respectively."
msgstr ""

msgid "If overriding this method, you must call ``super()``."
msgstr "Má tá an modh seo á shárú agat, ní mór duit glaoch ar ``super () ``."

msgid ""
"The ``view`` part of the view -- the method that accepts a ``request`` "
"argument plus arguments, and returns an HTTP response."
msgstr ""
"An chuid ``tuairim`` den tuairim -- an modh a ghlacann le argóint ``iarrat`` "
"móide argóintí, agus a thugann freagra HTTP ar ais."

msgid ""
"The default implementation will inspect the HTTP method and attempt to "
"delegate to a method that matches the HTTP method; a ``GET`` will be "
"delegated to ``get()``, a ``POST`` to ``post()``, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Déanfaidh an cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe iniúchadh ar an modh HTTP agus "
"déanfaidh sé iarracht é a tharmligean chuig modh a mheaitseálann leis an "
"modh HTTP; tarmligfear ``GET`` chuig `get () ``,`` POST ```` `post () ``, "
"agus mar sin de."

msgid ""
"By default, a ``HEAD`` request will be delegated to ``get()``. If you need "
"to handle ``HEAD`` requests in a different way than ``GET``, you can "
"override the ``head()`` method. See :ref:`supporting-other-http-methods` for "
"an example."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, tarmligfear iarratas ``HEAD`` chuig ``get () ``. "
"Más gá duit iarratais ``HEAD`` a láimhseáil ar bhealach difriúil ná ``GET``, "
"is féidir leat an modh ``head () ``a shárú. Féach:ref: `tacaíocht ear-http-"
"methods` mar shampla."

msgid ""
"If the view was called with an HTTP method it doesn't support, this method "
"is called instead."
msgstr ""
"Má ghlaoadh ar an radharc le modh HTTP nach dtacaíonn sé, tugtar an modh seo "
"ina ionad sin."

msgid ""
"The default implementation returns ``HttpResponseNotAllowed`` with a list of "
"allowed methods in plain text."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe ``HttpResponseNotAllowed`` le "
"liosta de na modhanna ceadaithe i ngnáthtéacs."

msgid ""
"Handles responding to requests for the OPTIONS HTTP verb. Returns a response "
"with the ``Allow`` header containing a list of the view's allowed HTTP "
"method names."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann freagra ar iarratais ar an briathar HTTP OPTIONS. Tugann sé "
"freagra ar ais leis an gceannteideal ``Allow ``ina bhfuil liosta "
"d'ainmneacha modh HTTP ceadaithe an amharc."

msgid ""
"If the other HTTP methods handlers on the class are asynchronous (``async "
"def``) then the response will be wrapped in a coroutine function for use "
"with ``await``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá na láimhseálaithe modhanna HTTP eile ar an rang asincrónach (``async "
"def``) ansin filteofar an freagra i bhfeidhm coroutine le húsáid le ```ag "
"fanacht ``."

msgid "``TemplateView``"
msgstr "``TeimpléadView ``"

msgid ""
