msgid "**Context**"
msgstr "**Comhthéacs**"

msgid ""
"Populated (through :class:`~django.views.generic.base.ContextMixin`) with "
"the keyword arguments captured from the URL pattern that served the view."
msgstr ""
"Daonra (trí:class: `~django.views.generic.base.contextMixin`) leis na "
"hargóintí eochairfhocal a ghabhadh ón bpatrún URL a d'fhreastail an dearcadh."

msgid ""
"You can also add context using "
"the :attr:`~django.views.generic.base.ContextMixin.extra_context` keyword "
"argument for :meth:`~django.views.generic.base.View.as_view`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat comhthéacs a chur leis freisin ag baint úsáide as an argóint "
"eochairfhocal: attr: `~django.views.generic.base.contextMixin.extra_context` "
"le haghaidh: meth: `~django.views.generic.base.view.as_view`."

msgid "``RedirectView``"
msgstr "``Redirectview``"

msgid "Redirects to a given URL."
msgstr "Atreoraíonn sé chuig URL ar leith."

msgid ""
"The given URL may contain dictionary-style string formatting, which will be "
"interpolated against the parameters captured in the URL. Because keyword "
"interpolation is *always* done (even if no arguments are passed in), any "
"``\"%\"`` characters in the URL must be written as ``\"%%\"`` so that Python "
"will convert them to a single percent sign on output."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh formáidiú teaghrán i stíl foclóra san URL a thugtar, a "
"dhéanfar idirphóladh i gcoinne na bparaiméadair a ghabhadh san URL. Toisc go "
"ndéantar idirpháirtíocht eochairfhocal i gcónaí* (fiú mura ndéantar aon "
"argóintí isteach), ní mór aon charachtair ``\"%\"`` sa URL a scríobh mar "
"``\"%%\"`` ionas go ndéanfaidh Python iad a thiontú go comhartha faoin gcéad "
"amháin ar aschur."

msgid ""
"If the given URL is ``None``, Django will return an ``HttpResponseGone`` "
"(410)."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``None ``an URL a thugtar, cuirfidh Django ``HttpResponseGone`` (410) "
"ar ais."

msgid "This view inherits methods and attributes from the following view:"
msgstr ""
"Oidhreann an dearcadh seo modhanna agus tréithe ón radharc seo a leanas:"

msgid ":meth:`get_redirect_url()`"
msgstr ":meth: `get_redirect_url () `"

msgid ""
"The URL to redirect to, as a string. Or ``None`` to raise a 410 (Gone) HTTP "
"error."
msgstr ""
"An URL le atreorú chuig, mar shreang. Nó ``None ``chun earráid HTTP 410 "
"(Iomte) a ardú."

msgid ""
"The name of the URL pattern to redirect to. Reversing will be done using the "
"same args and kwargs as are passed in for this view."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an phatrún URL le atreorú chuig. Déanfar aisiompú ag baint úsáide as na "
"hargaí agus na kwargs céanna a chuirtear isteach don dearcadh seo."

msgid ""
"Whether the redirect should be permanent. The only difference here is the "
"HTTP status code returned. If ``True``, then the redirect will use status "
"code 301. If ``False``, then the redirect will use status code 302. By "
"default, ``permanent`` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Cibé an chóir go mbeadh an t-atreorú buan. Is é an t-aon difríocht anseo ná "
"an cód stádais HTTP ar ais. Má tá ``True``, ansin úsáidfidh an t-atreorú cód "
"stádais 301. Má tá ``False``, úsáidfidh an t-atreorú cód stádais 302. De "
"réir réamhshocraithe, is é ``buan`` `False``."

msgid ""
"Whether to pass along the GET query string to the new location. If ``True``, "
"then the query string is appended to the URL. If ``False``, then the query "
"string is discarded. By default, ``query_string`` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Cibé an gcaithfidh tú dul ar feadh an sreangán fiosrúcháin GET chuig an "
"suíomh nua. Má tá ``True``, ansin cuirtear an teaghrán fiosrúcháin leis an "
"URL. Má tá ``False``, cuirtear an teaghrán fiosrúcháin a chaitheamh. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é ``query_string`` ``False``."

msgid "Constructs the target URL for redirection."
msgstr "Tógann sé an spriocURL le haghaidh athatreorú."

msgid ""
"The ``args`` and ``kwargs`` arguments are positional and/or keyword "
"arguments :ref:`captured from the URL pattern <how-django-processes-a-"
"request>`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"<how-django-processes-a-request>Is argóintí seasaimh agus/nó eochairfhocal "
"iad na hargóintí `args`` agus ``kwargs``: ref: `gabhadh ón bpatrún URL`, "
"faoi seach."

msgid ""
"The default implementation uses :attr:`url` as a starting string and "
"performs expansion of ``%`` named parameters in that string using the named "
"groups captured in the URL."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe:attr: `url `mar shreang tosaigh "
"agus déanann sé leathnú paraiméadair ainmnithe ``%`` sa sreang sin ag baint "
"úsáide as na grúpaí ainmnithe a ghabhadh san URL."

msgid ""
"If :attr:`url` is not set, ``get_redirect_url()`` tries to reverse "
"the :attr:`pattern_name` using what was captured in the URL (both named and "
"unnamed groups are used)."
msgstr ""
"Má tá: attr: `url” socraithe, iarrann ``get_redirect_url () ``an: attr: "
"`pattern_name` a aisiompú ag baint úsáide as an méid a gabhadh sa URL "
"(úsáidtear grúpaí ainmnithe agus gan ainmnithe araon)."

msgid ""
"If requested by :attr:`query_string`, it will also append the query string "
"to the generated URL. Subclasses may implement any behavior they wish, as "
"long as the method returns a redirect-ready URL string."
msgstr ""
"Má iarrann: attr: `query_string`, cuirfidh sé an teaghrán fiosrúcháin leis "
"an URL a ghintear freisin. Féadfaidh fo-aicmí aon iompar is mian leo a chur "
"i bhfeidhm, fad is a thabharfaidh an modh sreang URL réidh le hathreorú."

msgid "Class-based generic views - flattened index"
msgstr "Tuairimí cineálacha rang-bhunaithe - innéacs comhréadaithe"

msgid ""
"This index provides an alternate organization of the reference documentation "
"for class-based views. For each view, the effective attributes and methods "
"from the class tree are represented under that view. For the reference "
"documentation organized by the class which defines the behavior, "
"see :doc:`Class-based views</ref/class-based-views/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an t-innéacs seo eagraíocht mhalartach den doiciméad tagartha "
"do thuairimí rangbhunaithe. I gcás gach radharc, léirítear na tréithe agus "
"na modhanna éifeachtacha ón gcrann ranga faoin dearcadh sin. Maidir leis an "
"doiciméadú tagartha arna eagrú ag an rang a shainmhíníonn an t-iompar, "
"féach:doc: `Tuairimí rang-bhunaithe `</ref/class-based-views/index>."

msgid ""
"`Classy Class-Based Views <https://ccbv.co.uk/>`_ provides a nice interface "
"to navigate the class hierarchy of the built-in class-based views."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn `Classy Class-Bound Views`_ comhéadan deas chun nascleanúint a "
"< https://ccbv.co.uk/> dhéanamh ar ordlathas ranga na dtuairimí "
"rangbhunaithe ionsuite."

