msgid ""
"The ``week_format`` attribute is a :func:`~time.strptime` format string used "
"to parse the week number. The following values are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Is é an tréith ``week_format``:: func: `~time.strptime` teaghrán formáid a "
"úsáidtear chun uimhir na seachtaine a pháirseáil. Tacaítear leis na "
"luachanna seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"``'%U'``: Based on the United States week system where the week begins on "
"Sunday. This is the default value."
msgstr ""
"``'%U'``: Bunaithe ar chóras seachtaine na Stát Aontaithe ina dtosaíonn an "
"tseachtain Dé Domhnaigh. Is é seo an luach réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"``'%W'``: Similar to ``'%U'``, except it assumes that the week begins on "
"Monday. This is not the same as the ISO 8601 week number."
msgstr ""
"``'%W'``: Cosúil le ``'%U'``, ach amháin glacann sé leis go dtosaíonn an "
"tseachtain Dé Luain. Níl sé seo mar an gcéanna leis an uimhir seachtaine ISO "
"8601."

msgid "``'%V'``: ISO 8601 week number where the week begins on Monday."
msgstr ""
"``'%V'``: ISO 8601 uimhir seachtaine ina dtosaíonn an tseachtain Dé Luain."

msgid "**Example myapp/article_archive_week.html**:"
msgstr "**Sampla myapp/article_archive_week.html**:"

msgid ""
"In this example, you are outputting the week number. Keep in mind that week "
"numbers computed by the :tfilter:`date` template filter with the ``'W'`` "
"format character are not always the same as those computed "
"by :func:`~time.strftime` and :func:`~time.strptime` with the ``'%W'`` "
"format string. For year 2015, for example, week numbers output "
"by :tfilter:`date` are higher by one compared to those output "
"by :func:`~time.strftime`. There isn't an equivalent for the "
"``'%U'`` :func:`~time.strftime` format string in :tfilter:`date`. Therefore, "
"you should avoid using :tfilter:`date` to generate URLs for "
"``WeekArchiveView``."
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, tá tú ag cur uimhir na seachtaine. Coinnigh i gcuimhne nach "
"bhfuil uimhreacha seachtaine arna ríomh ag an scagaire teimpléad:tfilter: "
"`dáta` leis an gcarachtar formáid ``'W'`` mar an gcéanna i gcónaí leis na "
"huimhreacha a ríomhaítear ar:func: `~time.strftime` agus:func: "
"`~time.strptime` leis an teaghrán formáid ``'%W'`. Maidir le bliain 2015, "
"mar shampla, tá uimhreacha seachtaine a aschuirtear ag: tfilter: `dáta` níos "
"airde ceann amháin i gcomparáid leis na haschuir sin ag: func: "
"`~time.strftime`. Níl coibhéis ann don teaghrán formáid ```'%u'`:func: "
"`~time.strftime` in:tfilter: `dáta`. Dá bhrí sin, ba chóir duit: tfilter: "
