msgid "Thread safety with view arguments"
msgstr "Sábháilteacht snáithe le déanaí"

msgid ""
"Arguments passed to a view are shared between every instance of a view. This "
"means that you shouldn't use a list, dictionary, or any other mutable object "
"as an argument to a view. If you do and the shared object is modified, the "
"actions of one user visiting your view could have an effect on subsequent "
"users visiting the same view."
msgstr ""
"Roinntear argóintí a chuirtear chuig dearcadh idir gach cás de dhearcadh. "
"Ciallaíonn sé seo nár chóir duit liosta, foclóir, nó aon rud inathraithe "
"eile a úsáid mar argóint le dearcadh. Má dhéanann tú agus má athraítear an "
"réad roinnte, d'fhéadfadh tionchar a bheith ag gníomhartha úsáideora amháin "
"a thugann cuairt ar do radharc ar úsáideoirí ina dhiaidh sin a thugann "
"cuairt ar an radharc céanna"

msgid ""
"Arguments passed into :meth:`~django.views.generic.base.View.as_view()` will "
"be assigned onto the instance that is used to service a request. Using the "
"previous example, this means that every request on ``MyView`` is able to use "
"``self.size``. Arguments must correspond to attributes that already exist on "
"the class (return ``True`` on a ``hasattr`` check)."
msgstr ""
"Sannfar argóintí a chuirtear chuig: meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.base.view.as_view () `ar an gcás a úsáidtear chun "
"iarratas a sheirbheáil. Ag baint úsáide as an sampla roimhe seo, ciallaíonn "
"sé seo go bhfuil gach iarratas ar ``MyView`` in ann ``self.size`` a úsáid. "
"Caithfidh argóintí a fhreagraíonn do thréithe atá ann cheana ar an rang "
"(cuir ar ais ``True`` ar sheiceáil ``hasattr`)."

msgid "Base vs Generic views"
msgstr "Bunús vs tuairimí cineálacha"

msgid ""
"Base class-based views can be thought of as *parent* views, which can be "
"used by themselves or inherited from. They may not provide all the "
"capabilities required for projects, in which case there are Mixins which "
"extend what base views can do."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir tuairimí bunaithe ar rang a mheas mar thuairimí tuismitheoir*, ar "
"féidir leo féin a úsáid nó iad a oidhreacht uathu. B'fhéidir nach "
"soláthróidh siad na cumais go léir a theastaíonn le haghaidh tionscadail, "
"agus sa chás sin tá Mixins ann a leathnaíonn na rudaí is féidir le "
"buntuairimí a dhéanamh"

msgid ""
"Django's generic views are built off of those base views, and were developed "
"as a shortcut for common usage patterns such as displaying the details of an "
"object. They take certain common idioms and patterns found in view "
"development and abstract them so that you can quickly write common views of "
"data without having to repeat yourself."
msgstr ""
"Tá tuairimí cineálacha Django tógtha as na buntuairimí sin, agus forbraíodh "
"iad mar aicearra do phatrúin úsáide coitianta mar shonraí réad a "
"thaispeáint. Glacann siad nathanna agus patrúin choitianta áirithe a "
"fhaightear i bhforbairt amharc agus déanann siad teibí orthu ionas gur "
"féidir leat tuairimí coitianta sonraí a scríobh go tapa gan tú féin a "
"athdhéanamh"

msgid ""
"Most generic views require the ``queryset`` key, which is a ``QuerySet`` "
"instance; see :doc:`/topics/db/queries` for more information about "
"``QuerySet`` objects."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn an chuid is mó de na tuairimí cineálacha an eochair ``queryset``, ar "
"shampla ``QuerySet` é; féach:doc: `/topics/db/queries` le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"faisnéise faoi rudaí ``QuerySet ``."

msgid "Class-based views mixins"
msgstr "Meascáin tuairimí rang-bhunaithe"

msgid ""
"Class-based views API reference. For introductory material, see :doc:`/"
"topics/class-based-views/mixins`."
msgstr ""
"Tagairt API tuairimí rang-bhunaithe. Maidir le hábhar tosaigh, féach:doc: `/"
"topics/rang-bhunan-dearcadh/meascáin `."

msgid "Date-based mixins"
msgstr "Meascáin dáta-bhunaithe"

msgid ""
"All the date formatting attributes in these mixins "
"use :func:`~time.strftime` format characters. Do not try to use the format "
"characters from the :ttag:`now` template tag as they are not compatible."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann na tréithe formáidithe dáta go léir sna meascáin seo carachtair "
"formáide: func: `~time.strftime`. Ná déan iarracht na carachtair formáide a "
"úsáid ón gclib teimpléad:ttag: `now` mar nach bhfuil siad comhoiriúnach."

msgid "``YearMixin``"
msgstr "``YearMixin``"

msgid ""
"A mixin that can be used to retrieve and provide parsing information for a "
"year component of a date."
msgstr ""
"Meascán is féidir a úsáid chun faisnéis pháirseála a aisghabháil agus a "
"sholáthar do chomhpháirt bhliain de dháta."

