"`~Datemixin.allow_future`."

msgid "``DateMixin``"
msgstr "``Datemixin``"

msgid "A mixin class providing common behavior for all date-based views."
msgstr ""
"Rang mixin a sholáthraíonn iompar coitianta do gach tuairim dáta-bhunaithe."

msgid ""
"The name of the ``DateField`` or ``DateTimeField`` in the ``QuerySet``’s "
"model that the date-based archive should use to determine the list of "
"objects to display on the page."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an ``DateField`` nó ``DateTimeField`` sa tsamhail ``QuerySet`` ba chóir "
"don chartlann dáta-bhunaithe a úsáid chun liosta na rudaí atá le taispeáint "
"ar an leathanach a chinneadh."

msgid ""
"When :doc:`time zone support </topics/i18n/timezones>` is enabled and "
"``date_field`` is a ``DateTimeField``, dates are assumed to be in the "
"current time zone. Otherwise, the queryset could include objects from the "
"previous or the next day in the end user's time zone."
msgstr ""
"Nuair: doc: cumasaítear `tacaíocht crios ama' agus ``date_field`` </topics/"
"i18n/timezones> is ``DateTimefield``, glactar leis go bhfuil dátaí sa chrios "
"ama reatha. Seachas sin, d'fhéadfadh rudaí ón lá roimhe seo nó an lá dar "
"gcionn a áireamh sa tacar fiosrúcháin i gcrios ama an úsáideora deiridh."

msgid ""
"In this situation, if you have implemented per-user time zone selection, the "
"same URL may show a different set of objects, depending on the end user's "
"time zone. To avoid this, you should use a ``DateField`` as the "
"``date_field`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Sa chás seo, má tá roghnú crios ama in aghaidh an úsáideora curtha i "
"bhfeidhm agat, féadfaidh an URL céanna tacar difriúil rudaí a thaispeáint, "
"ag brath ar chrios ama an úsáideora deiridh. Chun é seo a sheachaint, ba "
"chóir duit ``DateField`` a úsáid mar an tréith ``date_field``."

msgid ""
"A boolean specifying whether to include \"future\" objects on this page, "
"where \"future\" means objects in which the field specified in "
"``date_field`` is greater than the current date/time. By default, this is "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
"Boolean a shonraíonn an gcaithfear rudaí “amach anseo” a áireamh ar an "
"leathanach seo, áit a gciallaíonn “todhchaí” rudaí ina bhfuil an réimse a "
"shonraítear in `date_field`` níos mó ná an dáta/am reatha. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é seo ``False``."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the field that contains the date data that this view "
"will operate on. Returns :attr:`~DateMixin.date_field` by default."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ainm an réimse ina bhfuil na sonraí dáta ar a n-oibreoidh an "
"dearcadh seo air. Tuairisceáin: attr: `~DateMixin.Date_Field` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Determine whether to include \"future\" objects on this page, where "
"\"future\" means objects in which the field specified in ``date_field`` is "
"greater than the current date/time. Returns :attr:`~DateMixin.allow_future` "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Faigh amach an gcuirfear rudaí “amach anseo” ar an leathanach seo, áit a "
"chiallaíonn “todhchaí” rudaí ina bhfuil an réimse a shonraítear in "
"`date_field`` níos mó ná an dáta/am reatha. Tuairisceáin: attr: "
"`~DateMixin.allow_future` de réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``BaseDateListView``"
msgstr "``Basedatelistview``"

msgid ""
"A base class that provides common behavior for all date-based views. There "
"won't normally be a reason to "
"instantiate :class:`~django.views.generic.dates.BaseDateListView`; "
"instantiate one of the subclasses instead."
msgstr ""
"Aicme bonn a sholáthraíonn iompar coitianta do gach tuairim dáta-bhunaithe. "
"De ghnáth ní bheidh cúis ann le instantie:class: "
"`~django.views.generic.dates.basedaListView`; ceann de na fo-aicmí a ionad."

msgid ""
"While this view (and its subclasses) are executing, ``self.object_list`` "
"will contain the list of objects that the view is operating upon, and "
"``self.date_list`` will contain the list of dates for which data is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Cé go bhfuil an dearcadh seo (agus a fho-aicmí) á chur i bhfeidhm, beidh "
"liosta na rudaí a bhfuil an dearcadh ag feidhmiú orthu sa "
"`self.object_list``, agus beidh liosta na dátaí a bhfuil sonraí ar fáil ina "
"leith ``self.date_list``."

msgid "**Mixins**"
msgstr "**Meascáin"

msgid ":class:`~django.views.generic.dates.DateMixin`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.views.generic.dates.dates.datemixin`"

msgid ":class:`~django.views.generic.list.MultipleObjectMixin`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.views.generic.list.multipleObjectMixin`"

msgid ""
"A boolean specifying whether to display the page if no objects are "
"available. If this is ``True`` and no objects are available, the view will "
"display an empty page instead of raising a 404."
msgstr ""
"Boolean a shonraíonn an bhfuil an leathanach le taispeáint mura bhfuil aon "
"rudaí ar fáil. Más é seo ``True`` agus nach bhfuil aon rudaí ar fáil, "
"taispeánfaidh an radharc leathanach folamh in ionad 404 a ardú."

msgid ""
"This is identical "
"to :attr:`django.views.generic.list.MultipleObjectMixin.allow_empty`, except "
"for the default value, which is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo comhionann le:attr: "
"`Django.Views.Generic.List.MultipleObjectMixin.ALLOW_EMPTY`, ach amháin an "
"luach réamhshocraithe, arb é ``False``."

msgid ""
"**Optional** A string defining the aggregation period for ``date_list``. It "
"must be one of ``'year'`` (default), ``'month'``, or ``'day'``."
msgstr ""
"**Roghnaí** Sreang a shainmhíníonn an tréimhse comhiomlánaithe le haghaidh "
"``date_list``. Caithfidh sé a bheith ar cheann de ``'blian'` "
"(réamhshocraithe), ```mhí'`, nó ```laeth'`."

msgid ""
"Returns a 3-tuple containing (``date_list``, ``object_list``, "
"``extra_context``)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tuipéal 3 ar ais ina bhfuil (``date_list``, `object_list``, "
"`extra_context``)."

msgid ""
"``date_list`` is the list of dates for which data is available. "
"``object_list`` is the list of objects. ``extra_context`` is a dictionary of "
"context data that will be added to any context data provided by "
"the :class:`~django.views.generic.list.MultipleObjectMixin`."
msgstr ""
"Is é `date_list`` liosta na dátaí a bhfuil sonraí ar fáil dóibh. Is é "
"``object_list`` liosta na rudaí. Is foclóir sonraí comhthéacs é "
"``extra_context`` a chuirfear le haon sonraí comhthéacs a sholáthraíonn "
"an:class: `~django.views.generic.list.multipleObjectMixin`."

msgid ""
"Returns a queryset, filtered using the query arguments defined by "
"``lookup``. Enforces any restrictions on the queryset, such as "
"``allow_empty`` and ``allow_future``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tacar ceisteanna ar ais, scagtha ag baint úsáide as na hargóintí "
"ceisteanna a shainmhínítear le ``lookup``. Feidhmíonn sé aon srianta ar an "
"tacar fiosrúcháin, mar shampla `allow_empty`` agus `allow_future``."

msgid ""
"Returns the aggregation period for ``date_list``. "
"Returns :attr:`~BaseDateListView.date_list_period` by default."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an tréimhse comhiomlánaithe le haghaidh ``date_list``. "
"Tuairisceanna:attr: `~BasedaTelistView.Date_List_Period` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of dates of type ``date_type`` for which ``queryset`` "
"contains entries. For example, ``get_date_list(qs, 'year')`` will return the "
"list of years for which ``qs`` has entries. If ``date_type`` isn't provided, "
"the result of :meth:`~BaseDateListView.get_date_list_period` is used. "
"``date_type`` and ``ordering`` are passed "
"to :meth:`QuerySet.dates()<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.dates>`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé liosta dátaí den chineál ``date_type`` a bhfuil iontrálacha ina "
"leith ``queryset``. Mar shampla, tabharfaidh ``get_date_list (qs, 'year') "
"``liosta na mblianta a bhfuil iontrálacha ag ``qs`` ar ais. Mura gcuirtear "
"`date_type`` ar fáil, úsáidtear torth:meth: "
"`~BasedaTelistView.get_Date_List_Period`. "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.dates>Cuirtear ``date_type`` agus "
"``ordach`` chuig: meth: `QuerySet.dates () `."

msgid "Editing mixins"
msgstr "Eagarthóireacht meascáin"

msgid "The following mixins are used to construct Django's editing views:"
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear na meascáin seo a leanas chun tuairimí eagarthóireachta Django a "
"thógáil:"

msgid ""
"Examples of how these are combined into editing views can be found at the "
"documentation on :doc:`/ref/class-based-views/generic-editing`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir samplaí den chaoi a ndéantar iad seo a chomhcheangal i dtuairimí "
"eagarthóireachta a fháil ag an doiciméadú ar:doc: `/ref/class-based-views/"
"generic-editing`."

msgid "``FormMixin``"
msgstr "``Formmixin``"

msgid ""
"A mixin class that provides facilities for creating and displaying forms."
msgstr ""
"Rang meascáin a sholáthraíonn áiseanna chun foirmeacha a chruthú agus a "
"thaispeáint"

msgid "A dictionary containing initial data for the form."
msgstr "Foclóir ina bhfuil sonraí tosaigh don fhoirm."

msgid "The form class to instantiate."
msgstr "An rang foirm le chéile."

msgid "The URL to redirect to when the form is successfully processed."
msgstr "An URL le atreorú nuair a dhéantar an fhoirm a phróiseáil go rathúil."

msgid "The :attr:`~django.forms.Form.prefix` for the generated form."
msgstr "An: attr: `~django.forms.form.prefix` don fhoirm ghintear."

msgid ""
"Retrieve initial data for the form. By default, returns a copy "
"of :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.initial`."
msgstr ""
"Aisghabháil sonraí tosaigh don fhoirm. De réir réamhshocraithe, filleann sé "
"cóip de:attr: `~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.initial`."

msgid ""
"Retrieve the form class to instantiate. By "
"default :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class`."
msgstr ""
"Aisghabháil an rang foirme chun teacht ar ais. De réir réamhshocraithe: "
"attr: `~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.form_class`."

msgid ""
"Instantiate an instance of ``form_class`` "
"using :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.get_form_kwargs`. If "
"``form_class`` isn't provided :meth:`get_form_class` will be used."
msgstr ""
"Cuir sampla de `form_class ``ag baint úsáid:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.get_form_kwargs`. Mura soláthraítear "
"``form_class``: meth: `get_form_class` úsáidfear."

msgid "Build the keyword arguments required to instantiate the form."
msgstr ""
"Tóg na hargóintí eochairfhocal atá riachtanach chun an fhoirm a thabhairt "
"isteach."

msgid ""
"The ``initial`` argument is set to :meth:`.get_initial`. If the request is a "
"``POST`` or ``PUT``, the request data (``request.POST`` and "
"``request.FILES``) will also be provided."
msgstr ""
"Tá an argóint ``initial`` socraithe to:meth: `.get_initial`. Más `POST`` nó "
"`PUT`` í an iarraidh, cuirfear na sonraí iarratais (``Request.POST`` agus "
"``Request.Files``) ar fáil freisin."

msgid ""
"Determine the :attr:`~django.forms.Form.prefix` for the generated form. "
"Returns :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.prefix` by default."
msgstr ""
"Cinneadh: attr: `~django.forms.form.prefix` don fhoirm ghintear. "
"Tuairisceanna:attr: `~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.prefix` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Determine the URL to redirect to when the form is successfully validated. "
"Returns :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.success_url` by default."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an URL le atreorú chuig nuair a bhailítear an fhoirm go rathúil. "
"Tuairisceanna:attr: `~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.success_URL` de "
"réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Redirects to :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.get_success_url`."
msgstr ""
"Atreoraíonn chuig:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.get_success_URL`."

msgid "Renders a response, providing the invalid form as context."
msgstr "Tugann sé freagra, ag soláthar an fhoirm neamhbhailí mar chomhthéacs."

msgid ""
"Calls :meth:`get_form` and adds the result to the context data with the name "
"'form'."
msgstr ""
"glaonna: meth: `get_form` agus cuireann sé an toradh leis na sonraí "
"comhthéacs leis an ainm 'foirm'."

msgid "``ModelFormMixin``"
msgstr "``ModelFormmixin``"

msgid ""
"A form mixin that provides facilities for working with a ``ModelForm``, "
"rather than a standalone form."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Since this is a subclass "
"of :class:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin`, instances of "
"this mixin have access to "
"the :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.model` "
"and :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.queryset` "
"attributes, describing the type of object that the ``ModelForm`` is "
"manipulating."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é gur fo-aicme é seo de:class: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectMixin`, tá rochtain ag cásanna den "
"mheascán seo ar na tréithe: attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectMixin.Model` agus:attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectMixin.QuerySet`, ag cur síos ar an "
"gcineál réada atá ag ionramháil an ``Modelform``."

msgid ""
"If you specify both "
"the :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.fields` "
"and :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` attributes, "
"an :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ImproperlyConfigured` exception will be "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"Má shonraíonn tú na tréithe: attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Edit.ModelFormMixin.Fields` agus:attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Edit.FormMixin.Form_Class` ardófar eisceacht, "
"agó:exc: `~Django.Core.Exceptions.ImProperlyConfigured` eisceacht."

msgid ""
"A model class. Can be explicitly provided, otherwise will be determined by "
"examining ``self.object`` "
"or :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.queryset`."
msgstr ""
"Rang samhail. Is féidir é a sholáthar go sainráite, ar shlí eile cinnfear é "
"trí scrúdú a dhéanamh ar ``self.object`` nó: attr: "
"`~django.views.generic.detail.singleObjectMixin.QuerySet`."

msgid ""
"A list of names of fields. This is interpreted the same way as the "
"``Meta.fields`` attribute of :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`."
msgstr ""
"Liosta d'ainmneacha réimsí. Déantar é seo a léirmhíniú ar an mbealach céanna "
"leis an tréith ``Meta.Fields`` de:class: `~Django.Forms.ModelForm`."

msgid ""
"This is a required attribute if you are generating the form class "
"automatically (e.g. using ``model``). Omitting this attribute will result in "
"an :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ImproperlyConfigured` exception."
msgstr ""
"Is tréith riachtanach é seo má tá an rang foirme á ghiniúint agat go "
"huathoibríoch (m.sh. ag baint úsáide as ``samhail ``). Beidh eisceacht: exc: "
"`~django.core.exceptions.imProperlyConfigured` mar thoradh ar an tréith seo "
"a fhágáil."

msgid ""
"``success_url`` may contain dictionary string formatting, which will be "
"interpolated against the object's field attributes. For example, you could "
"use ``success_url=\"/polls/{slug}/\"`` to redirect to a URL composed out of "
"the ``slug`` field on a model."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh formáidiú teaghrán foclóra a bheith i `success_url ``, a bheidh "
"idirphóilte i gcoinne tréithe réimse an réada. Mar shampla, d'fhéadfá "
"``success_url=” /polls/ {slug} /\"`` a úsáid chun atreorú chuig URL "
"comhdhéanta as an réimse ``slug`` ar mhúnla."

msgid ""
"Retrieve the form class to instantiate. "
"If :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` is provided, that "
"class will be used. Otherwise, a ``ModelForm`` will be instantiated using "
"the model associated with "
"the :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.queryset`, or with "
"the :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.model`, depending "
"on which attribute is provided."
msgstr ""
"Aisghabháil an rang foirme chun teacht ar ais. Má chuirtear: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.form_class` ar fáil, úsáidfear an rang "
"sin. Seachas sin, déanfar `ModelForm`` a chur isteach ag baint úsáide as an "
"tsamhail a bhaineann le:attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectMixin.QuerySet`, nó leis na:attr: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectMixin.Model`, ag brath ar an "
"tréith a chuirtear ar fáil."

msgid ""
"Add the current instance (``self.object``) to the "
"standard :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.get_form_kwargs`."
msgstr ""
"Cuir an cás reatha (``self.object``) leis an caighdeán:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.get_form_kwargs`."

msgid ""
"Determine the URL to redirect to when the form is successfully validated. "
"Returns :attr:`django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.success_url` if it "
"is provided; otherwise, attempts to use the ``get_absolute_url()`` of the "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an URL le atreorú chuig nuair a bhailítear an fhoirm go rathúil. "
"Returns:attr: `Django.Views.Generic.Edit.ModelFormMixin.Success_URL` má "
"chuirtear ar fáil é; ar shlí eile, déan iarracht ``get_absolute_url () ``den "
"réad a úsáid."

msgid ""
"Saves the form instance, sets the current object for the view, and redirects "
"to :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.get_success_url`."
msgstr ""
"Sábhálann sé an tsampla foirme, socraíonn sé an réad reatha don amharc, agus "
"atreoraíonn sé chuig:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.get_success_url`."

msgid "``ProcessFormView``"
msgstr "``ProcessFormView``"

msgid "A mixin that provides basic HTTP GET and POST workflow."
msgstr "Meascán a sholáthraíonn sreabhadh oibre bunúsach HTTP GET agus POST."

msgid ""
"This is named 'ProcessFormView' and inherits directly "
"from :class:`django.views.generic.base.View`, but breaks if used "
"independently, so it is more of a mixin."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar 'ProcessFormView' air seo agus tá sé oidhreachta go díreach ó:class: "
"`Django.Views.Generic.Base.View`, ach briseann sé má úsáidtear go "
"neamhspleách, mar sin is meascán níos mó é."

msgid "**Extends**"
msgstr "**Síneadaí**"

msgid ""
"Renders a response using a context created "
"with :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.get_context_data`."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé freagra ag baint úsáide as comhthéacs a cruthaíodh le:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.formmixin.get_context_data`."

msgid ""
"Constructs a form, checks the form for validity, and handles it accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé foirm, seiceálann sé an fhoirm le haghaidh bailíochta, agus "
"láimhseálann sé í dá réir."

msgid ""
"The ``PUT`` action is also handled and passes all parameters through "
"to :meth:`post`."
msgstr ""
"Déantar an gníomh ``PUT ``a láimhseáil freisin agus téann sé gach "
"paraiméadar trí:meth: `post`."

msgid "``DeletionMixin``"
msgstr "``DeletionMixin``"

msgid "Enables handling of the ``DELETE`` HTTP action."
msgstr "Cumasaíonn sé láimhseáil an ghníomhaíocht HTTP ``DELETE``."

msgid ""
"The url to redirect to when the nominated object has been successfully "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"An url le atreorú chuig nuair a scriosadh an réad ainmnithe go rathúil."

msgid ""
"``success_url`` may contain dictionary string formatting, which will be "
"interpolated against the object's field attributes. For example, you could "
"use ``success_url=\"/parent/{parent_id}/\"`` to redirect to a URL composed "
"out of the ``parent_id`` field on a model."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh formáidiú teaghrán foclóra a bheith i `success_url ``, a bheidh "
"idirphóilte i gcoinne tréithe réimse an réada. Mar shampla, d'fhéadfá "
"``success_url=” /parent/ {parent_id} /\"`` a úsáid chun atreorú chuig URL "
"comhdhéanta as an réimse ``parent_id`` ar mhúnla."

msgid ""
"Retrieves the target object and calls its ``delete()`` method, then "
"redirects to the success URL."
msgstr ""
"Aisghabhann sé an spriocréad agus glaonn sé ar a mhodh ``delete () ``, ansin "
"atreoraíonn sé chuig an URL rathúlachta."

msgid ""
"Returns the url to redirect to when the nominated object has been "
"successfully deleted. "
"Returns :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.DeletionMixin.success_url` by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an url chun a atreorú chuig nuair a scriosadh an réad ainmnithe "
"go rathúil. Tuairisceanna:attr: "
"`~django.views.generic.edit.deletionMixin.success_URL` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid "Multiple object mixins"
msgstr "Meascáin réad iolracha"

msgid "``MultipleObjectMixin``"
msgstr "``MultipleObjectMixin``"

msgid "A mixin that can be used to display a list of objects."
msgstr "Meascán is féidir a úsáid chun liosta rudaí a thaispeáint."

msgid ""
"If ``paginate_by`` is specified, Django will paginate the results returned "
"by this. You can specify the page number in the URL in one of two ways:"
msgstr ""
"Má shonraítear ``paginate_by``, déanfaidh Django na torthaí a chuirtear ar "
"ais leis seo a leathnú. Is féidir leat uimhir an leathanaigh sa URL a shonrú "
"ar cheann de dhá bhealach:"

msgid ""
"Use the ``page`` parameter in the URLconf. For example, this is what your "
"URLconf might look like::"
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an paraiméadar ``leathanach`` sa URLConf. Mar shampla, seo an chuma a "
"d'fhéadfadh a bheith ar do URLConf:"

msgid ""
"Pass the page number via the ``page`` query-string parameter. For example, a "
"URL would look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Pas uimhir an leathanaigh tríd an bparaiméadar sreangán fiosrúcháin "
"``leathanach`. Mar shampla, bheadh cuma seo ar URL:"

msgid ""
"These values and lists are 1-based, not 0-based, so the first page would be "
"represented as page ``1``."
msgstr ""
"Tá na luachanna agus na liostaí seo bunaithe ar 1, ní bunaithe ar 0, mar sin "
"léiríodh an chéad leathanach mar leathanach ``1``."

msgid ""
"For more on pagination, read the :doc:`pagination documentation </topics/"
"pagination>`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais faoi leathanaigh, léigh an:doc: `doiciméadú "
"leathanacha' </topics/pagination>."

msgid ""
"As a special case, you are also permitted to use ``last`` as a value for "
"``page``:"
msgstr ""
"Mar chás speisialta, ceadaítear duit ``deireann`` a úsáid mar luach do "
"`leathanach``:"

msgid ""
"This allows you to access the final page of results without first having to "
"determine how many pages there are."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé seo duit rochtain a fháil ar leathanach deiridh na dtorthaí gan a "
"chinneadh ar dtús cé mhéad leathanach atá ann."

msgid ""
"Note that ``page`` *must* be either a valid page number or the value "
"``last``; any other value for ``page`` will result in a 404 error."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh ``leathanach`` *uimhir leathanaigh bailí nó "
"an luach ``deireana``; beidh earráid 404 mar thoradh ar aon luach eile le "
"haghaidh `leathanach``."

msgid ""
"A boolean specifying whether to display the page if no objects are "
"available. If this is ``False`` and no objects are available, the view will "
"raise a 404 instead of displaying an empty page. By default, this is "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"Boolean a shonraíonn an bhfuil an leathanach le taispeáint mura bhfuil aon "
"rudaí ar fáil. Más é seo ``False`` agus mura bhfuil aon rudaí ar fáil, "
"ardóidh an radharc 404 in ionad leathanach folamh a thaispeáint. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é seo ``True``."

msgid ""
"The model that this view will display data for. Specifying ``model = Foo`` "
"is effectively the same as specifying ``queryset = Foo.objects.all()``, "
"where ``objects`` stands for ``Foo``’s :ref:`default manager <default-"
"managers>`."
msgstr ""
"An tsamhail a thaispeánfaidh an dearcadh seo sonraí dó. <default-managers>Tá "
"`model = Foo' a shonrú go héifeachtach mar an gcéanna le ``queryset = "
"foo.objects.all () ``a shonrú, áit a sheasann`` objects`` do `foo': ref: "
"`bainisteoir réamhshocraithe `."

msgid ""
"A ``QuerySet`` that represents the objects. If provided, the value of "
"``queryset`` supersedes the value provided for :attr:`model`."
msgstr ""
"``QuerySet`` a léiríonn na rudaí. Má chuirtear ar fáil, cuireann luach "
"``fiosrúchán ``in ionad an luach a sholáthraítear le haghaidh: attr: "
"`samhail`."

msgid ""
"``queryset`` is a class attribute with a *mutable* value so care must be "
"taken when using it directly. Before using it, either call "
"its :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.all` method or retrieve it "
"with :meth:`get_queryset` which takes care of the cloning behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"Is tréith aicme é ``queryset`` le luach*athraithe* agus mar sin caithfear "
"cúram a thabhairt nuair a úsáidtear é go díreach. Sula n-úsáidtear é, "
"glaoigh aith:meth: `~django.db.models.query.queryset.all` modh nó faigh é "
"le: meth: `get_queryset` a thugann aire don chlónáil taobh thiar de na "
"radhairc."

msgid ""
"A string or list of strings specifying the ordering to apply to the "
"``queryset``. Valid values are the same as those "
"for :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.order_by`."
msgstr ""
"Sreang nó liosta teaghráin a shonraíonn an t-ordú a chuirfear i bhfeidhm ar "
"an ``Queryset``. Tá luachanna bailí mar an gcéanna leo siúd le haghaidh: "
"meth: `~django.db.models.query.queryset.order_by`."

msgid ""
"An integer specifying how many objects should be displayed per page. If this "
"is given, the view will paginate objects with ``paginate_by`` objects per "
"page. The view will expect either a ``page`` query string parameter (via "
"``request.GET``) or a ``page`` variable specified in the URLconf."
msgstr ""
"Sláimhir a shonraíonn cé mhéad réad ba chóir a thaispeáint in aghaidh Má "
"thugtar é seo, leathnóidh an dearcadh rudaí le rudaí ``paginate_by`` in "
"aghaidh an leathanaigh. Beidh an dearcadh ag súil le paraiméadar teaghrán "
"fiosrúcháin ``page`` (trí `request.get``) nó athróg ``page`` a shonraítear "
"sa URLConf."

msgid ""
"An integer specifying the number of \"overflow\" objects the last page can "
"contain. This extends the :attr:`paginate_by` limit on the last page by up "
"to ``paginate_orphans``, in order to keep the last page from having a very "
"small number of objects."
msgstr ""
"Sláimhir a shonraíonn líon na rudaí “ró-shreabhadh” is féidir leis an "
"leathanach deireanach a bheith. Leathnaíonn sé seo an teorainne:attr: "
"`paginate_by` ar an leathanach deireanach suas go ``paginate_orphans``, "
"d'fhonn an leathanach deireanach a choinneáil ó líon an-bheag rudaí a bheith "
"aige."

msgid ""
"A string specifying the name to use for the page parameter. The view will "
"expect this parameter to be available either as a query string parameter "
"(via ``request.GET``) or as a kwarg variable specified in the URLconf. "
"Defaults to ``page``."
msgstr ""
"Sreang a shonraíonn an t-ainm atá le húsáid do pharaiméadar an leathanaigh. "
"Beidh an dearcadh ag súil go mbeidh an paraiméadar seo ar fáil mar "
"pharaiméadar teaghrán fiosrúcháin (trí ``request.get``) nó mar athróg kwarg "
"a shonraítear sa URLConf. Réamhshocraithe go ``leathanach``."

msgid ""
"The paginator class to be used for pagination. By "
"default, :class:`django.core.paginator.Paginator` is used. If the custom "
"paginator class doesn't have the same constructor interface "
"as :class:`django.core.paginator.Paginator`, you will also need to provide "
"an implementation for :meth:`get_paginator`."
msgstr ""
"An rang paginator le húsáid le haghaidh leathanaigh. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, úsáidtear: class: `django.core.paginator.paginator`. Mura "
"bhfuil an comhéadan tógála céanna ag an rang paginator saincheaptha "
"las:class: `django.core.paginator.paginator`, beidh ort cur i bhfeidhm a "
"sholáthar dó:meth: `get_paginator` freisin."

msgid "Designates the name of the variable to use in the context."
msgstr "Ainmníonn sé ainm an athróg le húsáid sa chomhthéacs."

msgid ""
"Get the list of items for this view. This must be an iterable and may be a "
"queryset (in which queryset-specific behavior will be enabled)."
msgstr ""
"Faigh liosta na míreanna don radharc seo. Caithfidh sé seo a bheith ina "
"athrá agus d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith ina tacar ceisteanna (ina gcumasófar "
"iompar sonrach le fiosrúcháin)."

msgid ""
"Returns a string (or iterable of strings) that defines the ordering that "
"will be applied to the ``queryset``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sreang ar ais (nó teaghráin in-athraithe) a shainmhíníonn an t-ordú a "
"chuirfear i bhfeidhm ar an ``Queryset``."

msgid "Returns :attr:`ordering` by default."
msgstr "Tuairisceáin: attr: `ordú `de réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Returns a 4-tuple containing (``paginator``, ``page``, ``object_list``, "
"``is_paginated``)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé 4 thipple ar ais ina bhfuil (``paginator``, `leathanach``, "
"`liosta_object``, ``is_paginated``)."

msgid ""
"Constructed by paginating ``queryset`` into pages of size ``page_size``. If "
"the request contains a ``page`` argument, either as a captured URL argument "
"or as a GET argument, ``object_list`` will correspond to the objects from "
"that page."
msgstr ""
"Tógtha trí leathanach ``queryset`` a chur isteach i leathanaigh de mhéid "
"``page_size``. Má tá argóint ``leathanach`` san iarraidh, mar argóint URL "
"gabháilte nó mar argóint GET, comhfhreagróidh ``object_list`` do na rudaí ón "
"leathanach sin."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of items to paginate by, or ``None`` for no pagination. "
"By default this returns the value of :attr:`paginate_by`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais líon na míreanna atá le leathiniú ag, nó ``None`` gan aon "
"leathanach. De réir réamhshocraithe filleann sé seo an luach de:attr: "
"`paginate_by`."

msgid ""
"Returns an instance of the paginator to use for this view. By default, "
"instantiates an instance of :attr:`paginator_class`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé sampla den paginator ar ais le húsáid don radharc seo. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, cruthaíonn sé sampla de:attr: `paginator_class`."

msgid ""
"An integer specifying the number of \"overflow\" objects the last page can "
"contain. By default this returns the value of :attr:`paginate_orphans`."
msgstr ""
"Sláimhir a shonraíonn líon na rudaí “ró-shreabhadh” is féidir leis an "
"leathanach deireanach a bheith. De réir réamhshocraithe filleann sé luach: "
"attr: `paginate_orphans`."

msgid ""
"Return a boolean specifying whether to display the page if no objects are "
"available. If this method returns ``False`` and no objects are available, "
"the view will raise a 404 instead of displaying an empty page. By default, "
"this is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair boolean ar ais ag sonrú an bhfuil an leathanach le taispeáint mura "
"bhfuil aon rudaí ar fáil. Má fhilleann an modh seo ``False`` agus nach "
"bhfuil aon rudaí ar fáil, ardóidh an radharc 404 in ionad leathanach folamh "
"a thaispeáint. De réir réamhshocraithe, is é seo ``True``."

msgid ""
"Return the context variable name that will be used to contain the list of "
"data that this view is manipulating. If ``object_list`` is a queryset of "
"Django objects and :attr:`context_object_name` is not set, the context name "
"will be the ``model_name`` of the model that the queryset is composed from, "
"with postfix ``'_list'`` appended. For example, the model ``Article`` would "
"have a context object named ``article_list``."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair ar ais ainm an athróg comhthéacs a úsáidfear chun liosta na sonraí "
"atá ag ionramháil leis an dearcadh seo a bheith ann. Más tacar ceisteanna de "
"rudaí Django é ``object_list`` agus mura socraítear: attr: "
"`context_object_name`, is é an t-ainm comhthéacs ``model_name`` den tsamhail "
"a bhfuil an tacar ceisteanna comhdhéanta as, le postfix ``'_list'`` curtha "
"leis. Mar shampla, bheadh réad comhthéacs darb ainm ``article_list`` ag an "
"tsamhail ``Airteagal``."

msgid "Returns context data for displaying the list of objects."
msgstr "Tugann sonraí comhthéacs ar ais chun liosta rudaí a thaispeáint."

msgid ""
"``object_list``: The list of objects that this view is displaying. If "
"``context_object_name`` is specified, that variable will also be set in the "
"context, with the same value as ``object_list``."
msgstr ""
"``object_list``: An liosta rudaí atá ag taispeáint an dearcadh seo. Má "
"shonraítear ``context_object_name``, socraítear an t-athróg sin sa "
"chomhthéacs freisin, leis an luach céanna le ``object_list``."

msgid ""
"``is_paginated``: A boolean representing whether the results are paginated. "
"Specifically, this is set to ``False`` if no page size has been specified, "
"or if the available objects do not span multiple pages."
msgstr ""
"``is_paginated``: Boolean a léiríonn cibé an bhfuil na torthaí leathanaigh. "
"Go sonrach, tá sé seo socraithe go ``False`` mura sonraíodh aon mhéid "
"leathanaigh, nó mura bhfuil na rudaí atá ar fáil réimse ar iliomad "
"leathanaigh."

msgid ""
"``paginator``: An instance of :class:`django.core.paginator.Paginator`. If "
"the page is not paginated, this context variable will be ``None``."
msgstr ""
"``paginator``: Sampla de:class: `django.core.paginator.paginator`. Mura "
"bhfuil an leathanach leathanaigh, is é an athróg comhthéacs seo ná ``None``."

msgid ""
"``page_obj``: An instance of :class:`django.core.paginator.Page`. If the "
"page is not paginated, this context variable will be ``None``."
msgstr ""
"``page_obj``: Sampla de:class: `django.core.paginator.page`. Mura bhfuil an "
"leathanach leathanaigh, is é an athróg comhthéacs seo ná ``None``."

msgid "``MultipleObjectTemplateResponseMixin``"
msgstr "``MultipleObjectTemplateResponseMixin``"

msgid ""
"A mixin class that performs template-based response rendering for views that "
"operate upon a list of object instances. Requires that the view it is mixed "
"with provides ``self.object_list``, the list of object instances that the "
"view is operating on. ``self.object_list`` may be, but is not required to "
"be, a :class:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet`."
msgstr ""
"Aicme meascáin a dhéanann rindreáil freagartha bunaithe ar theimpléad do "
"thuairimí a oibríonn ar liosta cásanna réada. Éilíonn go soláthraíonn an "
"dearcadh a bhfuil sé measctha leis ``self.object_list``, liosta na gcásanna "
"réada a bhfuil an dearcadh ag feidhmiú orthu. D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh "
"``self.object_list``, ach ní cheanglaítear a bheith, a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset`."

msgid ":class:`~django.views.generic.base.TemplateResponseMixin`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.views.generic.base.templateResponseMixin`"

msgid ""
"The suffix to append to the auto-generated candidate template name. Default "
"suffix is ``_list``."
msgstr ""
"An iarmhír le cur leis an ainm teimpléid iarrthóra a ghintear go "
"huathoibríoch. Is é ``_list`` iarmhír réamhshocraithe."

msgid "Returns a list of candidate template names. Returns the following list:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta ainmneacha teimpléad iarrthóra ar ais. Tugann an liosta seo a "
"leanas ar ais:"

msgid "the value of ``template_name`` on the view (if provided)"
msgstr "luach ``template_name`` ar an radharc (má chuirtear ar fáil)"

msgid "``<app_label>/<model_name><template_name_suffix>.html``"
msgstr "<model_name><template_name_suffix>``<app_label>/.html``"

msgid "Simple mixins"
msgstr "Meascáin shimplí"

msgid "``ContextMixin``"
msgstr "``ContextMixin``"

msgid ""
"A dictionary to include in the context. This is a convenient way of "
"specifying some context in :meth:`~django.views.generic.base.View.as_view`. "
"Example usage::"
msgstr ""
"Foclóir le cur san áireamh sa chomhthéacs. Is bealach áisiúil é seo chun "
"comhthéacs éigin a shonrú in:meth: "
"`~django.views.generic.base.view.as_view`. Úsáid sampla::"

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary representing the template context. The keyword "
"arguments provided will make up the returned context. Example usage::"
msgstr ""
"Filleann foclóir a léiríonn comhthéacs an teimpléid Is iad na hargóintí "
"eochairfhocal a chuirtear ar fáil an comhthéacs ar ais Úsáid sampla::"

msgid ""
"The template context of all class-based generic views include a ``view`` "
"variable that points to the ``View`` instance."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn comhthéacs teimpléid gach tuairimí cineálacha bunaithe ar aicme "
"athróg ``dearcadh ``a thugann tuiscint ar an gcás ``Amharc``."

msgid "Use ``alters_data`` where appropriate"
msgstr "Úsáid ``alters_data`` nuair is cuí"

msgid ""
"Note that having the view instance in the template context may expose "
"potentially hazardous methods to template authors.  To prevent methods like "
"this from being called in the template, set ``alters_data=True`` on those "
"methods.  For more information, read the documentation on :ref:`rendering a "
"template context <alters-data-description>`."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go bhféadfadh sé modhanna a d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith "
"guaiseach a nochtadh d'údair teimpléid a bheith ag baint leis Chun modhanna "
"mar seo a chosc ó ghlaoch sa teimpléad, socraigh ``alters_data=true`` ar na "
"modhanna sin. <alters-data-description>Le haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise, "
"léigh an doiciméadú ar:ref: `comhthéacs teimpléad a rinneadh `."

msgid "``TemplateResponseMixin``"
msgstr "``TemplateResponseMixin``"

msgid ""
"Provides a mechanism to construct "
"a :class:`~django.template.response.TemplateResponse`, given suitable "
"context. The template to use is configurable and can be further customized "
"by subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé meicníocht chun a:class: "
"`~django.template.Response.TemplateResponse` a thógáil, mar gheall ar "
"chomhthéacs oiriúnach. Tá an teimpléad le húsáid inchumraithe agus is féidir "
"é a shaincheapadh tuilleadh de réir fo-aicmí."

msgid ""
"The full name of a template to use as defined by a string. Not defining a "
"``template_name`` will raise "
"a :class:`django.core.exceptions.ImproperlyConfigured` exception."
msgstr ""
"Ainm iomlán teimpléid le húsáid mar a shainmhínítear le sreang. Gan "
"sainmhíniú ``template_name`` ardóidh eisceacht a:class: "
"`Django.Core.Exceptions.ImProperlyConfigured`."

msgid ""
"The :setting:`NAME <TEMPLATES-NAME>` of a template engine to use for loading "
"the template. ``template_engine`` is passed as the ``using`` keyword "
"argument to ``response_class``. Default is ``None``, which tells Django to "
"search for the template in all configured engines."
msgstr ""
"An: Socrú: `AINM <TEMPLATES-NAME>`inneall teimpléad le húsáid chun an "
"teimpléad a luchtú. Cuirtear ``template_engine`` mar an argóint "
"eochairfhocal ``úsáid`` chuig `response_class``. Is é “None” "
"réamhshocraithe, a insíonn do Django an teimpléad a chuardach i ngach "
"inneall cumraithe."

msgid ""
"The response class to be returned by ``render_to_response`` method. Default "
"is :class:`TemplateResponse <django.template.response.TemplateResponse>`. "
"The template and context of ``TemplateResponse`` instances can be altered "
"later (e.g. in :ref:`template response middleware <template-response-"
"middleware>`)."
msgstr ""
"An rang freagartha atá le tabhairt ar ais trí mhodh ``render_to_response``. "
"<django.template.response.TemplateResponse>Is é réamhshocraithe:class: "
"`TemplateResponse `. <template-response-middleware>Is féidir teimpléad agus "
"comhthéacs cásanna ``TemplateResponse`` a athrú níos déanaí (m.sh. in:ref: "
"`middleware freagairt teimpléad`)."

msgid ""
"If you need custom template loading or custom context object instantiation, "
"create a ``TemplateResponse`` subclass and assign it to ``response_class``."
msgstr ""
"Má theastaíonn luchtú teimpléad saincheaptha nó réad comhthéacs saincheaptha "
"uait, cruthaigh fo-aicme ``TemplateResponse`` agus sannadh é do "
"`response_class``."

msgid ""
"The content type to use for the response. ``content_type`` is passed as a "
"keyword argument to ``response_class``. Default is ``None`` -- meaning that "
"Django uses ``'text/html'``."
msgstr ""
"An cineál ábhair le húsáid don fhreagra. Cuirtear ``content_type`` mar "
"argóint eochairfhocal chuig ``response_class``. Is é “None” réamhshocraithe "
"- rud a chiallaíonn go n-úsáideann Django ```text/html'``."

msgid "Returns a ``self.response_class`` instance."
msgstr "Tugann sé sampla ``self.response_class`` ar ais."

msgid ""
"If any keyword arguments are provided, they will be passed to the "
"constructor of the response class."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear aon argóintí eochairfhocal ar fáil, cuirfear ar aghaidh chuig "
"tógálaí an ranga freagartha iad."

msgid ""
"Calls :meth:`get_template_names()` to obtain the list of template names that "
"will be searched looking for an existent template."
msgstr ""
"glaonna: meth: `get_template_names () `chun liosta ainmneacha teimpléad a "
"chuardófar a fháil ag lorg teimpléad atá ann."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of template names to search for when rendering the template. "
"The first template that is found will be used."
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta d'ainmneacha teimpléad ar ais le cuardach agus an teimpléad á "
"rindreáil. Úsáidfear an chéad teimpléad a fhaightear."

msgid ""
"The default implementation will return a list "
"containing :attr:`template_name` (if it is specified)."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfidh an cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe liosta ina bhfuil: attr: "
"`template_name` ar ais (má shonraítear é)."

msgid "Single object mixins"
msgstr "Meascáin réad aonair"

msgid "``SingleObjectMixin``"
msgstr "``SingleObjectMixin``"

msgid ""
"Provides a mechanism for looking up an object associated with the current "
"HTTP request."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé meicníocht chun réad a bhaineann leis an iarratas reatha "
"HTTP a chuardach."

msgid ""
"The name of the field on the model that contains the slug. By default, "
"``slug_field`` is ``'slug'``."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an réimse ar an tsamhail ina bhfuil an slug. De réir réamhshocraithe, "
"is é ``slug_field`` ```slug'``."

msgid ""
"The name of the URLConf keyword argument that contains the slug. By default, "
"``slug_url_kwarg`` is ``'slug'``."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an argóint eochairfhocal URLConf ina bhfuil an slug. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é ``slug_url_kwarg`` ```slug'``."

msgid ""
"The name of the URLConf keyword argument that contains the primary key. By "
"default, ``pk_url_kwarg`` is ``'pk'``."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an argóint eochairfhocal URLConf ina bhfuil an príomh-eochair. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é ``pk_url_kwarg`` ```pk'``."

msgid ""
"If ``True``, causes :meth:`get_object()` to perform its lookup using both "
"the primary key and the slug. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``True``, is cúis le: meth: `get_object () `a chuardach a dhéanamh ag "
"baint úsáide as an bpríomh-eochair agus an slug araon. Réamhshocraithe go "
"``False``."

msgid ""
"This attribute can help mitigate `insecure direct object reference`_ "
"attacks. When applications allow access to individual objects by a "
"sequential primary key, an attacker could brute-force guess all URLs; "
"thereby obtaining a list of all objects in the application. If users with "
"access to individual objects should be prevented from obtaining this list, "
"setting ``query_pk_and_slug`` to ``True`` will help prevent the guessing of "
"URLs as each URL will require two correct, non-sequential arguments. Using a "
"unique slug may serve the same purpose, but this scheme allows you to have "
"non-unique slugs."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an tréith seo cabhrú le hionsaithe `tagairt réad díreach "
"neamhchinnti`_ a mhaolú. Nuair a cheadaíonn feidhmchláir rochtain ar rudaí "
"aonair trí phríomh-eochair seicheamhach, d'fhéadfadh ionsaitheoir gach URL a "
"thuairim a dhéanamh; ar an gcaoi sin liosta de na rudaí go léir san "
"fheidhmchlár a fháil. Má cheart cosc a chur ar úsáideoirí a bhfuil rochtain "
"acu ar rudaí aonair an liosta seo a fháil, cuideoidh socrú "
"``query_pk_and_slug`` go `True`` le tuairim URLanna a chosc mar beidh dhá "
"argóint cheart neamh-seicheamhach ag teastáil ó gach URL. D'fhéadfadh go "
"mbeadh an cuspóir céanna ag baint úsáide as slug uathúil, ach tugann an "
"scéim seo deis duit slugs neamh-uathúla a bheith agat."

msgid ""
"Returns the single object that this view will display. If ``queryset`` is "
"provided, that queryset will be used as the source of objects; "
"otherwise, :meth:`get_queryset` will be used. ``get_object()`` looks for "
"a :attr:`pk_url_kwarg` argument in the arguments to the view; if this "
"argument is found, this method performs a primary-key based lookup using "
"that value. If this argument is not found, it looks for "
"a :attr:`slug_url_kwarg` argument, and performs a slug lookup using "
"the :attr:`slug_field`."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an réad aonair a thaispeánfaidh an radharc seo. Má chuirtear "
"``queryset`` ar fáil, úsáidfear an tacar ceisteanna sin mar fhoinse na "
"rudaí; ar shlí eile, úsáidfear :meth: `get_queryset`. Féachann ``get_object "
"() ``argóint a: attr: `pk_url_kwarg` sna hargóintí leis an dearcadh; má "
"aimsítear an argóint seo, déanann an modh seo cuardach bunaithe ar eochair "
"bhunaithe ag baint úsáide as an luach sin. Mura bhfaightear an argóint seo, "
"féachann sé argóint a:attr: `slug_url_kwarg`, agus déanann sé cuardach slug "
"ag baint úsáide as an: attr: `slug_field`."

msgid ""
"When :attr:`query_pk_and_slug` is ``True``, ``get_object()`` will perform "
"its lookup using both the primary key and the slug."
msgstr ""
"Nuair: attr: `query_pk_and_slug` ``True``, déanfaidh ``get_object () ``a "
"chuardach ag baint úsáide as an eochair phríomhúil agus an slug araon."

msgid ""
"Returns the queryset that will be used to retrieve the object that this view "
"will display. By default, :meth:`get_queryset` returns the value of "
"the :attr:`queryset` attribute if it is set, otherwise it constructs "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet` by calling the ``all()`` method "
"on the :attr:`model` attribute's default manager."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an tacar fiosrúcháin a úsáidfear chun an réad a thaispeánfaidh "
"an dearcadh seo a aisghabháil. De réir réamhshocraithe, filleann :meth: "
"`get_queryset` luach an tréithe: attr: `queryset` má tá sé socraithe, ar "
"shlí eile tógann sé a:class: `~django.db.models.query.queryset` trí ghlaoch "
"ar an modh ``all () ``ar bhainisteoir réamhshocraithe tréith: `model`."

msgid ""
"Return the context variable name that will be used to contain the data that "
"this view is manipulating. If :attr:`context_object_name` is not set, the "
"context name will be constructed from the ``model_name`` of the model that "
"the queryset is composed from. For example, the model ``Article`` would have "
"context object named ``'article'``."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair ar ais ainm athróg an chomhthéacs a úsáidfear chun na sonraí atá á "
"ionramháil ag an dearcadh seo a áireamh. Má tá: attr: `context_object_name` "
"socraithe, déanfar an t-ainm comhthéacs a thógáil ó ``model_name`` den "
"tsamhail a bhfuil an tacar ceisteanna comhdhéanta as. Mar shampla, bheadh "
"réad comhthéacs darb ainm ```Airteag`` sa tsamhail ``Airteagal``."

msgid "Returns context data for displaying the object."
msgstr "Filleann sonraí comhthéacs chun an réad a thaispeáint"

msgid ""
"The base implementation of this method requires that the ``self.object`` "
"attribute be set by the view (even if ``None``). Be sure to do this if you "
"are using this mixin without one of the built-in views that does so."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn cur i bhfeidhm bonn an mhodha seo go socraítear an tréith "
"``self.object`` ag an radharc (fiú mura bhfuil ``None``). Bí cinnte é seo a "
"dhéanamh má tá an meascán seo á úsáid agat gan ceann de na tuairimí ionsuite "
"a dhéanann amhlaidh."

msgid "It returns a dictionary with these contents:"
msgstr "Tugann sé foclóir ar ais leis na hábhair seo:"

msgid "``object``: The object that this view is displaying (``self.object``)."
msgstr ""
"``object``: An réad atá ag taispeáint an dearcadh seo (``self.object``)."

msgid ""
"``context_object_name``: ``self.object`` will also be stored under the name "
"returned by :meth:`get_context_object_name`, which defaults to the "
"lowercased version of the model name."
msgstr ""
"Stórálfar ``context_object_name``: ``self.object`` faoin ainm ar ais ag: "
"meth: `get_context_object_name`, a réamhshocraíonn an leagan íseal den ainm "
"samhail."

msgid "Context variables override values from template context processors"
msgstr "Déanann athróga comhthéacs athrú luachanna ó phróiseálaithe"

msgid ""
"Any variables from :meth:`get_context_data` take precedence over context "
"variables from :ref:`context processors <subclassing-context-"
"requestcontext>`. For example, if your view sets the :attr:`model` attribute "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User`, the default context object "
"name of ``user`` would override the ``user`` variable from "
"the :func:`django.contrib.auth.context_processors.auth` context processor. "
"Use :meth:`get_context_object_name` to avoid a clash."
msgstr ""
"<subclassing-context-requestcontext>Tá tosaíocht ag aon athróga ó:meth: "
"`get_context_data` thar athróga comhthéacs ó:ref: `próiseálaithe comhthéacs "
"`. Mar shampla, má shocraíonn d'amharc an tréith: attr: `model` to:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`, cuirfeadh ainm réad réamhshocraithe "
"comhthéacs ``user`` athróg ``user`` ón bpróiseálaí comhthéacs: func: "
"`django.contrib.auth.context_processors.auth`. Úsáid:Meth: "
"`get_context_object_name` chun coimhlint a sheachaint."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of a slug field to be used to look up by slug. By default "
"this returns the value of :attr:`slug_field`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ainm réimse slug ar ais le húsáid chun breathnú suas le slug. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe filleann sé luach: attr: `slug_field`."

msgid "``SingleObjectTemplateResponseMixin``"
msgstr "``SingleObjectTemplateResponseMixin``"

msgid ""
"A mixin class that performs template-based response rendering for views that "
"operate upon a single object instance. Requires that the view it is mixed "
"with provides ``self.object``, the object instance that the view is "
"operating on. ``self.object`` will usually be, but is not required to be, an "
"instance of a Django model. It may be ``None`` if the view is in the process "
"of constructing a new instance."
msgstr ""
"Aicme meascáin a dhéanann rindreáil freagartha bunaithe ar theimpléad do "
"thuairimí a oibríonn ar shampla réad amháin. Éilíonn sé go soláthraíonn an "
"dearcadh a bhfuil sé measctha leis ``self.object ``, an sampla réada a "
"bhfuil an radharc ag feidhmiú air. Is gnách go mbeidh `self.object ``mar "
"shampla Django, ach ní cheanglaítear é a bheith ann. D'fhéadfadh sé a bheith "
"``None`` má tá an dearcadh i bpróiseas chun cás nua a thógáil."

msgid ""
"The field on the current object instance that can be used to determine the "
"name of a candidate template. If either ``template_name_field`` itself or "
"the value of the ``template_name_field`` on the current object instance is "
"``None``, the object will not be used for a candidate template name."
msgstr ""
"An réimse ar an gcás réad reatha is féidir a úsáid chun ainm teimpléad "
"iarrthóra a chinneadh. Más é ``template_name_field`` féin nó luach an "
"``template_name_field`` ar an gcás réad reatha ``None``, ní úsáidfear an "
"réad le haghaidh ainm teimpléad iarrthóra."

msgid ""
"The suffix to append to the auto-generated candidate template name. Default "
"suffix is ``_detail``."
msgstr ""
"An iarmhír le cur leis an ainm teimpléid iarrthóra a ghintear go "
"huathoibríoch. Is é ``_detail`` iarmhír réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of candidate template names. Return a list containing "
"``template_name``, if set on the value. Otherwise, return a list containing:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"the contents of the ``template_name_field`` field on the object instance "
"that the view is operating upon (if available)"
msgstr ""
"ábhar an réimse ``template_name_field`` ar an gcás réad a bhfuil an radharc "
"ag feidhmiú air (má tá sé ar fáil)"

msgid "Clickjacking Protection"
msgstr "Cosaint clickjacking"

msgid ""
"The clickjacking middleware and decorators provide easy-to-use protection "
"against `clickjacking`_.  This type of attack occurs when a malicious site "
"tricks a user into clicking on a concealed element of another site which "
"they have loaded in a hidden frame or iframe."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn na meánearraí clickjacking agus na maisitheoirí cosaint éasca "
"le húsáid i gcoinne `clickjacking`_. Tarlaíonn an cineál seo ionsaithe nuair "
"a chuireann suíomh mailíseach cleas ar úsáideoir chun cliceáil ar ghné "
"folaithe de shuíomh eile atá luchtaithe acu i bhfráma nó iframe i bhfolach."

msgid "An example of clickjacking"
msgstr "Sampla de clickjacking"

msgid ""
"Suppose an online store has a page where a logged-in user can click \"Buy "
"Now\" to purchase an item. A user has chosen to stay logged into the store "
"all the time for convenience. An attacker site might create an \"I Like "
"Ponies\" button on one of their own pages, and load the store's page in a "
"transparent iframe such that the \"Buy Now\" button is invisibly overlaid on "
"the \"I Like Ponies\" button. If the user visits the attacker's site, "
"clicking \"I Like Ponies\" will cause an inadvertent click on the \"Buy "
"Now\" button and an unknowing purchase of the item."
msgstr ""

msgid "Preventing clickjacking"
msgstr "Clickjacking a chosc"

msgid ""
"Modern browsers honor the `X-Frame-Options`_ HTTP header that indicates "
"whether or not a resource is allowed to load within a frame or iframe. If "
"the response contains the header with a value of ``SAMEORIGIN`` then the "
"browser will only load the resource in a frame if the request originated "
"from the same site. If the header is set to ``DENY`` then the browser will "
"block the resource from loading in a frame no matter which site made the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Tugann brabhsálaí nua-aimseartha onóir ar cheanntásc HTTP `X-Frame-Options`_ "
"a thugann le fios an bhfuil cead ag acmhainn luchtú laistigh de fhráma nó "
"iframe nó nach bhfuil. Má tá an ceannteideal sa fhreagra le luach "
"``SAMEORIGIN`` ansin ní luchtálfaidh an brabhsálaí an acmhainn i bhfráma ach "
"amháin má tháinig an t-iarratas ón suíomh céanna. Má tá an ceannteideal "
"socraithe go `DENY`` ansin cuirfidh an brabhsálaí bac ar an acmhainn ó "
"luchtú i bhfráma is cuma cén suíomh a rinne an iarraidh."

msgid ""
"Django provides a few ways to include this header in responses from your "
"site:"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django cúpla bealach chun an ceannteideal seo a áireamh i "
"bhfreagraí ó do shuíomh:"

msgid "A middleware that sets the header in all responses."
msgstr "Middleware a shocraíonn an ceanntásc i ngach freagra."

msgid ""
"A set of view decorators that can be used to override the middleware or to "
"only set the header for certain views."
msgstr ""
"Sraith maisitheoirí radhairc is féidir a úsáid chun an lár-earraí a shárú nó "
"chun an ceanntásc a shocrú ach le haghaidh tuairimí áirithe."

msgid ""
"The ``X-Frame-Options`` HTTP header will only be set by the middleware or "
"view decorators if it is not already present in the response."
msgstr ""
"Ní shocróidh an ceannteideal HTTP ``X-Frame-Options`` ach ag na maisitheoirí "
"meán-earraí nó amharc mura bhfuil sé i láthair sa fhreagra cheana féin."

msgid "How to use it"
msgstr "Conas é a úsáid"

msgid "Setting ``X-Frame-Options`` for all responses"
msgstr "Socrú ``Roghanna X-Frame`` do gach freagra"

msgid ""
"To set the same ``X-Frame-Options`` value for all responses in your site, "
"put ``'django.middleware.clickjacking.XFrameOptionsMiddleware'`` "
"to :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`::"
msgstr ""
"Chun an luach céanna ``X-Frame-Options`` a shocrú do gach freagra ar do "
"shuíomh, cuir ``django.middleware.clickjacking.xframeOptionsMiddleware'` "
"chuig:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`:"

msgid ""
"This middleware is enabled in the settings file generated "
"by :djadmin:`startproject`."
msgstr ""
"Tá an láithreán gréasáin seo cumasaithe sa chomhad socruithe a ghineann: "
"djadmin: `startproject`."

msgid ""
"By default, the middleware will set the ``X-Frame-Options`` header to "
"``DENY`` for every outgoing ``HttpResponse``. If you want any other value "
"for this header instead, set the :setting:`X_FRAME_OPTIONS` setting::"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, socraíonn an middleware an ceannteideal ``X-Frame-"
"Options`` go `DENY`` do gach `HttpResponse`` atá ag imeacht. Más mian leat "
"aon luach eile don cheanntásc seo ina ionad sin, socraigh an socrú: setting: "
"`X_FRAME_OPTIONS`::"

msgid ""
"When using the middleware there may be some views where you do **not** want "
"the ``X-Frame-Options`` header set. For those cases, you can use a view "
"decorator that tells the middleware not to set the header::"
msgstr ""
"Agus an middleware á úsáid agat d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh roinnt tuairimí ann "
"nuair nach dteastaíonn uait** an tacar ceanntásc ``X-Frame-Options`` ag "
"teastáil uait. Maidir leis na cásanna sin, is féidir leat maisitheoir amharc "
"a úsáid a insíonn don middleware gan an ceannteideal a shocrú::"

msgid ""
"If you want to submit a form or access a session cookie within a frame or "
"iframe, you may need to modify the :setting:`CSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE` "
"or :setting:`SESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE` settings."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat foirm a chur isteach nó rochtain a fháil ar fhianán seisiúin "
"laistigh de fhráma nó iframe, b'fhéidir go mbeidh ort socruithe: :setting: "
"`CSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE` nó:setting: `SESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE` a mhodhnú."

msgid "Setting ``X-Frame-Options`` per view"
msgstr "Socrú ``Roghanna Fráma X-`` in aghaidh an amharc"

msgid ""
"To set the ``X-Frame-Options`` header on a per view basis, Django provides "
"these decorators::"
msgstr ""
"Chun an ceanntásc ``X-Frame-Options` a shocrú ar bhonn in aghaidh an amharc, "
"soláthraíonn Django na maisiúcháin seo:"

msgid ""
"Note that you can use the decorators in conjunction with the middleware. Use "
"of a decorator overrides the middleware."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara gur féidir leat na maisitheoirí a úsáid i gcomhar leis an "
"middleware. Sáraíonn úsáid maisitheora an mheán-earraí."

msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Teorainneacha"

msgid ""
"The ``X-Frame-Options`` header will only protect against clickjacking in "
"`modern browsers`_."
msgstr ""
"Ní chosnóidh an ceannteideal `X-Frame-Options`` ach ar chliceacáil i "
"`brabhsálaí nua-aimsearta'."

msgid "Admin actions"
msgstr "gníomhartha riaracháin"

msgid ""
"The basic workflow of Django's admin is, in a nutshell, \"select an object, "
"then change it.\" This works well for a majority of use cases. However, if "
"you need to make the same change to many objects at once, this workflow can "
"be quite tedious."
msgstr ""
"Is é sreabhadh oibre bunúsach riaracháin Django, go hachomair, “roghnaigh "
"réad, ansin athraigh é.” Oibríonn sé seo go maith le haghaidh formhór na "
"gcásanna úsáide. Mar sin féin, más gá duit an t-athrú céanna a dhéanamh ar "
"go leor rudaí ag an am céanna, is féidir leis an sreabhadh oibre seo a "
"bheith an-teannach."

msgid ""
"In these cases, Django's admin lets you write and register \"actions\" -- "
"functions that get called with a list of objects selected on the change list "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Sna cásanna seo, ligeann riarachán Django duit “gníomhartha” a scríobh agus "
"a chlárú - feidhmeanna a ghlaofar le liosta rudaí a roghnaítear ar "
"leathanach an liosta athraithe."

msgid ""
"If you look at any change list in the admin, you'll see this feature in "
"action; Django ships with a \"delete selected objects\" action available to "
"all models. For example, here's the user module from Django's built-"
"in :mod:`django.contrib.auth` app:"
msgstr ""
"Má fhéachann tú ar aon liosta athraithe sa riarachán, feicfidh tú an ghné "
"seo i ngníomh; Seolann Django le gníomh “scrios rudaí roghnaithe” atá ar "
"fáil do gach samhail. Mar shampla, seo an modúl úsáideora ó aip ionsuite "
"Django: mod: `django.contrib.auth`:"

msgid ""
"The \"delete selected objects\" action uses :meth:`QuerySet.delete() "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.delete>` for efficiency reasons, which has "
"an important caveat: your model's ``delete()`` method will not be called."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann <django.db.models.query.QuerySet.delete>an gníomh “scrios rudaí "
"roghnaithe”: meth: `QuerySet.delete () `ar chúiseanna éifeachtúlachta, a "
"bhfuil rabhadh tábhachtach aige: ní ghlaofar modh ``delete () ``do mhúnla."

msgid ""
"If you wish to override this behavior, you can "
"override :meth:`.ModelAdmin.delete_queryset` or write a custom action which "
"does deletion in your preferred manner -- for example, by calling "
"``Model.delete()`` for each of the selected items."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat an t-iompar seo a shárú, is féidir leat: meth: "
"`.modelAdmin.delete_querySet` a shárú nó gníomh saincheaptha a scríobh a "
"scriosann ar an mbealach is fearr leat - mar shampla, trí ghlaoch ar "
"``Model.delete () ``do gach ceann de na míreanna roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"For more background on bulk deletion, see the documentation on :ref:`object "
"deletion <topics-db-queries-delete>`."
msgstr ""
"<topics-db-queries-delete>Le haghaidh tuilleadh cúlra maidir le mór-"
"scriosadh, féach an doiciméadú ar:ref: `scriosadh réad `."

msgid "Read on to find out how to add your own actions to this list."
msgstr ""
"Léigh ar aghaidh chun a fháil amach conas do ghníomhartha féin a chur leis "
"an liosta seo."

msgid "Writing actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha scrí"

msgid "The easiest way to explain actions is by example, so let's dive in."
msgstr ""
"Is é an bealach is éasca le gníomhartha a mhíniú trí shampla, mar sin "
"déanaimis tumadh isteach."

msgid ""
"A common use case for admin actions is the bulk updating of a model. Imagine "
"a news application with an ``Article`` model::"
msgstr ""
"Cás úsáide coitianta do ghníomhartha riaracháin is ea an mórchnuashonrú ar "
"mhúnla. Samhlaigh feidhmchlár nuachta le samhail ``Airteagal``:"

msgid ""
"A common task we might perform with a model like this is to update an "
"article's status from \"draft\" to \"published\". We could easily do this in "
"the admin one article at a time, but if we wanted to bulk-publish a group of "
"articles, it'd be tedious. So, let's write an action that lets us change an "
"article's status to \"published.\""
msgstr ""
"Tasc coitianta a d'fhéadfaimis a dhéanamh le samhail mar seo ná stádas alt a "
"nuashonrú ó “dréacht” go “foilsithe”. D'fhéadfaimis é seo a dhéanamh go "
"héasca san riarachán alt amháin ag an am, ach dá dteastaíonn uainn grúpa alt "
"a fhoilsiú go mór, bheadh sé deacair. Mar sin, déanaimis gníomh a scríobh a "
"ligeann dúinn stádas alt a athrú go “foilsithe.”"

msgid "Writing action functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna gníomhaíochta"

msgid ""
"First, we'll need to write a function that gets called when the action is "
"triggered from the admin. Action functions are regular functions that take "
"three arguments:"
msgstr ""
"Ar dtús, beidh orainn feidhm a scríobh a ghlaofar nuair a spreagtar an "
"gníomh ón riarachán. Is feidhmeanna rialta iad feidhmeanna gníomhaíochta a "
"thógann trí argóint:"

msgid "The current :class:`ModelAdmin`"
msgstr "An reatha: aicme: `ModelAdmin`"

msgid "An :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest` representing the current request,"
msgstr "An:class: `~django.http.httpRequest` a léiríonn an t-iarratas reatha,"

msgid ""
"A :class:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet` containing the set of objects "
"selected by the user."
msgstr ""
"A: Class: `~django.db.models.query.querySet` ina bhfuil an tacar rudaí a "
"roghnaigh an t-úsáideoir."

msgid ""
"Our publish-these-articles function won't need the :class:`ModelAdmin` or "
"the request object, but we will use the queryset::"
msgstr ""
"Ní bheidh an: class: `ModelAdmin` nó an réad iarratais ag teastáil ó ár "
"bhfeidhm foilsithe seo, ach úsáidfimid an tacar ceisteanna::"

msgid ""
"For the best performance, we're using the queryset's :ref:`update method "
"<topics-db-queries-update>`. Other types of actions might need to deal with "
"each object individually; in these cases we'd iterate over the queryset::"
msgstr ""
"<topics-db-queries-update>Le haghaidh an fheidhmíocht is fearr, táimid ag "
"úsáid an Queryset 's:ref: `modh nuashonraithe `. B'fhéidir go mbeadh gá le "
"cineálacha eile gníomhartha déileáil le gach réad ina n-aonar; sna cásanna "
"seo déanfaimis athrá thar an tacar ceisteanna:"

msgid ""
"That's actually all there is to writing an action! However, we'll take one "
"more optional-but-useful step and give the action a \"nice\" title in the "
"admin. By default, this action would appear in the action list as \"Make "
"published\" -- the function name, with underscores replaced by spaces. "
"That's fine, but we can provide a better, more human-friendly name by using "
"the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.action` decorator on the ``make_published`` "
"function::"
msgstr ""
"Sin i ndáiríre gach rud atá ann chun gníomh a scríobh! Mar sin féin, "
"glacfaimid céim roghnach ach úsáideach amháin eile agus tabharfaimid teideal "
"“deas” don ghníomh sa riarachán. De réir réamhshocraithe, bheadh an gníomh "
"seo le feiceáil ar an liosta gníomhaíochta mar “Déan foilsithe” - ainm na "
"feidhme, le spásanna ina ionad béim. Tá sé sin go breá, ach is féidir linn "
"ainm níos fearr, níos cairdiúla don duine a sholáthar tríd an maisitheoir: "
"func: `~django.contrib.admin.action` a úsáid ar an bhfeidhm ``make_published "
"``:"

msgid ""
"This might look familiar; the "
"admin's :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.list_display` option uses a "
"similar technique with the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` decorator "
"to provide human-readable descriptions for callback functions registered "
"there, too."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh cuma eolach air seo; úsáideann an rogha admin's:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.list_display` teicníc den chineál céanna "
"leis an maisitheoir: func: `~django.contrib.admin.display` chun tuairiscí "
"inléite don duine a sholáthar d'fheidhmeanna aisghlaonna atá cláraithe ansin "
"freisin."

msgid "Adding actions to the :class:`ModelAdmin`"
msgstr "Gníomhartha a chur leis an:class: `ModelAdmin`"

msgid ""
"Next, we'll need to inform our :class:`ModelAdmin` of the action. This works "
"just like any other configuration option. So, the complete ``admin.py`` with "
"the action and its registration would look like::"
msgstr ""
"Ansin, beidh orainn ár n:class: `ModelAdmin` a chur ar an eolas faoin "
"ngníomh. Oibríonn sé seo díreach cosúil le haon rogha cumraíochta eile. Mar "
"sin, bheadh cuma ar an `admin.py`` iomlán leis an ngníomh agus a chlárú:"

msgid ""
"That code will give us an admin change list that looks something like this:"
msgstr ""
"Tabharfaidh an cód sin liosta athraithe riaracháin dúinn a bhfuil cuma mar "
"seo air:"

msgid ""
"That's really all there is to it! If you're itching to write your own "
"actions, you now know enough to get started. The rest of this document "
"covers more advanced techniques."
msgstr ""
"Sin go léir atá ann i ndáiríre! Má tá tú ag iarraidh do ghníomhartha féin a "
"scríobh, tá a fhios agat anois go leor chun tosú. Clúdaíonn an chuid eile "
"den doiciméad seo teicnící níos airde."

msgid "Handling errors in actions"
msgstr "Earráidí láimhseála i ngn"

msgid ""
"If there are foreseeable error conditions that may occur while running your "
"action, you should gracefully inform the user of the problem. This means "
"handling exceptions and "
"using :meth:`django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.message_user` to display a user "
"friendly description of the problem in the response."
msgstr ""
"Má tá coinníollacha earráide intuartha ann a d'fhéadfadh tarlú agus do "
"ghníomh á reáchtáil, ba cheart duit an t-úsáideoir a chur ar an eolas go "
"grásta faoin bhfadhb. Ciallaíonn sé seo eisceachtaí a láimhseáil agus úsáid: "
"meth: `django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.message_user` chun cur síos atá "
"cairdiúil don úsáideoir ar an bhfadhb sa fhreagra a thaispeáint."

msgid "Advanced action techniques"
msgstr "Teicnící gníomhaíochta chun"

msgid ""
"There's a couple of extra options and possibilities you can exploit for more "
"advanced options."
msgstr ""
"Tá cúpla rogha agus féidearthachtaí breise ann is féidir leat leas a bhaint "
"as le haghaidh roghanna níos airde."

msgid "Actions as :class:`ModelAdmin` methods"
msgstr "Gníomhartha cosúil:class: `ModelAdmin` modhanna"

msgid ""
"The example above shows the ``make_published`` action defined as a function. "
"That's perfectly fine, but it's not perfect from a code design point of "
"view: since the action is tightly coupled to the ``Article`` object, it "
"makes sense to hook the action to the ``ArticleAdmin`` object itself."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an sampla thuas an gníomh ``make_published`` a shainmhínítear "
"mar fheidhm. Tá sé sin go breá, ach níl sé foirfe ó thaobh dearaidh cód: ós "
"rud é go bhfuil an gníomh ceangailte go docht leis an réad ``Airteagal``, tá "
"sé ciallmhar an gníomh a cheangal leis an réad ``ArticleAdMin` féin."

msgid "You can do it like this::"
msgstr "Is féidir leat é a dhéanamh mar seo::"

msgid ""
"Notice first that we've moved ``make_published`` into a method and renamed "
"the ``modeladmin`` parameter to ``self``, and second that we've now put the "
"string ``'make_published'`` in ``actions`` instead of a direct function "
"reference. This tells the :class:`ModelAdmin` to look up the action as a "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara ar dtús gur bhogamar ``make_published`` isteach i modh "
"agus athainmníomar an paraiméadar ``modeladmin ``go `self``, agus sa dara "
"háit gur chuireamar an teaghrán ```make_published'` anois i ``actions`` in "
"ionad tagairt feidhme díreach. Insíonn sé seo la:class: `ModelAdmin` "
"breathnú suas ar an ngníomh mar mhodh."

msgid ""
"Defining actions as methods gives the action more idiomatic access to "
"the :class:`ModelAdmin` itself, allowing the action to call any of the "
"methods provided by the admin."
msgstr ""
"Tugann gníomhartha a shainmhíniú mar mhodhanna rochtain níos idiomatiúla don "
"ghníomhaíocht ar an: class: `ModelAdmin` féin, rud a ligeann don ghníomh aon "
