msgid "The Django admin documentation generator"
msgstr "Gineadóir doiciméadaithe riaracháin Django"

msgid ""
"Django's :mod:`~django.contrib.admindocs` app pulls documentation from the "
"docstrings of models, views, template tags, and template filters for any app "
"in :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` and makes that documentation available from "
"the :mod:`Django admin <django.contrib.admin>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.admin>Django's:mod: `~django.contrib.admindocs` tarraingíonn "
"aip cáipéisíocht ó na docstrings samhlacha, tuairimí, clibeanna teimpléad, "
"agus scagairí teimpléad d'aon aip in:setting: `INSTALLED_APPS` agus cuireann "
"sé an doiciméad sin ar fáil ó:mod: `Django admin `."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Forbhreathnú"

msgid ""
"To activate the :mod:`~django.contrib.admindocs`, you will need to do the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Chun an: mod: `~django.contrib.admindocs` a ghníomhachtú, beidh ort an méid "
"seo a leanas a dhéanamh:"

msgid "Add :mod:`django.contrib.admindocs` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`."
msgstr "Cuir: MOD: `django.contrib.admindocs` le do: socrú: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
"Add ``path('admin/doc/', include('django.contrib.admindocs.urls'))`` to your "
"``urlpatterns``. Make sure it's included *before* the ``'admin/'`` entry, so "
"that requests to ``/admin/doc/`` don't get handled by the latter entry."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ``path ('admin/doc/', include ('django.contrib.admindocs.urls')) ``le "
"do `urlpatterns``. Déan cinnte go bhfuil an iontráil ``'admin/'`` san "
"áireamh aige roimh*, ionas nach láimhseálfar iarratais chuig ``/admin/doc/`` "
"ag an dara iontráil."

msgid "Install the :pypi:`docutils` 0.19+ package."
msgstr "Suiteáil an pacáiste: pypi: `docutils` 0.19+."

msgid ""
"**Optional:** Using the admindocs bookmarklets requires "
"``django.contrib.admindocs.middleware.XViewMiddleware`` to be installed."
msgstr ""
"**Roghnach: ** Ag baint úsáide as na marcanna leabhar admindocs teastaíonn "
"``Django.Contrib.adminDocs.Middleware.xviewMiddleware`` a shuiteáil."

msgid ""
"Once those steps are complete, you can start browsing the documentation by "
"going to your admin interface and clicking the \"Documentation\" link in the "
"upper right of the page."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh na céimeanna sin críochnaithe, is féidir leat tosú ag "
"brabhsáil na doiciméadaithe trí dhul chuig do chomhéadan riaracháin agus "
"cliceáil ar an nasc “Doiciméadú” ar dheis uachtarach an leathanaigh"

msgid "Documentation helpers"
msgstr "Cúntóirí doiciméadaithe"

msgid ""
"The following special markup can be used in your docstrings to easily create "
"hyperlinks to other components:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an marcáil speisialta seo a leanas a úsáid i do docstrings chun "
"hipearnasc a chruthú go héasca le comhpháirteanna eile:"

msgid "Django Component"
msgstr "Comhpháirt Django"

msgid "reStructuredText roles"
msgstr "Róil athstruchtúrthéacs"

msgid "``:model:`app_label.ModelName```"
msgstr "``:model: `App_Label.ModelName```"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Radharcanna"

msgid "``:view:`app_label.view_name```"
msgstr "``:view: `app_label.view_name``"

msgid "Template tags"
msgstr "Clibeanna teimpléid"

msgid "``:tag:`tagname```"
msgstr "``:tag: `tagname```"

