msgid "Facets"
msgstr "Gnéithe"

msgid ""
"By default, counts for each filter, known as facets, can be shown by "
"toggling on via the admin UI. These counts will update according to the "
"currently applied filters. See :attr:`ModelAdmin.show_facets` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, is féidir comhaireamh do gach scagaire, ar a "
"dtugtar gnéithe, a thaispeáint trí aistriú tríd an gChomhéadan riaracháin. "
"Déanfar na comhaireanta seo a nuashonrú de réir na scagairí atá i bhfeidh "
"Féach: attr: `ModelAdmin.show_facets` le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid "The Django admin site"
msgstr "Suíomh riaracháin Django"

msgid ""
"One of the most powerful parts of Django is the automatic admin interface. "
"It reads metadata from your models to provide a quick, model-centric "
"interface where trusted users can manage content on your site. The admin's "
"recommended use is limited to an organization's internal management tool. "
"It's not intended for building your entire front end around."
msgstr ""
"Ceann de na codanna is cumhachtaí de Django ná an comhéadan riaracháin "
"uathoibríoch. Léann sé meiteashonraí ó do mhúnlaí chun comhéadan tapa, "
"samhail-lárnach a sholáthar inar féidir le húsáideoirí iontaofa ábhar ar do "
"shuíomh a bhainistiú. Tá úsáid mholta an riaracháin teoranta d'uirlis "
"bhainistíochta inmheánach eagraíochta. Níl sé beartaithe chun do cheann "
"tosaigh iomlán a thógáil timpeall."

msgid ""
"The admin has many hooks for customization, but beware of trying to use "
"those hooks exclusively. If you need to provide a more process-centric "
"interface that abstracts away the implementation details of database tables "
"and fields, then it's probably time to write your own views."
msgstr ""
"Tá go leor crúcaí ag an riarachán le saincheaptha, ach bí cúramach ort "
"iarracht a dhéanamh na crúcaí sin a úsáid go heisiach Más gá duit comhéadan "
"níos dírithe ar phróiseas a sholáthar a chuireann achoimir sonraí cur chun "
"feidhme táblaí agus réimsí bunachar sonraí, is dócha go bhfuil sé in am do "
"thuairimí féin a scríobh."

msgid ""
"In this document we discuss how to activate, use, and customize Django's "
"admin interface."
msgstr ""
"Sa doiciméad seo pléimid conas comhéadan riaracháin Django a ghníomhachtú, a "
"úsáid agus a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The admin is enabled in the default project template used "
"by :djadmin:`startproject`."
msgstr ""
"Tá an riarachán cumasaithe sa teimpléad tionscadail réamhshocraithe a "
"úsáideann: djadmin: `startproject`."

msgid ""
"If you're not using the default project template, here are the requirements:"
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil an teimpléad tionscadail réamhshocraithe á úsáid agat, seo na "
"riachtanais:"

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.admin'`` and its dependencies "
"- :mod:`django.contrib.auth`, :mod:`django.contrib.contenttypes`, :mod:`django.contrib.messages`, "
"and :mod:`django.contrib.sessions` - to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ``django.contrib.admin'`` agus a spleáchais -:mod: "
"`django.contrib.auth`, :mod: `django.contrib.contenttypes`, :mod: "
"`django.contrib.messages`, agus:mod: `django.contrib.sessions` - le "
"duit:setting: `INSTALLED_APP_ `socrú."

msgid ""
"Configure a :class:`~django.template.backends.django.DjangoTemplates` "
"backend in your :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting with "
"``django.template.context_processors.request``, "
"``django.contrib.auth.context_processors.auth``, and "
"``django.contrib.messages.context_processors.messages`` in the "
"``'context_processors'`` option of :setting:`OPTIONS <TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>`."
msgstr ""
"<TEMPLATES-OPTIONS>Cumraigh a:class: "
"`~django.template.backends.django.djangoTemplates` cúltaca i d:setting: "
"`TEMPLATES` socrú le ``django.template.context_processors.request``, "
"`django.contrib.auth.context_processors.auth``, agus "
"``django.contrimessb.ages.context_processors.messages`` sa rogha "
"``'context_processors' ``de:setting: `OPTIONS `."

msgid ""
"If you've customized the :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` "
"setting, :class:`django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware`, :class:`django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware`, "
"and :class:`django.contrib.messages.middleware.MessageMiddleware` must be "
"included."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an socrú:setting: `MIDDLEWARE` saincheaptha agat, :class: "
"`django.contrib.sessions.middleware.sessionMiddleware`, :class: "
"`django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware`, agus:class: "
"`django.contrib.messages.middleware.messageMiddleware`."

msgid ""
":ref:`Hook the admin's URLs into your URLconf <hooking-adminsite-to-"
"urlconf>`."
msgstr ""
"<hooking-adminsite-to-urlconf>:ref: `Ceangail URLanna an riaracháin isteach "
"i do URLConf `."

msgid ""
"After you've taken these steps, you'll be able to use the admin site by "
"visiting the URL you hooked it into (``/admin/``, by default)."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis duit na céimeanna seo a ghlacadh, beidh tú in ann an suíomh "
"riaracháin a úsáid trí chuairt a thabhairt ar an URL a chuir tú isteach air "
"(``/admin/``, de réir réamhshocraithe)."

msgid ""
"If you need to create a user to login with, use "
"the :djadmin:`createsuperuser` command. By default, logging in to the admin "
"requires that the user has the :attr:`~.User.is_staff` attribute set to "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit úsáideoir a chruthú le logáil isteach leis, bain úsáid as an "
"ordú:djadmin: `createsuperuser`. De réir réamhshocraithe, éilíonn logáil "
"isteach sa riarachán go bhfuil an tréith: attr: `~.user.is_staff` socraithe "
"go ``True`` ag an úsáideoir."

msgid ""
"Finally, determine which of your application's models should be editable in "
"the admin interface. For each of those models, register them with the admin "
"as described in :class:`ModelAdmin`."
msgstr ""
"Faoi dheireadh, socraigh cé acu de na samhlacha d'iarratais ba chóir a "
"bheith in-eagarthóireachta sa chomhéadan riaracháin. Maidir le gach ceann de "
"na samhlacha sin, cláraigh iad leis an riarachán mar a thuairiscítear "
"in:class: `ModelAdmin`."

msgid "Other topics"
msgstr "Ábhair eile"

msgid ""
"For information about serving the static files (images, JavaScript, and CSS) "
"associated with the admin in production, see :ref:`serving-files`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh faisnéise maidir le freastal ar na comhaid statacha (íomhánna, "
"JavaScript, agus CSS) a bhaineann leis an riarachán atá i dtáirgeadh, "
"féach:ref: `serving-files`."

msgid "Having problems?  Try :doc:`/faq/admin`."
msgstr "Ag fadhbanna agat? Bain triail as: doc: `/faq/admin `."

