"Sa sampla roimhe seo, ní shainmhíníonn an rang ``ModelAdmin`` aon luachanna "
"saincheaptha (fós). Mar thoradh air sin, cuirfear an comhéadan riaracháin "
"réamhshocraithe ar fáil. Má tá tú sásta leis an gcomhéadan riaracháin "
"réamhshocraithe, ní gá duit réad ``ModelAdmin` a shainiú ar chor ar bith - "
"is féidir leat an rang samhail a chlárú gan cur síos ``ModelAdmin` a "
"sholáthar. D'fhéadfaí an sampla roimhe seo a shimpliú go:"

msgid "The ``register`` decorator"
msgstr "An maisitheoir ``clár``"

msgid "There is also a decorator for registering your ``ModelAdmin`` classes::"
msgstr "Tá maisitheoir ann freisin chun do ranganna ``ModelAdmin` a chlárú::"

msgid ""
"It's given one or more model classes to register with the ``ModelAdmin``. If "
"you're using a custom :class:`AdminSite`, pass it using the ``site`` keyword "
"argument::"
msgstr ""
"Tugtar rang samhail amháin nó níos mó dó chun clárú leis an ``ModelAdmin``. "
"Má tá saincheap:class: `AdminSite` á úsáid agat, pas é ag baint úsáide as an "
"argóint eochairfhocal ``láithreach`:"

msgid ""
"You can't use this decorator if you have to reference your model admin class "
"in its ``__init__()`` method, e.g. ``super(PersonAdmin, "
"self).__init__(*args, **kwargs)``. You can use ``super().__init__(*args, "
"**kwargs)``."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leat an maisitheoir seo a úsáid má chaithfidh tú tagairt a "
"dhéanamh do rang riaracháin samhail ina mhodh ``__init__ () `, m.sh. `super "
"(PersonAdmin, self). __init__ (*args, **kwargs) ``. Is féidir leat ``super "
"() a úsáid. __init__ (*args, **kwargs) ``."

msgid "Discovery of admin files"
msgstr "Faighneadh comhaid riaracháin"

msgid ""
"When you put ``'django.contrib.admin'`` in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` "
"setting, Django automatically looks for an ``admin`` module in each "
"application and imports it."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chuireann tú ``django.contrib.admin`` i do shuíomh: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS`, lorgaíonn Django modúl ``admin ``go huathoibríoch i ngach "
"feidhmchlár agus déanann Django é a allmhairiú."

msgid ""
"This is the default :class:`~django.apps.AppConfig` class for the admin. It "
"calls :func:`~django.contrib.admin.autodiscover()` when Django starts."
msgstr ""
"Seo an rang réamhshocraithe: class: `~django.apps.appconfig` don admin. "
"Glaonn sé: func: `~django.contrib.admin.autoDiscovery () `nuair a thosaíonn "
"Django."

msgid ""
"This class works like :class:`~django.contrib.admin.apps.AdminConfig`, "
"except it doesn't call :func:`~django.contrib.admin.autodiscover()`."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn an rang seo cosúil:class: `~django.contrib.admin.apps.adminConfig`, "
"ach amháin nach nglaonn sé: func: `~django.contrib.admin.autoDiscovery () `."

msgid ""
"A dotted import path to the default admin site's class or to a callable that "
"returns a site instance. Defaults to "
"``'django.contrib.admin.sites.AdminSite'``. See :ref:`overriding-default-"
"admin-site` for usage."
msgstr ""
"Conair allmhairithe poncanach chuig rang an láithreáin riaracháin "
"réamhshocraithe nó chuig glaoch a thugann sampla láithreáin ar ais. "
"Réamhshocraithe go ``django.contrib.admin.sites.adminsite'`. Féach: ref: "
"`overriding-default-admin-site` le húsáid."

msgid ""
"This function attempts to import an ``admin`` module in each installed "
"application. Such modules are expected to register models with the admin."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an fheidhm seo iarracht modúl ``admin ``a allmhairiú i ngach "
"feidhmchlár suiteáilte. Táthar ag súil go gclárfaidh modúil den sórt sin "
"samhlacha leis an riarach"

msgid ""
"Typically you won't need to call this function directly "
"as :class:`~django.contrib.admin.apps.AdminConfig` calls it when Django "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth ní bheidh ort an fheidhm seo a ghlaoch go díreach mar: class: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.apps.adminConfig` glaonn sé nuair a thosaíonn Django."

msgid ""
"If you are using a custom ``AdminSite``, it is common to import all of the "
"``ModelAdmin`` subclasses into your code and register them to the custom "
"``AdminSite``. In that case, in order to disable auto-discovery, you should "
"put ``'django.contrib.admin.apps.SimpleAdminConfig'`` instead of "
"``'django.contrib.admin'`` in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting."
msgstr ""
"Má tá tú ag úsáid saincheaptha ``AdminSite``, is coitianta na fo-aicmí "
"``ModelAdmin`` go léir a iompórtáil isteach i do chód agus iad a chlárú "
"chuig an saincheaptha ``AdminSite``. Sa chás sin, d'fhonn uathoibríoch a "
"dhíchumasú, ba chóir duit ``django.contrib.admin.apps.simpleAdminConfig'` a "
"chur in ionad ```django.contrib.admin'` i do shuíomh: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid "``ModelAdmin`` options"
msgstr "Roghanna ``ModelAdmin``"

msgid ""
"The ``ModelAdmin`` is very flexible. It has several options for dealing with "
"customizing the interface. All options are defined on the ``ModelAdmin`` "
"subclass::"
msgstr ""
"Tá an ``ModelAdmin`` an-solúbtha. Tá roinnt roghanna aige chun déileáil leis "
"an gcomhéadan a shaincheapadh. Sainmhínítear gach rogha ar an bhfo-aicme "
"``ModelAdmin``:"

msgid ""
"A list of actions to make available on the change list page. See :doc:`/ref/"
"contrib/admin/actions` for details."
msgstr ""
"Liosta de na gníomhartha atá le cur ar fáil ar an leathanach liosta "
"athraithe. Féach: doc: `/ref/contrib/admin/actions` le haghaidh sonraí."

msgid ""
"Controls where on the page the actions bar appears. By default, the admin "
"changelist displays actions at the top of the page (``actions_on_top = True; "
"actions_on_bottom = False``)."
msgstr ""
"Rialuithe áit a bhfuil an barra gníomhartha le feiceáil ar an leathanach. De "
"réir réamhshocraithe, taispeánann an liosta athraithe riaracháin gníomhartha "
"ag barr an leathanaigh (`actions_on_top = True; actions_on_bottom = False``)."

msgid ""
"Controls whether a selection counter is displayed next to the action "
"dropdown. By default, the admin changelist will display it "
"(``actions_selection_counter = True``)."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé an bhfuil cuntar roghnúcháin ar taispeáint in aice leis an "
"anuas gníomhaíochta. De réir réamhshocraithe, taispeánfaidh an liosta "
"athraithe riaracháin é (``actions_selection_counter = True``)."

msgid ""
"Set ``date_hierarchy`` to the name of a ``DateField`` or ``DateTimeField`` "
"in your model, and the change list page will include a date-based drilldown "
