":class: `~django.contrib.admin.tabularInline` tacaíocht theoranta do "
"`fieldsets``"

msgid ""
"Using ``fieldsets`` with :class:`~django.contrib.admin.TabularInline` has "
"limited functionality. You can specify which fields will be displayed and "
"their order within the ``TabularInline`` layout by defining ``fields`` in "
