msgid ""
"By default, a :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField` is displayed in the "
"admin site with a ``<select multiple>``. However, multiple-select boxes can "
"be difficult to use when selecting many items. Adding "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField` to this list will instead use a "
"nifty unobtrusive JavaScript \"filter\" interface that allows searching "
"within the options. The unselected and selected options appear in two boxes "
"side by side. See :attr:`~ModelAdmin.filter_vertical` to use a vertical "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"<select multiple>De réir réamhshocraithe, taispeántar a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.manyTomanyField` ar an suíomh riaracháin le ````. Mar sin "
"féin, is féidir go mbeadh sé deacair boscaí ilroghnaithe a úsáid agus go "
"leor míreanna á roghnú. Ag cur a:class: `~django.db.models.manyToManyField` "
"leis an liosta seo úsáidfear comhéadan “scagaire” JavaScript neamh-"
"neamhbhraith ina ionad sin a cheadaíonn cuardach laistigh de na roghanna. Tá "
"na roghanna neamhroghnaithe agus roghnaithe le feiceáil i dhá bhosca taobh "
"le taobh. Féach: attr: `~ModelAdmin.filter_vertical` chun comhéadan "
"ingearach a úsáid."

msgid ""
"Same as :attr:`~ModelAdmin.filter_horizontal`, but uses a vertical display "
"of the filter interface with the box of unselected options appearing above "
"the box of selected options."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna len:attr: `~ModelAdmin.filter_Horizontal`, ach úsáideann sé "
"taispeáint ingearach den chomhéadan scagaire leis an mbosca roghanna "
"neamhroghnaithe atá le feiceáil os cionn an bhosca na roghanna roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"By default a ``ModelForm`` is dynamically created for your model. It is used "
"to create the form presented on both the add/change pages. You can easily "
"provide your own ``ModelForm`` to override any default form behavior on the "
"add/change pages. Alternatively, you can customize the default form rather "
"than specifying an entirely new one by using the :meth:`ModelAdmin.get_form` "
"method."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe cruthaítear ``ModelForm`` go dinimiciúil do do "
"mhúnla. Úsáidtear é chun an fhoirm a chuirtear i láthair ar na leathanaigh "
"cuirte/athraigh a chruthú. Is féidir leat do `ModelForm ``féin a sholáthar "
"go héasca chun aon iompar foirme réamhshocraithe ar na leathanaigh cuirte/"
"athraithe a shárú. De rogha air sin, is féidir leat an fhoirm "
"réamhshocraithe a shaincheapadh seachas ceann iomlán nua a shonrú tríd an "
"modh: meth: `ModelAdmin.get_form` a úsáid."

