"`ModelAdmin.get_formSets_with_inlines`."

msgid ""
"Set ``list_display`` to control which fields are displayed on the change "
"list page of the admin."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_display`` chun na réimsí a thaispeántar ar leathanach liosta "
"athraithe an riaracháin a rialú."

msgid ""
"If you don't set ``list_display``, the admin site will display a single "
"column that displays the ``__str__()`` representation of each object."
msgstr ""
"Mura socraíonn tú ``list_display``, taispeánfaidh an suíomh riaracháin colún "
"amháin a thaispeánann léiriú ``__str__ () `de gach rud."

