"There are five types of values that can be used in ``list_display``. All but "
"the simplest may use the  :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` decorator, "
"which is used to customize how the field is presented:"
msgstr ""
"Tá cúig chineál luachanna ann is féidir a úsáid i ``list_display``. "
"Féadfaidh gach duine ach an ceann is simplí an maisitheoir: func: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.display` a úsáid, a úsáidtear chun an chaoi a "
"gcuirtear an réimse i láthair a shaincheapadh:"

msgid "The name of a model field. For example::"
msgstr "Ainm réimse samhail. Mar shampla::"

msgid "The name of a related field, using the ``__`` notation. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Ainm réimse gaolmhar, ag baint úsáide as an nótaí ``__``. Mar shampla::"

msgid "A callable that accepts one argument, the model instance. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Inghlaonta a ghlacann le argóint amháin, an tsamhail samhail. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"A string representing a ``ModelAdmin`` method that accepts one argument, the "
"model instance. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Sreang a léiríonn modh ``ModelAdmin`` a ghlacann le argóint amháin, an "
"tsamhail samhail. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"A string representing a model attribute or method (without any required "
"arguments). For example::"
msgstr ""
"Sreang a léiríonn tréith nó modh samhail (gan aon argóintí riachtanacha). "
"Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Support for using ``__`` lookups was added, when targeting related fields."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh tacaíocht le cuardaigh ``__`` a úsáid, agus iad ag díriú ar réimsí "
"gaolmhara."

msgid "A few special cases to note about ``list_display``:"
msgstr "Cúpla cás speisialta le tabhairt faoi deara faoi ``list_display``:"

msgid ""
"If the field is a ``ForeignKey``, Django will display the ``__str__()`` of "
"the related object."
msgstr ""
"Más ``ForeignKey`` an réimse, taispeánfaidh Django ``__str__ () ``den réad "
"gaolmhar."

msgid ""
"``ManyToManyField`` fields aren't supported, because that would entail "
"executing a separate SQL statement for each row in the table. If you want to "
"do this nonetheless, give your model a custom method, and add that method's "
"name to ``list_display``. (See below for more on custom methods in "
"``list_display``.)"
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le réimsí ``ManyTomanyField`, toisc go mbeadh sé sin i gceist "
"leis sin ráiteas SQL ar leithligh a fhorghníomhú do gach sraith sa tábla. "
"Más mian leat é seo a dhéanamh mar sin féin, tabhair modh saincheaptha do do "
"mhúnla, agus cuir ainm an mhodha sin le `list_display`. (Féach thíos le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh faoi mhodhanna saincheaptha i `list_display``.)"

msgid ""
"If the field is a ``BooleanField``, Django will display a pretty \"yes\", "
"\"no\", or \"unknown\" icon instead of ``True``, ``False``, or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Más ``Booleanfield`` é an réimse, taispeánfaidh Django deilbhín deas “tá”, "
"“níl”, nó “anaithnid” in ionad ``True``, `False``, nó ``None``."

msgid ""
"If the string given is a method of the model, ``ModelAdmin`` or a callable, "
"Django will HTML-escape the output by default. To escape user input and "
"allow your own unescaped tags, use :func:`~django.utils.html.format_html`."
msgstr ""
"Más modh den mhúnla é an teaghrán a thugtar, ``ModelAdmin`` nó inghlaoithe, "
"éalóidh Django an t-aschur HTML de réir réamhshocraithe. Chun ionchur "
"úsáideora a éalú agus do chlibeanna gan éalú féin a cheadú, bain úsáid as: "
"func: `~django.utils.html.format_html`."

msgid "Here's a full example model::"
msgstr "Seo samhail iomlán sampla::"

msgid ""
"As some examples have already demonstrated, when using a callable, a model "
"method, or a ``ModelAdmin`` method, you can customize the column's title by "
"wrapping the callable with the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` "
"decorator and passing the ``description`` argument."
msgstr ""
"Mar a léirigh roinnt samplaí cheana féin, agus modh inghlaonta, modh "
"samhail, nó modh `ModelAdmin` á úsáid agat, is féidir leat teideal an "
"cholúin a shaincheapadh tríd an glaoch a fhilleadh leis an "
"maisitheoir: :func: `~django.contrib.admin.display` agus an argóint "
"`Description` a rith."

msgid ""
"If the value of a field is ``None``, an empty string, or an iterable without "
"elements, Django will display ``-`` (a dash). You can override this "
"with :attr:`AdminSite.empty_value_display`::"
msgstr ""
"Más é luach réimse ``None``, teaghrán folamh, nó athraitheach gan eilimintí, "
"taispeánfaidh Django ``-`` (doic). Is féidir leat é seo a shárú le:attr: "
"`adminsite.empty_value_display`::"

msgid "You can also use :attr:`ModelAdmin.empty_value_display`::"
msgstr "Is féidir leat úsáid freisin: attr: `ModelAdmin.empty_value_display`::"

msgid "Or on a field level::"
msgstr "Nó ar leibhéal réimse::"

msgid ""
"If the string given is a method of the model, ``ModelAdmin`` or a callable "
"that returns ``True``, ``False``, or ``None``, Django will display a pretty "
"\"yes\", \"no\", or \"unknown\" icon if you wrap the method with "
"the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` decorator passing the ``boolean`` "
"argument with the value set to ``True``::"
msgstr ""
"Más modh den tsamhail é an teaghrán a thugtar, ``ModelAdmin`` nó glaoch a "
"thugann ar ais `True``, `False``, nó ``None``, taispeánfaidh Django deilbhín "
"deas “yes”, “níl”, nó “anaithnid” má fhilleann tú an modh leis an: func: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.` argóint olean`` leis an luach socraithe go ``True``:"

msgid ""
"The ``__str__()`` method is just as valid in ``list_display`` as any other "
"model method, so it's perfectly OK to do this::"
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``__str__ () ``chomh bailí i ``list_display`` agus aon mhodh "
"samhail eile, mar sin tá sé go foirfe ceart go leor é seo a dhéanamh:"

msgid ""
"Usually, elements of ``list_display`` that aren't actual database fields "
"can't be used in sorting (because Django does all the sorting at the "
"database level)."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth, ní féidir eilimintí de `list_display`` nach réimsí bunachar "
"sonraí iarbhír iad a úsáid i sórtáil (toisc go ndéanann Django an sórtáil go "
"léir ag leibhéal an bhunachar sonraí)."

msgid ""
"However, if an element of ``list_display`` represents a certain database "
"field, you can indicate this fact by using "
"the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` decorator on the method, passing "
"the ``ordering`` argument::"
msgstr ""
"Mar sin féin, má léiríonn eilimint de `list_display`` réimse áirithe "
"bunachar sonraí, is féidir leat an fíric seo a chur in iúl tríd an "
"maisitheoir: func: `~django.contrib.admin.display` a úsáid ar an modh, ag "
"rith an argóint ``ordú ``:"

msgid ""
"The above will tell Django to order by the ``first_name`` field when trying "
"to sort by ``colored_first_name`` in the admin."
msgstr ""
"Inseoidh an méid thuas do Django ordú ag an réimse ``first_name`` agus tú ag "
"iarraidh a shórtáil de réir `colorred_first_name`` sa riarachán."

msgid ""
"To indicate descending order with the ``ordering`` argument you can use a "
"hyphen prefix on the field name. Using the above example, this would look "
"like::"
msgstr ""
"Chun ordú íslitheach a chur in iúl leis an argóint ``ordú ``is féidir leat "
"réimír bhreitheach a úsáid ar ainm an réimse. Ag baint úsáide as an sampla "
"thuas, bheadh an chuma seo mar seo:"

msgid ""
"The ``ordering`` argument supports query lookups to sort by values on "
"related models. This example includes an \"author first name\" column in the "
"list display and allows sorting it by first name::"
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn an argóint ``ordú ``le cuardaigh fiosrúcháin chun sórtáil de réir "
"luachanna ar mhúnlaí gaolmhara. Cuimsíonn an sampla seo colún “céadainm an "
"údair” i dtaispeáint an liosta agus ceadaíonn sé é a shórtáil de réir chéad "
"ainm:"

msgid ""
":doc:`Query expressions </ref/models/expressions>` may be used with the "
"``ordering`` argument::"
msgstr ""
":doc: Is féidir 'abairtí ceisteach' a úsáid leis an argóint ``ordú ``</ref/"
"models/expressions>:"

msgid "Elements of ``list_display`` can also be properties ::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le heilimintí de `list_display`` a bheith ina airíonna freisin:"

msgid ""
"Note that ``@property`` must be above ``@display``. If you're using the old "
"way -- setting the display-related attributes directly rather than using "
"the :func:`~django.contrib.admin.display` decorator --  be aware that the "
"``property()`` function and **not** the ``@property`` decorator must be "
"used::"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh ``@property`` a bheith os cionn "
"``@display``. Má tá an seanbhealach á úsáid agat - ag socrú na tréithe a "
"bhaineann le taispeáint go díreach seachas an maisitheoir: func: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.display` a úsáid -- bí ar an eolas go gcaithfear an "
"fheidhm ``property () ``agus **not** an maisitheoir`` @property ``a úsáid:"

msgid ""
"The field names in ``list_display`` will also appear as CSS classes in the "
"HTML output, in the form of ``column-<field_name>`` on each ``<th>`` "
"element. This can be used to set column widths in a CSS file for example."
msgstr ""
"<field_name><th>Beidh na hainmneacha réimse i `list_display`` le feiceáil "
"mar ranganna CSS san aschur HTML, i bhfoirm ``column- ``ar gach eilimint`` "
"``. Is féidir é seo a úsáid chun leithead colún a shocrú i gcomhad CSS mar "
"shampla."

msgid ""
"Django will try to interpret every element of ``list_display`` in this order:"
msgstr ""
"Déanfaidh Django iarracht gach eilimint de `list_display`` a léirmhíniú san "
"ord seo:"

msgid "A field of the model or from a related field."
msgstr "Réimse den tsamhail nó ó réimse gaolmhar."

msgid "A callable."
msgstr "Is féidir glaoch."

msgid "A string representing a ``ModelAdmin`` attribute."
msgstr "Sreang a léiríonn tréith ``ModelAdmin``."

msgid "A string representing a model attribute."
msgstr "Sreang a léiríonn tréith samhail."

msgid ""
"For example if you have ``first_name`` as a model field and as a "
"``ModelAdmin`` attribute, the model field will be used."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla má tá ``first_name`` agat mar réimse samhail agus mar thréith "
"``ModelAdmin``, úsáidfear an réimse samhail."

msgid ""
"Use ``list_display_links`` to control if and which fields "
"in :attr:`list_display` should be linked to the \"change\" page for an "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid ``list_display_links`` chun rialú a dhéanamh ar chóir agus cé na "
"réimsí in:attr: `list_display` a nascadh leis an leathanach “athraigh” le "
"haghaidh réad."

msgid ""
"By default, the change list page will link the first column -- the first "
"field specified in ``list_display`` -- to the change page for each item. But "
"``list_display_links`` lets you change this:"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, nascfaidh an leathanach liosta athraithe an chéad "
"cholún - an chéad réimse a shonraítear in ``list_display`` - leis an "
"leathanach athraithe do gach mír. Ach ligeann ``list_display_links`` duit é "
"seo a athrú:"

msgid "Set it to ``None`` to get no links at all."
msgstr "Socraigh é go ``None ```chun aon naisc a fháil ar chor ar bith."

msgid ""
"Set it to a list or tuple of fields (in the same format as ``list_display``) "
"whose columns you want converted to links."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh é go liosta nó tuipéar réimsí (san fhormáid chéanna le "
"`list_display``) ar mhaith leat a gcolúin a thiontú go naisc."

msgid ""
"You can specify one or many fields. As long as the fields appear in "
"``list_display``, Django doesn't care how many (or how few) fields are "
"linked. The only requirement is that if you want to use "
"``list_display_links`` in this fashion, you must define ``list_display``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat réimsí amháin nó go leor a shonrú. Chomh fada agus a bhíonn "
"na réimsí le feiceáil in `list_display``, ní cúram le Django cé mhéad (nó cé "
"chomh beag) réimse atá nasctha. Is é an t-aon riachtanas ná más mian leat "
"``list_display_links`` a úsáid ar an mbealach seo, ní mór duit "
"``list_display`` a shainiú."

msgid ""
"In this example, the ``first_name`` and ``last_name`` fields will be linked "
"on the change list page::"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, beidh na réimsí ``first_name`` agus ``last_name`` nasctha ar "
"an leathanach liosta athraithe:"

msgid "In this example, the change list page grid will have no links::"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, ní bheidh aon naisc ag an eangach leathanaigh liosta "
"athraithe:"

msgid ""
"Set ``list_editable`` to a list of field names on the model which will allow "
"editing on the change list page. That is, fields listed in ``list_editable`` "
"will be displayed as form widgets on the change list page, allowing users to "
"edit and save multiple rows at once."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_editable`` go liosta d'ainmneacha réimse ar an tsamhail a "
"cheadóidh eagarthóireacht ar leathanach an liosta athraithe. Is é sin, "
"taispeánfar réimsí atá liostaithe i `list_editable`` mar ghuirléidí foirme "
"ar leathanach an liosta athraithe, rud a ligeann d'úsáideoirí sraitheanna "
"iolracha a chur in eagar agus a shábháil ag an am céanna."

msgid ""
"``list_editable`` interacts with a couple of other options in particular "
"ways; you should note the following rules:"
msgstr ""
"Idirghníomhaíonn ``list_editable`` le cúpla rogha eile ar bhealaí ar leith; "
"ba chóir duit na rialacha seo a leanas a thabhairt faoi deara:"

msgid ""
"Any field in ``list_editable`` must also be in ``list_display``. You can't "
"edit a field that's not displayed!"
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh aon réimse i `list_editable`` a bheith i `list_display`` freisin. "
"Ní féidir leat réimse nach bhfuil ar taispeáint a chur in eagar!"

msgid ""
"The same field can't be listed in both ``list_editable`` and "
"``list_display_links`` -- a field can't be both a form and a link."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an réimse céanna a liostú in ``list_editable`` agus "
"``list_display_links`` araon - ní féidir réimse a bheith ina fhoirm agus ina "
"nasc araon."

msgid "You'll get a validation error if either of these rules are broken."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú earráid bailíochtaithe má bhristear ceachtar de na rialacha "
"seo."

msgid ""
"Set ``list_filter`` to activate filters in the right sidebar of the change "
"list page of the admin."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_filter`` chun scagairí a ghníomhachtú i mbarra taobh na "
"láimhe deise ar leathanach liosta athraithe an riaracháin."

msgid ""
"At it's simplest ``list_filter`` takes a list or tuple of field names to "
"activate filtering upon, but several more advanced options as available. "
"See :ref:`modeladmin-list-filters` for the details."
msgstr ""
"Ag an rud is simplí glacann ``list_filter`` liosta nó tuple d'ainmneacha "
"réimse chun scagadh a ghníomhachtú, ach roinnt roghanna níos airde mar atá "
"ar fáil. Féach: ref: `modeladmin-list-filters` le haghaidh na sonraí."

msgid ""
"Set ``list_max_show_all`` to control how many items can appear on a \"Show "
"all\" admin change list page. The admin will display a \"Show all\" link on "
"the change list only if the total result count is less than or equal to this "
"setting. By default, this is set to ``200``."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_max_show_all`` chun a rialú cé mhéad earra is féidir le "
"feiceáil ar leathanach liosta athraithe riaracháin “Taispeáin go léir”. "
"Taispeánfaidh an riarachán nasc “Taispeáin go léir” ar an liosta athraithe "
"ach amháin má tá líon iomlán na dtorthaí níos lú ná nó cothrom leis an socrú "
"seo. De réir réamhshocraithe, tá sé seo socraithe go ``200``."

msgid ""
"Set ``list_per_page`` to control how many items appear on each paginated "
"admin change list page. By default, this is set to ``100``."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_per_page`` chun a rialú cé mhéad míreanna atá le feiceáil ar "
"gach leathanach liosta athraithe riaracháin leathanaigh. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, tá sé seo socraithe go ``100``."

msgid ""
"Set ``list_select_related`` to tell Django to "
"use :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.select_related` in retrieving "
"the list of objects on the admin change list page. This can save you a bunch "
"of database queries."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``list_select_related`` chun a rá le Django go n-úsáid:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset.select_related` agus an liosta rudaí ar an "
"leathanach liosta athraithe riaracháin a aisghabháil. Féadann sé seo dornán "
"ceisteanna bunachar sonraí a shábháil duit."

msgid ""
"The value should be either a boolean, a list or a tuple. Default is "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh an luach boolean, liosta nó tuple. Is é “False” "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"When value is ``True``, ``select_related()`` will always be called. When "
"value is set to ``False``, Django will look at ``list_display`` and call "
"``select_related()`` if any ``ForeignKey`` is present."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn luach ``True``, glaofar ar ``select_related () ``i gcónaí. "
"Nuair a shocraítear luach go `False``, féachfaidh Django ar `list_display`` "
"agus glaoidh sé ar ``select_related () ``má tá aon ``ForeignKey`` i láthair."

msgid ""
"If you need more fine-grained control, use a tuple (or list) as value for "
"``list_select_related``. Empty tuple will prevent Django from calling "
"``select_related`` at all. Any other tuple will be passed directly to "
"``select_related`` as parameters. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Má theastaíonn níos mó rialú mionghráin uait, bain úsáid as tuple (nó "
"liosta) mar luach do `list_select_related`. Cuirfidh tuple folamh cosc ar "
"Django glaoch ar ``select_related`` ar chor ar bith. Cuirfear aon tuple eile "
"ar aghaidh go díreach chuig ``select_related`` mar pharaiméadair. Mar "
"shampla::"

msgid "will call ``select_related('author', 'category')``."
msgstr "glaoifidh sé ar ``select_related ('author', 'category') ``."

msgid ""
"If you need to specify a dynamic value based on the request, you can "
"implement a :meth:`~ModelAdmin.get_list_select_related` method."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit luach dinimiciúil a shonrú bunaithe ar an iarratas, is féidir "
"leat modh a: meth: `~ModelAdmin.get_List_Select_Related` a chur i bhfeidhm."

msgid ""
"``ModelAdmin`` ignores this attribute "
"when :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.select_related` was already "
"called on the changelist's ``QuerySet``."
msgstr ""
"Déanann ``ModelAdmin`` neamhaird ar an tréith seo nuair a rinneadh: meth: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset.select_related` ar `QuerySet`` an "
"changelist cheana féin."

msgid ""
"Set ``ordering`` to specify how lists of objects should be ordered in the "
"Django admin views. This should be a list or tuple in the same format as a "
"model's :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.ordering` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``ordú ``chun a shonrú conas ba chóir liostaí rudaí a ordú i "
"dtuairimí riaracháin Django. Ba chóir go mbeadh sé seo ina liosta nó tuple "
"san fhormáid chéanna le paraiméadar samhail's:attr: "
"`~django.db.Models.Options.Ordering`."

msgid ""
"If this isn't provided, the Django admin will use the model's default "
"ordering."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear é seo ar fáil, úsáidfidh riarachán Django ordú "
"réamhshocraithe an tsamhail."

msgid ""
"If you need to specify a dynamic order (for example depending on user or "
"language) you can implement a :meth:`~ModelAdmin.get_ordering` method."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit ordú dinimiciúil a shonrú (mar shampla ag brath ar úsáideoir nó "
"ar theanga) is féidir leat modh a: meth: `~ModelAdmin.get_Ordering` a chur i "
"bhfeidhm."

msgid "Performance considerations with ordering and sorting"
msgstr "Creithnithe feidhmíochta maidir le hordú agus"

msgid ""
"To ensure a deterministic ordering of results, the changelist adds ``pk`` to "
"the ordering if it can't find a single or unique together set of fields that "
"provide total ordering."
msgstr ""
"Chun ordú cinntitheach torthaí a chinntiú, cuireann an liosta athraithe "
"`pk`` leis an ordú mura féidir leis sraith réimsí amháin nó uathúil a fháil "
"le chéile a sholáthraíonn ordú iomlán."

msgid ""
"For example, if the default ordering is by a non-unique ``name`` field, then "
"the changelist is sorted by ``name`` and ``pk``. This could perform poorly "
"if you have a lot of rows and don't have an index on ``name`` and ``pk``."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, má tá an t-ordú réamhshocraithe ag réimse ``ainm ``neamh-"
"uathúil, ansin déantar an liosta athraithe a shórtáil de réir ``ainm`` agus "
"`pk``. D'fhéadfadh sé seo feidhmiú go dona má tá go leor sraitheanna agat "
"agus mura bhfuil innéacs agat ar ``ainm ``agus `pk``."

msgid ""
"The paginator class to be used for pagination. By "
"default, :class:`django.core.paginator.Paginator` is used. If the custom "
"paginator class doesn't have the same constructor interface "
"as :class:`django.core.paginator.Paginator`, you will also need to provide "
"an implementation for :meth:`ModelAdmin.get_paginator`."
msgstr ""
"An rang paginator le húsáid le haghaidh leathanaigh. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, úsáidtear: class: `django.core.paginator.paginator`. Mura "
"bhfuil an comhéadan tógála céanna ag an rang paginator saincheaptha "
"las:class: `django.core.paginator.paginator`, beidh ort cur i bhfeidhm a "
"sholáthar freis:meth: `ModelAdmin.get_Paginator`."

msgid ""
"Set ``prepopulated_fields`` to a dictionary mapping field names to the "
"fields it should prepopulate from::"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``prepopulated_fields`` chuig foclóir ainmneacha réimse a mhapáil "
"chuig na réimsí ba chóir dó a réamhphoiliú ó:"

msgid ""
"When set, the given fields will use a bit of JavaScript to populate from the "
"fields assigned. The main use for this functionality is to automatically "
"generate the value for ``SlugField`` fields from one or more other fields. "
"The generated value is produced by concatenating the values of the source "
"fields, and then by transforming that result into a valid slug (e.g. "
"substituting dashes for spaces and lowercasing ASCII letters)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh sé socraithe, úsáidfidh na réimsí ar leith beagán JavaScript "
"chun líonadh ó na réimsí a shanntar. Is é an príomhúsáid don fheidhmiúlacht "
"seo an luach do réimsí ``Slugfield` a ghiniúint go huathoibríoch ó réimse "
"amháin nó níos mó eile. Déantar an luach a ghintear a tháirgeadh trí "
"luachanna na réimsí foinse a chomhcheangal, agus ansin tríd an toradh sin a "
"athrú ina slug bailí (m.sh. sraitheanna a chur in ionad spásanna agus "
"litreacha ASCII níos ísle)."

msgid ""
"Prepopulated fields aren't modified by JavaScript after a value has been "
"saved. It's usually undesired that slugs change (which would cause an "
"object's URL to change if the slug is used in it)."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhéanann JavaScript réamhphoilte a mhodhnú tar éis luach a shábháil. De "
"ghnáth ní theastaíonn sé go n-athraíonn slóga (rud a d'fhágfadh go n-athródh "
"URL réada má úsáidtear an slug ann)."

msgid ""
"``prepopulated_fields`` doesn't accept ``DateTimeField``, ``ForeignKey``, "
"``OneToOneField``, and ``ManyToManyField`` fields."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlacann ``prepopulated_fields`` le réimsí ``DateTimeField``, "
"`ForeignKey``, `OneTooneField``, agus ```ManyTomanyField``."

msgid ""
"By default, applied filters are preserved on the list view after creating, "
"editing, or deleting an object. You can have filters cleared by setting this "
"attribute to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, caomhnaítear scagairí feidhme ar amharc an liosta "
"tar éis réad a chruthú, a chur in eagar nó a scriosadh Is féidir leat "
"scagairí a ghlanadh tríd an tréith seo a shocrú go ``False``."

msgid ""
"Controls whether facet counts are displayed for filters in the admin "
"changelist. Defaults to :attr:`.ShowFacets.ALLOW`."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn cibé an dtaispeántar comhaireamh gnéithe do scagairí sa liosta "
"athraithe riaracháin. Réamhshocraithe chuig: attr: `.showFacets.allow`."

msgid ""
"When displayed, facet counts update in line with currently applied filters."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a thaispeántar, nuashonraíonn comhaireamh gnéithe i gcomhréir leis na "
"scagairí"

msgid "Enum of allowed values for :attr:`.ModelAdmin.show_facets`."
msgstr ""
"Enum na luachanna ceadaithe le haghaidh: attr: `.modeladmin.show_facets`."

msgid "Always show facet counts."
msgstr "Taispeáin líon gnéithe i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"Show facet counts when the ``_facets`` query string parameter is provided."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin comhaireamh gnéithe nuair a chuirtear an paraiméadar teaghrán "
"fiosrúcháin ``_facets`` ar fáil."

msgid "Never show facet counts."
msgstr "Ná taispeáin comhaireamh gnéithe riamh."

msgid ""
"Set ``show_facets`` to the desired :class:`.ShowFacets` value. For example, "
"to always show facet counts without needing to provide the query parameter::"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``show_facets`` go dtí an luach inmhianaithe: class: `.showFacets`. "
"Mar shampla, chun comhaireamh gnéithe a thaispeáint i gcónaí gan gá duit an "
"paraiméadar ceisteanna a sholáthar:"

msgid "Performance considerations with facets"
msgstr "Creithnithe feidhmíochta le gnéithe"

msgid ""
"Enabling facet filters will increase the number of queries on the admin "
"changelist page in line with the number of filters. These queries may cause "
"performance problems, especially for large datasets. In these cases it may "
"be appropriate to set ``show_facets`` to :attr:`.ShowFacets.NEVER` to "
"disable faceting entirely."
msgstr ""
"Méadóidh scagairí gnéithe a chumasú líon na gceisteanna ar leathanach an "
"liosta athraithe riaracháin i gcomhréir le líon na scagairí. D'fhéadfadh "
"fadhbanna feidhmíochta a bheith ina chúis leis na ceisteanna seo, go "
"háirithe do Sna cásanna seo d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith oiriúnach "
"``show_facets`` a shocrú go:attr: `.showFacets.Never` chun aghaidh a "
"dhíchumasú go hiomlán."

msgid ""
"By default, Django's admin uses a select-box interface (<select>) for fields "
"that are ``ForeignKey`` or have ``choices`` set. If a field is present in "
"``radio_fields``, Django will use a radio-button interface instead. Assuming "
"``group`` is a ``ForeignKey`` on the ``Person`` model::"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáideann riarachán Django comhéadan bosca "
"roghnaithe (<select>) do réimsí atá ``ForeignKey`` nó a bhfuil ``roghanna "
"``socraithe acu. Má tá réimse i láthair in `radio_fields``, úsáidfidh Django "
"comhéadan cnaipe raidió ina ionad. Ag glacadh leis gur ``Grúpa`` is "
"``Eochair Foreign`` ar an tsamhail ``Duine``:"

msgid ""
"You have the choice of using ``HORIZONTAL`` or ``VERTICAL`` from the "
"``django.contrib.admin`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá an rogha agat ``HORIZONTAL`` nó ``VERTICAL`` a úsáid ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.admin``."

msgid ""
"Don't include a field in ``radio_fields`` unless it's a ``ForeignKey`` or "
"has ``choices`` set."
msgstr ""
"Ná cuir réimse san áireamh i `radio_fields`` mura bhfuil ``ForeignKey`` ann "
"nó má tá tacar ``roghanna ``ann."

msgid ""
"``autocomplete_fields`` is a list of ``ForeignKey`` and/or "
"``ManyToManyField`` fields you would like to change to `Select2 <https://"
"select2.org/>`_ autocomplete inputs."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``autocomplete_fields`` liosta de réimsí ``ForeignKey`` agus/nó "
"``ManyTomanyField`` ar mhaith leat a athrú go `Select2`_ ionchuir "
"uathchomhlánaithe. < https://select2.org/>"

msgid ""
"By default, the admin uses a select-box interface (``<select>``) for those "
"fields. Sometimes you don't want to incur the overhead of selecting all the "
"related instances to display in the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáideann an riarachán comhéadan bosca roghnaithe "
"(<select>```) do na réimsí sin. Uaireanta níl tú ag iarraidh an lasbhreas a "
"thabhairt faoi na cásanna gaolmhara go léir a roghnú le taispeáint sa anuas."

msgid ""
"The Select2 input looks similar to the default input but comes with a search "
"feature that loads the options asynchronously. This is faster and more user-"
"friendly if the related model has many instances."
msgstr ""
"Breathnaíonn an t-ionchur Select2 cosúil leis an ionchur réamhshocraithe ach "
"tagann sé le gné cuardaigh a luchtaíonn na roghanna go gascrónach. Tá sé seo "
"níos tapúla agus níos éasca le húsáid má tá go leor cásanna ag an tsamhail "
"ghaolmhar."

msgid ""
"You must define :attr:`~ModelAdmin.search_fields` on the related object's "
"``ModelAdmin`` because the autocomplete search uses it."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór duit: attr: `~ModelAdmin.search_fields` a shainiú ar `ModelAdmin`` an "
"réad gaolmhar toisc go n-úsáideann an cuardach uathchomhlánaithe é."

msgid ""
"To avoid unauthorized data disclosure, users must have the ``view`` or "
"``change`` permission to the related object in order to use autocomplete."
msgstr ""
"Chun nochtadh sonraí neamhúdaraithe a sheachaint, caithfidh an cead "
"``amharc`` nó ``athraithe`` a bheith ag úsáideoirí don réad gaolmhar chun "
"uathchomhlánú a úsáid."

msgid ""
"Ordering and pagination of the results are controlled by the related "
"``ModelAdmin``'s :meth:`~ModelAdmin.get_ordering` "
"and :meth:`~ModelAdmin.get_paginator` methods."
msgstr ""
"Rialaítear ordú agus leathanaigh na dtorthaí ag na modhanna gaolmhara "
"``ModelAdmin``: Meth: `~ModelAdmin.get_Ordering` agus:meth: "
"`~ModelAdmin.get_Paginator`."

msgid ""
"In the following example, ``ChoiceAdmin`` has an autocomplete field for the "
"``ForeignKey`` to the ``Question``. The results are filtered by the "
"``question_text`` field and ordered by the ``date_created`` field::"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo a leanas, tá réimse uathchomhlánaithe ag ``ChoiceAdmin`` don "
"`ForeignKey`` chuig an `Cheiste``. Déantar na torthaí a scagadh ag an réimse "
"``question_text`` agus ordaítear leis an réimse ``date_created``:"

msgid "Performance considerations for large datasets"
msgstr "Breithnithe feidhmíochta do thacair mhóra"

msgid ""
"Ordering using :attr:`ModelAdmin.ordering` may cause performance problems as "
"sorting on a large queryset will be slow."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh fadhbanna feidhmíochta a bheith ina chúis le hordú ag baint "
"úsáide as: attr: `ModelAdmin.Ordering` toisc go mbeidh sórtáil ar thacar "
"cheisteanna mór mall."

msgid ""
"Also, if your search fields include fields that aren't indexed by the "
"database, you might encounter poor performance on extremely large tables."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis sin, má chuimsíonn do réimsí cuardaigh réimsí nach bhfuil "
"innéacsaithe ag an mbunachar sonraí, d'fhéadfá droch-fheidhmíocht ar tháblaí "
"an-mhóra."

msgid ""
"For those cases, it's a good idea to write your "
"own :func:`ModelAdmin.get_search_results` implementation using a full-text "
"indexed search."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis na cásanna sin, is smaoineamh maith é do chur i bhfeidhm féin: "
"func: `ModelAdmin.get_search_results` a scríobh ag baint úsáide as cuardach "
"innéacsaithe lántéacs."

msgid ""
"You may also want to change the ``Paginator`` on very large tables as the "
"default paginator always performs a ``count()`` query. For example, you "
"could override the default implementation of the ``Paginator.count`` "
"property."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir gur mhaith leat an ``Paginator`` a athrú ar tháblaí an-mhóra mar "
"go ndéanann an paginator réamhshocraithe fiosrúchán ``count () ``i gcónaí. "
"Mar shampla, d'fhéadfá cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe na maoine "
"``Paginator.count`` a shárú."

msgid ""
"By default, Django's admin uses a select-box interface (<select>) for fields "
"that are ``ForeignKey``. Sometimes you don't want to incur the overhead of "
"having to select all the related instances to display in the drop-down."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáideann riarachán Django comhéadan bosca "
"roghnaithe (<select>) do réimsí atá `ForeignKey``. Uaireanta níl tú ag "
"iarraidh an lasbhreas a thabhairt faoi na cásanna gaolmhara go léir a roghnú "
"le taispeáint sa anuas anuas."

msgid ""
"``raw_id_fields`` is a list of fields you would like to change into an "
"``Input`` widget for either a ``ForeignKey`` or ``ManyToManyField``::"
msgstr ""
"Is liosta réimsí é ``raw_id_fields`` ar mhaith leat a athrú go giuirléid "
"``Input`` le haghaidh `ForeignKey`` nó ``ManyTomanyField``:"

msgid ""
"The ``raw_id_fields`` ``Input`` widget should contain a primary key if the "
"field is a ``ForeignKey`` or a comma separated list of values if the field "
"is a ``ManyToManyField``.  The ``raw_id_fields`` widget shows a magnifying "
"glass button next to the field which allows users to search for and select a "
"value:"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh eochair phríomh-eochair sa ghuirléid ``raw_id_fields`` "
"``Input`` má tá `ForeignKey`` sa réimse nó liosta luachanna scartha cama-"
"scartha más ``ManyTomanyField`` an réimse. Taispeánann an giuirléid "
"``raw_id_fields`` cnaipe gloine formhéadúcháin in aice leis an réimse a "
"ligeann d'úsáideoirí luach a chuardach agus a roghnú:"

msgid ""
"By default the admin shows all fields as editable. Any fields in this option "
"(which should be a ``list`` or ``tuple``) will display its data as-is and "
"non-editable; they are also excluded from "
"the :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` used for creating and editing. Note "
"that when specifying :attr:`ModelAdmin.fields` "
"or :attr:`ModelAdmin.fieldsets` the read-only fields must be present to be "
"shown (they are ignored otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe taispeánann an riarachán gach réimse mar "
"ineagarthóir. Taispeánfaidh aon réimsí sa rogha seo (ar chóir a bheith ina "
"``liost`` nó ``tuple``) a chuid sonraí mar atá agus neamh-eagarthaithe; tá "
"siad eisiata freisin ó:class: `~django.forms.ModelForm` a úsáidtear chun "
"cruthú agus eagarthóireacht. Tabhair faoi deara go gcaithfidh na réimsí "
"léite amháin a bheith i láthair nuair a shonraítear: attr: "
"`ModelAdmin.Fields` nó: attr: `ModelAdmin.FieldSets` ní mór na réimsí léite "
"amháin a bheith i láthair le taispeáint (déantar neamhaird orthu ar shlí "
"eile)."

msgid ""
"If ``readonly_fields`` is used without defining explicit ordering "
"through :attr:`ModelAdmin.fields` or :attr:`ModelAdmin.fieldsets` they will "
"be added last after all editable fields."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáidtear ``readonly_fields`` gan ordú follasach a shainiú trí:attr: "
"`ModelAdmin.fields` nó: attr: `ModelAdmin.FieldSets` cuirfear iad go "
"deireanach tar éis gach réimse ineagarthóireachta."

msgid ""
"A read-only field can not only display data from a model's field, it can "
"also display the output of a model's method or a method of the "
"``ModelAdmin`` class itself. This is very similar to the "
"way :attr:`ModelAdmin.list_display` behaves. This provides a way to use the "
"admin interface to provide feedback on the status of the objects being "
"edited, for example::"
msgstr ""
"Ní amháin gur féidir le réimse léite amháin sonraí ó réimse samhail a "
"thaispeáint, féadann sé aschur modh samhail nó modh den rang ``ModelAdmin` "
"féin a thaispeáint freisin. Tá sé seo an-chosúil leis an mbealach: attr: "
"`ModelAdmin.list_display` iompraíonn. Soláthraíonn sé seo bealach chun an "
"comhéadan riaracháin a úsáid chun aiseolas a sholáthar ar stádas na rudaí "
"atá á chur in eagar, mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Set ``save_as`` to enable a \"save as new\" feature on admin change forms."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``save_as ``chun gné “sábháil mar nua” a chumasú ar fhoirmeacha "
"athraithe riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Normally, objects have three save options: \"Save\", \"Save and continue "
"editing\", and \"Save and add another\". If ``save_as`` is ``True``, \"Save "
"and add another\" will be replaced by a \"Save as new\" button that creates "
"a new object (with a new ID) rather than updating the existing object."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth, bíonn trí rogha sábhála ag rudaí: “Sábháil”, “Sábháil agus lean "
"ar aghaidh ag eagarthóireacht”, agus “Sábháil agus cuir eile leis”. Más é "
"``save_as`` `True``, cuirfear cnaipe “Sábháil mar nua” in ionad “Sábháil "
"agus cuir eile leis” a chruthaíonn réad nua (le ID nua) seachas an réad atá "
"ann cheana a nuashonrú."

msgid "By default, ``save_as`` is set to ``False``."
msgstr "De réir réamhshocraithe, socraítear ``save_as`` go ``False``."

msgid ""
"When :attr:`save_as=True <save_as>`, the default redirect after saving the "
"new object is to the change view for that object. If you set "
"``save_as_continue=False``, the redirect will be to the changelist view."
msgstr ""
"When: attr: `save_as = True <save_as>`, is é an t-atreorú réamhshocraithe "
"tar éis an réad nua a shábháil chuig an radharc athraithe don réad sin. Má "
"shocraíonn tú ``save_as_continue=False``, beidh an t-atreorú chuig an "
"radharc liosta athraithe."

msgid "By default, ``save_as_continue`` is set to ``True``."
msgstr "De réir réamhshocraithe, socraítear ``save_as_continue`` go ``True``."

msgid ""
"Set ``save_on_top`` to add save buttons across the top of your admin change "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``save_on_top`` chun cnaipí sábhála a chur ar fud barr "
"d'fhoirmeacha athraithe riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Normally, the save buttons appear only at the bottom of the forms. If you "
"set ``save_on_top``, the buttons will appear both on the top and the bottom."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth, ní bhíonn na cnaipí sábhála le feiceáil ach ag bun na "
"bhfoirmeacha. Má shocraíonn tú ``save_on_top``, beidh na cnaipí le feiceáil "
"ar an mbarr agus ar an mbun araon."

msgid "By default, ``save_on_top`` is set to ``False``."
msgstr "De réir réamhshocraithe, socraítear ``save_on_top`` go ``False``."

msgid ""
"Set ``search_fields`` to enable a search box on the admin change list page. "
"This should be set to a list of field names that will be searched whenever "
"somebody submits a search query in that text box."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh ``search_fields`` chun bosca cuardaigh a chumasú ar an leathanach "
"liosta athraithe riaracháin. Ba chóir é seo a shocrú ar liosta d'ainmneacha "
"réimse a chuardófar aon uair a chuireann duine fiosrúchán cuardaigh isteach "
"sa bhosca téacs sin."

msgid ""
"These fields should be some kind of text field, such as ``CharField`` or "
"``TextField``. You can also perform a related lookup on a ``ForeignKey`` or "
"``ManyToManyField`` with the lookup API \"follow\" notation::"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh réimse téacs de chineál éigin sna réimsí seo, mar shampla "
"``Charfield`` nó ``TextField``. Is féidir leat cuardach gaolmhar a dhéanamh "
"freisin ar ``ForeignKey`` nó ``ManyTomanyField`` leis an notáil “lean” API "
"cuardaigh:"

msgid ""
"For example, if you have a blog entry with an author, the following "
"definition would enable searching blog entries by the email address of the "
"author::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, má tá iontráil blag agat le húdar, chuirfeadh an sainmhíniú seo "
"a leanas ar chumas iontrálacha blag a chuardach de réir seoladh ríomhphoist "
"an údair:"

msgid ""
"When somebody does a search in the admin search box, Django splits the "
"search query into words and returns all objects that contain each of the "
"words, case-insensitive (using the :lookup:`icontains` lookup), where each "
"word must be in at least one of ``search_fields``. For example, if "
"``search_fields`` is set to ``['first_name', 'last_name']`` and a user "
"searches for ``john lennon``, Django will do the equivalent of this SQL "
"``WHERE`` clause:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a dhéanann duine cuardach sa bhosca cuardaigh riaracháin, scoilteann "
"Django an fiosrúchán cuardaigh ina bhfocail agus filleann gach rud ina "
"bhfuil gach ceann de na focail, neamh-íogair (ag baint úsáide as an "
"lorga:lookup: `icontains` lookup), áit a gcaithfidh gach focal a bheith i "
"gceann de `search_fields`` ar a laghad. Mar shampla, má shocraítear "
"``search_fields`` go ``['first_name', 'last_name']`` agus má chuardaíonn "
"úsáideoir ``john lennon``, déanfaidh Django an chomhionann leis an gclásal "
"SQL ``WHERE``:"

msgid ""
"The search query can contain quoted phrases with spaces. For example, if a "
"user searches for ``\"john winston\"`` or ``'john winston'``, Django will do "
"the equivalent of this SQL ``WHERE`` clause:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir frásaí luaite le spásanna a bheith san fhiosrúchán cuardaigh. Mar "
"shampla, má dhéanann úsáideoir cuardach ar ``\"john winston\"`` nó ```john "
"winston'``, déanfaidh Django an coibhéis leis an gclásal ``WHERE`` SQL seo:"

msgid ""
"If you don't want to use ``icontains`` as the lookup, you can use any lookup "
"by appending it the field. For example, you could use :lookup:`exact` by "
"setting ``search_fields`` to ``['first_name__exact']``."
msgstr ""
"Mura dteastaíonn uait ``icontains`` a úsáid mar an cuardach, is féidir leat "
"aon chuardach a úsáid tríd an réimse a chur leis. Mar shampla, d'fhéadfá: "
"lookup: `exact` a úsáid trí `search_fields`` a shocrú go "
"``['first_name__correct']``."

msgid ""
"Some (older) shortcuts for specifying a field lookup are also available. You "
"can prefix a field in ``search_fields`` with the following characters and "
"it's equivalent to adding ``__<lookup>`` to the field:"
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt aicearraí (níos sine) chun cuardach réimse a shonrú ar fáil "
"freisin. <lookup>Is féidir leat réimse réimse a réamhrú in `search_fields`` "
"leis na carachtair seo a leanas agus tá sé coibhéiseach le ``__ ``a chur "
"leis an réimse:"

