"iad a leathnú mar a dhoiciméadaithe in:doc: `/topics/http/urls`, ag baint "
"úsáide as an fillteán ``adminsite.admin_view () ``ar do thuairimí::"

msgid ""
"If you want to use the admin layout, extend from ``admin/base_site.html``:"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat an leagan amach riaracháin a úsáid, síneadh ó ``admin/"
