"meaitseálfaidh siad beagnach aon rud, mar sin de ghnáth beidh tú ag iarraidh "
"do URLanna saincheaptha a phleanáil leis na cinn ionsuite."

msgid ""
"In this example, ``my_view`` will be accessed at ``/admin/myapp/mymodel/"
