msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, beidh rochtain ar ``my_view`` ag ``/admin/myapp/mymodel/"
"my_view/`` (ag glacadh leis go bhfuil na URLanna riaracháin san áireamh ag "
"``/admin/``.)"

msgid ""
"If the page is cacheable, but you still want the permission check to be "
