msgstr ""
"Má tá an leathanach incháilithe, ach má theastaíonn uait fós go ndéanfaí an "
"seiceáil ceada, is féidir leat argóint ``cacheable=True`` a chur ar aghaidh "
"chuig `adminsite.admin_view () ``:"

msgid ""
"``ModelAdmin`` views have ``model_admin`` attributes. Other ``AdminSite`` "
