msgstr ""
"Tá tréithe ``model_admin ``ag tuairimí ``ModelAdmin``. Tá tréithe "
"``admin_site`` ag tuairimí `adminSite`` eile."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` class for use in the admin add "
"and change views, see :meth:`add_view` and :meth:`change_view`."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a:class: `~django.forms.ModelForm` rang le húsáid sa riarachán "
"tuairimí cuir agus athraigh, féach:meth: `add_view` agus:meth: `change_view`."

msgid ""
"The base implementation uses :func:`~django.forms.models.modelform_factory` "
"to subclass :attr:`~form`, modified by attributes such as :attr:`~fields` "
"and :attr:`~exclude`. So, for example, if you wanted to offer additional "
"fields to superusers, you could swap in a different base form like so::"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an cur i bhfeidhm bonn:func: "
"`~django.forms.models.modelform_factory` go fo-aicme: attr: `~form`, "
"modhnaithe ag tréithe mar: attr: `~fields` agus:attr: `~fields` agus:attr: "
"`~ eisiúint `. Mar sin, mar shampla, dá dteastaíonn uait réimsí breise a "
"thairiscint do sárúsáideoirí, d'fhéadfá malartú i bhfoirm bhonn difriúil mar "
"sin:"

msgid ""
"You may also return a custom :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` class directly."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh tú rang saincheap:class: `~django.forms.ModelForm` a thabhairt ar "
"ais go díreach freisin."

msgid ""
"Yields (``FormSet``, :class:`InlineModelAdmin`) pairs for use in admin add "
"and change views."
msgstr ""
"Péirí torthaí (``FormSet``, :class: `InlineModelAdmin`) le húsáid i "
"riarachán tuairimí a chur leis agus a athrú."

msgid ""
"For example if you wanted to display a particular inline only in the change "
"view, you could override ``get_formsets_with_inlines`` as follows::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla más mian leat inlíne áirithe a thaispeáint sa radharc athraithe "
"amháin, d'fhéadfá ``get_formsets_with_inlines`` a shárú mar seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"The ``formfield_for_foreignkey`` method on a ``ModelAdmin`` allows you to "
"override the default formfield for a foreign keys field. For example, to "
"return a subset of objects for this foreign key field based on the user::"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an modh ``formfield_for_foreignkey`` ar `ModelAdmin`` duit an réimse "
"foirme réamhshocraithe do réimse eochracha eachtracha eachtracha a shárú. "
"Mar shampla, chun fo-thacar rudaí a thabhairt ar ais don phríomhréimse "
"eachtrach seo bunaithe ar an úsáideoir:"

msgid ""
"This uses the ``HttpRequest`` instance to filter the ``Car`` foreign key "
"field to only display the cars owned by the ``User`` instance."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann sé seo an tsampla `HttpRequest`` chun an réimse eochair eachtrach "
"``Car`` a scagadh chun na gluaisteáin atá faoi úinéireacht an ``Úsáideora "
"``a thaispeáint ach amháin."

msgid ""
"For more complex filters, you can use ``ModelForm.__init__()`` method to "
"filter based on an ``instance`` of your model (see :ref:`fields-which-handle-"
"relationships`). For example::"
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh scagairí níos casta, is féidir leat ``ModelForm a úsáid. Modh "
"__init__ () ``chun scagadh bunaithe ar `instance`` de do mhúnla (féach:ref: "
"`fields-what-handle-reachships`). Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Like the ``formfield_for_foreignkey`` method, the "
"``formfield_for_manytomany`` method can be overridden to change the default "
"formfield for a many to many field. For example, if an owner can own "
"multiple cars and cars can belong to multiple owners -- a many to many "
"relationship -- you could filter the ``Car`` foreign key field to only "
"display the cars owned by the ``User``::"
msgstr ""
"Cosúil leis an modh ``formfield_for_foreignkey``, is féidir an modh "
"``formfield_for_manytomany`` a athrú chun an réimse foirme réamhshocraithe "
"do réimse go leor réimse a athrú. Mar shampla, más féidir le húinéir "
"ilghluaisteáin a bheith ag úinéir agus is féidir gluaisteáin a bheith "
"bainteach le go leor úinéirí -- d'fhéadfá an réimse eochair eachtrach "
"``Carr` a scagadh chun na gluaisteáin atá faoi úinéireacht an ``Úsáideora "
"``a thaispeáint amháin:"

msgid ""
"Like the ``formfield_for_foreignkey`` and ``formfield_for_manytomany`` "
"methods, the ``formfield_for_choice_field`` method can be overridden to "
"change the default formfield for a field that has declared choices. For "
"example, if the choices available to a superuser should be different than "
"those available to regular staff, you could proceed as follows::"
msgstr ""
"Cosúil leis na modhanna ``formfield_for_foreignkey`` agus "
"``formfield_for_manytomany``, is féidir an modh "
"``formfield_for_choice_field`` a athrú chun an réimse foirme réamhshocraithe "
"a athrú do réimse a bhfuil roghanna dearbhaithe aige. Mar shampla, más chóir "
"go mbeadh na roghanna atá ar fáil do sárúsáideoir difriúil ná na roghanna "
"atá ar fáil d'fhoireann rialta, d'fhéadfá dul ar aghaidh mar seo a leanas:"

msgid "``choices`` limitations"
msgstr "Teorainneacha ``roghna``"

msgid ""
"Any ``choices`` attribute set on the formfield will be limited to the form "
"field only. If the corresponding field on the model has choices set, the "
"choices provided to the form must be a valid subset of those choices, "
"otherwise the form submission will fail with "
"a :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ValidationError` when the model itself is "
"validated before saving."
msgstr ""
"Beidh aon tréith ``roghna`` atá leagtha amach ar an réimse foirme teoranta "
"don réimse foirme amháin. Má tá roghanna socraithe sa réimse comhfhreagrach "
"ar an tsamhail, caithfidh na roghanna a chuirtear ar fáil don fhoirm a "
"bheith ina fho-thacar bailí de na roghanna sin, ar shlí eile teipeann ar an "
"aighneacht foirme le a:exc: `~django.core.exceptions.validationError` nuair "
"a bhailítear an tsamhail féin sula ndéantar é a shábháil."

msgid ""
"Returns the ``Changelist`` class to be used for listing. By default, "
"``django.contrib.admin.views.main.ChangeList`` is used. By inheriting this "
"class you can change the behavior of the listing."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an rang ``Changelist`` atá le húsáid le haghaidh liostú. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, úsáidtear ``django.contrib.admin.views.main.changeList``. "
"Trí an rang seo a oidhreacht is féidir leat iompar an liostaithe a athrú."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` class for use in the ``Formset`` "
"on the changelist page. To use a custom form, for example::"
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceann a:class: `~django.forms.ModelForm` rang le húsáid sa "
"``FormSet`` ar an leathanach liosta athraithe. Chun foirm saincheaptha a "
"úsáid, mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"If you define the ``Meta.model`` attribute on "
"a :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`, you must also define the ``Meta.fields`` "
"attribute (or the ``Meta.exclude`` attribute). However, ``ModelAdmin`` "
"ignores this value, overriding it with the :attr:`ModelAdmin.list_editable` "
"attribute. The easiest solution is to omit the ``Meta.model`` attribute, "
"since ``ModelAdmin`` will provide the correct model to use."
msgstr ""
"Má shainmhíníonn tú an tréith ``Meta.Model`` ar a:class: "
"`~Django.Forms.ModelForm`, ní mór duit an tréith ``Meta.Fields`` a shainiú "
"freisin (nó an tréith ``Meta.Exclude``). Mar sin féin, déanann "
"``ModelAdmin`` neamhaird ar an luach seo, agus é a shárú leis an tréith: "
"attr: `ModelAdmin.list_editable`. Is é an réiteach is éasca an tréith "
"`Meta.Model ``a fhágáil, ós rud é go soláthróidh ``ModelAdmin`` an tsamhail "
"cheart le húsáid."

msgid ""
"Returns a :ref:`ModelFormSet <model-formsets>` class for use on the "
"changelist page if :attr:`~ModelAdmin.list_editable` is used. To use a "
"custom formset, for example::"
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a:ref: `ModelFormSet <model-formsets>`aicme le húsáid ar an "
"leathanach liosta athraithe má úsáidtear: attr: `~ModelAdmin.list_editable`. "
"Chun tacar foirme saincheaptha a úsáid, mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"The objects in the changelist page can be filtered with lookups from the "
"URL's query string. This is how :attr:`list_filter` works, for example. The "
"lookups are similar to what's used in :meth:`.QuerySet.filter` (e.g. "
"``user__email=user@example.com``). Since the lookups in the query string can "
"be manipulated by the user, they must be sanitized to prevent unauthorized "
"data exposure."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir na rudaí ar leathanach an liosta athraithe a scagadh le cuardaigh "
"ó shreang fiosrúcháin an URL. Seo mar a oibríonn: attr: `list_filter`, mar "
"shampla. Tá na cuardaigh cosúil leis an méid a úsáidtear in:meth: "
"`.querySet.filter` (m.sh. ``user__email= user@example.com ``). Ós rud é gur "
"féidir leis an úsáideoir na cuardaigh sa sreangán fiosrúcháin a ionramháil, "
"caithfear iad a shláintiú chun nochtadh sonraí neamhúdaraithe a chosc."

msgid ""
"The ``lookup_allowed()`` method is given a lookup path from the query string "
"(e.g. ``'user__email'``), the corresponding value (e.g. "
"``'user@example.com'``), and the request, and returns a boolean indicating "
"whether filtering the changelist's ``QuerySet`` using the parameters is "
"permitted. If ``lookup_allowed()`` returns ``False``, "
"``DisallowedModelAdminLookup`` (subclass "
"of :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.SuspiciousOperation`) is raised."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar cosán cuardaigh don modh ``lookup_allow () ``ón sreang ceisteanna "
"(m.sh. ```user__email'``), an luach comhfhreagrach (m.sh. "
"```user@example.com '``), agus an t-iarratas, agus tugann sé boolean ag "
"tabhairt le fios an bhfuil ceadaithe ag scagadh ``QuerySet`` ag baint úsáide "
"as na paraiméadair. Má fhilleann ``lookup_allow () ```False``,, "
"DisallowedModelAdminlookup`` (fo-aicme de:exc: "
"`~Django.Core.Exceptions.SuspiciousOperation`) a ardaítear."

msgid ""
"By default, ``lookup_allowed()`` allows access to a model's local fields, "
"field paths used in :attr:`~ModelAdmin.list_filter` (but not paths "
"from :meth:`~ModelAdmin.get_list_filter`), and lookups required "
"for :attr:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey.limit_choices_to` to function "
"correctly in :attr:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.raw_id_fields`."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, ceadaíonn ``lookup_allow () ``rochtain ar réimsí "
"áitiúla samhail, cosáin réimse a úsáidtear in:attr: "
"`~ModelAdmin.list_filter` (ach ní cosáin ó:meth: "
"`~ModelAdmin.get_list_filter`), agus cuardaigh atá ag teastáil le haghaidh: "
"attr: `~Django.db.models.foreignkey.limit_choices_to` feidhmiú i gceart "
"in:attr: `~django.contrib.admin.modeladmin.raw_id_fields`."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the lookups permitted for "
"your :class:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin` subclass."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh an modh seo chun na cuardaigh a cheadaítear do d'fho-aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modelAdmin` a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"Should return ``True`` if viewing ``obj`` is permitted, ``False`` otherwise. "
"If obj is ``None``, should return ``True`` or ``False`` to indicate whether "
"viewing of objects of this type is permitted in general (e.g., ``False`` "
"will be interpreted as meaning that the current user is not permitted to "
"view any object of this type)."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``True`` a thabhairt ar ais má cheadaítear féachaint ar ``obj``, "
"`False`` ar shlí eile. Más é obj ``None``, ba cheart ``True`` nó `False`` a "
"thabhairt ar ais chun a léiriú an bhfuil ceadaithe féachaint ar rudaí den "
"chineál seo go ginearálta (m.sh., léirmhínítear ``False`` mar a chiallaíonn "
"nach ceadaítear don úsáideoir reatha aon rud den chineál seo a fheiceáil)."

msgid ""
"The default implementation returns ``True`` if the user has either the "
"\"change\" or \"view\" permission."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe ``True`` ar ais má tá an cead "
"“athraigh” nó “féachaint” ag an úsáideoir."

msgid ""
"Should return ``True`` if adding an object is permitted, ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``True`` a thabhairt ar ais má cheadaítear réad a chur leis, "
"``False`` ar shlí eile."

msgid ""
"Should return ``True`` if editing ``obj`` is permitted, ``False`` otherwise. "
"If ``obj`` is ``None``, should return ``True`` or ``False`` to indicate "
"whether editing of objects of this type is permitted in general (e.g., "
"``False`` will be interpreted as meaning that the current user is not "
"permitted to edit any object of this type)."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``True`` a thabhairt ar ais má cheadaítear ``obj`` eagarthóireacht, "
"``False`` ar shlí eile. Má tá ``obj`` ``None``, ba cheart ``True`` nó "
"`False`` a thabhairt ar ais chun a léiriú an bhfuil ceadaithe "
"eagarthóireacht rudaí den chineál seo i gcoitinne (m.sh., léirmhínítear "
"``False`` mar a chiallaíonn nach ceadaítear don úsáideoir reatha aon rud den "
"chineál seo a chur in eagar)."

msgid ""
"Should return ``True`` if deleting ``obj`` is permitted, ``False`` "
"otherwise. If ``obj`` is ``None``, should return ``True`` or ``False`` to "
"indicate whether deleting objects of this type is permitted in general "
"(e.g., ``False`` will be interpreted as meaning that the current user is not "
"permitted to delete any object of this type)."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir ``True`` a thabhairt ar ais má cheadaítear ``obj`` a scriosadh, "
"``False`` ar shlí eile. Má tá ``obj`` ``None``, ba cheart ``True`` nó "
"`False`` a thabhairt ar ais chun a léiriú an gceadaítear rudaí den chineál "
"seo a scriosadh go ginearálta (m.sh., léirmhínítear ``False`` mar a "
"chiallaíonn nach ceadaítear don úsáideoir reatha aon rud den chineál seo a "
"scriosadh)."

msgid ""
"Should return ``True`` if displaying the module on the admin index page and "
"accessing the module's index page is permitted, ``False`` otherwise. "
"Uses :meth:`User.has_module_perms() "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.has_module_perms>` by default. Overriding "
"it does not restrict access to the view, add, change, or delete "
"views, :meth:`~ModelAdmin.has_view_permission`, :meth:`~ModelAdmin.has_add_permission`, :meth:`~ModelAdmin.has_change_permission`, "
"and :meth:`~ModelAdmin.has_delete_permission` should be used for that."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go bhfilleadh ``True`` má cheadaítear an modúl a thaispeáint ar "
"leathanach innéacs an riaracháin agus rochtain a fháil ar leathanach innéacs "
"an mhodúil, ``False`` ar shlí eile. "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.has_module_perms>Úsáid:Meth: "
"`User.has_module_perms () `de réir réamhshocraithe. Ní chuireann sé srian ar "
"rochtain ar an radharc, cuir, athrú nó scriosadh radhairc, :meth: "
"`~modeladmin.has_view_permission`, :meth: "
"`~modeladmin.has_add_permission`, :meth: "
"`~ModelAdmin.has_Change_Permission`, agus:meth: "
"`~ModelAdmin.has_delete_permission` a úsáid chuige sin."

msgid ""
"The ``get_queryset`` method on a ``ModelAdmin`` returns "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet` of all model instances that can "
"be edited by the admin site. One use case for overriding this method is to "
"show objects owned by the logged-in user::"
msgstr ""
"Tugann an modh `get_queryset`` ar `ModelAdmin`` a: class: "
"`~django.db.models.queryset` de gach cás samhail is féidir leis an suíomh "
"riaracháin a chur in eagar. Cás úsáide amháin chun an modh seo a shárú is ea "
"rudaí atá faoi úinéireacht an úsáideora logáilte isteach a thaispeáint:"

msgid ""
"Sends a message to the user using the :mod:`django.contrib.messages` "
"backend.  See the :ref:`custom ModelAdmin example <custom-admin-action>`."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé teachtaireacht chuig an úsáideoir ag baint úsáide as an gcúltaca: "
"mod: `django.contrib.messages`. <custom-admin-action>Féach an:ref: `sampla "
"saincheaptha ModelAdmin `."

msgid ""
"Keyword arguments allow you to change the message level, add extra CSS tags, "
"or fail silently if the ``contrib.messages`` framework is not installed. "
"These keyword arguments match those "
"for :func:`django.contrib.messages.add_message`, see that function's "
"documentation for more details. One difference is that the level may be "
"passed as a string label in addition to integer/constant."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann argóintí eochairfhocal duit leibhéal na teachtaireachta a athrú, "
"clibeanna CSS breise a chur leis, nó teip go ciúin mura bhfuil an creat "
"`contrib.messages` suiteáilte. Meaitseálann na hargóintí eochairfhocal seo "
"leo siúd le haghaidh: func: `django.contrib.messages.add_message`, féach "
"doiciméadú na feidhme sin le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí. Difríocht amháin is "
"ea go bhféadfar an leibhéal a rith mar lipéad teaghrán i dteannta le sláin/"
"tairiseach."

msgid ""
"Returns an instance of the paginator to use for this view. By default, "
"instantiates an instance of :attr:`paginator`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé sampla den paginator ar ais le húsáid don radharc seo. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, cruthaíonn sé sampla de:attr: `paginator`."

msgid ""
"Determines the :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` for the :meth:`add_view` "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé an:class: `~django.http.httpResponse` don chéime:meth: "
"`add_view`."

msgid ""
"``response_add`` is called after the admin form is submitted and just after "
"the object and all the related instances have been created and saved. You "
"can override it to change the default behavior after the object has been "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Glaofar `response_add`` tar éis an fhoirm riaracháin a chur isteach agus "
"díreach tar éis an réad agus na cásanna gaolmhara go léir a chruthú agus a "
"shábháil. Is féidir leat é a shárú chun an t-iompar réamhshocraithe a athrú "
"tar éis an réad a chruthú."

msgid ""
"Determines the :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` for "
"the :meth:`change_view` stage."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé an:class: `~django.http.httpResponse` don chéime:meth: "
"`change_view`."

msgid ""
"``response_change`` is called after the admin form is submitted and just "
"after the object and all the related instances have been saved. You can "
"override it to change the default behavior after the object has been changed."
msgstr ""
"Glaofar `response_change`` tar éis an fhoirm riaracháin a chur isteach agus "
"díreach tar éis an réad agus na cásanna gaolmhara go léir a shábháil. Is "
"féidir leat é a shárú chun an t-iompar réamhshocraithe a athrú tar éis an "
"réad a athrú."

msgid ""
"Determines the :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` for "
"the :meth:`delete_view` stage."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé an:class: `~django.http.httpResponse` don chéime:meth: "
"`delete_view`."

msgid ""
"``response_delete`` is called after the object has been deleted. You can "
"override it to change the default behavior after the object has been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Glaofar ar `response_delete`` tar éis an réad a scriosadh. Is féidir leat é "
"a shárú chun an t-iompar réamhshocraithe a athrú tar éis an réad a scriosadh."

msgid "``obj_display`` is a string with the name of the deleted object."
msgstr "Is teaghrán é ``obj_display`` le hainm an réad scriosta."

msgid ""
"``obj_id`` is the serialized identifier used to retrieve the object to be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``obj_id`` an t-aitheantóir sraitheach a úsáidtear chun an réad atá le "
"scriosadh a aisghabháil."

msgid ""
"A hook for customizing the keyword arguments passed to the constructor of a "
"formset. For example, to pass ``request`` to formset forms::"
msgstr ""
"Crúca chun na hargóintí eochairfhocal a shaincheapadh chuig tógálaí "
"foirmshraith. Mar shampla, chun ``iarrat`` a chur chuig foirmeacha "
"foirmeacha:"

msgid "You can also use it to set ``initial`` for formset forms."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat é a úsáid freisin chun ``initial`` a shocrú d'fhoirmeacha "
"foirmeacha."

msgid ""
"A hook for the initial data on admin change forms. By default, fields are "
"given initial values from ``GET`` parameters. For instance, ``?"
"name=initial_value`` will set the ``name`` field's initial value to be "
"``initial_value``."
msgstr ""
"Croca do na sonraí tosaigh ar fhoirmeacha athraithe riaracháin. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, tugtar luachanna tosaigh do réimsí ó pharaiméadair `GET``. "
"Mar shampla, ``? name=initial_value`` socróidh luach tosaigh an réimse "
"``ainm`` mar ``luach_inicial``."

msgid ""
"This method should return a dictionary in the form ``{'fieldname': "
"'fieldval'}``::"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir don modh seo foclóir a thabhairt ar ais sa fhoirm ``{'fieldname': "
"'fieldval'}``:"

msgid ""
"A hook for customizing the deletion process of the :meth:`delete_view` and "
"the \"delete selected\" :doc:`action <actions>`."
msgstr ""
"<actions>Crúca chun an próiseas scriostha den: meth: `delete_view` agus an "
"“scrios roghnaithe”: doc: `action `a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"The ``objs`` argument is a homogeneous iterable of objects (a ``QuerySet`` "
"or a list of model instances) to be deleted, and ``request`` is "
"the :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest`."
msgstr ""
"Is é an argóint ``objs ``is athraitheach aonchineálach de rudaí "
"(``QuerySet`` nó liosta cásanna samhail) atá le scriosadh, agus is é "
"``request`` an:class: `~django.http.httpRequest`."

msgid ""
"This method must return a 4-tuple of ``(deleted_objects, model_count, "
"perms_needed, protected)``."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an modh seo 4-tuple de ``(deleted_objects, model_count, "
"perms_needed, protected)`` a thabhairt ar ais."

msgid ""
"``deleted_objects`` is a list of strings representing all the objects that "
"will be deleted. If there are any related objects to be deleted, the list is "
"nested and includes those related objects. The list is formatted in the "
"template using the :tfilter:`unordered_list` filter."
msgstr ""
"Is liosta de na teaghráin is ea `deleted_objects`` a léiríonn na rudaí go "
"léir a scriosfar. Má tá aon rudaí gaolmhara le scriosadh, tá an liosta "
"neadaithe agus tá na rudaí gaolmhara sin san áireamh. Déantar an liosta a "
"fhormáidiú sa teimpléad ag baint úsáide as an scagair:tfilter: "
"`unordered_list`."

msgid ""
"``model_count`` is a dictionary mapping each "
"model's :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.verbose_name_plural` to the number "
"of objects that will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Is foclóir é ``model_count`` mapáil gach samhail's:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.verbose_name_plural` ar líon na rudaí a scriosfar."

msgid ""
"``perms_needed`` is a set "
"of :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.verbose_name`\\s of the models that the "
"user doesn't have permission to delete."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``perms_needed`` sraith de:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.verbose_name`\\ s de na samhlacha nach bhfuil "
"cead ag an úsáideoir a scriosadh."

msgid ""
"``protected`` is a list of strings representing of all the protected related "
"objects that can't be deleted. The list is displayed in the template."
msgstr ""
"Is liosta de na teaghráin a léiríonn na rudaí gaolmhara cosanta go léir nach "
"féidir iad a scriosadh. Taispeántar an liosta sa teimpléad."

msgid "Other methods"
msgstr "Modhanna eile"

msgid "Django view for the model instance addition page. See note below."
msgstr ""
"Amharc Django don leathanach breise samhail samhail. Féach an nóta thíos."

msgid "Django view for the model instance editing page. See note below."
msgstr ""
"Amharc Django don leathanach eagarthóireachta sampla samhail. Féach an nóta "
"thíos."

msgid ""
"Django view for the model instances change list/actions page. See note below."
msgstr ""
"Amharc Django don leathanach athraithe cásanna samhail liosta/gníomhartha. "
"Féach an nóta thíos."

msgid ""
"Django view for the model instance(s) deletion confirmation page. See note "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Amharc Django do leathanach dearbhaithe scriosadh samhail (í) samhail. Féach "
"an nóta thíos."

msgid ""
"Django view for the page that shows the modification history for a given "
"model instance."
msgstr ""
"Amharc Django don leathanach a thaispeánann stair an mhodhnaithe do shampla "
"samhail ar leith."

msgid ""
"Unlike the hook-type ``ModelAdmin`` methods detailed in the previous "
"section, these five methods are in reality designed to be invoked as Django "
"views from the admin application URL dispatching handler to render the pages "
"that deal with model instances CRUD operations. As a result, completely "
"overriding these methods will significantly change the behavior of the admin "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Murab ionann agus na modhanna ``ModelAdmin`` de chineál haca a sonraíodh sa "
"chuid roimhe seo, tá na cúig mhodh seo deartha i ndáiríre chun iad a ghairm "
"mar thuairimí Django ó láimhseálaí seolta URL an fheidhmchláir riaracháin "
"chun na leathanaigh a dhéileálann le cásanna samhail oibríochtaí CRUD a "
"rinneadh. Mar thoradh air sin, athróidh na modhanna seo a shárú go hiomlán "
"iompar an fheidhmchláir riaracháin go suntasach."

msgid ""
"One common reason for overriding these methods is to augment the context "
"data that is provided to the template that renders the view. In the "
"following example, the change view is overridden so that the rendered "
"template is provided some extra mapping data that would not otherwise be "
"available::"
msgstr ""
"Cúis choitianta amháin chun na modhanna seo a shárú is ea na sonraí "
"comhthéacs a chuirtear ar fáil don teimpléad a léiríonn an dearcadh a "
"mhéadú. Sa sampla seo a leanas, cuirtear an dearcadh athraithe a athrú ionas "
"go gcuirtear roinnt sonraí mapála breise ar fáil don teimpléad rindreáilte "
"nach mbeadh ar fáil ar shlí eile:"

msgid ""
"These views return :class:`~django.template.response.TemplateResponse` "
"instances which allow you to easily customize the response data before "
"rendering. For more details, see the :doc:`TemplateResponse documentation </"
"ref/template-response>`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann na tuairimí seo ar ais: class: "
"`~django.template.Response.TemplateResponse` cásanna a ligeann duit na "
"sonraí freagartha a shaincheapadh go héasca sula ndéantar iad a rindreáil. "
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí, féach an:doc: `TemplateResponse "
"doiciméadúcháin </ref/template-response>."

msgid "``ModelAdmin`` asset definitions"
msgstr "Sainmhínithe sócmhainní ``ModelAdmin``"

msgid ""
"There are times where you would like add a bit of CSS and/or JavaScript to "
"the add/change views. This can be accomplished by using a ``Media`` inner "
"class on your ``ModelAdmin``::"
msgstr ""
"Tá amanna ann nuair ba mhaith leat beagán CSS agus/nó JavaScript a chur leis "
"na tuairimí a chur leis na tuairimí a chur leis /athraigh. Is féidir é seo a "
"chur i gcrích trí rang istigh ``Meáin ``a úsáid ar do `ModelAdmin``:"

msgid ""
"The :doc:`staticfiles app </ref/contrib/staticfiles>` "
"prepends :setting:`STATIC_URL` (or :setting:`MEDIA_URL` "
"if :setting:`STATIC_URL` is ``None``) to any asset paths. The same rules "
"apply as :ref:`regular asset definitions on forms <form-asset-paths>`."
msgstr ""
"Tá an aip: doc: `staticfiles `réasúnaí:socrú: `STATIC_URL` (nó</ref/contrib/"
"staticfiles> :socrú: `MEDIA_URL` más:socrú: ``STATIC_URL` ``None``) le haon "
"chosáin sócmhainní. <form-asset-paths>Tá na rialacha céanna i bhfeidhm "
"as:ref: `sainmhínithe rialta sócmhainní ar fhoirmeacha `."

msgid "jQuery"
msgstr "jQuery"

msgid "Django admin JavaScript makes use of the `jQuery`_ library."
msgstr "Baineann JavaScript admin Django úsáid as an leabharlann `jQuery `_."

msgid ""
"To avoid conflicts with user-supplied scripts or libraries, Django's jQuery "
"(version 3.7.1) is namespaced as ``django.jQuery``. If you want to use "
"jQuery in your own admin JavaScript without including a second copy, you can "
"use the ``django.jQuery`` object on changelist and add/edit views. Also, "
"your own admin forms or widgets depending on ``django.jQuery`` must specify "
"``js=['admin/js/jquery.init.js', …]`` when :ref:`declaring form media assets "
"<assets-as-a-static-definition>`."
msgstr ""
"Chun coinbhleachtaí a sheachaint le scripteanna nó leabharlanna a "
"sholáthraíonn an úsáideoir, déantar jQuery Django (leagan 3.7.1) spás "
"ainmneacha mar “Django.jQuery”. Más mian leat jQuery a úsáid i do JavaScript "
"riaracháin féin gan an dara cóip a áireamh, is féidir leat an réad "
"``Django.jQuery ``a úsáid ar changelist agus tuairimí a chur leis /eagar. "
"<assets-as-a-static-definition>Chomh maith leis sin, ní mór d'fhoirmeacha nó "
"giuirléidí riaracháin féin ag brath ar ``django.jQuery`` ``js= ['admin/js/"
"jquery.init.js',...] ``a shonrú nuai:ref: `sócmhainní meán foirm a dhearbhú "
"`."

msgid ""
"The :class:`ModelAdmin` class requires jQuery by default, so there is no "
"need to add jQuery to your ``ModelAdmin``’s list of media resources unless "
"you have a specific need. For example, if you require the jQuery library to "
"be in the global namespace (for example when using third-party jQuery "
"plugins) or if you need a newer version of jQuery, you will have to include "
"your own copy."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn an rang:Class: `ModelAdmin` jQuery de réir réamhshocraithe, mar sin "
"ní gá jQuery a chur le liosta d'acmhainní meán ``ModelAdmin` mura bhfuil "
"riachtanas sonrach agat. Mar shampla, má theastaíonn uait go mbeidh "
"leabharlann jQuery sa spás ainmneacha domhanda (mar shampla agus breiseáin "
"jQuery tríú páirtí á úsáid agat) nó má theastaíonn leagan níos nuaí de "
"jQuery uait, beidh ort do chóip féin a chur san áireamh."

msgid ""
"Django provides both uncompressed and 'minified' versions of jQuery, as "
"``jquery.js`` and ``jquery.min.js`` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django leaganacha neamhchomhbhrúite agus 'minified' de jQuery "
"araon, mar ``jquery.js ``agus ``jquery.min.js`` faoi seach."

msgid ""
":class:`ModelAdmin` and :class:`InlineModelAdmin` have a ``media`` property "
"that returns a list of ``Media`` objects which store paths to the JavaScript "
"files for the forms and/or formsets. If :setting:`DEBUG` is ``True`` it will "
"return the uncompressed versions of the various JavaScript files, including "
"``jquery.js``; if not, it will return the 'minified' versions."
msgstr ""
":class: `ModelAdmin` agus:class: `InlineModelAdmin` maoin ``media ``a "
"thugann ar ais liosta de rudaí ``Media`` a stóráil cosáin chuig na comhaid "
"JavaScript do na foirmeacha agus/nó foirmeacha. Más rud é: Socrú: ``True`` "
"is é `DEBUG`, cuirfidh sé na leaganacha neamhchomhbhrúite de na comhaid "
"éagsúla JavaScript ar ais, lena n-áirítear ``jquery.js ``; mura bhfuil, "
"cuirfidh sé ar ais na leaganacha 'minifithe'."

msgid "Adding custom validation to the admin"
msgstr "Bailíochtú saincheaptha a chur leis an riarachán"

msgid ""
"You can also add custom validation of data in the admin. The automatic admin "
"interface reuses :mod:`django.forms`, and the ``ModelAdmin`` class gives you "
"the ability to define your own form::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat bailíochtú saincheaptha sonraí a chur leis sa riarachán "
"freisin. Athúsáideann an comhéadan riaracháin uathoibrí:mod: `django.forms`, "
"agus tugann an rang ``ModelAdmin`` an cumas duit d'fhoirm féin a shainiú::"

msgid ""
"``MyArticleAdminForm`` can be defined anywhere as long as you import where "
"needed. Now within your form you can add your own custom validation for any "
"field::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir `MyArticleAdminform`` a shainiú áit ar bith chomh fada agus a "
"iompórtáil tú nuair is gá. Anois laistigh de d'fhoirm is féidir leat do "
"bhailíochtú saincheaptha féin a chur le haghaidh aon réimse:"

msgid ""
"It is important you use a ``ModelForm`` here otherwise things can break. See "
"the :doc:`forms </ref/forms/index>` documentation on :doc:`custom validation "
"</ref/forms/validation>` and, more specifically, the :ref:`model form "
