msgstr ""
"Ar dtús - tagairtí aicme ``MembershipInline`` ``Group.Members.Through ``. Is "
"tagairt é an tréith ``trí ``don tsamhail a bhainistíonn an gaol go leor. "
"Cruthaíonn Django an tsamhail seo go huathoibríoch nuair a shainmhíníonn tú "
"réimse go leor."

msgid ""
"Secondly, the ``GroupAdmin`` must manually exclude the ``members`` field. "
"Django displays an admin widget for a many-to-many field on the model that "
"defines the relation (in this case, ``Group``). If you want to use an inline "
"model to represent the many-to-many relationship, you must tell Django's "
"admin to *not* display this widget - otherwise you will end up with two "
"widgets on your admin page for managing the relation."
msgstr ""
"Ar an dara dul síos, ní mór don `Groupadmin`` an réimse ``baill ``a eisiamh "
