msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, dá mba mhaith linn uirlis a chur leis an amharc liosta "
"athraithe do na samhlacha go léir in aip darb ainm ``my_app``, chóipeáil "
"``contrib/admin/templates/admin/change_list.html`` chuig eolaire ``templates/"
"admin/my_app/`` dár dtionscadal, agus déanfaimis aon athruithe riachtanacha."

msgid ""
"If we wanted to add a tool to the change list view for only a specific model "
"named 'Page', we would copy that same file to the ``templates/admin/my_app/"
"page`` directory of our project."
msgstr ""
"Dá dteastaíonn uirlis a chur leis an amharc liosta athraithe amháin le "
