msgstr "``submit_line.html ``"

msgid ""
"For those templates that cannot be overridden in this way, you may still "
"override them for your entire project by placing the new version in your "
"``templates/admin`` directory. This is particularly useful to create custom "
"404 and 500 pages."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis na teimpléid sin nach féidir iad a shárú ar an mbealach seo, "
"féadfaidh tú iad a shárú do do thionscadal iomlán tríd an leagan nua a chur "
"i d'eolaire ``teimpléad/admin ``. Tá sé seo úsáideach go háirithe chun "
"leathanach saincheaptha 404 agus 500 a chruthú."

msgid ""
"Some of the admin templates, such as ``change_list_results.html`` are used "
"to render custom inclusion tags. These may be overridden, but in such cases "
"you are probably better off creating your own version of the tag in question "
"and giving it a different name. That way you can use it selectively."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear cuid de na teimpléid riaracháin, mar shampla "
"``change_list_results.html`` chun clibeanna cuimsithe saincheaptha a "
"rinneadh. D'fhéadfaí iad seo a shárú, ach i gcásanna den sórt sin is dócha "
"gur fearr duit do leagan féin den chlib atá i gceist a chruthú agus ainm "
"difriúil a thabhairt dó. Ar an mbealach sin is féidir leat é a úsáid go "
"roghnach."

msgid "Root and login templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid fréamh agus logála isteach"

msgid ""
"If you wish to change the index, login or logout templates, you are better "
"off creating your own ``AdminSite`` instance (see below), and changing "
"the :attr:`AdminSite.index_template` , :attr:`AdminSite.login_template` "
"or :attr:`AdminSite.logout_template` properties."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat na teimpléid innéacs, logáil isteach nó logáil amach a athrú, "
"is fearr duit do shampla ``Adminsite`` féin a chruthú (féach thíos), agus "
"airíonna: attr: `Adminsite.index_Template`, :attr: "
"`Adminsite.login_Template` nó: attr: `Adminsite.logout_Template` a athrú."

msgid "Theming support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht téamaí"

msgid ""
"The admin uses CSS variables to define colors and fonts. This allows "
"changing themes without having to override many individual CSS rules. For "
"example, if you preferred purple instead of blue you could add a ``admin/"
"base.html`` template override to your project:"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an riarachán athróga CSS chun dathanna agus clónna a shainiú. "
"Ligeann sé seo téamaí a athrú gan go leor rialacha CSS aonair a shárú. Mar "
"shampla, más fearr leat corcra in ionad gorm d'fhéadfá teimpléad `admin/"
"base.html` a chur le do thionscadal:"

msgid ""
"The list of CSS variables are defined at :source:`django/contrib/admin/"
"static/admin/css/base.css`."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear liosta na n-athróg CSS ag:source: `django/contrib/admin/static/"
"admin/css/base.css`."

msgid ""
"Dark mode variables, respecting the `prefers-color-scheme`_ media query, are "
"defined at :source:`django/contrib/admin/static/admin/css/dark_mode.css`. "
"This is linked to the document in ``{% block dark-mode-vars %}``."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear athróga mód dorcha, ag meas an cheist meán `prefers-color-"
"scheme`_, a:source: `django/contrib/admin/static/admin/css/dark_mode.css`. "
"Tá sé seo nasctha leis an doiciméad i ``{% block dark-mode-vars%} `."

msgid "``extrabody`` block"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can add custom HTML, JavaScript, or other content to appear just before "
"the closing ``</body>`` tag of templates that extend ``admin/base.html`` by "
"extending the ``extrabody`` block. For example, if you want an alert to "
"appear on page load you could add a ``admin/base.html`` template override to "
"your project:"
msgstr ""

msgid "``AdminSite`` objects"
msgstr "rudaí ``Admin Site``"

msgid ""
"A Django administrative site is represented by an instance of "
"``django.contrib.admin.sites.AdminSite``; by default, an instance of this "
"class is created as ``django.contrib.admin.site`` and you can register your "
"models and ``ModelAdmin`` instances with it."
msgstr ""
"Léirítear suíomh riaracháin Django le sampla de "
"``django.contrib.admin.sites.adminSite``; de réir réamhshocraithe, "
"cruthaítear sampla den rang seo mar ``django.contrib.admin.site`` agus is "
"féidir leat do mhúnlaí agus cásanna ``ModelAdmin` a chlárú leis."

msgid ""
"If you want to customize the default admin site, you can :ref:`override it "
"<overriding-default-admin-site>`."
msgstr ""
"<overriding-default-admin-site>Más mian leat an suíomh riaracháin "
"réamhshocraithe a shaincheapadh, is féidir leat: ref: `é a shárú `."

msgid ""
"When constructing an instance of an ``AdminSite``, you can provide a unique "
"instance name using the ``name`` argument to the constructor. This instance "
"name is used to identify the instance, especially when :ref:`reversing admin "
"URLs <admin-reverse-urls>`. If no instance name is provided, a default "
"instance name of ``admin`` will be used. See :ref:`customizing-adminsite` "
"for an example of customizing the :class:`AdminSite` class."
msgstr ""
"Agus sampla de ``Adminsite' á thógáil agat, is féidir leat ainm sampla "
"uathúil a sholáthar ag baint úsáide as an argóint ``ainm ``don tógálaí. "
"<admin-reverse-urls>Úsáidtear an t-ainm sampla seo chun an cás a aithint, go "
"háirithe nuair:ref: `URLanna riaracháin a aisiompú `. Mura gcuirtear aon "
"ainm sampla ar fáil, úsáidfear ainm sampla réamhshocraithe de ``admin ``. "
"Féach: ref: `customizing-adminsite` le haghaidh sampla den aicme: class: "
"`adminSite` a shaincheapadh."

msgid "A :class:`~weakref.WeakSet` contains all admin site instances."
msgstr "A: Class: `~ WeakRef.WeakSet` tá gach cás láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid "``AdminSite`` attributes"
msgstr "``AdminSite`` tréithe"

msgid ""
"Templates can override or extend base admin templates as described "
"in :ref:`admin-overriding-templates`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le teimpléid teimpléid riaracháin bonn a shárú nó a leathnú mar a "
"thuairiscítear in:ref: `admin-overriding-temples`."

msgid ""
"The text to put at the top of each admin page, as a ``<div>`` (a string). By "
"default, this is \"Django administration\"."
msgstr ""
"An téacs le cur ag barr gach leathanach riaracháin, mar ``<div>`` "
"(teaghrán). De réir réamhshocraithe, is é seo “riarachán Django”."

msgid ""
"The text to put at the end of each admin page's ``<title>`` (a string). By "
"default, this is \"Django site admin\"."
msgstr ""
"An téacs le cur ag deireadh gach leathanach riaracháin <title>```(teaghrán). "
"De réir réamhshocraithe, is é seo “Riarachán láithreáin Django”."

msgid ""
"The URL for the \"View site\" link at the top of each admin page. By "
"default, ``site_url`` is ``/``. Set it to ``None`` to remove the link."
msgstr ""
"An URL don nasc “Féach ar an suíomh” ag barr gach leathanach riaracháin. De "
"réir réamhshocraithe, is é ``site_url ````/``. Socraigh é go ``None ``chun "
"an nasc a bhaint."

msgid ""
"For sites running on a subpath, the :meth:`each_context` method checks if "
"the current request has ``request.META['SCRIPT_NAME']`` set and uses that "
"value if ``site_url`` isn't set to something other than ``/``."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le suíomhanna atá ag rith ar fho-chosán, seiceálann an modh:meth: "
"`each_context` an bhfuil `request.meta ['SCRIPT_NAME'] ``socraithe sa "
"iarraidh reatha agus úsáideann sé an luach sin mura bhfuil ``site_url`` "
"socraithe ar rud éigin seachas ``/``."

msgid ""
"The text to put at the top of the admin index page (a string). By default, "
"this is \"Site administration\"."
msgstr ""
"An téacs le cur ag barr an leathanaigh innéacs riaracháin (sreang). De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, is é seo “Riarachán láithreáin”."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site main index "
"view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh príomh-amharc innéacs an "
"láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site app index view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh amharc innéacs aip an "
"láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"The string to use for displaying empty values in the admin site's change "
"list. Defaults to a dash. The value can also be overridden on a per "
"``ModelAdmin`` basis and on a custom field within a ``ModelAdmin`` by "
"setting an ``empty_value_display`` attribute on the field. "
"See :attr:`ModelAdmin.empty_value_display` for examples."
msgstr ""
"An teaghrán le húsáid chun luachanna folmha a thaispeáint i liosta athraithe "
"an láithreáin riaracháin. Réamhshocraithe go sraitheanna. Is féidir an luach "
"a shárú freisin ar bhonn ``ModelAdmin`` agus ar réimse saincheaptha laistigh "
"de ``ModelAdmin`` trí thréith ``empty_value_display`` a shocrú ar an réimse. "
"Féach: attr: `ModelAdmin.empty_value_display` le haghaidh samplaí."

msgid ""
"A boolean value that determines whether to show the navigation sidebar on "
"larger screens. By default, it is set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Luach boolean a chinneann an dtaispeánfar an barra taobh nascleanúna ar "
"scáileáin níos mó. De réir réamhshocraithe, tá sé socraithe go ``True``."

msgid ""
"A boolean value that determines whether to add a final catch-all view to the "
"admin that redirects unauthenticated users to the login page. By default, it "
"is set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Luach boolean a chinneann an gcuirfear dearcadh deiridh catch-all a chur "
"leis an riarachán a atreoraíonn úsáideoirí neamhfhíordheimhnithe chuig an "
"leathanach logála isteach. De réir réamhshocraithe, tá sé socraithe go "
"``True``."

msgid ""
"Setting this to ``False`` is not recommended as the view protects against a "
"potential model enumeration privacy issue."
msgstr ""
"Ní mholtar é seo a shocrú go `False` toisc go gcosnaíonn an dearcadh i "
"gcoinne saincheist phríobháideachta féideartha líonta samhail."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site login view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh amharc logála isteach an "
"láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Subclass of :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` that will "
"be used by the admin site login view."
msgstr ""
"Fo-aicme de:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` a "
"úsáidfidh amharc logála isteach an láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site logout view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh amharc logáil amach an "
"láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site password "
"change view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh amharc athraithe pasfhocal "
"an láithreáin riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom template that will be used by the admin site password "
"change done view."
msgstr ""
"Conair chuig teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáidfidh athrú pasfhocal an "
"láithreáin riaracháin amharc déanta."

msgid "``AdminSite`` methods"
msgstr "Modhanna ``Adminsite``"

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of variables to put in the template context for every "
"page in the admin site."
msgstr ""
"Tugann foclóir athróg ar ais le cur i gcomhthéacs an teimpléid do gach "
"leathanach ar an suíomh riaracháin."

msgid "Includes the following variables and values by default:"
msgstr "Cuimsíonn sé na hathróga agus na luachanna seo a leanas de réir"

msgid "``site_header``: :attr:`AdminSite.site_header`"
msgstr "``site_header``: :attr: `Adminsite.site_header`"

msgid "``site_title``: :attr:`AdminSite.site_title`"
msgstr "``site_title``: :attr: `Adminsite.site_title`"

msgid "``site_url``: :attr:`AdminSite.site_url`"
msgstr "``site_url``: :attr: `Adminsite.site_url`"

msgid "``has_permission``: :meth:`AdminSite.has_permission`"
msgstr "``has_ceadúna``: :meth: `adminsite.has_ceadúna`"

msgid ""
"``available_apps``: a list of applications from the :doc:`application "
"registry </ref/applications/>` available for the current user. Each entry in "
"the list is a dict representing an application with the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"``available_apps``: liosta d'iarratais óna:doc: `clárú iarrataich` atá ar "
"fáil don úsáideoir reatha </ref/applications/>. Is é gach iontráil sa liosta "
"ina dhiaidh sin a léiríonn feidhmchlár leis na heochracha seo a leanas:"

msgid "``app_label``: the application label"
msgstr "``app_label``: an lipéad iarratais"

msgid "``app_url``: the URL of the application index in the admin"
msgstr "``app_url ``: URL an innéacs iarratais sa riarachán"

msgid ""
"``has_module_perms``: a boolean indicating if displaying and accessing of "
"the module's index page is permitted for the current user"
msgstr ""
"``has_module_perms``: boolean a léiríonn an bhfuil leathanach innéacs an "
"mhodúil ceadaithe don úsáideoir reatha a thaispeáint agus rochtain a fháil "
"ar leathanach innéacs an mhodúil"

msgid "``models``: a list of the models available in the application"
msgstr "``samhlacha ``: liosta de na samhlacha atá ar fáil san iarratas"

msgid "Each model is a dict with the following keys:"
msgstr "Is dict é gach samhail leis na heochracha seo a leanas:"

msgid "``model``: the model class"
msgstr "``samhail ``: an rang samhail"

msgid "``object_name``: class name of the model"
msgstr "``object_name``: ainm aicme an tsamhail"

msgid "``name``: plural name of the model"
msgstr "``ainm ``: ainm iolra an tsamhail"

msgid ""
"``perms``: a ``dict`` tracking ``add``, ``change``, ``delete``, and ``view`` "
"permissions"
msgstr ""
"``perms``: rianú ``dict`` `ceadanna ``add``, `athraithe``, `scrios``, agus "
"``féach``"

msgid "``admin_url``: admin changelist URL for the model"
msgstr "``admin_url``: URL liosta athraithe riaracháin don tsamhail"

msgid "``add_url``: admin URL to add a new model instance"
msgstr "``add_url``: URL riaracháin chun samhail nua a chur leis"

msgid "``is_popup``: whether the current page is displayed in a popup window"
msgstr ""
"``is_popup``: cibé an bhfuil an leathanach reatha ar taispeáint i bhfuinneog "
"aníos"

msgid "``is_nav_sidebar_enabled``: :attr:`AdminSite.enable_nav_sidebar`"
msgstr "``is_nav_sidebar_enabled``: :attr: `Adminsite.enable_nav_sidebar`"

msgid "``log_entries``: :meth:`.AdminSite.get_log_entries`"
msgstr "``log_entries``: :meth: `.adminsite.get_log_entries`"

msgid ""
"Returns a list of applications from the :doc:`application registry </ref/"
"applications/>` available for the current user. You can optionally pass an "
"``app_label`` argument to get details for a single app. Each entry in the "
"list is a dictionary representing an application with the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta iarratais ar ais ó:doc: `clár iarrataich` atá ar fáil don "
"úsáideoir </ref/applications/> reatha. Is féidir leat argóint ``app_label`` "
"a rith go roghnach chun sonraí a fháil d'aip amháin. Is foclóir é gach "
"iontráil sa liosta a léiríonn feidhmchlár leis na heochracha seo a leanas:"

msgid "``name``: name of the application"
msgstr "``ainm ``: ainm an iarratais"

msgid "Each model is a dictionary with the following keys:"
msgstr "Is foclóir é gach samhail leis na heochracha seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Lists of applications and models are sorted alphabetically by their names. "
"You can override this method to change the default order on the admin index "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Déantar liostaí iarratais agus samhlacha a shórtáil in ord aibítre de réir a "
"n-ainmneacha. Is féidir leat an modh seo a athrú chun an t-ordú "
"réamhshocraithe a athrú ar an leathanach innéacs riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the user for the given ``HttpRequest`` has permission to "
"view at least one page in the admin site. Defaults to requiring "
"both :attr:`User.is_active <django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active>` "
"and :attr:`User.is_staff <django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_staff>` to be "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ``True`` ar ais má tá cead ag an úsáideoir don `HttpRequest`` a "
"thugtar leathanach amháin ar a laghad a fheiceáil ar an suíomh riaracháin. "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active><django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_staff>Réamhshocraithe "
"chun a cheangal go mbeadh an bheirt: attr: `User.is_Active `agus: attr: "
"`User.is_staff` a bheith ``True``."

msgid ""
"Registers the given model class (or iterable of classes) with the given "
"``admin_class``. ``admin_class`` defaults "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin` (the default admin options). If "
"keyword arguments are given -- e.g. ``list_display`` -- they'll be applied "
"as options to the admin class."
msgstr ""
"Cláraíonn sé an rang samhail tugtha (nó athraitheach ranganna) leis an "
"`admin_class`` a thugtar. Réamhshocraithe ``admin_class`` to:class: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.modelAdmin` (na roghanna riaracháin réamhshocraithe). "
"Má thugtar argóintí eochairfhocal - m.sh. ``list_display`` -- cuirfear i "
"bhfeidhm iad mar roghanna ar an rang riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Raises :class:`~django.core.exceptions.ImproperlyConfigured` if a model is "
"abstract. and ``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.AlreadyRegistered`` if a "
"model is already registered."
msgstr ""
"Reass:class: `~django.core.exceptions.imProperlyConfigured` má tá samhail "
"teib. agus ``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.alreadyRegistered`` má tá "
"samhail cláraithe cheana féin."

msgid "Unregisters the given model class (or iterable of classes)."
msgstr "Díchláraigh an rang samhail a thugtar (nó athraitheach ranganna)."

msgid ""
"Raises ``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.NotRegistered`` if a model isn't "
"already registered."
msgstr ""
"Ardaíonn sé ``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.notRegistered`` mura bhfuil "
"samhail cláraithe cheana féin."

msgid ""
"Returns an admin class for the given model class. Raises "
"``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.NotRegistered`` if a model isn't "
"registered."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé rang riaracháin ar ais don rang samhail ar leith. Ardaíonn sé "
"``django.contrib.admin.exceptions.notRegistered`` mura bhfuil samhail "
"cláraithe."

msgid ""
"Returns a queryset for the "
"related :class:`~django.contrib.admin.models.LogEntry` instances, shown on "
"the site index page. This method can be overridden to filter the log entries "
"by other criteria."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tacar fiosrúcháin ar fáil do na cásanna gaolmha:class: "
"`~django.contrib.admin.models.logEntry`, a thaispeántar ar leathanach "
"innéacs an láithreáin. Is féidir an modh seo a shárú chun na hiontrálacha "
"logála a scagadh de réir critéir eile."

msgid "Hooking ``AdminSite`` instances into your URLconf"
msgstr "Cásanna ``AdminSite`` a chur isteach i do URLConf"

msgid ""
"The last step in setting up the Django admin is to hook your ``AdminSite`` "
"instance into your URLconf. Do this by pointing a given URL at the "
"``AdminSite.urls`` method. It is not necessary to "
"use :func:`~django.urls.include()`."
msgstr ""
"Is é an chéim dheireanach chun riarachán Django a bhunú ná do shampla "
"``AdminSite` a cheangal isteach i do URLConf. Déan é seo trí URL ar leith a "
"chur in iúl ag an modh `Adminsite.urls`. Ní gá a úsáid:func: "
"`~django.urls.include () `."

msgid ""
"In this example, we register the default ``AdminSite`` instance "
"``django.contrib.admin.site`` at the URL ``/admin/`` ::"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, cláraímid an sampla réamhshocraithe ``adminSite`` "
"``django.contrib.admin.site`` ag an URL ``/admin/``:"

msgid "Customizing the :class:`AdminSite` class"
msgstr "Saincheapadh an ranga:class: `adminSite`"

msgid ""
"If you'd like to set up your own admin site with custom behavior, you're "
"free to subclass ``AdminSite`` and override or add anything you like. Then, "
"create an instance of your ``AdminSite`` subclass (the same way you'd "
"instantiate any other Python class) and register your models and "
"``ModelAdmin`` subclasses with it instead of with the default site. Finally, "
"update :file:`myproject/urls.py` to reference your :class:`AdminSite` "
