"an réimír d'ainmneacha URL chun críocha:ref: `iad a aisiompú `. Níl sé seo "
"riachtanach ach má tá níos mó ná `Adminsite` amháin á úsáid agat."

msgid "Adding views to admin sites"
msgstr "Tuairimí a chur le suíomhanna riaracháin"

msgid ""
"Just like :class:`ModelAdmin`, :class:`AdminSite` provides "
"a :meth:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.get_urls()` method that can be "
"overridden to define additional views for the site. To add a new view to "
"your admin site, extend the "
"base :meth:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin.get_urls()` method to include a "
"pattern for your new view."
msgstr ""
"Díreach cosúil:class: `ModelAdmin`, :class: `adminSite` soláthraíonn a:meth: "
