"authentication system. For more details on the usage of these components or "
"how to customize authentication and authorization see "
"the :doc:`authentication topic guide </topics/auth/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an doiciméad seo ábhar tagartha API do chomhpháirteanna córas "
"fíordheimhnithe Django. Le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí maidir le húsáid na "
"gcomhpháirteanna seo nó conas fíordheimhniú agus údarú a shaincheapadh féach "
"an:doc: `treoir ábhar fíordheimhniúcháin' </topics/auth/index>."

msgid "``User`` model"
msgstr "Samhail ``Úsáideoir ``"

msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Réimsí"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` objects have the following fields:"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user` tá na réimsí seo a leanas ag "
"rudaí:"

msgid ""
"Required. 150 characters or fewer. Usernames may contain alphanumeric, "
"``_``, ``@``, ``+``, ``.`` and ``-`` characters."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach. 150 carachtar nó níos lú. D'fhéadfadh carachtair "
"alfauméireacha, ``_``, ``@``, ``+``, ``.`` agus ``-`` a bheith san "
"ainmneacha úsáideora."

msgid ""
"The ``max_length`` should be sufficient for many use cases. If you need a "
"longer length, please use a :ref:`custom user model <specifying-custom-user-"
"model>`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optional (:attr:`blank=True <django.db.models.Field.blank>`). 150 characters "
"or fewer."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach (:attr: `Blank = True <django.db.models.Field.blank>`). 150 "
"carachtar nó níos lú."

msgid ""
"Optional (:attr:`blank=True <django.db.models.Field.blank>`). Email address."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Field.blank>Roghnach (:attr: `Blank = True `). Seoladh "
"ríomhphoist."

msgid ""
"Required. A hash of, and metadata about, the password. (Django doesn't store "
"the raw password.) Raw passwords can be arbitrarily long and can contain any "
"character. The metadata in this field may mark the password as unusable. See "
"the :doc:`password documentation </topics/auth/passwords>`."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach. Hash den phasfhocal, agus meiteashonraí faoin bhfocal faire. "
"(Ní stóráilíonn Django an pasfhocal amh.) Is féidir le pasfhocail amh a "
"bheith fada go treallach agus is féidir aon charachtar a bheith iontu. "
"Féadfaidh na meiteashonraí sa réimse seo an pasfhocal a mharcáil mar "
"neamhúsáid Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú pasfhocal` </topics/auth/passwords>."

msgid "Many-to-many relationship to :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Group`"
msgstr ""
"Caidreamh go leor le go leor le:aicme: `~django.contrib.auth.models.group`"

msgid ""
"Many-to-many relationship to :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission`"
msgstr ""
"Caidreamh go leor le go leor le:aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.permission`"

msgid "Boolean. Allows this user to access the admin site."
msgstr ""
"Boolean. Ligeann an úsáideoir seo rochtain a fháil ar an suíomh riaracháin."

msgid ""
"Boolean. Marks this user account as active. We recommend that you set this "
"flag to ``False`` instead of deleting accounts. That way, if your "
"applications have any foreign keys to users, the foreign keys won't break."
msgstr ""
"Boolean. Marcálann an cuntas úsáideora seo mar ghníomhach. Molaimid duit an "
"bratach seo a shocrú go ``False`` in ionad cuntais a scriosadh. Ar an "
"mbealach sin, má tá aon eochracha eachtracha ag d'iarratais d'úsáideoirí, ní "
"bhrisefaidh na heochracha eachtracha"

msgid ""
"This doesn't necessarily control whether or not the user can log in. "
"Authentication backends aren't required to check for the ``is_active`` flag "
"but the default backend "
"(:class:`~django.contrib.auth.backends.ModelBackend`) and "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.backends.RemoteUserBackend` do. You can "
"use :class:`~django.contrib.auth.backends.AllowAllUsersModelBackend` "
"or :class:`~django.contrib.auth.backends.AllowAllUsersRemoteUserBackend` if "
"you want to allow inactive users to login. In this case, you'll also want to "
"customize the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` used by "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView` as it rejects inactive "
"users. Be aware that the permission-checking methods such "
"as :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.has_perm` and the authentication "
"in the Django admin all return ``False`` for inactive users."
msgstr ""
"Ní gá go rialaíonn sé seo cibé an féidir leis an úsáideoir logáil isteach nó "
"nach féidir. Ní gá cúltaca fíordheimhnithe chun an bhratach ``is_active`` a "
"sheiceáil ach déanann an backend réamhshocraithe (:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.backends.modelBackend`) agus an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.backends.remoteUserBackend`. Is féidir leat "
"úsáid:class: `~django.contrib.auth.backends.allowAllUsersModelBackend` "
"nó:class: `~django.contrib.auth.backends.allowAllUsersRemoteUserBackend` más "
"mian leat ligean d'úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha logáil isteach. Sa chás seo, "
"beidh tú ag iarraidh an: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` a úsáideann an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.loginView` a shaincheapadh toisc go ndiúltaíonn "
"sé úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha. Bí ar an eolas go bhfilleann na modhanna "
"seiceála ceadanna mar: meth: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.has_perm` "
"agus an fíordheimhniú i riarachán Django go léir ``False`` d'úsáideoirí "
"neamhghníomhacha."

msgid ""
"Boolean. Treats this user as having all permissions without assigning any "
"permission to it in particular."
msgstr ""
"Boolean. Déileálann leis an úsáideoir seo mar a bhfuil gach cead aige gan "
"aon chead a shannadh dó go háirithe."

msgid "A datetime of the user's last login."
msgstr "Dáta logála isteach deireanach an úsáideora."

msgid "The date/time when the account was created."
msgstr "An dát/am nuair a cruthaíodh an cuntas."

msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "tréithe"

msgid ""
"Read-only attribute which is always ``True`` (as opposed to "
"``AnonymousUser.is_authenticated`` which is always ``False``). This is a way "
"to tell if the user has been authenticated. This does not imply any "
"permissions and doesn't check if the user is active or has a valid session. "
"Even though normally you will check this attribute on ``request.user`` to "
"find out whether it has been populated by "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware` "
"(representing the currently logged-in user), you should know this attribute "
"is ``True`` for any :class:`~models.User` instance."
msgstr ""
"Tréith léite amháin atá ``True`` i gcónaí (seachas "
"``AnonymousUser.is_Authenticated`` atá ``False`` i gcónaí). Is bealach é seo "
"chun a rá an bhfuil an t-úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe. Ní thugann sé seo le "
"tuiscint ar aon cheadanna agus ní sheiceálann sé an bhfuil an t-úsáideoir "
"gníomhach nó an bhfuil seisiún bailí aige. Cé go seiceálfaidh tú an tréith "
"seo de ghnáth ar `request.user`` chun a fháil amach an bhfuil sé áitithe ag "
"an:class: `~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware` (a "
"léiríonn an t-úsáideoir logáilte isteach faoi láthair), ba chóir go mbeadh a "
"fhios agat gurb é an tréith seo `True`` d'aon shampla: `~Models.User`."

msgid ""
"Read-only attribute which is always ``False``. This is a way of "
"differentiating :class:`~models.User` and :class:`~models.AnonymousUser` "
"objects. Generally, you should prefer "
"using :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_authenticated` to this "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Tréith léitheoireachta amháin atá i gcónaí ``False``. Is bealach é seo chun "
"rudaí: class: `~Models.User` agus:class: `~Models.anonymousUser` a "
"idirdhealú. Go ginearálta, ba cheart duit úsáid a bhaint as: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_Authenticated` don tréith seo."

msgid ""
"Returns the username for the user. Since the ``User`` model can be swapped "
"out, you should use this method instead of referencing the username "
"attribute directly."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an t-ainm úsáideora ar ais don úsáideoir. Ós rud é gur féidir an "
"tsamhail ``Úsáideoir ``a mhalartú amach, ba cheart duit an modh seo a úsáid "
"in ionad tagairt a dhéanamh go díreach don tréith ainm úsáideora."

msgid ""
"Returns the :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.first_name` plus "
"the :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.last_name`, with a space in "
"between."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais an:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.first_name` "
"móide an:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.last_name`, le spás "
"eatarthu."

msgid "Returns the :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.first_name`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais an:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.first_name`."

msgid ""
"Sets the user's password to the given raw string, taking care of the "
"password hashing. Doesn't save the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn pasfhocal an úsáideora chuig an sreang amh a thugtar, ag tabhairt "
"aire don hashing pasfhocal. Ní shábhálann sé an réad:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`."

msgid ""
"When the ``raw_password`` is ``None``, the password will be set to an "
"unusable password, as "
"if :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.set_unusable_password()` were "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Nuair is é ``raw_password`` ``None``, socraítear an pasfhocal go pasfhocal "
"neamhúsáidte, mar a úsáideadh: meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.set_unusable_password () `."

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``acheck_password()``"
msgstr "*Leagan asincrón*: ``acheck_password () ``"

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the given raw string is the correct password for the "
"user. (This takes care of the password hashing in making the comparison.)"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é an teaghrán amh a thugtar an focal faire "
"ceart don úsáideoir. (Tugann sé seo aire don hashing pasfhocal agus an "
"comparáid a dhéanamh.)"

msgid ""
"Marks the user as having no password set by updating the metadata in "
"the :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.password` field. This isn't the "
"same as having a blank string for a "
"password. :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.check_password()` for this "
"user will never return ``True``. Doesn't save "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` object."
msgstr ""
"Marcaíonn sé an t-úsáideoir nach bhfuil aon phasfhocal socraithe aige trí na "
"meiteashonraí a nuashonrú sa réimsin:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.password`. Níl sé seo mar an gcéanna le "
"sreang bán a bheith agat le haghaidh pasfhocal. :meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.check_password () `ní thabharfaidh an t-"
"úsáideoir seo ``True`` ar ais riamh. Ní shábhálann sé an réad:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`."

msgid ""
"You may need this if authentication for your application takes place against "
"an existing external source such as an LDAP directory."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go mbeidh sé seo ag teastáil uait má tharlaíonn fíordheimhniú "
"d'iarratas i gcoinne foinse sheachtrach atá ann cheana mar eolaire LDAP."

msgid "Password reset restriction"
msgstr "Srian athshocraithe pasfhocal"

msgid ""
"Users having an unusable password will not able to request a password reset "
"email via :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.PasswordResetView`."
msgstr ""
"Ní bheidh úsáideoirí a bhfuil pasfhocal neamhúsáidte acu in ann ríomhphost "
"athshocraithe pasfhocal a iarraidh trí:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.views.passwordResetView`."

msgid ""
"Returns ``False`` "
"if :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.set_unusable_password()` has been "
"called for this user."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin ``False`` ife:meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.set_unusable_password () `a ghlaoadh don "
"úsáideoir seo."

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aget_user_permissions()``"
msgstr ""

msgid "Returns a set of permission strings that the user has directly."
msgstr "Filleann sé tacar teaghráin ceadanna atá ag an úsáideoir go díreach."

msgid ""
"If ``obj`` is passed in, only returns the user permissions for this specific "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``obj`` isteach, ní thugann sé ach ceadanna úsáideora don réad "
"sonrach seo ar ais."

msgid "``aget_user_permissions()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aget_group_permissions()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a set of permission strings that the user has, through their groups."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tacar teaghráin ceada atá ag an úsáideoir ar ais, trína ngrúpaí."

msgid ""
"If ``obj`` is passed in, only returns the group permissions for this "
"specific object."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``obj`` isteach, ní thugann sé ach ceadanna grúpa don réad "
"sonrach seo ar ais."

msgid "``aget_group_permissions()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aget_all_permissions()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a set of permission strings that the user has, both through group "
"and user permissions."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tacar teaghráin ceada atá ag an úsáideoir ar ais, trí cheadanna "
"grúpa agus úsáideora araon."

msgid ""
"If ``obj`` is passed in, only returns the permissions for this specific "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``obj`` isteach, ní thugann sé ach na ceadanna don réad sonrach "
"seo ar ais."

msgid "``aget_all_permissions()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``ahas_perm()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the user has the specified permission, where perm is in "
"the format ``\"<app label>.<permission codename>\"``. (see documentation "
"on :ref:`permissions <topic-authorization>`). If the user is inactive, this "
"method will always return ``False``. For an active superuser, this method "
"will always return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"<app label>Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` má tá an cead sonraithe ag an "
"úsáideoir, áit a bhfuil perm sa fhormáid ``”. <permission codename>“``. "
"<topic-authorization>(féach doiciméadú ar:ref: `ceadanna `). Má tá an t-"
"úsáideoir neamhghníomhach, cuirfidh an modh seo ``False`` ar ais i gcónaí. "
"Maidir le sárúsáideoir gníomhach, fillfidh an modh seo ``True`` i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"If ``obj`` is passed in, this method won't check for a permission for the "
"model, but for this specific object."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``obj`` isteach, ní sheiceálfaidh an modh seo cead don "
"tsamhail, ach don réad sonrach seo."

msgid "``ahas_perm()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``ahas_perms()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the user has each of the specified permissions, where "
"each perm is in the format ``\"<app label>.<permission codename>\"``. If the "
"user is inactive, this method will always return ``False``. For an active "
"superuser, this method will always return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"<app label>Tugann sé “True” ar ais má tá gach ceann de na ceadanna sonraithe "
"ag an úsáideoir, áit a bhfuil gach perm sa fhormáid ``”. <permission "
"codename>“``. Má tá an t-úsáideoir neamhghníomhach, cuirfidh an modh seo "
"``False`` ar ais i gcónaí. Maidir le sárúsáideoir gníomhach, fillfidh an "
"modh seo ``True`` i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"If ``obj`` is passed in, this method won't check for permissions for the "
"model, but for the specific object."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``obj`` isteach, ní sheiceálfaidh an modh seo ceadanna don "
"tsamhail, ach don réad ar leith."

msgid "``ahas_perms()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``ahas_module_perms()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the user has any permissions in the given package (the "
"Django app label). If the user is inactive, this method will always return "
"``False``. For an active superuser, this method will always return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` má tá aon cheadanna ag an úsáideoir sa phacáiste "
"tugtha (lipéad an aip Django). Má tá an t-úsáideoir neamhghníomhach, "
"cuirfidh an modh seo ``False`` ar ais i gcónaí. Maidir le sárúsáideoir "
"gníomhach, fillfidh an modh seo ``True`` i gcónaí."

msgid "``ahas_module_perms()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sends an email to the user. If ``from_email`` is ``None``, Django uses "
"the :setting:`DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL`. Any ``**kwargs`` are passed to the "
"underlying :func:`~django.core.mail.send_mail` call."
msgstr ""

msgid "Manager methods"
msgstr "Modhanna bainisteora"

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` model has a custom manager "
"that has the following helper methods (in addition to the methods provided "
"by :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.BaseUserManager`):"
msgstr ""
"Tá bainisteoir saincheaptha ag an tsamhail:Class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user` a bhfuil na modhanna cúntóra seo a leanas "
"aige (i dteannta leis na modhanna a sholáthraí:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.baseUserManager`):"

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``acreate_user()``"
msgstr ""

msgid "Creates, saves and returns a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User`."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn, sábhálann agus tugann sé ar ais a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`."

msgid ""
"The :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.username` "
"and :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.password` are set as given. The "
"domain portion of :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.email` is "
"automatically converted to lowercase, and the "
"returned :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` object will "
"have :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active` set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear an:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.userName` agus:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.password` mar a thugtar. Déantar an chuid "
"fearainn de:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.email` a thiontú go "
"huathoibríoch go litreacha beaga, agus beidh an réad ar ais: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user` socraí:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_active` socraithe go `True``."

msgid ""
"If no password is "
"provided, :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.set_unusable_password()` "
"will be called."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear aon phasfhocal ar fáil, glaofar ar :meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.set_unusable_password () `."

msgid ""
"If no email is provided, :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.email` will "
"be set to an empty string."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``extra_fields`` keyword arguments are passed through to "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User`’s ``__init__`` method to allow "
"setting arbitrary fields on a :ref:`custom user model <auth-custom-user>`."
msgstr ""
"<auth-custom-user>Cuirtear na hargóintí eochairfhocal ``extra_fields`` tríd "
"chuig an modh ``__init__``: `class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user` chun "
"réimsí treallacha a shocrú ar a:ref: `samhail úsáideora saincheaptaí`."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`Creating users <topics-auth-creating-users>` for example usage."
msgstr ""
"Féach: tagairt: `Úsáideoirí a chruthú <topics-auth-creating-users>`mar "
"shampla úsáid."

msgid "``acreate_user()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``acreate_superuser()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Same as :meth:`create_user`, but sets :attr:`~models.User.is_staff` "
"and :attr:`~models.User.is_superuser` to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna len:meth: `create_user`, ach socraíonn: attr: "
"`~Models.User.is_Staff` agus:attr: `~Models.User.is_SuperUser` go ``True``."

msgid "``acreate_superuser()`` method was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns users that have the given permission ``perm`` either in the ``\"<app "
"label>.<permission codename>\"`` format or as "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` instance. Returns an empty "
"queryset if no users who have the ``perm`` found."
msgstr ""
"<app label>Tugann sé ar ais úsáideoirí a bhfuil an cead tugtha ``perm`` acu "
"sa ``”. <permission codename>“``formáid nó mar a: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` sampla. Tugann sé tacar ceisteanna "
"folamh ar ais mura bhfuarthas aon úsáideoirí a bhfuil an `perm`` acu."

msgid ""
"If ``is_active`` is ``True`` (default), returns only active users, or if "
"``False``, returns only inactive users. Use ``None`` to return all users "
"irrespective of active state."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``is_active`` ``True`` (réamhshocraithe), ní fhaigheann sé ach "
"úsáideoirí gníomhacha, nó má fhaigheann ``False``, ach úsáideoirí "
"neamhghníomhacha. Úsáid ``None`` chun gach úsáideoir a thabhairt ar ais beag "
"beann ar staid ghníomhach."

msgid ""
"If ``include_superusers`` is ``True`` (default), the result will include "
"superusers."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``include_superusers`` ``True`` (réamhshocraithe), beidh sárúsáideoirí "
"san áireamh sa toradh."

msgid ""
"If ``backend`` is passed in and it's defined "
"in :setting:`AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, then this method will use it. "
"Otherwise, it will use the ``backend`` "
"in :setting:`AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, if there is only one, or raise an "
"exception."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ``backend`` isteach agus má shainmhínítear é in:setting: "
"`AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, ansin úsáidfidh an modh seo é. Seachas sin, "
"úsáidfidh sé an `backend`` in:setting: `AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, mura "
"bhfuil ach ceann amháin ann, nó ardóidh sé eisceacht."

msgid "``AnonymousUser`` object"
msgstr "```AnonymousUser`` réad"

msgid ""
":class:`django.contrib.auth.models.AnonymousUser` is a class that implements "
"the :class:`django.contrib.auth.models.User` interface, with these "
"differences:"
msgstr ""
":class: `django.contrib.auth.models.anonymousUser` is aicme é a chuireann an "
"comhéadan: class: `django.contrib.auth.models.user` i bhfeidhm, leis na "
"difríochtaí seo:"

msgid ":ref:`id <automatic-primary-key-fields>` is always ``None``."
msgstr ":ref: Is é `id <automatic-primary-key-fields>`i gcónaí ``None``."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.username` is always the empty string."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.username` an teaghrán folamh i "
"gcónaí."

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.get_username()` always returns the "
"empty string."
msgstr ""
":meth: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.get_username () `filleann an "
"teaghrán folamh i gcónaí."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_anonymous` is ``True`` instead of "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_anonymous` ``True`` in ionad "
"``False``."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_authenticated` is ``False`` "
"instead of ``True``."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_Authenticated` ``False`` in "
"ionad ``True``."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_staff` "
"and :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_superuser` are always "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_staff` agus:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_superuser` ``False`` i gcónaí."

msgid ":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active` is always ``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.is_active` i gcónaí ``False``."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.groups` "
"and :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.user_permissions` are always "
"empty."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.groups` agus:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.user_permissions` folamh i gcónaí."

msgid ""
":meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.set_password()`, :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User.check_password()`, :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.save` "
"and :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.delete()` "
"raise :exc:`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ""
":meth: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user.set_password () `, :meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user.check_password ()`, :meth: "
"`~django.db.models.model.save` agus:meth: `~django.db.models.model.delete () "
"`exc: `Not Implementederror`."

msgid ""
"In practice, you probably won't need to "
"use :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AnonymousUser` objects on your own, "
"but they're used by web requests, as explained in the next section."
msgstr ""
"Go praiticiúil, is dócha nach mbeidh ort rudaí:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.anonymousUser` a úsáid leat féin, ach úsáidtear "
"iad ag iarratais gréasáin, mar a mhínítear sa chéad chuid eile."

msgid "``Permission`` model"
msgstr "Samhail ``Ceadúna``"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` objects have the following "
"fields:"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` tá na réimsí seo a leanas "
"ag rudaí:"

msgid "Required. 255 characters or fewer. Example: ``'Can vote'``."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach. 255 carachtar nó níos lú. Sampla: ```'Is féidir vótáil' ``."

msgid ""
"Required. A foreign key to "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` model."
msgstr ""

msgid "Required. 100 characters or fewer. Example: ``'can_vote'``."
msgstr "Riachtanach. 100 carachtar nó níos lú. Sampla: ```'can_vote'``."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` objects have the standard "
"data-access methods like any other :doc:`Django model </ref/models/"
"instances>`."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` tá na modhanna "
"caighdeánacha rochtana sonraí ag rudaí cosúil le haon cheann eile: doc: "
"`samhail </ref/models/instances> Django`."

msgid "``Group`` model"
msgstr "Samhail ``Grúpa``"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Group` objects have the following fields:"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.group` tá na réimsí seo a leanas ag "
"rudaí:"

msgid ""
"Required. 150 characters or fewer. Any characters are permitted. Example: "
"``'Awesome Users'``."
msgstr ""
"Riachtanach. 150 carachtar nó níos lú. Ceadaítear aon charachtair. Sampla: "
"````Úsáideoirí uamhnóis``."

msgid "Many-to-many field to :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission`::"
msgstr "Réimse go leor to:class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.permission`::"

msgid "Validators"
msgstr "Bailíochtóirí"

msgid ""
"A field validator allowing only ASCII letters and numbers, in addition to "
"``@``, ``.``, ``+``, ``-``, and ``_``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíochtóir réimse nach gceadaíonn ach litreacha agus uimhreacha ASCII, i "
"dteannta le ``@``, ``.``, `+``, ``-``, agus ``_``."

msgid ""
"A field validator allowing Unicode characters, in addition to ``@``, ``.``, "
"``+``, ``-``, and ``_``. The default validator for ``User.username``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíochtóir réimse a cheadaíonn carachtair Unicode, chomh maith le ``@``, "
"`.``, ``, `+``, ``-``, agus ``_``. An bailíochtóir réamhshocraithe le "
"haghaidh ``User.UserName``."

msgid "Login and logout signals"
msgstr "Comharthaí logála isteach agus logála amach"

msgid ""
"The auth framework uses the following :doc:`signals </topics/signals>` that "
"can be used for notification when a user logs in or out."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an creat auth an méid seo a leanas: doc: `comharthaí 'is féidir a "
"úsáid le haghaidh fó</topics/signals> gra nuair a logálann úsáideoir isteach "
"nó amach."

msgid "Sent when a user logs in successfully."
msgstr "Seoltar nuair a logálann úsáideoir isteach go rathúil."

msgid "Arguments sent with this signal:"
msgstr "Argóintí a sheoltar leis an comhartha seo:"

msgid "``sender``"
msgstr "``Seoltóir ``"

msgid "The class of the user that just logged in."
msgstr "Aicme an úsáideora a logáil isteach díreach."

msgid "``request``"
msgstr "``Iarrata``"

msgid "The current :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest` instance."
msgstr "An sampla reatha: class: `~django.http.httpRequest`."

msgid "``user``"
msgstr "``Úsáideoir ``"

msgid "The user instance that just logged in."
msgstr "An tsampla úsáideora a logáil isteach díreach."

msgid "Sent when the logout method is called."
msgstr "Seoltar nuair a ghlaofar an modh logála amach."

msgid ""
"As above: the class of the user that just logged out or ``None`` if the user "
"was not authenticated."
msgstr ""
"Mar atá thuas: aicme an úsáideora a logáil isteach díreach nó ``None`` mura "
"ndearnadh an t-úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe."

msgid ""
"The user instance that just logged out or ``None`` if the user was not "
"authenticated."
msgstr ""
"An tsampla úsáideora a logáil isteach díreach nó ``None`` mura ndearnadh an "
"t-úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe."

msgid "Sent when the user failed to login successfully"
msgstr "Seoladh nuair a theip ar an úsáideoir logáil isteach go rathúil"

msgid "The name of the module used for authentication."
msgstr "Ainm an mhodúil a úsáidtear le haghaidh fíordheimhnithe."

msgid "``credentials``"
msgstr "``creidiúnaitheach``"

msgid ""
"A dictionary of keyword arguments containing the user credentials that were "
"passed to :func:`~django.contrib.auth.authenticate()` or your own custom "
"authentication backend. Credentials matching a set of 'sensitive' patterns, "
"(including password) will not be sent in the clear as part of the signal."
msgstr ""
"Foclóir argóintí eochairfhocal ina bhfuil na dintiúir úsáideora a cuireadh "
"chuig: func: `~django.contrib.auth.autentifikate () `nó do chúltaca "
"fíordheimhnithe saincheaptha féin. Ní sheolfar dhintiúir a mheaitseálann "
"sraith patrúin 'íogair', (lena n-áirítear pasfhocal) san soiléir mar chuid "
"den chomhartha."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest` object, if one was provided "
"to :func:`~django.contrib.auth.authenticate`."
msgstr ""
"An réad: Class: `~django.http.httpRequest`, má cuireadh ceann ar fáil chuig: "
"func: `~django.contrib.auth.autenticate`."

msgid "Authentication backends"
msgstr "Cúltaca fíordheimhnithe"

msgid ""
"This section details the authentication backends that come with Django. For "
"information on how to use them and how to write your own authentication "
"backends, see the :ref:`Other authentication sources section <authentication-"
"backends>` of the :doc:`User authentication guide </topics/auth/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn an chuid seo ar na cúltaca fíordheimhnithe a thagann le Django. Le "
"haghaidh faisnéise maidir le conas iad a úsáid agus conas do chúltaca "
"fíordheimhnithe féin a scríobh, féach an ranna:ref: `Foinsí fíordheimhnithe "
"eile </topics/auth/index> <authentication-backends>`den :doc: `Treoir "
"fíordheimhnithe úsáideoraithe'."

msgid "Available authentication backends"
msgstr "cúltaca fíordheimhnithe atá ar fáil"

msgid ""
"The following backends are available in :mod:`django.contrib.auth.backends`:"
msgstr ""
"Tá na cúltaca seo a leanas ar fáil in:mod: `django.contrib.auth.backends`:"

msgid ""
"A base class that provides default implementations for all required methods. "
"By default, it will reject any user and provide no permissions."
msgstr ""
"Aicme bonn a sholáthraíonn cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe do gach modh "
"riachtanach. De réir réamhshocraithe, diúltóidh sé aon úsáideoir agus ní "
"sholáthróidh sé aon cheadanna."

msgid "Returns an empty set."
msgstr "Tugann sé tacar folamh ar ais."

msgid "``aget_user_permissions()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid "``aget_group_permissions()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Uses :meth:`get_user_permissions` and :meth:`get_group_permissions` to get "
"the set of permission strings the ``user_obj`` has."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Meth: `get_user_permissions` agus:meth: `get_group_permissions` chun "
"an tacar teaghráin ceada atá ag ``user_obj ``a fháil."

msgid "``aget_all_permissions()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Uses :meth:`get_all_permissions` to check if ``user_obj`` has the permission "
"string ``perm``."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Meth: `get_all_permissions` chun a sheiceáil an bhfuil an teaghrán "
"ceada ``perm`` ag `user_obj``."

msgid "``ahas_perm()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This is the default authentication backend used by Django.  It authenticates "
"using credentials consisting of a user identifier and password.  For "
"Django's default user model, the user identifier is the username, for custom "
"user models it is the field specified by USERNAME_FIELD "
"(see :doc:`Customizing Users and authentication </topics/auth/customizing>`)."
msgstr ""
"Is é seo an cúltaca fíordheimhnithe réamhshocraithe a úsáideann Django. "
"Fíordheimhnigh sé trí dhintiúir a bhfuil aitheantóir úsáideora agus "
"pasfhocal. Maidir le samhail úsáideora réamhshocraithe Django, is é an t-"
"ainaitheoir úsáideora an t-ainm úsáideora, i gcás samhlacha úsáideora "
"saincheaptha is é an réimse a shonraíonn USERNAME_FIELD é (féach: "
"'Úsáideoirí a shaincheapadh agus fíordheimhniú</topics/auth/customizing> ')."

msgid ""
"It also handles the default permissions model as defined "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.PermissionsMixin`."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann sé freisin an tsamhail ceadanna réamhshocraithe mar a "
"shainmhínítear dó:class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.user` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.permissionsMixin`."

msgid ""
":meth:`has_perm`, :meth:`get_all_permissions`, :meth:`get_user_permissions`, "
"and :meth:`get_group_permissions` allow an object to be passed as a "
"parameter for object-specific permissions, but this backend does not "
"implement them other than returning an empty set of permissions if ``obj is "
"not None``."
msgstr ""
":meth: `has_perm`, :meth: `get_all_permissions`, :meth: "
"`get_user_permissions`, agus:meth: `get_group_permissions` ceadaíonn réad a "
"rith mar pharaiméadar le haghaidh ceadanna réad-shonracha, ach ní chuireann "
"an cúltaca seo i bhfeidhm iad seachas tacar folamh ceadanna a thabhairt ar "
"ais mura bhfuil `obj gan ``."

msgid ""
":meth:`with_perm` also allows an object to be passed as a parameter, but "
"unlike others methods it returns an empty queryset if ``obj is not None``."
msgstr ""
":meth: Ligeann `with_perm` réad a rith mar pharaiméadar freisin, ach murab "
"ionann agus modhanna eile filleann sé tacar fiosrúcháin folamh mura bhfuil "
"``obj None ``."

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aauthenticate()``"
msgstr "* Leagan asincrón*: ``aheimhniú () ``"

msgid ""
"Tries to authenticate ``username`` with ``password`` by "
"calling :meth:`User.check_password "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.check_password>`. If no ``username`` is "
"provided, it tries to fetch a username from ``kwargs`` using the "
"key :attr:`CustomUser.USERNAME_FIELD "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.USERNAME_FIELD>`. Returns an "
"authenticated user or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.check_password>Déanann iarracht ```ainm "
"úsáideora ``a fhíordheimhniú le ``pasfhocal`` trí ghlaoch a ghlao:meth: "
"`User.Check_Password `. "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.USERNAME_FIELD>Mura gcuirtear ``ainm "
"úsáideora ``ar fáil, déanann sé iarracht ainm úsáideora a fháil ó `kwargs`` "
"ag baint úsáide as an eochair:attr: `CustomUser.UserName_Field `. Tugann sé "
"úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe nó ``None`` ar ais."

msgid ""
"``request`` is an :class:`~django.http.HttpRequest` and may be ``None`` if "
"it wasn't provided to :func:`~django.contrib.auth.authenticate` (which "
"passes it on to the backend)."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``request`` an:class: `~django.http.httpRequest` agus d'fhéadfadh sé a "
"bheith ``None`` mura gcuirfí ar fáil é chuig:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.auth.autenticate` (a chuireann ar aghaidh chuig an "
"gcúltaca é)."

msgid "``aauthenticate()`` function was added."
msgstr "Cuireadh feidhm ``aautenticate () ``leis."

msgid ""
"Returns the set of permission strings the ``user_obj`` has from their own "
"user permissions. Returns an empty set "
"if :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AbstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` "
"or :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an tacar teaghráin ceada atá ag ``user_obj`` óna gceadanna "
"úsáideora féin ar ais. Tugann sé tacar folamh ar ais más: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.abstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` nó:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active` ``False``."

msgid ""
"Returns the set of permission strings the ``user_obj`` has from the "
"permissions of the groups they belong. Returns an empty set "
"if :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AbstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` "
"or :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active`  is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an tacar teaghráin ceadanna atá ag an ``user_obj`` ó cheadanna na "
"ngrúpaí a bhaineann leo. Tugann sé tacar folamh ar ais más: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.abstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` nó:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active` ``False``."

msgid ""
"Returns the set of permission strings the ``user_obj`` has, including both "
"user permissions and group permissions. Returns an empty set "
"if :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AbstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` "
"or :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an tacar teaghráin ceada atá ag ``user_obj ``, lena n-áirítear "
"ceadanna úsáideora agus ceadanna grúpa araon. Tugann sé tacar folamh ar ais "
"más: attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.abstractBaseUser.is_anonymous` "
"nó:attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active` ``False``."

msgid ""
"Uses :meth:`get_all_permissions` to check if ``user_obj`` has the permission "
"string ``perm``. Returns ``False`` if the user is "
"not :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active`."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Meth: `get_all_permissions` chun a sheiceáil an bhfuil an teaghrán "
"ceada ``perm`` ag `user_obj``. Filleann ``False`` mura bhfuil an t-"
"úsáideoir: attr: `~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active`."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the ``user_obj`` has any permissions on the app "
"``app_label``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais cibé an bhfuil aon cheadanna ag an ``user_obj`` ar an aip "
"`app_label``."

msgid "``ahas_module_perms()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns whether the user is allowed to authenticate. To match the behavior "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` "
"which :meth:`prohibits inactive users from logging in "
"<django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm.confirm_login_allowed>`, this "
"method returns ``False`` for users with :attr:`is_active=False "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active>`. Custom user models that don't "
"have an :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active` field are "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais cibé an gceadaítear don úsáideoir fíordheimhniú. "
"<django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm.confirm_login_allowed><django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active>Chun "
"iompraíocht de:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` a "
"mheaitseálann: meth: `cosc ar úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha logáil isteach `, "
"filleann an modh seo ``False`` d'úsáideoirí la:attr: `is_active=false`. "
"Ceadaítear samhlacha úsáideora saincheaptha nach bhfuil réimse: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active` acu."

msgid ""
"Returns all active users who have the permission ``perm`` either in the form "
"of ``\"<app label>.<permission codename>\"`` or "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` instance. Returns an empty "
"queryset if no users who have the ``perm`` found."
msgstr ""
"<app label>Tugann sé ar ais gach úsáideoir gníomhach a bhfuil cead acu "
"``perm`` i bhfoirm ``”. <permission codename>“``nó a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` sampla. Tugann sé tacar ceisteanna "
"folamh ar ais mura bhfaightear aon úsáideoirí a bhfuil an `perm`` acu."

msgid ""
"Same as :class:`ModelBackend` except that it doesn't reject inactive users "
"because :meth:`~ModelBackend.user_can_authenticate` always returns ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna len:class: `ModelBackend` ach amháin nach ndéanann sé diúltú "
"úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha toisc go bhfilleann: meth: "
"`~ModelBackend.User_can_Authenticate` ``True`` i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"When using this backend, you'll likely want to customize "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` used by "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.views.LoginView` by overriding "
"the :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm.confirm_login_allowed` "
"method as it rejects inactive users."
msgstr ""
"Agus an cúltaca seo á úsáid agat, is dócha go mbeidh tú ag iarraidh "
"an:class: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm` a úsáideann "
"an:class: `~django.contrib.auth.auth.views.loginView` a shárú tríd an modh: "
"meth: `~django.contrib.auth.forms.AuthenticationForm.confirm_login_allowed` "
"a shárú mar a dhiúltaíonn sé úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha."

msgid ""
"Use this backend to take advantage of external-to-Django-handled "
"authentication.  It authenticates using usernames passed "
"in :attr:`request.META['REMOTE_USER'] <django.http.HttpRequest.META>`.  See "
"the :doc:`Authenticating against REMOTE_USER </howto/auth-remote-user>` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an cúltaca seo chun leas a bhaint as fíordheimhniú seachtrach go "
"django láimhseáilte. <django.http.HttpRequest.META>Déanann sé fíordheimhniú "
"ag baint úsáide as ainmneacha úsáideora a rith in:attr: `request.meta "
"['REMOTE_USER'] `. Féach an doiciméad:doc: `Fíordheimhniú i gcoinne "
"REMOTE_USER`. </howto/auth-remote-user>"

msgid ""
"If you need more control, you can create your own authentication backend "
"that inherits from this class and override these attributes or methods:"
msgstr ""
"Má theastaíonn níos mó smachta uait, is féidir leat do chúltaca "
"fíordheimhnithe féin a chruthú a fhaigheann oidhreacht ón rang seo agus na "
"tréithe nó na modhanna seo a shárú:"

msgid ""
"``True`` or ``False``. Determines whether or not a user object is created if "
"not already in the database  Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"``Fíor`` nó ``Bréag``. Cinneann sé an gcruthaítear réad úsáideora nó nach "
"bhfuil sa bhunachar sonraí Réamhshocraithe go ``True`` cheana féin."

msgid ""
"The username passed as ``remote_user`` is considered trusted. This method "
"returns the user object with the given username, creating a new user object "
"if :attr:`~RemoteUserBackend.create_unknown_user` is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Meastar go bhfuil an t-ainm úsáideora a rith mar `remote_user`` iontaofa. "
"Tugann an modh seo an réad úsáideora ar ais leis an ainm úsáideora a "
"thugtar, ag cruthú réad úsáideora nua má tá: attr: "
"`~RemoteUserBackend.create_unknown_user` ``True``."

msgid ""
"Returns ``None`` if :attr:`~RemoteUserBackend.create_unknown_user` is "
"``False`` and a ``User`` object with the given username is not found in the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ``None`` ife:attr: `~RemoteUserBackend.create_unknown_user` ``False`` "
"agus ní aimsítear réad ```Úsáideor`` leis an ainm úsáideora tugtha sa "
"bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"Performs any cleaning on the ``username`` (e.g. stripping LDAP DN "
"information) prior to using it to get or create a user object. Returns the "
"cleaned username."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé aon ghlanadh ar an ``ainm úsáideora ``(m.sh. faisnéis LDAP DN a "
"scriosadh) sula n-úsáidtear é chun réad úsáideora a fháil nó a chruthú. "
"Tugann an t-ainm úsáideora glan ar ais."

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aconfigure_user()``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configures the user on each authentication attempt. This method is called "
"immediately after fetching or creating the user being authenticated, and can "
"be used to perform custom setup actions, such as setting the user's groups "
"based on attributes in an LDAP directory. Returns the user object. When "
"fetching or creating an user is called from a synchronous context, "
"``configure_user`` is called, ``aconfigure_user`` is called from async "
"contexts."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The setup can be performed either once when the user is created (``created`` "
"is ``True``) or on existing users (``created`` is ``False``) as a way of "
"synchronizing attributes between the remote and the local systems."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an socrú a dhéanamh uair amháin nuair a chruthaítear an t-"
"úsáideoir (“cruthaithe” is é ``True``) nó ar úsáideoirí atá ann cheana "
"(``cruthaithe`` ná `False``) mar bhealach chun tréithe a shioncronú idir na "
"córais iargúlta agus na córais áitiúla."

msgid "``aconfigure_user()`` function was added."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns whether the user is allowed to authenticate. This method returns "
"``False`` for users with :attr:`is_active=False "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active>`. Custom user models that don't "
"have an :attr:`~django.contrib.auth.models.CustomUser.is_active` field are "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais cibé an gceadaítear don úsáideoir fíordheimhniú. "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.User.is_active>Tugann an modh seo ``False`` ar "
"ais d'úsáideoirí le:attr: `is_active=false `. Ceadaítear samhlacha úsáideora "
"saincheaptha nach bhfuil réimse: attr: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.customUser.is_active` acu."

msgid ""
"Same as :class:`RemoteUserBackend` except that it doesn't reject inactive "
"users because :attr:`~RemoteUserBackend.user_can_authenticate` always "
"returns ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna len:class: `RemoteUserBackend` ach amháin nach ndéanann sé "
"diúltú úsáideoirí neamhghníomhacha toisc go bhfilleann: attr: "
"`~RemoteUserBackend.User_can_Authenticate` ``True`` i gcónaí."

msgid "Utility functions"
msgstr "feidhmeanna fóntais"

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aget_user()``"
msgstr "* Leagan asincrón*: ``aget_user () ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the user model instance associated with the given ``request``’s "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an tsamhail úsáideora a bhaineann le seisiún an ``iarrata`` a "
"thugtar."

msgid ""
"It checks if the authentication backend stored in the session is present "
"in :setting:`AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`. If so, it uses the backend's "
"``get_user()`` method to retrieve the user model instance and then verifies "
"the session by calling the user "
"model's :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AbstractBaseUser.get_session_auth_hash` "
"method. If the verification fails and :setting:`SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS` are "
"provided, it verifies the session against each fallback key "
"using :meth:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AbstractBaseUser.\\ "
"get_session_auth_fallback_hash`."
msgstr ""
"Seiceálann sé an bhfuil an cúltaca fíordheimhnithe atá stóráilte sa seisiún "
"i láthair in:setting: `AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`. Más ea, úsáideann sé modh "
"``get_user () ``an chúltaca chun sampla an úsáideora a aisghabháil agus "
"ansin fíoraíonn sé an seisiún trí ghlaoch ar an msamhail úsáideora 's:meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.abstractbaseUser.get_session_auth_hash`. Má "
"theipeann ar an bhfíorú agus:setting: `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS` ar fáil, "
"fíoraíonn sé an seisiún i gcoinne gach eochair fallback ag baint úsáid:meth: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.abstractBaseUser.\\ "
"get_session_auth_fallback_hash`."

msgid ""
"Returns an instance of :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.AnonymousUser` if "
"the authentication backend stored in the session is no longer "
"in :setting:`AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, if a user isn't returned by the "
"backend's ``get_user()`` method, or if the session auth hash doesn't "
"validate."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé sampla de:class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.anonymousUser` mura "
"bhfuil an cúltaca fíordheimhnithe a stóráiltear sa seisiún a thuilleadh "
"in:setting: `AUTHENTICATION_BACKENDS`, mura gcuirtear úsáideoir ar ais ag "
"modh `get_user () `, nó mura mbailíonn hash auth an seisiún."

msgid "The contenttypes framework"
msgstr "Creat na cineálacha ábhair"

msgid ""
"Django includes a :mod:`~django.contrib.contenttypes` application that can "
"track all of the models installed in your Django-powered project, providing "
"a high-level, generic interface for working with your models."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn Django feidhmchlár a:mod: `~django.contrib.contenttypes` atá in "
"ann na samhlacha go léir atá suiteáilte i do thionscadal Django faoi "
"thiomáint a rianú, ag soláthar comhéadan cineálach ardleibhéil chun oibriú "
"le do mhúnlaí."

msgid ""
"At the heart of the contenttypes application is "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` model, which "
"lives at ``django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType``. Instances "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` represent and "
"store information about the models installed in your project, and new "
"instances of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` are "
"automatically created whenever new models are installed."
msgstr ""
"I gcroílár an fheidhmchláir contenttypes tá an tsamhail:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType`, a chónaíonn ag "
"``Django.Contrib.ContentTypes.Models.ContentType``. Léiríonn agus stóráil "
"cásanna de:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` faisnéis "
"faoi na samhlacha atá suiteáilte i do thionscadal, agus cruthaítear cásanna "
"nua de:class: `~Django.Contrib.ContentTypes.Models.ContentType` go "
"huathoibríoch aon uair a shuiteáiltear samhlacha nua."

msgid ""
"Instances of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` have "
"methods for returning the model classes they represent and for querying "
"objects from those "
"models. :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` also has "
"a :ref:`custom manager <custom-managers>` that adds methods for working "
"with :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` and for "
"obtaining instances "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` for a particular "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Tá modhanna ag cásanna de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` chun na ranganna samhail a "
"léiríonn siad a thabhairt ar ais agus chun rudaí a fhiosrú ó na samhlacha "
"sin. :class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` tá a:ref: "
"`bainisteoir saincheapaithe` freisin a chuireann modhanna chun oibriú "
"le:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` agus chun "
"cásanna de:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType <custom-"
"managers>`a fháil do mhúnla áirithe."

msgid ""
"Relations between your models "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` can also be "
"used to enable \"generic\" relationships between an instance of one of your "
"models and instances of any model you have installed."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir caidreamh idir do mhúnlaí agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` a úsáid freisin chun "
"caidrimh “cineálacha” a chumasú idir sampla de cheann de do mhúnlaí agus "
"cásanna d'aon mhúnla atá suiteáilte agat."

msgid "Installing the contenttypes framework"
msgstr "Creat na cineálacha ábhair a shuiteáil"

msgid ""
"The contenttypes framework is included in the "
"default :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` list created by ``django-admin "
"startproject``, but if you've removed it or if you manually set up "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` list, you can enable it by adding "
"``'django.contrib.contenttypes'`` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting."
msgstr ""
"Tá an creat cineálacha ábhair san áireamh sa liosta réamhshocraithe:setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS` a chruthaigh ``django-admin startproject``, ach má bhain tú "
"é nó má shocraigh tú do liosta:setting: `INSTALLED_APPS` de láimh, is féidir "
"leat é a chumasú trí ``django.contrib.contenttypes'`` a chur le d':setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS` `socrú."

msgid ""
"It's generally a good idea to have the contenttypes framework installed; "
"several of Django's other bundled applications require it:"
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth is smaoineamh maith é creat na cineálacha ábhair a shuiteáil; "
"éilíonn roinnt d'fheidhmchláir cuabháilte eile Django é:"

msgid ""
"The admin application uses it to log the history of each object added or "
"changed through the admin interface."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an feidhmchlár riaracháin é chun stair gach réad a cuireadh leis "
"nó a athraigh tríd an gcomhéadan riaracháin a logáil."

msgid ""
"Django's :mod:`authentication framework <django.contrib.auth>` uses it to "
"tie user permissions to specific models."
msgstr ""
"Django's:mod: Úsáideann `creat fíordheimhniúcháin <django.contrib.auth>`é "
"chun ceadanna úsáideora a cheangal le samhlacha ar leith."

msgid "The ``ContentType`` model"
msgstr "An tsamhail ``ContentType``"

msgid ""
"Each instance of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` "
"has two fields which, taken together, uniquely describe an installed model:"
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá réimse ag gach sampla de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` a chuireann, le chéile, "
"cur síos uathúil ar mhúnla suiteáilte:"

msgid ""
"The name of the application the model is part of. This is taken from "
"the :attr:`app_label` attribute of the model, and includes only the *last* "
"part of the application's Python import path; "
"``django.contrib.contenttypes``, for example, becomes an :attr:`app_label` "
"of ``contenttypes``."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an fheidhmchláir tá an tsamhail mar chuid de. Tógtar é seo ó:attr: "
"`app_label` tréith an tsamhail, agus ní chuimsíonn sé ach an cuid deireanaí* "
"de chonair allmhairithe Python an fheidhmchláir; "
"``django.contrib.contenttypes``, mar shampla, éiríonn u:attr: `app_label` de "
"`contenttypes``."

msgid "The name of the model class."
msgstr "Ainm an rang samhail."

msgid "Additionally, the following property is available:"
msgstr "Ina theannta sin, tá an maoin seo a leanas ar fáil:"

msgid ""
"The human-readable name of the content type. This is taken from "
"the :attr:`verbose_name <django.db.models.Field.verbose_name>` attribute of "
"the model."
msgstr ""
"Ainm inléite don duine ar an gcineál ábhair. "
"<django.db.models.Field.verbose_name>Tógtar é seo ón tréith: attr: "
"`verbose_name `den tsamhail."

msgid ""
"Let's look at an example to see how this works. If you already have "
"the :mod:`~django.contrib.contenttypes` application installed, and then "
"add :mod:`the sites application <django.contrib.sites>` to "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting and run ``manage.py migrate`` to "
"install it, the model :class:`django.contrib.sites.models.Site` will be "
"installed into your database. Along with it a new instance "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` will be created "
"with the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Breathnaímid ar shampla chun a fheiceáil conas a oibríonn sé seo. Má tá an "
"feidhmchlár: mod: `~django.contrib.contenttypes` suiteáilte cheana féin, "
"agus ansin cuir:mod: `an feidhmchlár láithreáin `le do shuiteáil: `SET "
"<django.contrib.sites>TING: `INSTALLED_APPS` agus rith ``manage.py migrate`` "
"chun é a shuiteáil, suiteálfar an samhail:class: "
"`Django.contrib.sites.models.site` i do bhunachar sonraí. In éineacht leis "
"cruthófar sampla nua de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` leis na luachanna seo a "
"leanas:"

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType.app_label` will be "
"set to ``'sites'`` (the last part of the Python path "
"``django.contrib.sites``)."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType.app_label` "
"socraítear go ```'sites'` (an chuid deireanach den chonair Python "
"``django.contrib.sites``)."

msgid ""
":attr:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType.model` will be set to "
"``'site'``."
msgstr ""
":attr: Socrófar `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType.Model` go "
"````suite``."

msgid "Methods on ``ContentType`` instances"
msgstr "Modhanna ar chásanna ``ContentType``"

msgid ""
"Each :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instance has "
"methods that allow you to get from "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instance to the "
"model it represents, or to retrieve objects from that model:"
msgstr ""
"Tá modhanna ag gach ceann: Class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` a ligeann duit a fháil ó "
"a:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` sampla don "
"tsamhail a léiríonn sé, nó chun rudaí a aisghabháil ón tsamhail sin:"

msgid ""
"Takes a set of valid :ref:`lookup arguments <field-lookups-intro>` for the "
"model the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` "
"represents, and does :meth:`a get() lookup "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get>` on that model, returning the "
"corresponding object. The ``using`` argument can be used to specify a "
"different database than the default one."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.get>Glacann sé tacar d'argóintí bail:ref: "
"`lookup <field-lookups-intro>`don tsamhail the:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` léiríonn, agus "
"déanaim:meth: `a get () cuardach` ar an tsamhail sin, ag cur an réad "
"comhfhreagrach ar ais. Is féidir an argóint ``úsáid ``a úsáid chun bunachar "
"sonraí difriúil a shonrú ná an ceann réamhshocraithe."

msgid "The ``using`` argument was added."
msgstr "Cuireadh an argóint ``úsáid ``leis."

msgid ""
"Returns the model class represented by "
"this :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instance."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an rang samhail a léiríonn this:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` sampla."

msgid ""
"For example, we could look up "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` for "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` model:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, d'fhéadfaimis breathnú suas ar:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` don tsamhail:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`:"

msgid ""
"And then use it to query for a "
"particular :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User`, or to get access to "
"the ``User`` model class:"
msgstr ""
"Agus ansin bain úsáid as chun ceist a dhéanamh le haghaidh áirithe: class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.models.user`, nó chun rochtain a fháil ar an rang "
"samhail ``User``:"

msgid ""
"Together, :meth:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType.get_object_for_this_type` "
"and :meth:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType.model_class` "
"enable two extremely important use cases:"
msgstr ""
"Le chéile, cumasaíonn :meth: "
"`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.contenttype.get_object_for_this_type` "
"agus:meth: `~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.contenttype.model_class` dhá "
"chás úsáide thar a bheith tábhachtach:"

msgid ""
"Using these methods, you can write high-level generic code that performs "
"queries on any installed model -- instead of importing and using a single "
"specific model class, you can pass an ``app_label`` and ``model`` into "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` lookup at "
"runtime, and then work with the model class or retrieve objects from it."
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as na modhanna seo, is féidir leat cód cineálach ardleibhéil "
"a scríobh a dhéanann ceisteanna ar aon mhúnla suiteáilte - in ionad rang "
"samhail amháin a iompórtáil agus a úsáid, is féidir leat cuardach "
"``app_label`` agus `model ``model`` a chur isteach i a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.contentType` ag rith, agus ansin oibriú "
"leis an rang samhail nó rudaí a aisghabháil uaidh."

msgid ""
"You can relate another model "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` as a way of "
"tying instances of it to particular model classes, and use these methods to "
"get access to those model classes."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat samhail eile a cheangal la:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` mar bhealach chun cásanna "
"de a cheangal le ranganna samhail áirithe, agus na modhanna seo a úsáid chun "
"rochtain a fháil ar na ranganna samhail sin."

msgid ""
"Several of Django's bundled applications make use of the latter technique. "
"For example, :class:`the permissions system "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.Permission>` in Django's authentication "
"framework uses a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` model with "
"a foreign key to :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType`; "
"this lets :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` represent concepts "
"like \"can add blog entry\" or \"can delete news story\"."
msgstr ""
"Baineann roinnt de na feidhmchláir cuabháilte Django úsáid as an teicníc "
"deireanach sin. Mar shampla, :class: `an córas ceadanna "
"<django.contrib.auth.models.Permission>`i gcreat fíordheimhnithe Django "
"úsáideann samhail a:class: `~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` le "
"eochair eachtrach chuig:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType`; is féidir leis an "
"iontráil blog a chur leis” nó “is féidir scéal nuachta a scriosadh”."

msgid "The ``ContentTypeManager``"
msgstr "An ``ContentTypeManager``"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` also has a custom "
"manager, :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentTypeManager`, "
"which adds the following methods:"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` tá bainisteoir "
"saincheaptha freisin, :class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentTypeManager`, a chuireann na "
"modhanna seo a leanas leis:"

msgid ""
"Clears an internal cache used "
"by :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` to keep track of "
"models for which it has "
"created :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instances. "
"You probably won't ever need to call this method yourself; Django will call "
"it automatically when it's needed."
msgstr ""
"Glanann sé taisce inmheánach a úsáideann: :class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` chun súil a choinneáil ar "
"na samhlacha a bhfuil cruthaithe ai:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` cásanna. Is dócha nach "
"mbeidh ort an modh seo a ghlaoch ort féin riamh; Glaoifidh Django air go "
"huathoibríoch nuair a bheidh sé ag teastáil."

msgid ""
"Lookup a :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` by ID. "
"Since this method uses the same shared cache "
"as :meth:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentTypeManager.get_for_model`, "
"it's preferred to use this method over the usual "
"``ContentType.objects.get(pk=id)``"
msgstr ""
"Cuardaigh a:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` de réir "
"ID. Ós rud é go n-úsáideann an modh seo an taisce roinnte céanna amha:meth: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentTypeManager.get_for_model`, is "
"fearr an modh seo a úsáid thar an `ContentType.Objects.get (pk=id) `is gnách"

msgid ""
"Takes either a model class or an instance of a model, and returns "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instance "
"representing that model. ``for_concrete_model=False`` allows fetching "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` of a proxy "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé rang samhail nó sampla de mhúnla, agus filleann sé an "
"sampla:class: `~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` a léiríonn "
"an tsamhail sin. Ligeann ``for_concrete_model=False`` an: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` de mhúnla seachfhreastalaí "
"a fháil."

msgid ""
"Takes a variadic number of model classes, and returns a dictionary mapping "
"the model classes to "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` instances "
"representing them. ``for_concrete_models=False`` allows fetching "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` of proxy models."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé líon éagsúil ranganna samhail, agus cuireann sé foclóir ar ais ag "
"mapáil na ranganna samhail chuig na cásanna: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` a léiríonn iad. "
"``for_concrete_models=False`` ceadaíonn an: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` de mhúnlaí "
"seachfhreastalaí a fháil."

msgid ""
"Returns the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` "
"instance uniquely identified by the given application label and model name. "
"The primary purpose of this method is to "
"allow :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` objects to be "
"referenced via a :ref:`natural key<topics-serialization-natural-keys>` "
"during deserialization."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an sampla:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` a aithnítear go uathúil ag "
"an lipéad iarratais agus ainm an tsamhail. <topics-serialization-natural-"
"keys>Is é príomhchuspóir an mhodha seo ná: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` rudaí le tagairt a "
"thabhairt trí a:ref: `eochair nádúrtha `le linn dísheerialaithe."

msgid ""
"The :meth:`~ContentTypeManager.get_for_model()` method is especially useful "
"when you know you need to work with a :class:`ContentType "
"<django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType>` but don't want to go to "
"the trouble of obtaining the model's metadata to perform a manual lookup:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh: Meth: `~ContentTypeManager.get_for_Model () `úsáideach go "
"háirithe nuair a fhios agat go gcaithfidh tú oibriú le a:class: "
"`ContentType` ach níl tú ag iarraidh dul chuig an trioblóid meiteashonraí an "
"tsamhail a fháil chun cuardach lá "
"<django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType>imhe a dhéanamh:"

msgid "Generic relations"
msgstr "Caidreamh cineálach"

msgid ""
"Adding a foreign key from one of your own models "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` allows your "
"model to effectively tie itself to another model class, as in the example of "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Permission` model above. But it's "
"possible to go one step further and "
"use :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType` to enable truly "
"generic (sometimes called \"polymorphic\") relationships between models."
msgstr ""
"Ag cur eochair eachtrach ó cheann de do mhúnlaí féin chuig: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType` is féidir le do mhúnla é "
"féin a cheangal go héifeachtach le rang samhail eile, mar atá i sampla an "
"tsamhail: `~django.contrib.auth.models.permission` thuas. Ach is féidir dul "
"céim amháin níos faide agus úsáid:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentType` chun caidrimh fíor-"
"chineálacha (ar a dtugtar “polaimorfach” uaireanta) idir samhlacha a chumasú."

msgid "For example, it could be used for a tagging system like so::"
msgstr "Mar shampla, d'fhéadfaí é a úsáid le haghaidh córas clibeála mar seo:"

msgid ""
"A normal :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` can only \"point to\" one "
"other model, which means that if the ``TaggedItem`` model used "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` it would have to choose one and only "
"one model to store tags for. The contenttypes application provides a special "
"field type (``GenericForeignKey``) which works around this and allows the "
"relationship to be with any model:"
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir le gnáth:class: `~django.db.models.foreignKey` ach “pointe” ar "
"mhúnla amháin eile, rud a chiallaíonn má úsáideann an tsamhail "
"``TaggEditem`` a:class: `~Django.db.Models.ForeignKey` bheadh air samhail "
"amháin agus amháin a roghnú chun clibeanna a stóráil dó. Soláthraíonn an "
"feidhmchlár contenttypes cineál réimse speisialta (`GenericForeignKey`) a "
"oibríonn timpeall air seo agus a ligeann don chaidreamh a bheith le haon "
"mhúnla:"

msgid ""
"There are three parts to setting up "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey`:"
msgstr ""
"Tá trí chuid ann chun a: class a bhunú: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericForeignKey`:"

msgid ""
"Give your model a :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentType`. The usual name "
"for this field is \"content_type\"."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair do mhúnla a:class: `~django.db.models.foreignKey` chuig: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.ContentType`. Is é “content_type” an "
"gnáthainm don réimse seo."

msgid ""
"Give your model a field that can store primary key values from the models "
"you'll be relating to. For most models, this means "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.PositiveBigIntegerField`. The usual name for "
"this field is \"object_id\"."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Give your model "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey`, and pass "
"it the names of the two fields described above. If these fields are named "
"\"content_type\" and \"object_id\", you can omit this -- those are the "
"default field "
"names :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey` will "
"look for."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair do mhúnla a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericForeignKey`, agus cuir "
"ainmneacha an dá réimse a thuairiscítear thuas air. Má ainmnítear na réimsí "
"seo “content_type” agus “object_id”, is féidir leat é seo a fhágáil - is iad "
"sin na hainmneacha réimse réamhshocraithe: class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.fields.GenericForeignKey` a lorgfaidh."

msgid ""
"Unlike for the :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey`, a database index is "
"*not* automatically created on "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey`, so it's "
"recommended that you use :attr:`Meta.indexes "
"<django.db.models.Options.indexes>` to add your own multiple column index. "
"This behavior :ticket:`may change <23435>` in the future."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Options.indexes>Murab ionann agus don: class: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignKey`, cruthaítear innéacs bunachar sonraí *not* go "
"huathoibríoch ar:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericForeignKey`, mar sin moltar "
"duit: attr: `Meta.Indexes `a úsáid chun d'innéacs colún iolrach féin a chur "
"leis. An t-iompar seo: ticéad: `d'fhéadfadh athrú <23435>`sa todhchaí."

msgid ""
"If ``False``, the field will be able to reference proxy models. Default is "
"``True``. This mirrors the ``for_concrete_model`` argument "
"to :meth:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.models.ContentTypeManager.get_for_model`."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``False``, beidh an réimse in ann samhlacha seachfhreastalaí a "
"thagairt. Is é réamhshocraithe ``True``. Léiríonn sé seo an argóint "
"``for_concrete_model`` chuig: meth: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Models.contentTypeManager.get_for_model`."

msgid "Primary key type compatibility"
msgstr "Comhoiriúnacht príomhchineál"

msgid ""
"The \"object_id\" field doesn't have to be the same type as the primary key "
"fields on the related models, but their primary key values must be coercible "
"to the same type as the \"object_id\" field by "
"its :meth:`~django.db.models.Field.get_db_prep_value` method."
msgstr ""
"Ní gá go mbeadh an réimse “object_id” an cineál céanna leis na príomhréimsí "
"ar na samhlacha gaolmhara, ach caithfidh a bpríomh-luachanna a bheith "
"inéigeantach don chineál céanna leis an réimse “object_id” trí:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.field.get_db_prep_value` modh."

msgid ""
"For example, if you want to allow generic relations to models with "
"either :class:`~django.db.models.IntegerField` "
"or :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` primary key fields, you can "
"use :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` for the \"object_id\" field on your "
"model since integers can be coerced to strings "
"by :meth:`~django.db.models.Field.get_db_prep_value`."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, más mian leat caidreamh cineálach a cheadú le samhlacha le "
"príomhréimsí éither:class: `~django.db.models.integerfield` nó:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` príomhréimsí, is féidir leat:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` a úsáid don réimse “object_id” ar do mhúnla ós "
"rud é gur féidir slána a úsáid chuig teaghráin ag: meth: "
"`~django.db.models.field.get_db_prep_value`."

msgid ""
"For maximum flexibility you can use a :class:`~django.db.models.TextField` "
"which doesn't have a maximum length defined, however this may incur "
"significant performance penalties depending on your database backend."
msgstr ""
"Chun an tsolúbthacht is mó is féidir leat a: class: "
"`~django.db.models.textfield` a úsáid nach bhfuil an fad uasta sainmhínithe "
"aige, ach d'fhéadfadh pionóis feidhmíochta suntasacha a bheith air seo ag "
"brath ar do chúltaca bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"There is no one-size-fits-all solution for which field type is best. You "
"should evaluate the models you expect to be pointing to and determine which "
"solution will be most effective for your use case."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon réiteach aonmhéid a oireann do gach duine cén cineál réimse is fearr "
"dó. Ba cheart duit meastóireacht a dhéanamh ar na samhlacha a bhfuil tú ag "
"súil leo a bheith ag cur in iúl agus a chinneadh cén réiteach is éifeachtaí "
"do do chás úsáide"

