msgid "The flatpages app"
msgstr "An aip flatpages"

msgid ""
"Django comes with an optional \"flatpages\" application. It lets you store "
"\"flat\" HTML content in a database and handles the management for you via "
"Django's admin interface and a Python API."
msgstr ""
"Tagann Django le feidhmchlár roghnach “flatpages”. Ligeann sé duit ábhar "
"HTML “comhréidh” a stóráil i mbunachar sonraí agus láimhseálann sé an "
"bhainistíocht duit trí chomhéadan riaracháin Django agus API Python."

msgid ""
"A flatpage is an object with a URL, title and content. Use it for one-off, "
"special-case pages, such as \"About\" or \"Privacy Policy\" pages, that you "
"want to store in a database but for which you don't want to develop a custom "
"Django application."
msgstr ""
"Is réad é leathanach cothrom le URL, teideal agus ábhar. Úsáid é le haghaidh "
"leathanaigh aonuaire, cásanna speisialta, mar shampla leathanaigh “Maidir” "
"nó “Beartas Príobháideachta”, ar mhaith leat a stóráil i mbunachar sonraí "
"ach nach dteastaíonn uait feidhmchlár saincheaptha Django a fhorbairt dóibh."

msgid ""
"A flatpage can use a custom template or a default, systemwide flatpage "
"template. It can be associated with one, or multiple, sites."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le leathanach cothrom teimpléad saincheaptha nó teimpléad "
"réamhshocraithe ar fud an chórais a úsáid. Is féidir leis a bheith bainteach "
"le suíomh amháin, nó iolracha."

msgid ""
"The content field may optionally be left blank if you prefer to put your "
"content in a custom template."
msgstr ""
"Féadfar an réimse ábhair a fhágáil bán go roghnach más fearr leat d'ábhar a "
"chur i dteimpléad saincheaptha."

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Suiteáil"

msgid "To install the flatpages app, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Chun an aip flatpages a shuiteáil, lean na céimeanna seo:"

msgid ""
"Install the :mod:`sites framework <django.contrib.sites>` by adding "
"``'django.contrib.sites'`` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting, if "
"it's not already in there."
msgstr ""
"Suiteáil an creat:mod: `sites `trí "
"``<django.contrib.sites>django.contrib.sites'` a chur le do shuíomh: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS`, mura bhfuil sé ann cheana féin."

msgid ""
"Also make sure you've correctly set :setting:`SITE_ID` to the ID of the site "
"the settings file represents. This will usually be ``1`` (i.e. ``SITE_ID = "
"1``), but if you're using the sites framework to manage multiple sites, it "
"could be the ID of a different site."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.flatpages'`` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting."
msgstr "Cuir ``django.contrib.flatpages'` le do shocrú: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid "Then either:"
msgstr "Ansin ceachtar:"

msgid "Add an entry in your URLconf. For example::"
msgstr "Cuir iontráil isteach i do URLConf. Mar shampla::"

msgid "or:"
msgstr "nó:"

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware'`` to "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` setting."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ``django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpageFallbackmiddleware'` le "
"do shuíomh: `MIDDLEWARE`."

msgid "Run the command :djadmin:`manage.py migrate <migrate>`."
msgstr "<migrate>Rith an t-ordú: djadmin: `manage.py migration `."

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Conas a oibríonn sé"

msgid ""
"``manage.py migrate`` creates two tables in your database: "
"``django_flatpage`` and ``django_flatpage_sites``. ``django_flatpage`` is a "
"lookup table that maps a URL to a title and bunch of text content. "
"``django_flatpage_sites`` associates a flatpage with a site."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn ``manage.py migrate`` dhá thábla i do bhunachar sonraí: "
"``django_flatpage`` agus ``django_flatpage_sites``. Is tábla cuardaigh é "
"``django_flatpage`` a mhéapálann URL chuig teideal agus dornán ábhar téacs. "
"Comhcheanglaíonn ``django_flatpage_sites`` leathanach cothrom le suíomh."

msgid "Using the URLconf"
msgstr "Ag baint úsáide as an URLConf"

msgid ""
"There are several ways to include the flat pages in your URLconf. You can "
"dedicate a particular path to flat pages::"
msgstr ""
"Tá bealaí éagsúla ann chun na leathanaigh chomhréidh a áireamh i do URLConf. "
"Is féidir leat cosán áirithe a thiomnú chuig leathanaigh chomhréidh:"

msgid ""
"You can also set it up as a \"catchall\" pattern. In this case, it is "
"important to place the pattern at the end of the other urlpatterns::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat é a chur ar bun mar phatrún “catchall” freisin. Sa chás seo, "
"tá sé tábhachtach an patrún a chur ag deireadh na urlpattern eile::"

msgid ""
"If you set :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` to ``False``, you must remove the slash "
"in the catchall pattern or flatpages without a trailing slash will not be "
"matched."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú: socrú: `APPEND_SLASH` go ``False``, ní mór duit an slash "
"sa phatrún catchall a bhaint nó ní bheidh leathanaigh chomhréireáilte gan "
"slasc rianaithe a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"Another common setup is to use flat pages for a limited set of known pages "
"and to hard code their URLs in the :doc:`URLconf </topics/http/urls>`::"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``kwargs`` argument sets the ``url`` value used for the ``FlatPage`` "
"model lookup in the flatpage view."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``name`` argument allows the URL to be reversed in templates, for "
"example using the :ttag:`url` template tag."
msgstr ""

msgid "Using the middleware"
msgstr "Ag baint úsáide as an middleware"

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware` "
"can do all of the work."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpageFallbackmiddleware` an obair "
"go léir a dhéanamh."

msgid ""
"Each time any Django application raises a 404 error, this middleware checks "
"the flatpages database for the requested URL as a last resort. Specifically, "
"it checks for a flatpage with the given URL with a site ID that corresponds "
"to the :setting:`SITE_ID` setting."
msgstr ""
"Gach uair a ardaíonn aon fheidhmchlár Django earráid 404, seiceálann an "
"middleware seo bunachar sonraí na flatpages don URL iarrtha mar rogha "
"dheiridh. Go sonrach, seiceálann sé leathanach comhréidh leis an URL tugtha "
"le ID láithreáin a fhreagraíonn don socrú: setting: `SITE_ID`."

msgid "If it finds a match, it follows this algorithm:"
msgstr "Má aimsíonn sé meaitseáil, leanann sé an algartam seo:"

msgid ""
"If the flatpage has a custom template, it loads that template. Otherwise, it "
"loads the template :file:`flatpages/default.html`."
msgstr ""
"Má tá teimpléad saincheaptha ag an flatpage, luchtaíonn sé an teimpléad sin. "
"Seachas sin, luchtaíonn sé an teimpléad:file: `flatpages/default.html`."

msgid ""
"It passes that template a single context variable, ``flatpage``, which is "
"the flatpage object. It uses :class:`~django.template.RequestContext` in "
"rendering the template."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé athróg comhthéacs aonair ar an teimpléad sin, `flatpage``, arb é "
"an réad leathanaigh réidh. Úsáideann sé: aicme: "
"`~django.template.requestContext` chun an teimpléad a rindreáil."

msgid ""
"The middleware will only add a trailing slash and redirect (by looking at "
"the :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` setting) if the resulting URL refers to a valid "
"flatpage. Redirects are permanent (301 status code)."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirfidh an middleware slasc agus atreorú (trí fhéachaint ar an socrú: "
"“APPEND_SLASH`”) má thagraíonn an URL mar thoradh air do leathanach "
"comhréidh bailí. Tá athreoruithe buan (cód stádais 301)."

msgid ""
"If it doesn't find a match, the request continues to be processed as usual."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfaigheann sé meaitseáil, leanann an t-iarratas á phróiseáil mar is "
"gnách."

msgid ""
"The middleware only gets activated for 404s -- not for 500s or responses of "
"any other status code."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghníomhaítear an middleware ach ar feadh 404s - ní le haghaidh 500s nó "
"freagraí ar aon chód stádais eile."

msgid "Flatpages will not apply view middleware"
msgstr "Ní bheidh feidhm ag flatpages view middleware"

msgid ""
"Because the ``FlatpageFallbackMiddleware`` is applied only after URL "
"resolution has failed and produced a 404, the response it returns will not "
"apply any :ref:`view middleware <view-middleware>` methods. Only requests "
"which are successfully routed to a view via normal URL resolution apply view "
"middleware."
msgstr ""
"<view-middleware>Toisc nach gcuirtear an `flatpageFallbackmiddleware`` i "
"bhfeidhm ach amháin tar éis teip ar réiteach URL agus 404 a tháirgeadh, ní "
"bheidh feidhm ag an bhfreagra a thugann sé ar ais aon modhanna: ref: `view "
"middleware `. Ní bhaineann ach iarratais a atreoraítear go rathúil chuig "
"radharc trí ghnáthréiteach URL."

msgid ""
"Note that the order of :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` matters. Generally, you can "
"put :class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware` "
"at the end of the list. This means it will run first when processing the "
"response, and ensures that any other response-processing middleware see the "
"real flatpage response rather than the 404."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil tábhacht ag ordú:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`. Go "
"ginearálta, is féidir leat: class: "
"`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpageFallBackMiddleware` a chur ag "
"deireadh an liosta. Ciallaíonn sé seo go rithfidh sé ar dtús agus an freagra "
"á bpróiseáil, agus cinntíonn sé go bhfeiceann aon mheánearraí próiseála "
"freagartha eile an fíor-fhreagairt leathanaigh réidh seachas an 404."

msgid ""
"For more on middleware, read the :doc:`middleware docs </topics/http/"
"middleware>`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais faoi middleware, léigh an:doc: `middle</topics/"
"http/middleware> ware docs`."

msgid "Ensure that your 404 template works"
msgstr "Cinntigh go n-oibríonn do theimpléad 404"

msgid ""
"Note that "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware` "
"only steps in once another view has successfully produced a 404 response. If "
"another view or middleware class attempts to produce a 404 but ends up "
"raising an exception instead, the response will become an HTTP 500 "
"(\"Internal Server Error\") and "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware` "
"will not attempt to serve a flat page."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach ndéanann an: class: "
"`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpageFallBackMiddleware` céim "
"isteach ach amháin nuair a bheidh freagra 404 tar éis dearcadh eile a "
"tháirgeadh go rathúil. Má dhéanann radharc eile nó rang middleware iarracht "
"404 a tháirgeadh ach críochnaíonn sé eisceacht ina ionad sin, beidh an "
"freagra ina HTTP 500 (“Earráid Freastalaí Inmheánach”) agus ní dhéanfaidh "
"ain:class: `~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpagefallbackmiddleware` "
"iarracht leathanach comhréidh a sheirbheáil."

msgid "How to add, change and delete flatpages"
msgstr "Conas leathanaigh réidh a chur leis, a athrú agus a scriosadh"

msgid ""
"Permissions to add or edit flatpages should be restricted to trusted users. "
"Flatpages are defined by raw HTML and are **not sanitized** by Django. As a "
"consequence, a malicious flatpage can lead to various security "
"vulnerabilities, including permission escalation."
msgstr ""
"Ba cheart ceadanna chun leathanaigh réidh a chur leis nó a chur in eagar "
"srian d'úsáideoirí iontaofa. Sainmhínítear leathanaigh réidh le HTML amh "
"agus ní dhéantar iad a shláintiú** ag Django. Mar thoradh air sin, "
"d'fhéadfadh leochaileachtaí slándála éagsúla a bheith mar thoradh ar "
"leathanach cothrom mailíseach, lena n-áirítear méadú"

msgid "Via the admin interface"
msgstr "Tríd an gcomhéadan riaracháin"

msgid ""
"If you've activated the automatic Django admin interface, you should see a "
"\"Flatpages\" section on the admin index page. Edit flatpages as you edit "
"any other object in the system."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an comhéadan riaracháin Django uathoibríoch curtha i ngníomh agat, ba "
"chóir duit rannán “Flatpages” a fheiceáil ar an leathanach innéacs "
"riaracháin. Cuir leathanaigh cothrom in eagar agus tú in eagar aon rud eile "
"sa chóras."

msgid ""
"The ``FlatPage`` model has an ``enable_comments`` field that isn't used by "
"``contrib.flatpages``, but that could be useful for your project or third-"
"party apps. It doesn't appear in the admin interface, but you can add it by "
"registering a custom ``ModelAdmin`` for ``FlatPage``::"
msgstr ""
"Tá réimse ``enable_comments`` sa tsamhail ``flatpage`` nach n-úsáideann "
"`contrib.flatpages``, ach d'fhéadfadh sé sin a bheith úsáideach do do "
"thionscadal nó d'aipeanna tríú páirtí. Níl sé le feiceáil sa chomhéadan "
"riaracháin, ach is féidir leat é a chur leis trí “ModelAdmin” saincheaptha a "
"chlárú le haghaidh ``flatpage``:"

msgid "Via the Python API"
msgstr "Trí API Python"

msgid ""
"Flatpages are represented by a standard :doc:`Django model </topics/db/"
"models>`, :class:`.FlatPage`. You can access flatpage objects via "
"the :doc:`Django database API </topics/db/queries>`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Check for duplicate flatpage URLs."
msgstr "Seiceáil le haghaidh URLanna leathanaigh dhúblacha."

msgid ""
"If you add or modify flatpages via your own code, you will likely want to "
"check for duplicate flatpage URLs within the same site. The flatpage form "
"used in the admin performs this validation check, and can be imported from "
"``django.contrib.flatpages.forms.FlatpageForm`` and used in your own views."
msgstr ""
"Má chuireann tú leathanaigh réidh leis nó má mhodhníonn tú trí do chód féin, "
"is dócha go mbeidh tú ag iarraidh seiceáil le haghaidh URLanna leathanaigh "
"dhúbailte laistigh den suíomh céanna. Déanann an fhoirm flatpage a úsáidtear "
"sa riarachán an seiceáil bailíochtaithe seo, agus is féidir í a allmhairiú ó "
"``django.contrib.flatpages.forms.flatpageform`` agus a úsáid i do thuairimí "
"féin."

msgid "``FlatPage`` model"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.models.FlatPage` objects have the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Required. 100 characters or fewer. Indexed for faster lookups."
msgstr ""

msgid "Required. 200 characters or fewer."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optional (:attr:`blank=True "
"<django.db.models.Field.blank>`). :class:`~django.db.models.TextField` that "
"typically, contains the HTML content of the page."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Boolean. This field is not used by :mod:`~django.contrib.flatpages` by "
"default and does not appear in the admin interface. Please "
"see :ref:`flatpages admin interface section <flatpages-admin>` for a "
"detailed explanation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optional (:attr:`blank=True <django.db.models.Field.blank>`). 70 characters "
"or fewer. Specifies the template used to render the page. Defaults "
"to :file:`flatpages/default.html` if not provided."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Many-to-many relationship to :class:`~django.contrib.sites.models.Site`, "
"which determines the :doc:`sites </ref/contrib/sites>` the flatpage is "
"available on."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns the relative URL path of the page based on "
"the :attr:`~django.contrib.flatpages.models.FlatPage.url` attribute."
msgstr ""

msgid "Flatpage templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid Flatpage"

msgid ""
"By default, flatpages are rendered via the template :file:`flatpages/"
"default.html`, but you can override that for a particular flatpage: in the "
"admin, a collapsed fieldset titled \"Advanced options\" (clicking will "
"expand it) contains a field for specifying a template name. If you're "
"creating a flat page via the Python API you can set the template name as the "
"field ``template_name`` on the ``FlatPage`` object."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, taispeántar leathanaigh cothroma tríd an "
"teimpléad:file: `flatpages/default.html`, ach is féidir leat é sin a shárú "
"le haghaidh leathanaigh réidh áirithe: sa riarachán, tá réimse réimse chun "
"ainm teimpléad a shonrú i dtacar réimse réimse teideal “Advanced options” "
"(cliceáil é). Má tá leathanach comhréidh á chruthú agat trí API Python is "
"féidir leat ainm an teimpléid a shocrú mar an réimse ``template_name`` ar an "
"réad ``flatpage``."

msgid ""
"Creating the :file:`flatpages/default.html` template is your responsibility; "
"in your template directory, create a :file:`flatpages` directory containing "
"a file :file:`default.html`."
msgstr ""
"Tá freagracht ort an teimpléad:file: `flatpages/default.html` a chruthú; i "
"d'eolaire teimpléad, cruthaigh eolaire a:file: `flatpages` ina bhfuil "
"comhad:file: `default.html`."

msgid ""
"Flatpage templates are passed a single context variable, ``flatpage``, which "
"is the flatpage object."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear athróg comhthéacs amháin ar theimpléid flatpage, `flatpage``, arb é "
"an réad flatpage."

msgid "Here's a sample :file:`flatpages/default.html` template:"
msgstr "Seo sampla: comhad: teimpléad `flatpages/default.html`:"

msgid ""
"Since you're already entering raw HTML into the admin page for a flatpage, "
"both ``flatpage.title`` and ``flatpage.content`` are marked as **not** "
"requiring :ref:`automatic HTML escaping <automatic-html-escaping>` in the "
"template."
msgstr ""
"<automatic-html-escaping>Ós rud é go bhfuil HTML amh á iontráil agat cheana "
"féin sa leathanach riaracháin le haghaidh leathanach cothrom, marcáiltear "
"``flatpage.title`` agus `flatpage.content`` araon mar **not** ag "
"iarraidh:ref: `uathoibríoch HTML éalú `sa teimpléad."

msgid ""
"Getting a list of :class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.models.FlatPage` objects "
"in your templates"
msgstr ""
"Ag fáil liosta de:class: `~django.contrib.flatpages.models.flatpage` rudaí i "
"do theimpléid"

msgid ""
"The flatpages app provides a template tag that allows you to iterate over "
"all of the available flatpages on the :ref:`current site <hooking-into-"
"current-site-from-views>`."
msgstr ""
"<hooking-into-current-site-from-views>Soláthraíonn an aip flatpages clib "
"teimpléad a ligeann duit athrá a dhéanamh thar na leathanaigh cothroma go "
"léir atá ar fáil ar:ref: `láithreán reatha `."

msgid ""
"Like all custom template tags, you'll need to :ref:`load its custom tag "
"library <loading-custom-template-libraries>` before you can use it. After "
"loading the library, you can retrieve all current flatpages via "
"the :ttag:`get_flatpages` tag:"
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le gach clib teimpléad saincheaptha, beidh ort: ref: `a leabharlann "
"clibeanna saincheaptha a luchtú sula bhfé <loading-custom-template-"
"libraries>adfaidh tú é a úsáid. Tar éis duit an leabharlann a luchtú, is "
"féidir leat gach leathanach cothrom reatha a aisghabháil tríd an "
"gclibe:ttag: `get_flatpages`:"

msgid "Displaying ``registration_required`` flatpages"
msgstr "Ag taispeáint leathanaigh árasán ``clárúcháin_riachtana``"

msgid ""
"By default, the :ttag:`get_flatpages` template tag will only show flatpages "
"that are marked ``registration_required = False``. If you want to display "
"registration-protected flatpages, you need to specify an authenticated user "
"using a ``for`` clause."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, ní thaispeánfaidh an clib teimpléad:ttag: "
"`get_flatpages` ach leathanaigh chomhpháirteanna atá marcáilte "
"``registration_required = False``. Más mian leat leathanaigh árasaithe atá "
"cosanta ó chlárú a thaispeáint, ní mór duit úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe a "
"shonrú ag baint úsáide as clásal `for``."

msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"If you provide an anonymous user, :ttag:`get_flatpages` will behave the same "
"as if you hadn't provided a user -- i.e., it will only show you public "
"flatpages."
msgstr ""
"Má sholáthraíonn tú úsáideoir gan ainm, iompróidh :ttag: `get_flatpages` mar "
"an gcéanna is dá mbeadh úsáideoir curtha ar fáil agat - ie, ní "
"thaispeánfaidh sé ach leathanaigh árasán poiblí duit."

msgid "Limiting flatpages by base URL"
msgstr "Leathanaigh réidh a theorannú de réir URL bonn"

msgid ""
"An optional argument, ``starts_with``, can be applied to limit the returned "
"pages to those beginning with a particular base URL. This argument may be "
"passed as a string, or as a variable to be resolved from the context."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir argóint roghnach, `starts_with`, a chur i bhfeidhm chun na "
"leathanaigh a chuirtear ar ais a theorannú dóibh siúd a thosaíonn le URL "
"bonn áirithe. Féadfar an argóint seo a rith mar shreang, nó mar athróg le "
"réiteach ón gcomhthéacs."

msgid "Integrating with :mod:`django.contrib.sitemaps`"
msgstr "Comhtháthú le:mod: `django.contrib.sitemaps`"

msgid ""
"The :class:`sitemaps.FlatPageSitemap "
"<django.contrib.flatpages.sitemaps.FlatPageSitemap>` class looks at all "
"publicly visible :mod:`~django.contrib.flatpages` defined for the "
"current :setting:`SITE_ID` (see the :mod:`sites documentation "
"<django.contrib.sites>`) and creates an entry in the sitemap. These entries "
"include only the :attr:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.location` attribute "
"-- "
"not :attr:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.lastmod`, :attr:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.changefreq` "
"or :attr:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap.priority`."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.sites>Breathnaíonn an rang:class: `SiteMaps.flatPageSitemap "
"<django.contrib.flatpages.sitemaps.FlatPageSitemap>`ar gach ceann atá le "
"feiceáil go poibl:mod: `~django.contrib.flatpages` atá sainmhínithe don "
"reath:setting: `SITE_ID` (féach an doiciméadú: mod: `sites`) agus cruthaíonn "
"sé iontráil sa léarscáil. Ní áirítear ar na hiontrálacha seo ach an tréith: "
"attr: `~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.location` -- not:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.lastmod`, :attr: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.changeFreq` nó:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.changeFreq` .contrib.sitemaps.sitemap.priority`."

msgid "Example"
msgstr "Sampla"

msgid "Here's an example of a URLconf using :class:`FlatPageSitemap`::"
msgstr "Seo sampla de URLConf ag baint úsáid:class: `FlatPageSitemap`::"

msgid "GeoDjango's admin site"
msgstr "Suíomh riaracháin GeodJango"

msgid "``GISModelAdmin``"
msgstr "``GisModelAdmin``"

msgid ""
"The widget class to be used "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.GeometryField`. Defaults "
"to :class:`~django.contrib.gis.forms.widgets.OSMWidget`."
msgstr ""
"An rang giuirléid atá le húsáid le haghaidh: :class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.geometryfield`. Réamhshocraithe chuig: aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.forms.widgets.osmWidget`."

msgid ""
"The keyword arguments that would be passed to the :attr:`gis_widget`. "
"Defaults to an empty dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Na hargóintí eochairfhocal a chuirfeadh chuig:attr: `gis_widget`. "
"Réamhshocraithe chuig foclóir folamh."

msgid "GeoDjango Management Commands"
msgstr "Orduithe Bainistíochta GeodJango"

msgid "``inspectdb``"
msgstr "``Inspectdb``"

msgid ""
"When :mod:`django.contrib.gis` is in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`, "
"the :djadmin:`inspectdb` management command is overridden with one from "
"GeoDjango. The overridden command is spatially-aware, and places geometry "
"fields in the auto-generated model definition, where appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn: MOD: `django.contrib.gis` i do: setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`, "
"athsholáthraítear an t-ordú bainistíochta: djadmin: `inspectdb` le ceann ó "
"GeodJango. Tá an t-ordú athsháraithe ar an eolas spásúil, agus cuireann sé "
"réimsí geoiméadachta sa sainmhíniú samhail uathoibríoch a ghintear, nuair"

msgid "``ogrinspect``"
msgstr "``ogrinspect``"

msgid ""
"The ``ogrinspect`` management command will inspect the given OGR-"
"compatible :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.DataSource` (e.g., a shapefile) "
"and will output a GeoDjango model with the given model name.  There's a "
"detailed example of using ``ogrinspect`` :ref:`in the tutorial <ogrinspect-"
"intro>`."
msgstr ""
"Déanfaidh an t-ordú bainistíochta `ogrinspect`` iniúchadh ar an OGR-"
"comhoiriúnach tugtha: Class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.datasource` (m.sh., "
"comhad cruth) agus aschur samhail GeodJango leis an ainm samhail tugtha. "
"<ogrinspect-intro>Tá sampla mionsonraithe ann maidir le ``ogrinspect``: ref: "
"`sa rang teagaisc `a úsáid."

msgid ""
"Use a comma separated list of OGR field names to add the ``blank=True`` "
"keyword option to the field definition.  Set with ``true`` to apply to all "
"applicable fields."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid liosta scartha camóg d'ainmneacha réimse OGR chun an rogha "
"eochairfhocal ``Blank = True`` a chur leis an sainmhíniú réimse. Socraigh le "
"``fíor` chun feidhm a chur i bhfeidhm ar gach réimse is infheidhme."

msgid ""
"Use a comma separated list of OGR float fields to "
"generate :class:`~django.db.models.DecimalField` instead of the "
"default :class:`~django.db.models.FloatField`. Set to ``true`` to apply to "
"all OGR float fields."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid liosta scartha camóg de réimsí snámhphointe OGR chun a "
"ghiniúint:class: `~django.db.models.decimalfield` in ionad an "
"réamhshocraithe:class: `~django.db.models.floatfield`. Socraigh go ``fíor` "
"chun feidhm a chur i bhfeidhm ar gach réimse snámhphointe OGR."

msgid ""
"Specifies the model attribute name to use for the geometry field. Defaults "
"to ``'geom'``."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn ainm tréith an tsamhail atá le húsáid don réimse geoiméadrach. "
"Réamhshocraithe go ``'geom'``."

msgid ""
"The key for specifying which layer in the "
"OGR :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.DataSource` source to use. Defaults to "
"0 (the first layer). May be an integer or a string identifier for "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.Layer`. When inspecting databases, "
"``layer`` is generally the table name you want to inspect."
msgstr ""
"An eochair chun a shonrú cén ciseal san OGR: Class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.datasource` foinse atá le húsáid. Réamhshocraithe "
"go 0 (an chéad chiseal). D'fhéadfadh sé a bheith ina shláimhir nó ina "
"aitheantóir teaghrán don :class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.layer`. Agus "
"bunachair sonraí á iniúchadh agat, is iondúil gurb é `sraith ``an t-ainm "
"tábla a theastaíonn uait a iniúchadh."

msgid ""
"Automatically generate a mapping dictionary for use "
"with :class:`~django.contrib.gis.utils.LayerMapping`."
msgstr ""
"Ginigh foclóir mapála go huathoibríoch le húsáid le:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.utils.layermapping`."

msgid ""
"When generating the geometry field, treat it as a geometry collection. For "
"example, if this setting is enabled then "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.MultiPolygonField` will be placed in "
"the generated model rather "
"than :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.PolygonField`."
msgstr ""
"Agus an réimse geoiméadrachta á ghiniúint agat, déileáil leis mar "
"bhailiúchán Mar shampla, má tá an socrú seo cumasaithe ansin cuirfear "
"a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.db.models.multipolygonfield` sa tsamhail "
"ghintear seachas: :class: `~django.contrib.gis.db.models.polygonfield`."

msgid ""
"Generates a ``__str__()`` method on the model that returns the given field "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Gineann sé modh ``__str__ () ``ar an tsamhail a thugann ainm an réimse "
"tugtha ar ais."

msgid ""
"Suppresses the ``from django.contrib.gis.db import models`` import statement."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé cosc ar an ráiteas allmhairithe ``ó django.contrib.gis.db "
"samhlacha allmhairiúcháin."

msgid ""
"Use a comma separated list of OGR field names to add the ``null=True`` "
"keyword option to the field definition.  Set with ``true`` to apply to all "
"applicable fields."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid liosta scartha camóg d'ainmneacha réimse OGR chun an rogha "
"eochairfhocal ``Null=True`` a chur leis an sainmhíniú réimse. Socraigh le "
"``fíor` chun feidhm a chur i bhfeidhm ar gach réimse is infheidhme."

msgid ""
"The SRID to use for the geometry field.  If not set, ``ogrinspect`` attempts "
"to automatically determine of the SRID of the data source."
msgstr ""
"An SRID le húsáid don réimse geoiméadrach. Mura bhfuil sé socraithe, déanann "
"``ogrinspect`` iarracht SRID na foinse sonraí a chinneadh go huathoibríoch."

msgid "GeoDjango Database API"
msgstr "API Bunachar Sonraí GeodJango"

msgid "Spatial Backends"
msgstr "Cúltaca Spásúla"

msgid "GeoDjango currently provides the following spatial database backends:"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn GeodJango na cúltaca bunachar sonraí spásúla seo a leanas faoi "
"láthair:"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.postgis``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.postgis``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.mysql``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.mysql``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.oracle``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.oracle``"

msgid "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.spatialite``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.gis.db.backends.spatialite``"

msgid "MySQL Spatial Limitations"
msgstr "Teorainneacha Spásúla"

msgid ""
"Django supports spatial functions operating on real geometries available in "
"modern MySQL versions. However, the spatial functions are not as rich as "
"other backends like PostGIS."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django le feidhmeanna spásúla a oibríonn ar gheoiméadraí fíor atá "
"ar fáil i leaganacha MySQL Mar sin féin, níl na feidhmeanna spásúla chomh "
"saibhir le cúltaca eile cosúil le PostGIS."

msgid "Raster Support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht Raster"

msgid ""
"``RasterField`` is currently only implemented for the PostGIS backend. "
"Spatial lookups are available for raster fields, but spatial database "
"functions and aggregates aren't implemented for raster fields."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirtear `Rasterfield ``i bhfeidhm faoi láthair ach amháin don chúltaca "
"PostGIS. Tá cuardaigh spásúla ar fáil do réimsí raster, ach ní chuirtear "
"feidhmeanna bunachar sonraí spásúla agus comhiomlánaithe i bhfeidhm do "
"réimsí raster."

