msgid "Form widgets"
msgstr "Giuirléidí foir"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango form widgets allow you to display and edit geographic data on a "
"visual map. Note that none of the currently available widgets supports 3D "
"geometries, hence geometry fields will fallback using a ``Textarea`` widget "
"for such data."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann giuirléidí foirme GeodJango duit sonraí geografacha a thaispeáint "
"agus a chur in eagar ar léarscáil amhairc Tabhair faoi deara nach dtacaíonn "
"aon cheann de na giuirléidí atá ar fáil faoi láthair le geoiméadair 3D, mar "
"sin tiocfaidh réimsí geoiméadachta siar ag úsáid giuirléid ``Textarea` le "
"haghaidh sonraí den sórt"

msgid "Widget attributes"
msgstr "tréithe giuirléid"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango widgets are template-based, so their attributes are mostly "
"different from other Django widget attributes."
msgstr ""
"Tá giuirléidí GeodJango bunaithe ar theimpléad, mar sin tá a gcuid tréithe "
"difriúil den chuid is mó ó thréithe giuirléid Django eile."

msgid "The OpenGIS geometry type, generally set by the form field."
msgstr ""
"An cineál geoiméadracht OpenGIS, arna shocrú go ginearálta ag an réimse "
"foirme."

msgid "SRID code used by the map (default is 4326)."
msgstr "Cód SRID a úsáideann an léarscáil (réamhshocraithe ná 4326)."

msgid ""
"Boolean value specifying if a textarea input showing the serialized "
"representation of the current geometry is visible, mainly for debugging "
"purposes (default is ``False``)."
msgstr ""
"Luach Boolean a shonraíonn an bhfuil ionchur textarea a thaispeánann léiriú "
"sraitheach an ghéiméadracht reatha le feiceáil, go príomha chun críocha "
"dífhabhtaithe (is é “False” réamhshocraithe)."

msgid ""
"Indicates if the widget supports edition of 3D data (default is ``False``)."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn sé an dtacaíonn an giuirléid le eagrán sonraí 3D (réamhshocraithe "
"ná ``False``)."

msgid "The template used to render the map widget."
msgstr "An teimpléad a úsáidtear chun an giuirléid léarscáil a"

msgid ""
"You can pass widget attributes in the same manner that for any other Django "
"widget. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat tréithe giuirléid a rith ar an mbealach céanna le haghaidh "
"aon ghuirléid Django eile. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Widget classes"
msgstr "Ranganna giuirléid"

msgid "``BaseGeometryWidget``"
msgstr "``BasegeometryWidget``"

msgid ""
"This is an abstract base widget containing the logic needed by subclasses. "
"You cannot directly use this widget for a geometry field. Note that the "
"rendering of GeoDjango widgets is based on a template, identified by "
"the :attr:`template_name` class attribute."
msgstr ""
"Is giuirléid bonn teibí é seo ina bhfuil an loighic a theastaíonn ó fho-"
"aicmí. Ní féidir leat an giuirléid seo a úsáid go díreach do réimse "
"geoiméadrach. Tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil rindreáil giuirléidí GeodJango "
"bunaithe ar theimpléad, a aithnítear ag an tréith aicme:attr: "
"`template_name`."

msgid "``OpenLayersWidget``"
msgstr "``OpenLayersWidget``"

msgid ""
"This is the default widget used by all GeoDjango form fields. "
"``template_name`` is ``gis/openlayers.html``."
msgstr ""
"Is é seo an giuirléid réamhshocraithe a úsáideann gach réimse foirme "
"GeodJango. Is é ``template_name`` `gis/openlayers.html``."

msgid ""
"``OpenLayersWidget`` and :class:`OSMWidget` use the ``ol.js`` file hosted on "
"the ``cdn.jsdelivr.net`` content-delivery network. You can subclass these "
"widgets in order to specify your own version of the ``ol.js`` file in the "
"``js`` property of the inner ``Media`` class (see :ref:`assets-as-a-static-"
"definition`)."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid ``OpenLayersWidget`` agus:class: `OsmWidget` an comhad ``ol.js ``arna "
"óstáil ar an líonra seachadta ábhair ``cdn.jsdelivr.net``. Is féidir leat na "
"giuirléidí seo a fho-aicmiú d'fhonn do leagan féin den chomhad ``ol.js`` a "
"shonrú i maoin `js`` den aicme ``Meáin ``istigh (féach:ref: `assets-as-a-"
"static-definition`)."

msgid "``OSMWidget``"
msgstr "``OsmWidget``"

msgid ""
"This widget uses an OpenStreetMap base layer to display geographic objects "
"on. Attributes are:"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an giuirléid seo ciseal bonn OpenStreetMap chun rudaí geografacha "
"a thaispeáint. Is iad na tréithe:"

msgid "``gis/openlayers-osm.html``"
msgstr "``gis/openlayers-osm.html``"

msgid ""
"The default center latitude and longitude are ``47`` and ``5``, "
"respectively, which is a location in eastern France."
msgstr ""
"Is é an domhantead agus an domhanfhad lárnach réamhshocraithe ``47`` agus "
"``5``, faoi seach, atá ina suíomh in oirthear na Fraince."

msgid "The default map zoom is ``12``."
msgstr "Is é ``12`` an súmáil léarscáileanna réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"The :class:`OpenLayersWidget` note about JavaScript file hosting above also "
"applies here. See also this `FAQ answer`_ about ``https`` access to map "
"tiles."
msgstr ""
"Tá feidhm ag an nóta:class: `OpenLayersWidget` faoi óstáil comhad JavaScript "
"thuas anseo freisin. Féach freisin an `freagra Ceisteanna Coitianta `_ faoi "
"rochtain `https`` ar tíleanna léarscáileanna."

msgid "Geographic Database Functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna Bunachar Sonraí"

msgid ""
"The functions documented on this page allow users to access geographic "
"database functions to be used in annotations, aggregations, or filters in "
"Django."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann na feidhmeanna doiciméadaithe ar an leathanach seo d'úsáideoirí "
"rochtain a fháil ar fheidhmeanna bunachar sonraí geografacha le húsáid in "
"anótaí, comhiomlánaithe nó scagairí i Django."

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Sampla:"

msgid ""
"Not all backends support all functions, so refer to the documentation of "
"each function to see if your database backend supports the function you want "
"to use. If you call a geographic function on a backend that doesn't support "
"it, you'll get a ``NotImplementedError`` exception."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn gach cúltaca le gach feidhm, mar sin déan tagairt do "
"dhoiciméadú gach feidhme chun a fháil amach an dtacaíonn do chúlcheann "
"bunachar sonraí leis an bhfeidhm is mian leat a úsáid. Má ghlaonn tú feidhm "
"gheografach ar chúltaca nach dtacaíonn leis, gheobhaidh tú eisceacht "
"`NotImplementederror`."

msgid "Measurements"
msgstr ""

msgid "``Area``"
msgstr "``Limistéar``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-"
"polygon-property-functions.html#function_st-area>`_, Oracle, `PostGIS "
"<https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Area.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-polygon-property-"
"functions.html#function_st-area> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Area.html>*Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`_, Oracle, `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the area of the "
"field as an :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Area` measure."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus cuireann sé limistéar "
"an réimse ar ais mar bheart: `~django.contrib.gis.Measure.Area`."

msgid ""
"MySQL and SpatiaLite without LWGEOM/RTTOPO don't support area calculations "
"on geographic SRSes."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn MySQL agus SpatialITE gan LWGEOM/RTTOPO le ríomhanna limistéar "
"ar SRSEanna geografacha."

msgid "``Distance``"
msgstr "``Fad ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"relation-functions-object-shapes.html#function_st-distance>`__, `PostGIS "
"<https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Distance.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-relation-functions-object-"
"shapes.html#function_st-distance> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Distance.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, Oracle, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the distance "
"between them, as a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Distance` object. On "
"MySQL, a raw float value is returned when the coordinates are geodetic."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografach agus filleann sé an fad "
"eatarthu, mar a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.Measure.distance` réad. Ar "
"MySQL, cuirtear luach snámh amh ar ais nuair a bhíonn na comhordanáidí "
"geodeiteach."

msgid ""
"On backends that support distance calculation on geodetic coordinates, the "
"proper backend function is automatically chosen depending on the SRID value "
"of the geometries (e.g. `ST_DistanceSphere <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_DistanceSphere.html>`__ on PostGIS)."
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_DistanceSphere.html>Ar chúltaca a thacaíonn le "
"ríomh achair ar chomhordanáidí geodéiseacha, roghnaítear an fheidhm cúltaca "
"ceart go huathoibríoch ag brath ar luach SRID na ngeoiméadraí (m.sh. "
"`ST_distanceSPHERE`__ ar PostGIS)."

msgid ""
"When distances are calculated with geodetic (angular) coordinates, as is the "
"case with the default WGS84 (4326) SRID, you can set the ``spheroid`` "
"keyword argument to decide if the calculation should be based on a simple "
"sphere (less accurate, less resource-intensive) or on a spheroid (more "
"accurate, more resource-intensive)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a ríomhtar achair le comhordanáidí geodéiseacha (uilleacha), mar atá "
"leis an réamhshocraithe WGS84 (4326) SRID, is féidir leat an argóint "
"eochairfhocal `spheroid` a shocrú chun cinneadh a dhéanamh an chóir an ríomh "
"a bheith bunaithe ar réimse simplí (níos cruinne, níos dian-acmhainní) nó ar "
"spheroid (níos cruinne, níos déine acmhainní)."

msgid ""
"In the following example, the distance from the city of Hobart to every "
"other :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.PointField` in the "
"``AustraliaCity`` queryset is calculated:"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo a leanas, ríomhtar an fad ó chathair Hobart go gach ceann "
"eile: `~django.contrib.gis.db.models.pointfield` sa tacar ceisteanna "
"``Austráliacity``:"

msgid ""
"Because the ``distance`` attribute is "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Distance` object, you can easily "
"express the value in the units of your choice. For example, "
"``city.distance.mi`` is the distance value in miles and ``city.distance.km`` "
"is the distance value in kilometers. See :doc:`measure` for usage details "
"and the list of :ref:`supported_units`."
msgstr ""
"Toisc gurb é an tréith `distance`` a: aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.Measure.distance` réad, is féidir leat an luach sna "
"haonaid de do rogha a chur in iúl go héasca. Mar shampla, is é "
"``city.distance.mi`` an luach achair i míleanna agus ``city.distance.km`` an "
"luach achair i gciliméadar. Féach: doc: `tomh` le haghaidh sonraí úsáide "
"agus an liosta de:ref: `supported_units`."

msgid "``GeometryDistance``"
msgstr "``Fad geoiméadraithe``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"geometry_distance_knn.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/geometry_distance_knn.html>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGis`__"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the distance "
"between them. When used in "
"an :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.order_by` clause, it provides "
"index-assisted nearest-neighbor result sets."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografach agus filleann sé an fad "
"eatarthu. Nuair a úsáidtear é i gclásal an:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.query.queryset.order_by`, soláthraíonn sé tacair torthaí "
"is gaire don chomharsa le cúnamh innéacs."

msgid "``Length``"
msgstr "``Fad ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-"
"linestring-property-functions.html#function_st-length>`__, Oracle, `PostGIS "
"<https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Length.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-linestring-property-"
"functions.html#function_st-length> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Length.html>*Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, Oracle, `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic linestring or multilinestring field or "
"expression and returns its length as "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Distance` measure."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú líne geografach amháin nó illíne agus "
"filleann sé a fhad mar a: aicme: `~django.contrib.gis.measur.distance` beart."

msgid ""
"On PostGIS and SpatiaLite, when the coordinates are geodetic (angular), you "
"can specify if the calculation should be based on a simple sphere (less "
"accurate, less resource-intensive) or on a spheroid (more accurate, more "
"resource-intensive) with the ``spheroid`` keyword argument."
msgstr ""
"Ar PostGIS agus Spatialite, nuair a bhíonn na comhordanáidí geodeiteach "
"(uilleach), is féidir leat a shonrú an chóir go mbeadh an ríomh bunaithe ar "
"réimse simplí (chomh cruinn, chomh dian ar acmhainní) nó ar spheroid (níos "
"cruinne, níos déine acmhainní) leis an argóint eochairfhocal `spheroid`."

msgid "MySQL doesn't support length calculations on geographic SRSes."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn MySQL le ríomhanna fad ar SRSEanna geografacha."

msgid "``Perimeter``"
msgstr "``Periméadar ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Perimeter.html>`__, "
"Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Perimeter.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the perimeter of "
"the geometry field as a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Distance` object."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus cuireann sé imlíne an "
"réimse geoimnéadais ar ais mar a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.Measure.distance` réad."

msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "Caidrimh"

msgid "``Azimuth``"
msgstr "``Azimuth``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Azimuth.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite (LWGEOM/RTTOPO)"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Azimuth.html>* Infhaighteacht*: `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite (LWGEOM/RTTOPO)"

msgid ""
"Returns the azimuth in radians of the segment defined by the given point "
"geometries, or ``None`` if the two points are coincident. The azimuth is "
"angle referenced from north and is positive clockwise: north = ``0``; east = "
"``π/2``; south = ``π``; west = ``3π/2``."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an azimuth i radáin den deighleog atá sainmhínithe ag na "
"geoiméadrachtaí pointe ar leith, nó ``None ``má tá an dá phointe ag teacht "
"le chéile. Is uillinn é an azimuth a dtagraítear ó thuaidh agus tá sé "
"dearfach deaclaíoch: thuaidh = ``0``; thoir = `π/2``; theas = ``π``; thiar = "
"``3π/2``."

msgid "``BoundingCircle``"
msgstr "``Ciorcal teorannaitheach``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_MinimumBoundingCircle.html>`__, `Oracle <https://docs.oracle.com/en/"
"database/oracle/oracle-database/21/spatl/ SDO_GEOM-"
"reference.html#GUID-82A61626-BB64-4793-B53D-A0DBEC91831A>`_, SpatiaLite 5.1+"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_MinimumBoundingCircle.html> < https://"
"docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/oracle-database/21/spatl/ SDO_GEOM-"
"reference.html #GUID -82A61626-BB64-4793-B53D-A0DBEC91831A>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGis`__, `Oracle`_, Spatialite 5.1+"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the smallest "
"circle polygon that can fully contain the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé an polagún "
"ciorcal is lú ar féidir leis an geoiméadacht a bheith ina iomlán."

msgid "The ``num_seg`` parameter is used only on PostGIS."
msgstr "Ní úsáidtear an paraiméadar ``num_seg`` ach ar PostGIS."

msgid "SpatiaLite 5.1+ support was added."
msgstr "Cuireadh tacaíocht Spatialite 5.1+ leis."

msgid "``Centroid``"
msgstr "``Centroid``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-"
"polygon-property-functions.html#function_st-centroid>`__, `PostGIS <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_Centroid.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-polygon-property-"
"functions.html#function_st-centroid> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Centroid.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, Oracle, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the ``centroid`` "
"value of the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé luach "
"``centroid`` an ghéiméadrachta."

msgid "``ClosestPoint``"
msgstr "``Closestpoint``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_ClosestPoint.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_ClosestPoint.html>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGis`__, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the 2-dimensional "
"point on geometry A that is closest to geometry B."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografacha agus filleann sé an pointe "
"déthoiseach ar ghéimseadra A atá is gaire do ghéimse"

msgid "``Envelope``"
msgstr "```Imbléad``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-"
"general-property-functions.html#function_st-envelope>`__, `Oracle <https://"
"docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/oracle-database/21/spatl/ spatial-"
"operators-reference.html#GUID-ACED800F-3435-44AA-9606-D40934A23ED0>`__, "
"`PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Envelope.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-general-property-"
"functions.html#function_st-envelope> < https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/"
"oracle/oracle-database/21/spatl/ spatial-operators-reference.html #GUID "
"-ACED800F-3435-44AA-9606-D40934A23ED0> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Envelope.html>*Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `Oracle`__, "
"`PostGis`__, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the geometry "
"representing the bounding box of the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé an "
"geoiméadra a léiríonn bosca teorainneacha an geoiméadair."

msgid "``LineLocatePoint``"
msgstr "``Linelocatepoint``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_LineLocatePoint.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_LineLocatePoint.html>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGis`__, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Returns a float between 0 and 1 representing the location of the closest "
"point on ``linestring`` to the given ``point``, as a fraction of the 2D line "
"length."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé snámhphointe idir 0 agus 1 a léiríonn suíomh an phointe is gaire "
"ar `linestring`` don `point`` a thugtar, mar chodán den fad líne 2D."

msgid "``PointOnSurface``"
msgstr "``PointonSurface``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_PointOnSurface.html>`__, MariaDB, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_PointOnSurface.html>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGIS`__, MariaDB, Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a ``Point`` "
"geometry guaranteed to lie on the surface of the field; otherwise returns "
"``None``."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé "
"geoiméadacht ``Point`` ráthaithe go luíonn sé ar dhromchla an réimse; ar "
"shlí eile filleann sé ``None``."

msgid "Operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí"

msgid "``Difference``"
msgstr "``Difríocht ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"operator-functions.html#function_st-difference>`__, `PostGIS <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_Difference.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-operator-"
"functions.html#function_st-difference> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Difference.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the geometric "
"difference, that is the part of geometry A that does not intersect with "
"geometry B."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografacha agus filleann sé an "
"difríocht geoiméadrach ar ais, is é sin an chuid de ghéimseata A nach "
"ndéanann trasnán le céimse"

msgid "``Intersection``"
msgstr "``Idirdhearnadh ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"operator-functions.html#function_st-intersection>`__, `PostGIS <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_Intersection.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-operator-"
"functions.html#function_st-intersection> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_Intersection.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the geometric "
"intersection between them."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografach agus cuireann sé an trasna "
"geoiméadrach eatarthu"

msgid "``SymDifference``"
msgstr "``Difríocht chomhsha``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"operator-functions.html#function_st-symdifference>`__, `PostGIS <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_SymDifference.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-operator-"
"functions.html#function_st-symdifference> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_SymDifference.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the geometric "
"symmetric difference (union without the intersection) between the given "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografacha agus filleann sé an "
"difríocht shioméadrach geoiméadrach (aontas gan an trasna) idir na "
"paraiméadair"

msgid "``Union``"
msgstr "``Aontas``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"operator-functions.html#function_st-union>`__, `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/"
"docs/ST_Union.html>`__, Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-operator-"
"functions.html#function_st-union> < https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Union.html>* "
"Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts two geographic fields or expressions and returns the union of both "
"geometries."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt gheografach agus cuireann sé aontas an dá "
"ghéiméadair ar ais."

msgid "Editors"
msgstr "Eagarthóirí"

msgid "``ForcePolygonCW``"
msgstr "``ForcePolygOncw``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_ForcePolygonCW.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_ForcePolygonCW.html>*Infhaighteacht*: "
"`PostGis`__, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a modified "
"version of the polygon/multipolygon in which all exterior rings are oriented "
"clockwise and all interior rings are oriented counterclockwise. Non-"
"polygonal geometries are returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé leagan "
"modhnaithe den pholagón/ilpholygón ina bhfuil na fáinní seachtracha go léir "
"dírithe ar an gcéal agus go bhfuil gach fáinní istigh dírithe i gcoinne. "
"Cuirtear geoiméadraí neamholgánacha ar ais gan athrú."

msgid "``MakeValid``"
msgstr "``Makevalid``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_MakeValid.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite (LWGEOM/RTTOPO)"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_MakeValid.html>* Infhaighteacht*: `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite (LWGEOM/RTTOPO)"

msgid ""
"Accepts a geographic field or expression and attempts to convert the value "
"into a valid geometry without losing any of the input vertices. Geometries "
"that are already valid are returned without changes. Simple polygons might "
"become a multipolygon and the result might be of lower dimension than the "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach agus déanann sé iarracht an luach "
"a thiontú ina geoiméadracht bailí gan aon cheann de na beartacha ionchuir a "
"chail Cuirtear geoiméadraí atá bailí cheana féin ar ais gan athruithe. "
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh polagóin shimplí ina ilpholygón agus d'fhéadfadh gné "
"níos ísle a bheith ar an toradh ná an t-ionchur."

msgid "``Reverse``"
msgstr "```Ag siom``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Reverse.html>`__, "
"Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Reverse.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a geometry with "
"reversed coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé céimseata "
"le comhordanáidí aisiom"

msgid "``Scale``"
msgstr "``Scála ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Scale.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Scale.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGis`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a geometry with "
"scaled coordinates by multiplying them with the ``x``, ``y``, and optionally "
"``z`` parameters."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé céiméadra "
"le comhordanáidí scáilte tríd iad a iolrú leis na paraiméadair ``x``, `y``, "
"agus `z ``roghnach."

msgid "``SnapToGrid``"
msgstr "``SnaptoGrid ``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_SnapToGrid.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_SnapToGrid.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGis`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a geometry with "
"all points snapped to the given grid.  How the geometry is snapped to the "
"grid depends on how many numeric (either float, integer, or long) arguments "
"are given."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé "
"céiméadracht le gach pointe a ghearradh chuig an eangach ar leith. "
"Braitheann an chaoi a ngearrtar an geoiméadracht chuig an eangach ar cé "
"mhéad argóint uimhriúla (snámhphointe, sláimhir nó fada) a thugtar."

msgid "Number of Arguments"
msgstr "Líon na n-Argóintí"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "Cur síos"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid "A single size to snap both the X and Y grids to."
msgstr "Méid amháin chun na greille X agus Y a ghabháil leo."

msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

msgid "X and Y sizes to snap the grid to."
msgstr "Méideanna X agus Y chun an greille a ghabháil chuig."

msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

msgid "X, Y sizes and the corresponding X, Y origins."
msgstr "Méideanna X, Y agus an bhunús X, Y comhfhreagrach."

msgid "``Transform``"
msgstr "``Transform``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Transform.html>`__, "
"Oracle, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Transform.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGIS`__, "
"Oracle, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a geographic field or expression and a SRID integer code, and "
"returns the transformed geometry to the spatial reference system specified "
"by the ``srid`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach agus cód sláimhir SRID, agus "
"filleann sé an geoiméadra claochlaithe ar ais chuig an gcóras tagartha "
"spásúil a shonraítear leis an bparaiméadar ``srid`."

msgid ""
"What spatial reference system an integer SRID corresponds to may depend on "
"the spatial database used.  In other words, the SRID numbers used for Oracle "
"are not necessarily the same as those used by PostGIS."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh an córas tagartha spásúil a fhreagraíonn SRID sláimhir ag brath ar "
"an mbunachar sonraí spásúil a úsáidtear Is é sin le rá, ní gá go bhfuil na "
"huimhreacha SRID a úsáidtear le haghaidh Oracle mar an gcéanna leis na "
"huimhreacha a úsáideann PostGIS."

msgid "``Translate``"
msgstr "``Aistriúch``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Translate.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Translate.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGis`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a geometry with "
"its coordinates offset by the ``x``, ``y``, and optionally ``z`` numeric "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé "
"céiméadracht lena chomhordanáidí a fhritháireamh leis na paraiméadair "
"uimhriúla ``x``, `y``, agus `z ``roghnach."

msgid "Input format"
msgstr "Formáid ionchuir"

msgid "``FromWKB``"
msgstr "``FromWKB``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/gis-wkb-"
