"an argóint roghnach ``srid`` SRID an geoiméadracht mar thoradh air a shonrú. "
"Déantar neamhaird ar ``srid`` ar Oracle."

msgid "Output format"
msgstr "Formáid aschuir"

msgid "``AsGeoJSON``"
msgstr "``Asgeojson``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: MariaDB, `MySQL <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-"
"geojson-functions.html#function_st-asgeojson>`__, Oracle, `PostGIS <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_AsGeoJSON.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/en/spatial-geojson-"
"functions.html#function_st-asgeojson> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_AsGeoJSON.html>*Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, Oracle, `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a `GeoJSON "
"<https://geojson.org/>`_ representation of the geometry. Note that the "
"result is not a complete GeoJSON structure but only the ``geometry`` key "
"content of a GeoJSON structure. See also :doc:`/ref/contrib/gis/serializers`."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus cuireann sé léiriú "
"`GeoJson`_ ar an geoiméadracht < https://geojson.org/> ar ais. Tabhair faoi "
"deara nach struchtúr iomlán GeoJSON é an toradh ach ach príomhábhar "
"“geoiméadracht” de struchtúr GeoJSON amháin. Féach freis:doc: `/ref/contrib/"
"gis/serializers`."

msgid "Keyword Argument"
msgstr "Argóint Eochairfho"

msgid "``bbox``"
msgstr "``bbox``"

msgid ""
"Set this to ``True`` if you want the bounding box to be included in the "
"returned GeoJSON. Ignored on Oracle."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh é seo go ``True`` más mian leat go gcuirfí an bosca teorainneacha "
"san áireamh sa GeoJSON ar ais. Neamhaird a dhéanamh ar Oracle."

msgid "``crs``"
msgstr "``crs``"

msgid ""
"Set this to ``True`` if you want the coordinate reference system to be "
"included in the returned GeoJSON. Ignored on MySQL and Oracle."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh é seo go ``True`` más mian leat go gcuirfí an córas tagartha "
"comhordaithe san áireamh sa GeoJSON ar ais. Neamhaird a dhéanamh ar MySQL "
"agus Oracle."

msgid "``precision``"
msgstr "```cruinne``"

msgid ""
"It may be used to specify the number of significant digits for the "
"coordinates in the GeoJSON representation -- the default value is 8. Ignored "
"on Oracle."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a úsáid chun líon na ndigití suntasacha a shonrú do na "
"comhordanáidí san ionadaíocht GeoJSON - is é 8 an luach réamhshocraithe. "
"Neamhaird a dhéanamh ar Oracle."

msgid "``AsGML``"
msgstr "``ASGML``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: Oracle, `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_AsGML.html>`__, SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_AsGML.html>*Infhaighteacht*: Oracle, "
"`PostGis`__, Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a `Geographic "
"Markup Language (GML)`__ representation of the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé léiriú "
"`Teanga Marcála Geografach (GML) `__ ar an geoiméadracht."

msgid ""
"Specifies the number of significant digits for the coordinates in the GML "
"representation -- the default value is 8. Ignored on Oracle."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn sé líon na ndigití suntasacha do na comhordanáidí san ionadaíocht "
"GML - is é 8 an luach réamhshocraithe. Neamhaird a dhéanamh ar Oracle."

msgid "``version``"
msgstr "``leagan``"

msgid "Specifies the GML version to use: 2 (default) or 3."
msgstr "Sonraíonn sé an leagan GML le húsáid: 2 (réamhshocraithe) nó 3."

msgid "``AsKML``"
msgstr "``Askml``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_AsKML.html>`__, "
