"`Teanga Marcála Eochairpholl (KML) `__ ar an geoiméadracht."

msgid ""
"This keyword may be used to specify the number of significant digits for the "
"coordinates in the KML representation -- the default value is 8."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an eochairfhocal seo a úsáid chun líon na ndigití suntasacha do na "
"comhordanáidí san ionadaíocht KML a shonrú - is é 8 an luach réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``AsSVG``"
msgstr "``Assvg``"

msgid ""
"*Availability*: `PostGIS <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_AsSVG.html>`__, "
"SpatiaLite"
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_AsSVG.html>*Infhaighteacht*: `PostGis`__, "
"Spatialite"

