"ST_AsText.html>*Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, Oracle, `PostGIS`__, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns a `Well-known "
"text (WKT)`_ representation of the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus cuireann sé léiriú "
"`téacs aitheanta (WKT) `_ ar an geoiméadracht ar ais."

msgid "``GeoHash``"
msgstr "``Geohash``"

