"``GEOMETRYCOLLECTION`` nó ``MULTI*``). Tuairisceáin 1 le haghaidh "
"geoiméadraí aonair."

msgid "On MySQL, returns ``None`` for single geometries."
msgstr "Ar MySQL, filleann ``None ``le haghaidh geoiméadraí aonair."

