"functions.html#function_st-numpoints> < https://postgis.net/docs/"
"ST_NPoints.html>* Infhaighteacht*: MariaDB, `MySQL`__, `PostGIS`__, Oracle, "
"Spatialite"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single geographic field or expression and returns the number of "
"points in a geometry."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú geografach amháin agus filleann sé líon na "
"bpointí i gcéiméadra ar ais."

msgid "On MySQL, returns ``None`` for any non-``LINESTRING`` geometry."
msgstr "Ar MySQL, filleann ``None`` d'aon ghéimseadracht neamh-`LíneString``."

msgid "GDAL API"
msgstr "GDAL API"

msgid ""
"`GDAL`__ stands for **Geospatial Data Abstraction Library**, and is a "
"veritable \"Swiss army knife\" of GIS data functionality.  A subset of GDAL "
"is the `OGR`__ Simple Features Library, which specializes in reading and "
"writing vector geographic data in a variety of standard formats."
msgstr ""
"Seasann `GDAL`__ d'**Leabharlann Aistrithe Sonraí Geospásúil**, agus is "
"fíor-“ scian arm na hEilvéise” é de fheidhmiúlacht sonraí GIS. Is fo-thacar "
"de GDAL ná Leabharlann Gnéithe Simple `OGR`__, a dhéanann speisialtóireacht "
"ar shonraí geografacha veicteora a léamh agus a scríobh i bhformáidí "
"caighdeánacha éagsúla."

msgid ""
"GeoDjango provides a high-level Python interface for some of the "
"capabilities of OGR, including the reading and coordinate transformation of "
"vector spatial data and minimal support for GDAL's features with respect to "
"raster (image) data."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn GeodJango comhéadan Python ardleibhéil do chuid de chumais OGR, "
"lena n-áirítear claochlú léitheoireachta agus comhordaithe sonraí spásúla "
"veicteora agus tacaíocht íosta do ghnéithe GDAL maidir le sonraí raster "
"(íomhá)."

msgid ""
"Although the module is named ``gdal``, GeoDjango only supports some of the "
"capabilities of OGR and GDAL's raster features at this time."
msgstr ""
"Cé go dtugtar “gdal” ar an modúl, ní thacaíonn GeoDjango ach le cuid de "
"chumais gnéithe raster OGR agus GDAL ag an am seo."

msgid "Sample Data"
msgstr "Sonraí Samplacha"

msgid ""
"The GDAL/OGR tools described here are designed to help you read in your "
"geospatial data, in order for most of them to be useful you have to have "
"some data to work with.  If you're starting out and don't yet have any data "
"of your own to use, GeoDjango tests contain a number of data sets that you "
"can use for testing. You can download them here:"
msgstr ""
"Tá na huirlisí GDAL/OGR a thuairiscítear anseo deartha chun cabhrú leat do "
"shonraí geospásúla a léamh, d'fhonn go mbeidh an chuid is mó díobh úsáideach "
"caithfidh roinnt sonraí a bheith agat le hoibriú leo. Má tá tú ag tosú amach "
"agus mura bhfuil aon sonraí féin agat le húsáid fós, tá roinnt tacar sonraí "
"i dtástálacha GeodJango is féidir leat a úsáid le haghaidh tástála. Is "
"féidir leat iad a íoslódáil anseo:"

msgid "Vector Data Source Objects"
msgstr "Rudaí Foinse Sonraí Veicteora"

msgid "``DataSource``"
msgstr "``Sonraí Sonraí``"

msgid ""
":class:`DataSource` is a wrapper for the OGR data source object that "
"supports reading data from a variety of OGR-supported geospatial file "
"formats and data sources using a consistent interface.  Each data source is "
"represented by a :class:`DataSource` object which contains one or more "
"layers of data.  Each layer, represented by a :class:`Layer` object, "
"contains some number of geographic features (:class:`Feature`), information "
"about the type of features contained in that layer (e.g. points, polygons, "
"etc.), as well as the names and types of any additional fields "
"(:class:`Field`) of data that may be associated with each feature in that "
"layer."
msgstr ""
":class: Is fillteán é `DataSource` don réad foinse sonraí OGR a thacaíonn le "
"sonraí a léamh ó fhormáidí comhaid geospásúla agus foinsí sonraí éagsúla le "
"tacaíocht ó OGR ag baint úsáide as comhéadan comhsheasmhach. Léirítear gach "
"foinse sonraí ag a: aicme: `DataSource` réad ina bhfuil sraitheanna sonraí "
"amháin nó níos mó. Tá roinnt gnéithe geografacha (:class: `Feature`), "
"faisnéis faoi chineál gnéithe atá sa chiseal sin (m.sh. pointí, polagóin, "
"srl.), chomh maith le hainmneacha agus cineálacha aon réimsí breise (:class: "
"`Field`) sonraí a d'fhéadfadh a bheith bainteach le gach gné sa chiseal sin."

msgid ""
"The constructor for ``DataSource`` only requires one parameter: the path of "
"the file you want to read. However, OGR also supports a variety of more "
"complex data sources, including databases, that may be accessed by passing a "
"special name string instead of a path. For more information, see the `OGR "
"Vector Formats`__ documentation. The :attr:`name` property of a "
"``DataSource`` instance gives the OGR name of the underlying data source "
"that it is using."
msgstr ""
"Ní theastaíonn ach paraiméadar amháin ar an tógálaí do `DataSource``: cosán "
"an chomhaid is mian leat a léamh. Mar sin féin, tacaíonn OGR le réimse "
"foinsí sonraí níos casta, lena n-áirítear bunachair sonraí, ar féidir "
"rochtain a fháil orthu trí shreang ainm speisialta a rith in ionad cosán. Le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise, féach an doiciméadú `OGR Vector Formats`__. "
"Tugann maoin: Attr: `ainm` de shampla ``Datasource`` ainm OGR an fhoinse "
"sonraí bunúsach atá á úsáid aige."

msgid ""
"The optional ``encoding`` parameter allows you to specify a non-standard "
"encoding of the strings in the source. This is typically useful when you "
"obtain ``DjangoUnicodeDecodeError`` exceptions while reading field values."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an paraiméadar roghnach “ionchódú” duit ionchódú neamhchaighdeánach "
"de na teaghráin sa fhoinse a shonrú. Is gnách go mbíonn sé seo úsáideach "
"nuair a fhaigheann tú eisceachtaí ``DjangounicodeDecodeError`` agus tú ag "
"léamh luachanna réimse."

msgid ""
"Once you've created your ``DataSource``, you can find out how many layers of "
"data it contains by accessing the :attr:`layer_count` property, or "
"(equivalently) by using the ``len()`` function. For information on accessing "
"the layers of data themselves, see the next section:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh do `Dataource`` cruthaithe agat, is féidir leat a fháil amach "
"cé mhéad sraitheanna sonraí atá ann trí rochtain a fháil ar an maoin: attr: "
"`layer_count`, nó (go coibhéiseach) tríd an bhfeidhm `len () ``a úsáid. Le "
"haghaidh faisnéise maidir le rochtain a fháil ar na sraitheanna sonraí féin, "
"féach an chéad chuid eile:"

msgid "Returns the number of layers in the data source."
msgstr "Tugann sé líon na sraitheanna san fhoinse sonraí ar ais."

msgid "Returns the name of the data source."
msgstr "Tugann ainm na foinse sonraí ar ais."

msgid "``Layer``"
msgstr "``Sraith ``"

msgid ""
"``Layer`` is a wrapper for a layer of data in a ``DataSource`` object. You "
"never create a ``Layer`` object directly. Instead, you retrieve them from "
"a :class:`DataSource` object, which is essentially a standard Python "
"container of ``Layer`` objects. For example, you can access a specific layer "
"by its index (e.g. ``ds[0]`` to access the first layer), or you can iterate "
"over all the layers in the container in a ``for`` loop. The ``Layer`` itself "
"acts as a container for geometric features."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``Layer`` fillteán do chiseal sonraí i réad ``DataSource``. Ní "
"chruthaíonn tú réad ``Layer`` go díreach riamh. Ina áit sin, aisghabhann tú "
"iad ó a: class: `DataSource` réad, atá go bunúsach ina choimeádán "
"caighdeánach Python de rudaí ``Layer`. Mar shampla, is féidir leat rochtain "
"a fháil ar chiseal ar leith trína innéacs (m.sh. `ds [0] ``chun rochtain a "
"fháil ar an gcéad chiseal), nó is féidir leat athrá thar na sraitheanna go "
"léir sa choimeádán i lúb ``for``. Feidhmíonn an ``Layer`` féin mar "
"choimeádán do ghnéithe geoiméadracha."

msgid ""
"Typically, all the features in a given layer have the same geometry type. "
"The :attr:`geom_type` property of a layer is an :class:`OGRGeomType` that "
"identifies the feature type. We can use it to print out some basic "
"information about each layer in a :class:`DataSource`:"
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth, bíonn an cineál céanna céanna ag na gnéithe go léir i gciseal "
"áirithe. Is é maoin: attr: `geom_type` ciseal ná: class: `ogrGeomType` a "
"aithníonn an cineál gné. Is féidir linn é a úsáid chun roinnt faisnéise "
"bunúsach a phriontáil faoi gach ciseal in a:class: `DataSource`:"

msgid ""
"The example output is from the cities data source, loaded above, which "
"evidently contains one layer, called ``\"cities\"``, which contains three "
"point features. For simplicity, the examples below assume that you've stored "
"that layer in the variable ``layer``:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-aschur sampla ó fhoinse sonraí na gcathracha, luchtaithe thuas, ina "
"léir go bhfuil ciseal amháin, ar a dtugtar ``\"cathracha” ``, ina bhfuil trí "
"ghné phointe ann. Ar mhaithe le simplíocht, glacann na samplaí thíos leis "
"gur stóráil tú an ciseal sin san athróg ``sraith ``:"

msgid "Returns the name of this layer in the data source."
msgstr "Tugann ainm an chiseal seo ar ais san fhoinse sonraí."

msgid "Returns the number of features in the layer. Same as ``len(layer)``:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé líon na ngnéithe sa chiseal ar ais. Mar an gcéanna le `len "
"(ciseal) ``:"

msgid ""
"Returns the geometry type of the layer, as an :class:`OGRGeomType` object:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé cineál geoiméadrach an chiseal ar ais, mar réad: class: "
"`ogrGeomType`:"

msgid ""
"Returns the number of fields in the layer, i.e the number of fields of data "
"associated with each feature in the layer:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé líon na réimsí sa chiseal ar ais, ie líon na réimsí sonraí a "
"bhaineann le gach gné sa chiseal:"

msgid "Returns a list of the names of each of the fields in this layer:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta ar ais d'ainmneacha gach ceann de na réimsí sa chiseal seo:"

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the data types of each of the fields in this layer. These "
"are subclasses of ``Field``, discussed below:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta de na cineálacha sonraí gach ceann de na réimsí sa chiseal seo "
"ar ais. Is fo-aicmí iad seo de `Field`, a phléitear thíos:"

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the maximum field widths for each of the fields in this "
"layer:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta de na leithead réimse uasta do gach ceann de na réimsí sa "
"chiseal seo ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the numeric precisions for each of the fields in this "
"layer. This is meaningless (and set to zero) for non-numeric fields:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta de na cruinneas uimhriúla ar ais do gach ceann de na réimsí sa "
"chiseal seo. Tá sé seo gan brí (agus socraithe go nialas) do réimsí neamh-"
"uimhriúla:"

msgid ""
"Returns the spatial extent of this layer, as an :class:`Envelope` object:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais méid spásúil an chiseal seo, mar réad an:class: `Envelope`:"

msgid ""
"Property that returns the :class:`SpatialReference` associated with this "
"layer:"
msgstr ""
"Maoin a thugann air:class: `spatialReference` a bhaineann leis an gciseal "
"seo:"

msgid ""
"If the :class:`Layer` has no spatial reference information associated with "
"it, ``None`` is returned."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil aon fhaisnéis tagartha spásúil ag an:class: `Layer` a bhaineann "
"leis, cuirtear ``None ``ar ais."

msgid ""
"Property that may be used to retrieve or set a spatial filter for this "
"layer. A spatial filter can only be set with an :class:`OGRGeometry` "
"instance, a 4-tuple extent, or ``None``. When set with something other than "
"``None``, only features that intersect the filter will be returned when "
"iterating over the layer:"
msgstr ""
"Maoin a d'fhéadfaí a úsáid chun scagaire spásúil a aisghabháil nó a shocrú "
"don chiseal seo. Ní féidir scagaire spásúil a shocrú ach amháin le sampla: "
"class: `OgrGeometry`, méid 4 tuipéil, nó ``None``. Nuair a bheidh sé "
"socraithe le rud éigin seachas ``None ``, ní thabharfar ach gnéithe a "
"thrasnaíonn an scagaire ar ais agus iad ag athrú thar an gciseal:"

msgid ""
"A method that returns a list of the values of a given field for each feature "
"in the layer:"
msgstr ""
"Modh a thugann liosta de luachanna réimse ar leith ar fáil do gach gné sa "
"chiseal:"

msgid ""
"A method that returns a list containing the geometry of each feature in the "
"layer. If the optional argument ``geos`` is set to ``True`` then the "
"geometries are converted to :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geos.GEOSGeometry` "
"objects. Otherwise, they are returned as :class:`OGRGeometry` objects:"
msgstr ""
"Modh a thugann liosta ar ais ina bhfuil geoiméadacht gach gné sa chiseal. Má "
"tá an argóint roghnach ``geos`` socraithe go ``True`` ansin déantar na "
"geoiméadrachtaí a thiontú go rudaí:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.geos.geosgeometry`. Seachas sin, cuirtear ar ais iad "
"mar: class: `ogrGeometry` rudaí:"

msgid ""
"Returns a boolean indicating whether this layer supports the given "
"capability (a string).  Examples of valid capability strings include: "
"``'RandomRead'``, ``'SequentialWrite'``, ``'RandomWrite'``, "
"``'FastSpatialFilter'``, ``'FastFeatureCount'``, ``'FastGetExtent'``, "
"``'CreateField'``, ``'Transactions'``, ``'DeleteFeature'``, and "
"``'FastSetNextByIndex'``."
msgstr ""
"Filleann boolean a thugann le fios an dtacaíonn an gciseal seo leis an "
"gcumas a thugtar (sreang). I measc samplaí de theagáin chumais bailí tá: "
"``'RandomRead'``, ``SequentialWrite'``, ```RandomWrite'`, "
"``FastSpatialFilter'``, ``FastFeatureCount'`, ``FastGetExtent'``, "
"``CreateField'``, ``Transactions``, `Delete` Feature'``, agus "
"```FastSetNextByIndex'`."

msgid "``Feature``"
msgstr "``Gnéithe``"

msgid ""
"``Feature`` wraps an OGR feature. You never create a ``Feature`` object "
"directly. Instead, you retrieve them from a :class:`Layer` object. Each "
"feature consists of a geometry and a set of fields containing additional "
"properties. The geometry of a field is accessible via its ``geom`` property, "
"which returns an :class:`OGRGeometry` object. A ``Feature`` behaves like a "
"standard Python container for its fields, which it returns as :class:`Field` "
"objects: you can access a field directly by its index or name, or you can "
"iterate over a feature's fields, e.g. in a ``for`` loop."
msgstr ""
"Fillteann ``Feature`` gné OGR. Ní chruthaíonn tú réad ``Feature`` go díreach "
"riamh. Ina áit sin, aisghabhann tú iad ó réad a: class: `Layer`. Is éard atá "
"i ngach gné geoiméadracht agus sraith réimsí ina bhfuil airíonna breise. Tá "
"geoiméadracht réimse inrochtana tríd a mhaoin ``geom``, a thugann "
"ruda:class: `ogrGeometry` ar ais. Iompraíonn ``Feature`` cosúil le coimeádán "
"caighdeánach Python dá réimsí, a thugann sé ar ais mar ruda:class: `Field`: "
"is féidir leat rochtain a fháil ar réimse go díreach trína innéacs nó ainm, "
"nó is féidir leat athrá thar réimsí gné, m.sh. i lúb `for``."

msgid "Returns the geometry for this feature, as an ``OGRGeometry`` object:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an geoiméadracht don ghné seo ar ais, mar réad ``Ogrgeoiméadr`:"

msgid ""
"A method that returns the value of the given field (specified by name) for "
"this feature, **not** a ``Field`` wrapper object:"
msgstr ""
"Modh a thugann luach an réimse tugtha ar ais (sonraithe de réir ainm) don "
"ghné seo, **ní** réad fillte ``Réimse ``:"

msgid ""
"Returns the type of geometry for this feature, as an :class:`OGRGeomType` "
"object. This will be the same for all features in a given layer and is "
"equivalent to the :attr:`Layer.geom_type` property of the :class:`Layer` "
"object the feature came from."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an cineál céimeadra don ghné seo ar ais, mar réad: class: "
"`ogrGeomType`. Beidh sé seo mar an gcéanna do gach gné i gciseal ar leith "
"agus tá sé coibhéiseach leis an maoin: attr: `Layer.geom_TYPE` den "
"réad :class: `Layer` as a tháinig an ghné."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of fields of data associated with the feature. This will "
"be the same for all features in a given layer and is equivalent to "
"the :attr:`Layer.num_fields` property of the :class:`Layer` object the "
"feature came from."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé líon na réimsí sonraí a bhaineann leis an ngné ar ais. Beidh sé "
"seo mar an gcéanna do gach gné i gciseal ar leith agus tá sé coibhéiseach "
"leis an maoin: attr: `Layer.num_Fields` den réad: Class: `Layer` as a "
"tháinig an ghné."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the names of the fields of data associated with the "
"feature. This will be the same for all features in a given layer and is "
"equivalent to the :attr:`Layer.fields` property of the :class:`Layer` object "
"the feature came from."
msgstr ""
"Tugann liosta ar ais d'ainmneacha na réimsí sonraí a bhaineann leis an ngné. "
"Beidh sé seo mar an gcéanna do gach gné i gciseal ar leith agus tá sé "
"coibhéiseach leis an maoin: attr: `Layer.Fields` den réad: Class: `Layer` as "
"a tháinig an ghné."

msgid "Returns the feature identifier within the layer:"
msgstr "Tugann an t-aitheantas gné ar ais laistigh den chiseal:"

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the :class:`Layer` that the feature came from. This will "
"be the same for all features in a given layer:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann ainm an: class: `Layer` as a tháinig an ghné ar ais. Beidh sé seo mar "
"an gcéanna le haghaidh gach gné i gciseal ar leith:"

msgid ""
"A method that returns the index of the given field name. This will be the "
"same for all features in a given layer:"
msgstr ""
"Modh a thugann innéacs an ainm réimse tugtha ar ais. Beidh sé seo mar an "
"gcéanna do gach gné i gciseal ar leith:"

msgid "``Field``"
msgstr "``Réimse``"

msgid "Returns the name of this field:"
msgstr "Tugann ainm an réimse seo ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Returns the OGR type of this field, as an integer. The ``FIELD_CLASSES`` "
"dictionary maps these values onto subclasses of ``Field``:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an cineál OGR den réimse seo ar ais, mar shláimhir. Déanann an "
