msgid "Returns a string with the name of the data type of this field:"
msgstr "Tugann teaghrán ar ais le hainm an chineál sonraí an réimse seo:"

msgid ""
"Returns the value of this field. The ``Field`` class itself returns the "
"value as a string, but each subclass returns the value in the most "
"appropriate form:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann luach an réimse seo ar ais. Tugann an rang ``Field`` féin an luach ar "
"ais mar shreang, ach filleann gach fo-aicme an luach sa fhoirm is oiriúnaí:"

msgid "Returns the width of this field:"
msgstr "Tugann sé leithead an réimse seo ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Returns the numeric precision of this field. This is meaningless (and set to "
"zero) for non-numeric fields:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann cruinneas uimhriúil an réimse seo ar ais. Tá sé seo gan brí (agus "
"socraithe go nialas) do réimsí neamh-uimhriúla:"

msgid "Returns the value of the field as a double (float):"
msgstr "Tugann luach an réimse ar ais mar dhúbailte (snámhphointe):"

msgid "Returns the value of the field as an integer:"
msgstr "Tugann luach an réimse ar ais mar shláimhir:"

msgid "Returns the value of the field as a string:"
msgstr "Tugann luach an réimse ar ais mar shreang:"

