msgstr ""
"Tugann luach an réimse ar ais mar thiúpla de chomhpháirteanna dáta agus ama:"

msgid "``Driver``"
msgstr "``Tiomána``"

msgid ""
"The ``Driver`` class is used internally to wrap an OGR :class:`DataSource` "
"driver."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an rang ``Tiomána`` go hinmheánach chun tiománaí OGR:Class: "
"`DataSource` a fhilleadh."

msgid "Returns the number of OGR vector drivers currently registered."
msgstr ""
"Filleann líon na dtiománaithe veicteora OGR atá cláraithe faoi láthair."

msgid "OGR Geometries"
msgstr "Geoiméadrachtaí OGR"

msgid "``OGRGeometry``"
msgstr "``Geoiméadracht ``"

msgid ""
":class:`OGRGeometry` objects share similar functionality "
"with :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geos.GEOSGeometry` objects and are thin "
"wrappers around OGR's internal geometry representation. Thus, they allow for "
"more efficient access to data when using :class:`DataSource`. Unlike its "
"GEOS counterpart, :class:`OGRGeometry` supports spatial reference systems "
"and coordinate transformation:"
msgstr ""
":class: Tá feidhmiúlacht chosúil ag rudaí `ogrGeometry` le rudaí: class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.geos.geosGeometry` agus fillteáin tanaí iad timpeall "
"ionadaíocht geoiméadrachta inmheánach OGR. Dá bhrí sin, ceadaíonn siad "
"rochtain níos éifeachtaí ar shonraí nuair a úsáidtear iad: class: "
"`DataSource`. Murab ionann agus a mhacasamhail GEOS, tacaíonn :class: "
"`OGGeometry` le córais tagartha spásúla agus claochlú comhordaithe:"

msgid ""
"This object is a wrapper for the `OGR Geometry`__ class. These objects are "
"instantiated directly from the given ``geom_input`` parameter, which may be "
"a string containing WKT, HEX, GeoJSON, a ``buffer`` containing WKB data, or "
"an :class:`OGRGeomType` object. These objects are also returned from "
"the :class:`Feature.geom` attribute, when reading vector data "
"from :class:`Layer` (which is in turn a part of a :class:`DataSource`)."
msgstr ""
"Is fillteán é an réad seo don rang `Geoiméadracht OGR `__. Déantar na rudaí "
"seo a thionscnamh go díreach ón bparaiméadar ``geom_input`` a thugtar, ar "
"d'fhéadfadh a bheith ina sreang ina bhfuil WKT, HEX, GeoJSON, `maolán ``ina "
"bhfuil sonraí WKB, nó ruda:class: `ogrGeomType`. Cuirtear na rudaí seo ar "
"ais freisin ón tréith: :class: `Feature.geom`, agus sonraí veicteora á léamh "
"ó:class: `Layer` (atá ina chuid de a:class: `DataSource`)."

msgid "Constructs an :class:`OGRGeometry` from the given GML string."
msgstr "Tógann sé an:aicme: `OgGeoiméadrach` ón sreang GML tugtha."

msgid "Constructs a :class:`Polygon` from the given bounding-box (a 4-tuple)."
msgstr "Tógann a: aicme: `Polygon` ón mbosca teorainn a thugtar (4-tuple)."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of points in a :class:`LineString`, the number of rings "
"in a :class:`Polygon`, or the number of geometries in "
"a :class:`GeometryCollection`. Not applicable to other geometry types."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais líon na bpointí in a:aicme: `Linestring`, líon na bhfáinní "
"in a:aicme: `Polygon`, nó líon na ngeoiméadrachtaí in a:class: "
"`GeometryCollection`. Ní bhaineann le cineálacha geoiméadrachta eile."

msgid ""
"Iterates over the points in a :class:`LineString`, the rings in "
"a :class:`Polygon`, or the geometries in a :class:`GeometryCollection`. Not "
"applicable to other geometry types."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh thar na pointí in a: aicme: `Linestring`, na fáinní i a: aicme: "
"`Polygon`, nó na geoiméadrachtaí in a:class: `GeometryCollection`. Ní "
"bhaineann le cineálacha geoiméadrachta eile."

msgid ""
"Returns the point at the specified index for a :class:`LineString`, the "
"interior ring at the specified index for a :class:`Polygon`, or the geometry "
"at the specified index in a :class:`GeometryCollection`. Not applicable to "
"other geometry types."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an pointe ar ais ag an innéacs sonraithe le haghaidh a: aicme: "
"`LíneString`, an fáinne istigh ag an innéacs sonraithe do a:class: "
"`Polygon`, nó an geoiméadra ag an innéacs sonraithe in a:class: "
"`GeometryCollection`. Ní bhaineann le cineálacha geoiméadrachta eile."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of coordinated dimensions of the geometry, i.e. 0 for "
"points, 1 for lines, and so forth:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé líon toisí comhordaithe an ghéiméadrachta ar ais, ie 0 do phointí, "
"1 do línte, agus mar sin de:"

msgid ""
"Returns the coordinate dimension of this geometry. For example, the value "
"would be 2 for two-dimensional geometries."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé gné comhordaithe an ghéiméadracht seo. Mar shampla, bheadh an "
"luach 2 le haghaidh geoiméadraí déthoiseach."

msgid "The ``coord_dim`` setter is deprecated. Use :meth:`.set_3d` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socraithe ``coord_dim`` a dhíchur. Úsáid: Meth: `.set_3d` ina ionad."

msgid "A boolean indicating if this geometry has Z coordinates."
msgstr "Boolean a léiríonn an bhfuil comhordanáidí Z ag an gcéimseadra seo."

msgid "A method that adds or removes the Z coordinate dimension."
msgstr "Modh a chuireann nó a bhaineann an toise comhordaithe Z."

