msgstr "Boolean a léiríonn an bhfuil comhordanáidí M ag an gcéimseadra seo."

msgid "A method to add or remove the M coordinate dimension."
msgstr "Modh chun an toise comhordaithe M a chur leis nó a bhaint."

msgid "Returns the number of elements in this geometry:"
msgstr "Tugann sé líon na n-eilimintí sa geoiméadra seo ar ais:"

msgid "A boolean indicating if this geometry is or contains a curve geometry."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a linear version of the geometry. If no conversion can be made, the "
"original geometry is returned."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Returns a curved version of the geometry. If no conversion can be made, the "
"original geometry is returned."
msgstr ""

msgid "Returns the number of points used to describe this geometry:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé líon na bpointí a úsáidtear chun cur síos a dhéanamh ar an geoiméad"

msgid "Alias for :attr:`point_count`."
msgstr "Alias le haghaidh: attr: `point_count`."

msgid "Returns the type of this geometry, as an :class:`OGRGeomType` object."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an cineál céimeadra seo ar ais, mar réad: class: `ogrGeomType`."

msgid "Returns the name of the type of this geometry:"
msgstr "Tugann ainm an chineál céiméadra seo ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Returns the area of this geometry, or 0 for geometries that do not contain "
"an area:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé limistéar an geoiméadra seo ar ais, nó 0 le haghaidh geoiméadraí "
