msgid ""
"Integer representing the number of bands of the raster. A raster can be "
"created without passing band data upon creation. If the number of bands "
"isn't specified, it's automatically calculated from the length of the "
"``bands`` input. The number of bands can't be changed after creation."
msgstr ""
"Sláimhir a léiríonn líon na mbannaí den raster. Is féidir raster a chruthú "
"gan sonraí banna a chur ar aghaidh nuair a chruthaítear iad. Mura sonraítear "
"líon na mbannaí, ríomhtar é go huathoibríoch ó fhad na n-ionchur ``banda``. "
"Ní féidir líon na mbannaí a athrú tar éis a chruthú."

msgid ""
"A list of ``band_input`` dictionaries with band input data. The resulting "
"band indices are the same as in the list provided. The definition of the "
"band input dictionary is given below. If band data isn't provided, the "
"raster bands values are instantiated as an array of zeros and the \"no "
"data\" value is set to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Liosta de fhoclóirí ``band_input`` le sonraí ionchuir banna. Tá na "
"hinnéacsanna banna mar thoradh air mar an gcéanna leis an liosta a chuirtear "
"ar fáil. Tá an sainmhíniú ar an bhfoclóir ionchuir banna tugtar thíos. Mura "
"gcuirtear sonraí banna ar fáil, déantar luachanna na mbannaí raster a "
"ionchasadh mar shraith nialas agus socraítear an luach “gan aon sonraí” go "
"``None ``."

msgid ""
"A dictionary with raster creation options. The key-value pairs of the input "
"dictionary are passed to the driver on creation of the raster."
msgstr ""
"Foclóir le roghanna cruthaithe raster. Cuirtear péirí luach eochair an "
"fhoclóra ionchuir chuig an tiománaí nuair a chruthaítear an raster."

msgid ""
"The available options are driver-specific and are described in the "
"documentation of each driver."
msgstr ""
"Tá na roghanna atá ar fáil sainiúil don tiománaí agus déantar cur síos orthu "
"i ndoiciméadú gach tiománaí."

msgid ""
"The values in the dictionary are not case-sensitive and are automatically "
"converted to the correct string format upon creation."
msgstr ""
"Níl na luachanna sa fhoclóir cás-íogair agus déantar iad a thiontú go "
"huathoibríoch go formáid sreinge ceart nuair a chruthaítear iad"

msgid ""
"The following example uses some of the options available for the `GTiff "
"driver`__. The result is a compressed raster with an internal tiling scheme. "
"The internal tiles have a block size of 23 by 23:"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an sampla seo a leanas cuid de na roghanna atá ar fáil don "
"`tiománaí GTIFF `__. Is é an toradh ná raster comhbhrúite le scéim tíleála "
"inmheánach. Tá méid bloc 23 ag 23 ag na tíleanna inmheánacha:"

msgid "The ``band_input`` dictionary"
msgstr "An foclóir ``band_input``"

msgid ""
"The ``bands`` key in the ``ds_input`` dictionary is a list of ``band_input`` "
"dictionaries. Each ``band_input`` dictionary can contain pixel values and "
"the \"no data\" value to be set on the bands of the new raster. The data "
"array can have the full size of the new raster or be smaller. For arrays "
"that are smaller than the full raster, the ``size``, ``shape``, and "
"``offset`` keys  control the pixel values. The corresponding keys are passed "
"to the :meth:`~GDALBand.data` method. Their functionality is the same as "
"setting the band data with that method. The following table describes the "
"keys that can be used."
msgstr ""
"Is é an eochair ``bands`` sa fhoclóir `ds_input`` liosta de fhoclóirí "
"``band_input``. Is féidir luachanna picteilín a bheith i ngach foclóir "
"``band_input`` agus an luach “gan sonraí” atá le socrú ar bannaí an raster "
"nua. Féadfaidh méid iomlán an raster nua a bheith ag an eagar sonraí nó a "
"bheith níos lú. Maidir le eagair atá níos lú ná an raster iomlán, rialaíonn "
"na heochracha ```méid ``, `cruth``, agus ``offset`` na luachanna picteilín. "
"Cuirtear na heochracha comhfhreagracha ar aghaidh chuig an modh: meth: "
"`~Gdalband.data`. Tá a bhfeidhmiúlacht mar an gcéanna le sonraí na mbanna a "
"shocrú leis an modh sin. Déanann an tábla seo a leanas cur síos ar na "
"heochracha is féidir a úsáid."

msgid "``nodata_value``"
msgstr "``luach_nodata``"

msgid "``None``"
msgstr "```Aon cheann``"

msgid "Mapped to the :attr:`~GDALBand.nodata_value` attribute"
msgstr "Mapáilte leis an tréith: attr: `~gdalband.nodata_value`"

msgid "``data``"
msgstr "``sonraí ``"

msgid "Same as ``nodata_value`` or ``0``"
msgstr "Mar an gcéanna le ``nodata_value`` nó ``0``"

msgid "Passed to the :meth:`~GDALBand.data` method"
msgstr "Rinneadh chuig an modh: meth: `~Gdalband.data`"

msgid "``size``"
msgstr "``Méid ``"

msgid "``(with, height)`` of raster"
msgstr "``(le, airde)`` de raster"

