msgstr "``(0, 0)``"

msgid "Using GDAL's Virtual Filesystem"
msgstr "Ag baint úsáide as Córas Comhad Fíorúil GDAL"

msgid ""
"GDAL can access files stored in the filesystem, but also supports virtual "
"filesystems to abstract accessing other kind of files, such as compressed, "
"encrypted, or remote files."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le GDAL rochtain a fháil ar chomhaid atá stóráilte sa chóras "
"comhaid, ach tacaíonn sé freisin le córais chomhad fíorúla chun rochtain "
"teibí a fháil ar chineál eile comhaid, mar shampla comhaid chomhbhrúite, "
"criptithe nó iargúlta."

msgid "Using memory-based Virtual Filesystem"
msgstr "Córas Comhad Fíorúil bunaithe ar chuimhne a úsáid"

msgid ""
"GDAL has an internal memory-based filesystem, which allows treating blocks "
"of memory as files. It can be used to read and write :class:`GDALRaster` "
"objects to and from binary file buffers."
msgstr ""
"Tá córas comhaid bunaithe ar chuimhne inmheánach ag GDAL, a cheadaíonn bloic "
"cuimhne a chóireáil mar chomhaid. Is féidir é a úsáid chun rudaí: aicme: "
"`GdalRaster` a léamh agus a scríobh chuig agus ó mhaoláin comhaid dénártha."

msgid ""
"This is useful in web contexts where rasters might be obtained as a buffer "
"from a remote storage or returned from a view without being written to disk."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo úsáideach i gcomhthéacsanna gréasáin ina bhféadfaí rasters a fháil "
"mar mhaolán ó stóráil iargúlta nó a thabhairt ar ais ó radharc gan iad a "
"scríobh ar dhiosca."

msgid ""
":class:`GDALRaster` objects are created in the virtual filesystem when a "
"``bytes`` object is provided as input, or when the file path starts with ``/"
"vsimem/``."
msgstr ""
":class: Cruthaítear rudaí `GdalRaster` sa chóras comhaid fíorúil nuair a "
"chuirtear réad ``bytes`` ar fáil mar ionchur, nó nuair a thosaíonn cosán an "
"chomhaid le ``/vsimem/``."

msgid ""
"Input provided as ``bytes`` has to be a full binary representation of a "
"file. For instance:"
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh ionchur a sholáthraítear mar “bytes” a bheith ina léiriú dénártha "
"iomlán ar chomhad. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"To create a new virtual file-based raster from scratch, use the ``ds_input`` "
"dictionary representation and provide a ``name`` argument that starts with "
"``/vsimem/`` (for detail of the dictionary representation, see :ref:`gdal-"
"raster-ds-input`). For virtual file-based rasters, "
"the :attr:`~GDALRaster.vsi_buffer` attribute returns the ``bytes`` "
"representation of the raster."
msgstr ""
"Chun raster fíorúil nua atá bunaithe ar chomhad a chruthú ón tús, bain úsáid "
"as ionadaíocht foclóra `ds_input`` agus tabhair argóint ``ainm ``a thosaíonn "
"le ``/vsimem/`` (le haghaidh mionsonraithe an fhoclóra, féach:ref: `gdal-"
"raster-ds-input`). Maidir le rastróirí fíorúla comhad-bhunaithe, tugann an "
"tréith: attr: `~gdalraster.vsi_buffer` léiriú ``bytes`` an raster ar ais."

msgid ""
"Here's how to create a raster and return it as a file in "
"an :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse`:"
msgstr ""
"Seo conas raster a chruthú agus é a thabhairt ar ais mar chomhad in "
"an:class: `~django.http.httpResponse`:"

msgid "Using other Virtual Filesystems"
msgstr "Ag baint úsáide as córas comhaid fíorúla eile"

msgid ""
"Depending on the local build of GDAL other virtual filesystems may be "
"supported. You can use them by prepending the provided path with the "
"appropriate ``/vsi*/`` prefix. See the `GDAL Virtual Filesystems "
"documentation`_ for more details."
msgstr ""
"Ag brath ar thógáil áitiúil GDAL d'fhéadfaí tacú le córais chomhad fíorúla "
"eile. Is féidir leat iad a úsáid tríd an gcosán a chuirtear ar fáil "
"réamhfheidhmiú leis an réimír chuí ``/vsi*/``. Féach an doiciméadú `Córais "
"Comhad Fíorúla GDAL `_ le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid "Compressed rasters"
msgstr "Rasters comhbhrúite"

msgid ""
"Instead decompressing the file and instantiating the resulting raster, GDAL "
"can directly access compressed files using the ``/vsizip/``, ``/vsigzip/``, "
"or ``/vsitar/`` virtual filesystems:"
msgstr ""
"Ina áit sin an comhad a dhíchumasú agus an raster mar thoradh air a "
"thionscnamh, is féidir le GDAL rochtain a fháil go díreach ar chomhaid "
"chomhbhrúite ag baint úsáide as na córais comhaid fíorúla ``/vsizip/``, `/"
"vsigzip/``, nó ``/vsitar/``:"

msgid "Network rasters"
msgstr "Rosters líonra"

msgid ""
"GDAL can support online resources and storage providers transparently. As "
"long as it's built with such capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le GDAL tacú le hacmhainní ar líne agus soláthraithe stórála go "
"trédhearcach Chomh fada agus a thógtar é le cumais den sórt sin."

msgid ""
"To access a public raster file with no authentication, you can use ``/"
"vsicurl/``:"
msgstr ""
"Chun rochtain a fháil ar chomhad raster poiblí gan aon fhíordheimhniú, is "
"féidir leat ``/vsicurl/`` a úsáid:"

msgid ""
"For commercial storage providers (e.g. ``/vsis3/``) the system should be "
"previously configured for authentication and possibly other settings (see "
"the `GDAL Virtual Filesystems documentation`_ for available options)."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le soláthraithe stórála tráchtála (m.sh. ``/vsis3/``) ba chóir an "
"córas a chumrú roimhe seo le haghaidh fíordheimhnithe agus socruithe eile "
"b'fhéidir (féach doiciméadú `GDAL Virtual Filesystems `_ le haghaidh na "
"roghanna atá ar fáil)."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Socruithe"

msgid "``GDAL_LIBRARY_PATH``"
msgstr "``BÓTHAIR_LEABHARLANNA_GDAL``"

msgid ""
"A string specifying the location of the GDAL library.  Typically, this "
"setting is only used if the GDAL library is in a non-standard location "
"(e.g., ``/home/john/lib/libgdal.so``)."
msgstr ""
"Sreang a shonraíonn suíomh leabharlann GDAL. De ghnáth, ní úsáidtear an "
"socrú seo ach amháin má tá leabharlann GDAL in áit neamhchaighdeánach "
"(m.sh., ``/home/john/lib/libgdal.so ``)."

msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Eisceachtaí"

msgid "The base GDAL exception, indicating a GDAL-related error."
msgstr "An buneisceacht GDAL, ag léiriú earráid a bhaineann le GDAL."

msgid ""
"An exception raised when an error occurs when constructing or using a "
"spatial reference system object."
msgstr ""
"Eisceacht a ardaítear nuair a tharlaíonn earráid agus réad córais tagartha "
"spásúil á thógáil nó ag úsáid."

msgid "Geolocation with GeoIP2"
msgstr "Geolocation le GeoIP2"

msgid ""
"The :class:`GeoIP2` object is a wrapper for the :pypi:`MaxMind geoip2 Python "
"library <geoip2>`. [#]_"
msgstr ""
"<geoip2>Is fillteán é an réad: Class: `GeoIP2` don leabharlann: pypi: "
"`MaxMind geoip2 Python`. [#] _"

msgid ""
"In order to perform IP-based geolocation, the :class:`GeoIP2` object "
"requires the :pypi:`geoip2` Python package and the GeoIP ``Country`` and/or "
"``City`` datasets in binary format (the CSV files will not work!), "
"downloaded from e.g. `MaxMind`__ or `DB-IP`__ websites. Grab the ``GeoLite2-"
"Country.mmdb.gz`` and ``GeoLite2-City.mmdb.gz`` files and unzip them in a "
"directory corresponding to the :setting:`GEOIP_PATH` setting."
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn geolocation bunaithe ar IP a dhéanamh, teastaíonn an réad:class: "
"`GeoIP2` an pacáiste Python:pypi: `geoip2` agus tacair sonraí GeoIP "
"``Country ``agus/nó ``Cathra` i bhformáid dénártha (ní oibreoidh na comhaid "
"CSV!) , íoslódáilte ó shuíomhanna gréasáin `MaxMind`__ nó `DB-IP`__. Faigh "
"na comhaid ``Geolite2-Country.mmdb.gz`` agus ``Geolite2-City.MMDB.GZ`` agus "
"dí-zip iad i eolaire a fhreagraíonn don socrú: `GEOIP_PATH`."

msgid ""
"Additionally, it is recommended to install the `libmaxminddb C library`__, "
"so that ``geoip2`` can leverage the C library's faster speed."
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, moltar leabharlann `libmaxminddb C `__ a shuiteáil, ionas "
"gur féidir le ``geoip2` luas níos tapúla leabharlann C a ghiaráil."

msgid "Here is an example of its usage:"
msgstr "Seo sampla dá úsáid:"

msgid ""
"The ``GeoIP`` object does not require any parameters to use the default "
"settings. However, at the very least the :setting:`GEOIP_PATH` setting "
"should be set with the path of the location of your GeoIP datasets. The "
"following initialization keywords may be used to customize any of the "
"defaults."
msgstr ""
"Ní éilíonn aon pharaiméadair ar an réad ``Geoip`` chun na socruithe "
"réamhshocraithe a úsáid. Mar sin féin, ar a laghad ba cheart an socrú: "
"setting: `GEOIP_PATH` a shocrú le cosán suíomh do thacair sonraí GeoIP. Is "
"féidir na heochairfhocail tionscnaíochta seo a leanas a úsáid chun aon "
"cheann de na réamhshocruithe a shaincheapadh."

msgid "Keyword Arguments"
msgstr "Argóintí Eochair"

msgid "``path``"
msgstr "``Conair``"

msgid ""
"Base directory to where GeoIP data is located or the full path to where the "
"city or country data files (``.mmdb``) are located. Assumes that both the "
"city and country datasets are located in this directory; overrides "
"the :setting:`GEOIP_PATH` setting."
msgstr ""
"Buneolaire chuig an áit a bhfuil sonraí GeoIP suite nó an cosán iomlán chuig "
"an áit a bhfuil comhaid sonraí na cathrach nó na tíre (`.mmdb``) suite. "
"Glacann sé leis go bhfuil tacair shonraí na cathrach agus na tíre araon "
"suite san eolaire seo; sáraíonn sé an socrú:setting: `GEOIP_PATH`."

msgid "``cache``"
msgstr "``Cache ``"

msgid ""
"The cache settings when opening up the GeoIP datasets. May be an integer in "
"(0, 1, 2, 4, 8) corresponding to the ``MODE_AUTO``, ``MODE_MMAP_EXT``, "
"``MODE_MMAP``, and ``GEOIP_INDEX_CACHE`` ``MODE_MEMORY`` C API settings, "
"respectively. Defaults to 0 (``MODE_AUTO``)."
msgstr ""
"Na socruithe taisce agus na tacair sonraí GeoIP á oscailt suas. D'fhéadfadh "
"sé a bheith ina shláimhir i (0, 1, 2, 4, 8) a fhreagraíonn do na socruithe "
"API ``MODE_AUTO``, `MODE_MMAP_EXT``, `MODE_MMAP``, agus ``GEOIP_INDEX_CACHE "
"```MODE_MEMORY`` C API, faoi seach. Réamhshocraithe go 0 (``MODE_AUTO``)."

msgid "``country``"
msgstr "```tír``"

msgid ""
"The name of the GeoIP country data file. Defaults to ``GeoLite2-"
"Country.mmdb``. Setting this keyword overrides the :setting:`GEOIP_COUNTRY` "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an chomhad sonraí tíre GeoIP. Réamhshocraithe go ``Geolite2-"
"Country.mmdb``. Cuireann an eochairfhocal seo a shocrú ar an socrú:setting: "
"`GEOIP_COUNTRY`."

msgid "``city``"
msgstr "``Cathair``"

msgid ""
"The name of the GeoIP city data file. Defaults to ``GeoLite2-City.mmdb``. "
"Setting this keyword overrides the :setting:`GEOIP_CITY` setting."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an chomhad sonraí cathrach GeoIP. Réamhshocraithe go ``Geolite2-"
"City.mmdb``. Cuireann an eochairfhocal seo a shocrú ar an socrú: socrú: "
"`GEOIP_CITY`."

msgid "Instantiating"
msgstr "Ag teacht ar aghaidh"

msgid ""
"This classmethod instantiates the GeoIP object from the given database path "
"and given cache setting."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an modh ranga seo an réad GeoIP ón gcosán bunachar sonraí tugtha "
"agus socrú taisce tugtha."

msgid "Use the :class:`GeoIP2()` constructor instead."
msgstr "Úsáid an tógálaí: class: `GeoIP2 () `ina ionad."

msgid "Querying"
msgstr "Ag fiosrú"

msgid ""
"All the following querying routines may take an instance "
"of :class:`~ipaddress.IPv4Address` or :class:`~ipaddress.IPv6Address`, a "
"string IP address, or a fully qualified domain name (FQDN). For example, "
"``IPv4Address(\"205.186.163.125\")``, ``\"205.186.163.125\"``, and "
"``\"djangoproject.com\"`` would all be valid query parameters."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh na gnáthaimh fiosrúcháin seo a leanas a bheith mar shampla "
"de:class: `~iPaddress.ipv4Address` nó:class: `~iPaddress.ipv6Address`, "
"seoladh IP teaghrán, nó ainm fearainn láncháilithe (FQDN). Mar shampla, "
"“IPV4Address (“205.186.163.125\") ``, ``\"205.186.163.125\"``, agus "
"``\"djangoproject.com\"`` a bheadh paraiméadair bhailí fiosrúcháin."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of city information for the given query. Some of the "
"values in the dictionary may be undefined (``None``)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann foclóir faisnéise cathrach ar ais don cheist a thugtar. D'fhéadfadh "
"go mbeadh cuid de na luachanna sa fhoclóir neamhshainithe (``None ``)."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary with the country code and country for the given query."
msgstr ""
"Tugann foclóir ar ais leis an gcód tíre agus an tír don cheist a thugtar."

msgid "Returns the country code corresponding to the query."
msgstr "Tugann an cód tíre a fhreagraíonn don cheist ar ais."

msgid "Returns the country name corresponding to the query."
msgstr "Tugann ainm na tíre a fhreagraíonn don cheist ar ais."

msgid "Coordinate Retrieval"
msgstr "Comhordú Aisghabháil"

msgid "Returns a coordinate tuple of (longitude, latitude)."
msgstr "Tuipéar comhordaithe de (domhanfhad, domhanleithead) ar ais."

msgid "Use :meth:`.GeoIP2.lon_lat` instead."
msgstr "Úsáid: Meth: `.geoip2.lon_lat` ina ionad."

msgid "Returns a coordinate tuple of (latitude, longitude),"
msgstr "Tuipéar comhordaithe de (domhanleithead, domhanfhad) ar ais,"

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geos.Point` object corresponding to "
"the query."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.geos.point` réad a fhreagraíonn "
"don cheist."

msgid "``GEOIP_PATH``"
msgstr "``GEOIP_PATH``"

msgid ""
"A string or :class:`pathlib.Path` specifying the directory where the GeoIP "
"data files are located. This setting is *required* unless manually specified "
"with ``path`` keyword when initializing the :class:`GeoIP2` object."
msgstr ""
"Teagán nó:class: `PathLib.path` a shonraíonn an eolaire ina bhfuil na "
"comhaid sonraí GeoIP suite. Tá an socrú seo *riachtanáil* mura sonraítear de "
"láimh le heochairfhocal ``path`` nuair a thosaíonn an réad: class: `GeoIP2`."

msgid "``GEOIP_COUNTRY``"
msgstr "``TÍR_GEOIP``"

msgid ""
"The basename to use for the GeoIP country data file. Defaults to ``'GeoLite2-"
"Country.mmdb'``."
msgstr ""
"An bunainm le húsáid don chomhad sonraí tíre GeoIP. Réamhshocraithe go "
"```'Geolite2-Country.mmdb'``."

msgid "``GEOIP_CITY``"
msgstr "``GEOIP_CATH``"

msgid ""
"The basename to use for the GeoIP city data file. Defaults to ``'GeoLite2-"
"City.mmdb'``."
msgstr ""
"An bunainm le húsáid le haghaidh comhad sonraí cathrach GeoIP. "
"Réamhshocraithe go ```'Geolite2-City.mmdb'``."

msgid ""
"The exception raised when an error occurs in the :class:`GeoIP2` wrapper. "
"Exceptions from the underlying ``geoip2`` library are passed through "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ardaíodh an eisceacht nuair a tharlaíonn earráid sa bhfillteán: aicme: "
"`GeoIP2`. Cuirtear eisceachtaí ón leabharlann bunúsach `geoip2` tríd gan "
"athrú."

msgid "GeoIP(R) is a registered trademark of MaxMind, Inc."
msgstr "Is trádmharc cláraithe de MaxMind, Inc. é GeoIP (R)."

msgid "GIS QuerySet API Reference"
msgstr "Tagairt API GIS QuerySet"

msgid ""
"The spatial lookups in this section are available for :class:`GeometryField` "
"and :class:`RasterField`."
msgstr ""
"Tá na cuardaigh spásúla sa chuid seo ar fáil le haghaidh: aicme: "
"`GeometryField` agus:class: `Rasterfield`."

msgid ""
"For an introduction, see the :ref:`spatial lookups introduction <spatial-"
"lookups-intro>`.  For an overview of what lookups are compatible with a "
"particular spatial backend, refer to the :ref:`spatial lookup compatibility "
"table <spatial-lookup-compatibility>`."
msgstr ""
"<spatial-lookups-intro>Le haghaidh réamhrá, féach an:ref: `réamhrá cuardaigh "
"spásúla `. <spatial-lookup-compatibility>Chun forbhreathnú a fháil ar na "
"cuardaigh atá comhoiriúnach le cúltaca spásúil áirithe, féach faoir:ref: "
"`tábla comhoiriúnachta cuardaigh spásúil `."

msgid "Lookups with rasters"
msgstr "Cuardaigh le rasters"

msgid ""
"All examples in the reference below are given for geometry fields and "
"inputs, but the lookups can be used the same way with rasters on both sides. "
"Whenever a lookup doesn't support raster input, the input is automatically "
"converted to a geometry where necessary using the `ST_Polygon <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/RT_ST_Polygon.html>`_ function. See also "
"the :ref:`introduction to raster lookups <spatial-lookup-raster>`."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar na samplaí go léir sa tagairt thíos do réimsí geoiméadrachta agus "
"ionchuir, ach is féidir na cuardaigh a úsáid ar an mbealach céanna le "
"rasters ar an dá thaobh. < https://postgis.net/docs/RT_ST_Polygon.html>Aon "
"uair nach dtacaíonn cuardach le hionchur raster, déantar an t-ionchur a "
"thiontú go géiméadracht go huathoibríoch nuair is gá ag baint úsáide as an "
"bhfeidhm `ST_Polygon`_. <spatial-lookup-raster>Féach freis:ref: `réamhrá ar "
"chuardach raster `."

msgid ""
"The database operators used by the lookups can be divided into three "
"categories:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir na hoibreoirí bunachar sonraí a úsáideann na cuardaigh a roinnt "
"ina thrí chatagóir:"

msgid ""
"Native raster support ``N``: the operator accepts rasters natively on both "
"sides of the lookup, and raster input can be mixed with geometry inputs."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht raster dúchasach ``N``: glacann an t-oibreoir le rastrí go "
"dúchasach ar an dá thaobh den chuardach, agus is féidir ionchur raster a "
"mheascadh le hionchuir geoiméadrachta."

msgid ""
"Bilateral raster support ``B``: the operator supports rasters only if both "
"sides of the lookup receive raster inputs. Raster data is automatically "
"converted to geometries for mixed lookups."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht raster déthaobhach ``B``: ní thacaíonn an t-oibreoir le rasters "
"ach amháin má fhaigheann an dá thaobh den chuardach ionchuir raster. Déantar "
"sonraí raster a thiontú go huathoibríoch go geoiméadraí le haghaidh "
"cuardaigh measctha"

msgid ""
"Geometry conversion support ``C``. The lookup does not have native raster "
"support, all raster data is automatically converted to geometries."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíocht tiontaithe geoiméadais ``C``. Níl tacaíocht raster dúchasach ag an "
"lorg, déantar na sonraí raster go léir a thiontú go geoiméadraí go "
"huathoibríoch."

msgid ""
"The examples below show the SQL equivalent for the lookups in the different "
