msgid ""
"On these spatial backends the intersection pattern is a string comprising "
"nine characters, which  define intersections between  the interior, "
"boundary, and exterior of the geometry field and the lookup geometry. The "
"intersection pattern matrix may only use the following characters: ``1``, "
"``2``, ``T``, ``F``, or ``*``.  This lookup type allows users to \"fine "
"tune\" a specific geometric relationship consistent with the DE-9IM model. "
"[#fnde9im]_"
msgstr ""
"Ar na cúltaca spásúla seo is teaghrán é an patrún trasna ina bhfuil naoi "
"charachtar, a shainmhíníonn trasnáithe idir taobh istigh, teorainn agus "
"taobh amuigh den réimse geoiméadrach agus an geoiméadracht cuardaigh. Ní "
"féidir leis an maitrís phatrún trasna ach na carachtair seo a leanas a "
"úsáid: ``1``, ``2``, `T``, `F``, nó ``*``. Ligeann an cineál cuardaigh seo "
"d'úsáideoirí caidreamh geoiméadrach ar leith a “tiúnadh go mín” atá "
"comhsheasmhach leis an tsamhail DE-9IM. [#fnde9im] _"

