msgid ""
"For an overview on performing distance queries, please refer to "
"the :ref:`distance queries introduction <distance-queries>`."
msgstr ""
"<distance-queries>Le haghaidh forbhreathnú ar cheisteanna achair a dhéanamh, "
"féach le do thoil faoir:ref: `réamhrá ceisteanna achair `."

msgid "Distance lookups take the following form:"
msgstr "Tá an fhoirm seo a leanas ag cuardach achair:"

msgid ""
"The value passed into a distance lookup is a tuple; the first two values are "
"mandatory, and are the geometry to calculate distances to, and a distance "
"value (either a number in units of the field, "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.measure.Distance` object, or a :doc:`query "
"expression </ref/models/expressions>`). To pass a band index to the lookup, "
"use a 3-tuple where the second entry is the band index."
msgstr ""
"Is é an luach a chuirtear isteach i gcuardach achair; tá an chéad dá luach "
"éigeantach, agus is iad an geoiméadra chun achair a ríomh, agus luach achair "
"(uimhir in aonaid den réimse, a: aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.Measure.distance` réad, nó a:doc: `</ref/models/"
"expressions> léiriú fiosraithe'). Chun innéacs banna a chur chuig an lorg, "
"bain úsáid as 3-tuple ina bhfuil an dara iontráil an t-innéacs banna."

msgid ""
"On every distance lookup except :lookup:`dwithin`, an optional element, "
"``'spheroid'``, may be included to use the more accurate spheroid distance "
"calculation functions on fields with a geodetic coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Ar gach cuardach achair ach amháin: lookup: `dwithin`, féadfar eilimint "
"roghnach, ``spheroid``, a chur san áireamh chun na feidhmeanna ríofa achair "
"spheroid níos cruinne a úsáid ar réimsí le córas comhordaithe geodéiseach."

msgid ""
"On PostgreSQL, the ``'spheroid'`` option uses `ST_DistanceSpheroid <https://"
"postgis.net/docs/ST_Distance_Spheroid.html>`__ instead of `ST_DistanceSphere "
"<https://postgis.net/docs/ST_DistanceSphere.html>`__. The simpler "
"`ST_Distance <https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Distance.html>`__ function is used "
"with projected coordinate systems. Rasters are converted to geometries for "
"spheroid based lookups."
msgstr ""
"< https://postgis.net/docs/ST_Distance_Spheroid.html> < https://postgis.net/"
"docs/ST_DistanceSphere.html>Ar PostgreSQL, úsáideann an rogha ``'spheroid'`` "
"`ST_distanceSpheroid`__ in ionad `ST_distanceSphere`__. Úsáidtear an fheidhm "
"`ST_distance`__ níos simplí le córais chomhordaithe ré< https://postgis.net/"
"docs/ST_Distance.html> amh-mheasta. Déantar rasters a thiontú go geoiméadraí "
"le haghaidh cuardaigh bunaithe ar spheroid."

