msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh míniú ar an ngnáthamh seo, léigh “Quirks of the “Contains” "
"Spásúil Predicate`_ le < https://lin-ear-th-inking.blogspot.com/2007/06/"
"subtleties-of-ogc-covers-spatial.html> Martin Davis (forbróir PostGIS)."

msgid "GEOS API"
msgstr "GEOS API"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "Cúlra"

msgid "What is GEOS?"
msgstr "Cad é GEOS?"

msgid ""
"`GEOS`__ stands for **Geometry Engine - Open Source**, and is a C++ library, "
"ported from the  `Java Topology Suite`__.  GEOS implements the OpenGIS "
"`Simple Features for SQL`__ spatial predicate functions and spatial "
"operators. GEOS, now an OSGeo project, was initially developed and "
"maintained by `Refractions Research`__ of Victoria, Canada."
msgstr ""
"Seasann `GEOS`__ d'**Inneall Geoimseachta - Foinse Oscailte**, agus is "
"leabharlann C ++ é, a iompraítear ón `Java Topology Suite `__. Cuireann GEOS "
"na Gnéithe Simplí OpenGIS i bhfeidhm d'fheidhmeanna réamhchúiseacha spásúla "
"SQL`__ agus oibreoirí spásúla. D'fhorbair agus cothabháil ar dtús GEOS, "
"tionscadal OSGeo anois, ag `Refractions Research`__ de Victoria, Ceanada."

msgid "Features"
msgstr "Gnéithe"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango implements a high-level Python wrapper for the GEOS library, its "
"features include:"
msgstr ""
"Cuireann GeodJango fillteán Python ardleibhéil i bhfeidhm don leabharlann "
"GEOS, tá a ghnéithe tá:"

msgid ""
"A BSD-licensed interface to the GEOS geometry routines, implemented purely "
"in Python using ``ctypes``."
msgstr ""
"Comhéadan ceadúnaithe BSD le gnáthaimh geoiméadachta GEOS, a chuirtear i "
"bhfeidhm i Python amháin ag baint úsáide as `ctype``."

msgid ""
"Loosely-coupled to GeoDjango.  For example, :class:`GEOSGeometry` objects "
"may be used outside of a Django project/application.  In other words, no "
"need to have :envvar:`DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE` set or use a database, etc."
msgstr ""
"Cúpláilte go scaoilte le GeodJango. Mar shampla, is féidir rudaí: class: "
"`GeosGeometry` a úsáid lasmuigh de thionscadal/feidhmchlár Django. Is é sin "
"le rá, ní gá: envvar: `DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE` bunachar sonraí a shocrú nó a "
"úsáid, srl."

msgid "Mutability: :class:`GEOSGeometry` objects may be modified."
msgstr "Is féidir athraitheacht: :class: rudaí `Geosgeometry` a mhodhnú."

msgid "Cross-platform tested."
msgstr ""

