msgid "My logs are filled with GEOS-related errors"
msgstr "Líontar mo logaí le hearráidí a bhaineann le Geos"

msgid ""
"You find many ``TypeError`` or ``AttributeError`` exceptions filling your "
"web server's log files. This generally means that you are creating GEOS "
"objects at the top level of some of your Python modules. Then, due to a race "
"condition in the garbage collector, your module is garbage collected before "
"the GEOS object. To prevent this, create :class:`GEOSGeometry` objects "
"inside the local scope of your functions/methods."
msgstr ""
"Faigheann tú go leor eisceachtaí ``TypeError`` nó ``AttributeError`` ag "
"líonadh comhaid log do fhreastalaí gréasáin. Ciallaíonn sé seo go ginearálta "
"go bhfuil tú ag cruthú rudaí GEOS ag barrleibhéal cuid de do mhodúil Python. "
"Ansin, mar gheall ar riocht rása sa bhailitheoir truflais, bailítear do "
"mhodúl truflais roimh réad GEOS. Chun é seo a chosc, cruthaigh rudaí:class: "
"`GeosGeometry` taobh istigh de raon feidhme áitiúil do fheidhmeanna/modhanna."

