msgid "Output Properties"
msgstr "Airíonna Aschuir"

msgid ""
"The properties in this section export the :class:`GEOSGeometry` object into "
"a different.  This output may be in the form of a string, buffer, or even "
"another object."
msgstr ""
"Easpórtáil na hairíonna sa chuid seo an réad: aicme: `GeosGeometry` isteach "
"i gceann difriúil. D'fhéadfadh an t-aschur seo a bheith i bhfoirm sreang, "
"maolán, nó fiú réad eile."

msgid ""
"Returns the \"extended\" Well-Known Text of the geometry.  This "
"representation is specific to PostGIS and is a superset of the OGC WKT "
"standard. [#fnogc]_ Essentially the SRID is prepended to the WKT "
"representation, for example ``SRID=4326;POINT(5 23)``."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an Téacs Aitheanta “leathnaithe” den ghéiméadracht. Tá an t-"
"ionadaíocht seo go sonrach do PostGIS agus is superset é de chaighdeán OGC "
"WKT. [#fnogc] _ Go bunúsach tá an SRID réamhdhéanta don ionadaíocht WKT, mar "
"shampla ``SRID=4326; POINT (5 23) ``."

msgid ""
"The output from this property does not include the 3dm, 3dz, and 4d "
"information that PostGIS supports in its EWKT representations."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuimsíonn an t-aschur ón maoin seo an fhaisnéis 3dm, 3dz, agus 4d a "
"dtacaíonn PostGIS ina ionadaíochtaí EWKT."

msgid ""
"Returns the WKB of this Geometry in hexadecimal form.  Please note that the "
"SRID value is not included in this representation because it is not a part "
"of the OGC specification (use the :attr:`GEOSGeometry.hexewkb` property "
"instead)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé WKB an Céiméadracht seo ar ais i bhfoirm heicseachadach. Tabhair "
"faoi deara le do thoil nach bhfuil an luach SRID san áireamh sa léiriú seo "
"toisc nach cuid de shonraíocht OGC é (bain úsáid as maoin: attr: "
"`Geosgeometry.hexewKB` ina ionad sin)."

msgid ""
"Returns the EWKB of this Geometry in hexadecimal form.  This is an extension "
"of the WKB specification that includes the SRID value that are a part of "
"this geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tugann EWKB an Cóiméadracht seo ar ais i bhfoirm heicseachadach. Is síneadh "
"é seo ar shonraíocht WKB a chuimsíonn luach SRID atá mar chuid den "
"ghéiméadracht seo."

msgid ""
"Returns the GeoJSON representation of the geometry. Note that the result is "
"not a complete GeoJSON structure but only the ``geometry`` key content of a "
"GeoJSON structure. See also :doc:`/ref/contrib/gis/serializers`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ionadaíocht GeoJSON ar an geoiméadra ar ais. Tabhair faoi deara nach "
"struchtúr iomlán GeoJSON é an toradh ach ach príomhábhar “geoiméadracht” de "
"struchtúr GeoJSON amháin. Féach freis:doc: `/ref/contrib/gis/serializers`."

msgid "Alias for :attr:`GEOSGeometry.json`."
msgstr "Alias le haghaidh: attr: `GeosGeometry.JSON`."

msgid ""
"Returns a `KML`__ (Keyhole Markup Language) representation of the geometry.  "
"This should only be used for geometries with an SRID of 4326 (WGS84), but "
"this restriction is not enforced."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé léiriú `KML`__ (Keyhole Markup Teanga) ar an geoiméadracht. Níor "
"cheart é seo a úsáid ach le haghaidh geoiméadraí le SRID de 4326 (WGS84), "
"ach ní chuirtear an srian seo i bhfeidhm."

msgid ""
"Returns an :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.OGRGeometry` object "
"corresponding to the GEOS geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.ogrGeometry` réad a "
"fhreagraíonn don geoiméadacht GEOS."

msgid ""
"Returns the WKB (Well-Known Binary) representation of this Geometry as a "
"Python buffer.  SRID value is not included, use "
"the :attr:`GEOSGeometry.ewkb` property instead."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ionadaíocht WKB (Dénártha Aitheanta) ar an gCoiméadra seo ar ais "
"mar mhaolán Python. Níl luach SRID san áireamh, bain úsáid as an maoin: "
"attr: `Geosgeometry.ewkb` ina ionad."

msgid ""
"Return the EWKB representation of this Geometry as a Python buffer. This is "
"an extension of the WKB specification that includes any SRID value that are "
"a part of this geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair ar ais ionadaíocht EWKB an Céiméadracht seo mar mhaolán Python. Is "
"síneadh é seo ar shonraíocht WKB a chuimsíonn aon luach SRID atá mar chuid "
"den ghéiméadracht seo."

msgid "Returns the Well-Known Text of the geometry (an OGC standard)."
msgstr "Tugann sé an Téacs Aitheanta den ghéiméadracht (caighdeán OGC) ar ais."

msgid "Spatial Predicate Methods"
msgstr "Modhanna Predicate Spásúla"

msgid ""
"All of the following spatial predicate methods take "
"another :class:`GEOSGeometry` instance (``other``) as a parameter, and "
"return a boolean."
msgstr ""
"Glacann gach ceann de na modhanna réamhdhéanta spásúla seo a leanas eile: "
"class: `Geosgeometry` (``eile ``) mar pharaiméadar, agus cuireann sé boolean "
"ar ais."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if :meth:`other.within(this) <GEOSGeometry.within>` returns "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"<GEOSGeometry.within>Tuairisceann ``True`` ife:meth: `other.within (this) "
"`filleann ``True``."

msgid "Returns ``True`` if this geometry covers the specified geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` má chlúdaíonn an geoiméadacht seo an geoiméadra "
"sonraithe."

msgid "The ``covers`` predicate has the following equivalent definitions:"
msgstr ""
"Tá na sainmhínithe coibhéiseach seo a leanas ag an réamhchúiseach "
"``clúdaithe``"

msgid "Every point of the other geometry is a point of this geometry."
msgstr "Is pointe den ghéiméadracht seo é gach pointe den ghéimseadracht eile."

msgid ""
"The `DE-9IM`_ Intersection Matrix for the two geometries is ``T*****FF*``, "
"``*T****FF*``, ``***T**FF*``, or ``****T*FF*``."
msgstr ""
"Is é `T*****FF*``, ``*T****FF*``, ``***T**FF*``, ``***T**FF*``, "
"`***T**FF*``, nó ``****T*FF*``."

msgid "If either geometry is empty, returns ``False``."
msgstr "Má tá ceachtar geoiméadair folamh, filleann sé ``False``."

msgid ""
"This predicate is similar to :meth:`GEOSGeometry.contains`, but is more "
"inclusive (i.e. returns ``True`` for more cases). In particular, "
"unlike :meth:`~GEOSGeometry.contains` it does not distinguish between points "
"in the boundary and in the interior of geometries. For most situations, "
"``covers()`` should be preferred to :meth:`~GEOSGeometry.contains`. As an "
"added benefit, ``covers()`` is more amenable to optimization and hence "
"should outperform :meth:`~GEOSGeometry.contains`."
msgstr ""
"Tá an predicate seo cosúil le:meth: `Geosgeometry.contains`, ach tá sé níos "
"cuimsitheach (ie tuairisceann ``True`` le haghaidh tuilleadh cásanna). Go "
"háirithe, nach cosúil:meth: `~ Geosgeometry.Contains` ní dhéanann sé "
"idirdhealú idir pointí sa teorainn agus ar an taobh istigh de na "
"geoiméadraí. Maidir le formhór na gcásanna, ba chóir go mbeadh `clúdaigh () "
"``níos fearr ná: meth: `~ Geosgeometry.contains`. Mar shochar breise, tá "
"``clúdaigh () ``níos inúsáidte le barrfheabhsú agus dá bhrí sin ba chóir go "
"mbeadh feidhm níos faide ná: meth: `~Geosgeometry.contains`."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two Geometries is "
"``T*T******`` (for a point and a curve,a point and an area or a line and an "
"area) ``0********`` (for two curves)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é `T*T******`` an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don dá "
"Geoiméadair ``(le haghaidh pointe agus cuar, pointe agus limistéar nó líne "
"agus limistéar) ``0********`` (le haghaidh dhá chuar)."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two geometries is "
"``FF*FF****``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é `FF*FF****`` an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don dá "
"ghéiméadracht."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two geometries is "
"``T*F**FFF*``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é `T* F**FFF*`` an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don "
"dá ghéiméadracht."

msgid ""
"Returns true if the two geometries are exactly equal, up to a specified "
"tolerance.  The ``tolerance`` value should be a floating point number "
"representing the error tolerance in the comparison, e.g., "
"``poly1.equals_exact(poly2, 0.001)`` will compare equality to within one "
"thousandth of a unit."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé fíor má tá an dá ghéiméadracht cothrom go díreach, suas le "
"lamháltas sonraithe. Ba chóir go mbeadh an luach “lamháltais” ina uimhir "
"phointe snámh a léiríonn an lamháltas earráide sa chomparáid, m.sh., "
"déanfaidh `poly1.equals_correct (poly2, 0.001) `comparáid idir comhionannas "
"le laistigh de na mílte aonad."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the two geometries are point-wise equivalent by checking "
"that the structure, ordering, and values of all vertices are identical in "
"all dimensions. ``NaN`` values are considered to be equal to other ``NaN`` "
"values. Requires GEOS 3.12."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé “Fíor” ar ais má tá an dá ghéiméadracht coibhéiseach pointe trí "
"sheiceáil go bhfuil struchtúr, ordú agus luachanna gach beart comhionann i "
"ngach toise. Meastar go bhfuil luachanna ``Nan`` comhionann le luachanna "
"``Nan`` eile. Éilíonn GEOS 3.12."

msgid "Returns ``True`` if :meth:`GEOSGeometry.disjoint` is ``False``."
msgstr "Tuairisceann ``True`` ife:meth: `Geosgeometry.disjoint` ``False``."

msgid ""
"Returns true if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two geometries is "
"``T*T***T**`` (for two points or two surfaces) ``1*T***T**`` (for two "
"curves)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé fíor más é an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don dá ghéiméadracht "
"``T*T***T**`` (le haghaidh dhá phointe nó dhá dhromchla) ``1* T***T**`` (le "
"haghaidh dhá chuar)."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the elements in the DE-9IM intersection matrix for this "
"geometry and the other matches the given ``pattern`` -- a string of nine "
"characters from the alphabet: {``T``, ``F``, ``*``, ``0``}."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ``True`` ar ais má mheaitríonn na heilimintí i maitrís trasna DE-9IM "
"don ghéiméadracht seo agus an ceann eile leis an ``patrún ``a thugtar -- "
"sreang de naoi charachtar ón aibítir: {``T``, `F``, `*``, `0``}."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two geometries is "
"``FT*******``, ``F**T*****`` or ``F***T****``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é `FT*******``, `F**T*****`` nó ``F***T****`` "
"nó ``F***T****`` an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don dá ghéiméadracht."

msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if the DE-9IM intersection matrix for the two geometries is "
"``T*F**F***``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais ``True`` más é `T*F**F***`` an maitrís trasna DE-9IM don dá "
"ghéiméadracht ``T*F**F***``."

msgid "Topological Methods"
msgstr "Modhanna Topolaíocha"

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` that represents all points whose distance "
"from this geometry is less than or equal to the given ``width``. The "
"optional ``quadsegs`` keyword sets the number of segments used to "
"approximate a quarter circle (defaults is 8)."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a:aicme: `Geosgeoiméadr` a léiríonn gach pointe a bhfuil a n-"
"achar ón gcéiméadra seo níos lú ná nó cothrom leis an `leithead` a thugtar. "
"Socraíonn an eochairfhocal roghnach `quadsegs' líon na ndeighleoga a "
"úsáidtear chun ceathrú ciorcal a mheas (is é 8 na réamhshocraithe)."

msgid "Same as :meth:`buffer`, but allows customizing the style of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna le: meth: `maolán `, ach ceadaíonn sé stíl an maoláin a "
"shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"``end_cap_style`` can be round (``1``), flat (``2``), or square (``3``)."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le ``end_cap_style`` a bheith cruinn (``1``), cothrom (``2``), nó "
"cearnach (``3``)."

msgid "``join_style`` can be round (``1``), mitre (``2``), or bevel (``3``)."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le ``join_style`` a bheith cruinn (``1``), mitre (``2``), nó bevel "
"(``3``)."

msgid "Mitre ratio limit (``mitre_limit``) only affects mitered join style."
msgstr ""
"Níl i bhfeidhm ach ar an teorainn cóimheas mitre (`mitre_limit``) ar stíl "
"comhcheangail mitre."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` representing the points making up this "
"geometry that do not make up other."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: `GeosGeometry` a léiríonn na pointí a chuimsíonn an "
"geoiméadracht seo nach ndéanann suas eile."

msgid ""
"Given a distance (float), returns the point (or closest point) within the "
"geometry (:class:`LineString` or :class:`MultiLineString`) at that distance. "
"The normalized version takes the distance as a float between 0 (origin) and "
"1 (endpoint)."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar achar (snámhphointe), filleann sé an pointe (nó an pointe is "
"gaire) laistigh den ghéiméadracht (:class: `Linestring` nó:class: "
"`MultilineString`) ag an achar sin. Tógann an leagan normalaithe an fad mar "
"snámhphointe idir 0 (tionscnamh) agus 1 (críochphointe)."

msgid "Reverse of :meth:`GEOSGeometry.project`."
msgstr "Iomsaigh de:meth: `Geosgeometry.Project`."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` representing the points shared by this "
"geometry and other."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: `GeosGeometry` a léiríonn na pointí atá roinnte ag an "
"geoiméadacht seo agus eile."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance (float) from the origin of the geometry "
"(:class:`LineString` or :class:`MultiLineString`) to the point projected on "
"the geometry (that is to a point of the line the closest to the given "
"point). The normalized version returns the distance as a float between 0 "
"(origin) and 1 (endpoint)."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an fad (snámhphointe) ó bhunús an ghéiméadrachta (:class: "
"`Linestring` nó:class: `MultilineString`) go dtí an pointe a réamhaítear ar "
"an geoiméadra (is é sin go pointe den líne is gaire don phointe ar leith). "
"Tugann an leagan normalaithe an fad ar ais mar snámhphointe idir 0 "
"(tionscnamh) agus 1 (críochphointe)."

msgid "Reverse of :meth:`GEOSGeometry.interpolate`."
msgstr "Iomsaigh de:meth: `Geosgeometry.interpolate`."

msgid ""
"Returns the DE-9IM intersection matrix (a string) representing the "
"topological relationship between this geometry and the other."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an maitrís trasna DE-9IM (sreang) a léiríonn an gaol topolaíoch "
"idir an geoiméadacht seo agus an ceann eile."

msgid ""
"Returns a new :class:`GEOSGeometry`, simplified to the specified tolerance "
"using the Douglas-Peucker algorithm. A higher tolerance value implies fewer "
"points in the output. If no tolerance is provided, it defaults to 0."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé nua:class: `GeosGeometry`, a shimpliú go dtí an lamháltas "
"sonraithe ag baint úsáide as an algartam Douglas-Peucker. Tugann luach "
"lamháltais níos airde le tuiscint níos lú pointí san aschur. Mura gcuirtear "
"aon lamháltas ar fáil, réamhshocraíonn sé go 0."

msgid ""
"By default, this function does not preserve topology. For "
"example, :class:`Polygon` objects can be split, be collapsed into lines, or "
"disappear. :class:`Polygon` holes can be created or disappear, and lines may "
"cross. By specifying ``preserve_topology=True``, the result will have the "
"same dimension and number of components as the input; this is significantly "
"slower, however."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, ní chaomhnóidh an fheidhm seo topolaíocht. Mar "
"shampla, :class: Is féidir rudaí `Polygon` a roinnt, iad a thitim ina línte, "
"nó imeacht. :class: Is féidir poill `Polygon` a chruthú nó a imirt, agus "
"féadfaidh línte trasnú. Trí shonrú ``preserve_topology=True``, beidh an "
"toise agus an líon comhpháirteanna céanna ag an toradh leis an ionchur; tá "
"sé seo i bhfad níos moille, áfach."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` combining the points in this geometry not in "
"other, and the points in other not in this geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: `GeosGeometry` a chomhcheanglaíonn na pointí sa "
"ghéimseadracht seo nach bhfuil i bpointí eile, agus na pointí eile nach "
"bhfuil sa ghéiméadracht seo."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` representing all the points in this geometry "
"and the other."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: `GeosGeometry` a léiríonn na pointí go léir sa "
"ghéimseadracht seo agus an ceann eile."

msgid "Topological Properties"
msgstr "Airíonna Topolaíocha"

msgid "Returns the boundary as a newly allocated Geometry object."
msgstr "Tugann sé an teorainn ar ais mar réad Coiméadra nua-leithdháil"

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`Point` object representing the geometric center of the "
"geometry.  The point is not guaranteed to be on the interior of the geometry."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: réad `Point` a léiríonn lár geoiméadrach an "
"ghéiméadrachta. Ní ráthaítear go mbeidh an pointe ar an taobh istigh den "
"ghéiméadracht."

msgid ""
"Returns the smallest :class:`Polygon` that contains all the points in the "
"geometry."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an beag:class: `Polygon` ina bhfuil na pointí go léir sa "
"ghéimseadracht."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`Polygon` that represents the bounding envelope of this "
"geometry. Note that it can also return a :class:`Point` if the input "
"geometry is a point."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a: aicme: `Polygon` a léiríonn clúdach teorainneach an "
"geoiméadair seo. Tabhair faoi deara gur féidir leis a: class: `Point` a "
"thabhairt ar ais freisin más pointe é an geoiméadra ionchuir."

msgid ""
"Computes and returns a :class:`Point` guaranteed to be on the interior of "
"this geometry."
msgstr ""
"Ráthaítear go mbeidh `Point` ar an taobh istigh den ghéiméadracht seo a "
"ríomh agus tuairisceann a: aicme: `Point`"

msgid "Computes the union of all the elements of this geometry."
msgstr "Ríomhann aontas na n-eilimintí uile den ghéiméadracht seo."

msgid "The result obeys the following contract:"
msgstr "Cloíonn an toradh don chonradh seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Unioning a set of :class:`LineString`\\s has the effect of fully noding and "
"dissolving the linework."
msgstr ""
"Tá an éifeacht ag aontú tacar de:class: `Linestring`\\ s an obair líne a "
"nochtadh agus a dhíscaoileadh go hiomlán."

msgid ""
"Unioning a set of :class:`Polygon`\\s will always return a :class:`Polygon` "
"or :class:`MultiPolygon` geometry (unlike :meth:`GEOSGeometry.union`, which "
"may return geometries of lower dimension if a topology collapse occurs)."
msgstr ""
"Ag aontú sraith de:class: `Polygon`\\ s, tabharfar ar ais i gcónaí a:class: "
"`Polygon` nó:class: `Multipolygon` geoiméadracht (gan amhail: meth: "
"`Geosgeometry.Union`, a d'fhéadfadh geoiméadraí de ghné níos ísle a "
"thabhairt ar ais má tharlaíonn titim topaolaíochta)."

msgid "Other Properties & Methods"
msgstr "Airíonna & Modhanna Eile"

msgid "This property returns the area of the Geometry."
msgstr "Tugann an maoin seo limistéar an Céiméadracht ar ais."

msgid ""
"This property returns the extent of this geometry as a 4-tuple, consisting "
"of ``(xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax)``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an maoin seo méid an geoiméadra seo ar ais mar 4-tuple, comhdhéanta "
"de ``(xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax)``."

msgid ""
"This method returns a :class:`GEOSGeometry` that is a clone of the original."
msgstr "Tugann an modh seo a: class: `GeosGeometry` is clón den bhunaidh é."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance between the closest points on this geometry and the "
"given ``geom`` (another :class:`GEOSGeometry` object)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an fad idir na pointí is gaire ar an geoiméadacht seo agus an "
"`geom`` a thugtar (rud eile: aicme: `GeosGeometry` réad)."

msgid ""
"GEOS distance calculations are  linear -- in other words, GEOS does not "
"perform a spherical calculation even if the SRID specifies a geographic "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Tá ríomhanna achair GEOS líneach - is é sin le rá, ní dhéanann GEOS ríomh "
"sféarúil fiú má shonraíonn an SRID córas comhordaithe geografach."

msgid ""
"Returns the length of this geometry (e.g., 0 for a :class:`Point`, the "
"length of a :class:`LineString`, or the circumference of a :class:`Polygon`)."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais fad an ghéiméadracht seo (m.sh., 0 do aicme a: `Point`, fad "
"a: aicme a: `LíneString`, nó imlíne a:aicme: `Polygon`)."

msgid ""
"Returns a GEOS ``PreparedGeometry`` for the contents of this geometry. "
"``PreparedGeometry`` objects are optimized for the contains, intersects, "
"covers, crosses, disjoint, overlaps, touches and within operations. Refer to "
"the :ref:`prepared-geometries` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Filleann GEOS ``PrepareidGeometry`` le haghaidh ábhar an geoiméadra seo. "
"Déantar rudaí ``Geoiméadracht ullmhaithe “a bharrfheabhsú le haghaidh na n-"
"ábhar, trasna, clúdaigh, croisí, neamhchoitianta, forluí, teagmhálacha agus "
"laistigh d'oibríochtaí. Féach ar an doiciméadach:ref: `ullmhai-"
"geoiméadraitheach` le haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise."

msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.SpatialReference` object "
"corresponding to the SRID of the geometry or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.spatialReference` réad a "
"fhreagraíonn do SRID an geoiméadair nó ``None``."

msgid ""
"Transforms the geometry according to the given coordinate transformation "
"parameter (``ct``), which may be an integer SRID, spatial reference WKT "
"string, a PROJ string, a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.SpatialReference` "
"object, or a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.CoordTransform` object. By "
"default, the geometry is transformed in-place and nothing is returned. "
"However if the ``clone`` keyword is set, then the geometry is not modified "
"and a transformed clone of the geometry is returned instead."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé an geoiméadra de réir an pharaiméadar claochlaithe comhordaithe "
"tugtha (`ct``), a d'fhéadfadh a bheith ina SRID sláimhir, teaghrán spásúil "
"WKT, teaghrán PROJ, a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.spatialReference` "
"réad, nó a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.coordTransform`. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, déantar an geoiméadra a athrú in áit agus ní thugtar aon "
"rud ar ais Mar sin féin má shocraítear an eochairfhocal “clón”, ansin ní "
"mhodhnaítear an geoiméadra agus cuirtear clón claochlaithe den ghéiméadracht "
"ar ais ina ionad sin."

msgid ""
"Raises :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geos.GEOSException` if GDAL is not "
"available or if the geometry's SRID is ``None`` or less than 0. It doesn't "
"impose any constraints on the geometry's SRID if called with "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.CoordTransform` object."
msgstr ""
"Ardaithe:Class: `~django.contrib.gis.geos.geosException` mura bhfuil GDAL ar "
"fáil nó má tá SRID an geoiméadra ``None`` nó níos lú ná 0. Ní chuireann sé "
"aon srianta ar SRID an ghéiméadrachta má thugtar air le réad a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.coordTransform`."

msgid ""
"Returns a valid :class:`GEOSGeometry` equivalent, trying not to lose any of "
"the input vertices. If the geometry is already valid, it is returned "
"untouched. This is similar to "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.MakeValid` database "
"function. Requires GEOS 3.8."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé coibhéis bailí:class: `GeosGeometry` ar ais, ag iarraidh gan aon "
"cheann de na beartacha ionchuir a chailleadh. Má tá an geoiméadra bailí "
"cheana féin, cuirtear ar ais gan teagmháil leis. Tá sé seo cosúil leis an "
"bhfeidhm bunachar sonraí:: class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.functions.MakeValid`. Éilíonn GEOS 3.8."

msgid ""
"Converts this geometry to canonical form. If the ``clone`` keyword is set, "
"then the geometry is not modified and a normalized clone of the geometry is "
