"seo a leanas coibhéiseach:"

msgid ""
"In addition, ``LineString`` objects may also be created by passing in a "
"single sequence of coordinate or :class:`Point` objects:"
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, féadfar rudaí `LíneString`` a chruthú freisin trí "
"sheicheamh amháin de rudaí comhordaithe nó: aicme: `Point` a rith i seacham "
"amháin:"

msgid ""
"Empty ``LineString`` objects may be instantiated by passing no arguments or "
"an empty sequence. The following are equivalent:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfar rudaí folmha ``LíneString`` a thionscnamh trí aon argóintí nó "
"seicheamh folamh a chur ar aghaidh. Tá na nithe seo a leanas comhionann:"

msgid "Returns whether or not this ``LineString`` is closed."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais cibé an bhfuil an `Linestring`` seo dúnta nó nach bhfuil."

msgid "``LinearRing``"
msgstr "``Línear``"

msgid ""
"``LinearRing`` objects are constructed in the exact same way "
"as :class:`LineString` objects, however the coordinates must be *closed*, in "
"other words, the first coordinates must be the same as the last coordinates. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"Tógtar rudaí `Línearing`` ar an mbealach céanna le rudaí: aicme: "
"`LíneString`, ach caithfidh na comhordanáidí* a bheith dúnta, is é sin le "
"rá, caithfidh na chéad chomhordanáidí a bheith mar an gcéanna leis na "
"comhordanáidí deireanacha. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Notice that ``(0, 0)`` is the first and last coordinate -- if they were not "
"equal, an error would be raised."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara gurb é ``(0, 0)`` an chéad chomhordú agus an comhordú "
"deireanach - mura mbeadh siad comhionann, ardófaí earráid."

msgid "Returns whether this ``LinearRing`` is counterclockwise."
msgstr "Tugann sé ar ais cibé an bhfuil an `Línearing`` seo i gcoinne."

msgid "``Polygon``"
msgstr "``Polygón``"

msgid ""
"``Polygon`` objects may be instantiated by passing in parameters that "
"represent the rings of the polygon.  The parameters must either "
"be :class:`LinearRing` instances, or a sequence that may be used to "
"construct a :class:`LinearRing`:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfar rudaí ``Polygon`` a chur isteach trí pharaiméadair a léiríonn fáinní "
"an pholugáin a chur isteach. Ní mór go mbeadh na paraiméadair: aicme: "
"`Línearing` cásanna, nó seicheamh a d'fhéadfaí a úsáid chun a:class: "
"`Linearring` a thógáil:"

msgid ""
"Returns a polygon object from the given bounding-box, a 4-tuple comprising "
"``(xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax)``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé réad polagún ar ais ón mbosca teorainn a thugtar, 4 tuipéil ina "
"bhfuil ``(xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax)``."

msgid "Returns the number of interior rings in this geometry."
msgstr "Filleann líon na bhfáinní taobh istigh sa geoiméadracht seo."

msgid "Comparing Polygons"
msgstr "Déan comparáid idir Polagáin"

msgid ""
"Note that it is possible to compare ``Polygon`` objects directly with ``<`` "
"or ``>``, but as the comparison is made through "
"Polygon's :class:`LineString`, it does not mean much (but is consistent and "
"quick). You can always force the comparison with "
"the :attr:`~GEOSGeometry.area` property:"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara gur féidir rudaí ``Polygon`` a chur i gcomparáid go "
"díreach le ``<`` nó ``>``, ach de réir mar a dhéantar an comparáid trí "
"Polygon's:class: `Linestring`, ní chiallaíonn sé mórán (ach tá sé "
"comhsheasmhach agus tapa). Is féidir leat an comparáid a chur i gcónaí leis "
"an maoin: attr: `~ Geosgeometry.Area`:"

msgid "Geometry Collections"
msgstr "Bailiúcháin Gé"

msgid "``MultiPoint``"
msgstr "``Ilphoint``"

msgid ""
"``MultiPoint`` objects may be instantiated by passing in :class:`Point` "
"objects as arguments, or a single sequence of :class:`Point` objects:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfar rudaí ``multipoint`` a chur isteach trí rudaí: aicme: `Point` a rith "
"mar argóintí, nó seicheamh amháin de:class: `Point` rudaí:"

