"``MultiLineString`` objects may be instantiated by passing "
"in :class:`LineString` objects as arguments, or a single sequence "
"of :class:`LineString` objects:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfar rudaí ``MultilineString`` a chur isteach trí rudaí: class: "
"`Linestring` a chur isteach mar argóintí, nó seicheamh amháin de:class: "
"`LineString` rudaí:"

msgid ""
