msgstr ""
"a: aicme: `Geosgeometry` a fhreagraíonn do na sonraí spásúla sa sreangán"

msgid ""
"``fromstr(string, srid)`` is equivalent to :class:`GEOSGeometry(string, "
"srid) <GEOSGeometry>`."
msgstr ""
"<GEOSGeometry>Tá ``fromstr (string, srid) ``comhionann le:aicme: "
"`GeosGeometracht (string, srid) `."

msgid "I/O Objects"
msgstr "Cuspóirí I/O"

msgid "Reader Objects"
msgstr "Réadanna Léitheora"

msgid ""
"The reader I/O classes return a :class:`GEOSGeometry` instance from the WKB "
"and/or WKT input given to their ``read(geom)`` method."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ranganna I/O an léitheora a: class: `GeosGeometry` ar ais ón ionchur "
"WKB agus/nó WKT a thugtar dá modh `léite (geom) ``."

msgid "Writer Objects"
msgstr "Rudaí Scríbhneoir"

msgid ""
"All writer objects have a ``write(geom)`` method that returns either the WKB "
"or WKT of the given geometry.  In addition, :class:`WKBWriter` objects also "
"have properties that may be used to change the byte order, and or include "
"the SRID value (in other words, EWKB)."
msgstr ""
"Tá modh ``scríobh (geom) ``ag gach réad scríbhneoir a thugann an WKB nó WKT "
"den ghéimseadracht tugtha ar ais. Ina theannta sin, tá airíonna ag "
"rudaí :class: `WKBWriter` a d'fhéadfaí a úsáid chun an t-ordú béite a athrú, "
"agus nó an luach SRID a áireamh (i bhfocail eile, EWKB)."

msgid ""
"``WKBWriter`` provides the most control over its output.  By default it "
"returns OGC-compliant WKB when its ``write`` method is called.  However, it "
"has properties that allow for the creation of EWKB, a superset of the WKB "
"standard that includes additional information. See "
"the :attr:`WKBWriter.outdim` documentation for more details about the "
"``dim`` argument."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn ``WKBwriter`` an smacht is mó ar a aschur. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe filleann sé WKB a chomhlíonann OGC nuair a thugtar a mhodh "
"``scríbhneoireach`. Mar sin féin, tá airíonna aige a cheadaíonn EWKB a "
"chruthú, superset de chaighdeán WKB a chuimsíonn faisnéis bhreise. Féach an "
"doiciméadach:attr: `WKBWriter.outdim` le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoin "
"argóint `dim``."

msgid ""
"Returns the WKB of the given geometry as a Python ``buffer`` object. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé WKB an ghéimseadracht a thugtar ar ais mar réad Python ``buffer``. "
"Sampla:"

msgid "Returns WKB of the geometry in hexadecimal.  Example:"
msgstr "Tugann sé ar ais WKB den ghéimseata i heicseachadúil. Sampla:"

msgid ""
"This property may be set to change the byte-order of the geometry "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"Féadfar an maoin seo a shocrú chun ordú báite na léiriúcháin geoiméadrachta "
"a athrú."

msgid "Byteorder Value"
msgstr "Luach Byteorder"

msgid "Big Endian (e.g., compatible with RISC systems)"
msgstr "Big Endian (m.sh., comhoiriúnach le córais RISC)"

msgid "Little Endian (e.g., compatible with x86 systems)"
msgstr "Little Endian (m.sh., comhoiriúnach le córais x86)"

msgid ""
"This property may be set to change the output dimension of the geometry "
"representation.  In other words, if you have a 3D geometry then set to 3 so "
"that the Z value is included in the WKB."
msgstr ""
"Féadfar an maoin seo a shocrú chun gné aschuir na léiriúcháin geoiméadrachta "
"a athrú. Is é sin le rá, má tá geoiméadra 3D agat ansin socraigh go 3 ionas "
"go mbeidh an luach Z san áireamh sa WKB."

msgid "Outdim Value"
msgstr "Luach Outdim"

msgid "The default, output 2D WKB."
msgstr "An réamhshocraithe, aschur 2D WKB."

msgid "Output 3D WKB."
msgstr "Aschur 3D WKB."

msgid ""
"Set this property with a boolean to indicate whether the SRID of the "
"geometry should be included with the WKB representation.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an maoin seo le boolean chun a léiriú an chóir SRID an geoiméadair "
"a áireamh leis an ionadaíocht WKB. Sampla:"

msgid ""
"This class allows outputting the WKT representation of a geometry. See "
"the :attr:`WKBWriter.outdim`, :attr:`trim`, and :attr:`precision` attributes "
"for details about the constructor arguments."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an rang seo léiriú WKT de ghéiméadracht a chur amach. Féach na "
"tréithe: attr: `wkbwriter.outdim`, :attr: `trim`, agus:attr: `precision` le "
"haghaidh sonraí faoi argóintí an tógálaí."

msgid "Returns the WKT of the given geometry. Example:"
msgstr "Tugann sé ar ais WKT an ghéiméadracht a thugtar. Sampla:"

msgid "See :attr:`WKBWriter.outdim`."
msgstr "Féach: attr: `WKBWriter.outdim`."

msgid ""
"This property is used to enable or disable trimming of unnecessary decimals."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an maoin seo chun gearradh deochlacha gan ghá a chumasú nó a "
"dhíchumasú."

msgid ""
"This property controls the rounding precision of coordinates; if set to "
"``None`` rounding is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn an maoin seo cruinneas timpeallaithe na gcomhordanáidí; má tá sé "
"socraithe go ``None`` díchumasaítear an timpeallú."

msgid "``GEOS_LIBRARY_PATH``"
msgstr "``CONAIR_LEABHARLANNA_GEOS``"

msgid ""
"A string specifying the location of the GEOS C library.  Typically, this "
"setting is only used if the GEOS C library is in a non-standard location "
"(e.g., ``/home/bob/lib/libgeos_c.so``)."
msgstr ""
"Sreang a shonraíonn suíomh leabharlann GEOS C. De ghnáth, ní úsáidtear an "
"socrú seo ach amháin má tá leabharlann GEOS C in áit neamhchaighdeánach "
"(m.sh., ``/home/bob/lib/libgeos_c.so``)."

msgid ""
"The setting must be the *full* path to the **C** shared library; in other "
"words you want to use ``libgeos_c.so``, not ``libgeos.so``."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an socrú gurb é an cosán *iomlán* chuig an leabharlann "
"roinnte**C**; i bhfocail eile ba mhaith leat ``libgeos_c.so`` a úsáid, ní "
"``libgeos.so``."

msgid "The base GEOS exception, indicates a GEOS-related error."
msgstr "Léiríonn an buneisceacht GEOS earráid a bhaineann le GEOS."

msgid "GeoDjango"
msgstr "GeodJango"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango intends to be a world-class geographic web framework. Its goal is "
"to make it as easy as possible to build GIS web applications and harness the "
"power of spatially enabled data."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé i gceist ag GeodJango a bheith ina creat gréasáin geografach den "
"scoth. Is é an aidhm atá aige é a dhéanamh chomh furasta agus is féidir "
"feidhmchláir gréasáin GIS a thógáil agus cumhacht sonraí cumasaithe go "
"spásúil a úsáid."

