"ach GEOS ag teastáil."

msgid ""
"On Linux platforms, it may be necessary to run the ``ldconfig`` command "
"after installing each library. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Ar ardáin Linux, b'fhéidir go mbeadh sé riachtanach an t-ordú `ldconfig` a "
"reáchtáil tar éis gach leabharlann a shuiteáil. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"macOS users must install `Xcode`_ in order to compile software from source."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór d'úsáideoirí macOS `Xcode`_ a shuiteáil d'fhonn bogearraí a thiomsú "
"ón bhfoinse."

msgid "GEOS"
msgstr "GEOS"

msgid ""
"GEOS is a C++ library for performing geometric operations, and is the "
"default internal geometry representation used by GeoDjango (it's behind the "
"\"lazy\" geometries).  Specifically, the C API library is called (e.g., "
"``libgeos_c.so``) directly from Python using ctypes."
msgstr ""
"Is leabharlann C ++ é GEOS chun oibríochtaí geoiméadracha a dhéanamh, agus "
"is é an léiriú geoiméadrachta inmheánach réamhshocraithe a úsáideann "
"GeodJango (tá sé taobh thiar de na geoiméadrachtaí “leisciúla”). Go sonrach, "
"tugtar leabharlann C API (m.sh., ``libgeos_c.so ``) go díreach ó Python ag "
"baint úsáide as ctypes."

msgid ""
"First, download GEOS from the GEOS website and untar the source archive:"
msgstr ""
"Ar dtús, íoslódáil GEOS ó shuíomh Gréasáin GEOS agus déan an cartlann foinse "
"a dhíoslódáil:"

