"Then step into the GEOS directory, create a ``build`` folder, and step into "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"Ansin téigh isteach san eolaire GEOS, cruthaigh fillteán ``tógáil ``, agus "
"déan isteach ann:"

msgid "Then build and install the package:"
msgstr "Ansin tógáil agus suiteáil an pacáiste:"

