msgstr "Athróg comhshaoil ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``"

msgid ""
"A user may set this environment variable to customize the library paths they "
"want to use.  The typical library directory for software built from source "
"is ``/usr/local/lib``.  Thus, ``/usr/local/lib`` needs to be included in the "
"``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` variable.  For example, the user could place the "
"following in their bash profile:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh úsáideoir an t-athróg comhshaoil seo a shocrú chun na cosáin "
"leabharlainne is mian leo a úsáid a shaincheapadh Is é ``/usr/local/lib`` an "
"eolaire leabharlainne tipiciúil do bhogearraí a tógadh ó fhoinse. Dá bhrí "
"sin, ní mór ``/usr/local/lib`` a áireamh san athróg ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``. Mar "
"shampla, d'fhéadfadh an t-úsáideoir na rudaí seo a leanas a chur ina "
"bpróifíl bash:"

