msgstr "Cosán leabharlainne córais a shocrú"

msgid ""
"On GNU/Linux systems, there is typically a file in ``/etc/ld.so.conf``, "
"which may include additional paths from files in another directory, such as "
"``/etc/ld.so.conf.d``. As the root user, add the custom library path (like "
"``/usr/local/lib``) on a new line in ``ld.so.conf``.  This is *one* example "
"of how to do so:"
msgstr ""
"Ar chórais GNU/Linux, de ghnáth bíonn comhad ann i ``/etc/ld.so.conf``, a "
"d'fhéadfadh cosáin bhreise a áireamh ó chomhaid in eolaire eile, mar shampla "
"``/etc/ld.so.conf.d``. Mar úsáideoir fréimhe, cuir an cosán leabharlainne "
"saincheaptha (cosúil le ``/usr/local/lib``) ar líne nua i `ld.so.conf``. "
"Seo* sampla aon* de conas é sin a dhéanamh:"

msgid ""
"For OpenSolaris users, the system library path may be modified using the "
"``crle`` utility.  Run ``crle`` with no options to see the current "
"configuration and use ``crle -l`` to set with the new library path.  Be "
"*very* careful when modifying the system library path:"
msgstr ""
"Maidir le húsáideoirí OpenSolaris, féadfar cosán leabharlainne an chórais a "
"mhodhnú ag baint úsáide as an bhfóntais ``crle``. Rith ``crle`` gan aon "
"roghanna chun an chumraíocht reatha a fheiceáil agus bain úsáid as ``crle "
"-l`` chun socrú leis an gcosán leabharlainne nua. Bí * mór* cúramach agus "
"cosán leabharlainne an chórais á mhodhnú agat:"

msgid "Install ``binutils``"
msgstr "Suiteáil ``binutils``"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango uses the ``find_library`` function (from the ``ctypes.util`` "
"Python module) to discover libraries.  The ``find_library`` routine uses a "
"program called ``objdump`` (part of the ``binutils`` package) to verify a "
"shared library on GNU/Linux systems.  Thus, if ``binutils`` is not installed "
"on your Linux system then Python's ctypes may not be able to find your "
"library even if your library path is set correctly and geospatial libraries "
"were built perfectly."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann GeodJango an fheidhm ``find_library`` (ón modúl Python "
"``ctypes.util``) chun leabharlanna a fháil amach. Úsáideann gnáthamh "
"``find_library`` clár ar a dtugtar ``objdump`` (cuid den phacáiste "
"``binutils``) chun leabharlann roinnte ar chórais GNU/Linux a fhíorú. Dá "
"bhrí sin, mura bhfuil `binutils` suiteáilte ar do chóras Linux ansin "
"b'fhéidir nach mbeidh ctypes Python in ann do leabharlann a aimsiú fiú má tá "
"do chosán leabharlainne socraithe i gceart agus tógadh leabharlanna "
"geospásúla go foirfe."

