msgid ""
"`Homebrew`__ provides \"recipes\" for building binaries and packages from "
"source. It provides recipes for the GeoDjango prerequisites on Macintosh "
"computers running macOS. Because Homebrew still builds the software from "
"source, `Xcode`_ is required."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn `Homebrew`__ “oidis” chun dénártha agus pacáistí a thógáil ón "
"bhfoinse. Soláthraíonn sé oidis do na réamhriachtanais GeodJango ar "
"ríomhairí Macintosh atá ag rith macOS. Toisc go dtógann Homebrew na "
"bogearraí ó fhoinse fós, tá `Xcode`_ ag teastáil."

msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Achoimre:"

msgid "Fink"
msgstr "Fink"

msgid ""
"`Kurt Schwehr`__ has been gracious enough to create GeoDjango packages for "
"users of the `Fink`__ package system. `Different packages are available`__ "
"(starting with ``django-gis``), depending on which version of Python you "
"want to use."
msgstr ""
"Bhí `Kurt Schwehr`__ grásta go leor chun pacáistí GeodJango a chruthú "
"d'úsáideoirí an chórais pacáiste `Fink`__. `Tá pacáistí éagsúla ar fáil `__ "
"(ag tosú le ``django-gis``), ag brath ar an leagan de Python is mian leat a "
"úsáid."

msgid "MacPorts"
msgstr "MacPorts"

msgid ""
"`MacPorts`__ may be used to install GeoDjango prerequisites on computers "
"running macOS.  Because MacPorts still builds the software from source, "
"`Xcode`_ is required."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir `MacPorts `__ a úsáid chun réamhriachtanais GeodJango a shuiteáil "
"ar ríomhairí atá ag rith macOS. Toisc go dtógann MacPorts na bogearraí ó "
"fhoinse fós, tá `Xcode`_ ag teastáil."

msgid ""
"You will also have to modify the ``PATH`` in your ``.profile`` so that the "
"MacPorts programs are accessible from the command-line:"
msgstr ""
"Beidh ort freisin an `PATH`` a mhodhnú i do `.profile`` ionas go mbeidh na "
"cláir MacPorts inrochtana ón líne ordaithe:"

msgid ""
"In addition, add the ``DYLD_FALLBACK_LIBRARY_PATH`` setting so that the "
"libraries can be found by Python:"
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, cuir an socrú ``DYLD_FALLBACK_LIBRARY_PATH`` ionas gur "
"féidir Python na leabharlanna a fháil:"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Fuinneoga"

msgid ""
"Proceed through the following sections sequentially in order to install "
"GeoDjango on Windows. In this tutorial we will install 64 bit versions of "
"each application."
msgstr ""
"Lean ar aghaidh tríd na codanna seo a leanas go seicheamhach d'fhonn "
"GeodJango a shuiteáil ar Windows. Sa rang teagaisc seo, suiteálfaimid "
"leaganacha 64 giotán de gach feidhmchlár."

msgid ""
"Install a 64 bit version of Python. See :doc:`Install Python </howto/"
"windows>` for further information."
msgstr ""
"Suiteáil leagan 64 giotán de Python. Féach: Doc: `Suiteáil Python` le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise </howto/windows>."

msgid ""
"Download the latest `PostgreSQL 15.x installer`__ from the `EnterpriseDB`__ "
"website.  After downloading, run the installer, follow the on-screen "
"directions, and keep the default options unless you know the consequences of "
"changing them."
msgstr ""
"Íoslódáil an suiteálaí `PostgreSQL 15.x `__ is déanaí ó shuíomh Gréasáin "
"`EnterprisedB`__. Tar éis duit a íoslódáil, rith an suiteálaí, lean na "
"treoracha ar an scáileán, agus coinnigh na roghanna réamhshocraithe mura "
"bhfuil a fhios agat na hiarmhairtí"

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL installer creates a new ``postgres`` database superuser You "
"will be prompted once to set the password -- make sure to remember it!"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn suiteálaí PostgreSQL sárúsáideoir bunachar sonraí nua "
"``postgres`` spreagfar ort uair amháin an pasfhocal a shocrú - déan cinnte "
"cuimhneamh air!"

msgid ""
"When the installer completes, it will ask to \"Launch Stack Builder at exit?"
"\" -- keep this checked, as it is necessary to install :ref:`postgisasb`."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chríochnaíonn an suiteálaí, iarrfaidh sé “Seoladh Tógálaí Stack ag "
"imeacht?” - coinnigh é seo a sheiceáil, mar is gá a shuiteáil:ref: "
"`postgisasb`."

msgid ""
"If installed successfully, the PostgreSQL server will run in the background "
"each time the system as started as a Windows service. "
"A :menuselection:`PostgreSQL 15` start menu group will created and contains "
"shortcuts for the Application Stack Builder (ASB) as well as the 'SQL "
"Shell', which will launch a ``psql`` command window."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé suiteáilte go rathúil, rithfidh an freastalaí PostgreSQL sa chúlra "
"gach uair a thosaigh an córas mar sheirbhís Windows. A: MenusElection: "
"Cruthóidh grúpa roghchlár tosaigh `PostgreSQL 15` agus beidh aicearraí ann "
"don Tógálaí Staca Feidhmchláir (ASB) chomh maith leis an 'SQL Shell', a "
"sheolfaidh fuinneog ordaithe ``psql ``."

msgid ""
"From within the Stack Builder (to run outside of the "
"installer, :menuselection:`Start --> PostgreSQL 15 --> Application Stack "
"Builder`), select :menuselection:`PostgreSQL 15 (x64) on port 5432` from the "
"drop down menu and click next. Expand the :menuselection:`Categories --> "
"Spatial Extensions` menu tree and select :menuselection:`PostGIS X.Y for "
"PostgreSQL 15`."
msgstr ""
"Ón taobh istigh den Tógálaí Stack (chun rith lasmuigh den "
"suiteálaí, :menuselection: `Start --> PostgreSQL 15 --> Tógálaí Stack "
"Iarrataire`), roghnaigh: menuselection: `PostgreSQL 15 (x64) ar chalafort "
"5432` ón roghchlár anuas agus cliceáil ar aghaidh. Leathnaigh an crann "
"roghchláir: menuselection: `Catagóirí --> Síneadh spásúil` agus roghnaigh: "
"menuselection: `PostGIS X.Y do PostgreSQL 15`."

msgid ""
"After clicking next, you will be prompted to confirm the selected package "
"and \"Download directory\". Click next again, this will download PostGIS and "
"you will be asked to click next to begin the PostGIS installer. Select the "
"default options during install. The install process includes four Yes/No "
"dialog boxes, the default option for all four is \"No\"."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis duit cliceáil ar aghaidh, cuirfear ort an pacáiste roghnaithe a "
"dhearbhú agus “Íoslódáil eolaire”. Cliceáil ar aghaidh arís, íoslódóidh sé "
"seo PostGIS agus iarrfar ort cliceáil in aice le suiteálaí PostGIS a thosú. "
"Roghnaigh na roghanna réamhshocraithe le linn suite Cuimsíonn an próiseas "
"suiteála ceithre bhosca dialóige Tai/Níl, is é “Níl” an rogha "
"réamhshocraithe do gach ceathrar."

msgid "OSGeo4W"
msgstr "OSGeo4w"

msgid ""
"The `OSGeo4W installer`_ helps to install the PROJ, GDAL, and GEOS libraries "
"required by GeoDjango. First, download the `OSGeo4W installer`_, and run it. "
"Select :menuselection:`Express Web-GIS Install` and click next.  In the "
"'Select Packages' list, ensure that GDAL is selected. If any other packages "
"are enabled by default, they are not required by GeoDjango and may be "
"unchecked safely. After clicking next and accepting the license agreements, "
"the packages will be automatically downloaded and installed, after which you "
"may exit the installer."
msgstr ""
"Cuidíonn an `suiteálaí OSGeo4W `_ leis na leabharlanna PROJ, GDAL, agus GEOS "
"a theastaíonn ag GeoDjango a shuiteáil. Ar dtús, íoslódáil an `suiteálaí "
"OSGeo4w `_, agus rith é. Roghnaigh: MenusElection: `Express Web-GIS Install` "
"agus cliceáil ar aghaidh. Sa liosta 'Roghnaigh Pacáistí', cinntigh go "
"roghnaítear GDAL. Má chumasaítear aon phacáistí eile de réir "
"réamhshocraithe, ní theastaíonn GeodJango iad agus féadfar iad a "
"dhísheiceáil go sábháilte. Tar éis duit cliceáil eile agus glacadh leis na "
"comhaontuithe ceadúnais, déanfar na pacáistí a íoslódáil agus a shuiteáil go "
"huathoibríoch, agus ina dhiaidh"

msgid "Modify Windows environment"
msgstr "Athraigh timpeallacht Windows"

msgid ""
"In order to use GeoDjango, you will need to add your OSGeo4W directories to "
"your Windows system ``Path``, as well as create ``GDAL_DATA`` and "
"``PROJ_LIB`` environment variables.  The following set of commands, "
"executable with ``cmd.exe``, will set this up. Restart your device once this "
"is complete for new environment variables to be recognized:"
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn GeodJango a úsáid, beidh ort d'eolairí OSGeo4w a chur le do chóras "
"Windows ``Path``, chomh maith le hathróga timpeallachta ``GDAL_DATA`` agus "
"`PROJ_LIB`` a chruthú. Cuirfidh an tacar orduithe seo a leanas, "
"infheidhmithe le `cmd.exe``, é seo ar bun. Athosaigh do ghléas nuair a "
"bheidh sé seo críochnaithe chun athróga nua timpeallachta a aithint:"

msgid ""
"Administrator privileges are required to execute these commands. To do this, "
"run command prompt as administrator and enter the commands above. You need "
"to log out and log back in again for the settings to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn pribhléidí riarthóra chun na horduithe seo a chur i Chun seo a "
"dhéanamh, reáchtáil pras ordaithe mar riarthóir agus cuir isteach na "
"horduithe thuas. Ní mór duit logáil amach agus logáil isteach arís chun go "
"dtiocfaidh na socruithe i bhfeidhm."

msgid ""
"If you customized the OSGeo4W installation directories, then you will need "
"to modify the ``OSGEO4W_ROOT`` variables accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Má shaincheapann tú eolairí suiteála OSGeo4w, ansin beidh ort na hathróga "
"`OSGEO4W_ROOT`` a mhodhnú dá réir."

msgid "Install Django and set up database"
msgstr "Suiteáil Django agus bunachar sonraí a bhunú"

msgid ""
":ref:`Install Django <installing-official-release>` on your system. It is "
"recommended that you create a :doc:`virtual environment <python:tutorial/"
"venv>` for each project you create."
msgstr ""
":ref: `Suiteáil Django <installing-official-release>`ar do chóras. Moltar "
"duit a:doc: `timpeallacht fhíorúil' a chruthú do gach tionscadal "
"<python:tutorial/venv> a chruthaíonn tú."

msgid "psycopg"
msgstr "Psychopg"

msgid ""
"The ``psycopg`` Python module provides the interface between Python and the "
"PostgreSQL database. ``psycopg`` can be installed via pip within your Python "
"virtual environment:"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn modúl Python ``psycopg`` an comhéadan idir Python agus bunachar "
"sonraí PostgreSQL. Is féidir `psycopg`` a shuiteáil trí phip laistigh de do "
"thimpeallacht fhíorúil Python:"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango uses the :func:`~ctypes.util.find_library` routine from "
"``ctypes.util`` to locate shared libraries."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann GeodJango gnáthamh: func: `~ctypes.util.find_library` ó "
"``ctypes.util`` chun leabharlanna roinnte a aimsiú."

msgid "Installing PostGIS"
msgstr "PostGIS a shuiteáil"

msgid ""
"`PostGIS`_ adds geographic object support to PostgreSQL, turning it into a "
"spatial database. :ref:`geosbuild`, :ref:`proj4` and :ref:`gdalbuild` should "
"be installed prior to building PostGIS. You might also need additional "
"libraries, see `PostGIS requirements`_."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann `PostGIS `_ tacaíocht réad geografach le PostgreSQL, agus é a iompú "
"ina bhunachar sonraí spásúil. :ref: `geosbuild`, :ref: `proj4` agus:ref: "
"`gdalbuild` ba chóir a shuiteáil sula dtógtar PostGIS. B'fhéidir go mbeadh "
"leabharlanna breise ag teastáil uait freisin, féach `riachtanais PostGIS `_."

msgid ""
"The `psycopg`_ or `psycopg2`_ module is required for use as the database "
"adapter when using GeoDjango with PostGIS."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn an modúl `psycopg`_ nó `psycopg2`_ le húsáid mar an cuibheoir "
"bunachar sonraí agus GeoDjango á úsáid le PostGIS."

msgid ""
"On Debian/Ubuntu, you are advised to install the following packages: "
"``postgresql-x``, ``postgresql-x-postgis-3``, ``postgresql-server-dev-x``, "
"and ``python3-psycopg3`` (x matching the PostgreSQL version you want to "
"install). Alternately, you can `build from source`_. Consult the platform-"
"specific instructions if you are on :ref:`macos` or :ref:`windows`."
msgstr ""
"Ar Debian/Ubuntu, moltar duit na pacáistí seo a leanas a shuiteáil: "
"`postgresql-x``, `postgresql-x-postgis-3``, `postgresql-server-dev-x``, agus "
"``python3-psycopg3`` (x a mheaitseáil leis an leagan PostgreSQL is mian leat "
"a shuiteáil). Ar mhalairt air sin, is féidir leat `tógáil ó fhoinse`_. Téigh "
"i gcomhairle leis na treoracha atá sonrach don ardán má tá tú ar:ref: "
"`macos` nó:ref: `windows`."

msgid "Post-installation"
msgstr "Iar-shuiteáil"

msgid "Creating a spatial database"
msgstr "Bunachar sonraí spásúil a chruthú"

msgid ""
"PostGIS includes an extension for PostgreSQL that's used to enable spatial "
"functionality:"
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn PostGIS síneadh do PostgreSQL a úsáidtear chun feidhmiúlacht "
"spásúil a chumasú:"

msgid ""
"The database user must be a superuser in order to run ``CREATE EXTENSION "
"postgis;``. The command is run during the :djadmin:`migrate` process. An "
"alternative is to use a migration operation in your project::"
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an t-úsáideoir bunachar sonraí a bheith ina sárúsáideoir d'fhonn "
"``CREATE EXTENSION postgis; ``a reáchtáil. Reáchtáiltear an t-ordú le linn "
"an phróisis: djadmin: `migrate`. Rogha eile is ea oibríocht imirce a úsáid i "
"do thionscadal:"

msgid ""
"If you plan to use PostGIS raster functionality, you should also activate "
"the ``postgis_raster`` extension. You can install the extension using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.CreateExtension` migration "
"operation, or directly by running ``CREATE EXTENSION postgis_raster;``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé ar intinn agat feidhmiúlacht raster PostGIS a úsáid, ba cheart duit "
"an síneadh `postgis_raster` a ghníomhachtú freisin. Is féidir leat an "
"síneadh a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as oibríocht imirce: :class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.createExtension`, nó go díreach trí "
"`CREATE EXTENSION postgis_raster; ``a reáchtáil."

msgid ""
"GeoDjango does not currently leverage any `PostGIS topology "
"functionality`__. If you plan to use those features at some point, you can "
"also install the ``postgis_topology`` extension by issuing ``CREATE "
"EXTENSION postgis_topology;``."
msgstr ""
"Faoi láthair ní ghiaráilíonn GeoDjango aon fheidhmiúlacht topolaíochta "
"PostGIS `__. Má tá sé ar intinn agat na gnéithe sin a úsáid ag pointe éigin, "
"is féidir leat an síneadh `postgis_topology` a shuiteáil freisin trí "
"``CREATE EXTENSION postgis_topology; ``a eisiúint."

msgid "Managing the database"
msgstr "An bunachar sonraí a bhainistiú"

msgid ""
"To administer the database, you can either use the pgAdmin III program "
"(:menuselection:`Start --> PostgreSQL X --> pgAdmin III`) or the SQL Shell "
"(:menuselection:`Start --> PostgreSQL X --> SQL Shell`). For example, to "
"create a ``geodjango`` spatial database and user, the following may be "
"executed from the SQL Shell as the ``postgres`` user:"
msgstr ""
"Chun an bunachar sonraí a riaradh, is féidir leat an clár pgAdmin III a "
"úsáid (:menuselection: `Start -> PostgreSQL X -> pgAdmin III`) nó an SQL "
"Shell (:menuselection: `Start --> PostgreSQL X -> SQL Shell'). Mar shampla, "
"chun bunachar sonraí spásúil agus úsáideoir ``geodjango`` a chruthú, féadfar "
"an méid seo a leanas a fhorghníomhú ón SQL Shell mar úsáideoir ``postgres``:"

msgid "Installing SpatiaLite"
msgstr "Suiteáil SpatiaLite"

msgid ""
"`SpatiaLite`__ adds spatial support to SQLite, turning it into a full-"
"featured spatial database."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann `Spatialite`__ tacaíocht spásúil le SQLite, agus é a iompú ina "
"mbunachar sonraí spásúil lánfheidhme."

msgid ""
"First, check if you can install SpatiaLite from system packages or binaries."
msgstr ""
"Ar dtús, seiceáil an féidir leat SpatiaLite a shuiteáil ó phacáistí córais "
"nó dénártha."

msgid ""
"For example, on Debian-based distributions that package SpatiaLite 4.3+, try "
"to install the ``libsqlite3-mod-spatialite`` package. For older releases "
"install ``spatialite-bin``."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, ar dháileadh bunaithe ar Debian a phacáistíonn SpatialITE 4.3+, "
"déan iarracht an pacáiste ``libsqlite3-mod-spatialite`` a shuiteáil. Maidir "
"le heisiúintí níos sine suiteáil ``spatialite-bin``."

msgid "For macOS, follow the :ref:`instructions below<spatialite_macos>`."
msgstr "<spatialite_macos>Maidir le macOS, lean na:ref: `treoracha thíos`."

msgid "For Windows, you may find binaries on the `Gaia-SINS`__ home page."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le Windows, b'fhéidir go bhfaighidh tú dénártha ar an leathanach "
"baile `Gaia-Sins`__."

msgid ""
"In any case, you should always be able to :ref:`install from source "
"<spatialite_source>`."
msgstr ""
"<spatialite_source>Ar aon chuma, ba chóir go mbeadh tú in ann i gcónaí:ref: "
"`suiteáil ó fhoinse `."

msgid "Installing from source"
msgstr "Suiteáil ó fhoinse"

msgid ""
":doc:`GEOS and PROJ</ref/contrib/gis/install/geolibs>` should be installed "
"prior to building SpatiaLite."
msgstr ""
":doc: Ba chóir `GEOS agus PROJ` a shuiteáil sula dtógtar</ref/contrib/gis/"
"install/geolibs> SpatialITE."

msgid ""
"Check first if SQLite is compiled with the `R*Tree module`__. Run the "
"sqlite3 command line interface and enter the following query:"
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil ar dtús an bhfuil SQLite le tiomsú leis an modúl `R* Tree `__. Rith "
"comhéadan líne ordaithe sqlite3 agus cuir isteach an cheist seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"If you obtain an error, you will have to recompile SQLite from source. "
"Otherwise, skip this section."
msgstr ""
"Má fhaigheann tú earráid, beidh ort SQLite a aththiomsú ón bhfoinse. Seachas "
"sin, scipeáil an chuid seo."

msgid ""
"To install from sources, download the latest amalgamation source archive "
"from the `SQLite download page`__, and extract:"
msgstr ""
"Chun suiteáil ó fhoinsí, íoslódáil an cartlann foinse cumaisc is déanaí ón "
"leathanach íoslódála `SQLite `__, agus bain:"

msgid ""
"Next, run the ``configure`` script -- however the ``CFLAGS`` environment "
"variable needs to be customized so that SQLite knows to build the R*Tree "
"module:"
msgstr ""
"Ansin, reáchtáil an script ``configure`` - ach ní mór an t-athróg "
"timpeallachta ``CFLAGS` a shaincheapadh ionas go mbeidh a fhios ag SQLite an "
"modúl R* Tree a thógáil:"

msgid "SpatiaLite library (``libspatialite``)"
msgstr "Leabharlann Spatialite (``libspatialite``)"

msgid ""
"Get the latest SpatiaLite library source bundle from the `download page`__:"
msgstr ""
"Faigh an beartán foinse leabharlainne SpatiaLite is déanaí ón leathanach "
"`íoslódálaí` __:"

msgid ""
"For macOS users building from source, the SpatiaLite library *and* tools "
"need to have their ``target`` configured:"
msgstr ""
"Maidir le húsáideoirí macOS ag tógáil ó fhoinse, caithfidh uirlisí "
"leabharlann SpatiaLite *agus* a bheith cumraithe:"

msgid "macOS-specific instructions"
msgstr "Treoracha macOS-shonracha"

msgid ""
"To install the SpatiaLite library and tools, macOS users can use `Homebrew`_."
msgstr ""
"Chun an leabharlann agus na huirlisí SpatiaLite a shuiteáil, is féidir le "
"húsáideoirí macOS `Homebrew `_ a úsáid."

msgid ""
"`Homebrew`_ handles all the SpatiaLite related packages on your behalf, "
"including SQLite, SpatiaLite, PROJ, and GEOS. Install them like this:"
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann `Homebrew `_ na pacáistí go léir a bhaineann le SpatiaLite thar "
"do cheann, lena n-áirítear SQLite, SpatiaLite, PROJ, agus GEOS. Suiteáil iad "
"mar seo:"

msgid ""
"Finally, for GeoDjango to be able to find the SpatiaLite library, set the "
"``SPATIALITE_LIBRARY_PATH`` setting to its path. This will be within your "
"brew install path, which you can check with:"
msgstr ""
"Faoi dheireadh, chun GeodJango a bheith in ann an leabharlann SpatialITE a "
"aimsiú, socraigh an socrú ``SPATIALITE_LIBRARY_PATH`` ar a chonair. Beidh sé "
"seo laistigh de do chosán suiteála brú, ar féidir leat a sheiceáil leis:"

msgid ""
"Using this brew install path, the full path can be constructed like this::"
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as an gcosán suiteála brea seo, is féidir an cosán iomlán a "
"thógáil mar seo:"

msgid "``LayerMapping`` data import utility"
msgstr "Fóntais allmhairithe sonraí ``Layermapping``"

msgid ""
"The :class:`LayerMapping` class provides a way to map the contents of vector "
"spatial data files (e.g. shapefiles) into GeoDjango models."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an rang:class: `LayerMapping` bealach chun ábhar comhaid sonraí "
"spásúla veicteora (m.sh. comhaid chruthach) a mhapáil i samhlacha GeoDjango."

msgid ""
"This utility grew out of the author's personal needs to eliminate the code "
"repetition that went into pulling geometries and fields out of a vector "
"layer, converting to another coordinate system (e.g. WGS84), and then "
"inserting into a GeoDjango model."
msgstr ""
"D'fhás an fóntais seo as riachtanais phearsanta an údair chun deireadh a "
"chur leis an athrá cód a chuaigh chun geoiméadraí agus réimsí a tharraingt "
"as ciseal veicteora, ag tiontú go córas comhordaithe eile (m.sh. WGS84), "
"agus ansin a chur isteach i samhail GeoDjango."

msgid "Use of :class:`LayerMapping` requires GDAL."
msgstr "Úsáid o:class: `LayerMapping` teastaíonn GDAL."

msgid ""
"GIS data sources, like shapefiles, may be very large.  If you find "
"that :class:`LayerMapping` is using too much memory, set :setting:`DEBUG` to "
"``False`` in your settings.  When :setting:`DEBUG` is set to ``True``, "
"Django :ref:`automatically logs <faq-see-raw-sql-queries>` *every* SQL query "
"-- and when SQL statements contain geometries, this may consume more memory "
"than is typical."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh foinsí sonraí GIS, cosúil le cruthfiles, a bheith an-mhór. Má "
"aimsíonn tú go bhfuil: class: `LayerMapping` ag úsáid an iomarca cuimhne, "
"socraí:setting: `DEBUG` go ``False`` i do shocruithe. Nuair a bheidh: Socrú: "
