"le a:class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.spatialReference` chun réad ceann a "
"shonrú."

msgid "``LayerMapping`` API"
msgstr "``Sraith Maping`` API"

msgid ""
"The following are the arguments and keywords that may be used during "
"instantiation of ``LayerMapping`` objects."
msgstr ""
"Is iad seo a leanas na hargóintí agus na heochairfhocail a d'fhéadfaí a "
"úsáid le linn rudaí `Layermapping`` a chur isteach."

msgid "Argument"
msgstr "Argóint"

msgid "``model``"
msgstr "``Samhail ``"

msgid "The geographic model, *not* an instance."
msgstr "An tsamhail gheografach, *ní* sampla."

msgid "``data_source``"
msgstr "``foinse sonraí``"

msgid ""
"The path to the OGR-supported data source file (e.g., a shapefile).  Also "
"accepts :class:`django.contrib.gis.gdal.DataSource` instances."
msgstr ""
"An cosán chuig an gcomhad foinse sonraí le tacaíocht ó OGR (m.sh., comhad "
"cruth). Glacann sé freisin le: class: `django.contrib.gis.gdal.datasource` "
"cásanna."

msgid "``mapping``"
msgstr "``mapaitheo``"

msgid ""
"A dictionary: keys are strings corresponding to the model field, and values "
"correspond to string field names for the OGR feature, or if the model field "
"is a geographic then it should correspond to the OGR geometry type, e.g., "
"``'POINT'``, ``'LINESTRING'``, ``'POLYGON'``."
msgstr ""
"Foclóir: is teaghráin iad na heochracha a fhreagraíonn don réimse samhail, "
"agus freagraíonn luachanna d'ainmneacha réimse teaghrán don ghné OGR, nó más "
"réimse samhail is geografach é ansin ba chóir go bhfreagródh sé do chineál "
"geoiméadrachta OGR, m.sh., ```POINT``, `LINESTRING``, ``POLYGON'`."

msgid "``layer``"
msgstr "``sraithe``"

msgid "The index of the layer to use from the Data Source (defaults to 0)"
msgstr "Innéacs an chiseal le húsáid ón bhFoinse Sonraí (réamhshocraithe go 0)"

msgid "``source_srs``"
msgstr "``foinse_srs``"

msgid ""
"Use this to specify the source SRS manually (for example, some shapefiles "
"don't come with a ``'.prj'`` file).  An integer SRID, WKT or PROJ strings, "
"and :class:`django.contrib.gis.gdal.SpatialReference` objects are accepted."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid é seo chun an SRS foinse a shonrú de láimh (mar shampla, ní thagann "
"comhad ```.prj ``le roinnt comhaid cruth). Glactar le teaghráin SRID, WKT nó "
"PROJ sláimhir, agus:class: `django.contrib.gis.gdal.spatialReference` rudaí."

msgid "``encoding``"
msgstr "``ionchódú ``"

msgid ""
"Specifies the character set encoding of the strings in the OGR data source.  "
"For example, ``'latin-1'``, ``'utf-8'``, and ``'cp437'`` are all valid "
"encoding parameters."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn ionchódú tacar carachtair na teaghráin i bhfoinse sonraí OGR. Mar "
"shampla, is paraiméadair ionchódú bailí iad ``'latin-1'``, ``utf-8'``, agus "
"```cp437'`` uile."

msgid "``transaction_mode``"
msgstr "``mod_idirbhearta``"

msgid "May be ``'commit_on_success'`` (default) or ``'autocommit'``."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh sé a bheith ```commit_on_success'`` (réamhshocraithe) nó "
"```'autochommit'``."

msgid "``transform``"
msgstr "```claochl``"

msgid ""
"Setting this to False will disable coordinate transformations.  In other "
"words, geometries will be inserted into the database unmodified from their "
"original state in the data source."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn sé seo go False, díchumasfar claochlú comhordaithe Is é sin le "
"rá, cuirfear geoiméadraí isteach sa bhunachar sonraí gan mhodhnú óna staid "
"bhunaidh san fhoinse sonraí."

msgid "``unique``"
msgstr "``uath``"

msgid ""
"Setting this to the name, or a tuple of names, from the given  model will "
"create models unique only to the given name(s). Geometries from each feature "
"will be added into the collection associated with the unique model.  Forces "
"the transaction mode to be ``'autocommit'``."
msgstr ""
"Ag leagan síos é seo don ainm, nó le cúpla ainmneacha, ón tsamhail a thugtar "
"cruthófar samhlacha atá uathúil don ainm (í) ar leith amháin. Cuirfear "
"geoiméadraí ó gach gné isteach sa bhailiúchán a bhaineann leis an tsamhail "
"uathúil. Cuireann iallach ar an modh idirbheart a bheith ```autochommit``."

msgid "``using``"
msgstr "```Úsáid``"

msgid ""
"Sets the database to use when importing spatial data. Default is "
"``'default'``."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an bunachar sonraí le húsáid agus sonraí spásúla á iompórtá Is é "
"réamhshocraithe ``'default' ``."

msgid "``save()`` Keyword Arguments"
msgstr "``save () ``Argóintí Eochairfhocal"

msgid ""
"The ``save()`` method also accepts keywords.  These keywords are used for "
"controlling output logging, error handling, and for importing specific "
"feature ranges."
msgstr ""
"Glacann an modh `save () ``le heochairfhocail freisin. Úsáidtear na "
"heochairfhocail seo chun logáil aschuir a rialú, láimhseáil earráidí, agus "
"chun raonta gnéithe ar leith"

msgid "Save Keyword Arguments"
msgstr "Argóintí Eochairfhocal"

msgid "``fid_range``"
msgstr "``raon fid``"

msgid ""
"May be set with a slice or tuple of (begin, end) feature ID's to map from "
"the data source.  In other words, this keyword enables the user to "
"selectively import a subset range of features in the geographic data source."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a shocrú le slisnacht nó tuple d'aitheantais ghné (tús, "
"deireadh) le léarscáil ón bhfoinse sonraí. Is é sin le rá, cuireann an "
"eochairfhocal seo ar chumas an úsáideora raon foshraith gnéithe a iompórtáil "
"go roghnach san fhoinse sonraí geografacha."

msgid "``progress``"
msgstr "```dul chun cinne``"

msgid ""
"When this keyword is set, status information will be printed giving the "
"number of features processed and successfully saved.  By default, progress "
"information will be printed every 1000 features processed, however, this "
"default may be overridden by setting this keyword with an integer for the "
"desired interval."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a shocraítear an eochairfhocal seo, clófar faisnéis stádais ag "
"tabhairt líon na ngnéithe a phróiseáladh agus a shábháil go rathúil De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, clófar faisnéis dul chun cinn gach 1000 gné a "
"phróiseáiltear, áfach, féadfar an réamhshocrú seo a shárú tríd an "
"eochairfhocal seo a shocrú le sláimhir don eatramh inmhianaithe"

msgid "``silent``"
msgstr "``ciúna``"

msgid ""
"By default, non-fatal error notifications are printed to ``sys.stdout``, but "
"this keyword may be set to disable these notifications."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, clóitear fógraí earráide neamh-mharfach chuig "
"`sys.stdout``, ach féadfar an eochairfhocal seo a shocrú chun na fógraí seo "
"a dhíchumasú."

msgid "``step``"
msgstr "``céime``"

msgid ""
"If set with an integer, transactions will occur at every step interval. For "
"example, if ``step=1000``, a commit would occur after the 1,000th feature, "
"the 2,000th feature etc."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraítear é le sláimhir, tarlóidh idirbhearta ag gach eatramh céim. Mar "
"shampla, má tharlódh sé ``step = 1000``, tiomantas tar éis na 1,000ú gné, an "
"2,000ú gné srl."

msgid "``stream``"
msgstr "``sruth``"

msgid ""
"Status information will be written to this file handle.  Defaults to using "
"``sys.stdout``, but any object with a ``write`` method is supported."
msgstr ""
"Scríofar faisnéis stádais chuig an láimhseáil comhad seo. Réamhshocraithe "
"chun `sys.stdout`` a úsáid, ach tacaítear le haon rud le modh "
"``scríbhneoire``."

msgid "``strict``"
msgstr "``docht ``"

msgid ""
"Execution of the model mapping will cease upon the first error encountered.  "
"The default value (``False``) behavior is to attempt to continue."
msgstr ""
"Scoirfidh forghníomhú na mapáil samhail ar an gcéad earráid a thagann chun "
"cinn. Is é an t-iompar luach réamhshocraithe (``False``) iarracht a dhéanamh "
"leanúint ar aghaidh."

msgid "``verbose``"
msgstr "``Verbose``"

msgid ""
"If set, information will be printed subsequent to each model save executed "
"on the database."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraítear é, clófar faisnéis ina dhiaidh sin gach samhail sábháil a "
"fhorghníomhú ar an mbunachar sonraí."

msgid "Running out of memory"
msgstr "Rith as cuimhne"

msgid ""
"As noted in the warning at the top of this section, Django stores all SQL "
"queries when ``DEBUG=True``.  Set ``DEBUG=False`` in your settings, and this "
"should stop excessive memory use when running ``LayerMapping`` scripts."
msgstr ""
"Mar a thugtar faoi deara sa rabhadh ag barr an chuid seo, stóráilíonn Django "
"gach ceist SQL nuair a bhíonn `debug = true``. Socraigh ``debug = false ``i "
"do shocruithe, agus ba cheart go stopfadh sé seo úsáid iomarcach cuimhne "
"agus scripteanna ``LayerMapping`` á reáchtáil."

msgid "MySQL: ``max_allowed_packet`` error"
msgstr "MySQL: earráid ``max_allowed_packet``"

