msgstr ""
"Ligeann fóntais GDAL ``ogrinfo` a scrúdú ar mheiteashonraí comhaid cruth nó "
"foinsí sonraí veicteora eile:"

msgid ""
"``ogrinfo`` tells us that the shapefile has one layer, and that this layer "
"contains polygon data.  To find out more, we'll specify the layer name and "
"use the ``-so`` option to get only the important summary information:"
msgstr ""
"Insíonn ``ogrinfo`` dúinn go bhfuil ciseal amháin ag an bhformáid, agus go "
"bhfuil sonraí polugón sa chiseal seo. Chun tuilleadh a fháil amach, "
"sonróimid ainm an chiseal agus úsáidfimid an rogha ``-so ``chun an fhaisnéis "
"achoimre tábhachtach a fháil amháin:"

msgid ""
"This detailed summary information tells us the number of features in the "
"layer (246), the geographic bounds of the data, the spatial reference system "
"(\"SRS WKT\"), as well as type information for each attribute field. For "
"example, ``FIPS: String (2.0)`` indicates that the ``FIPS`` character field "
"has a maximum length of 2.  Similarly, ``LON: Real (8.3)`` is a floating-"
"point field that holds a maximum of 8 digits up to three decimal places."
msgstr ""
"Insíonn an fhaisnéis achoimre mionsonraithe seo dúinn líon na ngnéithe sa "
"chiseal (246), teorainneacha geografacha na sonraí, an córas tagartha "
"spásúil (“SRS WKT”), chomh maith le faisnéis chineál do gach réimse tréithe. "
"Mar shampla, léiríonn ``FIPS: String (2.0) ``go bhfuil fad uasta 2 ag an "
"réimse carachtar ``FIPS``. Ar an gcaoi chéanna, is réimse pointe snámh é "
"`LON: Real (8.3) `a bhfuil uasmhéid de 8 dhigit suas le trí áit deachúil."

