"Now, open the world borders shapefile using "
"GeoDjango's :class:`~django.contrib.gis.gdal.DataSource` interface:"
msgstr ""
"Anois, oscail an comhad cruth teorainneacha domhanda ag baint úsáide as "
"comhéadan GeodjangoS:Class: `~django.contrib.gis.gdal.datasource`:"

msgid ""
"Data source objects can have different layers of geospatial features; "
"however, shapefiles are only allowed to have one layer:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le sraitheanna éagsúla de ghnéithe geospásúla a bheith ag rudaí "
