"aonaid céimeanna."

msgid ""
"In addition, shapefiles also support attribute fields that may contain "
"additional data.  Here are the fields on the World Borders layer:"
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, tacaíonn shapefiles le réimsí tréithe a d'fhéadfadh sonraí "
"breise a bheith iontu. Seo na réimsí ar an gciseal Teorainneacha Domhanda:"

