msgstr "Féadfar geoiméadraí teorann a onnmhairiú mar WKT agus GeoJSON:"

msgid "``LayerMapping``"
msgstr "``Sraith maping``"

msgid ""
"To import the data, use a ``LayerMapping`` in a Python script. Create a file "
"called ``load.py`` inside the ``world`` application, with the following "
"code::"
msgstr ""
"Chun na sonraí a iompórtáil, bain úsáid as ``LayerMapping`` i script Python. "
"Cruthaigh comhad ar a dtugtar ``load.py`` taobh istigh den fheidhmchlár "
"``world``, leis an gcód seo a leanas:"

msgid "A few notes about what's going on:"
msgstr "Cúpla nóta faoin méid atá ar siúl:"

msgid ""
"Each key in the ``world_mapping`` dictionary corresponds to a field in the "
"``WorldBorder`` model.  The value is the name of the shapefile field that "
"data will be loaded from."
msgstr ""
"Freagraíonn gach eochair sa fhoclóir ``world_mapping`` do réimse sa tsamhail "
"``Worldborder``. Is é an luach ainm an réimse shapefile as a luchtálfar "
"sonraí uaidh."

msgid ""
"The key ``mpoly`` for the geometry field is ``MULTIPOLYGON``, the geometry "
"type GeoDjango will import the field as.  Even simple polygons in the "
"shapefile will automatically be converted into collections prior to "
"insertion into the database."
msgstr ""
"Is é “MULTIPOLYGON” an eochair `mpoly`` don réimse geoiméadachta "
"``MULTIPOLYGON``, iompórfaidh an cineál geoiméadais GeoDjango an réimse mar. "
"Déanfar fiú polagóin shimplí sa shapefile a thiontú go huathoibríoch ina "
"mbailiúcháin sula gcuirtear isteach sa bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"The path to the shapefile is not absolute -- in other words, if you move the "
"``world`` application (with ``data`` subdirectory) to a different location, "
"the script will still work."
msgstr ""
"Níl an cosán chuig an bhformáid iomlán - is é sin le rá, má bhogann tú an "
"feidhmchlár ``domhan` (le fo-eolaire ``sonraí ``) go suíomh difriúil, "
"oibreoidh an script fós."

msgid ""
"The ``transform`` keyword is set to ``False`` because the data in the "
"shapefile does not need to be converted -- it's already in WGS84 (SRID=4326)."
msgstr ""
"Tá an eochairfhocal ``transform` socraithe go ``False`` toisc nach gá na "
"sonraí sa chomhad cruth a thiontú - tá sé i WGS84 cheana féin (SRID = 4326)."

msgid ""
"Afterward, invoke the Django shell from the ``geodjango`` project directory:"
msgstr ""
"Ina dhiaidh sin, glaoch ar an bhlaosc Django ón eolaire tionscadail "
"``geodjango``:"

