msgid "Try ``ogrinspect``"
msgstr "Bain triail as ``ogrinspect``"

msgid ""
"Now that you've seen how to define geographic models and import data with "
"the :doc:`layermapping`, it's possible to further automate this process with "
"use of the :djadmin:`ogrinspect` management command.  "
"The :djadmin:`ogrinspect` command  introspects a GDAL-supported vector data "
"source (e.g., a shapefile) and generates a model definition and "
"``LayerMapping`` dictionary automatically."
msgstr ""
"Anois go bhfaca tú conas samhlacha geografacha a shainiú agus sonraí a "
"iompórtáil leis an: doc: `layermapping`, is féidir an próiseas seo a "
"uathoibriú tuilleadh trí úsáid a bhaint as an ordú bainistíochta: djadmin: "
"`ogrinspect`. Déanann an t-ordú: Djadmin: `ogrinspect` inspreagadh foinse "
"sonraí veicteora tacaíochta le GDAL (m.sh., comhad cruth) agus gineann sé "
"sainmhíniú samhail agus foclóir ``LayerMapping`` go huathoibríoch."

msgid "The general usage of the command goes as follows:"
msgstr "Tá úsáid ghinearálta an ordaithe mar seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"``data_source`` is the path to the GDAL-supported data source and "
"``model_name`` is the name to use for the model.  Command-line options may "
"be used to further define how the model is generated."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``data_source`` an cosán chuig an bhfoinse sonraí a thacaíonn GDAL agus "
"``model_name`` an t-ainm atá le húsáid don tsamhail. Féadfar roghanna líne "
"ordaithe a úsáid chun a shainiú tuilleadh conas a ghintear an tsamhail."

msgid ""
"For example, the following command nearly reproduces the ``WorldBorder`` "
"model and mapping dictionary created above, automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, atháirgeann an t-ordú seo a leanas beagnach an tsamhail "
"``Worldborder`` agus an foclóir mapála a cruthaíodh thuas, go huathoibríoch:"

msgid "A few notes about the command-line options given above:"
msgstr "Cúpla nóta faoi na roghanna líne ordaithe a thugtar thuas:"

msgid "The ``--srid=4326`` option sets the SRID for the geographic field."
msgstr "Socraíonn an rogha ``--srid = 4326`` an SRID don réimse geografach."

msgid ""
"The ``--mapping`` option tells ``ogrinspect`` to also generate a mapping "
"dictionary for use with :class:`~django.contrib.gis.utils.LayerMapping`."
msgstr ""
"Insíonn an rogha ``--mapping`` le ``ogrinspect`` foclóir mapála a ghiniúint "
"freisin le húsáid le:class: `~django.contrib.gis.utils.layermapping`."

msgid ""
"The ``--multi`` option is specified so that the geographic field is "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.MultiPolygonField` instead of just "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.PolygonField`."
msgstr ""
"Sonraítear an rogha ``--multi`` ionas gurb é an réimse geografach a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.multipolygonfield` in ionad ach a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.gis.db.models.polygonfield`."

msgid ""
"The command produces the following output, which may be copied directly into "
"the ``models.py`` of a GeoDjango application::"
msgstr ""
"Táirgeann an t-ordú an t-aschur seo a leanas, ar féidir a chóipeáil go "
"díreach isteach sa `models.py`` d'fheidhmchlár GeoDjango:"

