msgstr ""
"<geos>Ar an gcaoi chéanna, is féidir leat a:doc: `Rud geoiméadachta GEOS `a "
"úsáid freisin. Anseo, is féidir leat an cuardach spásúil ``intersects`` a "
"chomhcheangal leis an modh ``get ``chun ach an sampla ``Worldborder`` a "
"aisghabháil do San Mairíne in ionad tacar ceisteanna:"

msgid ""
"The ``contains`` and ``intersects`` lookups are just a subset of the "
