msgid "Lazy Geometries"
msgstr "Geoiméadraí leisciúla"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango loads geometries in a standardized textual representation.  When "
"the geometry field is first accessed, GeoDjango creates "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.gis.geos.GEOSGeometry` object, exposing powerful "
