msgstr ""
"Áirítear leis seo rochtain ar na hardoibríochtaí geoiméadracha go léir a "
"sholáthraíonn leabharlann GEOS:"

msgid "Geographic annotations"
msgstr "Anótaí geografacha"

msgid ""
"GeoDjango also offers a set of geographic annotations to compute distances "
