"doiciméad:doc: `feidhmeans`."

msgid "Putting your data on the map"
msgstr "Cuir do chuid sonraí ar an léarscáil"

msgid "Geographic Admin"
msgstr "Riarachán Geografach"

msgid ""
":doc:`Django's admin application </ref/contrib/admin/index>` supports "
"editing geometry fields."
msgstr ""
":doc: Tacaíonn `feidhmchlár riaracháin Django` le réimsí geoiméadachta "
"eagarthóireachta. </ref/contrib/admin/index>"

msgid "Basics"
msgstr "Buneilimintí"

msgid ""
"The Django admin allows users to create and modify geometries on a "
"JavaScript slippy map (powered by `OpenLayers`_)."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann riarachán Django d'úsáideoirí geoiméadraí a chruthú agus a mhodhnú "
"ar léarscáil slippy JavaScript (faoi thiomáint ag `OpenLayers`_)."

msgid ""
"Let's dive right in. Create a file called ``admin.py`` inside the ``world`` "
"application with the following code::"
msgstr ""
"Déanaimis tumadóireacht isteach. Cruthaigh comhad darb ainm `admin.py`` "
"taobh istigh den fheidhmchlár ``domh`` leis an gcód seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Next, edit your ``urls.py`` in the ``geodjango`` application folder as "
"follows::"
msgstr ""
"Ansin, cuir do `urls.py`` in eagar san fhillteán feidhmchláir ``geodjango`` "
"mar seo a leanas:"

msgid "Create an admin user:"
msgstr "Cruthaigh úsáideoir riaracháin:"

msgid "Next, start up the Django development server:"
msgstr "Ansin, cuir tús leis an bhfreastalaí forbartha Django:"

msgid ""
"Finally, browse to ``http://localhost:8000/admin/``, and log in with the "
"user you just created. Browse to any of the ``WorldBorder`` entries -- the "
"borders may be edited by clicking on a polygon and dragging the vertices to "
