msgstr ""
"Faoi dheireadh, brabhsáil chuig ``http://localhost:8000/admin/``, agus "
"logáil isteach leis an úsáideoir a chruthaigh tú díreach. Brabhsáil chuig "
"aon cheann de na hiontrálacha ``Worldborder`` - is féidir na teorainneacha a "
"chur in eagar trí chliceáil ar pholugún agus na coirteanna a tharraingt go "
"dtí an suíomh atá ag teastáil."

msgid ""
"With the :class:`~django.contrib.gis.admin.GISModelAdmin`, GeoDjango uses an "
"`OpenStreetMap`_ layer in the admin. This provides more context (including "
"street and thoroughfare details) than available with "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.admin.ModelAdmin` (which uses the `Vector Map "
"Level 0`_ WMS dataset hosted at `OSGeo`_)."
msgstr ""
"Leis an: class: `~django.contrib.gis.admin.gismodelAdmin`, úsáideann "
"GeoDjango ciseal `OpenStreetMap`_ sa riarachán. Soláthraíonn sé seo níos mó "
"comhthéacs (lena n-áirítear sonraí sráide agus smachta) ná mar atá ar fáil "
"len:class: `~django.contrib.admin.modelAdmin` (a úsáideann an tacar sonraí "
"`Level Léarscáil Vector 0`_ WMS atá óstáilte ag `OsGeo`_)."

msgid ""
"The PROJ datum shifting files must be installed (see the :ref:`PROJ "
"installation instructions <proj4>` for more details)."
msgstr ""
"Caithfear na comhaid aistrithe dáta PROJ a shuiteáil (féach an:ref: "
"`Treoracha suiteála PROJ <proj4>`le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí)."

msgid ""
"If you meet this requirement, then use the ``GISModelAdmin`` option class in "
"your ``admin.py`` file::"
msgstr ""
"Má chomhlíonann tú an riachtanas seo, ansin bain úsáid as an rang rogha "
"``GisModelAdmin`` i do chomhad ``admin.py``:"

msgid ""
"Special thanks to Bjørn Sandvik of `mastermaps.net <https://mastermaps.net/"
">`_ for providing and maintaining this dataset."
msgstr ""
"Buíochas speisialta do Bjørn Sandvik de `mastermaps.net`< https://"
"mastermaps.net/> _ as an tacar sonraí seo a sholáthar agus a chothabháil."

msgid ""
"GeoDjango basic apps was written by Dane Springmeyer, Josh Livni, and "
"Christopher Schmidt."
msgstr ""
"Scríobh Dane Springmeyer, Josh Livni, agus Christopher Schmidt aipeanna "
"bunúsacha GeodJango."

msgid ""
"This point is the `University of Houston Law Center <https://www.law.uh.edu/"
">`_."
msgstr ""
"Is é an pointe seo `Ionad Dlí Ollscoil Houston`_. < https://www.law.uh.edu/>"

msgid ""
"Open Geospatial Consortium, Inc., `OpenGIS Simple Feature Specification For "
"SQL <https://www.ogc.org/standards/sfs>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.ogc.org/standards/sfs>Open Geospatial Consortium, Inc., "
"`Sonraíocht Gné Simplí OpenGIS Do SQL`_."

msgid "GeoDjango Utilities"
msgstr "Fóntais GeodJango"

msgid ""
"The :mod:`django.contrib.gis.utils` module contains various utilities that "
"are useful in creating geospatial web applications."
msgstr ""
"Tá fóntais éagsúla sa mhodúl:MOD: `django.contrib.gis.utils` atá úsáideach "
"chun feidhmchláir ghréasáin geospásúla a chruthú."

msgid "``django.contrib.humanize``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.humanize``"

msgid ""
"A set of Django template filters useful for adding a \"human touch\" to data."
msgstr ""
"Sraith scagairí teimpléad Django atá úsáideach chun “teagmháil dhaonna” a "
"chur le sonraí."

msgid ""
"To activate these filters, add ``'django.contrib.humanize'`` to "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting. Once you've done that, use ``{% load "
"humanize %}`` in a template, and you'll have access to the following filters."
msgstr ""
"Chun na scagairí seo a ghníomhachtú, cuir ``django.contrib.humanize'` ``le "
"do shuíomh: `SETTING: `INSTALLED_APPS`. Nuair a bheidh sé sin déanta agat, "
"bain úsáid as ``{% load humanize%}`` i dteimpléad, agus beidh rochtain agat "
"ar na scagairí seo a leanas."

msgid "``apnumber``"
msgstr "``apnumber``"

msgid ""
"For numbers 1-9, returns the number spelled out. Otherwise, returns the "
"number. This follows Associated Press style."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le huimhreacha 1-9, filleann sé an uimhir atá litrithe amach. Seachas "
"sin, filleann an uimhir ar ais. Leanann sé seo stíl Associated Press."

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Samplaí:"

msgid "``1`` becomes ``one``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1`` ```a`` ````````````"

msgid "``2`` becomes ``two``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```2`` ``dhá ``."

msgid "``10`` becomes ``10``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```10`` ``10``."

msgid ""
"You can pass in either an integer or a string representation of an integer."
msgstr "Is féidir leat scríomhaire nó léiriú teaghrán sláimhir a rith isteach."

msgid "``intcomma``"
msgstr "``intcomma`"

msgid ""
"Converts an integer or float (or a string representation of either) to a "
"string containing commas every three digits."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé sláimhir nó snámhphointe (nó léiriú teaghrán ar cheachtar acu) "
"go sreang ina bhfuil camóga gach trí dhigit."

msgid "``4500`` becomes ``4,500``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``4500`` ``4,500``."

msgid "``4500.2`` becomes ``4,500.2``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```4500.2`` ``4,500.2``."

msgid "``45000`` becomes ``45,000``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``45000`` ``45,000``."

msgid "``450000`` becomes ``450,000``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``450000`` ``450,000``."

msgid "``4500000`` becomes ``4,500,000``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```4500000`` ``4,500,000``."

msgid ""
":doc:`/topics/i18n/formatting` will be respected if enabled, e.g. with the "
"``'de'`` language:"
msgstr ""
":doc: urramófar `/topics/i18n/formatting` má chumasaítear é, m.sh. leis an "
"teanga ``'de'`:"

msgid "``45000`` becomes ``'45.000'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```45000`` ```45.000``."

msgid "``450000`` becomes ``'450.000'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``450000`` ``450.000``."

msgid "``intword``"
msgstr "```intword``"

msgid ""
"Converts a large integer (or a string representation of an integer) to a "
"friendly text representation. Translates ``1.0`` as a singular phrase and "
"all other numeric values as plural, this may be incorrect for some "
"languages. Works best for numbers over 1 million."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé sláimhir mhór (nó léiriú teaghrán ar shlámhshláir) go léiriú "
"téacs cairdiúil. Aistríonn ``1.0`` mar abairt uaineach agus gach luach "
"uimhriúil eile mar iolra, d'fhéadfadh sé seo a bheith mícheart i gcás roinnt "
"teangacha. Oibríonn sé is fearr d'uimhreacha os cionn 1 milliún."

msgid "``1000000`` becomes ``1.0 million``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1000000`` ```1.0 milliú``."

msgid "``1200000`` becomes ``1.2 million``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1200000`` ``1.2 milliú``."

msgid "``1200000000`` becomes ``1.2 billion``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1200000000`` ``1.2 billiún ``."

msgid "``-1200000000`` becomes ``-1.2 billion``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``-1200000000`` ``-1.2 billiún ``."

msgid "Values up to 10^100 (Googol) are supported."
msgstr "Tacaítear le luachanna suas le 10 ^ 100 (Googol)."

msgid "``1000000`` becomes ``'1,0 Million'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1000000`` ```1,0 Milliú'``."

msgid "``1200000`` becomes ``'1,2 Millionen'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``1200000`` ```1,2 Millionen``."

msgid "``1200000000`` becomes ``'1,2 Milliarden'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``1200000000`` ```1,2 Milliarden``."

msgid "``-1200000000`` becomes ``'-1,2 Milliarden'``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ``-1200000000`` ```-1,2 Milliarden'``."

msgid "``naturalday``"
msgstr "``Lá nádúrsa``"

msgid ""
"For dates that are the current day or within one day, return \"today\", "
"\"tomorrow\" or \"yesterday\", as appropriate. Otherwise, format the date "
"using the passed in format string."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le dátaí atá an lá reatha nó laistigh de lá amháin, filleadh “inniu”, "
"“amárach” nó “inné”, de réir mar is cuí. Seachas sin, formáidigh an dáta ag "
"baint úsáide as an sreang a rith i bhformáid."

msgid ""
"**Argument:** Date formatting string as described in the :tfilter:`date` tag."
msgstr ""
"**Argóint: ** Sreang formáidithe dáta mar a thuairiscítear sa chlib: "
"tfilter: `dáta`."

msgid "Examples (when 'today' is 17 Feb 2007):"
msgstr "Samplaí (nuair a bhíonn 'inniu' 17 Feabhra 2007):"

msgid "``16 Feb 2007`` becomes ``yesterday``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ````16 Feabhra 2007`` ````inné ``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007`` becomes ``today``."
msgstr "Tagann ````17 Feabhra 2007`` ``inniu ``."

msgid "``18 Feb 2007`` becomes ``tomorrow``."
msgstr "Tagann ````18 Feabhra 2007`` ``amár``."

msgid ""
"Any other day is formatted according to given argument or "
"the :setting:`DATE_FORMAT` setting if no argument is given."
msgstr ""
"Déantar aon lá eile a fhormáidiú de réir argóint a thugtar nó an "
"socrú:setting: `DATE_FORMAT` mura dtugtar aon argóint."

msgid "``naturaltime``"
msgstr "```am nádúrsa``"

msgid ""
"For datetime values, returns a string representing how many seconds, minutes "
"or hours ago it was -- falling back to the :tfilter:`timesince` format if "
"the value is more than a day old. In case the datetime value is in the "
"future the return value will automatically use an appropriate phrase."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le luachanna dáta-ama, filleann sreang a léiríonn cé mhéad soicind, "
"nóiméad nó uair an chloig ó shin a bhí sé - ag titim ar ais go formáid: "
"tfilter: `timesince` má tá an luach níos mó ná lá d'aois. Sa chás go mbeidh "
"an luach dáta-ama sa todhchaí úsáidfidh an luach tuairisceáin frása cuí go "
"huathoibríoch."

msgid "Examples (when 'now' is 17 Feb 2007 16:30:00):"
msgstr "Samplaí (nuair is é 'anois' 17 Feabh 2007 16:30:00):"

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:30:00`` becomes ``now``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 16:30:00 ```anois ``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:29:31`` becomes ``29 seconds ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 16:29:31 ``éiríonn ```29 soicind ó shin``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:29:00`` becomes ``a minute ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 16:29:00 ``éiríonn ````nóiméad ó shin``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:25:35`` becomes ``4 minutes ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 16:25:35 ``éiríonn ```4 nóiméad ó shin``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 15:30:29`` becomes ``59 minutes ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 15:30:29 ``éiríonn ```59 nóiméad ó shin``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 15:30:01`` becomes ``59 minutes ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 15:30:01 ``éiríonn ```59 nóiméad ó shin``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 15:30:00`` becomes ``an hour ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 15:30:00 `````uair an chloig ó shin ``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 13:31:29`` becomes ``2 hours ago``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 13:31:29 ``éiríonn ```2 uair an chloig ó shin``."

msgid "``16 Feb 2007 13:31:29`` becomes ``1 day, 2 hours ago``."
msgstr ""
"``16 Feabhra 2007 13:31:29 ``éiríonn ```1 lá, 2 uair an chloig ó shin``."

msgid "``16 Feb 2007 13:30:01`` becomes ``1 day, 2 hours ago``."
msgstr ""
"``16 Feabhra 2007 13:30:01 ``éiríonn ```1 lá, 2 uair an chloig ó shin``."

msgid "``16 Feb 2007 13:30:00`` becomes ``1 day, 3 hours ago``."
msgstr "``16 Feabhra 2007 13:30:00 ````1 lá, 3 huaire an chloig ó shin ``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:30:30`` becomes ``30 seconds from now``."
msgstr "```17 Feabhra 2007 16:30:30 ``éiríonn ```30 soicind as anois`."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:30:29`` becomes ``29 seconds from now``."
msgstr "``17 Feabhra 2007 16:30:29 ``éiríonn ``29 soicind as anois`."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:31:00`` becomes ``a minute from now``."
msgstr "```17 Feabhra 2007 16:31:00 ``éiríonn ````nóiméad as anois``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 16:34:35`` becomes ``4 minutes from now``."
msgstr "```17 Feabhra 2007 16:34:35 ``éiríonn ```4 nóiméad as seo``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 17:30:29`` becomes ``an hour from now``."
msgstr "```17 Feabhra 2007 17:30:29 ``````uair an chloig as seo``."

msgid "``17 Feb 2007 18:31:29`` becomes ``2 hours from now``."
msgstr "```17 Feabhra 2007 18:31:29 ````2 uair an chloig as seo``."

msgid "``18 Feb 2007 16:31:29`` becomes ``1 day from now``."
msgstr "```18 Feabhra 2007 16:31:29 ``éiríonn ```1 lá as anois`."

msgid "``26 Feb 2007 18:31:29`` becomes ``1 week, 2 days from now``."
msgstr "``26 Feabhra 2007 18:31:29 ``éiríonn ``1 seachtain, 2 lá as anois`."

msgid "``ordinal``"
msgstr "``Gnáth``"

msgid "Converts an integer to its ordinal as a string."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé sláimhir go dtí a ordal mar shreang."

msgid "``1`` becomes ``1st``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```1`` ``1`` `1``."

msgid "``2`` becomes ``2nd``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```2`` ``2`` `2``."

msgid "``3`` becomes ``3rd``."
msgstr "Éiríonn ```3`` ``3rd``."

msgid ""
"You can pass in either an integer or a string representation of an integer. "
"Negative integers are returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat scríomhaire nó léiriú teaghrán sláimhir a rith isteach. "
"Cuirtear sláimhreacha diúltacha ar ais gan athrú."

msgid "``contrib`` packages"
msgstr "Pacáistí ``contrib``"

msgid ""
"Django aims to follow Python's :ref:`\"batteries included\" philosophy <tut-"
"batteries-included>`. It ships with a variety of extra, optional tools that "
"solve common web development problems."
msgstr ""
"<tut-batteries-included>Tá sé mar aidhm ag Django Python a leanúint:ref: "
"`\"cadhnraí san áireamh” fealsúnacht `. Seolann sé le réimse uirlisí "
"roghnacha breise a réitíonn fadhbanna coitianta forbartha gréasáin."

msgid ""
"This code lives in :source:`django/contrib` in the Django distribution. This "
"document gives a rundown of the packages in ``contrib``, along with any "
"dependencies those packages have."
msgstr ""
"Tá an cód seo ina gcónaí in:source: `django/contrib` sa dáileadh Django. "
"Tugann an doiciméad seo cur síos ar na pacáistí in `contrib``, chomh maith "
"le haon spleáchais atá ag na pacáistí sin."

msgid "Including ``contrib`` packages in ``INSTALLED_APPS``"
msgstr "Lena n-áirítear pacáistí ``contrib`` i `INSTALLED_APPS``"

msgid ""
"For most of these add-ons -- specifically, the add-ons that include either "
"models or template tags -- you'll need to add the package name (e.g., "
"``'django.contrib.redirects'``) to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting "
"and rerun ``manage.py migrate``."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis an gcuid is mó de na breiseáin seo - go sonrach, na breiseáin a "
"chuimsíonn samhlacha nó clibeanna teimpléad - beidh ort ainm an phacáiste "
"(m.sh., ``django.contrib.redirects'`) a chur le do shuíomh: `INSTALLED_APPS` "
"agus `manage.py migrate`` a athrith."

msgid ""
"The automatic Django administrative interface. For more information, "
"see :doc:`Tutorial 2 </intro/tutorial02>` and the :doc:`admin documentation "
"</ref/contrib/admin/index>`."
msgstr ""
"An comhéadan riaracháin uathoibríoch Django. Le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"faisnéise, féach:doc: `Teagaisc 2` agus an:doc: `doiciméadú riaracháin `</"
"intro/tutorial02> </ref/contrib/admin/index>."

msgid "Requires the auth_ and contenttypes_ contrib packages to be installed."
msgstr "Éilíonn sé na pacáistí contrib auth_ agus contenttypepes_ a shuiteáil."

msgid "Django's authentication framework."
msgstr "Creat fíordheimhnithe Django."

msgid "See :doc:`/topics/auth/index`."
msgstr "Féach: doc: `/topics/auth/index `."

msgid ""
"A light framework for hooking into \"types\" of content, where each "
"installed Django model is a separate content type."
msgstr ""
"Creat éadrom chun dul isteach i “chineálacha” ábhair, áit a bhfuil gach "
"samhail Django suiteáilte ina chineál ábhair ar leithligh."

msgid "See the :doc:`contenttypes documentation </ref/contrib/contenttypes>`."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú cineálacha content` </ref/contrib/contenttypes>."

msgid "``flatpages``"
msgstr "``flatpages ``"

msgid "A framework for managing \"flat\" HTML content in a database."
msgstr "Creat chun ábhar HTML “comhréidh” a bhainistiú i mbunachar sonraí."

msgid "See the :doc:`flatpages documentation </ref/contrib/flatpages>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: doiciméadú `flatpages </ref/contrib/flatpages>."

msgid "Requires the sites_ contrib package to be installed as well."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn sé go mbeadh an pacáiste suíomhanna _ contrib a shuiteáil freisin."

msgid "``gis``"
msgstr "``Gis``"

msgid ""
"A world-class geospatial framework built on top of Django, that enables "
"storage, manipulation and display of spatial data."
msgstr ""
"Creat geospásúil den scoth tógtha ar bharr Django, a chuireann ar chumas "
"stóráil, ionramháil agus taispeáint sonraí spásúla."

msgid "See the :doc:`/ref/contrib/gis/index` documentation for more."
msgstr ""
"Féach an doiciméadach:doc: `/ref/contrib/gis/index` le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"eolais."

msgid "``humanize``"
msgstr "``daonnacht ``"

msgid "See the :doc:`humanize documentation </ref/contrib/humanize>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: `</ref/contrib/humanize> doiciméadú daonnach'."

msgid "``messages``"
msgstr "``teachtaireachtaí ``"

msgid ""
"A framework for storing and retrieving temporary cookie- or session-based "
"messages"
msgstr ""
"Creat chun teachtaireachtaí sealadacha fianán nó seisiúin-bhunaithe a "
"stóráil agus a aisghabháil"

msgid "See the :doc:`messages documentation </ref/contrib/messages>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: `</ref/contrib/messages> doiciméadú teachtaireachtaí '."

msgid "A collection of PostgreSQL specific features."
msgstr "Bailiúchán de ghnéithe sonracha PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"See the :doc:`contrib.postgres documentation </ref/contrib/postgres/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú contrib.postgres` </ref/contrib/postgres/index>."

msgid "``redirects``"
msgstr "``atreoruithe ``"

msgid "A framework for managing redirects."
msgstr "Creat chun atreoruithe a bhainistiú."

msgid "See the :doc:`redirects documentation </ref/contrib/redirects>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: `</ref/contrib/redirects> doiciméadú a atreoraíonn '."

msgid "``sessions``"
msgstr "``seisiúin``"

msgid "A framework for storing data in anonymous sessions."
msgstr "Creat chun sonraí a stóráil i seisiúin gan ainm."

msgid "See the :doc:`sessions documentation </topics/http/sessions>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: doiciméadú `seisiúiní` </topics/http/sessions>."

msgid ""
"A light framework that lets you operate multiple websites off of the same "
"database and Django installation. It gives you hooks for associating objects "
"to one or more sites."
msgstr ""
"Creat éadrom a ligeann duit láithreáin ghréasáin iolracha a oibriú as an "
"mbunachar sonraí céanna agus suiteáil Django. Tugann sé crúcaí duit chun "
"rudaí a cheangal le suíomh amháin nó níos mó."

msgid "See the :doc:`sites documentation </ref/contrib/sites>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú láithreáin `</ref/contrib/sites>."

msgid "``sitemaps``"
msgstr "``láithreach``"

msgid "A framework for generating Google sitemap XML files."
msgstr "Creat chun comhaid XML léarscáileáin Google a ghiniúint."

msgid "See the :doc:`sitemaps documentation </ref/contrib/sitemaps>`."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:doc: doiciméadú `léarscáileanna láithreach' </ref/contrib/sitemaps>."

msgid "``syndication``"
msgstr "``sindiúcháin``"

msgid ""
"A framework for generating syndication feeds, in RSS and Atom, quite easily."
msgstr ""
"Creat chun fothaí sindicíochta a ghiniúint, i RSS agus Atom, go héasca."

msgid "See the :doc:`syndication documentation </ref/contrib/syndication>`."
msgstr "Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú sindiciúcháin` </ref/contrib/syndication>."

msgid "The messages framework"
msgstr "Creat na teachtaireachtaí"

msgid ""
"Quite commonly in web applications, you need to display a one-time "
"notification message (also known as \"flash message\") to the user after "
"processing a form or some other types of user input."
msgstr ""
"Go coitianta in iarratais gréasáin, ní mór duit teachtaireacht fógra aon-"
"uaire (ar a dtugtar “teachtaireacht splanc” freisin) a thaispeáint don "
"úsáideoir tar éis foirm nó cineálacha éigin eile ionchuir úsáideora a "
"phróiseáil."

msgid ""
"For this, Django provides full support for cookie- and session-based "
"messaging, for both anonymous and authenticated users. The messages "
"framework allows you to temporarily store messages in one request and "
"retrieve them for display in a subsequent request (usually the next one). "
"Every message is tagged with a specific ``level`` that determines its "
"priority (e.g., ``info``, ``warning``, or ``error``)."
msgstr ""
"Chuige seo, soláthraíonn Django tacaíocht iomlán do theachtaireachtaí "
"bunaithe ar fhianán agus seisiún, d'úsáideoirí gan ainm agus fíordheimhnithe "
"araon. Ligeann an creat teachtaireachtaí duit teachtaireachtaí a stóráil go "
"sealadach in iarratas amháin agus iad a aisghabháil le taispeáint in "
"iarratas ina dhiaidh sin (an chéad cheann eile de ghnáth). Tá “leibhéal” ar "
"leith clibeáilte ar gach teachtaireacht a chinneann a thosaíocht (m.sh., "
"``info``, `rabhadh ``, nó ``earráid``)."

msgid "Enabling messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí a chum"

msgid ""
"Messages are implemented through a :doc:`middleware </ref/middleware>` class "
"and corresponding :doc:`context processor </ref/templates/api>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear teachtaireachtaí i bhfeidhm trí aicme a:doc: `middleware` agus "
"comhfhreagraí:doc: `próiseálaí comhthéacs` </ref/middleware> </ref/templates/"
"api>."

msgid ""
"The default ``settings.py`` created by ``django-admin startproject`` already "
"contains all the settings required to enable message functionality:"
msgstr ""
"Tá na socruithe go léir a theastaíonn chun feidhmiúlacht teachtaireachta a "
"chumasú sa réamhshocraithe ``settings.py`` a chruthaigh ``django-admin "
"startproject`` cheana féin:"

msgid "``'django.contrib.messages'`` is in :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`."
msgstr "Tá ``'django.contrib.messages'` in:setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
":setting:`MIDDLEWARE` contains "
"``'django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware'`` and "
"``'django.contrib.messages.middleware.MessageMiddleware'``."
msgstr ""
":setting: `MIDDLEWARE` tá "
"```Django.contrib.sessions.middleware.sessionMiddleware'` agus "
"``django.contrib.messages.middleware.messageMiddleware'`."

msgid ""
"The default :ref:`storage backend <message-storage-backends>` relies "
"on :doc:`sessions </topics/http/sessions>`. That's why ``SessionMiddleware`` "
"must be enabled and appear before ``MessageMiddleware`` "
"in :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`."
msgstr ""
"</topics/http/sessions> <message-storage-backends>Braitheann an "
"réamhshocraithe:ref: `backend stórála `ar:doc: `seisiúin`. Sin an fáth go "
"gcaithfear ``SessionMiddleware`` a chumasú agus a bheith le feiceáil roimh "
"``MessageMiddleware`` in:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`."

msgid ""
"The ``'context_processors'`` option of the ``DjangoTemplates`` backend "
"defined in your :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting contains "
"``'django.contrib.messages.context_processors.messages'``."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``django.contrib.messages.context_processors.messages'`` sa rogha "
"``context_processors' ``den chúlcheann ``DjangoTemplates`` a shainmhínítear "
"i do shuíomh: `TEMPLATES`."

msgid ""
"If you don't want to use messages, you can remove "
"``'django.contrib.messages'`` from your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`, the "
"``MessageMiddleware`` line from :setting:`MIDDLEWARE`, and the ``messages`` "
"context processor from :setting:`TEMPLATES`."
msgstr ""
"Mura dteastaíonn uait teachtaireachtaí a úsáid, is féidir leat "
"``django.contrib.messages'` a bhaint as d':setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`, an "
"líne ``MessageMiddleware` ó:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`, agus an próiseálaí "
"comhthéacs `teachtaireachtaí ``ó:setting: `TEMPLATES`."

msgid "Configuring the message engine"
msgstr "An t-inneall teachtaireachta a chumrú"

msgid "Storage backends"
msgstr "Cúltaca stórála"

msgid ""
"The messages framework can use different backends to store temporary "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an gcreat teachtaireachtaí cúltaca éagsúla a úsáid chun "
"teachtaireachtaí sealadacha a stó"

msgid ""
"Django provides three built-in storage classes "
"in :mod:`django.contrib.messages`:"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django trí rang stórála ionsuite in:mod: "
"`django.contrib.messages`:"

msgid ""
"This class stores all messages inside of the request's session. Therefore it "
"requires Django's ``contrib.sessions`` application."
msgstr ""
"Stórálann an rang seo gach teachtaireacht taobh istigh de sheisiún an "
"iarratais. Dá bhrí sin éilíonn sé iarratas ``contrib.sessions` Django."

msgid ""
"This class stores the message data in a cookie (signed with a secret hash to "
"prevent manipulation) to persist notifications across requests. Old messages "
"are dropped if the cookie data size would exceed 2048 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Stórálann an rang seo sonraí na teachtaireachta i bhfianán (sínithe le hash "
"rúnda chun ionramháil a chosc) chun fógraí a leanúint ar fud iarratais. "
"Scaoiltear seantheachtaireachtaí dá mbeadh méid na sonraí fianán níos mó ná "
"2048 beát."

msgid ""
"This class first uses ``CookieStorage``, and falls back to using "
"``SessionStorage`` for the messages that could not fit in a single cookie. "
"It also requires Django's ``contrib.sessions`` application."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an rang seo `CookieStorage`` den chéad uair, agus titim siar ar "
"``SessionStorage`` a úsáid do na teachtaireachtaí nach bhféadfadh a bheith "
"oiriúnach i bhfianán amháin. Éilíonn sé freisin iarratas ``contrib.sessions` "
"Django."

msgid ""
"This behavior avoids writing to the session whenever possible. It should "
"provide the best performance in the general case."
msgstr ""
"Seachnaíonn an t-iompar seo scríobh chuig an seisiún nuair is féidir. Ba "
"chóir dó an fheidhmíocht is fearr a sholáthar sa chás ginearálta."

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.messages.storage.fallback.FallbackStorage` is the "
"default storage class. If it isn't suitable to your needs, you can select "
"another storage class by setting :setting:`MESSAGE_STORAGE` to its full "
"import path, for example::"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.messages.storage.fallback.fallbackStorage` an rang "
"stórála réamhshocraithe. Mura bhfuil sé oiriúnach do do riachtanais, is "
"féidir leat rang stórála eile a roghnú trí shocrú: socrú: `MESSAGE_STORAGE` "
"chuig a chonair iomlán iompórtála, mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"To write your own storage class, subclass the ``BaseStorage`` class in "
"``django.contrib.messages.storage.base`` and implement the ``_get`` and "
"``_store`` methods."
msgstr ""
"Chun do rang stórála féin a scríobh, fo-aicmigh an rang ``BaseStorage`` i "
"``django.contrib.messages.storage.base`` agus cuir na modhanna ``_get`` agus "
"``_store`` i bhfeidhm."

msgid "Message levels"
msgstr "Leibhéil teachtaire"

msgid ""
"The messages framework is based on a configurable level architecture similar "
"to that of the Python logging module. Message levels allow you to group "
"messages by type so they can be filtered or displayed differently in views "
"and templates."
msgstr ""
"Tá creat na teachtaireachtaí bunaithe ar ailtireacht leibhéal inchumraithe "
"cosúil le hailtireacht an mhodúl logála Python. Ligeann leibhéil "
"teachtaireachtaí duit teachtaireachtaí a ghrúpáil de réir cineálacha ionas "
"gur féidir iad a scagadh nó a thaispeáint go difriúil i"

msgid ""
"The built-in levels, which can be imported from ``django.contrib.messages`` "
"directly, are:"
msgstr ""
"Is iad na leibhéil ionsuite, ar féidir iad a allmhairiú go díreach ó "
"``django.contrib.messages``:"

msgid "Constant"
msgstr "Tairiseach"

msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Cuspóir"

msgid "``DEBUG``"
msgstr "``DEBUG``"

msgid ""
"Development-related messages that will be ignored (or removed) in a "
"production deployment"
msgstr ""
"Teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le forbairt a ndéanfar neamhaird orthu (nó a "
"bhaint) in imscaradh táirgeachta"

msgid "``INFO``"
msgstr "``EOLAS ``"

msgid "Informational messages for the user"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí faisnéise don úsáideoir"

msgid "``SUCCESS``"
msgstr "``RATH ``"

msgid ""
"An action was successful, e.g. \"Your profile was updated successfully\""
msgstr "D'éirigh le gníomh, m.sh. “Nuashonraíodh do phróifíl go rathúil”"

msgid "``WARNING``"
msgstr "``RABHADH ``"

msgid "A failure did not occur but may be imminent"
msgstr "Níor tharla teip ach d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith le teacht"

msgid "``ERROR``"
msgstr "``EARRÁID``"

msgid "An action was **not** successful or some other failure occurred"
msgstr "Níor éirigh le gníomh nó tharla teip éigin eile"

msgid ""
"The :setting:`MESSAGE_LEVEL` setting can be used to change the minimum "
"recorded level (or it can be `changed per request`_). Attempts to add "
"messages of a level less than this will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an socrú: SETTING: `MESSAGE_LEVEL` a úsáid chun an leibhéal íosta "
"taifeadta a athrú (nó is féidir é a `athrú in aghaidh an iarrata`_). Déanfar "
"neamhaird ar iarrachtaí teachtaireachtaí de leibhéal níos lú ná seo a chur "
"leis."

msgid "Message tags"
msgstr "Clibeanna teachtaireachta"

msgid ""
"Message tags are a string representation of the message level plus any extra "
"tags that were added directly in the view (see `Adding extra message tags`_ "
"below for more details). Tags are stored in a string and are separated by "
"spaces. Typically, message tags are used as CSS classes to customize message "
"style based on message type. By default, each level has a single tag that's "
