msgid "Behavior of parallel requests"
msgstr "Iompar iarrataí comhthreomhara"

msgid ""
"Due to the way cookies (and hence sessions) work, **the behavior of any "
"backends that make use of cookies or sessions is undefined when the same "
"client makes multiple requests that set or get messages in parallel**. For "
"example, if a client initiates a request that creates a message in one "
"window (or tab) and then another that fetches any uniterated messages in "
"another window, before the first window redirects, the message may appear in "
"the second window instead of the first window where it may be expected."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar an mbealach a oibríonn fianáin (agus dá bhrí sin seisiúin), "
"**ní shainmhínítear iompar aon chúltaca a úsáideann fianáin nó seisiúin "
"nuair a dhéanann an cliant céanna iolracha iarrataí a leagann nó a "
"fhaigheann teachtaireachtaí comhthreomhaol**. Mar shampla, má thionscnaíonn "
"cliant iarratas a chruthaíonn teachtaireacht i bhfuinneog amháin (nó "
"cluaisín) agus ansin ceann eile a fhaigheann aon teachtaireachtaí "
"neamhliteartha i bhfuinneog eile, sula ndéanann an chéad fhuinneog a "
"atreorú, féadfaidh an teachtaireacht a bheith le feiceáil sa dara fuinneog "
"in ionad an chéad fhuinneog inar féidir a bheith ag súil leis."

msgid ""
"In short, when multiple simultaneous requests from the same client are "
"involved, messages are not guaranteed to be delivered to the same window "
"that created them nor, in some cases, at all. Note that this is typically "
"not a problem in most applications and will become a non-issue in HTML5, "
"where each window/tab will have its own browsing context."
msgstr ""
"I mbeagán focal, nuair a bhíonn iliarratais chomhuaineach ón gcliant céanna "
"i gceist, ní ráthaítear go seachadfar teachtaireachtaí chuig an bhfuinneog "
"chéanna a chruthaigh iad ná, i gcásanna áirithe, ar chor ar bith. Tabhair "
"faoi deara nach fadhb í seo de ghnáth i bhformhór na bhfeidhmchlár agus go "
"mbeidh sé ina neamhcheist i HTML5, áit a mbeidh a chomhthéacs brabhsála féin "
"ag gach fuinneog/cluaisín."

