"mura bhfuil aon luachanna ann. <jsonfield.key>Is féidir leat an toradh a "
"cheistiú ag baint úsáid:lookup: `eochair agus innéacs cuardaigh `."

msgid "Examples are the same as for :attr:`ArrayAgg.order_by`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``ordering`` keyword argument is deprecated. "
"Use :attr:`JSONBAgg.order_by` instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "``StringAgg``"
msgstr "``Stringag``"

msgid ""
"Returns the input values concatenated into a string, separated by the "
"``delimiter`` string, or ``default`` if there are no values."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé na luachanna ionchuir atá comhcheangailte i sreang, scartha leis "
"an teaghrán ``delimiter``, nó ``default`` mura bhfuil aon luachanna ann."

msgid "Required argument. Needs to be a string."
msgstr "Argóint riachtanach. Caithfidh a bheith ina shreang."

msgid ""
"An optional boolean argument that determines if concatenated values will be "
"distinct. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Argóint roghnach boolean a chinneann an mbeidh luachanna comhtháite ar "
"leith. Réamhshocraithe go ``False``."

msgid ""
"An optional string of a field name (with an optional ``\"-\"`` prefix which "
"indicates descending order) or an expression (or a tuple or list of strings "
"and/or expressions) that specifies the ordering of the elements in the "
"result string."
msgstr ""
"Sreang roghnach d'ainm réimse (le réimír roghnach ``” -\"`` a léiríonn ord "
"íslitheach) nó abairt (nó liosta teaghráin agus/nó nathanna) a shonraíonn "
"ordú na n-eilimintí sa sreangán torthaí."

msgid ""
"The ``ordering`` keyword argument is deprecated. "
"Use :attr:`StringAgg.order_by` instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "Aggregate functions for statistics"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna comhiomlána le"

msgid "``y`` and ``x``"
msgstr "``y`` agus ``x``"

msgid ""
"The arguments ``y`` and ``x`` for all these functions can be the name of a "
"field or an expression returning a numeric data. Both are required."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis na hargóintí ``y`` agus ``x`` do na feidhmeanna seo go léir a "
"bheith ina ainm réimse nó abairt ar ais sonraí uimhriúla. Tá an dá cheann ag "
"teastáil."

msgid "``Corr``"
msgstr "``Corr``"

msgid ""
"Returns the correlation coefficient as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there "
"aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an comhéifeacht comhghaoil ar ais mar ``snám``, nó "
"``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``CovarPop``"
msgstr "``Covarpop``"

msgid ""
"Returns the population covariance as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there "
"aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an comhathracht daonra ar ais mar ``snám``, nó ``réamhshocraithe`` "
"mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid ""
"Optional. By default ``CovarPop`` returns the general population covariance. "
"However, if ``sample=True``, the return value will be the sample population "
"covariance."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach. De réir réamhshocraithe filleann ``Covarpop`` an coathraitheacht "
"ghinearálta daonra. Mar sin féin, má tá ``sample=True``, is é an luach "
"tuairisceáin an coathraitheacht daonra samplach."

msgid "``RegrAvgX``"
msgstr "``RegraVGX``"

msgid ""
"Returns the average of the independent variable (``sum(x)/N``) as a "
"``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé meán an athróg neamhspleách (``sum (x) /N``) ar ais mar ``snám`, "
"nó ``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrAvgY``"
msgstr "``Regravgi``"

msgid ""
"Returns the average of the dependent variable (``sum(y)/N``) as a ``float``, "
"or ``default`` if there aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé meán an athróg cleithiúnach (``sum (y) /N``) ar ais mar ``snám`, "
"nó ``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrCount``"
msgstr "``RegrCount``"

msgid ""
"Returns an ``int`` of the number of input rows in which both expressions are "
"not null."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé ``int ``de líon na sraitheanna ionchuir nach bhfuil an dá abairt "
"neall."

msgid "The ``default`` argument is not supported."
msgstr "Ní thacaítear leis an argóint ``réamhshocraithe``."

msgid "``RegrIntercept``"
msgstr "``RegRintercept``"

msgid ""
"Returns the y-intercept of the least-squares-fit linear equation determined "
"by the ``(x, y)`` pairs as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any "
"matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an t-idirghabháil y den chothromóid líneach is lú atá oiriúnach "
"cearnach arna chinneadh ag na péirí ``(x, y)`` mar ``snáth``, nó "
"``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrR2``"
msgstr "``RegRr2``"

msgid ""
"Returns the square of the correlation coefficient as a ``float``, or "
"``default`` if there aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann cearnóg an chomhéifeacht comhghaoil ar ais mar ``snám`, nó "
"``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrSlope``"
msgstr "``RegrSlope``"

msgid ""
"Returns the slope of the least-squares-fit linear equation determined by the "
"``(x, y)`` pairs as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any matching "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann fána an chothromóid líneach is lú atá oiriúnach cearnach a chinneadh "
"ag na péirí ``(x, y)`` mar ``snámh ``, nó ``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil "
"aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrSXX``"
msgstr "``RegRsXX``"

msgid ""
"Returns ``sum(x^2) - sum(x)^2/N`` (\"sum of squares\" of the independent "
"variable) as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tugann ``sum (x ^ 2) - suim (x) ^2/N`` (“suim na gcearnóga” den athróg "
"neamhspleách) mar ``snám``, nó `réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon "
"sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrSXY``"
msgstr "``RegrsXY``"

msgid ""
"Returns ``sum(x*y) - sum(x) * sum(y)/N`` (\"sum of products\" of independent "
"times dependent variable) as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any "
"matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceáin ``suim (x*y) - suim (x) * suim (y) /N`` (“suim táirgí” d'athróg "
"neamhspleách ag brath ar amanna) mar ``snám``, nó ``réamhshocraithe`` mura "
"bhfuil aon sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "``RegrSYY``"
msgstr "``Regrsyy``"

msgid ""
"Returns ``sum(y^2) - sum(y)^2/N`` (\"sum of squares\" of the dependent "
"variable) as a ``float``, or ``default`` if there aren't any matching rows."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisceann ``sum (y ^ 2) - suim (y) ^2/N`` (“suim na gcearnóga” den athróg "
"cleithiúnach) mar ``snám``, nó ``réamhshocraithe`` mura bhfuil aon "
"sraitheanna meaitseála ann."

msgid "Usage examples"
msgstr "Samplaí úsáide"

msgid "We will use this example table:"
msgstr "Úsáidfimid an tábla sampla seo:"

msgid ""
"Here's some examples of some of the general-purpose aggregation functions:"
msgstr ""
"Seo roinnt samplaí de chuid de na feidhmeanna comhiomlánaithe "
"ginearálchuspóireach:"

msgid ""
"The next example shows the usage of statistical aggregate functions. The "
"underlying math will be not described (you can read about this, for example, "
"at `wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regression_analysis>`_):"
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an chéad sampla eile úsáid feidhmeanna comhiomlán staitistiúla. "
"< https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regression_analysis>Ní dhéanfar cur síos ar "
"an mhatamaitic bhunúsach (is féidir leat léamh faoi seo, mar shampla, ag "
"`wikipedia`_):"

msgid "PostgreSQL specific database constraints"
msgstr "Srianta bunachar sonraí sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL supports additional data integrity constraints available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.constraints`` module. They are added in the "
"model :attr:`Meta.constraints <django.db.models.Options.constraints>` option."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn PostgreSQL le srianta breise sláine sonraí atá ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.restricints'. "
"<django.db.models.Options.constraints>Cuirtear iad leis sa rogha samhail: "
"attr: `Meta.Constraints `."

msgid "``ExclusionConstraint``"
msgstr "``Srianadh eisiaim``"

msgid ""
"Creates an exclusion constraint in the database. Internally, PostgreSQL "
"implements exclusion constraints using indexes. The default index type is "
"`GiST <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gist.html>`_. To use them, "
"you need to activate the `btree_gist extension <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/btree-gist.html>`_ on PostgreSQL. You can install it using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.BtreeGistExtension` "
"migration operation."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn sé srian eisiaimh sa bhunachar sonraí. Go hinmheánach, cuireann "
"PostgreSQL srianta eisiaimh i bhfeidhm ag úsáid innéacsanna. < https://"
"www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gist.html>Is é `Gist `_ an cineál innéacs "
"réamhshocraithe. < https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/btree-"
"gist.html>Chun iad a úsáid, ní mór duit an síneadh `btree_gist `_ a "
"ghníomhachtú ar PostgreSQL. Is féidir leat é a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as "
"an oibríocht imirce:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.btreegistExtension`."

msgid ""
"If you attempt to insert a new row that conflicts with an existing row, "
"an :exc:`~django.db.IntegrityError` is raised. Similarly, when update "
"conflicts with an existing row."
msgstr ""
"Má dhéanann tú iarracht sraith nua a chur isteach a dhéanann coinbhleacht "
"leis an tsraith atá ann cheana, ardaítear an:exc: "
"`~django.db.IntegrityError`. Ar an gcaoi chéanna, nuair a nuashonraítear "
"coinbhleachtaí le sraith"

msgid ""
"Exclusion constraints are checked during the :ref:`model validation "
"<validating-objects>`."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>Déantar srianta eisiaimh a sheiceáil le linn an: ref: "
"`bailíochtú samhail `."

msgid "See :attr:`.BaseConstraint.name`."
msgstr "Féach: attr: `.baseConstraint.name`."

msgid "``expressions``"
msgstr "``léiritheach``"

msgid ""
"An iterable of 2-tuples. The first element is an expression or string. The "
"second element is an SQL operator represented as a string. To avoid typos, "
"you may use :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.RangeOperators` which "
"maps the operators with strings. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Athraitheach de 2-tuples. Is é an chéad eilimint ná abairt nó sreang. Is é "
"an dara gné ná oibreoir SQL a léirítear mar shreang. Chun clóscríobh a "
"sheachaint, is féidir leat: class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.rangeOperators` a mhéapálann na hoibreoirí "
"le teaghráin. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Restrictions on operators."
msgstr "Srianta ar oibreoirí."

msgid "Only commutative operators can be used in exclusion constraints."
msgstr "Ní féidir ach oibreoirí comutaitheacha a úsáid i srianta eisiaimh."

msgid ""
"The :class:`OpClass() <django.contrib.postgres.indexes.OpClass>` expression "
"can be used to specify a custom `operator class`_ for the constraint "
"expressions. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an abairt: class: `op "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.OpClass>Class () `a úsáid chun `aicme "
"oibreora `_ saincheaptha a shonrú do na nathanna srianta. Mar shampla::"

msgid "creates an exclusion constraint on ``circle`` using ``circle_ops``."
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn srian eisiaimh ar ``circle`` ag baint úsáide as ``circle_ops``."

msgid "``index_type``"
msgstr "``cineál_innéacsa``"

msgid ""
"The index type of the constraint. Accepted values are ``GIST`` or "
"``SPGIST``. Matching is case insensitive. If not provided, the default index "
"type is ``GIST``."
msgstr ""
"Cineál innéacs an srianta. Is iad na luachanna a nglactar leo ná ``GIST`` nó "
"``SPGIST``. Tá an meaitseáil neamh-íogair. Mura gcuirtear ar fáil, is é "
"`GIST ``an cineál innéacs réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``condition``"
msgstr "``coinníoll``"

msgid ""
"A :class:`~django.db.models.Q` object that specifies the condition to "
"restrict a constraint to a subset of rows. For example, "
"``condition=Q(cancelled=False)``."
msgstr ""
"A: Aicme: `~Django.db.Models.q` réad a shonraíonn an coinníoll chun srian a "
"shrianadh le fo-thacar sraitheanna. Mar shampla, ``Condition=Q (cealaithe = "
"bréagach) ``."

msgid ""
"These conditions have the same database restrictions "
"as :attr:`django.db.models.Index.condition`."
msgstr ""
"Tá na srianta bunachar sonraí céanna ag na coinníollacha seo las:attr: "
"`django.db.models.index.condition`."

msgid "``deferrable``"
msgstr "``iarchurraithe``"

msgid ""
"Set this parameter to create a deferrable exclusion constraint. Accepted "
"values are ``Deferrable.DEFERRED`` or ``Deferrable.IMMEDIATE``. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar seo chun srian eisiaimh in-iarchurtha a chruthú. Is "
"iad na luachanna a nglactar leo ná ``Deferrable.Ferred`` nó "
"``Deferrable.Immediate``. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"By default constraints are not deferred. A deferred constraint will not be "
"enforced until the end of the transaction. An immediate constraint will be "
"enforced immediately after every command."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe ní chuirtear srianta ar iarchur. Ní chuirfear srian "
"iarchurtha i bhfeidhm go dtí deireadh an idirbheart. Cuirfear srian "
"láithreach i bhfeidhm díreach tar éis gach ordaithe."

msgid ""
"Deferred exclusion constraints may lead to a `performance penalty <https://"
"www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createtable.html#id-1.9.3.85.9.4>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-"
"createtable.html#id-1.9.3.85.9.4>D'fhéadfadh “pionós feidhmíochta” _ a "
"bheith mar thoradh ar srianta eisiaimh iarchurtha."

msgid "``include``"
msgstr "``san áireamh ``"

msgid ""
"A list or tuple of the names of the fields to be included in the covering "
"exclusion constraint as non-key columns. This allows index-only scans to be "
"used for queries that select only included fields "
"(:attr:`~ExclusionConstraint.include`) and filter only by indexed fields "
"(:attr:`~ExclusionConstraint.expressions`)."
msgstr ""
"Liosta nó tuipéar d'ainmneacha na réimsí atá le cur san áireamh sa srian "
"eisiaimh clúdaigh mar cholúin neamh-lárnacha. Ligeann sé seo scananna "
"innéacs amháin a úsáid le haghaidh ceisteanna nach roghnaíonn ach réimsí san "
"áireamh (:attr: `~ExclusionConstraint.include`) agus ní scagann ach amháin "
"de réir réimsí innéacsaithe (:attr: `~ExclusionConstraint.Expressions`)."

msgid ""
"``include`` is supported for GiST indexes. PostgreSQL 14+ also supports "
"``include`` for SP-GiST indexes."
msgstr ""
"Tacaítear le ``include`` d'innéacsanna GiST. Tacaíonn PostgreSQL 14+ le "
"``include`` le haghaidh innéacsanna SP-Gist freisin."

msgid "``violation_error_code``"
msgstr "```cód_earráid_shárú ``"

msgid ""
"The error code used when ``ValidationError`` is raised during :ref:`model "
"validation <validating-objects>`. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>An cód earráide a úsáidtear nuair a ardaítear "
"``ValidationError`` trí:ref: `bailíochtú samhail `. Réamhshocraithe go "
"``None``."

msgid "``violation_error_message``"
msgstr "``teachtaireachtaí earráid_shárúcháin ``"

msgid ""
"The error message used when ``ValidationError`` is raised during :ref:`model "
"validation <validating-objects>`. Defaults "
"to :attr:`.BaseConstraint.violation_error_message`."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>An teachtaireacht earráide a úsáidtear nuair a ardaítear "
"``ValidationError`` trí:ref: `bailíochtú samhail `. Réamhshocraithe to:attr: "
"`.baseConstraint.VIOLATION_ERROR_MESSAGE`."

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Samplaí"

msgid ""
"The following example restricts overlapping reservations in the same room, "
"not taking canceled reservations into account::"
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an sampla seo a leanas srian ar áirithintí forluí sa seomra céanna, "
"gan áirithintí cealaithe a chur san áireamh:"

msgid ""
"In case your model defines a range using two fields, instead of the native "
"PostgreSQL range types, you should write an expression that uses the "
"equivalent function (e.g. ``TsTzRange()``), and use the delimiters for the "
"field. Most often, the delimiters will be ``'[)'``, meaning that the lower "
"bound is inclusive and the upper bound is exclusive. You may use "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.RangeBoundary` that provides an "
"expression mapping for the `range boundaries <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/ current/rangetypes.html#RANGETYPES-INCLUSIVITY>`_. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Sa chás go sainmhíníonn do mhúnla raon ag baint úsáide as dhá réimse, in "
"ionad na cineálacha raon dúchasacha PostgreSQL, ba cheart duit abairt a "
"scríobh a úsáideann an fheidhm choibhéiseach (m.sh. `TstzRange () ``), agus "
"na teorannaithe a úsáid don réimse. Is minic a bheidh na teorannaitheoirí ná "
"``'[) ', rud a chiallaíonn go bhfuil an teorainn íochtarach cuimsitheach "
"agus go bhfuil an teorainn uachtarach eisiach. < https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/ current/rangetypes.html #RANGETYPES -INCLUSIVITY>Is féidir leat an: "
"class: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.rangeBoundary` a sholáthraíonn "
"léarscáil abairt do na `teorainneacha raon `_ a úsáid. Mar shampla::"

msgid "PostgreSQL specific query expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna fiosrúcháin sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"These expressions are available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.expressions`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá na nathanna seo ar fáil ón modúl ``django.contrib.postgres.expressions``."

msgid "``ArraySubquery()`` expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ``ArraySubquery () ``"

msgid ""
"``ArraySubquery`` is a :class:`~django.db.models.Subquery` that uses the "
"PostgreSQL ``ARRAY`` constructor to build a list of values from the "
"queryset, which must use :meth:`.QuerySet.values` to return only a single "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``ArraySubquery`` a:class: `~django.db.models.subquery` a úsáideann an "
"tógálaí PostgreSQL ``ARRAY`` chun liosta luachanna a thógáil ón gceist, nach "
"mór a úsáid:meth: `.queryset.values` chun ach colún amháin a thabhairt ar "
"ais."

msgid ""
"This class differs "
"from :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg` in the way that "
"it does not act as an aggregate function and does not require an SQL ``GROUP "
"BY`` clause to build the list of values."
msgstr ""
"Tá difríocht idir an rang seo ó:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.aggregates.ArrayAgg` sa chaoi nach ngníomhaíonn sé "
"mar fheidhm chomhiomlán agus nach dteastaíonn clásal SQL ``GROUP BY`` uaidh "
"chun an liosta luachanna a thógáil."

msgid ""
"For example, if you want to annotate all related books to an author as JSON "
"objects:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, más mian leat gach leabhar gaolmhar a anótáil le húdar mar "
"rudaí JSON:"

msgid "PostgreSQL specific model fields"
msgstr "Réimsí samhlacha sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"All of these fields are available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.fields`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá na réimsí seo go léir ar fáil ón modúl ``django.contrib.postgres.fields``."

msgid "Indexing these fields"
msgstr "Na réimsí seo a innéacsú"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.Index` and :attr:`.Field.db_index` both create a B-"
"tree index, which isn't particularly helpful when querying complex data "
"types. Indexes such as :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GinIndex` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GistIndex` are better suited, "
"though the index choice is dependent on the queries that you're using. "
"Generally, GiST may be a good choice for the :ref:`range fields <range-"
"fields>` and :class:`HStoreField`, and GIN may be helpful "
"for :class:`ArrayField`."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.db.models.index` agus:attr: `.field.db_index` cruthaíonn "
"innéacs B-tree araon, rud nach bhfuil cabhrach go háirithe agus cineálacha "
"casta sonraí á bhfiosrú. Tá innéacsanna mar: class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.ginIndex` agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.indexes.gistIndex` oiriúnach níos fearr, cé go "
"bhfuil an rogha innéacs ag brath ar na ceisteanna atá á úsáid agat. Go "
"ginearálta, d'fhéadfadh gur rogha maith é GiST do na réimsí: ref: `raon "
"`agus:class:` <range-fields>hStorefield`, agus d'fhéadfadh GIN a bheith "
"cabhrach d':class: `ArrayField`."

msgid "``ArrayField``"
msgstr "``Arrayfield``"

msgid ""
"A field for storing lists of data. Most field types can be used, and you "
"pass another field instance as the :attr:`base_field "
"<ArrayField.base_field>`. You may also specify a :attr:`size "
"<ArrayField.size>`. ``ArrayField`` can be nested to store multi-dimensional "
"arrays."
msgstr ""
"Réimse chun liostaí sonraí a stóráil. <ArrayField.base_field>Is féidir an "
"chuid is mó de na cineálacha réimse a úsáid, agus téann tú sampla réimse "
"eile mar an:attr: `base_field `. <ArrayField.size>Féadfaidh tú a: attr: "
"`size `a shonrú freisin. Is féidir ``Arrayfield`` a neadadh chun eagair "
"ilthoiseach a stóráil."

msgid ""
"If you give the field a :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.default`, ensure it's "
"a callable such as ``list`` (for an empty default) or a callable that "
"returns a list (such as a function). Incorrectly using ``default=[]`` "
"creates a mutable default that is shared between all instances of "
"``ArrayField``."
msgstr ""
"Má thugann tú an réimse a:attr: `~django.db.models.field.default`, déan "
"cinnte go bhfuil sé inghlaonta mar `liost`` (le haghaidh réamhshocraithe "
"folamh) nó inghlaonta a thugann liosta (mar shampla feidhm). Trí úsáid "
"mícheart ``default= [] ``cruthaíonn réamhshocrú inathraithe a roinntear idir "
"gach cás de ``ArrayField``."

msgid "This is a required argument."
msgstr "Is argóint riachtanach é seo."

msgid ""
"Specifies the underlying data type and behavior for the array. It should be "
"an instance of a subclass of :class:`~django.db.models.Field`. For example, "
"it could be an :class:`~django.db.models.IntegerField` or "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.CharField`. Most field types are permitted, with "
"the exception of those handling relational data "
"(:class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey`, :class:`~django.db.models.OneToOneField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField`) and file fields "
"(:class:`~django.db.models.FileField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.ImageField`)."
msgstr ""

