"It is possible to nest array fields - you can specify an instance of "
"``ArrayField`` as the ``base_field``. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir réimsí eagar a neadú - is féidir leat sampla de ``Arrayfield`` a "
"shonrú mar an ``base_field``. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Transformation of values between the database and the model, validation of "
"data and configuration, and serialization are all delegated to the "
"underlying base field."
msgstr ""
"Tarmligtear claochlú luachanna idir an bunachar sonraí agus an tsamhail, "
"bailíochtú sonraí agus cumraíocht, agus sraitheadh go léir chuig an réimse "
"bunúsach."

msgid "This is an optional argument."
msgstr "Is argóint roghnach é seo."

msgid ""
"If passed, the array will have a maximum size as specified. This will be "
"passed to the database, although PostgreSQL at present does not enforce the "
"restriction."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé á rith, beidh uasmhéid ag an eagar mar a shonraítear. Cuirfear é "
"seo ar aghaidh chuig an mbunachar sonraí, cé nach bhforfheidhmíonn "
"PostgreSQL an srian faoi láthair."

msgid ""
"When nesting ``ArrayField``, whether you use the ``size`` parameter or not, "
