msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag neadú ``Arrayfield`, cibé an úsáideann tú an paraiméadar ``méid "
"``nó nach bhfuil, éilíonn PostgreSQL go mbeidh na eagair dronuilleogach:"

msgid ""
"If irregular shapes are required, then the underlying field should be made "
"nullable and the values padded with ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Má theastaíonn cruthanna neamhrialta, ansin ba chóir an réimse bunúsach a "
