"luachanna a rith. Úsáideann sé an oibreoir SQL ``@> ``. Mar shampla:"

msgid "``contained_by``"
msgstr "``coinneáilteo_ag``"

msgid ""
"This is the inverse of the :lookup:`contains <arrayfield.contains>` lookup - "
"the objects returned will be those where the data is a subset of the values "
"passed. It uses the SQL operator ``<@``. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Is é seo an inbhéar den chuardach: lookup: `conté <arrayfield.contains>`- is "
"iad na rudaí a chuirtear ar ais iad na rudaí ina bhfo-thacar de na luachanna "
"a rith iad na sonraí. Úsáideann sé an oibreoir SQL ``<@``. Mar shampla:"

msgid "``overlap``"
msgstr "```overlap``"

