msgstr ""
"Tugann rudaí ar ais ina roinneann na sonraí aon torthaí leis na luachanna a "
"rith. Úsáideann an t-oibreoir SQL ``&&``. Mar shampla:"

msgid "``len``"
msgstr "```len``"

msgid ""
"Returns the length of the array. The lookups available afterward are those "
