msgstr "agus ``NumericRange``:"

msgid "Containment functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna srianta"

msgid ""
"As with other PostgreSQL fields, there are three standard containment "
"operators: ``contains``, ``contained_by`` and ``overlap``, using the SQL "
"operators ``@>``, ``<@``, and ``&&`` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Mar is amhlaidh le réimsí PostgreSQL eile, tá trí oibreoir srianta "
"caighdeánacha ann: ``contains``, `contained_by`` agus ``overlap``, ag baint "
"úsáide as na hoibreoirí SQL ``@>``, ``<@``, agus ``&&`` faoi seach."

msgid ""
"The ``contained_by`` lookup is also available on the non-range field "
"types: :class:`~django.db.models.SmallAutoField`, :class:`~django.db.models.AutoField`, :class:`~django.db.models.BigAutoField`, :class:`~django.db.models.SmallIntegerField`, :class:`~django.db.models.IntegerField`, :class:`~django.db.models.BigIntegerField`, :class:`~django.db.models.DecimalField`, :class:`~django.db.models.FloatField`, :class:`~django.db.models.DateField`, "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.DateTimeField`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an cuardach ``contained_by`` ar fáil freisin ar na cineálacha réimse "
"neamh-raon: :class: `~django.db.models.smallAutofield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.autofield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.bigautofield`, :class: `~django.db.models.smallintefield` "
"eld`, :class: `~django.db.models.integerfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.bigintegerfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.decimalfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.floatfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.db.models.db.DateField`, agus:aicme: "
"`~Django.db.Models.DateTimeField`. Mar shampla:"

msgid "Comparison functions"
msgstr "feidhmeanna comparáide"

msgid ""
"Range fields support the standard "
"lookups: :lookup:`lt`, :lookup:`gt`, :lookup:`lte` and :lookup:`gte`. These "
"are not particularly helpful - they compare the lower bounds first and then "
"the upper bounds only if necessary. This is also the strategy used to order "
"by a range field. It is better to use the specific range comparison "
"operators."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn réimsí raon leis na cuardaigh chaighdeánacha: :lookup: "
"`lt`, :lookup: `gt`, :lookup: `lte` agus:lookup: `gte`. Níl siad seo "
"cabhrach go háirithe - déanann siad comparáid idir na teorainneacha "
"íochtaracha ar dtús agus ansin na teorainneacha uachtaracha ach amháin más "
"gá. Is í seo freisin an straitéis a úsáidtear chun ordú ag réimse raon. Is "
"fearr na hoibreoirí comparáide raon sonracha a úsáid."

msgid "``fully_lt``"
msgstr "```go hiomlán_lt``"

msgid ""
"The returned ranges are strictly less than the passed range. In other words, "
"all the points in the returned range are less than all those in the passed "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Tá na raonta a thugtar ar ais níos lú ná an raon rith. Is é sin le rá, tá na "
"pointí go léir sa raon ar ais níos lú ná iad siúd go léir sa raon rith."

msgid "``fully_gt``"
msgstr "``go hiomlán_gt``"

msgid ""
"The returned ranges are strictly greater than the passed range. In other "
"words, the all the points in the returned range are greater than all those "
"in the passed range."
msgstr ""
"Tá na raonta ar ais níos mó go docht ná an raon rith. Is é sin le rá, tá na "
"pointí go léir sa raon ar ais níos mó ná iad siúd go léir sa raon rith."

msgid "``not_lt``"
msgstr "```not_lt``"

msgid ""
"The returned ranges do not contain any points less than the passed range, "
"that is the lower bound of the returned range is at least the lower bound of "
"the passed range."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon phointí níos lú ná an raon rith sna raonta ar ais, is é sin an "
"teorainn íochtarach den raon a thugtar ar ais an teorainn íochtarach den "
"raon rith ar a laghad."

msgid "``not_gt``"
msgstr "```ní gt``"

msgid ""
"The returned ranges do not contain any points greater than the passed range, "
"that is the upper bound of the returned range is at most the upper bound of "
"the passed range."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon phointí níos mó ná an raon rith sna raonta ar ais, is é sin an "
"teorainn uachtarach den raon a thugtar ar ais an teorainn uachtarach den "
"raon rith ar a mhéad."

msgid "``adjacent_to``"
msgstr "``in aice láimhe ``"

msgid "The returned ranges share a bound with the passed range."
msgstr "Roinneann na raonta a thugtar ar ais ceangailte leis an raon rith."

msgid "Querying using the bounds"
msgstr "Fiosrú ag baint úsáide as na teorainneacha"

msgid "Range fields support several extra lookups."
msgstr "Tacaíonn réimsí raon le roinnt cuardaigh bhreise."

msgid "``startswith``"
msgstr "``tosaíonn leis ``"

msgid ""
"Returned objects have the given lower bound. Can be chained to valid lookups "
"for the base field."
msgstr ""
"Tá an teorainn íochtarach tugtha ag rudaí ar ais. Is féidir é a shlabhraithe "
"le cuardaigh bailí don bhunréimse."

msgid "``endswith``"
msgstr "``Críochnaíonn ``"

msgid ""
"Returned objects have the given upper bound. Can be chained to valid lookups "
"for the base field."
msgstr ""
"Tá an teorainn uachtarach tugtha ag rudaí ar ais. Is féidir é a shlabhraithe "
"le cuardaigh bailí don bhunréimse."

msgid ""
"Returned objects are empty ranges. Can be chained to valid lookups for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.BooleanField`."
msgstr ""
"Is raonta folamh iad rudaí ar ais. Is féidir é a shlabhraithe le cuardaigh "
"bailí do a:class: `~django.db.models.booleanfield`."

msgid "``lower_inc``"
msgstr "```lower_inc``"

msgid ""
"Returns objects that have inclusive or exclusive lower bounds, depending on "
"the boolean value passed. Can be chained to valid lookups for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.BooleanField`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé rudaí ar ais a bhfuil teorainneacha íochtaracha cuimsitheacha nó "
"eisiacha acu, ag brath ar an luach boolean a rith. Is féidir é a "
"shlabhraithe le cuardaigh bailí do a:class: `~django.db.models.booleanfield`."

msgid "``lower_inf``"
msgstr "``inf_níos ísle ``"

msgid ""
"Returns objects that have unbounded (infinite) or bounded lower bound, "
"depending on the boolean value passed. Can be chained to valid lookups for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.BooleanField`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé rudaí ar ais a bhfuil srian níos ísle neamhtheoranta (gan "
"teorainn) nó teoranta acu, ag brath ar an luach boolean a rith. Is féidir é "
"a shlabhraithe le cuardaigh bailí do a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.booleanfield`."

msgid "``upper_inc``"
msgstr "``uachtar_inc``"

msgid ""
"Returns objects that have inclusive or exclusive upper bounds, depending on "
"the boolean value passed. Can be chained to valid lookups for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.BooleanField`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé rudaí ar ais a bhfuil teorainneacha uachtaracha cuimsitheacha nó "
"eisiacha acu, ag brath ar an luach boolean a rith. Is féidir é a "
"shlabhraithe le cuardaigh bailí do a:class: `~django.db.models.booleanfield`."

msgid "``upper_inf``"
msgstr "``uachtar_inf``"

msgid ""
"Returns objects that have unbounded (infinite) or bounded upper bound, "
"depending on the boolean value passed. Can be chained to valid lookups for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.BooleanField`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais rudaí a bhfuil srian uachtarach neamhtheoranta (gan "
"teorainn) nó teoranta acu, ag brath ar an luach boolean a rith. Is féidir é "
"a shlabhraithe le cuardaigh bailí do a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.booleanfield`."

msgid "Defining your own range types"
msgstr "Sainmhíniú do chineálacha raon féin"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL allows the definition of custom range types. Django's model and "
"form field implementations use base classes below, and ``psycopg`` provides "
"a :func:`~psycopg:psycopg.types.range.register_range` to allow use of custom "
"range types."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn PostgreSQL sainmhíniú ar chineálacha raon saincheaptha. Úsáideann "
"forfheidhmithe réimse samhail agus foirme Django bunaicmí thíos, agus "
"soláthraíonn ``psycopg`` a:func: "
"`~psycopg:psycopg.types.range.register_range` chun cineálacha raon "
"saincheaptha a úsáid."

msgid "Base class for model range fields."
msgstr "Aicme bonn do réimsí raon samhail."

msgid "The model field class to use."
msgstr "An rang réimse samhail le húsáid."

msgid "The range type to use."
msgstr "An cineál raon le húsáid."

msgid ""
"The form field class to use. Should be a subclass "
"of :class:`django.contrib.postgres.forms.BaseRangeField`."
msgstr ""
"An rang réimse foirm le húsáid. Ba chóir go mbeadh fo-aicme de:class: "
"`Django.Contrib.Postgres.Forms.BaseRangeField`."

msgid "Base class for form range fields."
msgstr "Aicme bonn do réimsí raon foirme."

msgid "The form field to use."
msgstr "An réimse foirme le húsáid."

msgid "Range operators"
msgstr "Oibreoirí raon"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL provides a set of SQL operators that can be used together with "
"the range data types (see `the PostgreSQL documentation for the full details "
"of range operators <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ functions-"
"range.html#RANGE-OPERATORS-TABLE>`_). This class is meant as a convenient "
"method to avoid typos. The operator names overlap with the names of "
"corresponding lookups."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ functions-range.html #RANGE "
"-OPERATORS-TABLE>Soláthraíonn PostgreSQL sraith oibreoirí SQL is féidir a "
"úsáid in éineacht leis na cineálacha sonraí raon (féach `doiciméadú "
"PostgreSQL le haghaidh sonraí iomlána oibreoirí raon `_). Tá an rang seo i "
"gceist mar mhodh áisiúil chun clóscríobh a sheachaint. Forluíonn ainmneacha "
"na n-oibreoirí le hainmneacha cuardaigh comhfhreagracha."

msgid "RangeBoundary() expressions"
msgstr "RangeBoundary () abairtí"

msgid ""
"If ``True`` (default), the lower bound is inclusive ``'['``, otherwise it's "
"exclusive ``'('``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``True`` (réamhshocraithe), tá an teorainn íochtarach cuimsitheach "
"``'['`, ar shlí eile is``' eisiach é ('``."

msgid ""
"If ``False`` (default), the upper bound is exclusive ``')'``, otherwise it's "
"inclusive ``']'``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``False`` (réamhshocraithe), is é an teorainn uachtarach eisiach ``') "
"'``, ar shlí eile tá sé chuimsitheach``'] '`."

msgid ""
"A ``RangeBoundary()`` expression represents the range boundaries. It can be "
"used with a custom range functions that expected boundaries, for example to "
"define :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.constraints.ExclusionConstraint`. "
"See `the PostgreSQL documentation for the full details <https://"
"www.postgresql.org/ docs/current/rangetypes.html#RANGETYPES-INCLUSIVITY>`_."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn abairt ``rangeboundary () ``teorainneacha na raon. Is féidir é a "
"úsáid le feidhmeanna raon saincheaptha a raibh súil le teorainneacha, mar "
"shampla chun sainmhíniú:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.restricints.ExclusionConstraint`. < https://"
"www.postgresql.org/ docs/current/rangetypes.html #RANGETYPES "
"-INCLUSIVITY>Féach `doiciméadú PostgreSQL le haghaidh na sonraí iomlána`_."

msgid "PostgreSQL specific form fields and widgets"
msgstr "Réimsí foirme agus giuirléidí sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"All of these fields and widgets are available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.forms`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá na réimsí agus na giuirléidí seo go léir ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.forms``."

msgid "``SimpleArrayField``"
msgstr "``Simplearrayfield``"

msgid ""
"A field which maps to an array. It is represented by an HTML ``<input>``."
msgstr "Réimse a dhéanann mapáil chuig eagar. Léirítear é ag HTML <input>```."

msgid ""
"It specifies the underlying form field for the array. This is not used to "
"render any HTML, but it is used to process the submitted data and validate "
"it. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn sé an réimse foirme bhunúsach don eagar. Ní úsáidtear é seo chun "
"aon HTML a rinneadh, ach úsáidtear é chun na sonraí a chuirtear isteach a "
"phróiseáil agus iad a bhailíochtú. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"This is an optional argument which defaults to a comma: ``,``. This value is "
"used to split the submitted data. It allows you to chain "
"``SimpleArrayField`` for multidimensional data:"
msgstr ""
"Is argóint roghnach é seo a réamhshocraíonn camóg: ``,``. Úsáidtear an luach "
"seo chun na sonraí curtha isteach a roinnt. Ligeann sé duit "
"``SimpleArrayField` a shlánú le haghaidh sonraí ilthoiseach:"

msgid ""
"The field does not support escaping of the delimiter, so be careful in cases "
"where the delimiter is a valid character in the underlying field. The "
"delimiter does not need to be only one character."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an réimse le éalú ón teorannaire, mar sin bí cúramach i "
"gcásanna ina bhfuil an teorannaitheoir ina charachtar bailí sa réimse "
"bunúsach. Ní gá go mbeadh an teorannaitheoir ach carachtar amháin."

msgid ""
"This is an optional argument which validates that the array does not exceed "
"the stated length."
msgstr ""
"Is argóint roghnach é seo a bhailíochtaíonn nach sáraíonn an tsraith an fad "
"luaite."

msgid ""
"This is an optional argument which validates that the array reaches at least "
"the stated length."
msgstr ""
"Is argóint roghnach é seo a bhailíochtaíonn go sroicheann an t-eagar an fad "
"luaite ar a laghad."

msgid "User friendly forms"
msgstr "Foirmeacha atá cairdiúil don"

msgid ""
"``SimpleArrayField`` is not particularly user friendly in most cases, "
"however it is a useful way to format data from a client-side widget for "
"submission to the server."
msgstr ""
"Níl `SimpleArrayField ``an-chairdiúil le húsáid i bhformhór na gcásanna, ach "
"is bealach úsáideach é chun sonraí a fhormáidiú ó ghuirléid taobh an "
"chliaint le cur isteach chuig an bhfreastalaí."

msgid "``SplitArrayField``"
msgstr "``SplitarrayField``"

msgid ""
"This field handles arrays by reproducing the underlying field a fixed number "
"of times."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann an réimse seo eagair tríd an réimse bunúsach a atáirgeadh líon "
"seasta uaireanta"

msgid ""
"This is a required argument. It specifies the form field to be repeated."
msgstr ""
"Is argóint riachtanach é seo. Sonraíonn sé an réimse foirme atá le "
"hathdhéanamh arís."

msgid "This is the fixed number of times the underlying field will be used."
msgstr "Is é seo an líon seasta uaireanta a úsáidfear an réimse bunúsach."

msgid ""
"By default, this is set to ``False``. When ``False``, each value from the "
"repeated fields is stored. When set to ``True``, any trailing values which "
"are blank will be stripped from the result. If the underlying field has "
"``required=True``, but ``remove_trailing_nulls`` is ``True``, then null "
"values are only allowed at the end, and will be stripped."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, tá sé seo socraithe go ``False``. Nuair a bhíonn "
"“False”, stóráiltear gach luach ó na réimsí arís agus arís eile. Nuair a "
"bheidh sé socraithe go “True”, bainfear aon luachanna rianacha atá bán as an "
"toradh. Má tá ``required=True`` sa réimse bunúsach, ach is é ```True`` "
"`remove_trailing_nulls``, ansin ní cheadaítear luachanna null ach ag an "
"deireadh, agus scriosfar iad."

msgid "Some examples::"
msgstr "Roinnt samplaí::"

msgid ""
"A field which accepts JSON encoded data for "
"an :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField`. It casts all values "
"(except nulls) to strings. It is represented by an HTML ``<textarea>``."
msgstr ""
"Réimse a ghlacann le sonraí ionchódaithe JSON le haghaidh an:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hStoreField`. Caitheann sé gach luach "
"(seachas neamhaill) chuig teaghráin. Léirítear é ag HTML <textarea>```."

msgid ""
"``HStoreField`` is not particularly user friendly in most cases, however it "
"is a useful way to format data from a client-side widget for submission to "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"Níl `hStorefield ``an-chairdiúil le húsáid i bhformhór na gcásanna, ach is "
"bealach úsáideach é chun sonraí a fhormáidiú ó ghuirléid taobh an chliaint "
"le cur isteach chuig an bhfreastalaí."

msgid ""
"This group of fields all share similar functionality for accepting range "
"data. They are based on :class:`~django.forms.MultiValueField`. They treat "
"one omitted value as an unbounded range. They also validate that the lower "
"bound is not greater than the upper bound. All of these fields "
"use :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.forms.RangeWidget`."
msgstr ""
"Tá feidhmiúlacht chosúil ag an ngrúpa réimsí seo go léir chun glacadh le "
"sonraí ra Tá siad bunaithe ar:class: `~django.forms.MultivalueField`. "
"Déileálann siad le luach amháin a fhágtar amach mar raon neamhtheoranta. "
"Bailíonn siad freisin nach bhfuil an teorainn íochtarach níos mó ná an "
"teorainn uachtarach. Úsáideann na réimsí seo go léir:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.forms.rangeWidget`."

msgid ""
"Based on :class:`~django.forms.IntegerField` and translates its input into "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.NumericRange``. Default "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.IntegerRangeField` "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.BigIntegerRangeField`."
msgstr ""
"Bunaithe ar:class: `~django.forms.IntegerField` agus aistríonn a ionchur go "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.numericRange``. Réamhshocraithe "
"le haghaidh: aicme: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.IntegerRangeField` "
"agus:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.bigintegerRangeField`."

msgid ""
"Based on :class:`~django.forms.DecimalField` and translates its input into "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.NumericRange``. Default "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DecimalRangeField`."
msgstr ""
"Bunaithe ar:class: `~Django.Forms.DecimalField` agus aistríonn a ionchur go "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.numericRange``. Réamhshocraithe "
"le haghaidh: aicme: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DecimalRangeField`."

msgid ""
"Based on :class:`~django.forms.DateTimeField` and translates its input into "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.DateTimeTZRange``. Default "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DateTimeRangeField`."
msgstr ""
"Bunaithe ar:class: `~django.forms.DateTimeField` agus aistríonn a ionchur go "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.DateTimetzRange``. "
"Réamhshocraithe le haghaidh: aicme: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.dateTimeRangeField`."

msgid ""
"Based on :class:`~django.forms.DateField` and translates its input into "
"``django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.DateRange``. Default "
"for :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DateRangeField`."
msgstr ""
"Bunaithe ar:class: `~Django.Forms.DateField` agus aistríonn a ionchur go "
"``Django.db.backends.postgresql.psycopg_any.daterange``. Réamhshocraithe le "
"haghaidh: aicme: `~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DateRangeField`."

msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "Giuirléidí"

msgid "``RangeWidget``"
msgstr "``RangeWidget``"

msgid ""
"Widget used by all of the range fields. Based "
"on :class:`~django.forms.MultiWidget`."
msgstr ""
"Giuirléid a úsáideann gach ceann de na réimsí raon. Bunaithe ar:aicme: "
"`~django.forms.multiwidget`."

msgid ":class:`~RangeWidget` has one required argument:"
msgstr ":class: Tá argóint amháin riachtanach ag `~RangeWidget`:"

msgid "A :class:`~RangeWidget` comprises a 2-tuple of ``base_widget``."
msgstr "A: Aicme: Cuimsíonn `~ RangeWidget` 2-tuple de ``base_widget``."

msgid ""
"Takes a single \"compressed\" value of a field, for example "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DateRangeField`, and returns a "
"tuple representing a lower and upper bound."
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé luach amháin “comhbhrúite” de réimse, mar shampla a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.DateRangeField`, agus filleann sé tuipéar a "
"léiríonn ceann íochtarach agus uachtarach."

msgid "PostgreSQL specific database functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna bunachar sonraí sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"All of these functions are available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.functions`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá na feidhmeanna seo go léir ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.functions``."

msgid "``RandomUUID``"
msgstr "``Randamuuid``"

msgid "Returns a version 4 UUID."
msgstr "Tugann leagan 4 UUID ar ais."

msgid "Usage example:"
msgstr "Sampla úsáide:"

msgid "``TransactionNow``"
msgstr "``Idirghníomhaíochtaí Anois ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the date and time on the database server that the current "
"transaction started. If you are not in a transaction it will return the date "
"and time of the current statement. This is a complement "
"to :class:`django.db.models.functions.Now`, which returns the date and time "
"of the current statement."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an dáta agus an t-am ar an bhfreastalaí bunachar sonraí a thosaigh "
"an t-idirbheart reatha. Mura bhfuil tú i idirbheart, cuirfidh sé dáta agus "
"am an ráiteas reatha ar ais. Is comhlánú é seo la:class: "
"`Django.db.Models.Functions.Now`, a thugann dáta agus am an ráiteas reatha "
"ar ais."

msgid ""
"Note that only the outermost call to :func:`~django.db.transaction.atomic()` "
"sets up a transaction and thus sets the time that ``TransactionNow()`` will "
"return; nested calls create savepoints which do not affect the transaction "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach gcuireann ach an glao is seachtrach to:func: "
"`~django.db.transaction.atomic () `idirbheart ar bun agus dá bhrí sin "
"socraíonn sé an t-am a fhillfidh ``TransactionNow () ``; cruthaíonn glaonna "
"neadaithe pointí sábhála nach ndéanann difear don am idirbheart."

msgid "``django.contrib.postgres``"
msgstr "``django.contrib.postgres``"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL has a number of features which are not shared by the other "
"databases Django supports. This optional module contains model fields and "
"form fields for a number of PostgreSQL specific data types."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt gnéithe ag PostgreSQL nach bhfuil roinnte ag na bunachair sonraí "
"eile a thacaíonn Django. Tá réimsí samhlacha agus réimsí foirme sa mhodúl "
"roghnach seo do roinnt cineálacha sonraí sonraí sonracha PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Django is, and will continue to be, a database-agnostic web framework. We "
"would encourage those writing reusable applications for the Django community "
"to write database-agnostic code where practical. However, we recognize that "
"real world projects written using Django need not be database-agnostic. In "
"fact, once a project reaches a given size changing the underlying data store "
"is already a significant challenge and is likely to require changing the "
"code base in some ways to handle differences between the data stores."
msgstr ""
"Is creat gréasáin agnóstach bunachar sonraí é, agus leanfaidh sé de Django. "
"Spreagfaimis iad siúd a scríobhann feidhmchláir in-athúsáidte do phobal "
"Django cód bunachar sonraí agnóstach a scríobh nuair a bhíonn sé pra "
"Aithnímid, áfach, nach gá go mbeadh tionscadail an domhain fíor atá scríofa "
"ag baint úsáide as Django a bheith agnasach bunachar Déanta na fírinne, "
"nuair a shroicheann tionscadal méid áirithe is dúshlán suntasach cheana féin "
"é an stór sonraí bunúsach a athrú agus is dócha go mbeidh gá leis an mbonn "
"cód a athrú ar bhealaí éigin chun difríochtaí idir na siopaí sonraí"

msgid ""
"Django provides support for a number of data types which will only work with "
"PostgreSQL. There is no fundamental reason why (for example) a "
"``contrib.mysql`` module does not exist, except that PostgreSQL has the "
"richest feature set of the supported databases so its users have the most to "
"gain."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django tacaíocht do roinnt cineálacha sonraí nach n-oibreoidh "
"ach le PostgreSQL. Níl aon chúis bunúsach ann nach bhfuil modúl "
"``contrib.mysql` ann (mar shampla), ach amháin go bhfuil an tacar gné is "
"saibhre de na bunachair sonraí tacaithe ag PostgreSQL ionas go mbeidh an "
"chuid is mó le fáil dá úsáideoirí."

msgid "PostgreSQL specific model indexes"
msgstr "Innéacsanna samhail sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"The following are PostgreSQL specific :doc:`indexes </ref/models/indexes>` "
"available from the ``django.contrib.postgres.indexes`` module."
msgstr ""
"Is iad seo a leanas sonrach PostgreSQL: doc: `indexes` atá ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.indexes`` </ref/models/indexes>."

msgid "``BloomIndex``"
msgstr "``Bloomindex ``"

msgid "Creates a bloom_ index."
msgstr "Cruthaíonn innéacs blá_."

msgid ""
"To use this index access you need to activate the bloom_ extension on "
"PostgreSQL. You can install it using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.BloomExtension` migration "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Chun an rochtain innéacs seo a úsáid ní mór duit an síneadh bloom_ a "
"ghníomhachtú ar PostgreSQL. Is féidir leat é a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as "
"oibríocht imirce:: class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.bloomextension`."

msgid ""
"Provide an integer number of bits from 1 to 4096 to the ``length`` parameter "
"to specify the length of each index entry. PostgreSQL's default is 80."
msgstr ""
"Cuir líon sláireach giotán ó 1 go 4096 ar fáil go dtí an paraiméadar ``fad "
"``chun fad gach iontráil innéacs a shonrú. Is é 80 réamhshocraithe "
"PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"The ``columns`` argument takes a tuple or list of up to 32 values that are "
"integer number of bits from 1 to 4095."
msgstr ""
"Tógann an argóint ``colúna`` tuple nó liosta de suas le 32 luach atá ina "
"líon slámhshláir giotán ó 1 go 4095."

msgid "``BrinIndex``"
msgstr "``Brinindex ``"

msgid ""
"Creates a `BRIN index <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/brin.html>`_."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Set the ``autosummarize`` parameter to ``True`` to enable `automatic "
"summarization`_ to be performed by autovacuum."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``autoresumize`` go `True`` chun go mbeidh `achoimre "
"uathoibríoch `_ a dhéanamh le autovacuum."

msgid "The ``pages_per_range`` argument takes a positive integer."
msgstr "Glacann an argóint ``pages_per_range`` sláimhir dhearfach."

msgid "``BTreeIndex``"
msgstr "``Btreeindex``"

msgid "Creates a B-Tree index."
msgstr "Cruthaíonn innéacs B-Tree."

msgid ""
"Provide an integer value from 10 to 100 to the fillfactor_ parameter to tune "
"how packed the index pages will be. PostgreSQL's default is 90."
msgstr ""
"Cuir luach sláimhir ó 10 go 100 ar fáil don pharaiméadar fillfactor_ chun a "
"thiúnadh cé chomh pacáilte a bheidh na leathanaigh innéacs. Is é 90 "
"réamhshocraithe PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Provide a boolean value to the deduplicate_items_ parameter to control "
"whether deduplication is enabled. PostgreSQL enables deduplication by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Cuir luach boolean ar fáil don pharaiméadar deduplicate_items_ chun a rialú "
"an bhfuil deduplication cumasaithe. Cumasaíonn PostgreSQL dídhúbailt de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid "The ``deduplicate_items`` parameter was added."
msgstr "Cuireadh an paraiméadar `deduplicate_items`` leis."

msgid "``GinIndex``"
msgstr "``Ginindex ``"

msgid ""
"Creates a `gin index <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gin.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gin.html>Cruthaíonn innéacs `gin "
"`_."

msgid ""
"To use this index on data types not in the `built-in operator classes "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gin.html#GIN-BUILTIN-OPCLASSES>`_, "
"you need to activate the `btree_gin extension <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/btree-gin.html>`_ on PostgreSQL. You can install it using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.BtreeGinExtension` migration "
"operation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Set the ``fastupdate`` parameter to ``False`` to disable the `GIN Fast "
"Update Technique`_ that's enabled by default in PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``fastupdate`` go `False`` chun an `GIN Fast Update "
"Technique`_ atá cumasaithe de réir réamhshocraithe i PostgreSQL a dhíchumasú."

msgid ""
"Provide an integer number of kilobytes to the gin_pending_list_limit_ "
"parameter to tune the maximum size of the GIN pending list which is used "
"when ``fastupdate`` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Cuir líon sláimhir cileobaití ar fáil don pharaiméadar "
"gin_pending_list_limit_ chun uasmhéid an liosta GIN ar feitheamh a úsáidtear "
"nuair a chumasaítear ``fastupdate``."

msgid "``GistIndex``"
msgstr "``Innéacs Gist``"

msgid ""
"Creates a `GiST index <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gist.html>`_. "
"These indexes are automatically created on spatial fields "
"with :attr:`spatial_index=True "
"<django.contrib.gis.db.models.BaseSpatialField.spatial_index>`. They're also "
"useful on other types, such "
"as :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` or the :ref:`range "
"fields <range-fields>`."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gist.html>Cruthaíonn innéacs `Gist "
"`_. <django.contrib.gis.db.models.BaseSpatialField.spatial_index>Cruthaítear "
"na hinnéacsanna seo go huathoibríoch ar réimsí spásúla le:attr: "
"`spatial_index = true `. <range-fields>Tá siad úsáideach freisin ar "
"chineálacha eile, mar shampla:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hstorefield` nó na:ref: `réimsí raon `."

msgid ""
"To use this index on data types not in the built-in `gist operator classes "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/gist.html#GIST-BUILTIN-"
"OPCLASSES>`_, you need to activate the `btree_gist extension <https://"
"www.postgresql.org/docs/current/btree-gist.html>`_ on PostgreSQL. You can "
"install it using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.BtreeGistExtension` "
"migration operation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Set the ``buffering`` parameter to ``True`` or ``False`` to manually enable "
"or disable `buffering build`_ of the index."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``maolánach`` go `True`` nó ``False`` chun `tógáil "
"maolánai`_ an innéacs a chumasú nó a dhíchumasú de láimh."

msgid "``HashIndex``"
msgstr "``HashIndex``"

msgid "Creates a hash index."
msgstr "Cruthaíonn innéacs hash."

msgid "``SpGistIndex``"
msgstr "``Innéacs SPGIST``"

msgid ""
"Creates an `SP-GiST index <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/"
"spgist.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/spgist.html>Cruthaíonn innéacs `SP-"
"Gist `_."

msgid "``OpClass()`` expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ``opClass () ``"

msgid ""
"An ``OpClass()`` expression represents the ``expression`` with a custom "
"`operator class`_ that can be used to define functional indexes, functional "
"unique constraints, or exclusion constraints. To use it, you need to add "
"``'django.contrib.postgres'`` in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`. Set the "
"``name`` parameter to the name of the `operator class`_."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn abairt ``opClass () ``an `léiriú ``léirithe`` le `rang oibreora `_ "
"saincheaptha is féidir a úsáid chun innéacsanna feidhmiúla, srianta uathúla "
"feidhmiúla, nó srianta eisiaimh a shainiú. Chun é a úsáid, ní mór duit "
"``'django.contrib.postgres'`` a chur i d':setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`. "
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``ainm ``ar ainm an `ranga oibreora `_."

msgid ""
"creates an index on ``Lower('username')`` using ``varchar_pattern_ops``. ::"
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn innéacs ar ``Lower ('username') ``ag baint úsáide as "
"``varchar_pattern_ops`` . ::"

msgid ""
"creates a unique constraint on ``Upper('description')`` using "
"``text_pattern_ops``. ::"
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn srian uathúil ar ``Uachtarach ('cur síos') ``ag baint úsáide as "
"``text_pattern_ops`` . ::"

msgid "PostgreSQL specific lookups"
msgstr "Cuardaigh sonracha PostgreSQL"

msgid "Trigram similarity"
msgstr "Cosúlacht Trigram"

msgid "``trigram_similar``"
msgstr "``trigram_cosúil ``"

msgid ""
"The ``trigram_similar`` lookup allows you to perform trigram lookups, "
"measuring the number of trigrams (three consecutive characters) shared, "
"using a dedicated PostgreSQL extension. A trigram lookup is given an "
"expression and returns results that have a similarity measurement greater "
"than the current similarity threshold."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an cuardach ``trigram_similar`` duit cuardaigh trigram a dhéanamh, "
"ag tomhas líon na dtrigram (trí charachtar as a chéile) a roinntear, ag "
"baint úsáide as síneadh tiomnaithe PostgreSQL. Tugtar léiriú do chuardach "
"trigram agus tugann sé torthaí a bhfuil tomhas cosúlachta níos mó acu ná an "
"tairseach cosúlachta reatha."

msgid ""
"To use it, add ``'django.contrib.postgres'`` in "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` and activate the `pg_trgm extension`_ on "
"PostgreSQL. You can install the extension using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.TrigramExtension` migration "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Chun é a úsáid, cuir ``django.contrib.postgres'`` i d:setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS` agus gníomhachtaigh an síneadh `pg_trgm `_ ar PostgreSQL. "
"Is féidir leat an síneadh a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as an oibríocht "
"imirce:class: `~django.contrib.postgres.operations.TrigramExtension`."

msgid ""
"The ``trigram_similar`` lookup can be used "
"on :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an cuardach ``trigram_similar`` a úsáid ar:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` agus:class: `~django.db.models.textfield`:"

msgid "``trigram_word_similar``"
msgstr "``trigram_word_similar``"

msgid ""
"The ``trigram_word_similar`` lookup allows you to perform trigram word "
"similarity lookups using a dedicated PostgreSQL extension. It can be "
"approximately understood as measuring the greatest number of trigrams shared "
"between the parameter and any substring of the field. A trigram word lookup "
"is given an expression and returns results that have a word similarity "
"measurement greater than the current similarity threshold."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an cuardach ``trigram_word_similar`` duit cuardach cosúlachta focal "
"trigram a dhéanamh ag baint úsáide as síneadh tiomnaithe PostgreSQL. Is "
"féidir é a thuiscint thart ar an líon is mó de thrigrams a roinntear idir an "
"paraiméadar agus aon fho-shreang den réimse a thomhas. Tugtar abairt do "
"chuardach focal trigram agus tugann sé torthaí ar ais a bhfuil tomhas "
"cosúlachta focal níos mó ná an tairseach cosúlachta reatha."

msgid ""
"The ``trigram_word_similar`` lookup can be used "
"on :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an cuardach ``trigram_word_similar`` a úsáid ar:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` agus:class: `~django.db.models.textfield`:"

msgid "``trigram_strict_word_similar``"
msgstr "``trigram_strict_word_similar``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :lookup:`trigram_word_similar`, except that it forces extent "
"boundaries to match word boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:lookup: `trigram_word_similar`, ach amháin go gcuireann sé i "
"bhfeidhm ar theorainneacha méid teorainneacha focal a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"The ``trigram_strict_word_similar`` lookup can be used "
"on :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an cuardach ``trigram_strict_word_similar`` a úsáid ar:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` agus:class: `~django.db.models.textfield`."

msgid "``Unaccent``"
msgstr "``Unacent``"

msgid ""
"The ``unaccent`` lookup allows you to perform accent-insensitive lookups "
"using a dedicated PostgreSQL extension."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an cuardach ``unaccent` duit cuardaigh neamh-íogair a dhéanamh ag "
"baint úsáide as síneadh tiomnaithe PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"This lookup is implemented using :class:`~django.db.models.Transform`, so it "
"can be chained with other lookup functions. To use it, you need to add "
"``'django.contrib.postgres'`` in your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` and activate "
"the `unaccent extension on PostgreSQL`_. "
"The :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.UnaccentExtension` migration "
"operation is available if you want to perform this activation using "
"migrations)."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an cuardach seo i bhfeidhm ag baint úsáid:class: "
"`~django.db.models.transform`, ionas gur féidir é a shlabhraithe le "
"feidhmeanna cuardaigh eile. Chun é a úsáid, ní mór duit "
"``django.contrib.postgres'` a chur isteach i do: setting: `INSTALLED_APPS` "
"agus an síneadh `unaccent ar PostgreSQL `_ a ghníomhachtú. Tá an oibríocht "
"imirce: Class: `~django.contrib.postgres.operations.unaccentextension` ar "
"fáil más mian leat an gníomhachtú seo a dhéanamh ag baint úsáide as imirce)."

msgid ""
"The ``unaccent`` lookup can be used on :class:`~django.db.models.CharField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an cuardach ``unaccent`` a úsáid ar:class: "
"`~django.db.models.charfield` agus:class: `~django.db.models.textfield`:"

msgid ""
"``unaccent`` lookups should perform fine in most use cases. However, queries "
"using this filter will generally perform full table scans, which can be slow "
"on large tables. In those cases, using dedicated full text indexing tools "
"might be appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh cuardaigh ``unaccent`` go breá i bhformhór na gcásanna "
"úsáide. Mar sin féin, is gnách go ndéanfaidh ceisteanna a úsáideann an "
"scagaire seo scananna tábla iomlána, ar féidir leo a bheith mall ar tháblaí "
"móra. Sna cásanna sin, d'fhéadfadh sé go mbeadh sé oiriúnach uirlisí "
"innéacsaíochta téacs iomlána"

msgid "Database migration operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí imirce bunachar"

msgid ""
"All of these :doc:`operations </ref/migration-operations>` are available "
"from the ``django.contrib.postgres.operations`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá gach ceann díobh seo: doc: `operations` ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.operations``. </ref/migration-operations>"

msgid "Creating extension using migrations"
msgstr "Síneadh a chruthú ag úsáid imirceanna"

msgid ""
"You can create a PostgreSQL extension in your database using a migration "
"file. This example creates an hstore extension, but the same principles "
"apply for other extensions."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat síneadh PostgreSQL a chruthú i do bhunachar sonraí ag baint "
"úsáide as comhad imirce. Cruthaíonn an sampla seo síneadh hstore, ach tá na "
"prionsabail chéanna i bhfeidhm maidir le síntí eile."

msgid ""
"Set up the hstore extension in PostgreSQL before the first ``CreateModel`` "
"or ``AddField`` operation that "
"involves :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.HStoreField` by adding a "
"migration with "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.HStoreExtension` operation. "
"For example::"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an síneadh hstore i PostgreSQL roimh an gcéad oibríocht "
"``CreateModel`` nó `AddField`` a bhaineann lena mbain:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.hStorefield` trí imirce a chur leis an "
"oibríocht: :class: `~django.contrib.postgres.operations.hStoreExtension`. "
"Mar shampla::"

msgid "The operation skips adding the extension if it already exists."
msgstr "Sceapann an oibríocht an síneadh a chur leis má tá sé ann cheana féin."

msgid ""
"For most extensions, this requires a database user with superuser "
"privileges. If the Django database user doesn't have the appropriate "
"privileges, you'll have to create the extension outside of Django migrations "
"with a user that has them. In that case, connect to your Django database and "
"run the query ``CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS hstore;``."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le formhór na síntí, éilíonn sé seo úsáideoir bunachar sonraí le "
"pribhléidí superuser Mura bhfuil na pribhléidí cuí ag úsáideoir bunachar "
"sonraí Django, beidh ort an síneadh a chruthú lasmuigh d'imirce Django le "
"húsáideoir a bhfuil siad aige. Sa chás sin, ceangail le do bhunachar sonraí "
"Django agus reáchtáil an cheist ``CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS hstore; ``."

msgid "``CreateExtension``"
msgstr "``CreateExtension``"

msgid ""
"An ``Operation`` subclass which installs a PostgreSQL extension. For common "
"extensions, use one of the more specific subclasses below."
msgstr ""
"Fo-aicme ``Oibríocht' a shuiteálann síneadh PostgreSQL. Maidir le síntí "
"coitianta, bain úsáid as ceann de na fo-aicmí níos sainiúla thíos."

msgid "This is a required argument. The name of the extension to be installed."
msgstr "Is argóint riachtanach é seo. Ainm an síneadh atá le suiteáil."

msgid "``BloomExtension``"
msgstr "``BloomExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``bloom`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``bloom``."

msgid "``BtreeGinExtension``"
msgstr "``BTreeginExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``btree_gin`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``btree_gin ``."

msgid "``BtreeGistExtension``"
msgstr "``BTreegistExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``btree_gist`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``btree_gist``."

msgid "``CITextExtension``"
msgstr "``CiteExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``citext`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``citext``."

msgid "``CryptoExtension``"
msgstr "``CryptoExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``pgcrypto`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh `pgcrypto``."

msgid "``HStoreExtension``"
msgstr "``HStoreExtension``"

msgid ""
"Installs the ``hstore`` extension and also sets up the connection to "
"interpret hstore data for possible use in subsequent migrations."
msgstr ""
"Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``hstore`` agus bunaíonn sé an nasc freisin chun "
"sonraí hstore a léirmhíniú le húsáid féideartha in imirce ina dhiaidh sin."

msgid "``TrigramExtension``"
msgstr "``Síneadh Trigrama``"

msgid "Installs the ``pg_trgm`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh `pg_trgm``."

msgid "``UnaccentExtension``"
msgstr "``UnaccentExtension``"

msgid "Installs the ``unaccent`` extension."
msgstr "Suiteálann sé an síneadh ``unaccent``."

msgid "Managing collations using migrations"
msgstr "Coláidí a bhainistiú ag úsáid imirce"

msgid ""
"If you need to filter or order a column using a particular collation that "
"your operating system provides but PostgreSQL does not, you can manage "
"collations in your database using a migration file. These collations can "
"then be used with the ``db_collation`` parameter "
"on :class:`~django.db.models.CharField`, :class:`~django.db.models.TextField`, "
"and their subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit colún a scagadh nó a ordú ag baint úsáide as comhlánú áirithe a "
"sholáthraíonn do chóras oibriúcháin ach nach ndéanann PostgreSQL, is féidir "
"leat coláidí i do bhunachar sonraí a bhainistiú ag baint úsáide as comhad "
"imirce. Is féidir na comparáidí seo a úsáid ansin leis an bparaiméadar "
"``db_collation`` ar:class: `~django.db.models.charfield`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.textfield`, agus a bhfo-aicmí."

msgid "For example, to create a collation for German phone book ordering::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, chun comhdhlúthú a chruthú le haghaidh ordú leabhar teileafóin "
"na Gearmáine::"

msgid ""
"Creates a collation with the given ``name``, ``locale`` and ``provider``."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn sé comhdhlúthú leis an ``ainm ``, `locale`` agus ``soláthróir` a "
"thugtar."

msgid ""
"Set the ``deterministic`` parameter to ``False`` to create a non-"
"deterministic collation, such as for case-insensitive filtering."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``deirmitheach`` go `False`` chun comparáid neamh-"
"chinntitheach a chruthú, mar shampla le haghaidh scagadh cás-neamh-íogair."

msgid "Removes the collations named ``name``."
msgstr "Baineann sé na coláidí darb ainm ``ainm ``."

msgid ""
"When reversed this is creating a collation with the provided ``locale``, "
"``provider``, and ``deterministic`` arguments. Therefore, ``locale`` is "
"required to make this operation reversible."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a aisiomptear é seo tá comhlánú á chruthú leis na hargóintí "
"``locale``, `soláthróir`, agus ``deirmitheach`` a chuirtear ar fáil. Dá bhrí "
"sin, tá gá le ``áitiúil ``chun an oibríocht seo a dhéanamh inchúlghabháilte."

msgid "Concurrent index operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí innéacs comhthéanta"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL supports the ``CONCURRENTLY`` option to ``CREATE INDEX`` and "
"``DROP INDEX`` statements to add and remove indexes without locking out "
"writes. This option is useful for adding or removing an index in a live "
"production database."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn PostgreSQL leis an rogha ``CONCURRENTLY`` chun ráitis `CREATE "
"INDEX`` agus `DROP INDEX ``chun innéacsanna a chur leis agus a bhaint gan "
"scríobhanna a ghlasáil amach. Tá an rogha seo úsáideach chun innéacs a chur "
"leis nó a bhaint i mbunachar sonraí táirgeachta beo."

msgid ""
"Like :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AddIndex`, but creates an "
"index with the ``CONCURRENTLY`` option. This has a few caveats to be aware "
"of when using this option, see `the PostgreSQL documentation of building "
"indexes concurrently <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ sql-"
"createindex.html#SQL-CREATEINDEX-CONCURRENTLY>`_."
msgstr ""
"Cos:class: `~django.db.migrations.operations.addIndex`, ach cruthaíonn sé "
"innéacs leis an rogha ``CONCURRENTLY``. < https://www.postgresql.org/docs/"
"current/ sql-createindex.html #SQL -CREATEINDEX-CONCURRENTLY>Tá cúpla "
"rabhadh air seo le bheith ar an eolas fúthu agus an rogha seo á úsáid agat, "
"féach `doiciméadú PostgreSQL ar innéacsanna tógála ag comhaontúnaí' _."

msgid ""
"Like :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.RemoveIndex`, but removes the "
"index with the ``CONCURRENTLY`` option. This has a few caveats to be aware "
"of when using this option, see `the PostgreSQL documentation <https://"
"www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-dropindex.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Cos:class: `~django.db.migrations.operations.removeIndex`, ach baineann sé "
"an t-innéacs leis an rogha ``CONCURRENTLY``. < https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/sql-dropindex.html>Tá cúpla rabhadh le bheith ar an eolas faoi "
"seo agus an rogha seo á úsáid agat, féach `an doiciméadú PostgreSQL `_."

msgid ""
"The ``CONCURRENTLY`` option is not supported inside a transaction "
"(see :ref:`non-atomic migration <non-atomic-migrations>`)."
msgstr ""
"<non-atomic-migrations>Ní thacaítear leis an rogha ``CONCURRENTLY` taobh "
"istigh d'idirbheart (féach:ref: `imirce neamh-adamh`)."

msgid "Adding constraints without enforcing validation"
msgstr "Srianta a chur leis gan bailíochtú a fheidhmiú"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL supports the ``NOT VALID`` option with the ``ADD CONSTRAINT`` "
"statement to add check constraints without enforcing validation on existing "
"rows. This option is useful if you want to skip the potentially lengthy scan "
"of the table to verify that all existing rows satisfy the constraint."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn PostgreSQL leis an rogha ``NOT VALID`` leis an ráiteas `ADD "
"CONSTRAINT ``chun srianta seiceála a chur leis gan bailíochtú a "
"fhorfheidhmiú ar shraitheanna atá ann cheana. Tá an rogha seo úsáideach más "
"mian leat scanadh fada an tábla a d'fhéadfadh a bheith fada a scipeáil chun "
"a fhíorú go sásaíonn gach sraitheanna atá ann cheana an srian."

msgid ""
"To validate check constraints created with the ``NOT VALID`` option at a "
"later point of time, use "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.ValidateConstraint` "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Chun srianta seiceála a cruthaíodh leis an rogha ``NOT VALID`` a bhailíochtú "
"ag pointe ama níos déanaí, bain úsáid as an oibríocht:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.validateConstraint`."

msgid ""
"See `the PostgreSQL documentation <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ "
"sql-altertable.html#SQL-ALTERTABLE-NOTES>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ sql-altertable.html #SQL "
"-ALTERTABLE-NOTES>Féach `an doiciméadú PostgreSQL `__ le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"sonraí."

msgid ""
"Like :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AddConstraint`, but avoids "
"validating the constraint on existing rows."
msgstr ""
"Cos:class: `~django.db.migrations.operations.addConstraint`, ach seachnaíonn "
"sé an srian ar na sraitheanna atá ann cheana a bhailíochtú."

msgid ""
"Scans through the table and validates the given check constraint on existing "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé scanadh tríd an tábla agus bailíochtú an srian seiceála a thugtar "
"ar shraitheanna atá ann cheana"

msgid ""
"``AddConstraintNotValid`` and ``ValidateConstraint`` operations should be "
"performed in two separate migrations. Performing both operations in the same "
"atomic migration has the same effect "
"as :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AddConstraint`, whereas "
"performing them in a single non-atomic migration, may leave your database in "
"an inconsistent state if the ``ValidateConstraint`` operation fails."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir oibríochtaí `AddConstraintNotValid`` agus ``ValidateConstraint`` a "
"dhéanamh i dhá imirce ar leithligh. Tá an éifeacht chéanna ag déanamh an dá "
"oibríocht san imirce adamhach céanna as:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.addConstraint`, cé go ndéanann siad iad in "
"imirce neamh-adamhach amháin, féadfaidh sé do bhunachar sonraí a fhágáil i "
"stát neamhchomhsheasmhach má theipeann ar an oibríocht `ValidateConstraint``."

msgid "Full text search"
msgstr "Cuardach téacs iomlán"

msgid ""
"The database functions in the ``django.contrib.postgres.search`` module ease "
"the use of PostgreSQL's `full text search engine <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/textsearch.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/textsearch.html>Éascaíonn "
"feidhmeanna an bhunachar sonraí sa mhodúl ``django.contrib.postgres.search`` "
"úsáid `inneall cuardaigh téacs iomlán`_ PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"For the examples in this document, we'll use the models defined in :doc:`/"
"topics/db/queries`."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis na samplaí sa doiciméad seo, úsáidfimid na samhlacha atá "
"sainmhínithe in:doc: `/topics/db/queries`."

msgid ""
"For a high-level overview of searching, see the :doc:`topic documentation </"
"topics/db/search>`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh forbhreathnú ardleibhéil ar chuardach, féach an:doc: `doiciméadú "
"topaic` </topics/db/search>."

msgid "The ``search`` lookup"
msgstr "An cuardach ``chuardach``"

msgid ""
"A common way to use full text search is to search a single term against a "
"single column in the database. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Bealach coitianta chun cuardach téacs iomlán a úsáid ná téarma amháin a "
"chuardach i gcoinne colún amháin sa bhunachar sonraí. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"This creates a ``to_tsvector`` in the database from the ``body_text`` field "
"and a ``plainto_tsquery`` from the search term ``'Cheese'``, both using the "
"default database search configuration. The results are obtained by matching "
"the query and the vector."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn sé seo ``to_tsvector`` sa bhunachar sonraí ón réimse "
"``body_text`` agus ``plainto_tsquery`` ón téarma cuardaigh ```Cheise``, ag "
"baint úsáide as an gcumraíocht réamhshocraithe cuardaigh bunachar sonraí. "
"Faightear na torthaí tríd an gceist agus an veicteoir a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"To use the ``search`` lookup, ``'django.contrib.postgres'`` must be in "
"your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS`."
msgstr ""
"Chun an cuardach ``search`` a úsáid, caithfidh ``django.contrib.postgres'`` "
"a bheith i d':setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid "``SearchVector``"
msgstr "``SearchVector``"

msgid ""
"Searching against a single field is great but rather limiting. The ``Entry`` "
"instances we're searching belong to a ``Blog``, which has a ``tagline`` "
"field. To query against both fields, use a ``SearchVector``:"
msgstr ""
"Tá sé iontach cuardach i gcoinne réimse amháin ach teorannach. Baineann na "
"cásanna ``Iontrála`` atá á chuardach againn le ``Blog``, a bhfuil réimse "
"``tagline`` aige. Chun ceist a dhéanamh i gcoinne an dá réimse, bain úsáid "
"as ``SearchVector``:"

msgid ""
"The arguments to ``SearchVector`` can be "
"any :class:`~django.db.models.Expression` or the name of a field. Multiple "
"arguments will be concatenated together using a space so that the search "
"document includes them all."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis na hargóintí le `SearchVector`` a bheith aon:class: "
"`~django.db.Models.Expression` nó ainm réimse. Déanfar argóintí iolracha a "
"chomhcheangal le chéile ag baint úsáide as spás ionas go gcuimsíonn an "
"doiciméad cuardaigh iad uile"

msgid ""
"``SearchVector`` objects can be combined together, allowing you to reuse "
"them. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir rudaí `SearchVector ``a chomhcheangal le chéile, rud a ligeann "
"duit iad a athúsáid. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`postgresql-fts-search-configuration` and :ref:`postgresql-fts-"
"weighting-queries` for an explanation of the ``config`` and ``weight`` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Féach:ref: `postgresql-fts-search-cumraí` agus:ref: `postgresql-fts-"
"weighting-queries` le haghaidh míniú ar na paraiméadair `config`` agus "
"`meách``."

msgid "``SearchQuery``"
msgstr "``Cuardcheiste``"

msgid ""
"``SearchQuery`` translates the terms the user provides into a search query "
"object that the database compares to a search vector. By default, all the "
"words the user provides are passed through the stemming algorithms, and then "
"it looks for matches for all of the resulting terms."
msgstr ""
"Aistríonn ``SearchQuery`` na téarmaí a sholáthraíonn an t-úsáideoir ina réad "
"fiosrúcháin cuardaigh a dhéanann an bunachar sonraí comparáid le veicteoir "
"cuardaigh. De réir réamhshocraithe, cuirtear na focail go léir a "
"sholáthraíonn an t-úsáideoir tríd na halgartaim spreagtha, agus ansin "
"féachann sé cluichí do na téarmaí go léir mar thoradh air."

msgid ""
"If ``search_type`` is ``'plain'``, which is the default, the terms are "
"treated as separate keywords. If ``search_type`` is ``'phrase'``, the terms "
"are treated as a single phrase. If ``search_type`` is ``'raw'``, then you "
"can provide a formatted search query with terms and operators. If "
"``search_type`` is ``'websearch'``, then you can provide a formatted search "
"query, similar to the one used by web search engines. ``'websearch'`` "
"requires PostgreSQL ≥ 11. Read PostgreSQL's `Full Text Search docs`_ to "
"learn about differences and syntax. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"Más é ``search_type`` ``plain'``, arb é an réamhshocrú, déileálfar leis na "
"téarmaí mar eochairfhocail ar leithligh. Más é ``search_type`` ``frase '``, "
"déileáiltear leis na téarmaí mar abairt amháin. Más é ``search_type`` "
"``raw'``, ansin is féidir leat ceist cuardaigh formáidithe a sholáthar le "
"téarmaí agus oibreoirí. Más é ``search_type`` ```websearch'`, ansin is "
"féidir leat ceist cuardaigh formáidithe a sholáthar, cosúil leis an gceann a "
"úsáideann innill chuardaigh gréasáin. Éilíonn ``'websearch'` PostgreSQL ≥ "
"11. Léigh PostgreSQL `Doiciméid Cuardaigh Téacs Iomlána`_ chun foghlaim faoi "
"dhifríochtaí agus comhréireacht. Samplaí:"

msgid ""
"``SearchQuery`` terms can be combined logically to provide more flexibility:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir téarmaí ``SearchQuery`` a chomhcheangal go loighciúil chun níos mó "
"solúbthachta a sholáthar:"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`postgresql-fts-search-configuration` for an explanation of the "
"``config`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Féach:ref: `postgresql-fts-search-configuration` le haghaidh míniú ar an "
"paraiméadar ``config``."

msgid "``SearchRank``"
msgstr "``Searchrank``"

msgid ""
"So far, we've returned the results for which any match between the vector "
"and the query are possible. It's likely you may wish to order the results by "
"some sort of relevancy. PostgreSQL provides a ranking function which takes "
"into account how often the query terms appear in the document, how close "
"together the terms are in the document, and how important the part of the "
"document is where they occur. The better the match, the higher the value of "
"the rank. To order by relevancy:"
msgstr ""
"Go dtí seo, tá na torthaí ar ais againn ar a bhfuil aon mheaitseáil idir an "
"veicteoir agus an cheist indéanta. Is dócha gur mhaith leat na torthaí a "
"ordú de réir ábharthachta de chineál éigin. Soláthraíonn PostgreSQL feidhm "
"rangú a chuireann san áireamh cé chomh minic a bhíonn na téarmaí fiosrúcháin "
"le feiceáil sa doiciméad, cé chomh gar dá chéile atá na téarmaí sa "
"doiciméad, agus cé chomh tábhachtach is atá an chuid den doiciméad ina "
"dtarlaíonn siad. An níos fearr an cluiche, is airde luach an chéim. Chun "
"ordú de réir ábharthachta:"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`postgresql-fts-weighting-queries` for an explanation of the "
"``weights`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Féach:ref: `postgresql-fts-weighting-queries` le haghaidh míniú ar an "
"bparaiméadar ``meáchain ``."

msgid ""
"Set the ``cover_density`` parameter to ``True`` to enable the cover density "
"ranking, which means that the proximity of matching query terms is taken "
"into account."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar `cover_density`` go `True`` chun rangú an dlús "
"clúdaigh a chumasú, rud a chiallaíonn go gcuirtear cógasacht na dtéarmaí "
"ceisteanna meaitseála san áireamh."

msgid ""
"Provide an integer to the ``normalization`` parameter to control rank "
"normalization. This integer is a bit mask, so you can combine multiple "
"behaviors:"
msgstr ""
"Cuir sláimhir ar fáil don pharaiméadar ``normalization` chun normalú céim a "
"rialú. Is masc beagán é an sláimhir seo, ionas gur féidir leat iompraíochtaí "
"iolracha a chomhcheangal:"

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL documentation has more details about `different rank "
"normalization options`_."
msgstr ""
"Tá tuilleadh sonraí ag doiciméadú PostgreSQL faoi `roghanna normalú céim "
"éagsúla `_."

msgid "``SearchHeadline``"
msgstr "``Ceannlíne chuardacha``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or an expression, a query, a config, and a set "
"of options. Returns highlighted search results."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó abairt, ceist, cumraíocht, agus tacar "
"roghanna. Tuairisceáin aibhsithe ar thorthaí"

msgid ""
"Set the ``start_sel`` and ``stop_sel`` parameters to the string values to be "
"used to wrap highlighted query terms in the document. PostgreSQL's defaults "
"are ``<b>`` and ``</b>``."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh na paraiméadair ``start_sel`` agus ``stop_sel`` chuig na luachanna "
"teaghrán atá le húsáid chun téarmaí fiosrúcháin aibhsithe sa doiciméad a "
"fhilleadh. <b>Is iad réamhshocruithe PostgreSQL ná ```` agus ````.</b>"

msgid ""
"Provide integer values to the ``max_words`` and ``min_words`` parameters to "
"determine the longest and shortest headlines. PostgreSQL's defaults are 35 "
"and 15."
msgstr ""
"Cuir luachanna sláimhir ar fáil do na paraiméadair ``max_words`` agus "
"``min_words`` chun na ceannlínte is faide agus is giorra a chinneadh. Is iad "
"réamhshocruithe PostgreSQL ná 35 agus 15."

msgid ""
"Provide an integer value to the ``short_word`` parameter to discard words of "
"this length or less in each headline. PostgreSQL's default is 3."
msgstr ""
"Cuir luach sláimhir ar fáil don pharaiméadar ``short_word`` chun focail den "
"fhad seo nó níos lú a dhiúscairt i ngach ceanncheannlíne. Is é réamhshocrú "
"PostgreSQL 3."

msgid ""
"Set the ``highlight_all`` parameter to ``True`` to use the whole document in "
"place of a fragment and ignore ``max_words``, ``min_words``, and "
"``short_word`` parameters. That's disabled by default in PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar ``highlight_all`` go ``True`` chun an doiciméad "
"iomlán a úsáid in ionad blúire agus neamhaird a dhéanamh ar pharaiméadair "
"``max_words``, `min_words``, agus ``short_word``. Tá sé sin díchumasaithe de "
"réir réamhshocraithe i PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Provide a non-zero integer value to the ``max_fragments`` to set the maximum "
"number of fragments to display. That's disabled by default in PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Cuir luach sláimhir neamh-nialasach ar fáil don ``max_fragments`` chun an "
"líon uasta na mblúirí atá le taispeáint a shocrú. Tá sé sin díchumasaithe de "
"réir réamhshocraithe i PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Set the ``fragment_delimiter`` string parameter to configure the delimiter "
"between fragments. PostgreSQL's default is ``\" ... \"``."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an paraiméadar teaghrán `fragment_delimiter`` chun an "
"teorannaitheoir idir blúirí a chumrú. Is é réamhshocrú PostgreSQL ná ``”... "
"“``."

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL documentation has more details on `highlighting search "
"results`_."
msgstr ""
"Tá tuilleadh sonraí ag doiciméadú PostgreSQL maidir le `aird a tharraingt ar "
"thorthaí cuardaigh `_."

msgid "Changing the search configuration"
msgstr "Cumraíocht an chuardaigh a athrú"

msgid ""
"You can specify the ``config`` attribute to a :class:`SearchVector` "
"and :class:`SearchQuery` to use a different search configuration. This "
"allows using different language parsers and dictionaries as defined by the "
"database:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an tréith ``config`` a shonrú le a:class: `searchVector` "
"agus:class: `searchQuery` chun cumraíocht cuardaigh difriúil a úsáid. "
"Ligeann sé seo parsálaí agus foclóirí teanga éagsúla a úsáid mar a "
"shainmhíníonn an bunachar"

msgid "The value of ``config`` could also be stored in another column:"
msgstr "D'fhéadfaí luach `config`` a stóráil i gcolún eile freisin:"

msgid "Weighting queries"
msgstr "Fiosruithe meáchain"

msgid ""
"Every field may not have the same relevance in a query, so you can set "
"weights of various vectors before you combine them:"
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir nach mbeidh an t-ábharthacht chéanna ag gach réimse i gceist, "
"ionas gur féidir leat meáchain veicteoirí éagsúla a shocrú sula "
"gcomhcheanglaíonn tú iad:"

msgid ""
"The weight should be one of the following letters: D, C, B, A. By default, "
"these weights refer to the numbers ``0.1``, ``0.2``, ``0.4``, and ``1.0``, "
"respectively. If you wish to weight them differently, pass a list of four "
"floats to :class:`SearchRank` as ``weights`` in the same order above:"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh an meáchan ar cheann de na litreacha seo a leanas: D, C, "
"B, A. De réir réamhshocraithe, tagraíonn na meáchain seo do na huimhreacha "
"``0.1``, `0.2``, `0.4``, agus ``1.0``, faoi seach. Más mian leat iad a "
"mheáchan ar bhealach difriúil, cuir liosta de cheithre snámh chuig: class: "
"`searchRank` mar ``Weights`` san ord céanna thuas:"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "feidhmíocht"

msgid ""
"Special database configuration isn't necessary to use any of these "
"functions, however, if you're searching more than a few hundred records, "
"you're likely to run into performance problems. Full text search is a more "
"intensive process than comparing the size of an integer, for example."
msgstr ""
"Ní gá cumraíocht bunachar sonraí speisialta chun aon cheann de na "
"feidhmeanna seo a úsáid, áfach, má tá níos mó ná cúpla céad taifead á "
"chuardach agat, is dócha go mbeidh fadhbanna feidhmíochta ort. Is próiseas "
"níos déine é cuardach téacs iomlán ná comparáid a dhéanamh idir méid "
"sláimhir, mar shampla."

msgid ""
"In the event that all the fields you're querying on are contained within one "
"particular model, you can create a functional :class:`GIN "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GinIndex>` or :class:`GiST "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GistIndex>` index which matches the search "
"vector you wish to use. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Sa chás go bhfuil na réimsí go léir a bhfuil tú ag fiosrú orthu laistigh de "
"mhúnla áirithe amháin, is féidir leat inné "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GinIndex><django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GistIndex>acs "
"feidhmiúil:class: `GIN `nó: class: `GIST` a chruthú a oireann leis an "
"veicteoir cuardaigh is mian leat a úsáid. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL documentation has details on `creating indexes for full text "
"search <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/textsearch-"
"tables.html#TEXTSEARCH-TABLES-INDEX>`_."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/textsearch-tables.html#TEXTSEARCH-"
"TABLES-INDEX>Tá sonraí ag doiciméadú PostgreSQL maidir le `innéacsanna a "
"chruthú le haghaidh cuardach téacs iomlán`_."

msgid "``SearchVectorField``"
msgstr "``SearchVectorField``"

msgid ""
"If this approach becomes too slow, you can add a ``SearchVectorField`` to "
"your model. You'll need to keep it populated with triggers, for example, as "
"described in the `PostgreSQL documentation`_. You can then query the field "
"as if it were an annotated ``SearchVector``:"
msgstr ""
"Má éiríonn an cur chuige seo ró-mhall, is féidir leat ``SearchVectorField`` "
"a chur le do mhúnla. Beidh ort é a choinneáil daonra le spreagthóirí, mar "
"shampla, mar a thuairiscítear sa doiciméadú `PostgreSQL`_. Ansin is féidir "
"leat an réimse a cheistiú amhail is dá mba “SearchVector” anótáilte é:"

msgid ""
"Another approach to searching is trigram similarity. A trigram is a group of "
"three consecutive characters. In addition to "
"the :lookup:`trigram_similar`, :lookup:`trigram_word_similar`, "
"and :lookup:`trigram_strict_word_similar` lookups, you can use a couple of "
"other expressions."
msgstr ""
"Cur chuige eile maidir le cuardach is ea cosúlacht trigram. Is grúpa de thrí "
"charachtar as a chéile é trigram. Chomh maith leis na:lookup: "
"`trigram_similar`, :lookup: `trigram_word_similar`, agus:lookup: "
"`trigram_strict_word_similar` cuardaigh, is féidir leat cúpla abairt eile a "
"úsáid."

msgid ""
"To use them, you need to activate the `pg_trgm extension <https://"
"www.postgresql.org/docs/current/pgtrgm.html>`_ on PostgreSQL. You can "
"install it using "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.TrigramExtension` migration "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/pgtrgm.html>Chun iad a úsáid, ní "
"mór duit an síneadh `pg_trgm `_ a ghníomhachtú ar PostgreSQL. Is féidir leat "
"é a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as an oibríocht imirce:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.TrigramExtension`."

msgid "``TrigramSimilarity``"
msgstr "``Trigramchosúlacht ``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a field name or expression, and a string or expression. Returns the "
"trigram similarity between the two arguments."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le hainm réimse nó léiriú, agus teaghrán nó abairt. Tugann sé an "
"chosúlacht trigram idir an dá argóint ar ais."

msgid "``TrigramWordSimilarity``"
msgstr "``Tríghrambhóthaíocht ``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a string or expression, and a field name or expression. Returns the "
"trigram word similarity between the two arguments."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le sreang nó abairt, agus ainm réimse nó léiriú. Filleann sé an "
"chosúlacht focal trigram idir an dá argóint."

msgid "``TrigramStrictWordSimilarity``"
msgstr "``TrigramstrictOrdComhoilarity``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a string or expression, and a field name or expression. Returns the "
"trigram strict word similarity between the two arguments. Similar "
"to :class:`TrigramWordSimilarity() <TrigramWordSimilarity>`, except that it "
"forces extent boundaries to match word boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le sreang nó abairt, agus ainm réimse nó léiriú. Filleann sé an "
"trigram cosúlacht dhian focal idir an dá argóint. Cosúil le:class: "
"`TrigramwordSimility () <TrigramWordSimilarity>`, ach amháin go gcuireann sé "
"teorainneacha méid teorainneacha focal a mheaitseáil."

msgid "``TrigramDistance``"
msgstr "``Trigramdistance``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a field name or expression, and a string or expression. Returns the "
"trigram distance between the two arguments."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le hainm réimse nó léiriú, agus teaghrán nó abairt. Tugann sé an "
"fad trigram idir an dá argóint ar ais."

msgid "``TrigramWordDistance``"
msgstr "``TrigramWorddistance``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a string or expression, and a field name or expression. Returns the "
"trigram word distance between the two arguments."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le sreang nó abairt, agus ainm réimse nó léiriú. Tugann sé an fad "
"focal trigram idir an dá argóint ar ais."

msgid "``TrigramStrictWordDistance``"
msgstr "``TrigramstrictOrdistance``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a string or expression, and a field name or expression. Returns the "
"trigram strict word distance between the two arguments."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le sreang nó abairt, agus ainm réimse nó léiriú. Filleann sé an "
"fad focal dian trigram idir an dá argóint."

msgid ""
"These validators are available from the "
"``django.contrib.postgres.validators`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá na bailíochtóirí seo ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.contrib.postgres.validators ``."

msgid "``KeysValidator``"
msgstr "``KeysValidator``"

msgid ""
"Validates that the given keys are contained in the value. If ``strict`` is "
"``True``, then it also checks that there are no other keys present."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé go bhfuil na heochracha a thugtar sa luach. Má tá ``docht "
"``True``, ansin seiceálann sé freisin nach bhfuil aon eochracha eile i "
"láthair."

msgid ""
"The ``messages`` passed should be a dict containing the keys "
"``missing_keys`` and/or ``extra_keys``."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh na `teachtaireachtaí ``a rith ina dhic ina bhfuil na "
"heochracha ``missing_keys`` agus/nó ``extra_keys``."

msgid ""
"Note that this checks only for the existence of a given key, not that the "
"value of a key is non-empty."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach ndéanann sé seo seiceáil ach ar eochair ar leith a "
"bheith ann, ní go bhfuil luach eochair neamh-folamh."

msgid "Range validators"
msgstr "Bailíochtóirí raon"

msgid "``RangeMaxValueValidator``"
msgstr "``RangeMaxValueValidator``"

msgid ""
"Validates that the upper bound of the range is not greater than "
"``limit_value``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé nach bhfuil srian uachtarach an raon níos mó ná ``limit_value``."

msgid "``RangeMinValueValidator``"
msgstr "``RangeminValueValidator``"

msgid ""
"Validates that the lower bound of the range is not less than the "
"``limit_value``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé nach bhfuil an teorainn íochtarach den raon níos lú ná an "
"``limit_value``."

msgid "The redirects app"
msgstr "An aip athatreoraithe"

msgid ""
"Django comes with an optional redirects application. It lets you store "
"redirects in a database and handles the redirecting for you. It uses the "
"HTTP response status code ``301 Moved Permanently`` by default."
msgstr ""
"Tagann Django le feidhmchlár athatreoruithe roghnach. Ligeann sé duit "
"atreoruithe a stóráil i mbunachar sonraí agus láimhseálann sé an t-atreorú "
"duit. Úsáideann sé an cód stádas freagartha HTTP ``301 Bogtha go Buan ``de "
"réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid "To install the redirects app, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Chun an aip atreoraithe a shuiteáil, lean na céimeanna seo:"

msgid ""
"Ensure that the ``django.contrib.sites`` framework :ref:`is installed "
"<enabling-the-sites-framework>`."
msgstr ""
"<enabling-the-sites-framework>Déan cinnte go bhfuil an chreat "
"``django.contrib.sites``: ref: `suiteáilte `."

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.redirects'`` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ``django.contrib.redirects'`` le do shuíomh: Setting: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware'`` to "
"your :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` setting."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ``django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackmiddleware'` le "
"do shuíomh: `MIDDLEWARE`."

msgid ""
"``manage.py migrate`` creates a ``django_redirect`` table in your database. "
"This is a lookup table with ``site_id``, ``old_path`` and ``new_path`` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn ``manage.py migrate`` tábla ``django_redirect`` i do bhunachar "
"sonraí. Is tábla cuardaigh é seo le réimsí ``site_id``, `old_path`` agus "
"``new_path``."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware` "
"does all of the work. Each time any Django application raises a 404 error, "
"this middleware checks the redirects database for the requested URL as a "
"last resort. Specifically, it checks for a redirect with the given "
"``old_path`` with a site ID that corresponds to the :setting:`SITE_ID` "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an: Class: "
"`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackMiddleWare` an obair "
"go léir. Gach uair a ardaíonn aon fheidhmchlár Django earráid 404, "
"seiceálann an middleware seo an bunachar sonraí atreoraithe don URL iarrtha "
"mar rogha dheiridh. Go sonrach, seiceálann sé athsheoladh leis an "
"`old_path`` a thugtar le ID láithreáin a fhreagraíonn don socrú: setting: "
"`SITE_ID`."

msgid ""
"If it finds a match, and ``new_path`` is not empty, it redirects to "
"``new_path`` using a 301 (\"Moved Permanently\") redirect. You can "
"subclass :class:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware` "
"and "
"set :attr:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware.response_redirect_class` "
"to :class:`django.http.HttpResponseRedirect` to use a ``302 Moved "
"Temporarily`` redirect instead."
msgstr ""
"Má aimsíonn sé meaitseáil, agus mura bhfuil ``new_path`` folamh, atreoraíonn "
"sé chuig ``new_path`` ag baint úsáide as atreorú 301 (“Bogtha go Buan”). Is "
"féidir leat subclass:class: "
"`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackMiddleware` agus "
"set:attr: "
"`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackmiddleware.response_redirect_class` "
"to:class: `django.http.httpresponseredirect` chun `302 Temporada a úsáid "
"Atreorú arily`` ina ionad sin."

msgid ""
"If it finds a match, and ``new_path`` is empty, it sends a 410 (\"Gone\") "
"HTTP header and empty (content-less) response."
msgstr ""
"Má aimsíonn sé meaitseáil, agus má tá ``new_path`` folamh, seolann sé "
"ceannteideal HTTP 410 (“Done”) agus freagra folamh (gan ábhar)."

msgid ""
"Note that the order of :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` matters. Generally, you can "
"put :class:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware` "
"at the end of the list, because it's a last resort."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil tábhacht ag ordú:setting: `MIDDLEWARE`. Go "
"ginearálta, is féidir leat: class: "
"`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackmiddleware` a chur ag "
"deireadh an liosta, toisc gur rogha deireanach é."

msgid "How to add, change and delete redirects"
msgstr "Conas atreoruithe a chur leis, a athrú agus a scriosadh"

msgid ""
"If you've activated the automatic Django admin interface, you should see a "
"\"Redirects\" section on the admin index page. Edit redirects as you edit "
"any other object in the system."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an comhéadan riaracháin Django uathoibríoch curtha i ngníomh agat, ba "
"chóir duit rannán “Atreoracha” a fheiceáil ar an leathanach innéacs "
"riaracháin. Athsheoltóirí in eagar agus tú in eagar aon rud eile sa chóras "
"in eagar."

msgid ""
"Redirects are represented by a standard :doc:`Django model </topics/db/"
"models>`, which lives in :source:`django/contrib/redirects/models.py`. You "
"can access redirect objects via the :doc:`Django database API </topics/db/"
"queries>`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Léirítear athatreoruithe le caighdeán:doc: `samhail Django`, a chónaíonn "
"in:source: `django/contrib/redirects/models.py`. </topics/db/models> Is "
"féidir leat rochtain a fháil ar rudaí atreoraithe trí:doc: `Bunachar sonraí "
"D</topics/db/queries> jango API`. Mar shampla:"

msgid "Middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí"

msgid ""
"You can change the :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` classes used by the "
"middleware by creating a subclass "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware` "
"and overriding ``response_gone_class`` and/or ``response_redirect_class``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat na ranganna: :class: `~django.http.httpResponse` a úsáideann "
"an middleware a athrú trí fho-aicme de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectfallbackmiddleware` a chruthú "
"agus `response_gone_class`` agus/nó ``response_redirect_class``."

msgid ""
"The :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` class used when "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.redirects.models.Redirect` is not found for the "
"requested path or has a blank ``new_path`` value."
msgstr ""
"An rang:class: `~django.http.httpResponse` a úsáidtear nuair nach "
"bhfaightear a:class: `~django.contrib.redirects.models.redirect` don chosán "
"iarrtha nó go bhfuil luach ``new_path`` bán aige."

msgid "Defaults to :class:`~django.http.HttpResponseGone`."
msgstr "Réamhshocraithe chuig: aicme: `~django.http.httpResponseGone`."

msgid "The :class:`~django.http.HttpResponse` class that handles the redirect."
msgstr ""
"An rang:class: `~django.http.httpResponse` a láimhseálann an t-atreorú."

msgid "Defaults to :class:`~django.http.HttpResponsePermanentRedirect`."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocraithe chuig: aicme: `~django.http.httpResponsePermanentDirect`."

msgid "The sitemap framework"
msgstr "Creat an léarscáileáin"

msgid ""
"Django comes with a high-level sitemap-generating framework to create "
"sitemap_ XML files."
msgstr ""
"Tagann Django le creat giniúna láithreáin ardleibhéil chun comhaid sitemap_ "
"XML a chruthú."

msgid ""
"A sitemap is an XML file on your website that tells search-engine indexers "
"how frequently your pages change and how \"important\" certain pages are in "
"relation to other pages on your site. This information helps search engines "
"index your site."
msgstr ""
"Is comhad XML é léarscáil an láithreán gréasáin ar do shuíomh Gréasáin a "
"insíonn innéacsóirí inneall cuardaigh cé chomh minic a athraíonn do "
"leathanaigh agus cé chomh tábhachtach agus atá leathanaigh áirithe maidir le "
"leathanaigh eile ar do shuíomh. Cuidíonn an fhaisnéis seo le hinnill "
"chuardaigh do láithreán a"

msgid ""
"The Django sitemap framework automates the creation of this XML file by "
"letting you express this information in Python code."
msgstr ""
"Déanann creat láithreán gréasáin Django cruthú an chomhad XML seo a "
"uathoibriú trí ligean duit an fhaisnéis seo a chur in iúl i gcód Python."

msgid ""
"It works much like Django's :doc:`syndication framework </ref/contrib/"
"syndication>`. To create a sitemap, write "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` class and point to it in "
"your :doc:`URLconf </topics/http/urls>`."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn sé cosúil le Django: doc: `creat sindication` </ref/contrib/"
"syndication>. Chun léarscáil an léarscáileáin a chruthú, scríobh a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.siteMap` rang agus dírigh air i d:doc: `URLCon</"
"topics/http/urls> f`."

msgid "To install the sitemap app, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Chun an aip léarscáileáin a shuiteáil, lean na céimeanna seo:"

msgid ""
"Add ``'django.contrib.sitemaps'`` to your :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` setting."
msgstr "Cuir ``django.contrib.sitemaps'`` le do shocrú: `INSTALLED_APPS`."

msgid ""
"Make sure your :setting:`TEMPLATES` setting contains a ``DjangoTemplates`` "
"backend whose ``APP_DIRS`` options is set to ``True``. It's in there by "
"default, so you'll only need to change this if you've changed that setting."
msgstr ""
"Déan cinnte go bhfuil cúltaca ``DjangoTemplates`` ag do shuíomh: setting: "
"`TEMPLATES` a bhfuil a roghanna ``APP_DIRS`` socraithe go ``True``. Tá sé "
"ann de réir réamhshocraithe, mar sin ní bheidh ort é seo a athrú ach má tá "
"an socrú sin athraithe agat."

msgid ""
"Make sure you've installed the :mod:`sites framework<django.contrib.sites>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.sites>Déan cinnte go bhfuil creat:mod: `sites `suiteáilte "
"agat."

msgid ""
"(Note: The sitemap application doesn't install any database tables. The only "
"reason it needs to go into :setting:`INSTALLED_APPS` is so that "
"the :func:`~django.template.loaders.app_directories.Loader` template loader "
"can find the default templates.)"
msgstr ""
"(Nóta: Ní shuiteálann an feidhmchlár léarscáileáin aon táblaí bunachar "
"sonraí. Is é an t-aon chúis a chaithfidh sé dul chuig: setting: "
"`INSTALLED_APPS` ionas gur féidir leis an lódóir teimpléad:func: "
"`~django.template.loaders.app_directories.loader` na teimpléid "
"réamhshocraithe a aimsiú.)"

msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "Tionscnamh"

msgid ""
"To activate sitemap generation on your Django site, add this line to "
"your :doc:`URLconf </topics/http/urls>`::"
msgstr ""
"Chun giniúint léarscáileán gréasáin a ghníomhachtú ar do shuíomh Django, "
"cuir an líne seo le duit:doc: `URLConf`:: </topics/http/urls>"

msgid ""
"This tells Django to build a sitemap when a client accesses :file:`/"
"sitemap.xml`."
msgstr ""
"Insíonn sé seo le Django léarscáil an léarscáileáin a thógáil nuair a "
"fhaigheann cliant rochtain aith:file: `/sitemap.xml`."

msgid ""
"The name of the sitemap file is not important, but the location is. Search "
"engines will only index links in your sitemap for the current URL level and "
"below. For instance, if :file:`sitemap.xml` lives in your root directory, it "
"may reference any URL in your site. However, if your sitemap lives "
"at :file:`/content/sitemap.xml`, it may only reference URLs that begin "
"with :file:`/content/`."
msgstr ""
"Níl ainm an chomhaid léarscáileáin tábhachtach, ach tá an suíomh. Ní "
"innéacfaidh innill chuardaigh ach naisc i do léarscáil gréasáin don leibhéal "
"reatha URL agus thíos. Mar shampla, má tá: file: `sitemap.xml` ina gcónaí i "
"d'eolaire fréimhe, féadfaidh sé tagairt a dhéanamh ar aon URL ar do shuíomh. "
"Mar sin féin, má tá do léarscáil an léarscáileáin ina g:file: `/content/"
"sitemap.xml`, ní fhéadfaidh sé tagairt a dhéanamh ach URLanna a thosaíonn "
"la:file: `/content/`."

msgid ""
"The sitemap view takes an extra, required argument: ``{'sitemaps': sitemaps}"
"``. ``sitemaps`` should be a dictionary that maps a short section label "
"(e.g., ``blog`` or ``news``) to "
"its :class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` class (e.g., ``BlogSitemap`` "
"or ``NewsSitemap``). It may also map to an *instance* of "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` class (e.g., "
"``BlogSitemap(some_var)``)."
msgstr ""
"Tógann an dearcadh léarscáileáin argóint breise riachtanach: ``{'sitemaps': "
"sitemaps}``. Ba chóir go mbeadh ``sitemaps ``ina fhoclóir a mhapálann lipéad "
"gearrchuid (m.sh., ``blog`` nó ``nuacht``) chuig a aicme:class: "
"`~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap` (m.sh., ``BlogSitemap`` nó "
"``NewsSitemap``). Féadfaidh sé léarscáil freisin chuig ranga*teacht* de "
"a:class: `~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap` (m.sh., ``BlogSitemap (some_var) "
"`)."

msgid "``Sitemap`` classes"
msgstr "Ranganna ``Sitemap``"

msgid ""
"A :class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` class is a Python class that "
"represents a \"section\" of entries in your sitemap. For example, "
"one :class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` class could represent all the "
"entries of your blog, while another could represent all of the events in "
"your events calendar."
msgstr ""
"A: Class: “~django.contrib.SiteMaps.SiteMap` aicme Python é rang a léiríonn "
"“cuid” d'iontrálacha i do léarscáil an léarscáileáin. Mar shampla, "
"d'fhéadfadh rang amháin: class: `~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap` "
"iontrálacha uile do bhlag a léiriú, agus d'fhéadfadh ceann eile léiriú a "
"dhéanamh ar na himeachtaí go léir i d'fhéilire imeachtaí."

msgid ""
"In the simplest case, all these sections get lumped together into "
"one :file:`sitemap.xml`, but it's also possible to use the framework to "
"generate a sitemap index that references individual sitemap files, one per "
"section. (See `Creating a sitemap index`_ below.)"
msgstr ""
"Sa chás is simplí, cuirtear na codanna seo go léir le chéile i gceann "
"amháin: file: `sitemap.xml`, ach is féidir an creat a úsáid freisin chun "
"innéacs léarscáil an léarscáileáin a ghiniúint a thagann tagairt do chomhaid "
"léarscáileáin aonair, ceann in aghaidh an roinn. (Féach `Innéacs "
"léarscáileáin a chruthú `_ thíos.)"

msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap` classes must subclass "
"``django.contrib.sitemaps.Sitemap``. They can live anywhere in your codebase."
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.sitemaps.sitemap` caithfidh ranganna fo-aicme "
"``Django.Contrib.SiteMaps.Sitemap``. Is féidir leo maireachtáil áit ar bith "
"i do bhunachar cóid."

msgid "An example"
msgstr "Sampla"

msgid ""
"Let's assume you have a blog system, with an ``Entry`` model, and you want "
"your sitemap to include all the links to your individual blog entries. "
"Here's how your sitemap class might look::"
msgstr ""
"Glacaimis leis go bhfuil córas blag agat, le samhail ``Iontrála`, agus ba "
"mhaith leat go n-áireofaí do léarscáil an léir le d'iontrálacha blag aonair. "
"Seo mar a d'fhéadfadh cuma ar do rang léarscáileán gréasáin::"

msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Nóta:"

msgid ""
":attr:`~Sitemap.changefreq` and :attr:`~Sitemap.priority` are class "
"attributes corresponding to ``<changefreq>`` and ``<priority>`` elements, "
"respectively. They can be made callable as functions, "
"as :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod` was in the example."
msgstr ""
"<changefreq><priority>:attr: `~SiteMap.ChangeFreq` agus:attr: "
"`~SiteMap.Priority` tréithe aicme iad a fhreagraíonn d'eilimintí ```` agus "
"````, faoi seach. Is féidir iad a dhéanamh inghlaoch mar fheidhmeanna, mar: "
"attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod` a bhí sa sampla."

msgid ""
":attr:`~Sitemap.items()` is a method that returns a :term:`sequence` or "
"``QuerySet`` of objects. The objects returned will get passed to any "
"callable methods corresponding to a sitemap property "
"(:attr:`~Sitemap.location`, :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod`, :attr:`~Sitemap.changefreq`, "
"and :attr:`~Sitemap.priority`)."
msgstr ""
":attr: `~SiteMap.items () `is modh a thugann a thugann a:term: `sequence` nó "
"``QuerySet`` rudaí. Cuirfear na rudaí a cuireadh ar ais chuig aon mhodhanna "
"inghlaonta a fhreagraíonn do mhaoin léarscáil an léarscáileáin (:attr: "
"`~SiteMap.Location`, :attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod`, :attr: "
"`~SiteMap.ChangeFreq`, agus:attr: `~SiteMap.Priority`)."

msgid ":attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod` should return a :class:`~datetime.datetime`."
msgstr ""
":attr: Ba chóir `~SiteMap.LastMod` a: class: `~datetime.datetime` a "
"thabhairt ar ais."

msgid ""
"There is no :attr:`~Sitemap.location` method in this example, but you can "
"provide it in order to specify the URL for your object. By "
"default, :attr:`~Sitemap.location()` calls ``get_absolute_url()`` on each "
"object and returns the result."
msgstr ""
"Níl modh: attr: `~SiteMap.location` sa sampla seo, ach is féidir leat é a "
"sholáthar d'fhonn an URL do réad a shonrú. De réir réamhshocraithe, glaonn: "
"attr: `~SiteMap.location () ```get_absolute_url () ``ar gach réad agus "
"filleann sé an toradh."

msgid "``Sitemap`` class reference"
msgstr "Tagairt aicme ``Sitemap``"

msgid "A ``Sitemap`` class can define the following methods/attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le rang ``Sitemap`` na modhaí/tréithe seo a leanas a shainiú:"

msgid ""
"**Required.** A method that returns a :term:`sequence` or ``QuerySet`` of "
"objects. The framework doesn't care what *type* of objects they are; all "
"that matters is that these objects get passed to "
"the :attr:`~Sitemap.location()`, :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod()`, :attr:`~Sitemap.changefreq()` "
"and :attr:`~Sitemap.priority()` methods."
msgstr ""
"**Riachtanach.** Modh a thugann a:term: `seicheamh` nó ``QuerySet`` rudaí. "
"Níl cúram ar an gcreat cén cineál* rudaí iad; níl tábhacht ann ná go "
"gcuirtear na rudaí seo chuig: attr: `~SiteMap.Location () `, :attr: "
"`~SiteMap.LastMod ()`, :attr: `~SiteMap.ChangeFreq () `agus: attr: "
"`~SiteMap.Priority ()`."

msgid "**Optional.** Either a method or attribute."
msgstr "**Roghnach. ** Modh nó tréith."

msgid ""
"If it's a method, it should return the absolute path for a given object as "
"returned by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más modh é, ba cheart dó an cosán iomlán a thabhairt ar ais do réad ar leith "
"mar a d'fhaigh:attr: `~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"If it's an attribute, its value should be a string representing an absolute "
"path to use for *every* object returned by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más tréith é, ba chóir go mbeadh a luach ina shreang a léiríonn cosán iomlán "
"le húsáid d'*gach réad ar ais ag: attr: `~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"In both cases, \"absolute path\" means a URL that doesn't include the "
"protocol or domain. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"Sa dá chás, ciallaíonn “cosán iomlán” URL nach bhfuil an prótacal nó an "
"fearann san áireamh. Samplaí:"

msgid "Good: ``'/foo/bar/'``"
msgstr "Go maith: ``'/foo/bar/'``"

msgid "Bad: ``'example.com/foo/bar/'``"
msgstr "Droch: ```example.com/foo/bar/'``"

msgid "Bad: ``'https://example.com/foo/bar/'``"
msgstr "Droch: ``'https://example.com/foo/bar/ '``"

msgid ""
"If :attr:`~Sitemap.location` isn't provided, the framework will call the "
"``get_absolute_url()`` method on each object as returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más rud é: Attr: `~SiteMap.Location` ar fáil, glaóidh an creat ar an modh "
"``get_absolute_url () ``ar gach réad mar a chuirtear ar ais ag: attr: "
"`~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"To specify a protocol other than ``'http'``, use :attr:`~Sitemap.protocol`."
msgstr ""
"Chun prótacal seachas ``'http'`` a shonrú, bain úsáid:attr: "
"`~SiteMap.Protocol`."

msgid ""
"If it's a method, it should take one argument -- an object as returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()` -- and return that object's last-modified date/"
"time as a :class:`~datetime.datetime`."
msgstr ""
"Más modh é, ba cheart dó argóint amháin a ghlacadh - réad mar a "
"d'fhaigh:attr: `~SiteMap.items () `- agus dáta/am modhnaithe deireanach an "
"réada sin a thabhairt ar ais mar a:class: `~datetime.datetime`."

msgid ""
"If it's an attribute, its value should be a :class:`~datetime.datetime` "
"representing the last-modified date/time for *every* object returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más tréith é, ba chóir go mbeadh a luach a:class: `~datetime.datetime` a "
"léiríonn an dáta/am a mhodhnaithe deireanach d'*gach réad ar ais ag: attr: "
"`~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"If all items in a sitemap have a :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod`, the sitemap "
"generated by :func:`views.sitemap` will have a ``Last-Modified`` header "
"equal to the latest ``lastmod``. You can activate "
"the :class:`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` to make Django "
"respond appropriately to requests with an ``If-Modified-Since`` header which "
"will prevent sending the sitemap if it hasn't changed."
msgstr ""
"Má tá a:attr: `~SiteMap.lastMod` ag gach mír i léarscáil an léarscáileáin, "
"beidh ceannteideal ``Last-Modified`` ag an léarscáileán a ghineann: func: "
"`views.sitemap` comhionann leis an `lastmod`` is déanaí. Is féidir leat an: "
"class: `~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware` a ghníomhachtú "
"chun a chur ar Django freagairt go cuí d'iarratais le ceannteideal ``If-"
"Modfied-Since`` a chuirfidh cosc ar an léarscáil an léarscáil a sheoladh "
"mura bhfuil sé athraithe."

msgid "**Optional.**"
msgstr "** Roghnach. **"

msgid ""
"This property returns a :class:`~django.core.paginator.Paginator` "
"for :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`. If you generate sitemaps in a batch you may "
"want to override this as a cached property in order to avoid multiple "
"``items()`` calls."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an maoin seo ar ais a:class: `~django.core.paginator.paginator` le "
"haghaidh: attr: `~SiteMap.items () `. Má ghineann tú léarscáileanna "
"láithreáin i mbaisc b'fhéidir gur mhaith leat é seo a shárú mar mhaoin "
"taisceáilte d'fhonn glaonna iolracha ``items () `a sheachaint."

msgid ""
"If it's a method, it should take one argument -- an object as returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()` -- and return that object's change frequency as "
"a string."
msgstr ""
"Más modh é, ba cheart dó argóint amháin a ghlacadh - réad mar a "
"d'fhaigh:attr: `~SiteMap.items () `- agus minicíocht athraithe an réada sin "
"a thabhairt ar ais mar shreang."

msgid ""
"If it's an attribute, its value should be a string representing the change "
"frequency of *every* object returned by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más tréith é, ba chóir go mbeadh a luach ina shreang a léiríonn minicíocht "
"athraithe* gach réad ar ais ag: attr: `~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"Possible values for :attr:`~Sitemap.changefreq`, whether you use a method or "
"attribute, are:"
msgstr ""
"Is iad na luachanna féideartha le haghaidh: attr: `~SiteMap.ChangeFreq`, "
"cibé acu a úsáideann tú modh nó tréith, ná:"

msgid "``'always'``"
msgstr "```'i gcónaí'"

msgid "``'hourly'``"
msgstr "`````uaireanta uaireanta ``"

msgid "``'daily'``"
msgstr "```'laeth'``"

msgid "``'weekly'``"
msgstr "`````Seachtainiú'`"

msgid "``'monthly'``"
msgstr "`````míosúil``"

msgid "``'yearly'``"
msgstr "````bliantú'`"

msgid "``'never'``"
msgstr "```'riam``"

msgid ""
"If it's a method, it should take one argument -- an object as returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()` -- and return that object's priority as either a "
"string or float."
msgstr ""
"Más modh é, ba cheart dó argóint amháin a ghlacadh - réad mar a "
"d'fhaigh:attr: `~SiteMap.items () `- agus tosaíocht an réada sin a thabhairt "
"ar ais mar shreang nó mar snámhphointe."

msgid ""
"If it's an attribute, its value should be either a string or float "
"representing the priority of *every* object returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.items()`."
msgstr ""
"Más tréith é, ba chóir go mbeadh a luach ina shreang nó snámhphointe a "
"léiríonn tosaíocht oir* gach réad ar ais ag: attr: `~SiteMap.items () `."

msgid ""
"Example values for :attr:`~Sitemap.priority`: ``0.4``, ``1.0``. The default "
"priority of a page is ``0.5``. See the `sitemaps.org documentation`_ for "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Luachanna samplacha le haghaidh: attr: `~SiteMap.Priority`: ``0.4``, `1.0``. "
"Is é ``0.5`` tosaíocht réamhshocraithe leathanaigh. Féach an doiciméadú "
"`sitemaps.org `_ le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

msgid ""
"This attribute defines the protocol (``'http'`` or ``'https'``) of the URLs "
"in the sitemap. If it isn't set, the protocol with which the sitemap was "
"requested is used. If the sitemap is built outside the context of a request, "
"the default is ``'https'``."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhíníonn an tréith seo prótacal (``'http'`` nó ``https'``) na URLanna sa "
"léarscáil an léarscáileáin. Mura bhfuil sé socraithe, úsáidtear an prótacal "
"lena n-iarradh an léarscáil an léarscáileáin. Má tá an léarscáil an "
"léarscáileáin tógtha lasmuigh de chomhthéacs iarratais, is é ``https'` an "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"This attribute defines the maximum number of URLs included on each page of "
"the sitemap. Its value should not exceed the default value of ``50000``, "
"which is the upper limit allowed in the `Sitemaps protocol <https://"
"www.sitemaps.org/protocol.html#index>`_."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhíníonn an tréith seo an líon uasta URLanna atá san áireamh ar gach "
"leathanach den láithreán gréasáin. < https://www.sitemaps.org/"
"protocol.html#index>Níor chóir go mbeadh a luach níos mó ná luach "
"réamhshocraithe ``50000``, is é sin an teorainn uachtarach a cheadaítear sa "
"phrótacal `Sitemaps `_."

msgid ""
"A boolean attribute that defines if the URLs of this sitemap should be "
"generated using all of your :setting:`LANGUAGES`. The default is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith boolean a shainmhíníonn an cheart URLanna an léarscáileáin seo a "
"ghiniúint ag baint úsáide as do chuid uil:setting: `LANGUAGES`. Is é an "
"réamhshocrú ``False``."

msgid ""
"A :term:`sequence` of :term:`language codes<language code>` to use for "
"generating alternate links when :attr:`~Sitemap.i18n` is enabled. Defaults "
"to :setting:`LANGUAGES`."
msgstr ""
"A: Téarma: `seiche <language code>am` de:téarma: `cóid teanga `le húsáid "
"chun naisc mhalartacha a ghiniúint nuair a chumasaítear: attr: "
"`~SiteMap.I18N`. Réamhshocraithe chuig: socrú: `LANGUAGES`."

msgid ""
"A boolean attribute. When used in conjunction with :attr:`~Sitemap.i18n` "
"generated URLs will each have a list of alternate links pointing to other "
"language versions using the `hreflang attribute`_. The default is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith boolean. Nuair a úsáidtear iad i gcomhar le:attr: `~SiteMap.i18n` "
"beidh liosta de naisc mhalartacha ag gach ceann acu ag díriú ar leaganacha "
"teanga eile ag baint úsáide as an tréith `hreflang `_. Is é an réamhshocrú "
"``False``."

msgid ""
"A boolean attribute. When ``True`` the alternate links generated "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.alternates` will contain a ``hreflang=\"x-default\"`` "
"fallback entry with a value of :setting:`LANGUAGE_CODE`. The default is "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith boolean. Nuair a bheidh `True`` beidh iontráil ``hreflang=\"x-"
"default\"`` le luach de:setting: `LANGUAGE_CODE` sna naisc malartacha a "
"ghineann: `~SiteMap.Alternates`. Is é an réamhshocrú ``False``."

msgid ""
"**Optional.** A method that returns the latest value returned "
"by :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod`. This function is used to add the ``lastmod`` "
"attribute to :ref:`Sitemap index context variables<sitemap-index-context-"
"variables>`."
msgstr ""
"**Roghnach. ** Modh a thugann an luach is déanaí ar ais ag: attr: "
"`~SiteMap.LastMod`. <sitemap-index-context-variables>Úsáidtear an fheidhm "
"seo chun an tréith ``lastmod`` a chur chuig: ref: `Athróga comhthéacs "
"innéacs Láithreáin Láithreáin `."

msgid "By default :meth:`~Sitemap.get_latest_lastmod` returns:"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe: meth: `~SiteMap.get_Latest_LastMod` tuairisceann:"

msgid "If :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod` is an attribute: :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod`."
msgstr "Má tá: attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod` tréith: :attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod`."

msgid ""
"If :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod` is a method: The latest ``lastmod`` returned by "
"calling the method with all items returned by :meth:`Sitemap.items`."
msgstr ""
"If: Attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod` is modh é: An `lastmod`` is déanaí ar ais tríd "
"an modh a ghlaoch leis na míreanna go léir ar ais ag: meth: `SiteMap.items`."

msgid ""
"**Optional.** A method that returns the sequence of language codes for which "
"the item is displayed. By default :meth:`~Sitemap.get_languages_for_item` "
"returns :attr:`~Sitemap.languages`."
msgstr ""
"**Roghnach. ** Modh a thugann seicheamh na gcód teanga ar taispeántar an mír "
"ina leith. De réir réamhshocraithe: meth: `~SiteMap.get_Languages_for_item` "
"filleadh: attr: `~SiteMap.Languages`."

msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "Aicearraí"

msgid "The sitemap framework provides a convenience class for a common case:"
msgstr "Soláthraíonn creat an léarscáileáin rang áisiúlachta do chás coiteann:"

msgid ""
"The :class:`django.contrib.sitemaps.GenericSitemap` class allows you to "
"create a sitemap by passing it a dictionary which has to contain at least a "
"``queryset`` entry. This queryset will be used to generate the items of the "
"sitemap. It may also have a ``date_field`` entry that specifies a date field "
"for objects retrieved from the ``queryset``. This will be used for "
"the :attr:`~Sitemap.lastmod` attribute "
"and :meth:`~Sitemap.get_latest_lastmod` methods in the in the generated "
"sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an rang:Class: `Django.Contrib.SiteMaps.GenericSiteMap` duit "
"léarscáil an léarscáileáin a chruthú trí fhoclóir a chur air a chaithfidh "
"iontráil ``queryset`` ar a laghad a bheith ann. Úsáidfear an tacar "
"ceisteanna seo chun míreanna an léarscáileáin a ghiniúint. D'fhéadfadh go "
"mbeadh iontráil `date_field`` aige freisin a shonraíonn réimse dáta do rudaí "
"a aisghabhadh ón ``queryset``. Úsáidfear é seo le haghaidh na modhanna: "
"attr: `~SiteMap.LastMod` agus:meth: `~SiteMap.Get_Latest_LastMod` sa "
"léarscáil an léarscáileáin a ghintear."

msgid ""
"The :attr:`~Sitemap.priority`, :attr:`~Sitemap.changefreq`, "
"and :attr:`~Sitemap.protocol` keyword arguments allow specifying these "
"attributes for all URLs."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn argóintí eochairfhocal:: attr: :attr: `~SiteMap.ChangeFreq`, "
"agus:attr: `~SiteMap.Protocol` argóintí eochairfhocal na tréithe seo a "
"shonrú do gach URLanna."

