"Here's an example of a :doc:`URLconf </topics/http/urls>` "
"using :class:`GenericSitemap`::"
msgstr ""
"Seo sampla de a:doc: `URLConf` ag baint úsáid:class: `GenericSiteMap` </"
"topics/http/urls>::"

