msgstr ""
"``{{obj}}`` -- An réad reatha (ceann de na rudaí a chuir tú ar ais i ``items "
"() ``)."

msgid ""
"``{{ site }}`` -- A :class:`django.contrib.sites.models.Site` object "
"representing the current site. This is useful for ``{{ site.domain }}`` or "
"``{{ site.name }}``. If you do *not* have the Django sites framework "
"installed, this will be set to "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.sites.requests.RequestSite` object. See "
"the :ref:`RequestSite section of the sites framework documentation "
"<requestsite-objects>` for more."
msgstr ""
"``{{site}}`` -- a:Class: `django.contrib.sites.models.site` réad a léiríonn "
"an láithreán reatha. Tá sé seo úsáideach do ``{{site.domain}}`` nó "
"``{{site.name}}``. Mura bhfuil creat láithreáin Django suiteáilte agat*, "
"socraítear é seo ar a:class: `~django.contrib.sites.requests.requestsite` "
"réad. <requestsite-objects>Féach an:ref: `RequestSite de dhoiciméadú creat "
"na láithreáin `le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

msgid "See `a complex example`_ below that uses a description template."
msgstr "Féach `sampla casta`_ thíos a úsáideann teimpléad tuairisc."

msgid ""
"There is also a way to pass additional information to title and description "
