msgid "Failure to do this may result in crashes and other odd behavior."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh timpeanna agus iompar aisteach eile a bheith mar thoradh ar "
"mhainneachtain é seo a dhéanamh."

msgid "INSERT ... RETURNING INTO"
msgstr "CUIR ISTEACH... AG FILLEADH ISTEACH"

msgid ""
"By default, the Oracle backend uses a ``RETURNING INTO`` clause to "
"efficiently retrieve the value of an ``AutoField`` when inserting new rows.  "
"This behavior may result in a ``DatabaseError`` in certain unusual setups, "
"such as when inserting into a remote table, or into a view with an ``INSTEAD "
"OF`` trigger. The ``RETURNING INTO`` clause can be disabled by setting the "
"``use_returning_into`` option of the database configuration to ``False``::"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáideann cúltaca Oracle clásal ``RETURNING INTO` "
"chun luach ``Autofield`` a aisghabháil go héifeachtúil agus sraitheanna nua "
"á chur isteach. D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh “Error bunachar sonraí” mar thoradh ar "
"an iompar seo i socruithe neamhghnácha áirithe, mar shampla nuair a "
"chuirtear isteach i dtábla iargúlta, nó i radharc le truicear ``INSTEAD OF`. "
"Is féidir an clásal ``RETURNING INTO` a dhíchumasú tríd an rogha "
"``use_returning_into`` de chumraíocht an bhunachar sonraí a shocrú go "
"``False``:"

msgid ""
"In this case, the Oracle backend will use a separate ``SELECT`` query to "
"retrieve ``AutoField`` values."
msgstr ""
"Sa chás seo, úsáidfidh cúltaca Oracle ceist ``SELECT`` ar leithligh chun "
"luachanna ``Autofield` a aisghabháil."

msgid "Naming issues"
msgstr "Saincheisteanna ainmni"

msgid ""
"Oracle imposes a name length limit of 30 characters. To accommodate this, "
"the backend truncates database identifiers to fit, replacing the final four "
"characters of the truncated name with a repeatable MD5 hash value. "
"Additionally, the backend turns database identifiers to all-uppercase."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann Oracle teorainn fad ainm de 30 carachtar i bhfeidhm. Chun freastal "
"air seo, cuireann an cúltaca aitheantóirí bunachar sonraí a fheistiú, agus "
"luach hash MD5 in-athsheolta in ionad ceithre charachtar deiridh den ainm "
"gearrtha. Ina theannta sin, casann an cúltaca aitheantóirí bunachar sonraí "
"go uile-uachtaracha."

msgid ""
"To prevent these transformations (this is usually required only when dealing "
"with legacy databases or accessing tables which belong to other users), use "
"a quoted name as the value for ``db_table``::"
msgstr ""
"Chun na claochlú seo a chosc (ní theastaíonn sé seo de ghnáth ach amháin "
"nuair a dhéileálann tú le bunachair sonraí oidhreachta nó rochtain a fháil "
"ar tháblaí a bhaineann le húsáideoirí eile), bain úsáid as ainm luaite mar "
"luach do `db_table``:"

msgid ""
"Quoted names can also be used with Django's other supported database "
"backends; except for Oracle, however, the quotes have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir ainmneacha luaite a úsáid freisin le cúltaca bunachar sonraí "
"tacaithe eile Django; seachas Oracle, áfach, níl aon éifeacht ag na luachana."

msgid ""
"When running ``migrate``, an ``ORA-06552`` error may be encountered if "
"certain Oracle keywords are used as the name of a model field or the value "
"of a ``db_column`` option.  Django quotes all identifiers used in queries to "
"prevent most such problems, but this error can still occur when an Oracle "
"datatype is used as a column name.  In particular, take care to avoid using "
"the names ``date``, ``timestamp``, ``number`` or ``float`` as a field name."
msgstr ""
"Agus ``imirce`` á reáchtáil, féadfar earráid ``ORA-06552`` a bheith ann má "
"úsáidtear eochairfhocail áirithe Oracle mar ainm réimse samhail nó luach "
"rogha ``db_column``. Luann Django gach aitheantóir a úsáidtear i gceisteanna "
"chun an chuid is mó de na fadhbanna den sórt sin a chosc, ach is féidir an "
"earráid seo tarlú fós nuair a úsáidtear cineál sonraí Oracle mar ainm colún "
"Go háirithe, bí cúramach na hainmneacha ``dáta ``, `timestamp``, ``uimhre`` "
"nó ``snám`` a sheachaint mar ainm réimse."

msgid "NULL and empty strings"
msgstr "NULL agus teaghráin folamh"

msgid ""
"Django generally prefers to use the empty string (``''``) rather than "
"``NULL``, but Oracle treats both identically. To get around this, the Oracle "
"backend ignores an explicit ``null`` option on fields that have the empty "
"string as a possible value and generates DDL as if ``null=True``. When "
"fetching from the database, it is assumed that a ``NULL`` value in one of "
"these fields really means the empty string, and the data is silently "
"converted to reflect this assumption."
msgstr ""
"Is fearr le Django go ginearálta an teaghrán folamh a úsáid seachas "
"``NULL``, ach déileálann Oracle leis an dá rud céanna. Chun timpeall air "
"seo, déanann cúltaca Oracle neamhaird ar rogha sainráite ``null`` ar réimsí "
"a bhfuil an teaghrán folamh acu mar luach féideartha agus a ghineann DDL "
"amhail is dá mba ``Null = True``. Nuair a bhfaightear ón mbunachar sonraí, "
"glactar leis go gciallaíonn luach ``NULL`` i gceann de na réimsí seo an "
"sreang folamh i ndáiríre, agus déantar na sonraí a thiontú go ciúin chun an "
"toimhde seo a léiriú."

msgid ""
"The Oracle backend stores each ``TextField`` as an ``NCLOB`` column. Oracle "
"imposes some limitations on the usage of such LOB columns in general:"
msgstr ""

msgid "LOB columns may not be used as primary keys."
msgstr "Ní féidir colúin LOB a úsáid mar eochracha príomhúil."

msgid "LOB columns may not be used in indexes."
msgstr "Ní féidir colúin LOB a úsáid in innéacsanna."

msgid ""
"LOB columns may not be used in a ``SELECT DISTINCT`` list. This means that "
"attempting to use the ``QuerySet.distinct`` method on a model that includes "
"``TextField`` columns will result in an ``ORA-00932`` error when run against "
"Oracle. As a workaround, use the ``QuerySet.defer`` method in conjunction "
"with ``distinct()`` to prevent ``TextField`` columns from being included in "
"the ``SELECT DISTINCT`` list."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir colúin LOB a úsáid i liosta ``SELECT DISTINCT``. Ciallaíonn sé seo "
"go mbeidh earráid ``ORA-00932` mar thoradh ar iarracht an modh "
"``QuerySet.Distinct' a úsáid ar mhúnla a chuimsíonn colúin ``TextField`` mar "
"thoradh ar earráid ``ORA-00932` nuair a bheidh á reáchtáil i gcoinne Oracle. "
"Mar réiteach, bain úsáid as an modh ``QuerySet.defer`` i gcomhar le "
"``different () ``chun cosc a chur ar cholúin ``TextField`` a chur san "
"áireamh sa liosta ``SELECT DISTINCT``."

msgid "Subclassing the built-in database backends"
msgstr "Fo-aicmiú na gcúltaca bunachar sonraí ionsuite"

msgid ""
"Django comes with built-in database backends. You may subclass an existing "
"database backends to modify its behavior, features, or configuration."
msgstr ""
"Tagann Django le cúltaca bunachar sonraí ionsuite. Féadfaidh tú cúltaca "
"bunachar sonraí atá ann cheana a fho-aicmiú chun a iompar, a ghnéithe nó a "
"chumraíocht a mhodhnú."

msgid ""
"Consider, for example, that you need to change a single database feature. "
"First, you have to create a new directory with a ``base`` module in it. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"Smaoinigh, mar shampla, go gcaithfidh tú gné bunachar sonraí amháin a athrú. "
"Ar dtús, caithfidh tú eolaire nua a chruthú le modúl ``base ``ann. Mar "
"shampla:"

