msgid "Configuring form elements' HTML ``id`` attributes and ``<label>`` tags"
msgstr ""
"<label>Eilimintí foirme a chumrú tréithe 'HTML ``id`` agus clibeanna ```"

msgid "By default, the form rendering methods include:"
msgstr "De réir réamhshocraithe, tá na modhanna rindreála foirme tá:"

msgid "HTML ``id`` attributes on the form elements."
msgstr "Tréithe HTML ``id ``ar na heilimintí foirme."

msgid ""
"The corresponding ``<label>`` tags around the labels. An HTML ``<label>`` "
"tag designates which label text is associated with which form element. This "
"small enhancement makes forms more usable and more accessible to assistive "
"devices. It's always a good idea to use ``<label>`` tags."
msgstr ""
"Na clibeanna comhfhreagracha <label>```timpeall na lipéid. Ainmníonn clib "
"HTML <label>```cén téacs lipéad a bhaineann leis an eilimint foirme. Déanann "
"an feabhsú beag seo foirmeacha níos inúsáidte agus níos inrochtana do "
"ghléasanna cúnta. Is smaoineamh maith é i gcónaí clibeanna <label>```a úsáid."

msgid ""
"The ``id`` attribute values are generated by prepending ``id_`` to the form "
"field names.  This behavior is configurable, though, if you want to change "
"the ``id`` convention or remove HTML ``id`` attributes and ``<label>`` tags "
"entirely."
msgstr ""
"Gintear na luachanna tréithe ``id`` trí `id_`` a réamhfheidhmiú chuig "
"ainmneacha réimse na foirme. <label>Tá an t-iompar seo inchumraithe, áfach, "
"más mian leat an coinbhinsiún ``id ``a athrú nó tréithe ``id`` HTML agus "
"clibeanna ```` a bhaint go hiomlán."

msgid ""
"Use the ``auto_id`` argument to the ``Form`` constructor to control the "
"``id`` and label behavior. This argument must be ``True``, ``False`` or a "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an argóint ``auto_id`` chuig an tógálaí ``Form ``chun an `id`` agus an "
"iompar lipéad a rialú. Caithfidh an argóint seo a bheith ``True``, `Fréag`` "
"nó teaghrán."

msgid ""
"If ``auto_id`` is ``False``, then the form output will not include "
"``<label>`` tags nor ``id`` attributes:"
msgstr ""
"<label>Más é ``auto_id`` `False``, ansin ní bheidh clibeanna ```` ná tréithe "
"``id ``san áireamh sa aschur foirme:"

msgid ""
"If ``auto_id`` is set to ``True``, then the form output *will* include "
"``<label>`` tags and will use the field name as its ``id`` for each form "
"field:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``auto_id`` socraithe go ``True``, ansin cuirfear clibeanna ```` san "
"aschur foirme** agus úsáidfidh sé ainm an réimse mar a `id <label>``do gach "
"réimse foirme:"

msgid ""
"If ``auto_id`` is set to a string containing the format character ``'%s'``, "
"then the form output will include ``<label>`` tags, and will generate ``id`` "
"attributes based on the format string. For example, for a format string "
"``'field_%s'``, a field named ``subject`` will get the ``id`` value "
"``'field_subject'``. Continuing our example:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``auto_id`` socraithe ar shreang ina bhfuil an carachtar formáide "
"```%s'``, ansin beidh clibeanna ```` san aschur foirme, agus ginfidh sé "
"tréithe ``id <label>``bunaithe ar an teaghrán formáide. Mar shampla, i gcás "
"teaghrán formáide ```field_%s'``, gheobhaidh réimse darb ainm ```subject`` "
"an luach ``id`` ```field_subject'``. Leanúint lenár sampla:"

msgid ""
"If ``auto_id`` is set to any other true value -- such as a string that "
"doesn't include ``%s`` -- then the library will act as if ``auto_id`` is "
"``True``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá `auto_id`` socraithe ar aon luach fíor eile -- mar shampla sreang nach "
"bhfuil ``%s`` san áireamh -- ansin gníomhóidh an leabharlann amhail is dá "
"mbeidh ``auto_id`` ``True``."

msgid "By default, ``auto_id`` is set to the string ``'id_%s'``."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, socraítear ``auto_id`` go dtí an teaghrán "
"``'id_%s'``."

msgid ""
"A translatable string (defaults to a colon (``:``) in English) that will be "
"appended after any label name when a form is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Sreang inaistrithe (réamhshocraithe go colon (``:``) i mBéarla) a chuirfear "
"isteach i ndiaidh aon ainm lipéad nuair a dhéantar foirm a léiriú."

msgid ""
"It's possible to customize that character, or omit it entirely, using the "
"``label_suffix`` parameter:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an carachtar sin a shaincheapadh, nó é a fhágáil go hiomlán, ag "
"baint úsáide as an paraiméadar ``label_suffix`:"

msgid ""
"Note that the label suffix is added only if the last character of the label "
"isn't a punctuation character (in English, those are ``.``, ``!``, ``?`` or "
"``:``)."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach gcuirtear iarmhír an lipéad leis ach mura carachtar "
"poncaíochta é an carachtar deireanach den lipéad (i mBéarla, is iad sin "
"``.``, ``! ``,``? ``nó``: ``)."

msgid ""
"Fields can also define their own :attr:`~django.forms.Field.label_suffix`. "
"This will take precedence over :attr:`Form.label_suffix "
"<django.forms.Form.label_suffix>`. The suffix can also be overridden at "
"runtime using the ``label_suffix`` parameter "
"to :meth:`~django.forms.BoundField.label_tag`/ :meth:`~django.forms.BoundField.legend_tag`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le réimsí a gcuid féin a shainiú freisin: attr: "
"`~django.forms.field.label_suffix`. <django.forms.Form.label_suffix>Beidh "
"tosaíocht aige seo thair:attr: `form.label_suffix `. Is féidir an iarmhír a "
"shárú freisin ag rith ag baint úsáide as an paraiméadar ``label_suffix`` "
"to:meth: `~django.forms.boundfield.label_tag`/:Meth: "
"`~django.forms.boundfield.legend_tag`."

msgid ""
"When set to ``True`` (the default), required form fields will have the "
"``required`` HTML attribute."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh sé socraithe go ``True`` (an réamhshocraithe), beidh an "
"tréith HTML ``riachtanaithe`` ag réimsí foirme riachtanacha."

msgid ""
":doc:`Formsets </topics/forms/formsets>` instantiate forms with "
"``use_required_attribute=False`` to avoid incorrect browser validation when "
"adding and deleting forms from a formset."
msgstr ""
":doc: `Formsets` foirmeacha éagsúla le ``use_required_attribute=false`` </"
"topics/forms/formsets> chun bailíochtú brabhsálaí mícheart a sheachaint "
"nuair a bhíonn foirmeacha á chur leis agus a scriosadh ó fhoirmeacha."

msgid "Configuring the rendering of a form's widgets"
msgstr "Rindreáil giuirléidí foirme a chumrú"

msgid ""
"Specifies the :doc:`renderer <renderers>` to use for the form. Defaults to "
