"má leathnaímid ár bhFoirm Teagmhála chun ``ImageField`` ar a dtugtar "
"``mugshot ``a áireamh, ní mór dúinn na sonraí comhaid ina bhfuil an íomhá "
"mugshot a cheangal:"

msgid ""
"In practice, you will usually specify ``request.FILES`` as the source of "
"file data (just like you use ``request.POST`` as the source of form data):"
msgstr ""
"Go praiticiúil, de ghnáth sonróidh tú ``Request.Files`` mar fhoinse sonraí "
"comhad (díreach mar a úsáideann tú ``Request.post`` mar fhoinse sonraí "
"foirme):"

msgid ""
"Constructing an unbound form is the same as always -- omit both form data "
"*and* file data:"
msgstr ""
"Tá foirm neamhcheangailte a thógáil mar an gcéanna agus i gcónaí - fág an dá "
"shonraí foirme* agus* sonraí comhaid:"

msgid "Testing for multipart forms"
msgstr "Tástáil le haghaidh foirmeacha ilpháirteach"

msgid ""
"If you're writing reusable views or templates, you may not know ahead of "
"time whether your form is a multipart form or not. The ``is_multipart()`` "
"method tells you whether the form requires multipart encoding for submission:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá tuairimí nó teimpléid in-athúsáidte á scríobh agat, b'fhéidir nach "
"bhfuil a fhios agat roimh am an bhfoirm ilpháirteach í d'fhoirm nó nach "
"bhfuil. Insíonn an modh ``is_multipart () ``duit an bhfuil ionchódú "
"ilpháirteach ag teastáil ón bhfoirm le haghaidh aighneachta:"

msgid "Here's an example of how you might use this in a template:"
msgstr "Seo sampla den chaoi a bhféadfá é seo a úsáid i dteimpléad:"

msgid "Subclassing forms"
msgstr "Foirmeacha fo-aicmithe"

msgid ""
"If you have multiple ``Form`` classes that share fields, you can use "
"subclassing to remove redundancy."
msgstr ""
"Má tá iliomad ranganna ``Foirme`` agat a roinneann réimsí, is féidir leat fo-"
"aicmiú a úsáid chun iomarcaíocht a bhaint."

msgid ""
"When you subclass a custom ``Form`` class, the resulting subclass will "
"include all fields of the parent class(es), followed by the fields you "
"define in the subclass."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a dhéanann tú rang saincheaptha ``Foirm ``a fho-aicmiú, beidh gach "
"réimse den tuismitheoir aicme (anna) san fho-aicme mar thoradh air, agus na "
"réimsí a shainmhíníonn tú sa fho-aicme ina dhiaidh sin."

msgid ""
"In this example, ``ContactFormWithPriority`` contains all the fields from "
"``ContactForm``, plus an additional field, ``priority``. The ``ContactForm`` "
"fields are ordered first:"
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, tá na réimsí go léir ó `ContactFormWithPriority``, móide "
"réimse breise, ``priority``. Déantar na réimsí `Teagmhála`` a ordú ar dtús:"

msgid ""
"It's possible to subclass multiple forms, treating forms as mixins. In this "
"example, ``BeatleForm`` subclasses both ``PersonForm`` and "
"``InstrumentForm`` (in that order), and its field list includes the fields "
"from the parent classes:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir foirmeacha iolracha a fho-aicmiú, ag caitheamh le foirmeacha mar "
"mheascáin. Sa sampla seo, tá fo-aicmí ``Beatleform`` agus ``InstrumentForm`` "
"araon (san ord sin), agus cuimsíonn a liosta réimsí na réimsí ó na "
"tuismitheoireachtaí:"

msgid ""
"It's possible to declaratively remove a ``Field`` inherited from a parent "
"class by setting the name of the field to ``None`` on the subclass. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir ``Field`` a bhaint go dearbhaithe ó rang tuismitheoirí trí ainm an "
"réimse a shocrú go ``None ``ar an bhfo-aicme. Mar shampla:"

msgid "Prefixes for forms"
msgstr "Réamhréamhacha le haghaidh foirmeacha"

msgid ""
"You can put several Django forms inside one ``<form>`` tag. To give each "
"``Form`` its own namespace, use the ``prefix`` keyword argument:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat roinnt foirmeacha Django a chur taobh istigh de chlib "
"``<form>`` amháin. Chun a spás ainmneacha féin a thabhairt do gach ``Form``, "
"bain úsáid as an argóint eochairfhocal ``prefix`:"

msgid "The prefix can also be specified on the form class:"
msgstr "Is féidir an réimír a shonrú freisin ar an rang foirme:"

msgid "Form fields"
msgstr "Réimsí foirm"

msgid ""
"When you create a ``Form`` class, the most important part is defining the "
"fields of the form. Each field has custom validation logic, along with a few "
"other hooks."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chruthaíonn tú rang ``Foirme``, is é an chuid is tábhachtaí ná "
"réimsí na foirme a shainiú. Tá loighic bailíochtaithe saincheaptha ag gach "
"réimse, mar aon le cúpla crúca eile."

msgid ""
"Although the primary way you'll use ``Field`` classes is in ``Form`` "
"classes, you can also instantiate them and use them directly to get a better "
"idea of how they work. Each ``Field`` instance has a ``clean()`` method, "
"which takes a single argument and either raises a "
"``django.core.exceptions.ValidationError`` exception or returns the clean "
"value:"
msgstr ""
"Cé go bhfuil an príomhbhealach a úsáidfidh tú ranganna ``Field`` i ranganna "
"``Foirme``, is féidir leat iad a chur i bhfeidhm agus iad a úsáid go díreach "
"chun tuairim níos fearr a fháil ar an gcaoi a n-oibríonn siad. Tá modh "
"``clean () ``ag gach cás ``Field`, a thógann argóint amháin agus a ardaíonn "
"eisceacht ``Django.Core.Exceptions.ValidationError`` nó a thugann an luach "
"glan ar ais:"

msgid "Core field arguments"
msgstr "Argóintí lárnach réimse"

msgid ""
"Each ``Field`` class constructor takes at least these arguments. Some "
"``Field`` classes take additional, field-specific arguments, but the "
"following should *always* be accepted:"
msgstr ""
"Glacann gach tógálaí ranga ``Field` ar a laghad na hargóintí seo. Glacann "
"roinnt ranganna ``Réimse`` argóintí breise, atá sonrach le réimse, ach ba "
"cheart glacadh leis na rudaí seo a leanas i gcónaí*:"

msgid "``required``"
msgstr "```riachtanai``"

msgid ""
"By default, each ``Field`` class assumes the value is required, so if you "
"pass an empty value -- either ``None`` or the empty string (``\"\"``) -- "
"then ``clean()`` will raise a ``ValidationError`` exception:"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, glacann gach rang ``Field`` go bhfuil an luach ag "
"teastáil, mar sin má chuireann tú luach folamh -- ``None`` nó an teaghrán "
"folamh (``````````````) -- ansin ardóidh ``clean () ``eisceacht "
"``ValidationError``:"

msgid ""
"To specify that a field is *not* required, pass ``required=False`` to the "
"``Field`` constructor:"
msgstr ""
"Chun a shonrú go bhfuil réimse *ní gá, cuir ``required=False`` chuig an "
"tógálaí ``Field``:"

msgid ""
"If a ``Field`` has ``required=False`` and you pass ``clean()`` an empty "
"value, then ``clean()`` will return a *normalized* empty value rather than "
"raising ``ValidationError``. For ``CharField``, this will "
"return :attr:`~CharField.empty_value` which defaults to an empty string. For "
"other ``Field`` classes, it might be ``None``. (This varies from field to "
"field.)"
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``required=false ``ag `Field`` agus má chuireann tú luach folamh ar "
"``clean ()``, ansin cuirfidh `clean () ``luach folm*normalaithe* ar ais "
"seachas ``ValidationError`` a ardú. Maidir le ``charfield``, cuirfidh sé seo "
"ar ais: attr: `~charfield.empty_value` atá réamhshocraithe go sreang folamh. "
"Maidir le ranganna eile ``Field`, d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith ``None``. "
"(Athraíonn sé seo ó réimse go réimse.)"

msgid ""
"Widgets of required form fields have the ``required`` HTML attribute. Set "
"the :attr:`Form.use_required_attribute` attribute to ``False`` to disable "
"it. The ``required`` attribute isn't included on forms of formsets because "
"the browser validation may not be correct when adding and deleting formsets."
msgstr ""
"Tá an tréith HTML “riachtanach” ag giuirléidí de réimsí foirme riachtanacha. "
"Socraigh an tréith: attr: `Form.USE_REQUIRED_ATTRIBUTE` le `False`` chun é a "
"dhíchumasú. Ní chuirtear an tréith “riachtanach” san áireamh ar fhoirmeacha "
"foirmeacha mar b'fhéidir nach mbeidh bailíochtú an bhrabhsálaí ceart agus "
"foirmeacha á gcur leis agus á scriosadh."

msgid "``label``"
msgstr "``lipéad``"

msgid ""
"The ``label`` argument lets you specify the \"human-friendly\" label for "
"this field. This is used when the ``Field`` is displayed in a ``Form``."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``lipéad`` duit an lipéad “atá cairdiúil don duine” don "
"réimse seo a shonrú. Úsáidtear é seo nuair a thaispeántar an ``Réimse`` i "
"`Foirm``."

msgid ""
"As explained in :ref:`ref-forms-api-outputting-html`, the default label for "
"a ``Field`` is generated from the field name by converting all underscores "
"to spaces and upper-casing the first letter. Specify ``label`` if that "
"default behavior doesn't result in an adequate label."
msgstr ""
"Mar a mhínítear in :ref:`ref-forms-api-outputting-html`, gintear an lipéad "
"réamhshocraithe le haghaidh ``Réimse`` ó ainm na páirce trí gach foscór a "
"thiontú go spásanna agus cás uachtair na chéad litir a chur isteach. "
"Sonraigh ``lipéad`` mura mbíonn lipéad imleor mar thoradh ar an iompar "
"réamhshocraithe sin."

msgid ""
"Here's a full example ``Form`` that implements ``label`` for two of its "
"fields. We've specified ``auto_id=False`` to simplify the output:"
msgstr ""
"Seo sampla iomlán ``Foirm ``a chuireann `lipéad`` i bhfeidhm do dhá cheann "
"dá réimsí. Tá `auto_id=false`` sonraithe againn chun an t-aschur a shimpliú:"

msgid "``label_suffix``"
msgstr "``iarmhair_lipéad``"

msgid ""
"The ``label_suffix`` argument lets you override the "
"form's :attr:`~django.forms.Form.label_suffix` on a per-field basis:"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint `label_suffix`` duit an fhoirm 's:attr: "
"`~django.forms.form.label_suffix` a shárú ar bhonn in aghaidh an réimse:"

msgid "``initial``"
msgstr "``tosaithe``"

msgid ""
"The ``initial`` argument lets you specify the initial value to use when "
"rendering this ``Field`` in an unbound ``Form``."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``tosaithe`` duit an luach tosaigh le húsáid a shonrú "
"agus an ``Réimse`` seo a rindreáil i ``Foirme`` neamhcheangailte."

msgid ""
"To specify dynamic initial data, see the :attr:`Form.initial` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Chun sonraí tosaigh dinimiciúla a shonrú, féach an paraiméadar: attr: "
"`Form.initial`."

msgid ""
"The use-case for this is when you want to display an \"empty\" form in which "
"a field is initialized to a particular value. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Is é an cás úsáide seo nuair is mian leat foirm “folamh” a thaispeáint ina "
"ndéantar réimse a thionscnamh go luach áirithe. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"You may be thinking, why not just pass a dictionary of the initial values as "
"data when displaying the form? Well, if you do that, you'll trigger "
"validation, and the HTML output will include any validation errors:"
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go bhfuil tú ag smaoineamh, cén fáth nach rachadh foclóir de na "
"luachanna tosaigh mar shonraí agus an fhoirm á thaispeáint agat? Bhuel, má "
"dhéanann tú é sin, spreagfaidh tú bailíochtú, agus beidh aon earráidí "
"bailíochtaithe san aschur HTML san áireamh:"

msgid ""
"This is why ``initial`` values are only displayed for unbound forms. For "
"bound forms, the HTML output will use the bound data."
msgstr ""
"Sin é an fáth nach dtaispeántar luachanna ``tosaithe`` ach le haghaidh "
"foirmeacha neamhcheangailte. Maidir le foirmeacha ceangailte, úsáidfidh an t-"
"aschur HTML na sonraí ceangailte."

msgid ""
"Also note that ``initial`` values are *not* used as \"fallback\" data in "
"validation if a particular field's value is not given. ``initial`` values "
"are *only* intended for initial form display:"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara freisin nach n-úsáidtear luachanna ``tosaithe`` mar "
"shonraí “fillte” i mbailíochtú mura dtugtar luach réimse áirithe. Is iad "
"luachanna ``tosaithe`` *amháin* atá beartaithe le haghaidh taispeáint foirme "
"tosaigh:"

msgid "Instead of a constant, you can also pass any callable:"
msgstr "In ionad tairiseach, is féidir leat aon ghlaoch a rith freisin:"

msgid ""
"The callable will be evaluated only when the unbound form is displayed, not "
"when it is defined."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhéanfar an glaoch a mheas ach amháin nuair a thaispeántar an fhoirm "
"neamhcheangailte, ní nuair a shainmhínítear í."

msgid "``widget``"
msgstr "``giuirléid``"

msgid ""
"The ``widget`` argument lets you specify a ``Widget`` class to use when "
"rendering this ``Field``. See :doc:`/ref/forms/widgets` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``widget`` duit rang ``Widget`` a shonrú le húsáid agus "
"an `Réimse ``seo á rindreáil. Féach: doc: `/ref/forms/giuirléidí `le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise."

msgid "``help_text``"
msgstr "``téacs_cabhrach``"

msgid ""
"The ``help_text`` argument lets you specify descriptive text for this "
"``Field``. If you provide ``help_text``, it will be displayed next to the "
"``Field`` when the ``Field`` is rendered by one of the convenience ``Form`` "
"methods (e.g., ``as_ul()``)."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``help_text`` duit téacs tuairisciúil a shonrú don "
"``Field`` seo. Má sholáthraíonn tú ``help_text``, taispeánfar é in aice leis "
"an ``Réimse`` nuair a dhéanfar an ``Field`` le ceann de na modhanna áisiúla "
"``Foirm`` (m.sh., ``as_ul () ``)."

msgid ""
"Like the model field's :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.help_text`, this value "
"isn't HTML-escaped in automatically-generated forms."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil leis an réimse samhail:: attr: `~django.db.models.field.help_text`, "
"níl an luach seo ag éalú HTML i bhfoirmeacha a ghintear go huathoibríoch."

msgid ""
"Here's a full example ``Form`` that implements ``help_text`` for two of its "
"fields. We've specified ``auto_id=False`` to simplify the output:"
msgstr ""
"Seo sampla iomlán ``Form`` a chuireann ``help_text`` i bhfeidhm do dhá "
"cheann dá réimsí. Tá `auto_id=false`` sonraithe againn chun an t-aschur a "
"shimpliú:"

msgid ""
"When a field has help text it is associated with its input using the ``aria-"
"describedby`` HTML attribute. If the widget is rendered in a ``<fieldset>`` "
"then ``aria-describedby`` is added to this element, otherwise it is added to "
"the widget's ``<input>``:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn téacs cabhrach ag réimse tá baint aige lena ionchur ag baint "
"úsáide as an tréith HTML ``aria-describedby``. <input>Má chuirtear an "
"giuirléid i ```an <fieldset>sin cuirtear ``aria-describedby`` leis an "
"eilimint seo, ar shlí eile cuirtear é le``` `giuirléid:"

msgid ""
"When adding a custom ``aria-describedby`` attribute, make sure to also "
"include the ``id`` of the ``help_text`` element (if used) in the desired "
"order. For screen reader users, descriptions will be read in their order of "
"appearance inside ``aria-describedby``:"
msgstr ""
"Agus tréith saincheaptha ``aria-describedby`` á chur leis, déan cinnte go "
"gcuirfidh tú ``id ``den eilimint ``help_text`` (má úsáidtear é) san ord atá "
"ag teastáil san áireamh freisin. Maidir le húsáideoirí léitheoirí scáileáin, "
"léitear tuairiscí ina n-ord cuma laistigh de `aria-describedby``:"

msgid "``aria-describedby`` support was added for ``<fieldset>``."
msgstr "<fieldset>Cuireadh tacaíocht ``aria-describedby`` leis do ````."

msgid "``error_messages``"
msgstr "``teachtaireachtaí earráid``"

msgid ""
"The ``error_messages`` argument lets you override the default messages that "
"the field will raise. Pass in a dictionary with keys matching the error "
"messages you want to override. For example, here is the default error "
"message:"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``error_messages`` duit na teachtaireachtaí "
"réamhshocraithe a ardóidh an réimse a shárú. Pas isteach i bhfoclóir le "
"heochracha a mheaitseálann leis na teachtaireachtaí earráide is mian leat a "
"shárú. Mar shampla, seo an teachtaireacht earráide réamhshocraithe:"

msgid "And here is a custom error message:"
msgstr "Agus seo teachtaireacht earráide saincheaptha:"

msgid ""
"In the `built-in Field classes`_ section below, each ``Field`` defines the "
"error message keys it uses."
msgstr ""
"Sa chuid `ranganna Réimse ionsuite `_ thíos, sainmhíníonn gach ``Field` na "
"heochracha teachtaireachta earráide a úsáideann sé."

msgid "``validators``"
msgstr "``bailíochtóirí ``"

msgid ""
"The ``validators`` argument lets you provide a list of validation functions "
"for this field."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``bailíochtaire`` duit liosta feidhmeanna bailíochtaithe "
"a sholáthar don réimse seo."

msgid ""
"See the :doc:`validators documentation </ref/validators>` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Féach na:doc: doiciméadú `bailíochtóir` le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais. </ref/"
"validators>"

msgid "``localize``"
msgstr "``logánaithe``"

msgid ""
"The ``localize`` argument enables the localization of form data input, as "
"well as the rendered output."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an argóint `localize`` ar chumas ionchur sonraí foirme a logánú, "
"chomh maith leis an aschur rindreáilte."

msgid ""
"See the :doc:`format localization documentation </topics/i18n/formatting>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Féach an :doc:`formáid doiciméadú logánaithe </topics/i18n/formatting>` le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

msgid "``disabled``"
msgstr "``díchumasa``"

msgid ""
"The ``disabled`` boolean argument, when set to ``True``, disables a form "
"field using the ``disabled`` HTML attribute so that it won't be editable by "
"users. Even if a user tampers with the field's value submitted to the "
"server, it will be ignored in favor of the value from the form's initial "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an argóint boolean ``díchumasa``, nuair a shocraíonn sé go ``True``, "
"réimse foirme a dhíchumasú ag baint úsáide as an tréith HTML ``disabled`` "
"ionas nach mbeidh úsáideoirí é in eagar. Fiú má chuireann úsáideoir isteach "
"ar luach an réimse a chuirtear chuig an bhfreastalaí, déanfar neamhaird air "
"i bhfabhar an luach ó shonraí tosaigh na foirme."

msgid ""
"The ``template_name`` argument allows a custom template to be used when the "
"field is rendered with :meth:`~django.forms.BoundField.as_field_group`. By "
"default this value is set to ``\"django/forms/field.html\"``. Can be changed "
"per field by overriding this attribute or more generally by overriding the "
"default template, see also :ref:`overriding-built-in-field-templates`."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``template_name`` teimpléad saincheaptha a úsáid nuair a "
"dhéantar an réimse a léiriú le:meth: "
"`~django.forms.boundfield.as_field_group`. De réir réamhshocraithe tá an "
"luach seo socraithe go ``” django/forms/field.html “``. Is féidir é a athrú "
"in aghaidh an réimse tríd an tréith seo a shárú nó níos ginearálta tríd an "
"teimpléad réamhshocraithe a shárú, féach freis:ref: `overriding-built-in-"
"field-templates`."

msgid "``bound_field_class``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ``bound_field_class`` attribute allows a per-field override "
"of :attr:`.Form.bound_field_class`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Checking if the field data has changed"
msgstr "Seiceáil an bhfuil athrú tagtha ar na sonraí réimse"

msgid "``has_changed()``"
msgstr "``aigh_athraigh () ``"

msgid ""
"The ``has_changed()`` method is used to determine if the field value has "
"changed from the initial value. Returns ``True`` or ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an modh ``has_changed () ``chun a chinneadh an bhfuil luach an "
"réimse athraithe ón luach tosaigh. Tuairisceáin ``True`` nó ``False``."

msgid "See the :class:`Form.has_changed()` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Féach an doiciméadach:class: `Form.has_Changed () `le haghaidh tuilleadh "
"faisnéise."

msgid "Built-in ``Field`` classes"
msgstr "Ranganna ``Réimse ``tógtha"

msgid ""
"Naturally, the ``forms`` library comes with a set of ``Field`` classes that "
"represent common validation needs. This section documents each built-in "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Ar ndóigh, tagann sraith ranganna ``Réimse`` sa leabharlann `foirme`` a "
"léiríonn riachtanais choiteanna bailíochtaithe. Doiciméadaítear an chuid seo "
"gach réimse ionsuite."

msgid ""
"For each field, we describe the default widget used if you don't specify "
"``widget``. We also specify the value returned when you provide an empty "
"value (see the section on ``required`` above to understand what that means)."
msgstr ""
"I gcás gach réimse, déanaimid cur síos ar an ngiuirléid réamhshocraithe a "
"úsáidtear mura sonraíonn tú ``giuirléid`. Sonraímid freisin an luach a "
"chuirtear ar ais nuair a sholáthraíonn tú luach folamh (féach an chuid ar "
"``riachtan`` thuas chun a thuiscint cad a chiallaíonn sé sin)."

msgid "``BooleanField``"
msgstr "``Booleanfield``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`CheckboxInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `CheckboxInput`"

msgid "Empty value: ``False``"
msgstr "Luach folamh: ``Fréag``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``True`` or ``False`` value."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Luach Python ``True`` nó `False``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the value is ``True`` (e.g. the check box is checked) if the "
"field has ``required=True``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gurb é an luach ``True`` (m.sh. seiceáiltear an bosca seiceála) "
"má tá ``required=True`` sa réimse."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``"
msgstr "Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``"

msgid ""
"Since all ``Field`` subclasses have ``required=True`` by default, the "
"validation condition here is important. If you want to include a boolean in "
"your form that can be either ``True`` or ``False`` (e.g. a checked or "
"unchecked checkbox), you must remember to pass in ``required=False`` when "
"creating the ``BooleanField``."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go bhfuil `required=True`` ag gach fo-aicme ``Field` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe, tá an coinníoll bailíochtaithe anseo tábhachtach. Más mian "
"leat boolean a chur san áireamh i d'fhoirm a d'fhéadfadh a bheith ``True`` "
"nó `False`` (m.sh. bosca seiceála seiceáilte nó neamhsheiceáilte), ní mór "
"duit cuimhneamh a chur isteach ``required=False`` agus an `Booleanfield`` á "
"chruthú."

msgid "``CharField``"
msgstr "``Charfield``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`TextInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `textInput`"

msgid "Empty value: Whatever you've given as :attr:`empty_value`."
msgstr "Luach folamh: Cibé rud a thug tú mar: attr: `empty_value`."

msgid "Normalizes to: A string."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Sreang."

msgid ""
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.MaxLengthValidator` "
"and :class:`~django.core.validators.MinLengthValidator` if ``max_length`` "
"and ``min_length`` are provided. Otherwise, all inputs are valid."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:aicme: `~django.core.validators.maxLengthValidator` agus:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.minLengthValidator` má chuirtear ``max_length "
"``agus ``min_length`` ```min_length``` ``ar fáil. Seachas sin, tá gach "
"ionchur bailí."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``max_length``, ``min_length``"
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, ``max_length ``, "
"`min_length`` `"

msgid "Has the following optional arguments for validation:"
msgstr "Tá na hargóintí roghnacha seo a leanas ann le haghaidh bailíoch"

msgid ""
"If provided, these arguments ensure that the string is at most or at least "
"the given length."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear ar fáil, cinntíonn na hargóintí seo go bhfuil an sreang ar a "
"mhéad nó ar a laghad an fad tugtha."

msgid ""
"If ``True`` (default), the value will be stripped of leading and trailing "
"whitespace."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``True`` (réamhshocraithe), déanfar an luach a bhaint as spás bán "
"tosaigh agus rianúil."

msgid "The value to use to represent \"empty\". Defaults to an empty string."
msgstr ""
"An luach le húsáid chun “folamh” a léiriú. Réamhshocraithe chuig teaghrán "
"folamh."

msgid "``ChoiceField``"
msgstr "``Réimse roghnaí``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`Select`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `Roghnaigh `"

msgid "Empty value: ``''`` (an empty string)"
msgstr "Luach folamh: ``\"``(teaghrán folamh)"

msgid "Validates that the given value exists in the list of choices."
msgstr "Bailíonn sé go bhfuil an luach a thugtar ar liosta na roghanna."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid_choice``"
msgstr "Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `invalid_choice``"

msgid ""
"The ``invalid_choice`` error message may contain ``%(value)s``, which will "
"be replaced with the selected choice."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``% (value) s`` sa teachtaireacht earráide "
"``invalid_choice``, agus cuirfear an rogha roghnaithe in ionad."

msgid "Takes one extra argument:"
msgstr "Tógann sé argóint breise amháin:"

msgid ""
"Either an :term:`iterable` of 2-tuples to use as choices for this "
"field, :ref:`enumeration type <field-choices-enum-types>`, or a callable "
"that returns such an iterable. This argument accepts the same formats as the "
"``choices`` argument to a model field. See the :ref:`model field reference "
"documentation on choices <field-choices>` for more details. If the argument "
"is a callable, it is evaluated each time the field's form is initialized, in "
"addition to during rendering. Defaults to an empty list."
msgstr ""
"<field-choices-enum-types>Ceachtar:term: `iterable` de dhá thúpla le húsáid "
"mar roghanna don réimse seo, :ref: `cineál áireamh `, nó glaoch a thugann "
"athraitheach den sórt sin. Glacann an argóint seo leis na formáidí céanna "
"leis an argóint ``roghna`` le réimse samhail. Féach an:ref: `doiciméadú "
"tagartha réimse samhail maidir le roghanna <field-choices>`le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh sonraí. Má tá an argóint inghlaonta, déantar é a mheas gach uair a "
"thionscnaítear foirm an réimse, i dteannta le linn rindreála. "
"Réamhshocraithe ar liosta folamh."

msgid "Choice type"
msgstr "Cineál rogha"

msgid ""
"This field normalizes choices to strings, so if choices are required in "
"other data types, such as integers or booleans, consider "
"using :class:`TypedChoiceField` instead."
msgstr ""
"Normalaíonn an réimse seo roghanna le teaghráin, mar sin má theastaíonn "
"roghanna i gcineálacha sonraí eile, mar shampla sláimhreacha nó booleans, "
"smaoinigh ar: class: `TypedChoiceField` a úsáid ina ionad."

msgid "``DateField``"
msgstr "``Dáta réimse``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`DateInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `DateInput`"

msgid "Empty value: ``None``"
msgstr "Luach folamh: ``Níl ``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``datetime.date`` object."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Rud Python ``datetime.date``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is either a ``datetime.date``, "
"``datetime.datetime`` or string formatted in a particular date format."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur `datetime.date``, `datetime.datetime`` nó teaghrán "
"formáidithe i bhformáid dáta áirithe an luach a thugtar."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``"
msgstr "Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí ``"

msgid "Takes one optional argument:"
msgstr "Tógann sé argóint roghnach amháin:"

msgid ""
"An iterable of formats used to attempt to convert a string to a valid "
"``datetime.date`` object."
msgstr ""
"Athraitheach formáidí a úsáidtear chun iarracht a dhéanamh teaghrán a "
"thiontú go réad bailí ``datetime.date``."

msgid ""
"If no ``input_formats`` argument is provided, the default input formats are "
"taken from the active locale format ``DATE_INPUT_FORMATS`` key, or "
"from :setting:`DATE_INPUT_FORMATS` if localization is disabled. See "
"also :doc:`format localization </topics/i18n/formatting>`."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear argóint ``input_formats`` ar fáil, tógtar na formáidí "
"ionchuir réamhshocraithe ón bhformáid áitiúil gníomhach "
"``DATE_INPUT_FORMATS`` eochair, nó ó:setting: `DATE_INPUT_FORMATS` má tá "
"logánú díchumasaithe. Féach freis:doc: `formáid logánaithe' </topics/i18n/"
"formatting>."

msgid "``DateTimeField``"
msgstr "``DataTimeField``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`DateTimeInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `DateTimeInput`"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``datetime.datetime`` object."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Rud Python ``datetime.datetime``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is either a ``datetime.datetime``, "
"``datetime.date`` or string formatted in a particular datetime format."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur `datetime.datetime``, `datetime.date`` nó teaghrán "
"formáidithe i bhformáid dáta-ama áirithe an luach a thugtar."

msgid ""
"An iterable of formats used to attempt to convert a string to a valid "
"``datetime.datetime`` object, in addition to ISO 8601 formats."
msgstr ""
"Athraitheach formáidí a úsáidtear chun iarracht a dhéanamh teaghrán a "
"thiontú go réad bailí `datetime.datetime``, i dteannta formáidí ISO 8601."

msgid ""
"The field always accepts strings in ISO 8601 formatted dates or similar "
"recognized by :func:`~django.utils.dateparse.parse_datetime`. Some examples "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Glacann an réimse i gcónaí le teaghráin i ndátaí formáidithe ISO 8601 nó den "
"chineál céanna aitheanta ar:func: `~django.utils.dateparse.parse_datetime`. "
"Is iad roinnt samplaí:"

msgid "``'2006-10-25 14:30:59'``"
msgstr "```2006-10-25 14:30:59 '``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25T14:30:59'``"
msgstr "``'2006-10-25H 14:30:59 '``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25 14:30'``"
msgstr "```'2006-10-25 14:30 '``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25T14:30'``"
msgstr "```'2006-10-25T 14:30 '``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25T14:30Z'``"
msgstr "``'2006-10-25H 14:30 AR ``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25T14:30+02:00'``"
msgstr "``'2006-10-25H 14:30 + 02:00 '``"

msgid "``'2006-10-25'``"
msgstr "```'2006-10-25'``"

msgid ""
"If no ``input_formats`` argument is provided, the default input formats are "
"taken from the active locale format ``DATETIME_INPUT_FORMATS`` and "
"``DATE_INPUT_FORMATS`` keys, or from :setting:`DATETIME_INPUT_FORMATS` "
"and :setting:`DATE_INPUT_FORMATS` if localization is disabled. See "
"also :doc:`format localization </topics/i18n/formatting>`."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear argóint ``input_formats`` ar fáil, tógtar na formáidí "
"ionchuir réamhshocraithe ón bhformáid áitiúil gníomhach "
"``DATETIME_INPUT_FORMATS`` agus ``DATE_INPUT_FORMATS`` eochracha, nó "
"ó:setting: `DATE_INPUT_FORMATS` má dhíchumasaítear logánú. Féach freis:doc: "
"`formáid logánaithe' </topics/i18n/formatting>."

msgid "``DecimalField``"
msgstr "``Decimalfield``"

msgid ""
"Default widget: :class:`NumberInput` when :attr:`Field.localize` is "
"``False``, else :class:`TextInput`."
msgstr ""
"Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `NumberInput` nuai:attr: `Field.Localize` "
"is ``False``, eile: class: `TextInput`."

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``decimal``."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: A Python ``deachimal``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is a decimal. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.MaxValueValidator` "
"and :class:`~django.core.validators.MinValueValidator` if ``max_value`` and "
"``min_value`` are provided. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.StepValueValidator` if ``step_size`` is "
"provided. Leading and trailing whitespace is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur deachúil é an luach a thugtar. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.maxvalueValidator` agus:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.minvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``max_value`` agus "
"``min_value`` ar fáil. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.stepvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``step_size`` ar "
"fáil. Déantar neamhaird de spás bán ceannródaíoch agus leantach."

msgid ""
"Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``max_value``, ``min_value``, "
"``max_digits``, ``max_decimal_places``, ``max_whole_digits``, ``step_size``."
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí``, "
"`luach_maxe``, `luach_mine``, `uas_digits``, `max_decimal_places``, "
"`max_whole_digits``, `step_size``."

msgid ""
"The ``max_value`` and ``min_value`` error messages may contain ``%"
"(limit_value)s``, which will be substituted by the appropriate limit. "
"Similarly, the ``max_digits``, ``max_decimal_places`` and "
"``max_whole_digits`` error messages may contain ``%(max)s``."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``% (limit_value) s`` sna teachtaireachtaí earráide "
"``max_value`` agus ``min_value``, a chuirfear an teorainn iomchuí in ionad. "
"Ar an gcaoi chéanna, d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh `% (max) s`` sna teachtaireachtaí "
"earráide ``max_digits``, `max_decimal_places`` agus ``max_whole_digits``."

msgid "Takes five optional arguments:"
msgstr "Tógann sé cúig argóint roghnach:"

msgid ""
"These control the range of values permitted in the field, and should be "
"given as ``decimal.Decimal`` values."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn siad seo an raon luachanna a cheadaítear sa réimse, agus ba cheart "
"iad a thabhairt mar luachanna ``Decimal.Decimal`."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of digits (those before the decimal point plus those "
"after the decimal point, with leading zeros stripped) permitted in the value."
msgstr ""
"An líon uasta na ndigití (iad siúd roimh an bpointe deachúil móide iad siúd "
"tar éis an phointe deachúil, le nialais tosaigh a scriosadh) a cheadaítear "
"sa luach."

msgid "The maximum number of decimal places permitted."
msgstr "An líon uasta na n-áiteanna deachúil a cheadaítear."

msgid ""
"Limit valid inputs to an integral multiple of ``step_size``. If "
"``min_value`` is also provided, it's added as an offset to determine if the "
"step size matches."
msgstr ""
"Cuir ionchuir bailí a theorannú go iolrach dhílis de ``step_size``. Má "
"chuirtear ``min_value`` ar fáil freisin, cuirtear é leis mar fhritháireamh "
"chun a fháil amach an bhfuil méid an chéim ag teacht leis."

msgid "``DurationField``"
msgstr "``Réimse tréimhseach``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python :class:`~python:datetime.timedelta`."
msgstr "Déanann sé normalú go: A Python: Class: `~python: datetime.timedelta`."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is a string which can be converted into a "
"``timedelta``. The value must be between :attr:`datetime.timedelta.min` "
"and :attr:`datetime.timedelta.max`."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur sreang é an luach a thugtar ar féidir é a thiontú ina "
"``timedel`. Ní mór an luach a bheith idir: attr: `datetime.timedelta.min` "
"agus:attr: `datetime.timedelta.max`."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``overflow``."
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí ``, "
"`overflow``."

msgid ""
"Accepts any format understood "
"by :func:`~django.utils.dateparse.parse_duration`."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le haon fhormáid a thuige:func: "
"`~django.utils.dateparse.parse_duration`."

msgid "``EmailField``"
msgstr "``Réimse ríomhphost``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`EmailInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `emailInput`"

msgid "Empty value: Whatever you've given as ``empty_value``."
msgstr "Luach folamh: Cibé rud a thug tú mar `empty_value``."

msgid ""
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.EmailValidator` to validate that the "
"given value is a valid email address, using a moderately complex regular "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Class: `~django.core.validators.emailValidator` chun a bhailíochtú gur "
"seoladh ríomhphoist bailí é an luach a thugtar, ag baint úsáide as léiriú "
"rialta measartha casta."

msgid ""
"Has the optional arguments ``max_length``, ``min_length``, and "
"``empty_value`` which work just as they do for :class:`CharField`. The "
"``max_length`` argument defaults to 320 (see :rfc:`3696#section-3`)."
msgstr ""
"Tá na hargóintí roghnacha ``max_length ``, `min_length``, agus "
"``empty_value`` a oibríonn díreach mar a dhéanann siad le haghaidh: class: "
"`charfield`. Tá an argóint ``max_length ``réamhshocraithe go 320 (féach: "
"rfc: `3696 #section -3`)."

msgid "``FileField``"
msgstr "``FileField``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`ClearableFileInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `ClearableFileInput`"

msgid ""
"Normalizes to: An ``UploadedFile`` object that wraps the file content and "
"file name into a single object."
msgstr ""
"Normalaíonn sé go: Rud `UploadedFile`` a fhilleann ábhar an chomhaid agus "
"ainm an chomhaid i réad amháin."

msgid "Can validate that non-empty file data has been bound to the form."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir a bhailíochtú go bhfuil sonraí comhad neamh-folamh ceangailte leis "
"an bhfoirm."

msgid ""
"Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``missing``, ``empty``, "
"``max_length``"
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí``, ``easna``, "
"`folamh ``, `max_length``"

msgid ""
"Has the optional arguments for validation: ``max_length`` and "
"``allow_empty_file``. If provided, these ensure that the file name is at "
"most the given length, and that validation will succeed even if the file "
"content is empty."
msgstr ""
"Tá na hargóintí roghnacha ann maidir le bailíochtú: ``max_length ``agus "
"``allow_empty_file``. Má chuirtear ar fáil, cinntíonn siad seo go bhfuil "
"ainm an chomhaid ar a mhéad an fad tugtha, agus go n-éireoidh leis an "
"mbailíochtú fiú má tá ábhar an chomhaid folamh."

msgid ""
"To learn more about the ``UploadedFile`` object, see the :doc:`file uploads "
"documentation </topics/http/file-uploads>`."
msgstr ""
"Chun tuilleadh eolais a fhoghlaim faoin réad ``uploadedfile``, féach na:doc: "
"`doiciméadú uaslódála comhad`. </topics/http/file-uploads>"

msgid ""
"When you use a ``FileField`` in a form, you must also remember to :ref:`bind "
"the file data to the form <binding-uploaded-files>`."
msgstr ""
"<binding-uploaded-files>Nuair a úsáideann tú ``FileField`` i bhfoirm, ní mór "
"duit cuimhneamh freisin to:ref: `sonraí an chomhaid a cheangal leis an "
"bhfoirm `."

msgid ""
"The ``max_length`` error refers to the length of the filename. In the error "
"message for that key, ``%(max)d`` will be replaced with the maximum filename "
"length and ``%(length)d`` will be replaced with the current filename length."
msgstr ""
"Tagraíonn an earráid ``max_length ``d'fhad an ainm comhaid. Sa "
"teachtaireacht earráide don eochair sin, cuirfear an fad uasta ainm comhaid "
"in ionad `% (max) d`` agus cuirfear an fad ainm comhaid reatha in ionad `% "
"(length) d``."

msgid "``FilePathField``"
msgstr "``FilePathfield``"

msgid "Validates that the selected choice exists in the list of choices."
msgstr "Bailíonn sé go bhfuil an rogha roghnaithe ar liosta na roghanna."

msgid ""
"The field allows choosing from files inside a certain directory. It takes "
"five extra arguments; only ``path`` is required:"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an réimse roghnú ó chomhaid taobh istigh de eolaire áirithe Tógann "
"sé cúig argóint breise; ní theastaíonn ach ``path``:"

msgid ""
"The absolute path to the directory whose contents you want listed. This "
"directory must exist."
msgstr ""
"An cosán iomlán chuig an eolaire a bhfuil a n-ábhar is mian leat liostaithe. "
"Caithfidh an t-eolaire seo a bheith ann."

msgid ""
"If ``False`` (the default) only the direct contents of ``path`` will be "
"offered as choices. If ``True``, the directory will be descended into "
"recursively and all descendants will be listed as choices."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``False`` (an réamhshocraithe) ní thairgfear ach ábhar díreach "
"``path`` mar roghanna. Má tá “Fíor”, cuirfear an t-eolaire isteach go "
"athshlánach agus liostófar gach sliocht mar roghanna."

msgid ""
"A regular expression pattern; only files with names matching this expression "
"will be allowed as choices."
msgstr ""
"Patrún abairt rialta; ní cheadófar ach comhaid le hainmneacha a "
"mheaitseálann leis an abairt seo mar roghanna."

msgid ""
"Optional.  Either ``True`` or ``False``.  Default is ``True``.  Specifies "
"whether files in the specified location should be included.  Either this "
"or :attr:`allow_folders` must be ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach. Ceachtar ``Fíor`` nó ``Bréag``. Is é réamhshocraithe ``True``. "
"Sonraíonn sé an gcaithfear comhaid sa suíomh sonraithe a áireamh. Caithfidh "
"ceachtar seo nó: attr: `allow_folders` a bheith ``True``."

msgid ""
"Optional.  Either ``True`` or ``False``.  Default is ``False``.  Specifies "
"whether folders in the specified location should be included.  Either this "
"or :attr:`allow_files` must be ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Roghnach. Ceachtar ``Fíor`` nó ``Bréag``. Is é “False” réamhshocraithe. "
"Sonraíonn sé an gcaithfear fillteáin sa suíomh sonraithe a áireamh. "
"Caithfidh ceachtar seo nó: attr: `allow_files` a bheith ``True``."

msgid "``FloatField``"
msgstr "``Floatfield ``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python float."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Snámhphointe Python."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is a float. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.MaxValueValidator` "
"and :class:`~django.core.validators.MinValueValidator` if ``max_value`` and "
"``min_value`` are provided. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.StepValueValidator` if ``step_size`` is "
"provided. Leading and trailing whitespace is allowed, as in Python's "
"``float()`` function."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur snámhphointe an luach a thugtar. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.maxvalueValidator` agus:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.minvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``max_value`` agus "
"``min_value`` ar fáil. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.stepvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``step_size`` ar "
"fáil. Ceadaítear spás bán tosaigh agus rianaithe, mar atá i bhfeidhm ``float "
"() ``Python."

msgid ""
"Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``max_value``, ``min_value``, "
"``step_size``."
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, ``neamhbhailí``, "
"`luach_maxe``, `luach_min``, `step_size``."

msgid "Takes three optional arguments:"
msgstr "Tógann sé trí argóint roghnacha:"

msgid "These control the range of values permitted in the field."
msgstr "Rialaíonn siad seo an raon luachanna a cheadaítear sa réimse."

msgid "``GenericIPAddressField``"
msgstr "``GenericipAddressField``"

msgid "A field containing either an IPv4 or an IPv6 address."
msgstr "Réimse ina bhfuil IPv4 nó seoladh IPv6."

msgid ""
"Normalizes to: A string. IPv6 addresses are normalized as described below."
msgstr ""
"Normalaítear go dtí: Sreang. Déantar seoltaí IPv6 a normalú mar a "
"thuairiscítear thíos."

msgid "Validates that the given value is a valid IP address."
msgstr "Bailíonn sé gur seoladh IP bailí é an luach a thugtar."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``max_length``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The IPv6 address normalization follows :rfc:`4291#section-2.2` section 2.2, "
"including using the IPv4 format suggested in paragraph 3 of that section, "
"like ``::ffff:192.0.2.0``. For example, ``2001:0::0:01`` would be normalized "
"to ``2001::1``, and ``::ffff:0a0a:0a0a`` to ``::ffff:10.10.10.10``. All "
"characters are converted to lowercase."
msgstr ""
"Leanann normalú an seoladh IPv6: rfc: `4291 #section -2.2` alt 2.2, lena n-"
"áirítear úsáid a bhaint as an bhformáid IPv4 a mholtar i mír 3 den chuid "
"sin, cosúil le ``: :ffff:192.0.2.0``. Mar shampla, bheadh ``2001:0:: 0:01`` "
"normalaithe go ``2001: :1``, agus ``: :ffff:0a0a0a`` go``: :ffff:10.10.10``. "
"Déantar gach carachtar a thiontú go litreacha beaga."

msgid ""
"Limits valid inputs to the specified protocol. Accepted values are ``both`` "
"(default), ``IPv4`` or ``IPv6``. Matching is case insensitive."
msgstr ""
"Teoraíonn sé ionchuir bailí don phrótacal sonraithe. Is iad na luachanna a "
"nglactar leo ná ``an bheirt ``(réamhshocraithe), ``IPv4`` nó ``IPv6``. Tá an "
"meaitseáil neamh-íogair."

msgid ""
"Unpacks IPv4 mapped addresses like ``::ffff:192.0.2.1``. If this option is "
"enabled that address would be unpacked to ``192.0.2.1``. Default is "
"disabled. Can only be used when ``protocol`` is set to ``'both'``."
msgstr ""
"Díphacáil seoltaí mapáilte IPv4 mar ``:: ffff: 192.0.2.1``. Má tá an rogha "
"seo cumasaithe déanfaí an seoladh sin a dhíphacáil go ``192.0.2.1 ``. Tá "
"réamhshocrú díchumasaithe. Ní féidir é a úsáid ach amháin nuair a "
"shocraítear ``prótacol`` go ```beach'`."

msgid ""
"Defaults to 39, and behaves the same way as it does for :class:`CharField`."
msgstr ""

msgid "The default value for ``max_length`` was set to 39 characters."
msgstr ""

msgid "``ImageField``"
msgstr "``ImageField``"

msgid ""
"Validates that file data has been bound to the form. Also "
"uses :class:`~django.core.validators.FileExtensionValidator` to validate "
"that the file extension is supported by Pillow."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé go bhfuil sonraí comhaid ceangailte leis an bhfoirm. Úsáideann "
"sé freisin: class: `~django.core.validators.fileExtensionValidator` chun a "
"bhailíochtú go dtacaíonn Pillow leis an síneadh comhaid."

msgid ""
"Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``missing``, ``empty``, "
"``invalid_image``"
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí``, ``easna``, "
"`folam``, ``invalid_image``"

msgid ""
"Using an ``ImageField`` requires that :pypi:`pillow` is installed with "
"support for the image formats you use. If you encounter a ``corrupt image`` "
"error when you upload an image, it usually means that Pillow doesn't "
"understand its format. To fix this, install the appropriate library and "
"reinstall Pillow."
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as ``ImageField`` is gá go bhfuil: pypi: `pillow` suiteáilte "
"le tacaíocht do na formáidí íomhá a úsáideann tú. Má bhíonn earráid “íomhá "
"truaillithe” ort nuair a uaslódálann tú íomhá, ciallaíonn sé de ghnáth nach "
"dtuigeann Pillow a fhormáid. Chun é seo a shocrú, suiteáil an leabharlann "
"cuí agus athshuiteáil Pillow."

msgid ""
"When you use an ``ImageField`` on a form, you must also remember "
"to :ref:`bind the file data to the form <binding-uploaded-files>`."
msgstr ""
"<binding-uploaded-files>Nuair a úsáideann tú ``ImageField`` ar fhoirm, ní "
"mór duit cuimhneamh freisin to:ref: `sonraí an chomhaid a cheangal leis an "
"bhfoirm `."

msgid ""
"After the field has been cleaned and validated, the ``UploadedFile`` object "
"will have an additional ``image`` attribute containing the Pillow `Image`_ "
"instance used to check if the file was a valid image. Pillow closes the "
"underlying file descriptor after verifying an image, so while non-image data "
"attributes, such as ``format``, ``height``, and ``width``, are available, "
"methods that access the underlying image data, such as ``getdata()`` or "
"``getpixel()``, cannot be used without reopening the file. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Tar éis an réimse a ghlanadh agus a bhailíochtú, beidh tréith “íomhá” breise "
"ag an réad ``uploadedfile`` ina bhfuil an sampla Pillow `Image`_ a úsáidtear "
"chun seiceáil an raibh an comhad ina íomhá bailí. Dúnann Pillow an "
"tuairisceoir comhaid bunúsach tar éis íomhá a fhíorú, mar sin cé go bhfuil "
"tréithe sonraí neamh-íomhá, mar shampla ``formáid`, `airde ``, agus "
"`leithead`, ar fáil, ní féidir modhanna a bhaineann rochtain ar shonraí "
"íomhá bunúsacha, mar shampla ``getdata () `nó `getpixel ()`, a úsáid gan an "
"comhad a athoscailt. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Additionally, ``UploadedFile.content_type`` will be updated with the image's "
"content type if Pillow can determine it, otherwise it will be set to "
"``None``."
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, déanfar ``uploadedfile.content_type`` a nuashonrú le "
"cineál ábhair na híomhá más féidir le Pillow é a chinneadh, ar shlí eile "
"socraítear é go ``None ``."

msgid "``IntegerField``"
msgstr "``Réimse iomlána``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python integer."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Sláimhir Python."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is an integer. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.MaxValueValidator` "
"and :class:`~django.core.validators.MinValueValidator` if ``max_value`` and "
"``min_value`` are provided. "
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.StepValueValidator` if ``step_size`` is "
"provided. Leading and trailing whitespace is allowed, as in Python's "
"``int()`` function."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur sláimhir é an luach a thugtar. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.maxvalueValidator` agus:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.minvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``max_value`` agus "
"``min_value`` ar fáil. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.core.validators.stepvalueValidator` má chuirtear ``step_size`` ar "
"fáil. Ceadaítear spás bán tosaigh agus rianaithe, mar atá i bhfeidhm ``int "
"() ``Python."

msgid ""
"Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid``, ``max_value``, ``min_value``, "
"``step_size``"
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, ``neamhbhailí ``, "
"`luach_maxe``, `luach_min``, `méide_step``"

msgid ""
"The ``max_value``, ``min_value`` and ``step_size`` error messages may "
"contain ``%(limit_value)s``, which will be substituted by the appropriate "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``% (limit_value) s`` sna teachtaireachtaí earráide "
"``max_value``, `min_value`` agus ``step_size``, `% (limit_value) s``, a "
"chuirfear an teorainn iomchuí in ionad."

msgid "Takes three optional arguments for validation:"
msgstr "Glacann sé trí argóint roghnach le haghaidh bailíochtú:"

msgid "``JSONField``"
msgstr "``Jsonfield``"

msgid ""
"A field which accepts JSON encoded data for "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.JSONField`."
msgstr ""
"Réimse a ghlacann le sonraí ionchódaithe JSON do a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.jsonField`."

msgid "Default widget: :class:`Textarea`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `Textarea`"

msgid ""
"Normalizes to: A Python representation of the JSON value (usually as a "
"``dict``, ``list``, or ``None``), depending on :attr:`JSONField.decoder`."
msgstr ""
"Normalaítear go dtí: Léiriú Python ar an luach JSON (de ghnáth mar ``dict``, "
"`liost``, nó ``None``), ag brath ar:attr: `JSONfield.decoder`."

msgid "Validates that the given value is a valid JSON."
msgstr "Bailíonn sé gur JSON bailí é an luach a thugtar."

msgid "Takes two optional arguments:"
msgstr "Glacann sé dhá argóint roghnach:"

msgid ""
"A :py:class:`json.JSONEncoder` subclass to serialize data types not "
"supported by the standard JSON serializer (e.g. ``datetime.datetime`` "
"or :class:`~python:uuid.UUID`). For example, you can use "
"the :class:`~django.core.serializers.json.DjangoJSONEncoder` class."
msgstr ""
"A: py:class: fo-aicme `JSON.JSONEncoder` chun cineálacha sonraí nach "
"dtacaíonn an serializer caighdeánach JSON a shraitheadh (m.sh. "
"`datetime.datetime`` nó:class: `~python: UUID.uuid`). Mar shampla, is féidir "
"leat an rang:class: `~django.core.serializers.json.djangojsonEncoder` a "
"úsáid."

msgid "Defaults to ``json.JSONEncoder``."
msgstr "Réamhshocraithe go ``JSON.JSONEncoder``."

msgid ""
"A :py:class:`json.JSONDecoder` subclass to deserialize the input. Your "
"deserialization may need to account for the fact that you can't be certain "
"of the input type. For example, you run the risk of returning a ``datetime`` "
"that was actually a string that just happened to be in the same format "
"chosen for ``datetime``\\s."
msgstr ""
"A: Py: aicme: fo-aicme `JSON.JSONDecoder` chun an t-ionchur a dhíshealú. "
"B'fhéidir go gcaithfidh do dhístiriú cuntas a thabhairt ar an bhfíric nach "
"féidir leat a bheith cinnte faoin gcineál ionchuir. Mar shampla, tá an baol "
"agat go bhfaighidh tú ``datetime`` a thabhairt ar ais a bhí i ndáiríre ina "
"teaghrán a bhí díreach sa fhormáid chéanna a roghnaíodh do `datetime``\\ s."

msgid ""
"The ``decoder`` can be used to validate the input. "
"If :py:class:`json.JSONDecodeError` is raised during the deserialization, a "
"``ValidationError`` will be raised."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an `díchódóir` a úsáid chun an t-ionchur a bhailíochtú. Má "
"ardaítear: PY:Class: `JSON.JSONDecodeError` le linn an díshealaithe, ardófar "
"``ValidationError``."

msgid "Defaults to ``json.JSONDecoder``."
msgstr "Réamhshocraithe go ``JSON.JSONDecoder``."

msgid ""
"If you use a :class:`ModelForm <django.forms.ModelForm>`, the ``encoder`` "
"and ``decoder`` from :class:`~django.db.models.JSONField` will be used."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú a:class: `ModelForm `<django.forms.ModelForm>, úsáidfear an "
"``encoder`` agus `decoder`` ó:class: `~django.db.models.jsonField`."

msgid ""
"``JSONField`` is not particularly user friendly in most cases. However, it "
"is a useful way to format data from a client-side widget for submission to "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"Níl ``JSONField`` go háirithe cairdiúil le húsáid i bhformhór na gcásanna. "
"Is bealach úsáideach é, áfach, sonraí a fhormáidiú ó ghuirléid taobh an "
"chliaint le cur isteach chuig an bhfreastalaí."

msgid "``MultipleChoiceField``"
msgstr "``MultiplechoiceField``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`SelectMultiple`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `SelectMultiple`"

msgid "Empty value: ``[]`` (an empty list)"
msgstr "Luach folamh: ``[]`` (liosta folamh)"

msgid "Normalizes to: A list of strings."
msgstr "Normalaítear go: Liosta de na teaghráin."

msgid ""
"Validates that every value in the given list of values exists in the list of "
"choices."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé go bhfuil gach luach sa liosta luachanna ar leith i liosta na "
"roghanna."

msgid "Error message keys: ``required``, ``invalid_choice``, ``invalid_list``"
msgstr ""
"Eochracha teachtaireachta earráide: ``riachtan``, `invalid_choice``, "
"`invalid_list``"

msgid ""
"Takes one extra required argument, ``choices``, as for :class:`ChoiceField`."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé argóint breise riachtanach amháin, ``roghna``, mar atá le "
"haghaidh: class: `roghnaíon`."

msgid "``NullBooleanField``"
msgstr "``Nullbooleanfield``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`NullBooleanSelect`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `NullBooleanSelect`"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``True``, ``False`` or ``None`` value."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Luach Python ``True``, `False`` nó ``None``."

msgid "Validates nothing (i.e., it never raises a ``ValidationError``)."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhailíonn sé rud ar bith (ie, ní ardaíonn sé ``ValidationError`` riamh)."

msgid ""
"``NullBooleanField`` may be used with widgets such "
"as :class:`~django.forms.Select` or :class:`~django.forms.RadioSelect` by "
"providing the widget ``choices``::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir ``NullBooleanField`` a úsáid le giuirléidí amsúil:class: "
"`~django.forms.select` nó:class: `~django.forms.radioSelect` tríd an "
"giuirléid ``roghnaithe`` a sholáthar::"

msgid "``RegexField``"
msgstr "``Regexfield``"

msgid ""
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.RegexValidator` to validate that the "
"given value matches a certain regular expression."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Class: `~django.core.validators.regexValidator` chun a bhailíochtú go "
"bhfuil an luach tugtha comhoiriúnach le léiriú rialta áirithe."

msgid "Takes one required argument:"
msgstr "Tógann sé argóint riachtanach amháin:"

msgid ""
"A regular expression specified either as a string or a compiled regular "
"expression object."
msgstr ""
"Léiriú rialta a shonraítear mar shreang nó mar réad abairt rialta tiomsaithe."

msgid ""
"Also takes ``max_length``, ``min_length``, ``strip``, and ``empty_value`` "
"which work just as they do for :class:`CharField`."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé freisin ``max_length ``, `min_length``, `strip``, agus "
"``empty_value`` a oibríonn díreach mar a dhéanann siad do:class: `charfield`."

msgid ""
"Defaults to ``False``. If enabled, stripping will be applied before the "
"regex validation."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocraithe go ``False``. Má tá sé cumasaithe, cuirfear stialladh i "
"bhfeidhm roimh an bhailíochtú regex."

msgid "``SlugField``"
msgstr "``Slugfield``"

msgid ""
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.validate_slug` "
"or :class:`~django.core.validators.validate_unicode_slug` to validate that "
"the given value contains only letters, numbers, underscores, and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:aicme: `~django.core.validators.validate_slug` nó:class: "
"`~django.core.validators.validate_unicode_slug` chun a bhailíochtú nach "
"bhfuil ach litreacha, uimhreacha, béim agus braithíní sa luach tugtha."

msgid "Error messages: ``required``, ``invalid``"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí earráide: ``riachtan``, `neamhbhailí``"

msgid ""
"This field is intended for use in representing a "
"model :class:`~django.db.models.SlugField` in forms."
msgstr ""
"Tá an réimse seo beartaithe le húsáid chun samhail:class: "
"`~django.db.models.slugfield` a léiriú i bhfoirmeacha."

msgid "Takes two optional parameters:"
msgstr "Glacann sé dhá pharaiméadar roghnach"

msgid ""
"A boolean instructing the field to accept Unicode letters in addition to "
"ASCII letters. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Boolean a thugann treoir don réimse glacadh le litreacha Unicode i dteannta "
"le litreacha ASCII. Réamhshocraithe go ``False``."

msgid "``TimeField``"
msgstr "``Réimse ama ``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`TimeInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `TimeInput`"

msgid "Normalizes to: A Python ``datetime.time`` object."
msgstr "Normalaítear go dtí: Rud Python ``datetime.time``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value is either a ``datetime.time`` or string "
"formatted in a particular time format."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé gur `datetime.time`` nó teaghrán formáidithe i bhformáid ama "
"áirithe an luach a thugtar."

msgid ""
"An iterable of formats used to attempt to convert a string to a valid "
"``datetime.time`` object."
msgstr ""
"Athraitheach formáidí a úsáidtear chun iarracht a dhéanamh teaghrán a "
"thiontú go réad bailí ``datetime.time``."

msgid ""
"If no ``input_formats`` argument is provided, the default input formats are "
"taken from the active locale format ``TIME_INPUT_FORMATS`` key, or "
"from :setting:`TIME_INPUT_FORMATS` if localization is disabled. See "
"also :doc:`format localization </topics/i18n/formatting>`."
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear argóint ``input_formats`` ar fáil, tógtar na formáidí "
"ionchuir réamhshocraithe ón bhformáid áitiúil gníomhach "
"``TIME_INPUT_FORMATS`` eochair, nó ó:setting: `TIME_INPUT_FORMATS` má tá "
"logánú díchumasaithe. Féach freis:doc: `formáid logánaithe' </topics/i18n/"
"formatting>."

msgid "``TypedChoiceField``"
msgstr "``TypedChoiceField``"

msgid ""
"Just like a :class:`ChoiceField`, except :class:`TypedChoiceField` takes two "
"extra arguments, :attr:`coerce` and :attr:`empty_value`."
msgstr ""
"Díreach cosúil le a:class: `choicefield`, except:class: `TypedChoiceField` "
"glacann dhá argóint breise, :attr: `coerce` agus:attr: `empty_value`."

msgid ""
"Normalizes to: A value of the type provided by the :attr:`coerce` argument."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé normalú go: Luach den chineál a sholáthraíonn an argóint:attr: "
"`coerce`."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given value exists in the list of choices and can be "
"coerced."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé go bhfuil an luach a thugtar ar liosta na roghanna agus gur "
"féidir é a chur iallach."

msgid "Takes extra arguments:"
msgstr "Tógann sé argóintí breise:"

msgid ""
"A function that takes one argument and returns a coerced value. Examples "
"include the built-in ``int``, ``float``, ``bool`` and other types. Defaults "
"to an identity function. Note that coercion happens after input validation, "
"so it is possible to coerce to a value not present in ``choices``."
msgstr ""
"Feidhm a thógann argóint amháin agus a thugann luach éigeantach ar ais. I "
"measc na samplaí tá na ``int``, `float``, `bool`` agus cineálacha eile "
"ionsuite. Réamhshocraithe ar fheidhm aitheantais. Tabhair faoi deara go "
"dtarlaíonn comhéigean tar éis bailíochtú ionchuir, mar sin is féidir luach "
"nach bhfuil i láthair i “roghanna” a chur i bhfeidhm."

msgid ""
"The value to use to represent \"empty.\" Defaults to the empty string; "
"``None`` is another common choice here. Note that this value will not be "
"coerced by the function given in the ``coerce`` argument, so choose it "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"An luach le húsáid chun “folamh” a léiriú. Réamhshocraithe don teaghrán "
"folamh; Is rogha coitianta eile é ``None ``anseo. Tabhair faoi deara nach "
"gcuirfear an luach seo a iallach leis an bhfeidhm a thugtar san argóint "
"``force``, mar sin roghnaigh é dá réir."

msgid "``TypedMultipleChoiceField``"
msgstr "``TypedMultiplechoiceField``"

msgid ""
"Just like a :class:`MultipleChoiceField`, "
"except :class:`TypedMultipleChoiceField` takes two extra arguments, "
"``coerce`` and ``empty_value``."
msgstr ""
"Díreach cosúil le a:class: `MultipleChoiceField`, seachas: class: "
"`TypedMultipleChoiceField` thógann dhá argóint breise, ``coerce`` agus "
"``empty_value``."

msgid "Empty value: Whatever you've given as ``empty_value``"
msgstr "Luach folamh: Cibé rud a thug tú mar ``empty_value``"

msgid ""
"Normalizes to: A list of values of the type provided by the ``coerce`` "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"Normalaítear go dtí: Liosta luachanna den chineál a sholáthraíonn an argóint "
"``forbairt ``."

msgid ""
"Validates that the given values exists in the list of choices and can be "
"coerced."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé go bhfuil na luachanna a thugtar ar liosta na roghanna agus gur "
"féidir iad a chur iallach."

msgid ""
"Takes two extra arguments, ``coerce`` and ``empty_value``, as "
"for :class:`TypedChoiceField`."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé dhá argóint bhreise, ``coerce`` agus `empty_value``, mar atá le "
"haghaidh: class: `TypedChoiceField`."

msgid "``URLField``"
msgstr "``Urlfield``"

msgid "Default widget: :class:`URLInput`"
msgstr "Giuirléid réamhshocraithe: :class: `Urlinput`"

msgid ""
"Uses :class:`~django.core.validators.URLValidator` to validate that the "
"given value is a valid URL."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid:Class: `~django.core.validators.urlValidator` chun a bhailíochtú gur "
"URL bailí é an luach a thugtar."

msgid ""
"Has the optional arguments ``max_length``, ``min_length``, ``empty_value`` "
"which work just as they do for :class:`CharField`, and one more argument:"
msgstr ""
"Tá na hargóintí roghnacha ``max_length ``, `min_length``, `empty_value`` a "
"oibríonn díreach mar a dhéanann siad do:class: `charfield`, agus argóint "
"amháin eile:"

msgid ""
"The scheme assumed for URLs provided without one. Defaults to ``\"http\"``. "
"For example, if ``assume_scheme`` is ``\"https\"`` and the provided value is "
"``\"example.com\"``, the normalized value will be ``\"https://"
"example.com\"``."
msgstr ""
"Ghlac an scéim le haghaidh URLanna a chuirtear ar fáil gan ceann amháin. "
"Réamhshocraithe go ``\"http\"``. Mar shampla, más é ``assume_scheme`` "
"``https\"`` agus gurb é ``\"example.com\"` an luach a chuirtear ar fáil, is "
"é``” https://example.com “``an luach normalaithe."

msgid ""
"The default value for ``assume_scheme`` will change from ``\"http\"`` to "
"``\"https\"`` in Django 6.0. Set :setting:`FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS` "
"transitional setting to ``True`` to opt into using ``\"https\"`` during the "
"Django 5.x release cycle."
msgstr ""
"Athróidh an luach réamhshocraithe do ``assume_scheme`` ó ``\"http\"`` go "
"``\"https\"`` i Django 6.0. Socraigh: socrú: `FORMS_URLFIELD_ASSUME_HTTPS` "
"socrú idirthréimhseach go ``True`` chun ``https\"` a úsáid le linn "
"timthriall scaoilte Django 5.x."

msgid "``UUIDField``"
msgstr "``Uuidfield``"

msgid "Normalizes to: A :class:`~python:uuid.UUID` object."
msgstr "Déanann sé normalú go réad: A: Class: `~Python: UUID.uuid`."

msgid ""
"This field will accept any string format accepted as the ``hex`` argument to "
"the :class:`~python:uuid.UUID` constructor."
msgstr ""
"Glacfaidh an réimse seo le haon fhormáid teaghrán a nglactar leis mar "
"argóint ``hex`` don tógálaí: class: `~python:uuid.uuid`."

msgid "Slightly complex built-in ``Field`` classes"
msgstr "Ranganna ``Páirce`` tógtha beagán casta"

msgid "``ComboField``"
msgstr "``Combofield``"

msgid ""
"Validates the given value against each of the fields specified as an "
"argument to the ``ComboField``."
msgstr ""
"Bailíonn sé an luach a thugtar i gcoinne gach ceann de na réimsí a "
"shonraítear mar argóint don `Combofield`."

msgid "Takes one extra required argument:"
msgstr "Tógann sé argóint riachtanach breise amháin:"

msgid ""
"The list of fields that should be used to validate the field's value (in the "
"order in which they are provided)."
msgstr ""
