"Formset templates receive a context from :meth:`.BaseFormSet.get_context`. "
"By default, formsets receive a dictionary with the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Faigheann teimpléid Formset comhthéacs ó:meth: `.baseFormSet.get_Context`. "
"De réir réamhshocraithe, faigheann foirmeacha foclóir leis na luachanna seo "
"a leanas:"

msgid "``formset``: The formset instance."
msgstr "``formset``: An sampla formset."

msgid "Context available in form templates"
msgstr "Comhthéacs ar fáil i dteimpléid"

msgid ""
"Form templates receive a context from :meth:`.Form.get_context`. By default, "
"forms receive a dictionary with the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Faigheann teimpléid fhoirme comhthéacs ó:meth: `.form.get_context`. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe, faigheann foirmeacha foclóir leis na luachanna seo a leanas"

msgid "Context available in field templates"
msgstr "Comhthéacs ar fáil i dteimpléid"

msgid ""
"Field templates receive a context from :meth:`.BoundField.get_context`. By "
"default, fields receive a dictionary with the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Faigheann teimpléid réimse comhthéacs ó:meth: `.boundfield.get_context`. De "
"réir réamhshocraithe, faigheann réimsí foclóir leis na luachanna seo a "
"leanas:"

msgid "``field``: The :class:`~django.forms.BoundField`."
msgstr "``field``: Aicme: `~Django.Forms.BoundField`."

msgid "Context available in widget templates"
msgstr "Comhthéacs ar fáil i dteimpléid"

msgid ""
"Widget templates receive a context from :meth:`.Widget.get_context`. By "
"default, widgets receive a single value in the context, ``widget``. This is "
"a dictionary that contains values like:"
msgstr ""
"Faigheann teimpléid giuirléid comhthéacs ó:meth: `.widget.get_context`. De "
"réir réamhshocraithe, faigheann giuirléidí luach amháin sa chomhthéacs, "
"``giuirléid``. Is foclóir é seo ina bhfuil luachanna mar:"

msgid "``value``"
msgstr "``luach``"

msgid "``attrs``"
msgstr "```Attrs``"

msgid "``is_hidden``"
msgstr "``Is _fhidden``"

msgid ""
"Some widgets add further information to the context. For instance, all "
"widgets that subclass ``Input`` defines ``widget['type']`` "
"and :class:`.MultiWidget` defines ``widget['subwidgets']`` for looping "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann roinnt giuirléidí breise faisnéise leis an gcomhthéacs Mar shampla, "
"gach giuirléid a shainmhíníonn fo-aicme ``Input`` ``giuirléid ['cineál']`` "
"agus:class: `.MultiWidget` ``widget ['subwidgets']`` chun críocha lúbtha."

msgid "Overriding built-in formset templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid foirmeacha ionsuite a shárú"

msgid ":attr:`.BaseFormSet.template_name`"
msgstr ":attr: `.baseFormSet.Template_Ainm`"

msgid ""
"To override formset templates, you must use the :class:`TemplatesSetting` "
"renderer. Then overriding formset templates works :doc:`the same as </howto/"
"overriding-templates>` overriding any other template in your project."
msgstr ""
"Chun teimpléid foirmshraith a shárú, ní mór duit an renderer: class: "
"`TemplateSetting` a úsáid. Ansin oibríonn teimpléid foirmshraith a shárú: "
"doc: `mar an gcéanna le `a sháraíonn aon teimpléad eile i do thi</howto/"
"overriding-templates> onscadal."

msgid "Overriding built-in form templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid fhoirme ionsuite a shárú"

msgid ":attr:`.Form.template_name`"
msgstr ":attr: `.form.template_name`"

msgid ""
"To override form templates, you must use the :class:`TemplatesSetting` "
"renderer. Then overriding form templates works :doc:`the same as </howto/"
"overriding-templates>` overriding any other template in your project."
msgstr ""
"Chun teimpléid fhoirme a shárú, ní mór duit an renderóir:class: "
"`TemplateSetting` a úsáid. Ansin oibríonn teimpléid fhoirme thábhacht:doc: "
"`mar an gcéanna le `a sháraíonn aon te</howto/overriding-templates> impléad "
"eile i do thionscadal."

msgid "Overriding built-in field templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid réimse ionsuite a shárú"

msgid ":attr:`.Field.template_name`"
msgstr ":attr: `.field.template_name`"

msgid ""
"To override field templates, you must use the :class:`TemplatesSetting` "
"renderer. Then overriding field templates works :doc:`the same as </howto/"
"overriding-templates>` overriding any other template in your project."
msgstr ""
"Chun teimpléid réimse a shárú, ní mór duit an renderer: class: "
"`TemplateSetting` a úsáid. Ansin oibríonn teimpléid allamuigh a shárú: doc: "
"`mar an gcéanna le `a sháraíonn aon te</howto/overriding-templates> impléad "
"eile i do thionscadal."

msgid "Overriding built-in widget templates"
msgstr "Teimpléid giuirléid ionsuite a chur"

msgid ""
"Each widget has a ``template_name`` attribute with a value such as "
"``input.html``. Built-in widget templates are stored in the ``django/forms/"
"widgets`` path. You can provide a custom template for ``input.html`` by "
"defining ``django/forms/widgets/input.html``, for example. See :ref:`built-"
"in widgets` for the name of each widget's template."
msgstr ""
"Tá tréith ``template_name`` ag gach giuirléid le luach mar ``input.html``. "
"Stóráiltear teimpléid giuirléid ionsuite sa chosán ``django/foirmeach/"
"giuirléidí ``. Is féidir leat teimpléad saincheaptha a sholáthar do "
"``input.html`` trí ``django/forms/widgets/input.html`` a shainiú, mar "
"shampla. Féach: ref: “giuirléidí ionsuite” le haghaidh ainm teimpléad gach "
"giuirléid."

msgid ""
"To override widget templates, you must use the :class:`TemplatesSetting` "
"renderer. Then overriding widget templates works :doc:`the same as </howto/"
"overriding-templates>` overriding any other template in your project."
msgstr ""
"Chun teimpléid giuirléid a athsháiriú, ní mór duit an renderer: class: "
"`TemplateSetting` a úsáid. Ansin oibríonn teimpléid giuirléid thábhachtach: "
"doc: `mar an gcéanna le `a sháraíonn aon teimpléad eile </howto/overriding-"
"templates> i do thionscadal."

msgid "Form and field validation"
msgstr "Bailíochtú foirm agus réimse"

msgid ""
"Form validation happens when the data is cleaned. If you want to customize "
"this process, there are various places to make changes, each one serving a "
"different purpose. Three types of cleaning methods are run during form "
"processing. These are normally executed when you call the ``is_valid()`` "
"method on a form. There are other things that can also trigger cleaning and "
"validation (accessing the ``errors`` attribute or calling ``full_clean()`` "
"directly), but normally they won't be needed."
msgstr ""
"Tarlaíonn bailíochtú foirme nuair a ghlantar na sonraí. Más mian leat an "
"próiseas seo a shaincheapadh, tá áiteanna éagsúla ann chun athruithe a "
"dhéanamh, agus gach ceann acu ag freastal ar chuspóir difriúil. "
"Reáchtáiltear trí chineál modhanna glantacháin le linn próiseála foirme. De "
"ghnáth déantar iad seo a fhorghníomhú nuair a ghlaonn tú ar an modh "
"``is_valid () ``ar fhoirm. Tá rudaí eile ann a d'fhéadfadh glanadh agus "
"bailíochtú a spreagadh freisin (rochtain a fháil ar an tréith ``earráidí "
"``nó glaoch ar `full_clean ()`` go díreach), ach de ghnáth ní bheidh siad ag "
"teastáil."

msgid ""
"In general, any cleaning method can raise ``ValidationError`` if there is a "
"problem with the data it is processing, passing the relevant information to "
"the ``ValidationError`` constructor. :ref:`See below <raising-validation-"
"error>` for the best practice in raising ``ValidationError``. If no "
"``ValidationError`` is raised, the method should return the cleaned "
"(normalized) data as a Python object."
msgstr ""
"Go ginearálta, is féidir le haon mhodh glantacháin ``ValidationError` a ardú "
"má tá fadhb ann leis na sonraí atá á phróiseáil aige, ag cur an fhaisnéis "
"ábhartha chuig an tógálaí ``ValidationError`. :ref: `Féach thíos <raising-"
"validation-error>`le haghaidh an dea-chleachtas maidir le "
"``ValidationError`` a ardú. Mura n-ardaítear aon ``ValidationError``, ba "
"cheart don modh na sonraí glanta (normalaithe) a thabhairt ar ais mar réad "
"Python."

msgid ""
"Most validation can be done using `validators`_ - helpers that can be "
"reused. Validators are functions (or callables) that take a single argument "
"and raise ``ValidationError`` on invalid input. Validators are run after the "
"field's ``to_python`` and ``validate`` methods have been called."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an chuid is mó de bhailíochtú a dhéanamh ag baint úsáide as "
"`bailíodóirí `_ - cúntóirí is féidir a athúsáid. Is feidhmeanna (nó glaonna) "
"iad bailíochtóirí a thógann argóint amháin agus a ardaíonn "
"``ValidationError`` ar ionchur neamhbhailí. Déantar bailíochtóirí a "
"reáchtáil tar éis modhanna ``to_python`` agus ``validate`` an réimse a "
"ghlaoch."

msgid ""
"Validation of a form is split into several steps, which can be customized or "
"overridden:"
msgstr ""
"Roinntear bailíochtú foirme ina roinnt céimeanna, ar féidir iad a "
"shaincheapadh nó a shárú:"

msgid ""
"The ``to_python()`` method on a ``Field`` is the first step in every "
"validation. It coerces the value to a correct datatype and raises "
"``ValidationError`` if that is not possible. This method accepts the raw "
"value from the widget and returns the converted value. For example, a "
"``FloatField`` will turn the data into a Python ``float`` or raise a "
"``ValidationError``."
msgstr ""
"Is é an modh ``to_python () ``ar `Réimse`` an chéad chéim i ngach "
"bailíochtú. Cuireann sé an luach ar chineál sonraí ceart agus ardaíonn sé "
"``ValidationError`` mura féidir é sin a dhéanamh. Glacann an modh seo leis "
"an luach amh ón ngiuirléid agus filleann sé an luach tiontaithe ar ais. Mar "
"shampla, iompróidh ``Floatfield`` na sonraí ina `float`` Python nó ardóidh "
"``ValidationError``."

msgid ""
"The ``validate()`` method on a ``Field`` handles field-specific validation "
"that is not suitable for a validator. It takes a value that has been coerced "
"to a correct datatype and raises ``ValidationError`` on any error. This "
"method does not return anything and shouldn't alter the value. You should "
"override it to handle validation logic that you can't or don't want to put "
"in a validator."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann an modh ``validate () ``ar `Réimse`` bailíochtú réamh-shonrach "
"nach bhfuil oiriúnach do bhailíochtóir. Tógann sé luach a cuireadh iallach "
"ar chineál sonraí ceart agus ardaíonn sé ``ValidationError`` ar aon earráid. "
"Ní thugann an modh seo aon rud ar ais agus níor cheart dó an luach a athrú. "
"Ba chóir duit é a shárú chun loighic bhailíochtaithe nach féidir leat nó "
"nach dteastaíonn uait bailíochtóir a chur isteach."

msgid ""
"The ``run_validators()`` method on a ``Field`` runs all of the field's "
"validators and aggregates all the errors into a single ``ValidationError``. "
"You shouldn't need to override this method."
msgstr ""
"Ritheann an modh ``run_validators () ``ar `Réimse`` bailíochtóirí uile an "
"réimse agus comhiomlánann sé na hearráidí go léir ina ``ValidationError`` "
"amháin. Níor chóir go gcaithfidh tú an modh seo a shárú."

msgid ""
"The ``clean()`` method on a ``Field`` subclass is responsible for running "
"``to_python()``, ``validate()``, and ``run_validators()`` in the correct "
"order and propagating their errors. If, at any time, any of the methods "
"raise ``ValidationError``, the validation stops and that error is raised. "
"This method returns the clean data, which is then inserted into the "
"``cleaned_data`` dictionary of the form."
msgstr ""
"Tá an modh ``clean () ``ar fho-aicme ``Field`` freagrach as ``to_python "
"()``, `validate () ``, agus ``run_validators ()`` a reáchtáil san ord ceart "
"agus a n-earráidí a iomadú. Má ardaíonn aon cheann de na modhanna, ag am ar "
"bith, `ValidationError`, stopann an bailíochtú agus ardaítear an earráid "
"sin. Tugann an modh seo na sonraí glan ar ais, a chuirtear isteach ansin "
"isteach i bhfoclóir ``cleaned_data`` na foirme."

msgid ""
"The ``clean_<fieldname>()`` method is called on a form subclass -- where "
"``<fieldname>`` is replaced with the name of the form field attribute. This "
"method does any cleaning that is specific to that particular attribute, "
"unrelated to the type of field that it is. This method is not passed any "
"parameters. You will need to look up the value of the field in "
"``self.cleaned_data`` and remember that it will be a Python object at this "
"point, not the original string submitted in the form (it will be in "
"``cleaned_data`` because the general field ``clean()`` method, above, has "
"already cleaned the data once)."
msgstr ""
"<fieldname>Glaítear ar an modh ``clean_ () `ar fho-aicme foirme -- ina "
"gcuirtear ainm tréith réim <fieldname>se na foirme in ionad ````. Déanann an "
"modh seo aon ghlanadh atá sonrach don tréith áirithe sin, nach mbaineann "
"leis an gcineál réimse atá ann. Ní chuirtear an modh seo ar bith "
"paraiméadair. Beidh ort luach an réimse a fheiceáil suas i "
"`self.cleaned_data ``agus cuimhnigh gur réad Python é ag an bpointe seo, ní "
"an teaghrán bunaidh a chuirtear isteach san fhoirm (beidh sé i "
"``cleaned_data`` toisc gur ghlanadh an modh réimse ginearálta ``clean () "
"``thuas, na sonraí cheana féin)."

msgid ""
"For example, if you wanted to validate that the contents of a ``CharField`` "
"called ``serialnumber`` was unique, ``clean_serialnumber()`` would be the "
"right place to do this. You don't need a specific field (it's a "
"``CharField``), but you want a formfield-specific piece of validation and, "
"possibly, cleaning/normalizing the data."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, dá dteastaíonn uait a bhailíochtú go raibh ábhar ``charfield`` "
"ar a dtugtar ``serialnumber`` uathúil, bheadh `clean_serialnumber () ``an "
"áit cheart chun é seo a dhéanamh. Ní theastaíonn réimse ar leith uait (is "
"`Charfield` é), ach teastaíonn píosa bailíochtaithe atá sonrach le réimse "
"foirme uait agus, b'fhéidir, na sonraí a ghlananach/normalú."

msgid ""
"The return value of this method replaces the existing value in "
"``cleaned_data``, so it must be the field's value from ``cleaned_data`` "
"(even if this method didn't change it) or a new cleaned value."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann luach tuairisceáin an mhodha seo in ionad an luach atá ann cheana i "
"`cleaned_data ``, mar sin caithfidh sé a bheith luach an réimse ó "
"`cleaned_data`` (fiú mura n-athraigh an modh seo é) nó luach nua glantaithe."

msgid ""
"The form subclass's ``clean()`` method can perform validation that requires "
"access to multiple form fields. This is where you might put in checks such "
"as \"if field ``A`` is supplied, field ``B`` must contain a valid email "
"address\". This method can return a completely different dictionary if it "
"wishes, which will be used as the ``cleaned_data``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le modh ``clean () ``an fho-aicme foirme bailíochtú a dhéanamh a "
"éilíonn rochtain ar réimsí iolracha foirme. Seo an áit a bhféadfá "
"seiceálacha a chur isteach mar “má sholáthraítear réimse ``A``, caithfidh "
"seoladh ríomhphoist bailí a bheith i réimse ``B``”. Is féidir leis an modh "
"seo foclóir go hiomlán difriúil a thabhairt ar ais más mian leis, a "
"úsáidfear mar an ``cleaned_data``."

msgid ""
"Since the field validation methods have been run by the time ``clean()`` is "
"called, you also have access to the form's ``errors`` attribute which "
"contains all the errors raised by cleaning of individual fields."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go bhfuil na modhanna bailíochtaithe réimse á reáchtáil faoin am a "
"dtugtar ``clean () ``, tá rochtain agat freisin ar thréith ``earráidí`` na "
"foirme ina bhfuil na hearráidí go léir a ardaítear trí ghlanadh réimsí "
"aonair."

msgid ""
"Note that any errors raised by your :meth:`Form.clean()` override will not "
"be associated with any field in particular. They go into a special \"field\" "
"(called ``__all__``), which you can access via "
"the :meth:`~django.forms.Form.non_field_errors` method if you need to. If "
"you want to attach errors to a specific field in the form, you need to "
"call :meth:`~django.forms.Form.add_error()`."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach mbeidh baint ag aon earráidí a ardóidh sé:meth: "
"`Form.clean () `le haon réimse go háirithe. Téann siad isteach i “réimse” "
"speisialta (ar a dtugtar ``__all__``), ar féidir leat rochtain a fháil tríd "
"an modh:meth: `~django.forms.form.NON_FIELD_ERRORS` más gá duit. Más mian "
"leat earráidí a cheangal le réimse ar leith san fhoirm, ní mór duit glaoch "
"ar: meth: `~django.forms.form.add_error () `."

msgid ""
"Also note that there are special considerations when overriding the "
"``clean()`` method of a ``ModelForm`` subclass. (see the :ref:`ModelForm "
"documentation <overriding-modelform-clean-method>` for more information)"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara freisin go bhfuil breithnithe speisialta ann agus an modh "
"`clean () `de fho-aicme ``ModelForm ``a shárú. (féach an:ref: `Doiciméadú "
"ModelForm <overriding-modelform-clean-method>`le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais)"

msgid ""
"These methods are run in the order given above, one field at a time.  That "
"is, for each field in the form (in the order they are declared in the form "
"definition), the ``Field.clean()`` method (or its override) is run, then "
"``clean_<fieldname>()``. Finally, once those two methods are run for every "
"field, the :meth:`Form.clean()` method, or its override, is executed whether "
"or not the previous methods have raised errors."
msgstr ""
"Reáchtáiltear na modhanna seo san ord a thugtar thuas, réimse amháin ag an "
"am. <fieldname>Is é sin, i gcás gach réimse san fhoirm (san ord a "
"dhearbhaítear iad sa mhíniú foirme), reáchtáiltear an modh ``Field.clean "
"()`` (nó a shárú), ansin ``clean_ () ``. Faoi dheireadh, nuair a bheidh an "
"dá mhodh sin á reáchtáil do gach réimse, déantar an modh:meth: `Form.clean "
"() `, nó a shárú, a fhorghníomhú cibé acu tá earráidí ardaithe ag na "
"modhanna roimhe seo nó nach bhfuil."

msgid "Examples of each of these methods are provided below."
msgstr "Tá samplaí de gach ceann de na modhanna seo ar fáil thíos."

msgid ""
"As mentioned, any of these methods can raise a ``ValidationError``. For any "
"field, if the ``Field.clean()`` method raises a ``ValidationError``, any "
"field-specific cleaning method is not called. However, the cleaning methods "
"for all remaining fields are still executed."
msgstr ""
"Mar a luadh, is féidir le haon cheann de na modhanna seo ``Error "
"Validationer`` a ardú. Maidir le haon réimse, má ardaíonn an modh "
"``Field.clean () ```Error validation``, ní ghlaofar aon mhodh glantacháin "
"réimsiú-shonrach. Mar sin féin, déantar na modhanna glantacháin do gach "
"réimse atá fágtha i bhfeidhm fós."

msgid "Raising ``ValidationError``"
msgstr "“Earráid Bailíochtaithe” a ardú"

msgid ""
"In order to make error messages flexible and easy to override, consider the "
"following guidelines:"
msgstr ""
"D'fhonn teachtaireachtaí earráide a dhéanamh solúbtha agus éasca le "
"frithdhíriú, smaoinigh ar na treoirlínte"

msgid "Provide a descriptive error ``code`` to the constructor::"
msgstr "Soláthar earráid tuairisciúil ``cód ``don tógálaí:"

msgid ""
"Don't coerce variables into the message; use placeholders and the ``params`` "
"argument of the constructor::"
msgstr ""
"Ná cuir athróga isteach sa teachtaireacht; bain úsáid as sealbhóirí agus "
"argóint `params' an tógálaí:"

msgid ""
"Use mapping keys instead of positional formatting. This enables putting the "
"variables in any order or omitting them altogether when rewriting the "
"message::"
msgstr ""
"Úsáid eochracha mapála in ionad formáidiú suímh. Cuireann sé seo ar chumas "
"na hathróga a chur in aon ord nó iad a fhágáil ar fad agus an teachtaireacht "
"á athscríobh:"

msgid "Wrap the message with ``gettext`` to enable translation::"
msgstr "Fill an teachtaireacht le ``gettext`` chun aistriúchán a chumasú:"

msgid "Putting it all together::"
msgstr "Ag cur é ar fad le chéile::"

msgid ""
"Following these guidelines is particularly necessary if you write reusable "
"forms, form fields, and model fields."
msgstr ""
"Is gá go háirithe na treoirlínte seo a leanúint má scríobhann tú foirmeacha "
"in-athúsáidte, réimsí foirme"

msgid ""
"While not recommended, if you are at the end of the validation chain (i.e. "
"your form ``clean()`` method) and you know you will *never* need to override "
"your error message you can still opt for the less verbose::"
msgstr ""
"Cé nach mholtar, má tá tú ag deireadh an slabhra bailíochtaithe (ie do mhodh "
"`glan () `foirm) agus má tá a fhios agat nach gcaithfidh tú *riam* do "
"theachtaireacht earráide a shárú is féidir leat an rud is lú fós a roghnú::"

msgid ""
"The :meth:`Form.errors.as_data() <django.forms.Form.errors.as_data()>` "
"and :meth:`Form.errors.as_json() <django.forms.Form.errors.as_json()>` "
"methods greatly benefit from fully featured ``ValidationError``\\s (with a "
"``code`` name and a ``params`` dictionary)."
msgstr ""
"<django.forms.Form.errors.as_json () >Baineann na modhanna: Meth: "
"`Form.errors.as_data ()` agus:meth: "
"`Form.error<django.forms.Form.errors.as_data () > s.as_json ()` leas mór as "
"``ValidationError``\\ s atá le feiceáil go hiomlán (le hainm ``cód `agus "
"foclóir `params``)."

msgid "Raising multiple errors"
msgstr "Earráidí iomadúla a ardú"

msgid ""
"If you detect multiple errors during a cleaning method and wish to signal "
"all of them to the form submitter, it is possible to pass a list of errors "
"to the ``ValidationError`` constructor."
msgstr ""
"Má aimsíonn tú earráidí iolracha le linn modh glantacháin agus má "
"theastaíonn uait iad go léir a chomharthú chuig an aighdeoir foirme, is "
"féidir liosta earráidí a chur ar aghaidh chuig an tógálaí `ValidationError`."

msgid ""
"As above, it is recommended to pass a list of ``ValidationError`` instances "
"with ``code``\\s and ``params`` but a list of strings will also work::"
msgstr ""
"Mar atá thuas, moltar liosta de chásanna ``ValidationError`` a rith le ``cód "
"``\\ s agus `params`` ach oibreoidh liosta teaghráin freisin:"

msgid "Using validation in practice"
msgstr "Bailíochtú a úsáid i gcleachtas"

msgid ""
"The previous sections explained how validation works in general for forms. "
"Since it can sometimes be easier to put things into place by seeing each "
"feature in use, here are a series of small examples that use each of the "
"previous features."
msgstr ""
"Mhínigh na hailt roimhe seo conas a oibríonn bailíochtú i gcoitinne le "
"haghaidh Ós rud é go bhféadfadh sé a bheith níos éasca uaireanta rudaí a "
"chur i bhfeidhm trí gach gné atá in úsáid a fheiceáil, seo sraith samplaí "
"beaga a úsáideann gach ceann de na gnéithe roimhe seo."

msgid "Using validators"
msgstr "Bailíochtóirí a úsáid"

msgid ""
"Django's form (and model) fields support use of utility functions and "
"classes known as validators. A validator is a callable object or function "
"that takes a value and returns nothing if the value is valid or raises "
"a :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.ValidationError` if not. These can be passed "
"to a field's constructor, via the field's ``validators`` argument, or "
"defined on the :class:`~django.forms.Field` class itself with the "
"``default_validators`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn réimsí foirme (agus samhail) Django le húsáid feidhmeanna fóntais "
"agus ranganna ar a dtugtar bailíochtóirí. Is réad nó feidhm inghlaonta é "
"bailíochtaitheoir a thógann luach agus nach dtugann aon rud ar ais má tá an "
