"this type of field, regardless of how it is subsequently used."
msgstr ""
"Beidh na modhanna seo á reáchtáil ag gach foirm a úsáideann an réimse seo "
"sula bhféadfar aon rud eile a dhéanamh le sonraí an réimse. Is glanadh é seo "
"atá sonrach don chineál seo réimse, beag beann ar an gcaoi a n-úsáidtear é "
"ina dhiaidh sin."

msgid ""
"Let's create a ``ContactForm`` to demonstrate how you'd use this field::"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaímid ``Foirm Teagmhála`` chun a thaispeáint conas a úsáideann tú an "
"réimse seo:"

msgid ""
"Use ``MultiEmailField`` like any other form field. When the ``is_valid()`` "
