"oidhreachta ó:class: `ChoiceField` agus athing:attr: `ChoiceField.choices` a "
"nuashonrú: attr: `select.choices`. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Widgets which offer a :attr:`~Select.choices` attribute can however be used "
"with fields which are not based on choice -- such as a :class:`CharField` -- "
"but it is recommended to use a :class:`ChoiceField`-based field when the "
"choices are inherent to the model and not just the representational widget."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir giuirléidí a thairgeann tréith a:attr: `~select.choices` a úsáid "
"le réimsí nach bhfuil bunaithe ar rogha -- amhail a:class: `Charfield` -- "
"ach moltar réimse a-class: `ChoiceField` a úsáid nuair a bhíonn na roghanna "
"bunúsach don tsamhail agus ní amháin an giuirléid ionadaíochta."

msgid "Customizing widget instances"
msgstr "Saincheapadh cásanna giuirléid"

msgid ""
"When Django renders a widget as HTML, it only renders very minimal markup - "
"Django doesn't add class names, or any other widget-specific attributes. "
"This means, for example, that all :class:`TextInput` widgets will appear the "
"same on your web pages."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a dhéanann Django giuirléid mar HTML, ní dhéanann sé ach marcáil an-"
"íosta - ní chuireann Django ainmneacha ranga leis, ná aon tréithe eile a "
"bhaineann go sonrach le giuirléid. Ciallaíonn sé seo, mar shampla, go mbeidh "
"giuirléidí uill:class: `TextInput` le feiceáil mar an gcéanna ar do "
"leathanaigh ghréasáin."

msgid ""
"There are two ways to customize widgets: :ref:`per widget instance <styling-"
"widget-instances>` and :ref:`per widget class <styling-widget-classes>`."
msgstr ""
"<styling-widget-classes>Tá dhá bhealach ann chun giuirléidí a "
"shaincheapadh: :ref: `in aghaidh an tsampla giuirléid <styling-widget-"
"instances>`agus:ref: `in aghaidh an aicme giuirléid`."

