msgstr "Foclóir ina bhfuil tréithe HTML le socrú ar an ngiuirléid rindreáilte."

msgid ""
"If you assign a value of ``True`` or ``False`` to an attribute, it will be "
"rendered as an HTML5 boolean attribute:"
msgstr ""
"Má shannann tú luach ``True`` nó `False`` do thréith, déanfar é mar thréith "
"boolean HTML5:"

msgid ""
"An attribute that defaults to ``True``. If set to ``False``, the "
"microseconds part of :class:`~datetime.datetime` and :class:`~datetime.time` "
"values will be set to ``0``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith atá réamhshocraithe go ``True``. Má tá sé socraithe go ``False``, "
"socraítear na luachanna micreasoicind de:class: `~datetime.datetime` "
"agus:class: `~datetime.time` go `0``."

msgid ""
"Cleans and returns a value for use in the widget template. ``value`` isn't "
"guaranteed to be valid input, therefore subclass implementations should "
"program defensively."
msgstr ""
"Glanann agus filleann sé luach le húsáid sa teimpléad giuirléid. Ní "
"ráthaítear go mbeidh “luach” ionchur bailí, dá bhrí sin ba cheart "
"forfheidhmithe fo-aicme a chlárú go cosanta."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of values to use when rendering the widget template. By "
"default, the dictionary contains a single key, ``'widget'``, which is a "
"dictionary representation of the widget containing the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"Filleann foclóir luachanna le húsáid agus an teimpléad giuirléid á "
"rindreáil. De réir réamhshocraithe, tá eochair amháin sa fhoclóir, "
"“'giuirléid”, ar léiriú foclóra é ar an ngiuirléid ina bhfuil na heochracha "
"seo a leanas:"

msgid "``'name'``: The name of the field from the ``name`` argument."
msgstr "````ainm``: Ainm an réimse ón argóint ``ainm ``."

msgid ""
"``'is_hidden'``: A boolean indicating whether or not this widget is hidden."
msgstr ""
"``'is_hidden'``: Boolean a léiríonn an bhfuil an giuirléid seo i bhfolach nó "
"nach bhfuil."

msgid ""
"``'required'``: A boolean indicating whether or not the field for this "
"widget is required."
msgstr ""
"``'riachtan``: Boolean a léiríonn cibé an bhfuil an réimse don ghuirléid seo "
"ag teastáil nó nach bhfuil."

msgid "``'value'``: The value as returned by :meth:`format_value`."
msgstr "```luach``: An luach mar a thug ar ais ag: meth: `format_value`."

msgid ""
"``'attrs'``: HTML attributes to be set on the rendered widget. The "
"combination of the :attr:`attrs` attribute and the ``attrs`` argument."
msgstr ""
"``'attrs'``: tréithe HTML atá le socrú ar an ngiuirléid rindreáilte. An "
"teaglaim den tréith: attr: `attrs` agus an argóint ``attrs``."

msgid "``'template_name'``: The value of ``self.template_name``."
msgstr "```'template_name'``: Luach ``self.template_name``."

msgid ""
"``Widget`` subclasses can provide custom context values by overriding this "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le fo-aicmí ``Widget`` luachanna comhthéacs saincheaptha a "
"sholáthar tríd an modh seo a shárú."

msgid ""
"Returns the HTML ID attribute of this widget for use by a ``<label>``, given "
"the ID of the field. Returns an empty string if an ID isn't available."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tréith ID HTML an ghuirléid seo ar ais le húsáid ag <label>```, i "
"bhfianaise ID an réimse. Tugann teaghrán folamh ar ais mura bhfuil "
"aitheantas ar fáil."

msgid ""
"This hook is necessary because some widgets have multiple HTML elements and, "
"thus, multiple IDs. In that case, this method should return an ID value that "
"corresponds to the first ID in the widget's tags."
msgstr ""
"Tá an crúca seo riachtanach toisc go bhfuil ileilimintí HTML ag roinnt "
"giuirléidí agus, dá bhrí sin, iolracha Sa chás sin, ba cheart don modh seo "
"luach aitheantais a fhreagraíonn don chéad aitheantas i gclibeanna an "
"ghuirléid a thabhairt ar ais."

msgid ""
"Renders a widget to HTML using the given renderer. If ``renderer`` is "
"``None``, the renderer from the :setting:`FORM_RENDERER` setting is used."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé giuirléid chuig HTML ag baint úsáide as an renderer a "
"thugtar. Más é ```renderer`` `None``, úsáidtear an rindeoir ón "
"socrú:setting: `FORM_RENDER`."

msgid ""
"Given a dictionary of data and this widget's name, returns the value of this "
"widget. ``files`` may contain data coming from :attr:`request.FILES "
"<django.http.HttpRequest.FILES>`. Returns ``None`` if a value wasn't "
"provided. Note also that ``value_from_datadict`` may be called more than "
"once during handling of form data, so if you customize it and add expensive "
"processing, you should implement some caching mechanism yourself."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar fhoclóir sonraí agus ainm an ghuirléid seo, filleann sé luach "
"an ghuirléid seo ar ais. <django.http.HttpRequest.FILES>D'fhéadfadh sonraí a "
"thagann ó:attr: `request.files `a bheith i ``comhaid``. Tugann sé ar ais "
"``None`` mura gcuirfí luach ar fáil. Tabhair faoi deara freisin gur féidir "
"glaoch ar `value_from_datadict`` níos mó ná uair amháin le linn láimhseáil "
"sonraí foirme, mar sin má shaincheapann tú iad agus má chuireann tú "
"próiseáil daor leis, ba cheart duit meicníocht caching éigin a chur i "
"bhfeidhm tú féin."

msgid ""
"Given ``data`` and ``files`` dictionaries and this widget's name, returns "
"whether or not there's data or files for the widget."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar fhoclóirí `sonra`` agus `comhad ``agus ainm an ghuirléid seo, "
"tugann sé ar ais cibé an bhfuil sonraí nó comhaid ann don ghuirléid nó nach "
"bhfuil."

msgid ""
"The method's result affects whether or not a field in a model "
"form :ref:`falls back to its default <topics-modelform-save>`."
msgstr ""
"<topics-modelform-save>Bíonn tionchar ag toradh an mhodha cibé acu an "
"dtagann réimse i bhfoirm mhúnla:ref: `ar ais go dtí a réamhshocraithe `nó "
"nach bhfuil."

msgid ""
"Special cases "
"are :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxInput`, :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxSelectMultiple`, "
"and :class:`~django.forms.SelectMultiple`, which always return ``False`` "
"because an unchecked checkbox and unselected ``<select multiple>`` don't "
"appear in the data of an HTML form submission, so it's unknown whether or "
"not the user submitted a value."
msgstr ""
"<select multiple>Is iad cásanna speisialta:class: "
"`~django.forms.checkboxInput`, :class: "
"`~django.forms.checkboxSelectMultiple`, agus:class: "
"`~django.forms.selectMultiple`, a fhilleann ``False`` i gcónaí toisc nach "
"bhfuil bosca seiceála neamhsheiceáilte agus ```` neamhroghnaithe le feiceáil "
"i sonraí aighneacht HTML, mar sin níl sé anaithnid cibé an chuir an t-"
"úsáideoir luach isteach nó nach bhfuil."

msgid ""
"An attribute to identify if the widget should be grouped in a ``<fieldset>`` "
"with a ``<legend>`` when rendered. Defaults to ``False`` but is ``True`` "
"when the widget contains multiple ``<input>`` tags such "
"as :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxSelectMultiple`, :class:`~django.forms.RadioSelect`, :class:`~django.forms.MultiWidget`, :class:`~django.forms.SplitDateTimeWidget`, "
"and :class:`~django.forms.SelectDateWidget`."
msgstr ""
"Tréith chun a aithint an gcaithfear an giuirléid a ghrúpáil i ```` le "
"<fieldset>```` nuair a rindreáiltear <legend>é. Réamhshocraithe go ``False`` "
"ach tá sé ``True`` nuair a bhíonn clibeanna iolracha ```` sa ghuirléid "
"amsúil:class: `~django.forms.CheckboxSelectMultiple`, :class: "
"`~django.forms.radioSelect`, <input>:class: "
"`~django.forms.datsplitMeWidget`, agus:aicme: "
"`~django.forms.selectDateWidget`."

msgid ""
"Given a form field's ``initial`` value, returns whether or not the widget "
"can be rendered with the ``required`` HTML attribute. Forms use this method "
"along with :attr:`Field.required <django.forms.Field.required>` "
"and :attr:`Form.use_required_attribute "
"<django.forms.Form.use_required_attribute>` to determine whether or not to "
"display the ``required`` attribute for each field."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar luach ``tosaithe`` réimse foirme, tugann tuairisceáin cibé acu "
"is féidir an giuirléid a léiriú leis an tréith HTML ``riachtan`` nó nach "
"féidir. <django.forms.Form.use_required_attribute>Úsáideann fo "
"<django.forms.Field.required>irmeacha an modh seo in éineacht le: attr: "
"`Field.Required` agus:attr: `Form.USE_REQUIRED_ATTRIBUT` chun a chinneadh an "
"bhfuil an tréith ``riachtan`` a thaispeáint do gach réimse nó nach bhfuil."

msgid ""
"By default, returns ``False`` for hidden widgets and ``True`` otherwise. "
"Special cases are :class:`~django.forms.FileInput` "
"and :class:`~django.forms.ClearableFileInput`, which return ``False`` when "
"``initial`` is set, and :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxSelectMultiple`, which "
"always returns ``False`` because browser validation would require all "
"checkboxes to be checked instead of at least one."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, filleann ``False`` le haghaidh giuirléidí i "
"bhfolach agus ``True`` ar shlí eile. Is iad cásanna speisialta:class: "
"`~django.forms.fileInput` agus:class: `~django.forms.clearaableFileInput`, a "
"fhilleann ``False`` nuair a shocraítear ``initial``, agus:class: "
"`~django.forms.checkboxSelectMultiple` a sheiceáil i gcónaí in ionad ceann "
"amháin ar a laghad."

msgid ""
"Override this method in custom widgets that aren't compatible with browser "
"validation. For example, a WSYSIWG text editor widget backed by a hidden "
"``textarea`` element may want to always return ``False`` to avoid browser "
"validation on the hidden field."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh an modh seo i giuirléidí saincheaptha nach bhfuil comhoiriúnach le "
"bailíochtú brabhsálaí. Mar shampla, b'fhéidir gur mhaith le giuirléid "
"eagarthóra téacs WSYSIWG le tacaíocht ó eilimint “textarea” i bhfolach "
"``False` a thabhairt ar ais i gcónaí chun bailíochtú brabhsálaí ar an réimse "
"i bhfolach a sheachaint."

msgid "``MultiWidget``"
msgstr "``Multiwidget``"

msgid ""
"A widget that is composed of multiple "
"widgets. :class:`~django.forms.MultiWidget` works hand in hand with "
"the :class:`~django.forms.MultiValueField`."
msgstr ""
"Giuirléid atá comhdhéanta de iliomad giuirléidí. :class: "
"`~Django.Forms.MultiWidget` oibríonn láimh ar láimh leis an: class: "
"`~Django.Forms.MultivalueField`."

msgid ":class:`MultiWidget` has one required argument:"
msgstr ":class: Tá argóint riachtanach amháin ag `MultiWidget`:"

msgid "An iterable containing the widgets needed. For example:"
msgstr "Athraitheach ina bhfuil na giuirléidí is gá. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"You may provide a dictionary in order to specify custom suffixes for the "
"``name`` attribute on each subwidget. In this case, for each ``(key, "
"widget)`` pair, the key will be appended to the ``name`` of the widget in "
"order to generate the attribute value. You may provide the empty string "
"(``''``) for a single key, in order to suppress the suffix for one widget. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh tú foclóir a sholáthar chun iarmhairtí saincheaptha a shonrú don "
"tréith ``ainm ``ar gach foghuirléid. Sa chás seo, do gach péire ``(eochair, "
"giuirléid)``, cuirfear an eochair le ``ainm ``den ghuirléid d'fhonn an luach "
"tréithe a ghiniúint. Féadfaidh tú an teaghrán folamh (``\"``) a sholáthar "
"d'eochair amháin, d'fhonn an iarmhír do ghuirléid amháin a chur faoi chois. "
"Mar shampla:"

msgid "And one required method:"
msgstr "Agus modh amháin riachtanach:"

msgid ""
"This method takes a single \"compressed\" value from the field and returns a "
"list of \"decompressed\" values. The input value can be assumed valid, but "
"not necessarily non-empty."
msgstr ""
"Tógann an modh seo luach amháin “comhbhrúite” ón réimse agus filleann sé "
"liosta de luachanna “díchomhbhrúite” ar ais. Is féidir glacadh leis an luach "
"ionchuir bailí, ach ní gá go bhfuil sé folamh."

msgid ""
"This method **must be implemented** by the subclass, and since the value may "
"be empty, the implementation must be defensive."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an fo-aicme an modh seo **a chur i bhfeidhme**, agus ós rud é go "
"bhféadfadh an luach a bheith folamh, caithfidh an cur i bhfeidhm a bheith "
"cosanta."

msgid ""
"The rationale behind \"decompression\" is that it is necessary to \"split\" "
"the combined value of the form field into the values for each widget."
msgstr ""
"Is é an réasúnaíocht atá taobh thiar de “díchomhbhrúite” ná go bhfuil sé "
"riachtanach luach comhcheangailte na réimse foirme a “roinnt” sna luachanna "
"do gach giuirléid."

msgid ""
"An example of this is how :class:`SplitDateTimeWidget` turns "
"a :class:`~datetime.datetime` value into a list with date and time split "
"into two separate values::"
msgstr ""
"Sampla de seo is ea conas a chasann: class: `SplitDateTimeWidget` luach a: "
"class: `~datetime.datetime` ina liosta le dáta agus am roinnte ina dhá luach "
"ar leithligh:"

msgid ""
"Note that :class:`~django.forms.MultiValueField` has a complementary "
"method :meth:`~django.forms.MultiValueField.compress` with the opposite "
"responsibility - to combine cleaned values of all member fields into one."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil modh comhlántach ag: :class: "
"`~django.forms.multivaluefield`: meth: "
"`~django.forms.multivaluefield.compress` leis an bhfreagracht mhalairt - "
"luachanna glanta gach réimse ball a chomhcheangal i gceann amháin."

msgid "It provides some custom context:"
msgstr "Soláthraíonn sé roinnt comhthéacs saincheaptha:"

msgid ""
"In addition to the ``'widget'`` key described in :meth:`Widget.get_context`, "
"``MultiWidget`` adds a ``widget['subwidgets']`` key."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis an eochair ``'widget'`` a thuairiscítear in:meth: "
"`Widget.get_context`, cuireann ``MultiWidget`` eochair ``widget "
"['subwidgets'] ``leis."

msgid "These can be looped over in the widget template:"
msgstr "Is féidir iad seo a lúbadh sa teimpléad giuirléid:"

msgid ""
"Here's an example widget which subclasses :class:`MultiWidget` to display a "
"date with the day, month, and year in different select boxes. This widget is "
"intended to be used with a :class:`~django.forms.DateField` rather than "
"a :class:`~django.forms.MultiValueField`, thus we have "
"implemented :meth:`~Widget.value_from_datadict`::"
msgstr ""
"Seo giuirléid shampla a dhéanann fo-aicmi:class: `MultiWidget` chun dáta a "
"thaispeáint leis an lá, an mhí agus an bhliain i mboscaí roghnaithe éagsúla. "
"Tá sé beartaithe an giuirléid seo a úsáid le a:class: "
"`~django.forms.datefield` seachas a:class: `~django.forms.multivaluefield`, "
"mar sin tá: meth: `~Widget.value_from_dataDict` curtha i bhfeidhm againn::"

msgid ""
"The constructor creates several :class:`Select` widgets in a list. The "
"``super()`` method uses this list to set up the widget."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn an tógálaí giuirléidí roinnt: class: `Roghnaithe` i liosta. "
"Úsáideann an modh ``super () ``an liosta seo chun an giuirléid a chur ar bun."

msgid ""
"The required method :meth:`~MultiWidget.decompress` breaks up a "
"``datetime.date`` value into the day, month, and year values corresponding "
"to each widget. If an invalid date was selected, such as the non-existent "
"30th February, the :class:`~django.forms.DateField` passes this method a "
"string instead, so that needs parsing. The final ``return`` handles when "
"``value`` is ``None``, meaning we don't have any defaults for our subwidgets."
msgstr ""
"Briseann an modh riachtanach: “~ MultiWidget.Decompress` luach "
"`datetime.date ``isteach sna luachanna lae, míosa agus bliana a fhreagraíonn "
"do gach giuirléid. Má roghnaíodh dáta neamhbhailí, mar shampla an 30 Feabhra "
"nach raibh ann, téann an:class: `~django.forms.datefield` teaghrán ar an "
"modh seo ina ionad sin, ionas gur gá parsáil air sin. Láimhseálann an "
"``fillead`` deiridh nuair is é ```luach`` ``None``, rud a chiallaíonn nach "
"bhfuil aon réamhshocraithe againn dár bhfo-ghuirléidí."

msgid ""
"The default implementation of :meth:`~Widget.value_from_datadict` returns a "
"list of values corresponding to each ``Widget``. This is appropriate when "
"using a ``MultiWidget`` with a :class:`~django.forms.MultiValueField`. But "
"since we want to use this widget with a :class:`~django.forms.DateField`, "
"which takes a single value, we have overridden this method. The "
"implementation here combines the data from the subwidgets into a string in "
"the format that :class:`~django.forms.DateField` expects."
msgstr ""
"Tugann cur i bhfeidhm réamhshocraithe de:meth: `~Widget.value_from_datadict` "
"liosta luachanna a fhreagraíonn do gach ``Widget``. Tá sé seo oiriúnach "
"nuair a úsáidtear ``MultiWidget`` le a:class: "
"`~django.forms.MultivalueField`. Ach ós rud é gur mhaith linn an giuirléid "
"seo a úsáid le a:class: `~django.forms.datefield`, a thógann luach amháin, "
"tá an modh seo curtha againn. Comhcheanglaíonn an cur i bhfeidhm anseo na "
"sonraí ó na fo-ghuirléidí i sreang san fhormáid a bhfuil súil ag: Class: "
"`~Django.Forms.DateField` ag súil leis."

