"default is a list containing the current year and the next 9 years."
msgstr ""
"Liosta roghnach de na blianta le húsáid sa bhosca roghnaithe “bliain”. Is é "
"an réamhshocrú liosta ina bhfuil an bhliain reatha agus na 9 mbliana amach "
"romhainn."

msgid "An optional dict of months to use in the \"months\" select box."
msgstr "Ordú roghnach míonna le húsáid sa bhosca roghnaithe “míonna”."

msgid ""
"The keys of the dict correspond to the month number (1-indexed) and the "
"values are the displayed months::"
msgstr ""
"Freagraíonn eochracha an dict d'uimhir na míosa (1-innéacsaithe) agus is iad "
"na luachanna na míonna a thaispeántar:"

msgid ""
"If the :class:`~django.forms.DateField` is not "
"required, :class:`SelectDateWidget` will have an empty choice at the top of "
"the list (which is ``---`` by default). You can change the text of this "
"label with the ``empty_label`` attribute. ``empty_label`` can be a "
"``string``, ``list``, or ``tuple``. When a string is used, all select boxes "
"will each have an empty choice with this label. If ``empty_label`` is a "
"``list`` or ``tuple`` of 3 string elements, the select boxes will have their "
"own custom label. The labels should be in this order ``('year_label', "
"'month_label', 'day_label')``."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil an: class: `~django.forms.DateField` ag teastáil, beidh rogha "
"folamh ag :class: `SelectDateWidget` ag barr an liosta (atá ``---`` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe). Is féidir leat téacs an lipéid seo a athrú leis an tréith "
"``empty_label``. Is féidir le ``empty_label`` a bheith ina ``string``, "
"`liost``, nó ``tuple``. Nuair a úsáidtear sreang, beidh rogha folamh ag gach "
"bosca roghnaithe leis an lipéad seo. Más ``liosta ``nó ``tuple`` de 3 "
"eilimint sreangán é ``empty_label``, beidh a lipéad saincheaptha féin ag na "
"boscaí roghnaithe. Ba chóir go mbeadh na lipéid san ord seo ``('year_label', "
"'month_label', 'day_label')``."

msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Logáil"

msgid ":ref:`logging-how-to`"
msgstr ":ref: `logán-conas to`"

msgid ":ref:`Django logging overview <logging-explanation>`"
msgstr "<logging-explanation>:ref: `Forbhreathnú logála Django `"

msgid "Django's logging module extends Python's builtin :mod:`logging`."
msgstr "Leathnaíonn modúl logála Django tógáil Python: mod: `loging`."

msgid ""
"Logging is configured as part of the general Django :func:`django.setup` "
"function, so it's always available unless explicitly disabled."
msgstr ""
"Cumraítear logáil mar chuid den fheidhm ghinearálta django: func: "
"`django.setup`, mar sin tá sé ar fáil i gcónaí mura bhfuil sé míchumasaithe "
"go sainráite."

msgid "Django's default logging configuration"
msgstr "Cumraíocht logála réamhshocraithe Django"

msgid ""
"By default, Django uses Python's :ref:`logging.config.dictConfig format "
"<logging-config-dictschema>`."
msgstr ""
"<logging-config-dictschema>De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáideann Django formáid "
"Python: Ref: `Logging.config.dictConfig `."

msgid "Default logging conditions"
msgstr "Coinníollacha logála réamhshoc"

msgid "The full set of default logging conditions are:"
msgstr "Is iad an tacar iomlán coinníollacha logála réamhshocraithe:"

msgid "When :setting:`DEBUG` is ``True``:"
msgstr "Nuair: Socrú: Is é `DEBUG` ``True``:"

msgid ""
"The ``django`` logger sends messages in the ``django`` hierarchy (except "
"``django.server``) at the ``INFO`` level or higher to the console."
msgstr ""
"Seolann an logálaí ``django ``teachtaireachtaí san ordlathas ``django`` "
"(seachas ``django.server``) ag an leibhéal ``INFO`` nó níos airde chuig an "
"gconsól."

msgid "When :setting:`DEBUG` is ``False``:"
msgstr "Nuair: Socrú: Is é `DEBUG` ``False``:"

msgid ""
"The ``django`` logger sends messages in the ``django`` hierarchy (except "
"``django.server``)  with ``ERROR`` or ``CRITICAL`` level "
"to :class:`AdminEmailHandler`."
msgstr ""
"Seolann an logálaí ``django`` teachtaireachtaí san ordlathas ``django`` "
"(seachas ``django.server``) le leibhéal ``ERROR`` nó ``CRITICAL`` go "
"dt:class: `AdminEmailHandler`."

msgid "Independently of the value of :setting:`DEBUG`:"
msgstr "Neamhspleách ar luach: socrú: `DEBUG`:"

msgid ""
"The :ref:`django-server-logger` logger sends messages at the ``INFO`` level "
"or higher to the console."
msgstr ""
"Seolann logger:ref: `django-server-logger` teachtaireachtaí ag an leibhéal "
"``INFO ``nó níos airde chuig an gconsól."

msgid ""
"All loggers except :ref:`django-server-logger` propagate logging to their "
"parents, up to the root ``django`` logger. The ``console`` and "
"``mail_admins`` handlers are attached to the root logger to provide the "
"behavior described above."
msgstr ""
"Déanann gach logger seachas: ref: `django-server-logger` iomadú logáil chuig "
"a dtuismitheoirí, suas go dtí an logger fréimhe ``django``. Tá na "
"láimhseálaithe ``console`` agus ``mail_admins`` ceangailte leis an logálaí "
"fréimhe chun an t-iompar a thuairiscítear thuas a sholáthar."

msgid ""
"Python's own defaults send records of level ``WARNING`` and higher to the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"Seolann réamhshocraithe Python féin taifid ar leibhéal ``RABHADH ``agus níos "
"airde chuig an gconsól."

msgid "Default logging definition"
msgstr "Sainmhíniú logála réamh"

msgid ""
"Django's default logging configuration inherits Python's defaults. It's "
"available as ``django.utils.log.DEFAULT_LOGGING`` and defined "
"in :source:`django/utils/log.py`::"
msgstr ""
"Oidhreann cumraíocht logála réamhshocraithe Django réamhshocraithe "
"réamhshocraithe Python. Tá sé ar fáil mar "
"``django.utils.log.default_logging`` agus sainithe in:source: `django/utils/"
"log.py`::"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`configuring-logging` on how to complement or replace this default "
"logging configuration."
msgstr ""
"Féach: ref: `cumraing-loging` maidir le conas an chumraíocht logála "
"réamhshocraithe seo a chomhlánú nó a athsholáthar."

msgid "Django logging extensions"
msgstr "Síntí logála Django"

msgid ""
"Django provides a number of utilities to handle the particular requirements "
"of logging in a web server environment."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django roinnt fóntais chun na riachtanais áirithe a bhaineann "
"le logáil isteach i dtimpeallacht freastalaí gréasáin a láim"

msgid "Loggers"
msgstr "Logálaí"

msgid "Django provides several built-in loggers."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn Django roinnt loggers ionsuite."

msgid "``django``"
msgstr "``Django``"

msgid ""
"The parent logger for messages in the ``django`` :ref:`named logger "
"hierarchy <naming-loggers-hierarchy>`. Django does not post messages using "
"this name. Instead, it uses one of the loggers below."
msgstr ""
"<naming-loggers-hierarchy>An logálaí tuismitheora do theachtaireachtaí sa "
"``django``:ref: `ordlathas logálaí ainmnithe `. Ní phostáil Django "
"teachtaireachtaí ag baint úsáide as an ainm seo. Ina áit sin, úsáideann sé "
"ceann de na loggers thíos."

msgid "``django.request``"
msgstr "``django.request``"

msgid ""
"Log messages related to the handling of requests. 5XX responses are raised "
"as ``ERROR`` messages; 4XX responses are raised as ``WARNING`` messages. "
"Requests that are logged to the ``django.security`` logger aren't logged to "
"``django.request``."
msgstr ""
"Teachtaireachtaí logála a bhaineann le láimhseáil iarratais. Ardaítear 5XX "
"freagra mar theachtaireachtaí ``ERROR``; Ardaítear 4XX freagra mar "
"theachtaireachtaí ``RABHADH ``. Ní chuirtear iarratais atá logáilte chuig an "
"logaire ``django.security`` logáilte chuig ``django.request``."

msgid "Messages to this logger have the following extra context:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhthéacs breise seo a leanas ag teachtaireachtaí chuig an logaire "
"seo:"

msgid "``status_code``: The HTTP response code associated with the request."
msgstr "``status_code``: An cód freagartha HTTP a bhaineann leis an iarratas."

msgid "``request``: The request object that generated the logging message."
msgstr "``request``: An réad iarratais a ghinigh an teachtaireacht logála."

msgid "``django.server``"
msgstr "``django.freastala``"

msgid ""
"Log messages related to the handling of requests received by the server "
"invoked by the :djadmin:`runserver` command. HTTP 5XX responses are logged "
"as ``ERROR`` messages, 4XX responses are logged as ``WARNING`` messages, and "
"everything else is logged as ``INFO``."
msgstr ""
"Logáil teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le láimhseáil iarratais a fhaigheann an "
"freastalaí a ghairm leis an ordú:djadmin: `runserver`. Logáiltear freagraí "
"HTTP 5XX mar theachtaireachtaí ``ERROR``, logáiltear freagraí 4XX mar "
"theachtaireachtaí ``RABHADH ``, agus logáiltear gach rud eile mar `INFO``."

msgid ""
"``request``: The request object (a :py:class:`socket.socket`) that generated "
"the logging message."
msgstr ""
"``request``: An réad iarratais (a:py:class: `socket.socket`) a ghinigh an "
"teachtaireacht logála."

msgid "``django.template``"
msgstr "``django.teimpléad``"

msgid "Log messages related to the rendering of templates."
msgstr "Logáil teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le rindreáil teimpléid."

msgid "Missing context variables are logged as ``DEBUG`` messages."
msgstr ""
"Logáiltear athróga comhthéacs atá in easnamh mar theachtaireachtaí ``DEBUG`."

msgid "``django.db.backends``"
msgstr "``django.db.backends``"

msgid ""
"Messages relating to the interaction of code with the database. For example, "
"every application-level SQL statement executed by a request is logged at the "
"``DEBUG`` level to this logger."
msgstr ""
"Teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le hidirghníomhú an chód leis an mbunachar "
"sonraí Mar shampla, logáiltear gach ráiteas SQL ar leibhéal feidhmchláir a "
"fhorghníomhaítear le hiarratas ag an leibhéal ``DEBUG` chuig an logger seo."

msgid "``duration``: The time taken to execute the SQL statement."
msgstr "``fad ``: An t-am a thógtar chun an ráiteas SQL a fhorghníomhú."

msgid "``sql``: The SQL statement that was executed."
msgstr "``sql``: An ráiteas SQL a cuireadh i bhfeidhm."

msgid "``params``: The parameters that were used in the SQL call."
msgstr "``params``: Na paraiméadair a úsáideadh sa ghlao SQL."

msgid "``alias``: The alias of the database used in the SQL call."
msgstr "``alias``: An alias den bhunachar sonraí a úsáidtear sa ghlao SQL."

msgid ""
"For performance reasons, SQL logging is only enabled when ``settings.DEBUG`` "
"is set to ``True``, regardless of the logging level or handlers that are "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Ar chúiseanna feidhmíochta, ní chumasaítear logáil SQL ach nuair a "
"shocraítear ``Settings.debug`` go ``True``, beag beann ar an leibhéal logála "
"nó ar an láimhseálaithe atá suiteáilte."

msgid ""
"This logging does not include framework-level initialization (e.g. ``SET "
"TIMEZONE``). Turn on query logging in your database if you wish to view all "
"database queries."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuimsíonn an logáil seo tionscnamh ar leibhéal creata (m.sh. `SET "
"TIMEZONE``). Cas ar logáil ceisteanna i do bhunachar sonraí más mian leat "
"gach ceist bunachar sonraí a fheiceáil."

msgid "``django.utils.autoreload``"
msgstr "``django.utils.autoreload``"

msgid ""
"Log messages related to automatic code reloading during the execution of the "
"Django development server. This logger generates an ``INFO`` message upon "
"detecting a modification in a source code file and may produce ``WARNING`` "
"messages during filesystem inspection and event subscription processes."
msgstr ""
"Logáil teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le hathluchtú cód uathoibríoch le linn "
"freastalaí forbartha Django a chur i bh Gineann an logálaí seo "
"teachtaireacht ``INFO` nuair a bhrath modhnú i gcomhad cód foinse agus "
"féadfaidh sé teachtaireachtaí `RABHADH ``a tháirgeadh le linn cigireachta an "
"chórais chomhaid agus próisis síntiúis imeachta."

msgid ""
"Log messages related to :doc:`contrib/auth`, particularly ``ERROR`` messages "
"are generated when a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` "
"is successfully submitted but the password reset email cannot be delivered "
"due to a mail sending exception."
msgstr ""
"Gintear teachtaireachtaí logála a bhaineann le:doc: `contrib/auth`, go "
"háirithe teachtaireachtaí ``ERROR`` nuair a chuirtear a:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.forms.passwordResetForm` isteach go rathúil ach ní "
"féidir an ríomhphost athshocraithe pasfhocal a sheachadadh mar gheall ar "
"eisceacht seolta ríomhphoist."

msgid ""
"Log messages related to :doc:`contrib/gis/index` at various points: during "
"the loading of external GeoSpatial libraries (GEOS, GDAL, etc.) and when "
"reporting errors. Each ``ERROR`` log record includes the caught exception "
"and relevant contextual data."
msgstr ""
"Logáil teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le:doc: `contrib/gis/index` ag pointí "
"éagsúla: le linn luchtú leabharlanna Geospásúla seachtracha (GEOS, GDAL, "
"srl.) agus nuair a thuairisciú earráidí. Cuimsíonn gach taifead logála "
"``ERROR` an eisceacht ghafa agus na sonraí comhthéacsúla ábhartha."

msgid "``django.dispatch``"
msgstr "``django.sheoladh ``"

msgid ""
"This logger is used in :doc:`signals`, specifically within "
"the :mod:`~django.dispatch.Signal` class, to report issues when dispatching "
"a signal to a connected receiver. The ``ERROR`` log record includes the "
"caught exception as ``exc_info`` and adds the following extra context:"
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an logaire seo in:doc: `signals`, go sonrach laistigh den aic:mod: "
"`~Django.Dispatch.Signal`, chun saincheisteanna a thuairisciú agus comhartha "
"á sheoladh chuig glacadóir ceangailte. Cuimsíonn an taifead logála ``ERROR`` "
"an eisceacht ghafa mar `exc_info`` agus cuireann sé an comhthéacs breise seo "
"a leanas leis:"

msgid "``receiver``: The name of the receiver."
msgstr "``glacadóir`: Ainm an ghlacadóra."

msgid "``err``: The exception that occurred when calling the receiver."
msgstr "``err``: An eisceacht a tharla nuair a ghlaoigh ar an nglacadóir."

msgid "``django.security.*``"
msgstr "``django.security. *``"

msgid ""
"The security loggers will receive messages on any occurrence "
"of :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.SuspiciousOperation` and other security-"
"related errors. There is a sub-logger for each subtype of security error, "
"including all ``SuspiciousOperation``\\s. The level of the log event depends "
"on where the exception is handled.  Most occurrences are logged as a "
"warning, while any ``SuspiciousOperation`` that reaches the WSGI handler "
"will be logged as an error. For example, when an HTTP ``Host`` header is "
"included in a request from a client that does not "
"match :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS`, Django will return a 400 response, and an "
"error message will be logged to the ``django.security.DisallowedHost`` "
"logger."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh na logóirí slándála teachtaireachtaí ar aon tarlú de:exc: "
"`~django.core.exceptions.SuspiciousOperation` agus earráidí eile a bhaineann "
"le slándáil. Tá fo-logaire ann do gach fo-chineál earráide slándála, lena n-"
"áirítear gach ``SuspiciousOperation``. Braitheann leibhéal an imeachta "
"logála ar an áit a láimhseálfar an eisceacht. Déantar an chuid is mó de na "
"himeachtaí a logáil mar rabhadh, agus logáilfear aon ``Abhrabhachas ``a "
"shroicheann láimhseálaí WSGI mar earráid. Mar shampla, nuair a chuirtear "
"ceannteideal HTTP ``Host`` san áireamh in iarratas ó chliant nach bhfuil "
"meait:setting: `ALLOWED_HOSTS`, cuirfidh Django freagra 400 ar ais, agus "
"logálfar teachtaireacht earráide chuig an logger "
"``Django.security.disallowedHost``."

msgid ""
"These log events will reach the ``django`` logger by default, which mails "
"error events to admins when ``DEBUG=False``. Requests resulting in a 400 "
"response due to a ``SuspiciousOperation`` will not be logged to the "
"``django.request`` logger, but only to the ``django.security`` logger."
msgstr ""
"Sroichfidh na himeachtaí logála seo an logaire ``django`` de réir "
"réamhshocraithe, a sheolann imeachtaí earráide chuig riarthóirí nuair a "
"bhíonn `debug = false ``. Ní logálfar iarratais a bhíonn freagra 400 mar "
"gheall ar ``AbhraisciousOperation`` sa logálaí `django.request``, ach chuig "
"an logálaí `django.security`` amháin."

msgid ""
"To silence a particular type of ``SuspiciousOperation``, you can override "
"that specific logger following this example::"
msgstr ""
"Chun cineál áirithe ``AspiciousOperation`` a thostú, is féidir leat an "
"logaire sonrach sin a shárú tar éis an sampla seo:"

msgid ""
"Other ``django.security`` loggers not based on ``SuspiciousOperation`` are:"
msgstr ""
"Is iad logálaí eile `django.security`` nach bhfuil bunaithe ar "
"``AspiciousOperation``:"

msgid ""
"``django.security.csrf``: For :ref:`CSRF failures <csrf-rejected-requests>`."
msgstr ""
"<csrf-rejected-requests>``django.security.csrf``: le haghaidh: `Teipeanna "
"CSRF `."

msgid "``django.db.backends.schema``"
msgstr "``django.db.backends.schema``"

msgid ""
"Logs the SQL queries that are executed during schema changes to the database "
"by the :doc:`migrations framework </topics/migrations>`. Note that it won't "
"log the queries executed "
"by :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.RunPython`. Messages to this "
"logger have ``params`` and ``sql`` in their extra context (but unlike "
"``django.db.backends``, not duration). The values have the same meaning as "
"explained in :ref:`django-db-logger`."
msgstr ""
"Logálann sé na ceisteanna SQL a fhorghníomhaítear le linn athruithe scéime "
"ar an mbunachar sonraí ag an gcreata:doc: `</topics/migrations> imirceach`. "
"Tabhair faoi deara nach logálfaidh sé na ceisteanna a fhorghníomhaí:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.runpython`. Tá `params`` agus `sql`` ag "
"teachtaireachtaí chuig an logaire seo ina gcomhthéacs breise (ach murab "
"ionann agus ``django.db.backends``, ní fad). Tá an brí céanna ag na "
"luachanna mar a mhínítear in:ref: `django-db-logger`."

msgid ""
"Log messages related to the :doc:`session framework</topics/http/sessions>`."
msgstr ""
"Logáil teachtaireachtaí a bhaineann le:doc: `session framework`</topics/http/"
"sessions>."

msgid ""
"Non-fatal errors occurring when using "
"the :class:`django.contrib.sessions.backends.cached_db.SessionStore` engine "
"are logged as ``ERROR`` messages with the corresponding traceback."
msgstr ""
"Déantar earráidí neamh-mharfacha a tharlaíonn nuair a úsáidtear an "
"inneall:class: `Django.contrib.sessions.backends.cached_db.sessionStore` "
"logáilte mar theachtaireachtaí ``ERROR`` leis an rianaireacht "
"chomhfhreagrach."

msgid "Handlers"
msgstr "Láimhseálaithe"

msgid ""
"Django provides one log handler in addition to :mod:`those provided by the "
"Python logging module <python:logging.handlers>`."
msgstr ""
"<python:logging.handlers>Soláthraíonn Django láimhseálaí logála amháin i "
"dteann:mod: `iad siúd a sholáthraíonn an modúl logála Python `."

msgid ""
"This handler sends an email to the site :setting:`ADMINS` for each log "
"message it receives."
msgstr ""
"Seolann an láimhseálaí seo ríomhphost chuig an láithreán: setting: `ADMINS` "
"do gach teachtaireacht logála a fhaigheann sé."

msgid ""
"If the log record contains a ``request`` attribute, the full details of the "
"request will be included in the email. The email subject will include the "
"phrase \"internal IP\" if the client's IP address is in "
"the :setting:`INTERNAL_IPS` setting; if not, it will include \"EXTERNAL IP\"."
msgstr ""
"Má tá tréith ``iarrata`` sa taifead logála, cuirfear sonraí iomlána an "
"iarratais san áireamh sa ríomhphost. Áireofar san ábhar ríomhphoist an "
"abairt “IP inmheánach” má tá seoladh IP an chliaint sa socrú: "
"`INTERNAL_IPS`; mura bhfuil, beidh “IP EXTERNAL” san áireamh ann."

msgid ""
"If the log record contains stack trace information, that stack trace will be "
"included in the email."
msgstr ""
"Má tá faisnéis rianaithe cruach sa taifead logála, cuirfear an rian cruach "
"sin san áireamh sa ríomhphost."

msgid ""
"The ``include_html`` argument of ``AdminEmailHandler`` is used to control "
"whether the traceback email includes an HTML attachment containing the full "
"content of the debug web page that would have been produced "
"if :setting:`DEBUG` were ``True``. To set this value in your configuration, "
"include it in the handler definition for "
"``django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler``, like this::"
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an argóint `include_html`` de `AdminEmailHandler`` chun rialú a "
"dhéanamh an bhfuil ceangaltán HTML san áireamh sa ríomhphost rianaithe ina "
"bhfuil ábhar iomlán an leathanaigh ghréasáin dífhabhtaithe a tháirgfeadh dá "
"mbeadh: socrú: `DEBUG` ``True``. Chun an luach seo a shocrú i do "
"chumraíocht, cuir san áireamh é sa sainmhíniú láimhseálaí do "
"``Django.utils.log.adminEmailHandler``, mar seo:"

msgid ""
"Be aware of the :ref:`security implications of logging <logging-security-"
"implications>` when using the ``AdminEmailHandler``."
msgstr ""
"Bí ar an eolas fao:ref: `impleachtaí slándála a bhaineann le logáil `agus an "
"`AdminEmailHand <logging-security-implications>ler`` á úsáid agat."

msgid ""
"By setting the ``email_backend`` argument of ``AdminEmailHandler``, "
"the :ref:`email backend <topic-email-backends>` that is being used by the "
"handler can be overridden, like this::"
msgstr ""
"<topic-email-backends>Trí an argóint ``email_backend`` de "
"`AdminEmailHandler`` a shocrú, is féidir an:ref: `backend ríomhphost` atá á "
"úsáid ag an láimhseálaí a athshealbhú, mar seo:"

msgid ""
"By default, an instance of the email backend specified "
"in :setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND` will be used."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáidfear sampla den chúltaca ríomhphoist a "
"shonraítear in:setting: `EMAIL_BACKEND`."

msgid ""
"The ``reporter_class`` argument of ``AdminEmailHandler`` allows providing an "
"``django.views.debug.ExceptionReporter`` subclass to customize the traceback "
"text sent in the email body. You provide a string import path to the class "
"you wish to use, like this::"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an argóint ``reporter_class`` de `AdminEmailHandler`` fo-aicme "
"``django.views.debug.exceptionReporter`` a sholáthar chun an téacs rianaithe "
"a sheoltar sa chomhlacht ríomhphoist a shaincheapadh. Soláthraíonn tú cosán "
"allmhairithe teaghrán chuig an rang is mian leat a úsáid, mar seo:"

msgid ""
"Sends emails to admin users. To customize this behavior, you can subclass "
"the :class:`~django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler` class and override this "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Seolann ríomhphoist chuig úsáideoirí admin. Chun an t-iompar seo a "
"shaincheapadh, is féidir leat an rang:class: "
"`~django.utils.log.adminEmailHandler` a fho-aicmiú agus an modh seo a shárú."

msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Scagairí"

msgid ""
"Django provides some log filters in addition to those provided by the Python "
"logging module."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django roinnt scagairí logála i dteannta leo siúd a "
"sholáthraíonn modúl logála Python."

msgid ""
"This filter accepts a callback function (which should accept a single "
"argument, the record to be logged), and calls it for each record that passes "
"through the filter. Handling of that record will not proceed if the callback "
"returns False."
msgstr ""
"Glacann an scagaire seo le feidhm aisghlaonna (ba chóir dó glacadh le "
"argóint amháin, an taifead atá le logáil), agus glaonn sé do gach taifead a "
"théann tríd an scagaire. Ní rachaidh láimhseáil an taifead sin ar aghaidh má "
"fhilleann an glaoch ar ais bréagach."

msgid ""
"For instance, to filter out :exc:`~django.http.UnreadablePostError` (raised "
"when a user cancels an upload) from the admin emails, you would create a "
"filter function::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, chun scagadh amach: exc: `~django.http.UnreadablePostError` "
"(arna ardú nuair a chuireann úsáideoir uaslódáil ar ceal) ó na ríomhphoist "
"riaracháin, chruthófá feidhm scagaire:"

msgid "and then add it to your logging config::"
msgstr "agus ansin cuir é le do chumraíocht logála::"

msgid "This filter will only pass on records when settings.DEBUG is False."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirfidh an scagaire seo ar thaifid ach nuair a bhíonn settings.Debug "
"bréagach."

msgid ""
"This filter is used as follows in the default :setting:`LOGGING` "
"configuration to ensure that the :class:`AdminEmailHandler` only sends error "
"emails to admins when :setting:`DEBUG` is ``False``::"
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an scagaire seo mar seo a leanas sa chumraíocht "
"réamhshocraithe:socrú: `LOGGING` chun a chinntiú nach seolann an:class: "
"`adminEmailHandler` ríomhphoist earráide chuig riarthóirí ach nuair:socrú: "
"`DEBUG` `False``:"

msgid ""
"This filter is similar to :class:`RequireDebugFalse`, except that records "
"are passed only when :setting:`DEBUG` is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Tá an scagaire seo cosúil le:class: `RequireDebugFalse`, ach amháin nach "
"ndéantar taifid a rith ach nuair:setting: `DEBUG` ``True``."

msgid ""
"This document explains all middleware components that come with Django. For "
"information on how to use them and how to write your own middleware, see "
"the :doc:`middleware usage guide </topics/http/middleware>`."
msgstr ""
"Míníonn an doiciméad seo gach comhpháirteanna middleware a thagann le "
"Django. Le haghaidh faisnéise maidir le conas iad a úsáid agus conas do "
"mheánearraí féin a scríobh, féach in:doc: `treoir úsáide middleware </topics/"
"http/middleware> `."

msgid "Available middleware"
msgstr "Middleware atá ar fáil"

msgid "Cache middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí taisce"

msgid ""
"Enable the site-wide cache. If these are enabled, each Django-powered page "
"will be cached for as long as the :setting:`CACHE_MIDDLEWARE_SECONDS` "
"setting defines. See the :doc:`cache documentation </topics/cache>`."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh taisce ar fud an láithreáin. Má chumasaítear iad seo, déanfar gach "
"leathanach faoi thiomáint Django a stóráil chomh fada agus a shainmhíníonn "
"an socrú:setting: `CACHE_MIDDLEWARE_SECONDS`. Féach na:doc: `cáipéisíocht "
"taisceach` </topics/cache>."

msgid "\"Common\" middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí “Coitianta”"

msgid ""
"Defaults to :class:`~django.http.HttpResponsePermanentRedirect`. Subclass "
"``CommonMiddleware`` and override the attribute to customize the redirects "
"issued by the middleware."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocraithe chuig: aicme: `~django.http.httpResponsePermanentDirect`. Fo-"
"aicme ``CommonMiddleware`` agus athsháraigh an tréith chun na haatreoruithe "
"arna eisiúint ag an middleware a shaincheapadh."

msgid "Adds a few conveniences for perfectionists:"
msgstr "Cuireann sé cúpla áiseanna le haghaidh foirfeachtóirí:"

msgid ""
"Forbids access to user agents in the :setting:`DISALLOWED_USER_AGENTS` "
"setting, which should be a list of compiled regular expression objects."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé cosc ar rochtain ar ghníomhairí úsáideora sa socrú:setting: "
"`DISALLOWED_USER_AGENTS`, ar chóir a bheith ina liosta de rudaí léirithe "
"rialta tiomsaithe."

msgid ""
"Performs URL rewriting based on the :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` "
"and :setting:`PREPEND_WWW` settings."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé athscríobh URL bunaithe ar na socruithe:: `APPEND_SLASH` "
"agus:setting: `PREPEND_WWW`."

msgid ""
"If :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` is ``True`` and the initial URL doesn't end with "
"a slash, and it is not found in the URLconf, then a new URL is formed by "
"appending a slash at the end. If this new URL is found in the URLconf, then "
"Django redirects the request to this new URL. Otherwise, the initial URL is "
"processed as usual."
msgstr ""
"Más rud é: Setting: ```True`` `APPEND_SLASH` agus ní chríochnaíonn an URL "
"tosaigh le slash, agus ní fhaightear é sa URLConf, ansin cruthaítear URL nua "
"trí slash a chur leis ag an deireadh. Má aimsítear an URL nua seo san "
"URLConf, ansin atreoraíonn Django an t-iarratas chuig an URL nua seo. "
"Seachas sin, déantar an URL tosaigh a phróiseáil mar is gnách."

msgid ""
"For example, ``foo.com/bar`` will be redirected to ``foo.com/bar/`` if you "
"don't have a valid URL pattern for ``foo.com/bar`` but *do* have a valid "
"pattern for ``foo.com/bar/``."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, atreorófar ``foo.com/bar`` chuig ``foo.com/bar/`` mura bhfuil "
"patrún URL bailí agat le haghaidh ``foo.com/bar`` ach tá patrún bailí aige "
"*do* do `foo.com/bar/``."

msgid ""
"If :setting:`PREPEND_WWW` is ``True``, URLs that lack a leading \"www.\" "
"will be redirected to the same URL with a leading \"www.\""
msgstr ""
"Más rud é: Socrú: ``PREPEND_WWW` ``True``, atreorófar URLanna nach bhfuil "
"“www.” tosaigh orthu chuig an URL céanna le “www.” tosaigh."

msgid ""
"Both of these options are meant to normalize URLs. The philosophy is that "
"each URL should exist in one, and only one, place. Technically a URL "
"``foo.com/bar`` is distinct from ``foo.com/bar/`` -- a search-engine indexer "
"would treat them as separate URLs -- so it's best practice to normalize URLs."
msgstr ""
"Tá an dá rogha seo i gceist URLanna a normalú. Is í an fhealsúnacht ná gur "
"chóir go mbeadh gach URL ann in aon áit amháin, agus amháin amháin. Go "
"teicniúil tá URL ``foo.com/bar`` difriúil ó ``foo.com/bar/`` -- déileálfadh "
"innéacsaitheoir inneall cuardaigh leo mar URLanna ar leithligh - mar sin is "
"fearr cleachtas é URLanna a normalú."

msgid ""
"If necessary, individual views may be excluded from the ``APPEND_SLASH`` "
"behavior using the :func:`~django.views.decorators.common.no_append_slash` "
"decorator::"
msgstr ""
"Más gá, féadfar tuairimí aonair a eisiamh ón iompar ``APPEND_SLASH`` ag "
"baint úsáide as an maisitheoir: :func: "
"`~django.views.decorators.common.no_append_slash`:"

msgid "Sets the ``Content-Length`` header for non-streaming responses."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé an ceannteideal ``Content-Fad ``le haghaidh freagraí neamh-"
"sruthú."

msgid ""
"Sends broken link notification emails to :setting:`MANAGERS` (see :doc:`/"
"howto/error-reporting`)."
msgstr ""
"Seolann sé ríomhphoist fógra nasc briste chuig: socrú: `MANAGERS` (féach: "
"doc: `/howto/earr-reporting`)."

msgid "GZip middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí gZip"

msgid ""
"Defaults to 100. Subclass ``GZipMiddleware`` and override the attribute to "
"change the maximum number of random bytes that is included with compressed "
"responses."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocraithe go 100. Fo-aicme ``GZipMiddleware`` agus athraigh an tréith "
"chun an líon uasta na mbetaí randamacha atá san áireamh le freagraí "
"comhbhrúite a athrú."

msgid ""
"Security researchers revealed that when compression techniques (including "
"``GZipMiddleware``) are used on a website, the site may become exposed to a "
"number of possible attacks."
msgstr ""
"Léirigh taighdeoirí slándála go bhféadfadh an suíomh a bheith nochtaithe do "
"roinnt ionsaithe féideartha nuair a úsáidtear teicnící comhbhrúite (lena n-"
"áirítear `GzipMiddleware`) ar shuíomh Gréasáin."

msgid ""
"To mitigate attacks, Django implements a technique called *Heal The Breach "
"(HTB)*. It adds up to 100 bytes (see :attr:`.max_random_bytes`) of random "
"bytes to each response to make the attacks less effective."
msgstr ""
"Chun ionsaithe a mhaolú, cuireann Django teicníc ar a dtugtar *Heal The "
"Breach (HTB) * i bhfeidhm. Cuireann sé suas le 100 beát (féach: attr: "
"`.max_random_bytes`) de bhartha randamach le gach freagra chun na hionsaithe "
"a dhéanamh chomh héifeachtach."

msgid ""
"For more details, see the `BREACH paper (PDF)`_, `breachattack.com`_, and "
"the `Heal The Breach (HTB) paper`_."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí, féach an `páipéar BREACH (PDF) `_, "
"`breachattack.com`_, agus an páipéar `Heal The Breach (HTB) `_."

msgid ""
"The ``django.middleware.gzip.GZipMiddleware`` compresses content for "
"browsers that understand GZip compression (all modern browsers)."
msgstr ""
"Comhbhrúiteann an `Django.middleware.gzip.gzipMiddleware ``ábhar do "
"bhrabhsálaithe a thuigeann comhbhrú GZip (gach brabhsálaí nua-aimseartha)."

msgid ""
"This middleware should be placed before any other middleware that need to "
"read or write the response body so that compression happens afterward."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir an láithreán gréasáin seo a chur os comhair aon mheánearraí eile a "
"chaithfidh an comhlacht freagartha a léamh nó a scríobh ionas go dtarlóidh "
"comhbhrú ina dhiaidh sin."

msgid "It will NOT compress content if any of the following are true:"
msgstr "NÍ chomhbhrúiteoidh sé ábhar má tá aon cheann díobh seo a leanas fíor:"

msgid "The content body is less than 200 bytes long."
msgstr "Tá an corp ábhair níos lú ná 200 bytes ar fad."

msgid "The response has already set the ``Content-Encoding`` header."
msgstr ""
"Tá an ceannteideal ``Content-Encoding`` socraithe ag an bhfreagra cheana "
"féin."

msgid ""
"The request (the browser) hasn't sent an ``Accept-Encoding`` header "
"containing ``gzip``."
msgstr ""
"Níor sheol an iarratas (an brabhsálaí) ceannteideal ``Accept-Encoding`` ina "
"bhfuil `gzip``."

msgid ""
"If the response has an ``ETag`` header, the ETag is made weak to comply "
"with :rfc:`9110#section-8.8.1`."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ceannteideal ``Etag`` sa fhreagra, déantar an ETag lag chun "
"comhlíonadh le:rfc: `9110 #section -8.8.1`."

msgid ""
"You can apply GZip compression to individual views using "
"the :func:`~django.views.decorators.gzip.gzip_page()` decorator."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat comhbhrú GZip a chur i bhfeidhm ar radhairc aonair ag baint "
"úsáide as an maisitheoir: func: `~django.views.decorators.gzip.gzip_page () "
"`."

msgid "Conditional GET middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí coinníollach GET"

msgid ""
"Handles conditional GET operations. If the response doesn't have an ``ETag`` "
"header, the middleware adds one if needed. If the response has an ``ETag`` "
"or ``Last-Modified`` header, and the request has ``If-None-Match`` or ``If-"
"Modified-Since``, the response is replaced by "
"an :class:`~django.http.HttpResponseNotModified`."
msgstr ""
"Láimhseálann oibríochtaí coinníollach Mura bhfuil ceannteideal ``Etag ``sa "
"fhreagra, cuireann an middleware ceann leis más gá. Má tá ceannteideal "
"``Etag`` nó ``Last-Modified`` sa fhreagra, agus má tá ``If-Non-Match`` nó "
"``If-Modhified-Since`` sa iarraidh, cuirtear an:class: "
"`~django.http.httpResponseNotModified` in ionad an fhreagra."

msgid ""
"You can handle conditional GET operations with individual views using "
"the :func:`~django.views.decorators.http.conditional_page()` decorator."
msgstr ""

msgid "Locale middleware"
msgstr "Middleware Áitiúil"

msgid ""
"Defaults to :class:`~django.http.HttpResponseRedirect`. Subclass "
"``LocaleMiddleware`` and override the attribute to customize the redirects "
"issued by the middleware."
msgstr ""
"Réamhshocraithe chuig: aicme: `~django.http.httpResponsereDirect`. Fo-aicme "
"``LocalEmiddleware`` agus athsháraigh an tréith chun na haatreoruithe arna "
"eisiúint ag an middleware a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"Enables language selection based on data from the request. It customizes "
"content for each user. See the :doc:`internationalization documentation </"
"topics/i18n/translation>`."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn sé roghnú teanga bunaithe ar shonraí ón iarratas. Saincheapann sé "
"ábhar do gach úsáideoir. Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú idirnáisiúnaithe</topics/"
"i18n/translation> '."

msgid "Message middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí teachtaireachta"

msgid ""
"Enables cookie- and session-based message support. See the :doc:`messages "
"documentation </ref/contrib/messages>`."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn sé tacaíocht teachtaireachtaí bunaithe ar fhianán agus seisiún. "
"Féach na:doc: `</ref/contrib/messages> doiciméadú teachtaireachtaí."

msgid "Security middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí slándála"

msgid ""
"If your deployment situation allows, it's usually a good idea to have your "
"front-end web server perform the functionality provided by the "
"``SecurityMiddleware``. That way, if there are requests that aren't served "
"by Django (such as static media or user-uploaded files), they will have the "
"same protections as requests to your Django application."
msgstr ""
"Má cheadaíonn do staid imscartha, is smaoineamh maith de ghnáth go mbeidh do "
"fhreastalaí gréasáin tosaigh an fheidhmiúlacht a sholáthraíonn an "
"“SecurityMiddleware” a chomhlíonadh. Ar an mbealach sin, má tá iarratais ann "
"nach bhfreastalaíonn Django (mar shampla meáin statacha nó comhaid "
"uaslódáilte ón úsáideoir), beidh na cosaintí céanna acu le hiarratais chuig "
"d'iarratas Django."

msgid ""
"The ``django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware`` provides several "
"security enhancements to the request/response cycle. Each one can be "
"independently enabled or disabled with a setting."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an ``django.middleware.security.securityMiddleware`` roinnt "
"feabhsuithe slándála don timthriall iarrata/freagartha. Is féidir gach ceann "
"a chumasú nó a dhíchumasú go neamhspleách le socrú."

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_REDIRECT_EXEMPT`"
msgstr ":setting: `SECURE_REDIRECT_EXEMPT`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`"
msgstr ":setting: `SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_SSL_HOST`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_SSL_HOST`"

msgid ":setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`"
msgstr ":shocrú: `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT`"

msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "Slándáil Iompair Dhian HTTP"

msgid ""
"For sites that should only be accessed over HTTPS, you can instruct modern "
"browsers to refuse to connect to your domain name via an insecure connection "
"(for a given period of time) by setting the `\"Strict-Transport-Security\" "
"header`__. This reduces your exposure to some SSL-stripping man-in-the-"
"middle (MITM) attacks."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le suíomhanna ar chóir rochtain a fháil orthu ach thar HTTPS, is "
"féidir leat treoir a thabhairt do bhrabhsálaithe nua-aimseartha diúltú "
"ceangal le d'ainm fearainn trí nasc neamhchinnte (ar feadh tréimhse áirithe "
"ama) tríd an gceannteideal `\"Strict-Transport-Security” a shocrú. "
"Laghdaíonn sé seo do nochtadh do roinnt ionsaithe fear in-the-lár (MITM) a "
"tharraingt SSL."

msgid ""
"``SecurityMiddleware`` will set this header for you on all HTTPS responses "
"if you set the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS` setting to a non-zero integer "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Socróidh ``SecurityMiddleware`` an ceannteideal seo duit ar gach freagra "
"HTTPS má shocraíonn tú an socrú: `SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS` go luach sláimhir "
"neamh-nialasach."

msgid ""
"When enabling HSTS, it's a good idea to first use a small value for testing, "
"for example, :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 3600<SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS>` for "
"one hour. Each time a web browser sees the HSTS header from your site, it "
"will refuse to communicate non-securely (using HTTP) with your domain for "
"the given period of time. Once you confirm that all assets are served "
"securely on your site (i.e. HSTS didn't break anything), it's a good idea to "
"increase this value so that infrequent visitors will be protected (31536000 "
"seconds, i.e. 1 year, is common)."
msgstr ""
"<SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS>Agus HSTS á chumasú agat, is smaoineamh maith é luach "
"beag a úsáid ar dtús le haghaidh tástála, mar shampla, :setting: "
"`SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 3600 `ar feadh uair an chloig. Gach uair a fheiceann "
"brabhsálaí gréasáin ceanntásc HSTS ó do shuíomh, diúltóidh sé cumarsáid a "
"dhéanamh neamh-shábháilte (ag baint úsáide as HTTP) le do fearainn ar feadh "
"na tréimhse ama ar leith. Nuair a dheimhníonn tú go ndéantar na sócmhainní "
"go léir a sheirbheáil go daingean ar do shuíomh (ie nár bhris HSTS aon rud), "
"is smaoineamh maith é an luach seo a mhéadú ionas go gcosnófar cuairteoirí "
"annamh (tá 31536000 soicind, ie 1 bhliain, coitianta)."

msgid ""
"Additionally, if you set the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS` "
"setting to ``True``, ``SecurityMiddleware`` will add the "
"``includeSubDomains`` directive to the ``Strict-Transport-Security`` header. "
"This is recommended (assuming all subdomains are served exclusively using "
"HTTPS), otherwise your site may still be vulnerable via an insecure "
"connection to a subdomain."
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, má shocraíonn tú an socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS` go `True``, cuirfidh ``SecurityMiddleware`` "
"an treoir `includeSubdomains`` leis an gceannteideal ``Strict-Transport-"
"Security ``. Moltar é seo (ag glacadh leis go ndéantar gach fofhearann a "
"sheirbheáil go heisiach ag úsáid HTTPS), ar shlí eile d'fhéadfadh do shuíomh "
"a bheith leochaileach fós trí nasc neamhchinnte le fo-fhearann."

msgid ""
"If you wish to submit your site to the `browser preload list`_, set "
"the :setting:`SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` setting to ``True``. That appends the "
"``preload`` directive to the ``Strict-Transport-Security`` header."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat do shuíomh a chur isteach chuig an `liosta réamh-luchtaithe "
"brabhsálaí`_, socraigh an socrú:setting: `SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD` go ``True``. "
"Cuireann sé sin an treoir ``réamh-ualacha`` leis an gceannteideal ``Strict-"
"Transport-Security ``."

msgid ""
"The HSTS policy applies to your entire domain, not just the URL of the "
"response that you set the header on. Therefore, you should only use it if "
"your entire domain is served via HTTPS only."
msgstr ""
"Baineann beartas HSTS le do fhearann iomlán, ní amháin URL an fhreagra ar "
"shocraigh tú an ceannteideal air. Dá bhrí sin, níor cheart duit é a úsáid "
"ach amháin má sheirbheáltar do fearainn iomlán trí HTTPS amháin."

msgid ""
"Browsers properly respecting the HSTS header will refuse to allow users to "
"bypass warnings and connect to a site with an expired, self-signed, or "
"otherwise invalid SSL certificate. If you use HSTS, make sure your "
"certificates are in good shape and stay that way!"
msgstr ""
"Diúltóidh brabhsálaithe a bhfuil meas acu i gceart ceanntásc HSTS ligean "
"d'úsáideoirí rabhaidh a sheachbhóthar agus ceangal le suíomh a bhfuil "
"deimhniú SSL in éag, féinshínithe nó neamhbhailí Má úsáideann tú HSTS, déan "
"cinnte go bhfuil do theastais i gcruth maith agus fan ar an mbealach sin!"

msgid ""
"If you are deployed behind a load-balancer or reverse-proxy server, and the "
"``Strict-Transport-Security`` header is not being added to your responses, "
"it may be because Django doesn't realize that it's on a secure connection; "
"you may need to set the :setting:`SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` setting."
msgstr ""
"Má tá tú imscartha taobh thiar de chothromóir ualaigh nó freastalaí "
"seachfhreastalaí droim, agus mura bhfuil an ceannteideal `Strict-Transport-"
"Security ``á chur le do chuid freagraí, b'fhéidir nach dtuigeann Django go "
"bhfuil sé ar nasc slán; b'fhéidir go mbeidh ort an socrú: "
"`SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` a shocrú."

msgid "Referrer Policy"
msgstr "Polasaí Atreoraithe"

msgid ""
"Browsers use `the Referer header`__ as a way to send information to a site "
"about how users got there. When a user clicks a link, the browser will send "
"the full URL of the linking page as the referrer. While this can be useful "
"for some purposes -- like figuring out who's linking to your site -- it also "
"can cause privacy concerns by informing one site that a user was visiting "
"another site."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann brabhsálaí `an ceannteideal Referer `__ mar bhealach chun faisnéis "
"a sheoladh chuig suíomh faoin gcaoi a ndeachaigh úsáideoirí ann. Nuair a "
"chliceálann úsáideoir ar nasc, seolfaidh an brabhsálaí URL iomlán an "
"leathanaigh nasctha mar an atreoróir. Cé go bhféadfadh sé seo a bheith "
"úsáideach chun críocha áirithe - cosúil le fáil amach cé atá ag nascadh le "
"do shuíomh - is féidir leis imní príobháideachta a bheith ina chúis freisin "
"trí shuíomh amháin a chur ar an eolas go raibh úsáideoir ag tabhairt cuairte "
"ar shuíomh eile."

msgid ""
"Some browsers have the ability to accept hints about whether they should "
"send the HTTP ``Referer`` header when a user clicks a link; this hint is "
"provided via `the Referrer-Policy header`__. This header can suggest any of "
"three behaviors to browsers:"
msgstr ""
"Tá sé de chumas ag roinnt brabhsálaithe glacadh le leideanna faoin "
"gceannteideal HTTP ``Referer`` a sheoladh nuair a chliceálann úsáideoir ar "
"nasc; cuirtear an leid seo ar fáil tríd `an ceannteideal Attreor-Polasaí "
"`__. Is féidir leis an gceanntásc seo aon cheann de thrí iompraíocht a "
"mholadh do bh"

msgid ""
"Full URL: send the entire URL in the ``Referer`` header. For example, if the "
"user is visiting ``https://example.com/page.html``, the ``Referer`` header "
"would contain ``\"https://example.com/page.html\"``."
msgstr ""
"URL iomlán: seol an URL iomlán sa cheannteideal ``Referer``. Mar shampla, má "
"tá an t-úsáideoir ag tabhairt cuairte ar ``https://example.com/page.html``, "
"bheadh ``” https://example.com/page.html “`` sa cheannteideal ``Referer``."

msgid ""
"Origin only: send only the \"origin\" in the referrer. The origin consists "
"of the scheme, host and (optionally) port number. For example, if the user "
"is visiting ``https://example.com/page.html``, the origin would be ``https://"
"example.com/``."
msgstr ""
"Bunús amháin: seol ach an “bunús” sa atreoróir. Is éard atá sa tionscnamh ná "
"an scéim, an t-óstach agus (roghnach) uimhir an chalafoirt. Mar shampla, má "
"tá an t-úsáideoir ag tabhairt cuairte ar ``https://example.com/page.html``, "
"bheadh an bunús ná ``https://example.com/``."

msgid "No referrer: do not send a ``Referer`` header at all."
msgstr "Gan aon atreoróir: ná seol ceannteideal ``Referer`` ar chor ar bith."

msgid ""
"There are two types of conditions this header can tell a browser to watch "
"out for:"
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá chineál coinníollacha ann is féidir leis an gceanntásc seo a rá do "
"bhrabhsálaí chun aire a thabhairt orthu:"

msgid ""
"Same-origin versus cross-origin: a link from ``https://example.com/1.html`` "
"to ``https://example.com/2.html`` is same-origin. A link from ``https://"
"example.com/page.html`` to ``https://not.example.com/page.html`` is cross-"
"origin."
msgstr ""
"An tionscnamh céanna i gcoinne trasbhunús: tá nasc ó ``https://example.com/"
"1.html`` go ``https://example.com/2.html`` an tionscnamh céanna. Tá nasc ó "
"``https://example.com/page.html`` go ``https://not.example.com/page.html`` "
"trasbhunús."

msgid ""
"Protocol downgrade: a downgrade occurs if the page containing the link is "
"served via HTTPS, but the page being linked to is not served via HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Íosghrádú prótacal: tarlaíonn íosghrádú má sheirbheáltar an leathanach ina "
"bhfuil an nasc trí HTTPS, ach ní sheirbheálfar an leathanach atá nasctha "
"leis trí HTTPS."

msgid ""
"When your site is served via HTTPS, :ref:`Django's CSRF protection system "
"<how-csrf-works>` requires the ``Referer`` header to be present, so "
"completely disabling the ``Referer`` header will interfere with CSRF "
"protection. To gain most of the benefits of disabling ``Referer`` headers "
"while also keeping CSRF protection, consider enabling only same-origin "
"referrers."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a sheirbheáltar ar do shuíomh trí HTTPS, :ref: Éil <how-csrf-"
"works>íonn córas cosanta CSRF `Django `go mbeidh ceannteideal ``Referer` i "
"láthair, mar sin cuirfear isteach ar an gceannteideal ``Referer` a "
"dhíchumasú go hiomlán ar chosaint CSRF. Chun an chuid is mó de na buntáistí "
"a bhaineann le ceanntásca ``Referer` a dhíchumasú agus cosaint CSRF a "
"choinneáil freisin, smaoinigh ar atreoróirí den bhunús céanna a chumasú."

msgid ""
"``SecurityMiddleware`` can set the ``Referrer-Policy`` header for you, based "
"on the :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` setting (note spelling: browsers "
"send a ``Referer`` header when a user clicks a link, but the header "
"instructing a browser whether to do so is spelled ``Referrer-Policy``). The "
"valid values for this setting are:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le `SecurityMiddleware`` ceannteideal ``Referrer-Policy`` a shocrú "
"duit, bunaithe ar an socrú:setting: `SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY `(nóta litriú: "
"seolann brabhsálaí ceannteideal ``Referer`` nuair a chliceálann úsáideoir ar "
"nasc, ach litrítear ``Referrer-Policy` sa cheannteideal a thugann brabhsálaí "
"an cheart é sin a dhéanamh). Is iad na luachanna bailí don socrú seo ná:"

msgid "``no-referrer``"
msgstr "```no-atreoraitheoir``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send no referrer for links clicked on this site."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí gan aon atreoróir a sheoladh le haghaidh naisc "
"a chliceáltar ar an suíomh seo."

msgid "``no-referrer-when-downgrade``"
msgstr "``níl aon atreorú-nuair a dhéantar íosghrádú ``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send a full URL as the referrer, but only when no "
"protocol downgrade occurs."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí URL iomlán a sheoladh mar an atreoróir, ach "
"ach amháin nuair nach dtarlaíonn aon íosghrádú prótacal."

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send only the origin, not the full URL, as the "
"referrer."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí an bunús amháin a sheoladh, ní an URL iomlán, "
"mar an atreoróir."

msgid "``origin-when-cross-origin``"
msgstr "``bunaidh-nuain-tras-bhunaithe``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send the full URL as the referrer for same-origin "
"links, and only the origin for cross-origin links."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí an URL iomlán a sheoladh mar an atreoróir do "
"naisc den bhunús céanna, agus gan ach an bunús do naisc trasbhunús."

msgid "``same-origin``"
msgstr "```an tionscnamh céann``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send a full URL, but only for same-origin links. No "
"referrer will be sent for cross-origin links."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí URL iomlán a sheoladh, ach amháin le haghaidh "
"naisc den bhunús céanna. Ní sheolfar aon atreoróir le haghaidh naisc "
"trasbhunús."

msgid "``strict-origin``"
msgstr "``tionscnamh docht ``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send only the origin, not the full URL, and to send "
"no referrer when a protocol downgrade occurs."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí an bunús amháin a sheoladh, ní an URL iomlán, "
"agus gan aon atreoróir a sheoladh nuair a tharlaíonn íosghrádú prótacal."

msgid "``strict-origin-when-cross-origin``"
msgstr "``tionscnamh docht - nuair a bhíonn sé tras-bhunaithe``"

msgid ""
"Instructs the browser to send the full URL when the link is same-origin and "
"no protocol downgrade occurs; send only the origin when the link is cross-"
"origin and no protocol downgrade occurs; and no referrer when a protocol "
"downgrade occurs."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí an URL iomlán a sheoladh nuair a bhíonn an "
"nasc den bhunús céanna agus ní tharlaíonn aon íosghrádú prótacal; seol ach "
"an bunús nuair a bhíonn an nasc trasbhunús agus ní tharlaíonn aon íosghrádú "
"prótacal; agus níl aon atreoróir nuair a tharlaíonn íosghrádú prótacal."

msgid "``unsafe-url``"
msgstr "``URL neamhshábháilte``"

msgid "Instructs the browser to always send the full URL as the referrer."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn sé don bhrabhsálaí an URL iomlán a sheoladh mar an atreoróir i "
"gcónaí."

msgid "Unknown Policy Values"
msgstr "Luachanna beartais anaithnid"

msgid ""
"Where a policy value is `unknown`__ by a user agent, it is possible to "
"specify multiple policy values to provide a fallback. The last specified "
"value that is understood takes precedence. To support this, an iterable or "
"comma-separated string can be used with :setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`."
msgstr ""
"I gcás ina bhfuil luach beartais `gan eolas `__ ag gníomhaire úsáideora, is "
"féidir luachanna polasaí iolracha a shonrú chun titim a sholáthar. Tá "
"tosaíocht ag an luach sonraithe deireanach a thuigtear. Chun tacú leis seo, "
"is féidir teaghrán athraitheach nó scartha le camóg a úsáid le:setting: "
"`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY`."

msgid "Cross-Origin Opener Policy"
msgstr "Polasaí Oscailte Tras-Bhunús"

msgid ""
"Some browsers have the ability to isolate top-level windows from other "
"documents by putting them in a separate browsing context group based on the "
"value of the `Cross-Origin Opener Policy`__ (COOP) header. If a document "
"that is isolated in this way opens a cross-origin popup window, the popup’s "
"``window.opener`` property will be ``null``. Isolating windows using COOP is "
"a defense-in-depth protection against cross-origin attacks, especially those "
"like Spectre which allowed exfiltration of data loaded into a shared "
"browsing context."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé de chumas ag roinnt brabhsálaithe fuinneoga barrleibhéil a leithlisiú "
"ó dhoiciméid eile trí iad a chur i ngrúpa comhthéacs brabhsála ar leithligh "
"bunaithe ar luach an cheanntásc `Polasaí Oscailte Tras-Origin `__ (COOP). Má "
"osclaíonn doiciméad atá ar leithligh ar an mbealach seo fuinneog aníos tras-"
"bhunús, beidh “null`` maoin `windoww.opener`` an popup. Is cosaint domhain "
"cosanta é fuinneoga a leithlisiú ag úsáid COOP i gcoinne ionsaithe "
"trasbhunús, go háirithe iad siúd cosúil le Spectre a cheadaigh easscagadh "
"sonraí a luchtaithe i gcomhthéacs brabhsála"

msgid ""
"``SecurityMiddleware`` can set the ``Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy`` header for "
"you, based on the :setting:`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY` setting. The "
"valid values for this setting are:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le ``SecurityMiddleware`` an ceannteideal ```Cross-Origin-Opener-"
"Policy`` a shocrú duit, bunaithe ar an socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_CROSS_ORIGIN_OPENER_POLICY`. Is iad na luachanna bailí don socrú seo "
"ná:"

msgid ""
"Isolates the browsing context exclusively to same-origin documents. Cross-"
"origin documents are not loaded in the same browsing context. This is the "
"default and most secure option."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé an comhthéacs brabhsála a leithliú go heisiach go doiciméid Ní "
"luchtaítear cáipéisí trasbhunús sa chomhthéacs brabhsála céanna. Is é seo an "
"rogha réamhshocraithe agus is sábháilte."

msgid "``same-origin-allow-popups``"
msgstr "```an bunaidh céann-ligead-popups``"

msgid ""
"Isolates the browsing context to same-origin documents or those which either "
"don't set COOP or which opt out of isolation by setting a COOP of ``unsafe-"
"none``."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé an comhthéacs brabhsála a leithlisiú chuig doiciméid den bhunús "
"céanna nó iad siúd nach leagann COOP nó a roghnaíonn as aonrú trí COOP de "
"“unsábháilte” a shocrú."

msgid "``unsafe-none``"
msgstr "```neamhshábháilt-neamh``"

msgid ""
"Allows the document to be added to its opener's browsing context group "
"unless the opener itself has a COOP of ``same-origin`` or ``same-origin-"
"allow-popups``."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé an doiciméad a chur le grúpa comhthéacs brabhsála a oscailteora "
"mura bhfuil COOP de ``same-origin`` nó ``same-origin-allow-popups`` ag an "
"oscailteoir féin."

msgid "``X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff``"
msgstr "``Roghanna Cineál-Ábhar X-: nosniff``"

msgid ""
"Some browsers will try to guess the content types of the assets that they "
"fetch, overriding the ``Content-Type`` header. While this can help display "
"sites with improperly configured servers, it can also pose a security risk."
msgstr ""
"Déanfaidh roinnt brabhsálaithe iarracht tuairim a dhéanamh ar chineálacha "
"ábhair na sócmhainní a fhaigheann siad, ag dul i bhfeidhm ar an "
"gceannteideal ``Content-Type``. Cé gur féidir leis seo cabhrú le suíomhanna "
"a thaispeáint le freastalaithe atá cumraithe míchuí, féadann sé riosca "
"slándála"

msgid ""
"If your site serves user-uploaded files, a malicious user could upload a "
"specially-crafted file that would be interpreted as HTML or JavaScript by "
"the browser when you expected it to be something harmless."
msgstr ""
"Má fhreastalaíonn do shuíomh comhaid uaslódáilte ón úsáideoir, d'fhéadfadh "
"úsáideoir mailíseach comhad atá déanta go speisialta a uaslódáil a "
"léirmhíníodh mar HTML nó JavaScript ag an mbrabhsálaí nuair a bhíothas ag "
"súil go mbeadh"

msgid ""
"To prevent the browser from guessing the content type and force it to always "
"use the type provided in the ``Content-Type`` header, you can pass the `X-"
"Content-Type-Options: nosniff`__ header.  ``SecurityMiddleware`` will do "
"this for all responses if the :setting:`SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF` setting "
"is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Chun an brabhsálaí a chosc ó thuairim a dhéanamh ar an gcineál ábhair agus "
"iallach air an cineál a chuirtear ar fáil sa cheanntásc ``Content-Type`` a "
"úsáid i gcónaí, is féidir leat an ceannteideal `X-Content-Type-Options: "
"nosniff `__ a rith. Déanfaidh ``SecurityMiddleware`` é seo do gach freagra "
"má tá an socrú: `SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF` ``True``."

msgid ""
"Note that in most deployment situations where Django isn't involved in "
"serving user-uploaded files, this setting won't help you. For example, if "
"your :setting:`MEDIA_URL` is served directly by your front-end web server "
"(nginx, Apache, etc.) then you'd want to set this header there. On the other "
"hand, if you are using Django to do something like require authorization in "
"order to download files and you cannot set the header using your web server, "
"this setting will be useful."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara, i bhformhór na gcásanna imscartha nach bhfuil baint ag "
"Django le freastal ar chomhaid uaslódáilte ón úsáideoir, ní chabhróidh an "
"suíomh Mar shampla, má sheirbheálann do fhreastalaí gréasáin tosaigh (nginx, "
"Apache, srl.) go díreach do: setting: `MEDIA_URL` ansin ba mhaith leat an "
"ceannteideal seo a shocrú ann. Ar an láimh eile, má tá Django á úsáid agat "
"chun rud éigin a dhéanamh mar údarú ag teastáil chun comhaid a íoslódáil "
"agus ní féidir leat an ceanntásc a shocrú ag baint úsáide as do fhreastalaí "
"gréasáin, beidh an socrú seo úsáideach."

msgid "SSL Redirect"
msgstr "Atreorú SSL"

msgid ""
"If your site offers both HTTP and HTTPS connections, most users will end up "
"with an unsecured connection by default. For best security, you should "
"redirect all HTTP connections to HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Má thairgeann do shuíomh naisc HTTP agus HTTPS araon, beidh nasc "
"neamhshlánaithe ag mórchuid na n-úsáideoirí de réir réamhshocraithe. Ar "
"mhaithe le slándáil is fearr, ba cheart duit gach nasc HTTP a atreorú chuig "
"HTTPS."

msgid ""
"If you set the :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` setting to True, "
"``SecurityMiddleware`` will permanently (HTTP 301) redirect all HTTP "
"connections to HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú an socrú:setting: `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` go True, atreoróidh "
"``SecurityMiddleware`` go buan (HTTP 301) gach nasc HTTP chuig HTTPS."

msgid ""
"For performance reasons, it's preferable to do these redirects outside of "
"Django, in a front-end load balancer or reverse-proxy server such as "
"`nginx`_. :setting:`SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` is intended for the deployment "
"situations where this isn't an option."
msgstr ""
"Ar chúiseanna feidhmíochta, is fearr na haatreoruithe seo a dhéanamh "
"lasmuigh de Django, i gcothromaitheoir ualaigh tosaigh nó i bhfreastalaí "
"seachfhreastalaí droim mar `nginx`_. :setting: Tá `SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT` "
"beartaithe do na cásanna imscartha nach rogha é seo."

msgid ""
"If the :setting:`SECURE_SSL_HOST` setting has a value, all redirects will be "
"sent to that host instead of the originally-requested host."
msgstr ""
"Má tá luach ag an socrú:setting: `SECURE_SSL_HOST`, seolfar gach athsheoladh "
"chuig an óstach sin in ionad an óstach a iarrtar go bunaidh."

msgid ""
"If there are a few pages on your site that should be available over HTTP, "
"and not redirected to HTTPS, you can list regular expressions to match those "
"URLs in the :setting:`SECURE_REDIRECT_EXEMPT` setting."
msgstr ""
"Má tá cúpla leathanach ar do shuíomh ar chóir go mbeadh ar fáil thar HTTP, "
"agus gan iad a atreorú chuig HTTPS, is féidir leat nathanna rialta a "
"liostáil chun na URLanna sin a mheaitseáil sa socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_REDIRECT_EXEMPT`."

msgid ""
"If you are deployed behind a load-balancer or reverse-proxy server and "
"Django can't seem to tell when a request actually is already secure, you may "
"need to set the :setting:`SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` setting."
msgstr ""
"Má tá tú imscartha taobh thiar de chothromaitheoir ualaigh nó freastalaí "
"seachfhreastalaí droim agus má chosúil nach féidir le Django a rá cathain a "
"bhíonn iarratas slán cheana féin, b'fhéidir go mbeidh ort an socrú:setting: "
"`SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` a shocrú."

msgid "Session middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí seisiúin"

msgid ""
"Enables session support. See the :doc:`session documentation </topics/http/"
"sessions>`."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn tacaíocht seisiún. Féach na:doc: `doiciméadú seisiúin` </topics/"
"http/sessions>."

msgid ""
"Adds the ``site`` attribute representing the current site to every incoming "
"``HttpRequest`` object. See the :ref:`sites documentation <site-middleware>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an tréith ``láithre`` a léiríonn an suíomh reatha le gach réad "
"``HttpRequest ``atá ag teacht isteach. <site-middleware>Féach an "
"doiciméadúcháin: `suíomhanna `."

msgid "Authentication middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí fíordheimhnithe"

msgid ""
"Adds the ``user`` attribute, representing the currently-logged-in user, to "
"every incoming ``HttpRequest`` object. See :ref:`Authentication in web "
"requests <auth-web-requests>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an tréith ``úsáideoir ``, a léiríonn an t-úsáideoir logáilte "
"isteach faoi láthair, le gach réad ``HttpRequest`` atá ag teacht isteach. "
"<auth-web-requests>Féach:ref: `Fíordheimhniú in iarratais gréasáin `."

msgid ""
"Subclass the middleware and override the following attributes and methods to "
"customize behavior for unauthenticated requests."
msgstr ""
"Fo-aicmiú na meán-earraí agus athraigh na tréithe agus na modhanna seo a "
"leanas chun iompar a shaincheapadh d'iarratais neamhfhíordheimhnithe."

msgid "Defaults to ``\"next\"``."
msgstr "Réamhshocraithe go ``\"eile” ``."

msgid ""
"Returns the URL that unauthenticated requests will be redirected to. This "
"result is either the ``login_url`` set on "
"the :func:`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` decorator (if not "
"``None``), or :setting:`settings.LOGIN_URL <LOGIN_URL>`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an URL ar ais a atreorófar iarratais neamhfhíordheimhnithe chuig. "
"<LOGIN_URL>Is é an toradh seo an ``login_url ``atá leagtha síos ar:func: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` maisitheoir (mura bhfuil "
"``None``), nó: setting: `Settings.login_url `."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the query parameter that contains the URL the user "
"should be redirected to after a successful login. This result is either the "
"``redirect_field_name`` set on "
"the :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` decorator (if "
"not ``None``), or :attr:`redirect_field_name`. If ``None`` is returned, a "
"query parameter won't be added."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ainm an pharaiméadair fiosrúcháin ina bhfuil an URL ba chóir an t-"
"úsáideoir a atreorú chuig tar éis logáil isteach rathúil. Is é an toradh seo "
"an ``redirect_field_name`` atá leagtha síos ar:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` maisitheoir (mura bhfuil "
"``None``), nó:attr: `redirect_field_name`. Má chuirtear ``None ``ar ais, ní "
"chuirfear paraiméadar fiosrúcháin leis."

msgid ""
"Redirects all unauthenticated requests to a login page, except for views "
"excluded with :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required`. "
"The login page defaults to :setting:`settings.LOGIN_URL <LOGIN_URL>`, but "
"can be customized."
msgstr ""
"Atreoraíonn gach iarratas neamhfhíordheimhnithe chuig leathanach logála "
"isteach, ach amháin tuairimí a eisiamh la:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required`. <LOGIN_URL>Tá an "
"leathanach logála isteach réamhshocraithe to:setting: `Settings.login_url `, "
"ach is féidir é a shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"Enable this middleware by adding it to the :setting:`MIDDLEWARE` setting "
"**after** :class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware`::"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an middleware seo tríd é a chur leis an socrú:setting: "
"`MIDDLEWARE` **iar-**:class: "
"`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware`::"

msgid ""
"Make a view public, allowing unauthenticated requests, "
"with :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required`. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"Déan radharc poiblí, ag ceadú iarratais neamhfhíordheimhnithe, le:func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_not_required`. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Customize the login URL or field name for authenticated views with "
"the :func:`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` decorator to set "
"``login_url`` or ``redirect_field_name`` respectively. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Saincheap an URL logála isteach nó ainm réimse le haghaidh tuairimí "
"fíordheimhnithe leis an maisitheoir: func: "
"`~.django.contrib.auth.decorators.login_required` chun ``login_url ``nó "
"``redirect_field_name`` a shocrú faoi seach. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Ensure that your login view does not require a login."
msgstr "Déan cinnte nach dteastaíonn logáil isteach ó d'amharc logála isteach."

msgid ""
"To prevent infinite redirects, ensure you have :ref:`enabled unauthenticated "
"requests <disable-login-required-middleware-for-views>` to your login view."
msgstr ""
"<disable-login-required-middleware-for-views>Chun atreoruithe gan teorainn a "
"chosc, déan cinnte go bhfuil: ref: `iarratais neamhfhíordheimhnithe "
"cumasaithe agat `chuig d'amharc logála isteach."

msgid ""
"Middleware for utilizing web server provided authentication. See :doc:`/"
"howto/auth-remote-user` for usage details."
msgstr ""
"Middleware chun freastalaí gréasáin a úsáid fíordheimhniú curtha ar fáil. "
"Féach: doc: `/howto/auth-remote-user` le haghaidh sonraí úsáide."

msgid ""
"Middleware for utilizing web server provided authentication when enabled "
"only on the login page. See :ref:`persistent-remote-user-middleware-howto` "
"for usage details."
msgstr ""
"Chuir Middleware chun freastalaí gréasáin a úsáid fíordheimhniú nuair a "
"chumasaíodh ach ar an leathanach logála isteach. Féach: ref: `persistent-"
"remote-user-middleware-howto` le haghaidh sonraí úsáide."

msgid "CSRF protection middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí cosanta CSRF"

msgid ""
"Adds protection against Cross Site Request Forgeries by adding hidden form "
"fields to POST forms and checking requests for the correct value. See "
"the :doc:`Cross Site Request Forgery protection documentation </ref/csrf>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé cosaint i gcoinne Brionnaithe Iarratais Trasláithreáin trí "
"réimsí foirme i bhfolach a chur le foirmeacha POST agus iarratais ar an "
"luach ceart Féach na:doc: `Doiciméadú cosanta bréagán a iarraidh ar "
"thrasláithreach' </ref/csrf>."

msgid ""
"You can add Cross Site Request Forgery protection to individual views using "
"the :func:`~django.views.decorators.csrf.csrf_protect()` decorator."
msgstr ""

msgid "``X-Frame-Options`` middleware"
msgstr "Meán-earraí ``Roghanna Fráma X-``"

msgid ""
"Simple :doc:`clickjacking protection via the X-Frame-Options header </ref/"
"clickjacking/>`."
msgstr ""
"Simple:doc: `cosaint clickjac</ref/clickjacking/> king tríd an gceannteideal "
"X-Frame-Options'."

msgid "Middleware ordering"
msgstr "Ordú Middleware"

msgid ""
"Here are some hints about the ordering of various Django middleware classes:"
msgstr "Seo roinnt leideanna faoi ordú ranganna éagsúla middleware Django:"

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.security.securityMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"It should go near the top of the list if you're going to turn on the SSL "
"redirect as that avoids running through a bunch of other unnecessary "
"middleware."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go dtéann sé gar do bharr an liosta má tá tú chun an t-atreorú SSL "
"a chasadh air mar seachnaíonn sé sin rith trí dornán de mheán-earraí "
"neamhriachtanacha eile."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.cache.UpdateCacheMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.cache.UpdateCacheMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"Before those that modify the ``Vary`` header (``SessionMiddleware``, "
"``GZipMiddleware``, ``LocaleMiddleware``)."
msgstr ""
"Roimh iad siúd a mhodhnóidh an ceannteideal ``Vary`` (`SessionMiddleware``, "
"`GzipMiddleware``, `LocalEmiddleware``)."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.gzip.GZipMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.gzip.gzipmiddleware`"

msgid "Before any middleware that may change or use the response body."
msgstr ""
"Roimh aon mheán-earraí a d'fhéadfadh an comhlacht freagartha a athrú nó a "
"úsáid."

msgid "After ``UpdateCacheMiddleware``: Modifies ``Vary`` header."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis ``UpdateCacheMiddleware``: Athraíonn sé ceannteideal ```Vary``."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.sessions.middleware.SessionMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.contrib.sessions.middleware.sessionMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"Before any middleware that may raise an exception to trigger an error view "
"(such as :exc:`~django.core.exceptions.PermissionDenied`) if you're "
"using :setting:`CSRF_USE_SESSIONS`."
msgstr ""
"Roimh aon mheán-earraí a d'fhéadfadh eisceacht a ardú chun dearcadh earráide "
"a spreagadh (mar shampla:exc: `~Django.Core.Exceptions.PermissionDenied`) má "
"tá tú ag baint úsáidea:setting: `CSRF_USE_SESSIONS`."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.http.ConditionalGetMiddleWare`"

msgid ""
"Before any middleware that may change the response (it sets the ``ETag`` "
"header)."
msgstr ""
"Roimh aon mheán-earraí a d'fhéadfadh an freagra a athrú (socraíonn sé an "
"ceannteideal ``Etag ``)."

msgid ""
"After ``GZipMiddleware`` so it won't calculate an ``ETag`` header on gzipped "
"contents."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis ``GzipMiddleware`` mar sin ní ríomh sé ceannteideal ``Etag`` ar "
"ábhar gzipped."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.locale.LocaleMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.locale.localeMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"One of the topmost, after ``SessionMiddleware`` (uses session data) and "
"``UpdateCacheMiddleware`` (modifies ``Vary`` header)."
msgstr ""
"Ceann de na cinn is barr, tar éis ``SessionMiddleware`` (úsáideann sonraí "
"seisiúin) agus ``UpdateCacheMiddleware`` (athraíonn sé ceannteideal "
"``Vary``)."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.common.commonMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"Before any middleware that may change the response (it sets the ``Content-"
"Length`` header). A middleware that appears before ``CommonMiddleware`` and "
"changes the response must reset ``Content-Length``."
msgstr ""
"Roimh aon mheán-earraí a d'fhéadfadh an freagra a athrú (socraíonn sé an "
"ceannteideal ``Content-Length``). Ní mór do mheán-earraí atá le feiceáil "
"roimh ``CommonMiddleware`` agus a athraíonn an freagra ``Content-Length`` a "
"athshocrú."

msgid ""
"Close to the top: it redirects when :setting:`APPEND_SLASH` "
"or :setting:`PREPEND_WWW` are set to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"In aice leis an mbarr: atreoraíonn sé nuair:setting: `APPEND_SLASH` "
"nó:setting: `PREPEND_WWW` socraítear go ``True``."

msgid ""
"After ``SessionMiddleware`` if you're using :setting:`CSRF_USE_SESSIONS`."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis ``SessionMiddleware`` má tá tú ag baint úsáidea:setting: "
"`CSRF_USE_SESSIONS`."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.csrf.csrfViewMiddleWare`"

msgid ""
"Before any view middleware that assumes that CSRF attacks have been dealt "
"with."
msgstr ""
"Roimh aon fheiceáil middleware a ghlacann leis gur déileáladh le hionsaithe "
"CSRF."

msgid ""
"Before :class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.RemoteUserMiddleware`, or any "
"other authentication middleware that may perform a login, and hence rotate "
"the CSRF token, before calling down the middleware chain."
msgstr ""
"Roimhe Sean:Class: `~django.contrib.auth.middleware.remoteUserMiddleware`, "
"nó aon mheán-earraí fíordheimhnithe eile a d'fhéadfadh logáil isteach a "
"dhéanamh, agus dá bhrí sin an comhartha CSRF a rothlú, sula nglaonn sé síos "
"an slabhra middleware."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.contrib.auth.middleware.AuthenticationMiddleWare`"

msgid "After ``SessionMiddleware``: uses session storage."
msgstr "Tar éis ``SessionMiddleware``: úsáideann sé stóráil seisiúin."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.auth.middleware.LoginRequiredMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.contrib.auth.middleware.loginrequiredMiddleWare`"

msgid "After ``AuthenticationMiddleware``: uses user object."
msgstr "Tar éis ``AuthenticationMiddleware``: úsáideann réad úsáideora."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.messages.middleware.MessageMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.contrib.messages.middleware.messageMiddleware`"

msgid "After ``SessionMiddleware``: can use session-based storage."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis ``SessionMiddleware``: is féidir le stóráil seisiúin-bhunaithe a "
"úsáid."

msgid ":class:`~django.middleware.cache.FetchFromCacheMiddleware`"
msgstr ":class: `~django.middleware.cache.fetchfromCacheMiddleware`"

msgid ""
"After any middleware that modifies the ``Vary`` header: that header is used "
"to pick a value for the cache hash-key."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis aon mheán-earraí a mhodhnóidh an ceannteideal ``Vary``: úsáidtear an "
"ceannteideal sin chun luach a roghnú don eochair hash-taisce."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.FlatpageFallbackMiddleware`"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.flatpages.middleware.flatpageFallbackmiddleware`"

msgid "Should be near the bottom as it's a last-resort type of middleware."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir go mbeadh sé gar don bhun mar is cineál lár-earraí deireanach é."

msgid ":class:`~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.RedirectFallbackMiddleware`"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.contrib.redirects.middleware.redirectFallbackmiddleware`"

msgid "Migration Operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí Imirce"

msgid ""
"Migration files are composed of one or more ``Operation``\\s, objects that "
"declaratively record what the migration should do to your database."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhaid imirce comhdhéanta de ``Oibríocht ``amháin nó níos mó, rudaí a "
"thaifeadann go dearbhaithe cad ba chóir don imirce a dhéanamh le do "
"bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"Django also uses these ``Operation`` objects to work out what your models "
"looked like historically, and to calculate what changes you've made to your "
"models since the last migration so it can automatically write your "
"migrations; that's why they're declarative, as it means Django can easily "
"load them all into memory and run through them without touching the database "
"to work out what your project should look like."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann Django na rudaí ``Oibríochta ``seo freisin chun a fháil amach cén "
"chuma atá ar do mhúnlaí go stairiúil, agus chun na hathruithe a rinne tú ar "
"do mhúnlaí ón imirce deireanach a ríomh ionas gur féidir leis d'imirce a "
"scríobh go huathoibríoch; sin an fáth go bhfuil siad dearbhaithe, mar "
"ciallaíonn sé gur féidir le Django iad go léir a luchtú agus rith tríd gan "
"teagmháil leis an mbunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"There are also more specialized ``Operation`` objects which are for things "
"like :ref:`data migrations <data-migrations>` and for advanced manual "
"database manipulation. You can also write your own ``Operation`` classes if "
"you want to encapsulate a custom change you commonly make."
msgstr ""
"<data-migrations>Tá rudaí ``Oibríocht ``speisialaithe ann freisin atá le "
"haghaidh rudaí cosúil:ref: `imirce sonraí `agus le haghaidh ionramháil "
"bunachar sonraí láimhe chun cinn. Is féidir leat do ranganna ``Oibríocht "
"``féin a scríobh freisin más mian leat athrú saincheaptha a dhéanann tú go "
"coitianta a chuimsíonn tú."

msgid ""
"If you need an empty migration file to write your own ``Operation`` objects "
"into, use ``python manage.py makemigrations --empty yourappname``, but be "
"aware that manually adding schema-altering operations can confuse the "
"migration autodetector and make resulting runs of :djadmin:`makemigrations` "
"output incorrect code."
msgstr ""
"Má theastaíonn comhad imirce folamh uait chun do chuid rudaí ``Oibríochta "
"``féin a scríobh isteach, bain úsáid as `python manage.py makemigrations --"
"empty yourappname``, ach bí ar an eolas gur féidir le hoibríochtaí athraithe "
"scéime a chur mearbhall ar an uathbhreithnitheoir imirce agus rith a "
"dhéanamh de:djadmin: `makemigrations` aschur mícheart."

msgid ""
"All of the core Django operations are available from the "
"``django.db.migrations.operations`` module."
msgstr ""
"Tá gach ceann de na croí-oibríochtaí Django ar fáil ón modúl "
"``django.db.migrations.operations`."

msgid ""
"For introductory material, see the :doc:`migrations topic guide </topics/"
"migrations>`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh ábhar tosaigh, féach an:doc: `treoir ábhair imirceach' </topics/"
"migrations>."

msgid "Schema Operations"
msgstr "Oibríochtaí Scéime"

msgid "``CreateModel``"
msgstr "``CreateModel``"

msgid ""
"Creates a new model in the project history and a corresponding table in the "
"database to match it."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn sé samhail nua i stair an tionscadail agus tábla comhfhreagrach "
"sa bhunachar sonraí chun é a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"``name`` is the model name, as would be written in the ``models.py`` file."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``ainm ``ainm an tsamhail, mar a scríobhfaí sa chomhad `models.py`."

msgid ""
"``fields`` is a list of 2-tuples of ``(field_name, field_instance)``. The "
"field instance should be an unbound field (so just "
"``models.CharField(...)``, rather than a field taken from another model)."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``fields`` liosta de dhá thiúpla de ``(ainm réimse, field_instance)``. "
"Ba chóir go mbeadh an t-áireamh réimse ina réimse neamhcheangailte (mar sin "
"díreach ``Models.charfield (...) ``, seachas réimse a tógadh ó mhúnla eile)."

msgid ""
"``options`` is an optional dictionary of values from the model's ``Meta`` "
"class."
msgstr ""
"Is foclóir roghnach luachanna ó rang ``Meta`` an tsamhail is ea ``roghanna "
"``."

msgid ""
"``bases`` is an optional list of other classes to have this model inherit "
"from; it can contain both class objects as well as strings in the format "
"``\"appname.ModelName\"`` if you want to depend on another model (so you "
"inherit from the historical version). If it's not supplied, it defaults to "
"inheriting from the standard ``models.Model``."
msgstr ""
"Is liosta roghnach d'aicmí eile é ``bases`` chun an tsamhail seo a bheith "
"oidhreachta uaidh; féadfaidh rudaí ranga a bheith ann chomh maith le "
"teaghráin san fhormáid ``\"AppName.ModelName\"`` más mian leat brath ar "
"mhúnla eile (ionas go n-oidhreann tú ón leagan stairiúil). Mura "
"soláthraítear é, réamhshocraíonn sé oidhreacht ón gcaighdeánach "
"``Models.Model ``."

msgid ""
"``managers`` takes a list of 2-tuples of ``(manager_name, "
"manager_instance)``. The first manager in the list will be the default "
"manager for this model during migrations."
msgstr ""
"Glacann ``bainisteoirí ``liosta de dhá thúpla de`` (ainm bainisteora, "
"bainisteor_instance) ``. Is é an chéad bhainisteoir ar an liosta an "
"bainisteoir réamhshocraithe don tsamhail seo le linn imirce."

msgid "``DeleteModel``"
msgstr "``DeleteModel``"

msgid ""
"Deletes the model from the project history and its table from the database."
msgstr ""
"Scriosann sé an tsamhail ó stair an tionscadail agus a tábla ón mbunachar "
"sonraí."

msgid "``RenameModel``"
msgstr "``Athainm Model``"

msgid "Renames the model from an old name to a new one."
msgstr "Athainmníonn an tsamhail ó sheanainm go ceann nua."

msgid ""
"You may have to manually add this if you change the model's name and quite a "
"few of its fields at once; to the autodetector, this will look like you "
"deleted a model with the old name and added a new one with a different name, "
"and the migration it creates will lose any data in the old table."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go mbeidh ort é seo a chur leis de láimh má athraíonn tú ainm an "
"tsamhail agus cúpla ceann dá réimsí ag an am céanna; chuig an autodetector, "
"beidh cuma air seo gur scrios tú samhail leis an sean-ainm agus gur chuir tú "
"ceann nua le ainm difriúil, agus caillfidh an imirce a chruthaíonn sé aon "
"sonraí sa tseantábla."

msgid "``AlterModelTable``"
msgstr "``AlterModelTable``"

msgid ""
"Changes the model's table name "
"(the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.db_table` option on the ``Meta`` "
"subclass)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn ainm tábla an tsamhail (an:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.db_table` rogha ar an bhfo-aicme ``Meta``)."

msgid "``AlterModelTableComment``"
msgstr "``AlterModelTableComment ``"

msgid ""
"Changes the model's table comment "
"(the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.db_table_comment` option on the "
"``Meta`` subclass)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé trácht tábla an tsamhail (an rogha: attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.db_table_comment` ar an bhfo-aicme ``Meta``)."

msgid "``AlterUniqueTogether``"
msgstr "``AlterUniquetogether``"

msgid ""
"Changes the model's set of unique constraints "
"(the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.unique_together` option on the "
"``Meta`` subclass)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé tacar srianta uathúla an tsamhail (an rogha: attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.unique_Together` ar an bhfo-aicme ``Meta``)."

msgid "``AlterIndexTogether``"
msgstr "``AlterIndexTogether``"

msgid ""
"Changes the model's set of custom indexes (the ``index_together`` option on "
"the ``Meta`` subclass)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé tacar innéacsanna saincheaptha an tsamhail (an rogha "
"``index_together ``ar an bhfo-aicme ``Meta`)."

msgid ""
"``AlterIndexTogether`` is officially supported only for pre-Django 4.2 "
"migration files. For backward compatibility reasons, it's still part of the "
"public API, and there's no plan to deprecate or remove it, but it should not "
"be used for new migrations. "
"Use :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.AddIndex` "
"and :class:`~django.db.migrations.operations.RemoveIndex` operations instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le `AlterIndexTogether`` go hoifigiúil ach do chomhaid imirce "
"réamh-Django 4.2. Ar chúiseanna comhoiriúnachta ar chúl, tá sé fós mar chuid "
"den API poiblí, agus níl aon phlean ann é a dhíchur nó a bhaint, ach níor "
"cheart é a úsáid le haghaidh imirce nua. Úsáid:aicme: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.addIndex` agus:class: "
"`~django.db.migrations.operations.removeIndex` oibríochtaí ina ionad."

msgid "``AlterOrderWithRespectTo``"
msgstr "``AlterOrderWithReas``"

msgid ""
"Makes or deletes the ``_order`` column needed for "
"the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.order_with_respect_to` option on the "
"``Meta`` subclass."
msgstr ""
"Déanann nó scriosann sé an colún ``_order`` is gá don rogha: attr: "
"`~django.db.models.options.ORDER_with_RESPECT_TO` ar an bhfo-aicme ``Meta``."

msgid "``AlterModelOptions``"
msgstr "``Roghanna AlterModel``"

msgid ""
"Stores changes to miscellaneous model options (settings on a model's "
"``Meta``) like ``permissions`` and ``verbose_name``. Does not affect the "
"database, but persists these changes for :class:`RunPython` instances to "
"use. ``options`` should be a dictionary mapping option names to values."
msgstr ""
"Stórálann athruithe ar roghanna samhail ilghnéitheacha (socruithe ar `Meta`` "
"samhail) cosúil le `ceadúna`` agus ``verbose_name``. Ní dhéanann sé difear "
"don bhunachar sonraí, ach leanann sé ar na hathruithe seo le haghaidh "
"cásanna: class: `RunPython` le húsáid. Ba chóir go mbeadh `roghanna ``ina "
"fhoclóir a mhapáil ainmneacha roghanna ar luachanna."

msgid "``AlterModelManagers``"
msgstr "``Bainisteoirí AlterModel``"

msgid "Alters the managers that are available during migrations."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé na bainisteoirí atá ar fáil le linn imirce."

msgid "``AddField``"
msgstr "``Addfield``"

msgid ""
"Adds a field to a model. ``model_name`` is the model's name, ``name`` is the "
"field's name, and ``field`` is an unbound Field instance (the thing you "
"would put in the field declaration in ``models.py`` - for example, "
"``models.IntegerField(null=True)``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé réimse le samhail. Is é ``model_name`` ainm an tsamhail, ``ainm "
"``is ainm an réimse, agus is sampla Réimse neamhcheangailte é ``field`` (an "
"rud a chuirfeá sa dearbhú réimse i `models.py`` - mar shampla, "
"``Models.IntegerField (Null=True)``."

msgid ""
"The ``preserve_default`` argument indicates whether the field's default "
"value is permanent and should be baked into the project state (``True``), or "
"if it is temporary and just for this migration (``False``) - usually because "
"the migration is adding a non-nullable field to a table and needs a default "
"value to put into existing rows. It does not affect the behavior of setting "
"defaults in the database directly - Django never sets database defaults and "
"always applies them in the Django ORM code."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an argóint `preserve_default`` an bhfuil luach réamhshocraithe an "
"réimse buan agus ba chóir é a bhácáil isteach i stát an tionscadail "
"(`True``), nó má tá sé sealadach agus díreach don imirce seo (`False``) - de "
"ghnáth toisc go bhfuil réimse neamh-neamhrialaithe ag cur le tábla agus "
"teastaíonn luach réamhshocraithe a chur sna sraitheanna atá ann cheana. Ní "
"dhéanann sé difear go díreach ar iompar réamhshocruithe a shocrú sa "
"bhunachar sonraí - ní shocraíonn Django réamhshocraithe bunachar sonraí "
"riamh agus cuireann sé i bhfeidhm iad i gcónaí sa chód ORM Django."

msgid ""
"On older databases, adding a field with a default value may cause a full "
"rewrite of the table. This happens even for nullable fields and may have a "
"negative performance impact. To avoid that, the following steps should be "
"taken."
msgstr ""
"Ar bhunachair sonraí níos sine, d'fhéadfadh réimse a chur leis le luach "
"réamhshocraithe a bheith ina chúis le hathscríobh iomlán an tábla. Tarlaíonn "
"sé seo fiú do réimsí in-neamhnaithe agus d'fhéadfadh tionchar diúltach "
"feidhmíochta a bheith aige. Chun é sin a sheachaint, ba chóir na céimeanna "
"seo a leanas a dhéanamh."

msgid ""
"Add the nullable field without the default value and run "
"the :djadmin:`makemigrations` command. This should generate a migration with "
"an ``AddField`` operation."
msgstr ""
"Cuir an réimse in-neamhnaithe leis gan an luach réamhshocraithe agus rith an "
"t-ordú:djadmin: `makemigrations`. Ba chóir go mbeadh sé seo imirce a "
"ghiniúint le hoibríocht `AddField`."

msgid ""
"Add the default value to your field and run the :djadmin:`makemigrations` "
"command. This should generate a migration with an ``AlterField`` operation."
msgstr ""
"Cuir an luach réamhshocraithe le do réimse agus rith an t-ordú:djadmin: "
"`makemigrations`. Ba chóir go gcruthódh sé seo imirce le hoibríocht "
"``Alterfield`."

msgid "``RemoveField``"
msgstr "``Réimse a bhaint ``"

msgid "Removes a field from a model."
msgstr "Baineann réimse as samhail."

msgid ""
"Bear in mind that when reversed, this is actually adding a field to a model. "
"The operation is reversible (apart from any data loss, which is "
"irreversible) if the field is nullable or if it has a default value that can "
"be used to populate the recreated column. If the field is not nullable and "
"does not have a default value, the operation is irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Cuimhnigh go bhfuil sé seo réimse a chur le samhail i ndáiríre nuair a "
"aisiomptear é. Tá an oibríocht inchúlaithe (seachas aon chaillteanas sonraí, "
"atá dochúlaithe) má tá an réimse in-neamhnaithe nó má tá luach "
"réamhshocraithe aige is féidir a úsáid chun an colún athchruthaithe a "
"líonadh. Mura bhfuil an réimse neamhnaithe agus mura bhfuil luach "
"réamhshocraithe aige, tá an oibríocht dochúilte."

msgid ""
"``RemoveField`` will also delete any additional database objects that are "
"related to the removed field (like views, for example). This is because the "
"resulting ``DROP COLUMN`` statement will include the ``CASCADE`` clause to "
"ensure `dependent objects outside the table are also dropped`_."
msgstr ""
"Scriosfaidh ``removefield`` aon rudaí bunachar sonraí breise a bhaineann "
"leis an réimse bainte (cosúil le tuairimí, mar shampla). Tá sé seo toisc go "
"n-áireofar an ráiteas ``DROP COLUMN`` mar thoradh air sin an clásal "
"``CASCADE`` chun a chinntiú go gcuirtear `rudaí spleácha lasmuigh den tábla "
"titim freisin `_."

msgid "``AlterField``"
msgstr "``Alterfield``"

msgid ""
"Alters a field's definition, including changes to its "
"type, :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.null`, :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.unique`, :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.db_column` "
"and other field attributes."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé sainmhíniú réimse, lena n-áirítear athruithe ar a "
"chineál, :attr: `~django.db.models.field.null`, :attr: "
"`~django.db.models.field.unique`, :attr: `~django.db.models.field.db_column` "
"agus tréithe réimse eile."

msgid ""
"The ``preserve_default`` argument indicates whether the field's default "
"value is permanent and should be baked into the project state (``True``), or "
"if it is temporary and just for this migration (``False``) - usually because "
"the migration is altering a nullable field to a non-nullable one and needs a "
"default value to put into existing rows. It does not affect the behavior of "
"setting defaults in the database directly - Django never sets database "
"defaults and always applies them in the Django ORM code."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an argóint `preserve_default`` an bhfuil luach réamhshocraithe an "
"réimse buan agus ba chóir é a bhácáil isteach i stát an tionscadail "
"(`True``), nó má tá sé sealadach agus díreach don imirce seo (`False``) - de "
"ghnáth toisc go bhfuil an imirce ag athrú réimse neamh-innithe agus "
"teastaíonn luach réamhshocraithe a chur sna sraitheanna atá ann cheana. Ní "
"dhéanann sé difear go díreach ar iompar réamhshocruithe a shocrú sa "
"bhunachar sonraí - ní shocraíonn Django réamhshocraithe bunachar sonraí "
"riamh agus cuireann sé i bhfeidhm iad i gcónaí sa chód ORM Django."

msgid ""
"Note that not all changes are possible on all databases - for example, you "
"cannot change a text-type field like ``models.TextField()`` into a number-"
"type field like ``models.IntegerField()`` on most databases."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach féidir gach athrú a dhéanamh ar gach bunachar sonraí "
"- mar shampla, ní féidir leat réimse cineál téacs mar `Models.textField () "
"``a athrú go réimse cineál uimhreacha mar ``Models.IntegerField ()`` ar "
"fhormhór na mbunachair sonraí."

msgid "``RenameField``"
msgstr "``Renamefield``"

msgid ""
"Changes a field's name (and, "
"unless :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.db_column` is set, its column name)."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn ainm réimse (agus, unless:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.field.db_column` socraítear, ainm a cholún)."

msgid "``AddIndex``"
msgstr "``AddIndex``"

msgid ""
"Creates an index in the database table for the model with ``model_name``. "
"``index`` is an instance of the :class:`~django.db.models.Index` class."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn innéacs sa tábla bunachar sonraí don tsamhail le ``model_name``. "
"Is sampla den aicme:class: `~django.db.models.index` is ea `index``."

msgid "``RemoveIndex``"
msgstr "``Táimhainnéacs ``"

msgid "Removes the index named ``name`` from the model with ``model_name``."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé an t-innéacs darb ainm ``ainm`` ón tsamhail le ``model_name``."

msgid "``RenameIndex``"
msgstr "``Renameindex``"

msgid ""
"Renames an index in the database table for the model with ``model_name``. "
"Exactly one of ``old_name`` and ``old_fields`` can be provided. "
"``old_fields`` is an iterable of the strings, often corresponding to fields "
"of ``index_together`` (pre-Django 5.1 option)."
msgstr ""
"Athainmnigh innéacs sa tábla bunachar sonraí don tsamhail le ``model_name``. "
"Is féidir ceann amháin de `old_name`` agus ``old_fields`` a sholáthar. Is é "
"`old_fields`` athraitheach de na teaghráin, a fhreagraíonn go minic do "
"réimsí ``index_together ``(rogha réamh-DJango 5.1)."

msgid ""
"On databases that don't support an index renaming statement (SQLite and "
"MariaDB < 10.5.2), the operation will drop and recreate the index, which can "
"be expensive."
msgstr ""
"Ar bhunachair sonraí nach dtacaíonn le ráiteas athainmnithe innéacs (SQLite "
"agus MariaDB <10.5.2), titeoidh an oibríocht an t-innéacs agus a athchruthú, "
"rud a d'fhéadfadh a bheith daor."

msgid "``AddConstraint``"
msgstr "``Adsrianadh ``"

msgid ""
"Creates a :doc:`constraint </ref/models/constraints>` in the database table "
"for the model with ``model_name``."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn a:doc: `sriant` sa tábla bunachar sonraí </ref/models/"
"constraints> don tsamhail le ``model_name``."

msgid "``RemoveConstraint``"
msgstr "``Removeconstraint``"

msgid ""
"Removes the constraint named ``name`` from the model with ``model_name``."
msgstr "Baineann sé an srian darb ainm ``ainm ``ón tsamhail le ``model_name``."

msgid "``AlterConstraint``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Alters the constraint named ``name`` of the model with ``model_name`` with "
"the new ``constraint`` without affecting the database."
