msgid "Constraints reference"
msgstr "Tagairt srianta"

msgid ""
"The classes defined in this module create database constraints. They are "
"added in the model :attr:`Meta.constraints "
"<django.db.models.Options.constraints>` option."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn na ranganna atá sainithe sa mhodúl seo srianta bunachar sonraí. "
