msgstr ""
"ceadóidh sé scagadh ar ``seomra`` agus ``dáta``, ag roghnú ``full_name`` "
"freisin, agus sonraí a thógáil ach ón innéacs."

msgid ""
"Unique constraints with non-key columns are ignored for databases besides "
"PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar srianta uathúla le colúin neamh-eochair do bhunachair "
"sonraí seachas PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Non-key columns have the same database restrictions as :attr:`Index.include`."
msgstr ""
"Tá na srianta bunachar sonraí céanna ag colúin neamh-eochair las:attr: "
"`Index.include`."

msgid "``opclasses``"
msgstr "``opclasses``"

msgid ""
"The names of the `PostgreSQL operator classes <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/indexes-opclass.html>`_ to use for this unique index. If you "
"require a custom operator class, you must provide one for each field in the "
"index."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/indexes-opclass.html>Ainmneacha na "
"`ranganna oibreora PostgreSQL `_ le húsáid don innéacs uathúil seo. Má "
"theastaíonn rang oibreora saincheaptha uait, ní mór duit ceann a sholáthar "
"do gach réimse san innéacs."

msgid "creates a unique index on ``username`` using ``varchar_pattern_ops``."
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn innéacs uathúil ar ``ainm úsáideora ``ag baint úsáide as "
"``varchar_pattern_ops``."

msgid "``opclasses`` are ignored for databases besides PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar ``opclasses`` le haghaidh bunachair sonraí seachas "
"PostgreSQL."

msgid "``nulls_distinct``"
msgstr "``nulls_distint``"

msgid ""
"Whether rows containing ``NULL`` values covered by the unique constraint "
"should be considered distinct from each other. The default value is ``None`` "
"which uses the database default which is ``True`` on most backends."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir sraitheanna ina bhfuil luachanna `NULL`` atá clúdaithe leis an "
"srian uathúil a mheas ar leith óna chéile. Is é an luach réamhshocraithe "
"``None`` a úsáideann réamhshocraithe an bunachar sonraí atá ``True`` ar "
"fhormhór na gcúltaca."

msgid ""
"creates a unique constraint that only allows one row to store a ``NULL`` "
"value in the ``ordering`` column."
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn srian uathúil nach gceadaíonn ach sraith amháin luach ``NULL`` a "
"stóráil sa cholún ``ordú ``."

msgid ""
"Unique constraints with ``nulls_distinct`` are ignored for databases besides "
"PostgreSQL 15+."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar srianta uathúla le `nulls_distingt`` do bhunachair "
"sonraí seachas PostgreSQL 15+."

msgid ""
"The error code used when a ``ValidationError`` is raised during :ref:`model "
"validation <validating-objects>`."
msgstr ""

