"If :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.fields` is set without "
"a :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.condition`, defaults to "
"the :attr:`Meta.unique_together <django.db.models.Options.unique_together>` "
"error code when there are multiple fields, and to the :attr:`.Field.unique` "
"error code when there is a single field."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In older versions, the "
"provided :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.violation_error_code` was not used "
"when :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.fields` was set without "
"a :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.condition`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The error message used when a ``ValidationError`` is raised "
"during :ref:`model validation <validating-objects>`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Defaults to :attr:`.BaseConstraint.violation_error_message`, when "
"either :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.condition` is set "
"or :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.fields` is not set."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.fields` is set without "
"a :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.condition`, defaults to "
"the :attr:`Meta.unique_together <django.db.models.Options.unique_together>` "
"error message when there are multiple fields, and to "
"the :attr:`.Field.unique` error message when there is a single field."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In older versions, the "
"provided :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.violation_error_message` was not used "
"when :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.fields` was set without "
"a :attr:`.UniqueConstraint.condition`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Database Functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna Sonraí"

msgid ""
"The classes documented below provide a way for users to use functions "
"provided by the underlying database as annotations, aggregations, or filters "
"in Django. Functions are also :doc:`expressions <expressions>`, so they can "
"be used and combined with other expressions like :ref:`aggregate functions "
"<aggregation-functions>`."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn na ranganna atá doiciméadaithe thíos bealach d'úsáideoirí "
"feidhmeanna a sholáthraíonn an bunachar sonraí bunúsach a úsáid mar anótaí, "
"comhiomlánaithe nó scagairí i Django. <aggregation-functions>Is iad na "
"feidhmeanna freis:doc: `<expressions>abairtí`, ionas gur féidir iad a úsáid "
"agus a chomhcheangal le nathanna eile cosúil:ref: `feidhmeanna comhiomlána `."

msgid "We'll be using the following model in examples of each function::"
msgstr "Beidh muid ag úsáid an tsamhail seo a leanas i samplaí de gach feidhm:"

msgid ""
"We don't usually recommend allowing ``null=True`` for ``CharField`` since "
"this allows the field to have two \"empty values\", but it's important for "
"the ``Coalesce`` example below."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth ní mholaimid ``Null=True`` a cheadú do ``Charfield`` ós rud é go "
"gceadaíonn sé seo dhá “luach folamh” a bheith ag an réimse, ach tá sé "
"tábhachtach don sampla ``Coalesce`` thíos."

msgid "Comparison and conversion functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna comparáide agus tiontai"

msgid "``Cast``"
msgstr "``Cast``"

msgid ""
"Forces the result type of ``expression`` to be the one from ``output_field``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann iallach ar an gcineál torthaí ``expression`` mar an ceann ó "
"``output_field``."

msgid "``Coalesce``"
msgstr "``Coalesce``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a list of at least two field names or expressions and returns the "
"first non-null value (note that an empty string is not considered a null "
"value). Each argument must be of a similar type, so mixing text and numbers "
"will result in a database error."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le liosta de dhá ainm nó abairt réimse ar a laghad agus tugann sé "
"an chéad luach neamh-niall ar ais (tabhair faoi deara nach meastar gur luach "
"neamh-mheas teaghrán folamh). Caithfidh gach argóint a bheith de chineál "
"céanna, mar sin beidh earráid bunachar sonraí mar thoradh ar théacs agus "
"uimhreacha a mheascadh."

msgid "Usage examples:"
msgstr "Samplaí úsáide:"

msgid ""
"A Python value passed to ``Coalesce`` on MySQL may be converted to an "
"incorrect type unless explicitly cast to the correct database type:"
msgstr ""
"Féadfar luach Python a chuirtear chuig `Coalesce`` ar MySQL a thiontú go "
"cineál mícheart mura gcaitheadh go sainráite chuig an gcineál ceart bunachar "
"sonraí:"

msgid "``Collate``"
msgstr "``Collate``"

msgid "Takes an expression and a collation name to query against."
msgstr "Tógann sé abairt agus ainm comhlánaithe le fiosrú ina choinne."

msgid "For example, to filter case-insensitively in SQLite:"
msgstr "Mar shampla, chun cás-neamhíogair a scagadh i SQLite:"

msgid "It can also be used when ordering, for example with PostgreSQL:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a úsáid freisin agus tú ag ordú, mar shampla le PostgreSQL:"

msgid "``Greatest``"
msgstr "``An Mhór ``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a list of at least two field names or expressions and returns the "
"greatest value. Each argument must be of a similar type, so mixing text and "
"numbers will result in a database error."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le liosta de dhá ainm nó abairt réimse ar a laghad agus tugann sé "
"an luach is mó ar ais. Caithfidh gach argóint a bheith de chineál céanna, "
"mar sin beidh earráid bunachar sonraí mar thoradh ar théacs agus uimhreacha "
"a mheascadh."

msgid ""
"``annotated_comment.last_updated`` will be the most recent of "
"``blog.modified`` and ``comment.modified``."
msgstr ""
"Beidh ``annotated_comment.last_updated`` an ceann is déanaí de "
"`blog.modified`` agus ``comment.modified``."

msgid ""
"The behavior of ``Greatest`` when one or more expression may be ``null`` "
"varies between databases:"
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn iompar ``Greatest`` nuair a bhféadfadh abairt amháin nó níos mó a "
"bheith ``null`` idir bunachair sonraí:"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL: ``Greatest`` will return the largest non-null expression, or "
"``null`` if all expressions are ``null``."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL: Tabharfaidh ``Greatest`` an abairt neamh-null is mó ar ais, nó "
"``null`` má tá `null`` gach abairt ``null``."

msgid ""
"SQLite, Oracle, and MySQL: If any expression is ``null``, ``Greatest`` will "
"return ``null``."
msgstr ""
"SQLite, Oracle, agus MySQL: Má tá aon abairt ``null``, fillfidh "
"```Greatest`` ``null``."

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL behavior can be emulated using ``Coalesce`` if you know a "
"sensible minimum value to provide as a default."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir aithris a dhéanamh ar iompar PostgreSQL ag baint úsáide as "
"``Coalesce`` má tá íosluach ciallmhar ar eolas agat le soláthar mar "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``Least``"
msgstr "``Is Leas``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a list of at least two field names or expressions and returns the "
"least value. Each argument must be of a similar type, so mixing text and "
"numbers will result in a database error."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le liosta de dhá ainm nó abairt réimse ar a laghad agus tugann sé "
"an luach is lú ar ais. Caithfidh gach argóint a bheith de chineál céanna, "
"mar sin beidh earráid bunachar sonraí mar thoradh ar théacs agus uimhreacha "
"a mheascadh."

msgid ""
"The behavior of ``Least`` when one or more expression may be ``null`` varies "
"between databases:"
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn iompar ``Is Leas` nuair a bhféadfadh léiriú amháin nó níos mó a "
"bheith ``null`` idir bunachair sonraí:"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL: ``Least`` will return the smallest non-null expression, or "
"``null`` if all expressions are ``null``."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL: Tabharfaidh ``Is leith`` an abairt neamh-null is lú ar ais, nó "
"``null`` má tá `null`` na nathanna go léir ``null``."

msgid ""
"SQLite, Oracle, and MySQL: If any expression is ``null``, ``Least`` will "
"return ``null``."
msgstr ""
"SQLite, Oracle, agus MySQL: Má tá aon abairt ``null``, fillfidh ```Is Leas` "
"```null``."

msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL behavior can be emulated using ``Coalesce`` if you know a "
"sensible maximum value to provide as a default."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir aithris a dhéanamh ar iompar PostgreSQL ag baint úsáide as "
"``Coalesce`` má tá uasluach ciallmhar ar eolas agat le soláthar mar "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``NullIf``"
msgstr "``Nullif``"

msgid ""
"Accepts two expressions and returns ``None`` if they are equal, otherwise "
"returns ``expression1``."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá abairt agus filleann sé ``None`` má tá siad comhionann, ar "
"shlí eile filleann sé ``expression1``."

msgid "Caveats on Oracle"
msgstr "Rabhadh ar Oracle"

msgid ""
"Due to an :ref:`Oracle convention<oracle-null-empty-strings>`, this function "
"returns the empty string instead of ``None`` when the expressions are of "
"type :class:`~django.db.models.CharField`."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar an:ref: `Coinbhinsiún Oracle <oracle-null-empty-strings>`, "
"filleann an fheidhm seo an teaghrán folamh in ionad ``None`` nuair a bhíonn "
"na nathanna de chineál:class: `~django.db.models.charfield`."

msgid ""
"Passing ``Value(None)`` to ``expression1`` is prohibited on Oracle since "
"Oracle doesn't accept ``NULL`` as the first argument."
msgstr ""
"Tá cosc ar ``Luach (Níl) ``a chur chuig `expression1`` ar Oracle ós rud é "
"nach nglacann Oracle le ``NULL`` mar an chéad argóint."

msgid "Date functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna dáta"

msgid "``Extract``"
msgstr "``Sliocht ``"

msgid "Extracts a component of a date as a number."
msgstr "Baineann comhpháirt de dháta mar uimhir."

msgid ""
"Takes an ``expression`` representing a ``DateField``, ``DateTimeField``, "
"``TimeField``, or ``DurationField`` and a ``lookup_name``, and returns the "
"part of the date referenced by ``lookup_name`` as an ``IntegerField``. "
"Django usually uses the databases' extract function, so you may use any "
"``lookup_name`` that your database supports. A ``tzinfo`` subclass, usually "
"provided by :mod:`zoneinfo`, can be passed to extract a value in a specific "
"timezone."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé ``expression`` a léiríonn ``DateField``, `DateTimefield``, "
"`Timefield``, nó ``Durationfield`` agus ``lookup_name``, agus filleann sé an "
"chuid den dáta dá dtagraítear ``lookup_name`` mar ``limistéar. De ghnáth "
"úsáideann Django feidhm sliocht na mbunachar sonraí, mar sin féadfaidh tú "
"aon ``lookup_name`` a úsáid a thacaíonn do bhunachar sonraí. Is féidir fo-"
"aicme `tzinfo``, a sholáthraíonn u:mod: `zoneinfo` de ghnáth, a chur ar "
"aghaidh chun luach a bhaint i gcrios ama ar leith."

msgid ""
"Given the datetime ``2015-06-15 23:30:01.000321+00:00``, the built-in "
"``lookup_name``\\s return:"
msgstr ""
"I bhfianaise an dáta ``2015-06-15 23:30:01.000 321+ 00:00 ``, filleann an "
"``lookup_name`` ionsuite:"

msgid "\"year\": 2015"
msgstr "“bliain”: 2015"

msgid "\"iso_year\": 2015"
msgstr "“Iso_bliain”: 2015"

msgid "\"quarter\": 2"
msgstr "“ráithe”: 2"

msgid "\"month\": 6"
msgstr "“mhí”: 6"

msgid "\"day\": 15"
msgstr "“lá”: 15"

msgid "\"week\": 25"
msgstr "“seachtain”: 25"

msgid "\"week_day\": 2"
msgstr "“Lá na seachtaine”: 2"

msgid "\"iso_week_day\": 1"
msgstr "“Iso_lá seachtaine”: 1"

msgid "\"hour\": 23"
msgstr "“uair an chloig”: 23"

msgid "\"minute\": 30"
msgstr "“nóiméad”: 30"

msgid "\"second\": 1"
msgstr "“an dara”: 1"

msgid ""
"If a different timezone like ``Australia/Melbourne`` is active in Django, "
"then the datetime is converted to the timezone before the value is "
"extracted. The timezone offset for Melbourne in the example date above is "
"+10:00. The values returned when this timezone is active will be the same as "
"above except for:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá crios ama difriúil mar ``Astráil/Melbourne`` gníomhach i Django, ansin "
"déantar an dáta-am a thiontú go dtí an crios ama sula mbaintear an luach. Is "
"é an fhritháireamh crios ama do Melbourne sa dáta sampla thuas ná + 10:00. "
"Beidh na luachanna a chuirtear ar ais nuair a bhíonn an crios ama seo "
"gníomhach mar an gcéanna agus thuas ach amháin:"

msgid "\"day\": 16"
msgstr "“lá”: 16"

msgid "\"week_day\": 3"
msgstr "“Lá na seachtaine”: 3"

msgid "\"iso_week_day\": 2"
msgstr "“Lá seachtaine iso_”: 2"

msgid "\"hour\": 9"
msgstr "“uair an chloig”: 9"

msgid "``week_day`` values"
msgstr "Luachanna ``seachtain_laeth``"

msgid ""
"The ``week_day`` ``lookup_type`` is calculated differently from most "
"databases and from Python's standard functions. This function will return "
"``1`` for Sunday, ``2`` for Monday, through ``7`` for Saturday."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhtar an ``week_day`` `lookup_type`` go difriúil ó fhormhór na mbunachair "
"sonraí agus ó fheidhmeanna caighdeánacha Python. Tabharfaidh an fheidhm seo "
"``1`` ar ais don Domhnach, ``2`` don Luain, trí ``7`` don Dé Sathairn."

msgid "The equivalent calculation in Python is:"
msgstr "Is é an ríomh coibhéiseach i Python:"

msgid "``week`` values"
msgstr "Luachanna ``seachtain``"

msgid ""
"The ``week`` ``lookup_type`` is calculated based on `ISO-8601 <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO-8601>`_, i.e., a week starts on a Monday. The "
"first week of a year is the one that contains the year's first Thursday, "
"i.e. the first week has the majority (four or more) of its days in the year. "
"The value returned is in the range 1 to 52 or 53."
msgstr ""
"< https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO-8601>Ríomhtar an ``seachtaine`` "
"`lookup_type`` bunaithe ar `ISO-8601`_, ie, tosaíonn seachtain ar Dé Luain. "
"Is í an chéad seachtain de bhliain an ceann ina bhfuil an chéad Déardaoin na "
"bliana, i.e. tá tromlach (ceithre nó níos mó) dá laethanta sa bhliain ag an "
"gcéad seachtain. Tá an luach a thugtar ar ais sa raon 1 go 52 nó 53."

msgid ""
"Each ``lookup_name`` above has a corresponding ``Extract`` subclass (listed "
"below) that should typically be used instead of the more verbose equivalent, "
"e.g. use ``ExtractYear(...)`` rather than ``Extract(..., "
"lookup_name='year')``."
msgstr ""
"Tá fo-aicme comhfhreagrach ```Extract`` (liostaithe thíos) ag gach "
"``lookup_name`` thuas ar chóir a úsáid de ghnáth in ionad an choibhéis níos "
"fhíorúla, m.sh. bain úsáid as ``ExtractYear (...) ``seachas ``Extract (..., "
"lookup_name = 'year') `."

msgid "``DateField`` extracts"
msgstr "Sleachta ``Datefield ``"

msgid "Returns the ISO-8601 week-numbering year."
msgstr "Tugann an bhliain uimhrithe seachtaine ISO-8601 ar ais."

msgid ""
"Returns the ISO-8601 week day with day 1 being Monday and day 7 being Sunday."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé lá na seachtaine ISO-8601 agus lá 1 é Luan agus lá 7 é Dé "
"Domhnaigh."

msgid ""
"These are logically equivalent to ``Extract('date_field', lookup_name)``. "
"Each class is also a ``Transform`` registered on ``DateField`` and "
"``DateTimeField`` as ``__(lookup_name)``, e.g. ``__year``."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo coibhéiseach go loighciúil le ``Extract ('date_field', "
"lookup_name) ``. Is é gach rang freisin ``Transform`` atá cláraithe ar "
"``DateField`` agus ``DateTimeField`` mar ``__ (lookup_name) ``, m.sh. "
"``__year``."

msgid ""
"Since ``DateField``\\s don't have a time component, only ``Extract`` "
"subclasses that deal with date-parts can be used with ``DateField``:"
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é nach bhfuil comhpháirt ama ag ``Datefield``, ní féidir ach fo-aicmí "
"``Extract ``a dhéileálann le dáta-chodanna a úsáid le ``Datefield``:"

msgid "``DateTimeField`` extracts"
msgstr "Sleachta ``DateTimefield``"

msgid ""
"In addition to the following, all extracts for ``DateField`` listed above "
"may also be used on ``DateTimeField``\\s ."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith leis an méid seo a leanas, féadfar gach sliocht do ``DateField "
"``atá liostaithe thuas a úsáid freisin ar ``DateTimefield``\\ s."

msgid ""
"These are logically equivalent to ``Extract('datetime_field', "
"lookup_name)``. Each class is also a ``Transform`` registered on "
"``DateTimeField`` as ``__(lookup_name)``, e.g. ``__minute``."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo coibhéiseach go loighciúil le ``Extract ('datetime_field', "
"lookup_name) ``. Is `Transform`` é gach rang freisin atá cláraithe ar "
"``DateTimeField`` mar ``__ (lookup_name) ``, m.sh. ``__minute``."

msgid "``DateTimeField`` examples:"
msgstr "Samplaí ``DateTimeField``:"

msgid ""
"When :setting:`USE_TZ` is ``True`` then datetimes are stored in the database "
"in UTC. If a different timezone is active in Django, the datetime is "
"converted to that timezone before the value is extracted. The example below "
"converts to the Melbourne timezone (UTC +10:00), which changes the day, "
"weekday, and hour values that are returned:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair: Setting: `USE_TZ` ``True`` ansin stóráiltear dáta-amanna sa bhunachar "
"sonraí i UTC. Má tá crios ama difriúil gníomhach i Django, déantar an dáta-"
"am a thiontú go dtí an crios ama sin sula mbaintear an luach. Athraíonn an "
"sampla thíos go crios ama Melbourne (UTC + 10:00), a athraíonn na luachanna "
"lae, lá na seachtaine agus na huaire a chuirtear ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Explicitly passing the timezone to the ``Extract`` function behaves in the "
"same way, and takes priority over an active timezone:"
msgstr ""
"Iompraíonn an crios ama a chur go sainráite chuig an bhfeidhm ``Extract`` ar "
"an mbealach céanna, agus tugann sé tosaíocht thar chrios ama gníomhach:"

msgid "``Now``"
msgstr "``Anois ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the database server's current date and time when the query is "
"executed, typically using the SQL ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP``."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé dáta agus am reatha an fhreastalaí bunachar sonraí nuair a "
"chuirtear an ceist i bhfeidhm, de ghnáth ag baint úsáide as an SQL "
"`CURRENT_TIMESTAMP``."

msgid "PostgreSQL considerations"
msgstr "Creithnithe PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"On PostgreSQL, the SQL ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` returns the time that the "
"current transaction started. Therefore for cross-database compatibility, "
"``Now()`` uses ``STATEMENT_TIMESTAMP`` instead. If you need the transaction "
"timestamp, use :class:`django.contrib.postgres.functions.TransactionNow`."
msgstr ""
"Ar PostgreSQL, filleann an SQL ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` an t-am a thosaigh an t-"
"idirbheart reatha. Dá bhrí sin le haghaidh comhoiriúnacht tras-bhunachar "
"sonraí, úsáideann ``Now () ```STATEMENT_TIMESTAMP`` ina ionad. Má "
"theastaíonn an stampa ama idirbheart uait, bain úsáid as: class: "
"`django.contrib.postgres.functions.TransactionNow`."

msgid ""
"On Oracle, the SQL ``LOCALTIMESTAMP`` is used to avoid issues with casting "
"``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` to ``DateTimeField``."
msgstr ""
"Ar Oracle, úsáidtear an SQL ``LOCALTIMESTAMP`` chun saincheisteanna a "
"sheachaint le réitigh ``CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`` go `DateTimeField``."

msgid "``Trunc``"
msgstr "``Trunc``"

msgid "Truncates a date up to a significant component."
msgstr "Déanann sé dáta a ghearradh suas go dtí comhpháirt shuntasach."

msgid ""
"When you only care if something happened in a particular year, hour, or day, "
"but not the exact second, then ``Trunc`` (and its subclasses) can be useful "
"to filter or aggregate your data. For example, you can use ``Trunc`` to "
"calculate the number of sales per day."
msgstr ""
"Nuair nach bhfuil cúram ort ach má tharla rud éigin i mbliain, uair an "
"chloig nó lá áirithe, ach ní an dara ceart, ansin is féidir le ``Trunc` "
"(agus a fho-aicmí) a bheith úsáideach chun do chuid sonraí a scagadh nó a "
"chomhiomlánú. Mar shampla, is féidir leat ``Trunc`` a úsáid chun líon na "
"ndíolacháin in aghaidh an lae a ríomh."

msgid ""
"``Trunc`` takes a single ``expression``, representing a ``DateField``, "
"``TimeField``, or ``DateTimeField``, a ``kind`` representing a date or time "
"part, and an ``output_field`` that's either ``DateTimeField()``, "
"``TimeField()``, or ``DateField()``. It returns a datetime, date, or time "
"depending on ``output_field``, with fields up to ``kind`` set to their "
"minimum value. If ``output_field`` is omitted, it will default to the "
"``output_field`` of ``expression``. A ``tzinfo`` subclass, usually provided "
"by :mod:`zoneinfo`, can be passed to truncate a value in a specific timezone."
msgstr ""
"Glacann ``Trunc`` `léirithe`` amháin, a léiríonn ``DataField``, "
"`Timefield``, nó ``DateTimeField``, ``cine`` a léiríonn cuid dáta nó ama, "
"agus ``output_field`` arb é ``DateTimeField ()``, `TimeField () ``, nó`` "
"Timefield () ``, nó ``Timefield ()``, ``, `Timefield ()``, nó ```“Dáta Field "
"() ``. Tugann sé dáta-am, dáta nó am ar ais ag brath ar ``output_field``, le "
"réimsí suas le `cineál` socraithe dá luach íosta. Má fhágtar "
"``output_field``, réamhshocróidh sé go ``output_field`` de `expression``. Is "
"féidir fo-aicme `tzinfo``, a sholáthraíonn u:mod: `zoneinfo` de ghnáth, a "
"chur ar aghaidh chun luach a ghearradh i gcrios ama ar leith."

msgid ""
"Given the datetime ``2015-06-15 14:30:50.000321+00:00``, the built-in "
"``kind``\\s return:"
msgstr ""
"I bhfianaise an dáta ``2015-06-15 14:30:50.000 321+ 00:00 ``, filleann an "
"``cine`` ionsuite:"

msgid "\"year\": 2015-01-01 00:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“bliain”: 2015-01-01 00:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"quarter\": 2015-04-01 00:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“ráithe”: 2015-04-01 00:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"month\": 2015-06-01 00:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“mhí”: 2015-06-01 00:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"week\": 2015-06-15 00:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“Seachtain”: 2015-06-15 00:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"day\": 2015-06-15 00:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“lá”: 2015-06-15 00:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"hour\": 2015-06-15 14:00:00+00:00"
msgstr "“uair an chloig”: 2015-06-15 14:00:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"minute\": 2015-06-15 14:30:00+00:00"
msgstr "“nóiméad”: 2015-06-15 14:30:00 + 00:00"

msgid "\"second\": 2015-06-15 14:30:50+00:00"
msgstr "“an dara”: 2015-06-15 14:30:50 + 00:00"

msgid ""
"If a different timezone like ``Australia/Melbourne`` is active in Django, "
"then the datetime is converted to the new timezone before the value is "
"truncated. The timezone offset for Melbourne in the example date above is "
"+10:00. The values returned when this timezone is active will be:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá crios ama difriúil mar ``Astráil/Melbourne`` gníomhach i Django, ansin "
"déantar an dáta-am a thiontú go dtí an crios ama nua sula ndéantar an luach "
"a ghearradh. Is é an fhritháireamh crios ama do Melbourne sa dáta sampla "
"thuas ná + 10:00. Is iad na luachanna a thugtar ar ais nuair a bheidh an "
"crios ama seo gníomhach ná"

msgid "\"year\": 2015-01-01 00:00:00+11:00"
msgstr "“bliain”: 2015-01-01 00:00:00 + 11:00"

msgid "\"quarter\": 2015-04-01 00:00:00+10:00"
msgstr "“ráithe”: 2015-04-01 00:00:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"month\": 2015-06-01 00:00:00+10:00"
msgstr "“mhí”: 2015-06-01 00:00:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"week\": 2015-06-16 00:00:00+10:00"
msgstr "“Seachtain”: 2015-06-16 00:00:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"day\": 2015-06-16 00:00:00+10:00"
msgstr "“lá”: 2015-06-16 00:00:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"hour\": 2015-06-16 00:00:00+10:00"
msgstr "“uair an chloig”: 2015-06-16 00:00:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"minute\": 2015-06-16 00:30:00+10:00"
msgstr "“nóiméad”: 2015-06-16 00:30:00 + 10:00"

msgid "\"second\": 2015-06-16 00:30:50+10:00"
msgstr "“an dara”: 2015-06-16 00:30:50 + 10:00"

msgid ""
"The year has an offset of +11:00 because the result transitioned into "
"daylight saving time."
msgstr ""
"Tá fritháireamh + 11:00 ag an mbliain toisc gur aistrigh an toradh go dtí am "
"sábhála solais an lae."

msgid ""
"Each ``kind`` above has a corresponding ``Trunc`` subclass (listed below) "
"that should typically be used instead of the more verbose equivalent, e.g. "
"use ``TruncYear(...)`` rather than ``Trunc(..., kind='year')``."
msgstr ""
"Tá fo-aicme comhfhreagrach ```Trunc`` (liostaithe thíos) ag gach `cineál`` "
"thuas ar chóir a úsáid de ghnáth in ionad an choibhéis is eolaí, m.sh. bain "
"úsáid as ``TruncYear (...) ``seachas ``Trunc (..., cine='bliain')``."

msgid ""
"The subclasses are all defined as transforms, but they aren't registered "
"with any fields, because the lookup names are already reserved by the "
"``Extract`` subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear na fo-aicmí go léir mar athruithe, ach níl siad cláraithe le "
"réimsí ar bith, toisc go bhfuil na fo-aicmí ``Eisceacht' in áirithe cheana "
"féin na hainmneacha cuardaigh."

msgid "``DateField`` truncation"
msgstr "``Dáta Field`` truncation"

msgid "Truncates to midnight on the Monday of the week."
msgstr "Cuireann sé go meán oíche Dé Luain na seachtaine."

msgid ""
"These are logically equivalent to ``Trunc('date_field', kind)``. They "
"truncate all parts of the date up to ``kind`` which allows grouping or "
"filtering dates with less precision. ``expression`` can have an "
"``output_field`` of either ``DateField`` or ``DateTimeField``."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo coibhéiseach go loighciúil le ``Trunc ('date_field', cineál) ``. "
"Déanann siad gach cuid den dáta a ghearradh suas go dtí ``cineál`, rud a "
"cheadaíonn dátaí a ghrúpáil nó a scagadh gan níos lú cruinneas. Is féidir le "
"``expression`` `output_field`` de ``DateField`` nó ``DateTimefield`` a "
"bheith aige."

msgid ""
"Since ``DateField``\\s don't have a time component, only ``Trunc`` "
"subclasses that deal with date-parts can be used with ``DateField``:"
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é nach bhfuil comhpháirt ama ag ``Datefield``, ní féidir ach fo-aicmí "
"``Trunc`` a dhéileálann le dáta-chodanna a úsáid le ``Datefield``:"

msgid "``DateTimeField`` truncation"
msgstr "``DateTimeField`` truncation"

msgid ""
"``TruncDate`` casts ``expression`` to a date rather than using the built-in "
"SQL truncate function. It's also registered as a transform on  "
"``DateTimeField`` as ``__date``."
msgstr ""
"Caitheann ``TruncDate`` `sainráite`` go dáta seachas an fheidhm truncate SQL "
"ionsuite a úsáid. Tá sé cláraithe freisin mar chlaochlú ar ``DateTimeField`` "
"mar ``__date ``."

msgid ""
"``TruncTime`` casts ``expression`` to a time rather than using the built-in "
"SQL truncate function. It's also registered as a transform on "
"``DateTimeField`` as ``__time``."
msgstr ""
"Caitheann ``TruncTime`` `léiriú ``go dtí am seachas an fheidhm truncate SQL "
"ionsuite a úsáid. Tá sé cláraithe freisin mar chlaochlú ar ``DateTimeField`` "
"mar ``__time``."

msgid ""
"These are logically equivalent to ``Trunc('datetime_field', kind)``. They "
"truncate all parts of the date up to ``kind`` and allow grouping or "
"filtering datetimes with less precision. ``expression`` must have an "
"``output_field`` of ``DateTimeField``."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo coibhéiseach go loighciúil le ``Trunc ('datetime_field', cineál) "
"``. Déanann siad gach cuid den dáta a ghearradh suas go “cineál” agus "
"ceadaíonn siad dáta a ghrúpáil nó a scagadh le níos lú cruinneas. Caithfidh "
"``output_field`` de `DateTimeField`` a bheith ag ``expression``."

msgid "``TimeField`` truncation"
msgstr "``Aimréimhseach`` curcú"

msgid ""
"These are logically equivalent to ``Trunc('time_field', kind)``. They "
"truncate all parts of the time up to ``kind`` which allows grouping or "
"filtering times with less precision. ``expression`` can have an "
"``output_field`` of either ``TimeField`` or ``DateTimeField``."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad seo coibhéiseach go loighciúil le ``Trunc ('time_field', cineál) ``. "
"Déanann siad gach cuid den am a ghearradh suas go dtí “cineál” a cheadaíonn "
"amanna grúpála nó scagtha le níos lú cruinneas. Is féidir le ``expression`` "
"`output_field`` de ``Timfield`` nó ``DateTimefield`` a bheith aige."

msgid ""
"Since ``TimeField``\\s don't have a date component, only ``Trunc`` "
"subclasses that deal with time-parts can be used with ``TimeField``:"
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é nach bhfuil comhpháirt dáta ag ``Timfield``, ní féidir ach fo-aicmí "
"``Trunc`` a dhéileálann le páirteanna ama a úsáid le ``Timfield``:"

msgid "JSON Functions"
msgstr ""

msgid "``JSONArray``"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Accepts a list of field names or expressions and returns a JSON array "
"containing those values."
msgstr ""

msgid "``JSONObject``"
msgstr "``JSONObject``"

msgid ""
"Takes a list of key-value pairs and returns a JSON object containing those "
"pairs."
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé liosta de phéirí luacha eochair agus filleann sé réad JSON ina "
"bhfuil na péirí sin ar ais."

msgid "Math Functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna Mate"

msgid "We'll be using the following model in math function examples::"
msgstr ""
"Beidh muid ag úsáid an tsamhail seo a leanas i samplaí feidhme matamaitice:"

msgid "``Abs``"
msgstr "``Abs``"

msgid "Returns the absolute value of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann luach iomlán réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais."

msgid "It can also be registered as a transform. For example:"
msgstr "Is féidir é a chlárú freisin mar chlaochlú. Mar shampla:"

msgid "``ACos``"
msgstr "``Acos ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the arccosine of a numeric field or expression. The expression value "
"must be within the range -1 to 1."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé arcosine réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais. Caithfidh an luach "
"abairt a bheith laistigh den raon -1 go 1."

msgid "``ASin``"
msgstr "``Asin``"

msgid ""
"Returns the arcsine of a numeric field or expression. The expression value "
"must be in the range -1 to 1."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé arcsine réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais. Caithfidh an luach "
"abairt a bheith sa raon -1 go 1."

msgid "``ATan``"
msgstr "``Atan``"

msgid "Returns the arctangent of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Filleann sé arctangent réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil."

msgid "``ATan2``"
msgstr "``Atan2``"

msgid "Returns the arctangent of ``expression1 / expression2``."
msgstr "Tugann sé an arctangent de ``expression1/expression2`` ar ais."

msgid "``Ceil``"
msgstr "``Uasteorain``"

msgid ""
"Returns the smallest integer greater than or equal to a numeric field or "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an sláimhir is lú níos mó ná réimse uimhriúil nó léiriú "
"uimhriúil."

msgid "``Cos``"
msgstr "``Cos``"

msgid "Returns the cosine  of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann sé cosine réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais."

msgid "``Cot``"
msgstr "``Cot``"

msgid "Returns the cotangent of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann sé cotangent réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais."

msgid "``Degrees``"
msgstr "``Céime``"

msgid "Converts a numeric field or expression from radians to degrees."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé réimse nó léiriú uimhriúil ó radáin go céimeanna."

msgid "``Exp``"
msgstr "``Exp``"

msgid ""
"Returns the value of ``e`` (the natural logarithm base) raised to the power "
"of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé luach `e`` (an bonn logarithm nádúrtha) arna ardú go cumhacht "
"réimse uimhriúil nó léirithe uimhriúil."

msgid "``Floor``"
msgstr "``Urlár``"

msgid ""
"Returns the largest integer value not greater than a numeric field or "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an luach sláireach is mó nach mó ná réimse uimhriúil nó léiriú "
"uimhriúil."

msgid "``Ln``"
msgstr "``Ln``"

msgid "Returns the natural logarithm a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann an logarithm nádúrtha réimse uimhriúil nó léiriú ar ais."

msgid "``Log``"
msgstr "``Log``"

msgid ""
"Accepts two numeric fields or expressions and returns the logarithm of the "
"second to base of the first."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt uimhriúla agus cuireann sé logarithm an "
"dara ceann ar ais go bonn an chéad cheann."

msgid "``Mod``"
msgstr "``Mod``"

msgid ""
"Accepts two numeric fields or expressions and returns the remainder of the "
"first divided by the second (modulo operation)."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt uimhriúla agus filleann sé an chuid eile "
"den chéad cheann roinnte leis an dara (oibríocht modulo)."

msgid "``Pi``"
msgstr "``Pi``"

msgid "Returns the value of the mathematical constant ``π``."
msgstr "Tugann luach an tairiseach matamaiticiúil ``π`` ar ais."

msgid "``Power``"
msgstr "``Cumhacht ``"

msgid ""
"Accepts two numeric fields or expressions and returns the value of the first "
"raised to the power of the second."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le dhá réimse nó abairt uimhriúla agus filleann sé luach an chéad "
"cheann a ardaíodh go cumhacht an dara ceann."

msgid "``Radians``"
msgstr "``Radians``"

msgid "Converts a numeric field or expression from degrees to radians."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé réimse nó léiriú uimhriúil ó chéimeanna go radáin."

msgid "``Random``"
msgstr "``Randam``"

msgid "Returns a random value in the range ``0.0 ≤ x < 1.0``."
msgstr "Tugann luach randamach ar ais sa raon ``0.0 ≤ x <1.0``."

msgid "``Round``"
msgstr "``Babhna``"

msgid ""
"Rounds a numeric field or expression to ``precision`` (must be an integer) "
"decimal places. By default, it rounds to the nearest integer. Whether half "
"values are rounded up or down depends on the database."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann réimse uimhriúil nó abairt uimhriúil chuig áiteanna deachúla "
"``cruinneas ``(ní mór gur sláimhir a bheith). De réir réamhshocraithe, "
"cruinneann sé go dtí an sláimhir is gaire. Braitheann cibé an bhfuil "
"leathluachanna cruinnithe suas nó síos ar an mbunachar sonraí."

msgid "``Sign``"
msgstr "``Comhartha``"

msgid "Returns the sign (-1, 0, 1) of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an comhartha (-1, 0, 1) de réimse uimhriúil nó léiriú ar ais."

msgid "``Sin``"
msgstr "``Sin``"

msgid "Returns the sine of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann sé sin réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais."

msgid "``Sqrt``"
msgstr "``Cearr``"

msgid "Returns the square root of a nonnegative numeric field or expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé fréamh cearnach réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil neamhdhiúltach ar ais."

msgid "``Tan``"
msgstr "``Tan``"

msgid "Returns the tangent of a numeric field or expression."
msgstr "Tugann sé tagent réimse nó léirithe uimhriúil ar ais."

msgid "Text functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna téacs"

msgid "``Chr``"
msgstr "``Chr``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a numeric field or expression and returns the text representation of "
"the expression as a single character. It works the same as "
"Python's :func:`chr` function."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú uimhriúil agus cuireann sé léiriú téacs an "
"abairt ar ais mar charachtar amháin. Oibríonn sé mar an gcéanna le feidhm "
"Python: Func: `chr`."

msgid ""
"Like :class:`Length`, it can be registered as a transform on "
"``IntegerField``. The default lookup name is ``chr``."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le: Class: `Fad `, is féidir é a chlárú mar chlaochlú ar "
"``Integerfield`. Is é ``chr`` an t-ainm cuardaigh réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``Concat``"
msgstr "``Concat``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a list of at least two text fields or expressions and returns the "
"concatenated text. Each argument must be of a text or char type. If you want "
"to concatenate a ``TextField()`` with a ``CharField()``, then be sure to "
"tell Django that the ``output_field`` should be a ``TextField()``. "
"Specifying an ``output_field`` is also required when concatenating a "
"``Value`` as in the example below."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le liosta de dhá réimse nó abairt téacs ar a laghad agus cuireann "
"sé an téacs comhtháite ar ais. Caithfidh gach argóint a bheith de chineál "
"téacs nó char. Más mian leat ``textField () ``a chomhcheangal le ``charField "
"()``, ansin bí cinnte a rá le Django gur chóir go mbeadh an ``output_field`` "
"ina `textField () ``. Teastaíonn ``output_field`` a shonrú freisin agus "
"``Luach`` á gcomhcheangal mar atá sa sampla thíos."

msgid ""
"This function will never have a null result. On backends where a null "
"argument results in the entire expression being null, Django will ensure "
"that each null part is converted to an empty string first."
msgstr ""
"Ní bheidh toradh neall ag an bhfeidhm seo riamh. Ar chúltaca ina bhfuil an "
"abairt iomlán neall mar thoradh ar argóint neall, cinnteoidh Django go "
"ndéantar gach cuid null a thiontú go sreang folamh ar dtús."

msgid "``Left``"
msgstr "```Ar Chlé ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the first ``length`` characters of the given text field or "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé na chéad charachtair ``fad ``den réimse téacs nó an léiriú téacs a "
"thugtar ar ais."

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the number of "
"characters the value has. If the expression is null, then the length will "
"also be null."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó léiriú agus filleann sé líon na "
"gcarachtar atá ag an luach. Má tá an abairt neall, ansin beidh an fad niall "
"freisin."

msgid "``Lower``"
msgstr "```Íoslag``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the lowercase "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú téacs amháin agus filleann sé an léiriú beaga "
"ar ais."

msgid ""
"It can also be registered as a transform as described in :class:`Length`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a chlárú freisin mar chlaochlú mar a thuairiscítear in:class: "
"`Fad`."

msgid "``LPad``"
msgstr "``Lpad``"

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the given text field or expression padded on the left "
"side with ``fill_text`` so that the resulting value is ``length`` characters "
"long. The default ``fill_text`` is a space."
msgstr ""
"Filleann luach an réimse téacs nó an léirithe téacs a thugtar a chuirtear ar "
"an taobh clé le `fill_text`` ionas gurb é carachtair ``fad ``an luach mar "
"thoradh air sin. Is é an réamhshocraithe ``fill_text`` spás."

msgid "``LTrim``"
msgstr "``Ltrim ``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :class:`~django.db.models.functions.Trim`, but removes only "
"leading spaces."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:class: `~Django.db.Models.Functions.Trim`, ach ní bhaineann sé ach "
"spásanna tosaigh."

msgid "``MD5``"
msgstr "``MD5``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the MD5 hash of the "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó léiriú agus filleann sé hash MD5 an "
"teaghrán ar ais."

msgid "``Ord``"
msgstr "``Ord``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the Unicode code point "
"value for the first character of that expression. It works similar to "
"Python's :func:`ord` function, but an exception isn't raised if the "
"expression is more than one character long."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó léiriú agus filleann sé luach pointe "
"cód Unicode ar ais don chéad charachtar den abairt sin. Oibríonn sé cosúil "
"le feidhm Python: Func: `ord`, ach ní ardaítear eisceacht má tá an abairt "
"níos mó ná carachtar amháin ar fad."

msgid ""
"It can also be registered as a transform as described in :class:`Length`. "
"The default lookup name is ``ord``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a chlárú freisin mar chlaochlú mar a thuairiscítear in:class: "
"`Fad`. Is é `ord`` an t-ainm cuardaigh réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``Repeat``"
msgstr "``Athsheol`"

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the given text field or expression repeated ``number`` "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé luach an réimse téacs nó na léirithe téacs a thugtar arís agus "
"arís eile ``uimhir ``uimhir."

msgid "``Replace``"
msgstr "``Athraithe``"

msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of ``text`` with ``replacement`` in ``expression``. "
"The default replacement text is the empty string. The arguments to the "
"function are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear ``athsholáthair`` in ``léirithe`` in `léirithe`` in `léirithe`` in "
"ionad ``téacs ``. Is é an téacs athsholáthair réamhshocraithe an teaghrán "
"folamh. Tá na hargóintí leis an bhfeidhm íogair ó chásanna."

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the characters of that "
"expression in reverse order."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó léiriú agus cuireann sé carachtair na "
"léirithe sin ar ais in ord droim."

msgid ""
"It can also be registered as a transform as described in :class:`Length`. "
"The default lookup name is ``reverse``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir é a chlárú freisin mar chlaochlú mar a thuairiscítear in:class: "
"`Fad`. Is é ``reverse`` an t-ainm cuardaigh réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``Right``"
msgstr "```Ceart ``"

msgid ""
"Returns the last ``length`` characters of the given text field or expression."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais na carachtair deireanacha ``fad ``den réimse téacs nó an "
"léiriú téacs a thugtar."

msgid "``RPad``"
msgstr "``Rpad``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :class:`~django.db.models.functions.LPad`, but pads on the right "
"side."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:class: `~django.db.models.functions.lpad`, ach ceapáin ar an taobh "
"dheis."

msgid "``RTrim``"
msgstr "``Rtrim ``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :class:`~django.db.models.functions.Trim`, but removes only "
"trailing spaces."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:class: `~Django.db.Models.Functions.Trim`, ach ní bhaineann sé ach "
"spásanna imeachta."

msgid "``SHA1``, ``SHA224``, ``SHA256``, ``SHA384``, and ``SHA512``"
msgstr "``SHA1``, `SHA224``, `SHA256``, `SHA384``, agus ``SHA512``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the particular hash of "
"the string."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse téacs amháin nó léiriú agus filleann sé hash áirithe an "
"teaghrán ar ais."

msgid ""
"They can also be registered as transforms as described in :class:`Length`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir iad a chlárú freisin mar athruithe mar a thuairiscítear in:class: "
"`Fad`."

msgid ""
"The `pgcrypto extension <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ "
"pgcrypto.html>`_ must be installed. You can use "
"the :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.CryptoExtension` migration "
"operation to install it."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ pgcrypto.html>Caithfear an "
"`síneadh pgcrypto`_ a shuiteáil. Is féidir leat an oibríocht imirce:class: "
"`~django.contrib.postgres.operations.cryptoextension` a úsáid chun é a "
"shuiteáil."

msgid "Oracle doesn't support the ``SHA224`` function."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn Oracle leis an bhfeidhm ``SHA224``."

msgid "``StrIndex``"
msgstr "``StrIndex``"

msgid ""
"Returns a positive integer corresponding to the 1-indexed position of the "
"first occurrence of ``substring`` inside ``string``, or 0 if ``substring`` "
"is not found."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé sláimhir dhearfach a fhreagraíonn do shuíomh 1-innéacsaithe ar an "
"gcéad tarlú de ``foshraithe`` taobh istigh de `sreang``, nó 0 mura "
"bhfaightear ``foshraithe``."

msgid ""
"In MySQL, a database table's :ref:`collation<mysql-collation>` determines "
"whether string comparisons (such as the ``expression`` and ``substring`` of "
"this function) are case-sensitive. Comparisons are case-insensitive by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"I MySQL, cinneann tábla bunachar sonraí 's:ref: `collation <mysql-"
"collation>`an bhfuil comparáidí teaghráin (mar shampla ``léirithe`` agus "
"``foshraithe`` den fheidhm seo) cás-íogair. Tá comparáidí neamh-íogair de "
"réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid "``Substr``"
msgstr "``Foshraithe``"

msgid ""
"Returns a substring of length ``length`` from the field or expression "
"starting at position ``pos``. The position is 1-indexed, so the position "
"must be greater than 0. If ``length`` is ``None``, then the rest of the "
"string will be returned."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé fotheagán de fhad ``fad ``ón réimse nó an abairt a thosaíonn ag an "
"suíomh ``pos``. Tá an suíomh 1-innéacsaithe, mar sin caithfidh an seasamh a "
"bheith níos mó ná 0. Más é ```fad ```None``, ansin cuirfear an chuid eile "
"den teaghrán ar ais."

msgid "``Trim``"
msgstr "``Trim``"

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the given text field or expression with leading and "
"trailing spaces removed."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé luach an réimse nó an léirithe téacs a thugtar ar ais le spásanna "
"tosaigh agus leantacha bainte."

msgid "``Upper``"
msgstr "``Uachtar``"

msgid ""
"Accepts a single text field or expression and returns the uppercase "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"Glacann sé le réimse nó léiriú téacs amháin agus cuireann sé an léiriú "
"uachtarchlóir ar ais"

msgid "Window functions"
msgstr "Feidhmeanna fuinn"

msgid ""
"There are a number of functions to use in "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.Window` expression for computing the "
"rank of elements or the :class:`Ntile` of some rows."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt feidhmeanna le húsáid in a:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.Expressions.Window` léiriú chun céim na n-eilimintí nó "
"an: aicme: `Ntile` de roinnt sraitheanna a ríomh."

msgid "``CumeDist``"
msgstr "``Cumedist``"

msgid ""
"Calculates the cumulative distribution of a value within a window or "
"partition. The cumulative distribution is defined as the number of rows "
"preceding or peered with the current row divided by the total number of rows "
"in the frame."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann dáileadh carnach luach laistigh de fhuinneog nó deighilt. "
"Sainmhínítear an dáileadh carnach mar líon na sraitheanna roimh an tsraith "
"reatha nó a chuirtear leis an tsraith reatha roinnte le líon iomlán na "
"sraitheanna sa fhráma."

msgid "``DenseRank``"
msgstr "``Denserank``"

msgid "Equivalent to :class:`Rank` but does not have gaps."
msgstr "Coibhéiseach len:class: `Rank` ach níl bearnaí aige."

msgid "``FirstValue``"
msgstr "``Chéadluach``"

msgid ""
"Returns the value evaluated at the row that's the first row of the window "
"frame, or ``None`` if no such value exists."
msgstr ""
"Filleann sé an luach a mheastófar ag an tsraith arb é an chéad shraith den "
"fhráma fuinneoige, nó ``Níl ``mura bhfuil aon luach den sórt sin ann."

msgid "``Lag``"
msgstr "``Lag``"

msgid ""
"Calculates the value offset by ``offset``, and if no row exists there, "
"returns ``default``."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann an luach a fhritháireamh le ``offset``, agus mura bhfuil aon "
"tsraith ann, filleann sé ``default``."

msgid ""
"``default`` must have the same type as the ``expression``, however, this is "
"only validated by the database and not in Python."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh ``réamhshocraithe`` an cineál céanna a bheith ag an ``léiritheo`, "
"áfach, ní bhailítear é seo ach ag an mbunachar sonraí agus ní i Python."

msgid "MariaDB and ``default``"
msgstr "MariaDB agus ``default``"

msgid ""
"MariaDB `doesn't support <https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-12981>`_ the "
"``default`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"< https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-12981>MariaDB `ní thacaíonn `_ leis "
"an bparaiméadar ``réamhshocraithe``."

msgid "``LastValue``"
msgstr "``Luach deiridh ``"

msgid ""
"Comparable to :class:`FirstValue`, it calculates the last value in a given "
"frame clause."
msgstr ""
"Inchomparáide len:class: `FirstValue`, ríomhann sé an luach deireanach i "
"gclásal fráma ar leith."

msgid "``Lead``"
msgstr "``Luaide``"

msgid ""
"Calculates the leading value in a given :ref:`frame <window-frames>`. Both "
"``offset`` and ``default`` are evaluated with respect to the current row."
msgstr ""
"<window-frames>Ríomhann an luach tosaigh i dtugtar: ref: `fráma `. Déantar "
"meastóireacht ar ``offset`` agus ``default`` araon maidir leis an tsraith "
"reatha."

msgid "``NthValue``"
msgstr "``Nthluach``"

msgid ""
"Computes the row relative to the offset ``nth`` (must be a positive value) "
"within the window. Returns ``None`` if no row exists."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann an tsraith i gcoibhneas leis an bhfritháireamh ``nth`` (caithfidh a "
"bheith ina luach dearfach) laistigh den fhuinneog. Tugann sé ar ais ``None`` "
"mura bhfuil aon tsraith ann."

msgid ""
"Some databases may handle a nonexistent nth-value differently. For example, "
"Oracle returns an empty string rather than ``None`` for character-based "
"expressions. Django doesn't do any conversions in these cases."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh roinnt bunachair sonraí n-luach nach bhfuil ann a láimhseáil go "
"difriúil. Mar shampla, filleann Oracle sreang folamh seachas ``None ``le "
"haghaidh nathanna carachtarbhunaithe. Ní dhéanann Django aon tiontaithe sna "
"cásanna seo."

msgid "``Ntile``"
msgstr "``Ntile ``"

msgid ""
"Calculates a partition for each of the rows in the frame clause, "
"distributing numbers as evenly as possible between 1 and ``num_buckets``. If "
"the rows don't divide evenly into a number of buckets, one or more buckets "
"will be represented more frequently."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann deighilt do gach ceann de na sraitheanna sa chlásal fráma, ag "
"dáileadh uimhreacha chomh cothrom agus is féidir idir 1 agus "
"``num_buckets``. Mura roinntear na sraitheanna go cothrom i roinnt buicéad, "
"cuirfear buicéad amháin nó níos mó ionadaíocht níos minice."

msgid "``PercentRank``"
msgstr "``Rang céatadáin``"

msgid ""
"Computes the relative rank of the rows in the frame clause. This computation "
"is equivalent to evaluating:"
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann céim choibhneasta na sraitheanna sa chlásal fráma. Tá an ríomh seo "
"comhionann le measúnú a dhéanamh ar:"

msgid ""
"The following table explains the calculation for the relative rank of a row:"
msgstr ""
"Míníonn an tábla seo a leanas an ríomh maidir le céim choibhneasta a chéile:"

msgid "Row #"
msgstr "Sraith #"

msgid "Rank"
msgstr "Céim"

msgid "Calculation"
msgstr "ríomh"

msgid "Relative Rank"
msgstr "Rang Choibhneasta"

msgid "15"
msgstr "15"

msgid "(1-1)/(7-1)"
msgstr "(1-1)/(7-1)"

msgid "0.0000"
msgstr "0.0000"

msgid "(2-1)/(7-1)"
msgstr "(2-1)/(7-1)"

msgid "0.1666"
msgstr "0.1666"

msgid "(5-1)/(7-1)"
msgstr "(5-1)/(7-1)"

msgid "0.6666"
msgstr "0.6666"

msgid "(7-1)/(7-1)"
msgstr "(7-1)/(7-1)"

msgid "1.0000"
msgstr "1.0000"

msgid "``Rank``"
msgstr "``Rang``"

msgid ""
"Comparable to :class:`RowNumber`, this function ranks rows in the window. "
"The computed rank contains gaps. Use :class:`DenseRank` to compute rank "
"without gaps."
msgstr ""
"Inchomparáide len:class: `RowNumber`, rangaíonn an fheidhm seo sraitheanna "
"san fhuinneog. Tá bearnaí sa chéim ríomhaithe. Úsáid: aicme: `Denserank` "
"chun céim a ríomh gan bearnaí."

msgid "``RowNumber``"
msgstr "``Uimhir Sraigh``"

msgid ""
"Computes the row number according to the ordering of either the frame clause "
"or the ordering of the whole query if there is no partitioning of "
"the :ref:`window frame <window-frames>`."
msgstr ""
"<window-frames>Ríomhann sé uimhir an tsraith de réir ordú an chlásal fráma "
"nó ordú na fiosrúcháin iomláine mura ndéantar deighilt an:ref: `fráma "
"fuinneoige `."

msgid "Query Expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ceisteanna"

msgid ""
"Query expressions describe a value or a computation that can be used as part "
"of an update, create, filter, order by, annotation, or aggregate. When an "
"expression outputs a boolean value, it may be used directly in filters. "
"There are a number of built-in expressions (documented below) that can be "
"used to help you write queries. Expressions can be combined, or in some "
"cases nested, to form more complex computations."
msgstr ""
"Déanann nathanna fiosrúcháin cur síos ar luach nó ar ríomh is féidir a úsáid "
"mar chuid de nuashonrú, cruthú, scagadh, ordú de réir, anótáil nó "
"comhiomlán. Nuair a aschuireann abairt luach boolean, féadfar é a úsáid go "
"díreach i scagairí. Tá roinnt nathanna ionsuite ann (doiciméadaithe thíos) "
"is féidir a úsáid chun cabhrú leat ceisteanna a scríobh. Is féidir nathanna "
"a chomhcheangal, nó i gcásanna áirithe a neadú, chun ríomhanna níos casta a "
"fhoirmiú."

msgid "Supported arithmetic"
msgstr "Uimhrithíocht tacaithe"

msgid ""
"Django supports negation, addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, "
"modulo arithmetic, and the power operator on query expressions, using Python "
"constants, variables, and even other expressions."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn Django le diúltú, cur leis, íolrú, iolrú, roinnt, uimhríocht "
"modulo, agus an t-oibreoir cumhachta ar nathanna fiosrúcháin, ag baint "
"úsáide as comhsheasmhainní Python, athróga, agus fiú nathanna eile."

msgid "Output field"
msgstr "Réimse aschuir"

msgid ""
"Many of the expressions documented in this section support an optional "
"``output_field`` parameter. If given, Django will load the value into that "
"field after retrieving it from the database."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn go leor de na nathanna doiciméadaithe sa chuid seo le paraiméadar "
"roghnach ``output_field``. Má thugtar, luchtálfaidh Django an luach isteach "
"sa réimse sin tar éis é a aisghabháil ón mbunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"``output_field`` takes a model field instance, like ``IntegerField()`` or "
"``BooleanField()``. Usually, the field doesn't need any arguments, like "
"``max_length``, since field arguments relate to data validation which will "
"not be performed on the expression's output value."
msgstr ""
"Glacann ``output_field`` sampla réimse samhail, mar ``IntegerField () ``nó "
"``BooleanField ()``. De ghnáth, ní theastaíonn aon argóintí ón réimse, "
"cosúil le ``max_length ``, ós rud é go mbaineann argóintí réimse le "
"bailíochtú sonraí nach ndéanfar ar luach aschuir an abairt."

msgid ""
"``output_field`` is only required when Django is unable to automatically "
"determine the result's field type, such as complex expressions that mix "
"field types. For example, adding a ``DecimalField()`` and a ``FloatField()`` "
"requires an output field, like ``output_field=FloatField()``."
msgstr ""
"Ní theastaíonn ``output_field`` ach amháin nuair nach bhfuil Django in ann "
"cineál réimse an torthaí a chinneadh go huathoibríoch, mar shampla nathanna "
"casta a mheascann cineálacha réimse. Mar shampla, teastaíonn réimse aschuir "
"``DecimalField () ``agus ``FloatField ()`` a chur leis, cosúil le "
"``output_field=floatField () ``."

msgid "Some examples"
msgstr "Roinnt samplaí"

msgid "Built-in Expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna tógtha"

msgid ""
"These expressions are defined in ``django.db.models.expressions`` and "
"``django.db.models.aggregates``, but for convenience they're available and "
"usually imported from :mod:`django.db.models`."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear na nathanna seo in `django.db.models.expressions`` agus "
"``django.db.models.aggregates``, ach ar mhaithe le háisiúlacht bíonn siad ar "
"fáil agus de ghnáth allmhairithe ó:mod: `django.db.models`."

msgid "``F()`` expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ``F () ``"

msgid ""
"An ``F()`` object represents the value of a model field, transformed value "
"of a model field, or annotated column. It makes it possible to refer to "
"model field values and perform database operations using them without "
"actually having to pull them out of the database into Python memory."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn réad ``F () `luach réimse samhail, luach claochlaithe réimse "
"samhail, nó colún anótaithe. De bharr sé gur féidir tagairt a dhéanamh do "
"luachanna réimse samhail agus oibríochtaí bunachar sonraí a dhéanamh ag "
"baint úsáide as iad gan iad a tharraingt amach as an mbunachar sonraí "
"isteach i gcuimhne Python."

msgid ""
"Instead, Django uses the ``F()`` object to generate an SQL expression that "
"describes the required operation at the database level."
msgstr ""
"Ina áit sin, úsáideann Django an réad ``F () `chun abairt SQL a ghiniúint a "
"thugann cur síos ar an oibríocht riachtanach ag leibhéal an bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"Let's try this with an example. Normally, one might do something like this::"
msgstr ""
"Déanaimis triail a bhaint as seo le sampla. De ghnáth, d'fhéadfadh duine rud "
"éigin mar seo a dhéanamh:"

msgid ""
"Here, we have pulled the value of ``reporter.stories_filed`` from the "
"database into memory and manipulated it using familiar Python operators, and "
"then saved the object back to the database. But instead we could also have "
"done::"
msgstr ""
"Anseo, tarraingamar luach ``reporter.stories_filed`` ón mbunachar sonraí "
"isteach i gcuimhne agus rinneamar é a ionramháil ag baint úsáide as "
"oibreoirí Python eolach, agus ansin shábháil an réad ar ais chuig an "
"mbunachar sonraí. Ach ina ionad sin d'fhéadfaimis a dhéanamh freisin:"

msgid ""
"Although ``reporter.stories_filed = F('stories_filed') + 1`` looks like a "
"normal Python assignment of value to an instance attribute, in fact it's an "
"SQL construct describing an operation on the database."
msgstr ""
"Cé go bhfuil cuma ``reporter.stories_filed = F ('stories_filed') + 1`` "
"cosúil le gnáthshannadh luach Python le tréith sampla, i ndáiríre is tógáil "
"SQL é ag cur síos ar oibríocht ar an mbunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"When Django encounters an instance of ``F()``, it overrides the standard "
"Python operators to create an encapsulated SQL expression; in this case, one "
"which instructs the database to increment the database field represented by "
"``reporter.stories_filed``."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a thagann Django le sampla de ``F () ``, a sháraíonn sé na hoibreoirí "
"caighdeánacha Python chun abairt SQL cumhdaithe a chruthú; sa chás seo, "
"ceann a thugann treoir don bhunachar sonraí an réimse bunachar sonraí a "
"léiríonn ``reporter.stories_filed`` a mhéadú."

msgid ""
"Whatever value is or was on ``reporter.stories_filed``, Python never gets to "
"know about it - it is dealt with entirely by the database. All Python does, "
"through Django's ``F()`` class, is create the SQL syntax to refer to the "
"field and describe the operation."
msgstr ""
"Cibé luach atá nó a bhí ar `reporter.stories_filed``, ní fhaigheann Python "
"eolas faoi riamh - déileálann an bunachar sonraí leis go hiomlán. Is é gach "
"rud a dhéanann Python, trí rang ``F () `Django, an comhréiteach SQL a "
"chruthú chun tagairt a dhéanamh don réimse agus cur síos a dhéanamh ar an "
"oibríocht."

msgid "To access the new value saved this way, the object must be reloaded::"
msgstr ""
"Chun rochtain a fháil ar an luach nua a shábháil ar an mbealach seo, "
"caithfear an réad a athluchtú::"

msgid ""
"As well as being used in operations on single instances as above, ``F()`` "
"can be used with ``update()`` to perform bulk updates on a ``QuerySet``. "
"This reduces the two queries we were using above - the ``get()`` and "
"the :meth:`~Model.save()` - to just one::"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We can also use :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.update()` to "
"increment the field value on multiple objects - which could be very much "
"faster than pulling them all into Python from the database, looping over "
"them, incrementing the field value of each one, and saving each one back to "
"the database::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir linn freisin: meth: `~django.db.models.query.queryset.update () `a "
"úsáid chun luach an réimse a mhéadú ar rudaí iolracha - rud a d'fhéadfadh a "
"bheith i bhfad níos gasta ná iad go léir a tharraingt isteach i Python ón "
"mbunachar sonraí, luach réimse gach ceann a mhéadú, agus gach ceann a "
"shábháil ar ais chuig an mbunachar sonraí::"

msgid "``F()`` therefore can offer performance advantages by:"
msgstr ""
"Dá bhrí sin is féidir le `F () ``buntáistí feidhmíochta a thairiscint trí:"

msgid "getting the database, rather than Python, to do work"
msgstr "an bunachar sonraí a fháil, seachas Python, chun obair a dhéanamh"

msgid "reducing the number of queries some operations require"
msgstr "laghdú ar líon na gceisteanna a theastaíonn ó oibríochtaí"

msgid "Slicing ``F()`` expressions"
msgstr "Ag sliseadh abairtí ``F () ``"

msgid ""
"For string-based fields, text-based fields, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.postgres.fields.ArrayField`, you can use "
"Python's array-slicing syntax. The indices are 0-based. The ``step`` "
"argument to ``slice`` and negative indexing are not supported. For example:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Avoiding race conditions using ``F()``"
msgstr "Coinníollacha rása a sheachaint ag baint úsáide as ``F () ``"

msgid ""
"Another useful benefit of ``F()`` is that having the database - rather than "
"Python - update a field's value avoids a *race condition*."
msgstr ""
"Buntáiste úsáideach eile a bhaineann le `F () ``ná go seachnaíonn an "
"bunachar sonraí - seachas Python - luach réimse a nuashonrú *coinníoll rása*."

msgid ""
"If two Python threads execute the code in the first example above, one "
"thread could retrieve, increment, and save a field's value after the other "
"has retrieved it from the database. The value that the second thread saves "
"will be based on the original value; the work of the first thread will be "
"lost."
msgstr ""
"Má fhorghníomhaíonn dhá snáithe Python an cód sa chéad shampla thuas, "
"d'fhéadfadh snáithe amháin luach réimse a aisghabháil, a mhéadú agus a "
"shábháil tar éis don duine eile é a aisghabháil ón mbunachar sonraí. Beidh "
"an luach a shábhálann an dara snáithe bunaithe ar an luach bunaidh; "
"caillfear obair an chéad snáithe."

msgid ""
"If the database is responsible for updating the field, the process is more "
"robust: it will only ever update the field based on the value of the field "
"in the database when the :meth:`~Model.save()` or ``update()`` is executed, "
"rather than based on its value when the instance was retrieved."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an bunachar sonraí freagrach as an réimse a nuashonrú, tá an próiseas "
"níos láidre: ní dhéanfaidh sé an réimse a nuashonrú riamh bunaithe ar luach "
"an réimse sa bhunachar sonraí nuair a fhorghníomhaítear an:meth: "
"`~model.save () `nó `update () ``, seachas bunaithe ar a luach nuair a "
"aisghabhadh an cás."

msgid "``F()`` assignments persist after ``Model.save()``"
msgstr "Leanann tascanna ``F () ``tar éis ``Model.save ()``"

msgid ""
"``F()`` objects assigned to model fields persist after saving the model "
"instance and will be applied on each :meth:`~Model.save()`. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Leanann rudaí ``F () ``a shanntar do réimsí samhail tar éis an tsamhail a "
"shábháil agus cuirfear i bhfeidhm ar gach ceann: meth: `~Model.save () `. "
"Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"``stories_filed`` will be updated twice in this case. If it's initially "
"``1``, the final value will be ``3``. This persistence can be avoided by "
"reloading the model object after saving it, for example, by "
"using :meth:`~Model.refresh_from_db()`."
msgstr ""
"Déanfar ``stories_filed`` a nuashonrú faoi dhó sa chás seo. Má tá sé ar dtús "
"``1``, is é ``3`` an luach deiridh. Is féidir an marthanacht seo a "
"sheachaint tríd an réad samhail a athluchtú tar éis é a shábháil, mar "
"shampla, trí:meth: `~Model.fresh_from_db () `a úsáid."

msgid "Using ``F()`` in filters"
msgstr "Ag baint úsáide as ``F () ``i scagairí"

msgid ""
"``F()`` is also very useful in ``QuerySet`` filters, where they make it "
"possible to filter a set of objects against criteria based on their field "
"values, rather than on Python values."
msgstr ""
"Tá ``F () ``an-úsáideach freisin i scagairí ``QuerySet``, áit a ndéanann "
"siad sraith rudaí a scagadh i gcoinne critéir bunaithe ar a luachanna "
