msgid "The ``Func`` API is as follows:"
msgstr "Is é seo a leanas an API `Func``:"

msgid ""
"A class attribute describing the function that will be generated. "
"Specifically, the ``function`` will be interpolated as the ``function`` "
"placeholder within :attr:`template`. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith aicme a dhéanann cur síos ar an bhfeidhm a ghinteofar. Go sonrach, "
"déanfar an `feidhm ``idirphóilte mar shealbhóir an ``feidhmi`` laistigh de: "
"attr: `teimpléad`. Réamhshocraithe go ``None``."

msgid ""
"A class attribute, as a format string, that describes the SQL that is "
"generated for this function. Defaults to ``'%(function)s(%(expressions)s)'``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith aicme, mar shreang formáide, a chuireann síos ar an SQL a ghintear "
"don fheidhm seo. Réamhshocraithe go ``'% (function) s (% (expressions) s) '`."

msgid ""
"If you're constructing SQL like ``strftime('%W', 'date')`` and need a "
"literal ``%`` character in the query, quadruple it (``%%%%``) in the "
"``template`` attribute because the string is interpolated twice: once during "
"the template interpolation in ``as_sql()`` and once in the SQL interpolation "
"with the query parameters in the database cursor."
msgstr ""
"Má tá SQL á thógáil agat cosúil le `strftime ('%W', 'date') ``agus má "
"theastaíonn carachtar liteartha ``%`` sa cheist, é a cheathrú (``%%%%%``) sa "
"tréith ``teimpléad`` toisc go ndéantar an sreang idirphóilte dhá uair: uair "
"amháin le linn an teimpléid in `as_sql ()`` agus uair amháin san idirpholú "
"SQL leis na paraiméadair iarratais sa chúrsóir bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"A class attribute that denotes the character used to join the list of "
"``expressions`` together. Defaults to ``', '``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith aicme a léiríonn an carachtar a úsáidtear chun páirt a ghlacadh le "
"liosta ``léiritheach`` le chéile. Réamhshocraithe go ``', '``."

msgid ""
"A class attribute that denotes the number of arguments the function accepts. "
"If this attribute is set and the function is called with a different number "
"of expressions, ``TypeError`` will be raised. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Tréith aicme a léiríonn líon na n-argóintí a nglacann an fheidhm leis. Má "
"shocraítear an tréith seo agus má thugtar an fheidhm le líon difriúil "
"nathanna, ardófar ``TypeError``. Réamhshocraithe go ``None``."

msgid ""
"Generates the SQL fragment for the database function. Returns a tuple "
"``(sql, params)``, where ``sql`` is the SQL string, and ``params`` is the "
"list or tuple of query parameters."
msgstr ""
"Gineann sé an blúire SQL don fheidhm bhunachar sonraí. Filleann sé tuple "
"``(sql, params)``, áit gurb é `sql`` an teaghrán SQL, agus `params`` an "
"liosta nó an tiúpla de pharaiméadair fiosrúcháin."

msgid ""
"The ``as_vendor()`` methods should use the ``function``, ``template``, "
"``arg_joiner``, and any other ``**extra_context`` parameters to customize "
"the SQL as needed. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir do na modhanna ``as_vendor () ``úsáid a bhaint as na paraiméadair`` "
"feidhm ``, `teimpléad``, `arg_joiner``, agus aon pharaiméadair "
"``**extra_context`` eile chun an SQL a shaincheapadh de réir mar is gá. Mar "
"shampla:"

msgid "``django/db/models/functions.py``"
msgstr "``django/db/samhlacha/feidhmeanna. py``"

msgid ""
"To avoid an SQL injection vulnerability, ``extra_context`` :ref:`must not "
"contain untrusted user input <avoiding-sql-injection-in-query-expressions>` "
"as these values are interpolated into the SQL string rather than passed as "
"query parameters, where the database driver would escape them."
msgstr ""
"Chun leochaileacht insteallta SQL a sheachaint, ní chóir go mbeadh ionchur "
"úsáideora neamhiontaofa ag ``extra_context`` <avoiding-sql-injection-in-"
"query-expressions>`: ref: `mar go ndéantar na luachanna seo a idirphóladh "
"isteach sa sreangán SQL seachas a rith mar pharaiméadair fiosrúcháin, áit a "
"n-éalódh tiománaí bunachar sonraí iad."

msgid ""
"The ``*expressions`` argument is a list of positional expressions that the "
"function will be applied to. The expressions will be converted to strings, "
"joined together with ``arg_joiner``, and then interpolated into the "
"``template`` as the ``expressions`` placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Is liosta de na nathanna seasaimh a chuirfear i bhfeidhm ar an bhfeidhm é an "
"argóint `* sainráitigh ``. Déanfar na nathanna a thiontú go teaghráin, a "
"chur le chéile le `arg_joiner``, agus ansin idirphóilfear isteach sa "
"`teimpléad ``mar shealbhóir áite ``léirithe``."

msgid ""
"Positional arguments can be expressions or Python values. Strings are "
"assumed to be column references and will be wrapped in ``F()`` expressions "
"while other values will be wrapped in ``Value()`` expressions."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le hargóintí seasaimh a bheith ina nathanna nó luachanna Python. "
"Glactar leis gur tagairtí colún iad na teaghráin agus fillfear iad in "
"abairtí ``F () ``agus cuirfear luachanna eile fillte in abairtí ``Luach ()``."

msgid ""
"The ``**extra`` kwargs are ``key=value`` pairs that can be interpolated into "
"the ``template`` attribute. To avoid an SQL injection vulnerability, "
"``extra`` :ref:`must not contain untrusted user input <avoiding-sql-"
"injection-in-query-expressions>` as these values are interpolated into the "
"SQL string rather than passed as query parameters, where the database driver "
"would escape them."
msgstr ""
"Is iad na kwargs ``**extra`` péirí ``eochair=luach`` is féidir iad a "
"ionghabháil isteach sa tréith ``teimpléad ``. Chun leochaileacht insteallta "
"SQL a sheachaint, ní chóir go mbeadh ionchur úsáideora neamhion <avoiding-"
"sql-injection-in-query-expressions>taofa ag ``extra``: ref: `mar go ndéantar "
"na luachanna seo a idirphóladh isteach sa sreang SQL seachas a rith mar "
"pharaiméadair cheisteanna, áit a n-éalfadh tiománaí an bunachar sonraí iad."

msgid ""
"The ``function``, ``template``, and ``arg_joiner`` keywords can be used to "
"replace the attributes of the same name without having to define your own "
"class. :ref:`output_field<output-field>` can be used to define the expected "
"return type."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir na heochairfhocail ``feidhm``, `teimpléad``, agus ``arg_joiner`` a "
"úsáid chun tréithe an ainm céanna a chur in ionad gan do rang féin a "
"shainiú. :ref: is féidir `output_field <output-field>`a úsáid chun an cineál "
"tuairisceáin a bhfuil súil leis a shainiú."

msgid "``Aggregate()`` expressions"
msgstr "Nathanna ``Comhiomlán () ``"

msgid ""
"An aggregate expression is a special case of a :ref:`Func() expression <func-"
"expressions>` that informs the query that a ``GROUP BY`` clause is required. "
"All of the :ref:`aggregate functions <aggregation-functions>`, like "
