"teastáil. Tá gach ceann de na feidhmeanna:ref: `comhiomlán <aggregation-"
"functions>`, cosúil le ``Sum () ``agus ``Count ()``, oidhreacht ó "
"``Comhiomlán () ``."

msgid ""
"Since ``Aggregate``\\s are expressions and wrap expressions, you can "
"represent some complex computations::"
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é gur abairtí agus nathanna fillte iad ``Comhiomlán``, is féidir leat "
"roinnt ríomhanna casta a léiriú:"

msgid "The ``Aggregate`` API is as follows:"
msgstr "Is é seo a leanas an API ``Comhléad``:"

