"a certain length, these table names will be automatically truncated and a "
"uniqueness hash will be used, e.g. ``author_books_9cdf``. You can manually "
"provide the name of the join table using "
"the :attr:`~ManyToManyField.db_table` option."
msgstr ""
"Taobh thiar de na radhairc, cruthaíonn Django tábla ceangail idirghabhálaí "
"chun an caidreamh go leor a léiriú. De réir réamhshocraithe, gintear an t-"
