"`field1`` ainm an eochair eachtrach don mhúnla an:class: `ManyTomanyfield` "
"sainmhínítear ar (``grúpa`` sa chás seo), agus ``field2`` ainm an eochair "
"eachtrach don spriocmhúnla (```duine ``sa chás seo)."

msgid ""
"When you have more than one foreign key on an intermediary model to any (or "
"even both) of the models participating in a many-to-many relationship, you "
"*must* specify ``through_fields``. This also applies to :ref:`recursive "
"relationships <recursive-relationships>` when an intermediary model is used "
"and there are more than two foreign keys to the model, or you want to "
"explicitly specify which two Django should use."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn níos mó ná eochair eachtrach amháin agat ar mhúnla "
"idirghabhála le haon (nó fiú an dá cheann) de na samhlacha atá "
"rannpháirteach i gcaidreamh go leor, ní mór duit* ``through_fields`` a "
"shonrú. Baineann sé seo freisin le:ref: `caidrimh athfhillteach <recursive-"
"relationships>`nuair a úsáidtear samhail idirghabhálaí agus go bhfuil níos "
"mó ná dhá eochair eachtracha don tsamhail, nó ba mhaith leat a shonrú go "
"sainráite cé na beirt Django ba chóir a úsáid."

msgid ""
"The name of the table to create for storing the many-to-many data. If this "
"is not provided, Django will assume a default name based upon the names of: "
"the table for the model defining the relationship and the name of the field "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an tábla le cruthú chun na sonraí go leor a stóráil. Mura gcuirtear é "
"seo ar fáil, glacfaidh Django le ainm réamhshocraithe bunaithe ar "
"ainmneacha: an tábla don tsamhail a shainmhíníonn an caidreamh agus ainm an "
"réimse féin."

msgid ""
"Controls whether or not constraints should be created in the database for "
"the foreign keys in the intermediary table. The default is ``True``, and "
"that's almost certainly what you want; setting this to ``False`` can be very "
"bad for data integrity. That said, here are some scenarios where you might "
"want to do this:"
msgstr ""
"Rialuithe cibé acu ba chóir srianta a chruthú sa bhunachar sonraí do na "
"heochracha eachtracha sa tábla idirghabhála nó nach bhfuil Is é “True” an "
"réamhshocraithe, agus is cinnte gurb é sin an rud a theastaíonn uait; is "
"féidir go mbeadh sé an-dona do shláine sonraí é seo a shocrú go `False`. É "
"sin ráite, seo roinnt cásanna inar mbeadh tú ag iarraidh é seo a dhéanamh:"

msgid "It is an error to pass both ``db_constraint`` and ``through``."
msgstr "Is earráid é ``db_restricint`` agus ``through ``a rith araon."

msgid ""
"Controls the migration framework's reaction if this :class:`ManyToManyField` "
"is pointing at a swappable model. If it is ``True`` - the default - then if "
"the :class:`ManyToManyField` is pointing at a model which matches the "
"current value of ``settings.AUTH_USER_MODEL`` (or another swappable model "
"setting) the relationship will be stored in the migration using a reference "
"to the setting, not to the model directly."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé imoibriú an chreat imirce má tá seo:class: `ManyTomanyField` ag "
"díriú ar mhúnla inmhalartaithe. Más é ``True`` - an réamhshocrú - ansin má "
"tá an:class: `ManyTomanyField` ag pointe ar mhúnla a mheaitseálann luach "
"reatha ``settings.auth_user_model`` (nó socrú samhail inmhalartaithe eile) "
"stóráilfear an caidreamh san imirce ag úsáid tagairt don socrú, ní don "
"tsamhail go díreach."

msgid ":class:`ManyToManyField` does not support :attr:`~Field.validators`."
msgstr ":class: `ManyTomanyField` ní thacaíonn o:attr: `~Field.validators `."

msgid ""
":attr:`~Field.null` has no effect since there is no way to require a "
"relationship at the database level."
msgstr ""
":attr: Níl aon éifeacht ag `~Field.null` ós rud é nach bhfuil aon bhealach "
"ann chun caidreamh a theastaíonn ag leibhéal an bhunachar sonraí."

msgid "``OneToOneField``"
msgstr "``Onetoonefield``"

msgid ""
"A one-to-one relationship. Conceptually, this is similar to "
"a :class:`ForeignKey` with :attr:`unique=True <Field.unique>`, but the "
"\"reverse\" side of the relation will directly return a single object."
msgstr ""
"Caidreamh duine le duine. Go coincheapúil, tá sé seo cosúil le a:class: "
"`ForeignKey` le: attr: `Unique=True <Field.unique>`, ach cuirfidh an taobh "
"“droim” den chaidreamh rud amháin ar ais go díreach."

msgid ""
"This is most useful as the primary key of a model which \"extends\" another "
"model in some way; :ref:`multi-table-inheritance` is implemented by adding "
"an implicit one-to-one relation from the child model to the parent model, "
"for example."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo is úsáideach mar phríomh-eochair mhúnla a “leathnaíonn” samhail "
"eile ar bhealach éigin; :ref: cuirtear `il-tábla-oidhreacht 'i bhfeidhm trí "
"ghaol intuigthe duine le duine a chur ón tsamhail linbh leis an tsamhail "
"tuismitheora, mar shampla."

msgid ""
"One positional argument is required: the class to which the model will be "
"related. This works exactly the same as it does for :class:`ForeignKey`, "
"including all the options regarding :ref:`recursive <recursive-"
"relationships>` and :ref:`lazy <lazy-relationships>` relationships."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn argóint seasmhach amháin: an rang lena mbeidh baint ag an "
"tsamhail. <recursive-relationships><lazy-relationships>Oibríonn sé seo "
"díreach mar an gcéanna agus a dhéanann sé le haghaidh: class: `ForeignKey`, "
"lena n-áirítear na roghanna go léir maidir le caidrimh: ref: `recursive "
"`agus:ref: `leisciúil`."

msgid ""
"If you do not specify the :attr:`~ForeignKey.related_name` argument for the "
"``OneToOneField``, Django will use the lowercase name of the current model "
"as default value."
msgstr ""
"Mura sonraíonn tú argóint: attr: `~ForeignKey.related_name` don "
"`OneTooneField``, úsáidfidh Django ainm beaga an tsamhail reatha mar luach "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid "With the following example::"
msgstr "Leis an sampla seo a leanas::"

msgid "your resulting ``User`` model will have the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"beidh na tréithe seo a leanas ag do mhúnla ``Úsáideora ``mar thoradh air:"

msgid ""
"A ``RelatedObjectDoesNotExist`` exception is raised when accessing the "
"reverse relationship if an entry in the related table doesn't exist. This is "
"a subclass of the target model's :exc:`Model.DoesNotExist "
"<django.db.models.Model.DoesNotExist>` exception and can be accessed as an "
"attribute of the reverse accessor. For example, if a user doesn't have a "
"supervisor designated by ``MySpecialUser``::"
msgstr ""
"Ardaítear eisceacht ``RelateDObjectDoesNotExist`` nuair a bhíonn rochtain ar "
"an gcaidreamh droim mura bhfuil iontráil sa tábla gaolmhar ann. Is fo-aicme "
"é seo den eisceacht spriocmhúnla 's:exc: `Model.doesNotExist "
"<django.db.models.Model.DoesNotExist>`agus is féidir rochtain a fháil air "
"mar thréith den rochtain ar ais. Mar shampla, mura bhfuil maoirseoir ag "
"úsáideoir ainmnithe ag `MySpecialUser``:"

msgid ""
"Additionally, ``OneToOneField`` accepts all of the extra arguments accepted "
"by :class:`ForeignKey`, plus one extra argument:"
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, glacann ``OneTooneField`` leis na hargóintí breise go léir "
"a nglacaí:class: `ForeignKey`, móide argóint bhreise amháin:"

msgid ""
"When ``True`` and used in a model which inherits from "
"another :term:`concrete model`, indicates that this field should be used as "
"the link back to the parent class, rather than the extra ``OneToOneField`` "
"which would normally be implicitly created by subclassing."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a úsáidtear ``True`` agus nuair a úsáidtear i samhail a fhaigheann "
"oidhreacht ó théarma eile: `samhail coincréit`, le fios gur chóir an réimse "
"seo a úsáid mar nasc ar ais leis an rang tuismitheora, seachas an "
"`OneToonefield` breise a chruthófaí go hiontach de ghnáth trí fho-aicmiú."

msgid ""
"See :doc:`One-to-one relationships </topics/db/examples/one_to_one>` for "
"usage examples of ``OneToOneField``."
msgstr ""
"Féach: Doc: `Caidrimh duine le Duain` le haghaidh samplaí úsáide de "
"``OneToonefield`. </topics/db/examples/one_to_one>"

msgid "Lazy relationships"
msgstr "Caidrimh leisciúil"

msgid ""
"Lazy relationships allow referencing models by their names (as strings) or "
"creating recursive relationships. Strings can be used as the first argument "
"in any relationship field to reference models lazily. A lazy reference can "
"be either :ref:`recursive <recursive-relationships>`, :ref:`relative "
"<relative-relationships>` or :ref:`absolute <absolute-relationships>`."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann caidrimh leisciúla tagairt a dhéanamh do mhúnlaí dá n-ainmneacha "
"(mar teaghráin) nó caidrimh athfhillteach Is féidir teaghráin a úsáid mar an "
"chéad argóint in aon réimse caidrimh chun samhlacha a thagairt go leisciúil. "
"<relative-relationships><absolute-relationships>Is féidir tagairt leisciúil "
"a bheith fiú:ref: `recursive <recursive-relationships>`, :ref: `coibhneasta` "
"nó: ref: `absolute `."

msgid "Recursive"
msgstr "Athfhillteach"

msgid ""
"To define a relationship where a model references itself, use ``\"self\"`` "
"as the first argument of the relationship field::"
msgstr ""
"Chun caidreamh a shainiú ina dtagraíonn samhail dó féin, bain úsáid as "
"``\"féin\"`` mar an chéad argóint den réimse caidrimh:"

msgid ""
"When used in an :ref:`abstract model <abstract-base-classes>`, the recursive "
"relationship resolves such that each concrete subclass references itself."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a úsáidtear é in an:ref: `samhail teibí <abstract-base-classes>`, "
"réitíonn an caidreamh athfhillteach ionas go dtagraíonn gach fo-aicme "
"coincréite dó féin."

msgid "Relative"
msgstr "Coibhneasta"

msgid ""
"When a relationship needs to be created with a model that has not been "
"defined yet, it can be referenced by its name rather than the model object "
"itself::"
msgstr ""
"Nuair is gá caidreamh a chruthú le samhail nár sainmhíníodh go fóill, is "
"féidir tagairt a dhéanamh dá ainm seachas an réad samhail féin:"

msgid ""
"Relationships defined this way on :ref:`abstract models <abstract-base-"
"classes>` are resolved when the model is subclassed as a concrete model and "
"are not relative to the abstract model's ``app_label``:"
msgstr ""
"Réitear caidrimh a shainmhínítear ar an mbe <abstract-base-classes>alach seo "
"ar:ref: `samhlacha teibí `nuair a dhéantar an tsamhail a fho-aicmiú mar "
"mhúnla coincréite agus nach bhfuil siad coibhneasta le ``app_label`` an "
"tsamhail teibí:"

msgid "``products/models.py``"
msgstr "``táirgí/samhlach.py``"

msgid "``production/models.py``"
msgstr "``táirgeacht/samhlach.py``"

msgid ""
"In this example, the ``Car.manufacturer`` relationship will resolve to "
"``production.Manufacturer``, as it points to the concrete model defined "
"within the ``production/models.py`` file."
msgstr ""
"Sa sampla seo, réiteoidh an caidreamh ``Car.Manufacturer`` go "
"``Production.Manufacturer``, mar a thugann sé in iúl don tsamhail "
"choincréite atá sainmhínithe laistigh den chomhad ``production/models.py`."

msgid "Reusable models with relative references"
msgstr "Múnlaí in-athúsáidte le tagairtí"

msgid ""
"Relative references allow the creation of reusable abstract models with "
"relationships that can resolve to different implementations of the "
"referenced models in various subclasses across different applications."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann tagairtí coibhneasta samhlacha teibí in-athúsáidte a chruthú le "
"caidrimh ar féidir leo réiteach ar chur i bhfeidhm éagsúla na samhlacha "
"tagartha i bhfo-aicmí éagsúla"

msgid "Absolute"
msgstr "Iomlán"

msgid ""
"Absolute references specify a model using its ``app_label`` and class name, "
"allowing for model references across different applications. This type of "
"lazy relationship can also help resolve circular imports."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn tagairtí iomlána samhail ag baint úsáide as a ``app_label`` agus "
"ainm ranga, rud a cheadaíonn tagairtí samhail ar fud feidhmchláir éagsúla. "
"Is féidir leis an gcineál caidrimh leisciúil seo cabhrú le allmhairí "
"ciorclach"

msgid ""
"For example, if the ``Manufacturer`` model is defined in another application "
"called ``thirdpartyapp``, it can be referenced as::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, má shainmhínítear an tsamhail ``Monaróir ``in iarratas eile ar "
"a dtugtar ``thirdpartyapp``, is féidir tagairt a thabhairt dó mar:"

msgid ""
"Absolute references always point to the same model, even when used in "
"an :ref:`abstract model <abstract-base-classes>`."
msgstr ""
"<abstract-base-classes>Léiríonn tagairtí iomlána ar an tsamhail chéanna i "
"gcónaí, fiú nuair a úsáidtear iad in an:ref: `samhail teibí `."

msgid "Field API reference"
msgstr "Tagairt API réimse"

msgid ""
"``Field`` is an abstract class that represents a database table column. "
"Django uses fields to create the database table (:meth:`db_type`), to map "
"Python types to database (:meth:`get_prep_value`) and vice-versa "
"(:meth:`from_db_value`)."
msgstr ""
"Is aicme teibí é ``Field`` a léiríonn colún tábla bunachar sonraí. Úsáideann "
"Django réimsí chun an tábla bunachar sonraí a chruthú (:meth: `db_type`), "
"chun cineálacha Python a mhapáil go bunachar sonraí (:meth: "
"`get_prep_value`) agus a mhalairt (:meth: `from_db_value`)."

msgid ""
"A field is thus a fundamental piece in different Django APIs, "
"notably, :class:`models <django.db.models.Model>` and :class:`querysets "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet>Mar sin is píosa bunúsach é réimse in APIs "
"éagsúla Django, go háirithe, :class: `models "
"<django.db.models.Model>`agus:class: `querysets`."

msgid ""
"In models, a field is instantiated as a class attribute and represents a "
"particular table column, see :doc:`/topics/db/models`. It has attributes "
"such as :attr:`null` and :attr:`unique`, and methods that Django uses to map "
"the field value to database-specific values."
msgstr ""
"I samhlacha, cuirtear réimse mar thréith aicme agus léiríonn sé colún tábla "
"áirithe, féach:doc: `/topics/db/models`. Tá tréithe aige mar: attr: `null` "
"agus:attr: `unique`, agus modhanna a úsáideann Django chun luach an réimse a "
"mhapáil go luachanna sonracha bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"A ``Field`` is a subclass "
"of :class:`~django.db.models.lookups.RegisterLookupMixin` and thus "
"both :class:`~django.db.models.Transform` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.Lookup` can be registered on it to be used in "
"``QuerySet``\\s (e.g. ``field_name__exact=\"foo\"``). All :ref:`built-in "
"lookups <field-lookups>` are registered by default."
msgstr ""
"Is fo-aicme é `Field`` de:class: "
"`~django.db.models.lookups.registerlookupmixin` agus dá bhrí sin is féidir "
"an bheath:class: `~django.db.Models.transform` agus:class: "
"`~Django.db.Models.lookup` a chlárú air le húsáid in ``QuerySet``\\ s (m.sh. "
"`fi` eld_ainm__exact=\"foo\"``). Gach: ref: cláraítear `cuardaigh ionsuite "
"<field-lookups>`de réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"All of Django's built-in fields, such as :class:`CharField`, are particular "
"implementations of ``Field``. If you need a custom field, you can either "
"subclass any of the built-in fields or write a ``Field`` from scratch. In "
"either case, see :doc:`/howto/custom-model-fields`."
msgstr ""
"Is cur i bhfeidhm ar ``Field` iad na réimsí ionsuite go léir atá ag Django, "
"mar shampla:class: `Charfield`. Má theastaíonn réimse saincheaptha uait, is "
"féidir leat aon cheann de na réimsí ionsuite a fho-aicmiú nó ``Réimse`` a "
"scríobh ón tús. I gceachtar cás, féach:doc: `/howto/custom-model-fields`."

msgid ""
"A verbose description of the field, e.g. for "
"the :mod:`django.contrib.admindocs` application."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisc fhíorúil ar an réimse, m.sh. don iarratas:mod: "
"`django.contrib.admindocs`."

msgid "The description can be of the form::"
msgstr "Is féidir leis an tuairisc a bheith ar an bhfoirm::"

msgid "where the arguments are interpolated from the field's ``__dict__``."
msgstr "ina ndéantar na hargóintí idirphóilte ó ``__dict__`` an réimse."

msgid ""
"A class implementing the :py:ref:`descriptor protocol <descriptors>` that is "
"instantiated and assigned to the model instance attribute. The constructor "
"must accept a single argument, the ``Field`` instance. Overriding this class "
"attribute allows for customizing the get and set behavior."
msgstr ""
"Aicme a chuirtear i bhfeidhm an prótacal:py:ref: `tuairiscitheo "
"<descriptors>`a chuirtear isteach agus a shanntar don tréith samhail "
"samhail. Ní mór don tógálaí glacadh le hargóint amháin, an sampla ``Field`. "
"Ligeann an tréith aicme seo a shárú an t-iompar faigh agus socraithe a "
"shaincheapadh."

msgid ""
"To map a ``Field`` to a database-specific type, Django exposes several "
"methods:"
msgstr ""
"Chun ``Réimse`` a mhapáil go cineál sonrach don bhunachar sonraí, nochtann "
"Django roinnt modhanna:"

msgid ""
"Returns a string naming this field for backend specific purposes. By "
"default, it returns the class name."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sreang ar ais ag ainmniú an réimse seo chun críocha cúltaca sonracha. "
"De réir réamhshocraithe, filleann sé ainm an ranga ar ais."

msgid "See :ref:`emulating-built-in-field-types` for usage in custom fields."
msgstr ""
"Féach: tagairt: `cineálacha ionsuite i réimse a aithris le húsáid i réimsí "
"saincheaptha."

msgid ""
"Returns the database column data type for the :class:`Field`, taking into "
"account the ``connection``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an cineál sonraí colún bunachar sonraí ar ais don: aicme: `Réimse`, "
"agus an `nasc`` á gcur san áireamh."

msgid "See :ref:`custom-database-types` for usage in custom fields."
msgstr ""
"Féach: ref: `saincheapach-bunachar sonraí cineálach` le húsáid i réimsí "
"saincheaptha."

msgid ""
"Returns the database column data type for fields such as ``ForeignKey`` and "
"``OneToOneField`` that point to the :class:`Field`, taking into account the "
"``connection``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an cineál sonraí colún bunachar sonraí ar fáil do réimsí amhail "
"``ForeignKey`` agus ``OneTooneField`` a thugann pointe chuir:class: `Field`, "
"agus an `nasc`` á gcur san áireamh."

msgid ""
"There are three main situations where Django needs to interact with the "
"database backend and fields:"
msgstr ""
"Tá trí phríomhchás ann ina gcaithfidh Django idirghníomhú le cúltaca "
"bunachar sonraí agus réimsí:"

msgid "when it queries the database (Python value -> database backend value)"
msgstr ""
"nuair a fhiosraíonn sé an bunachar sonraí (luach Python -> luach cúltaca "
"bunachar sonraí)"

msgid ""
"when it loads data from the database (database backend value -> Python value)"
msgstr ""
"nuair a luchtaíonn sé sonraí ón mbunachar sonraí (luach cúltaca bunachar "
"sonraí -> luach Python)"

msgid "when it saves to the database (Python value -> database backend value)"
msgstr ""
"nuair a shábhálann sé ar an mbunachar sonraí (luach Python -> luach cúltaca "
"bunachar sonraí)"

msgid ""
"When querying, :meth:`get_db_prep_value` and :meth:`get_prep_value` are used:"
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag fiosrú, úsáidtear :meth: `get_db_prep_value` agus:meth: "
"`get_prep_value`:"

msgid ""
"``value`` is the current value of the model's attribute, and the method "
"should return data in a format that has been prepared for use as a parameter "
"in a query."
msgstr ""
"Is é “luach” luach reatha tréith an tsamhail, agus ba cheart don mhodh "
"sonraí a thabhairt ar ais i bhformáid atá ullmhaithe le húsáid mar "
"pharaiméadar i bhfiosrúchán."

msgid "See :ref:`converting-python-objects-to-query-values` for usage."
msgstr "Féach:ref: `tiontaire-python-objects-go-fiosrúcháin luacha' le húsáid."

msgid ""
"Converts ``value`` to a backend-specific value. By default it returns "
"``value`` if ``prepared=True`` and :meth:`~Field.get_prep_value` if is "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé ``luach`` go luach cúlghair-shonrach. De réir réamhshocraithe "
"filleann sé ``lua`` má tá ``preparad=true`` agus:meth: "
"`~field.get_prep_value` má tá ``False``."

msgid "See :ref:`converting-query-values-to-database-values` for usage."
msgstr ""
"Féach:ref: `luachanna fiosrúcháin a thiontú go luachanna bunachar sonraí` le "
"húsáid."

msgid "When loading data, :meth:`from_db_value` is used:"
msgstr "Agus sonraí á luchtú, úsáidtear: meth: `from_db_value`:"

msgid ""
"Converts a value as returned by the database to a Python object. It is the "
"reverse of :meth:`get_prep_value`."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé luach mar a thug an bunachar sonraí ar ais go réad Python. Is é "
"an cúil de:meth: `get_prep_value`."

msgid ""
"This method is not used for most built-in fields as the database backend "
"already returns the correct Python type, or the backend itself does the "
"conversion."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáidtear an modh seo don chuid is mó de na réimsí ionsuite mar go "
"bhfilleann cúltaca an bunachar sonraí an cineál ceart Python cheana féin, nó "
"déanann an cúltaca féin an tiontú."

msgid "See :ref:`converting-values-to-python-objects` for usage."
msgstr "Féach: Ref: `luachanna tiontai-go-réadanna python` le húsáid."

msgid ""
"For performance reasons, ``from_db_value`` is not implemented as a no-op on "
"fields which do not require it (all Django fields). Consequently you may not "
"call ``super`` in your definition."
msgstr ""
"Ar chúiseanna feidhmíochta, ní chuirtear `from_db_value`` i bhfeidhm mar no-"
"op ar réimsí nach dteastaíonn é (gach réimse Django). Dá bhrí sin ní féidir "
"leat glaoch ar ``super`` i do shainmhíniú."

msgid "When saving, :meth:`pre_save` and :meth:`get_db_prep_save` are used:"
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag sábháil, úsáidtear :meth: `pre_save` agus:meth: "
"`get_db_prep_save`:"

msgid ""
"Same as the :meth:`get_db_prep_value`, but called when the field value must "
"be *saved* to the database. By default returns :meth:`get_db_prep_value`."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna leis an: meth: `get_db_prep_value`, ach tugtar air nuair a "
"chaithfear luach an réimse a shábháil* sa bhunachar sonraí. De réir "
"réamhshocraithe tuairisceáin: meth: `get_db_prep_value`."

msgid ""
"Method called prior to :meth:`get_db_prep_save` to prepare the value before "
"being saved (e.g. for :attr:`DateField.auto_now`)."
msgstr ""
"Modh ar a dtugtar roimh: meth: `get_db_prep_save` chun an luach a ullmhú "
"sula ndéantar é a shábháil (m.sh. le haghaidh: attr: `Datefield.auto_now`)."

msgid ""
"``model_instance`` is the instance this field belongs to and ``add`` is "
"whether the instance is being saved to the database for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``model_instance`` an cás leis an réimse seo agus ``add`` cibé an "
"bhfuil an cás á shábháil sa bhunachar sonraí den chéad uair."

msgid ""
"It should return the value of the appropriate attribute from "
"``model_instance`` for this field. The attribute name is in ``self.attname`` "
"(this is set up by :class:`~django.db.models.Field`)."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir dó luach na tréithe cuí a thabhairt ar ais ó `model_instance`` don "
"réimse seo. Tá ainm na tréithe in ``self.attname`` (bunaítear é seo "
"ar:class: `~django.db.models.field`)."

msgid "See :ref:`preprocessing-values-before-saving` for usage."
msgstr ""
"Féach: tagairt: `luachanna réamhphróiseálaí-roimh shábháilte' le húsáid."

msgid ""
"Fields often receive their values as a different type, either from "
"serialization or from forms."
msgstr ""
"Is minic a fhaigheann réimsí a luachanna mar chineál difriúil, ó shraitheadh "
"nó ó fhoirmeacha."

msgid ""
"Converts the value into the correct Python object. It acts as the reverse "
"of :meth:`value_to_string`, and is also called "
"in :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.clean`."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé an luach isteach sa réad ceart Python. Feidhmíonn sé mar "
"chúlghair:meth: `value_to_string`, agus tugtar air freisin in:meth: "
"`~django.db.models.model.clean`."

msgid ""
"Besides saving to the database, the field also needs to know how to "
"serialize its value:"
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith le sábháil ar an mbunachar sonraí, ní mór don réimse a bheith ar "
"an eolas freisin conas a luach a shraitheadh:"

msgid "Returns the field's value for the given model instance."
msgstr "Tugann luach an réimse ar ais don shampla samhail ar leith."

msgid "This method is often used by :meth:`value_to_string`."
msgstr "Is minic a úsáideann an modh seo ó:meth: `value_to_string`."

msgid "Converts ``obj`` to a string. Used to serialize the value of the field."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé ``obj`` go sreang. Úsáidtear chun luach an réimse a shraitheadh."

msgid "See :ref:`converting-model-field-to-serialization` for usage."
msgstr "Féach: ref: `tiontai-samhail-réim-to-sraitheoireach` le húsáid."

msgid ""
"When using :class:`model forms <django.forms.ModelForm>`, the ``Field`` "
"needs to know which form field it should be represented by:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a úsáidtear: aicme: `foirmeacha samhail <django.forms.ModelForm>`, ní "
"mór go mbeadh a fhios ag an ``Réimse ``cén réimse foirme ba chóir a léiriú "
"leis:"

msgid ""
"Returns the default :class:`django.forms.Field` of this field "
"for :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an réamhshocraithe:class: `Django.Forms.Field` den réimse seo ar "
"ais chó:class: `~Django.Forms.ModelForm`."

msgid ""
"If :meth:`~Field.formfield` is overridden to return ``None``, this field is "
"excluded from the :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"By default, if both ``form_class`` and ``choices_form_class`` are ``None``, "
"it uses :class:`~django.forms.CharField`. If the field "
"has :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.choices` and ``choices_form_class`` isn't "
"specified, it uses :class:`~django.forms.TypedChoiceField`."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, má tá ``form_class`` agus ``choices_form_class`` "
"``None ``araon, úsáideann sé: class: `~django.forms.charfield`. Mura bhfuil: "
"attr: `~django.db.models.field.choices` agus ``choices_form_class`` "
"sonraithe sa réimse, úsáideann se:class: `~django.forms.typedChoiceField`."

msgid "See :ref:`specifying-form-field-for-model-field` for usage."
msgstr ""
"Féach: tagairt: `sonraitheach-foirm-réimse-for-mhúnla-réimse` le húsáid."

msgid "Returns a 4-tuple with enough information to recreate the field:"
msgstr "Filleann sé 4-tuple le go leor faisnéise chun an réimse a athchruthú:"

msgid "The name of the field on the model."
msgstr "Ainm an réimse ar an tsamhail."

msgid ""
"The import path of the field (e.g. ``\"django.db.models.IntegerField\"``). "
"This should be the most portable version, so less specific may be better."
msgstr ""
"Conair allmhairithe an réimse (m.sh. ``\"Django.db.Models.IntegerField\"``). "
"Ba chóir gurb é seo an leagan is iniompartha, mar sin b'fhéidir go mbeadh "
"níos lú sonrach níos fearr."

msgid "A list of positional arguments."
msgstr "Liosta de na hargóintí seasaimh."

msgid "A dict of keyword arguments."
msgstr "Argóintí eochairfhocal."

msgid ""
"This method must be added to fields prior to 1.7 to migrate its data "
"using :doc:`/topics/migrations`."
msgstr ""
"Caithfear an modh seo a chur le réimsí roimh 1.7 chun a chuid sonraí a "
"aistriú ag baint úsáide:doc: `/topics/imirceas`."

msgid "Registering and fetching lookups"
msgstr "Cuardaigh a chlárú agus a fháil"

msgid ""
"``Field`` implements the :ref:`lookup registration API <lookup-registration-"
"api>`. The API can be used to customize which lookups are available for a "
"field class and its instances, and how lookups are fetched from a field."
msgstr ""
"<lookup-registration-api>Cuireann ``Field`` an API cláraithe cuardaithe:ref: "
"`cuardach i bhfeidhm. Is féidir an API a úsáid chun na cuardaigh atá ar fáil "
"do rang allamuigh agus a chásanna a shaincheapadh, agus conas a bhfaightear "
"cuardaigh ó réimse."

msgid "Field attribute reference"
msgstr "Tagairt tréithe réimse"

msgid ""
"Every ``Field`` instance contains several attributes that allow "
"introspecting its behavior. Use these attributes instead of ``isinstance`` "
"checks when you need to write code that depends on a field's functionality. "
"These attributes can be used together with the :ref:`Model._meta API <model-"
"meta-field-api>` to narrow down a search for specific field types. Custom "
"model fields should implement these flags."
msgstr ""
"Tá roinnt tréithe i ngach cás ``Field` a cheadaíonn a iompar a "
"inmheasachaint. Úsáid na tréithe seo in ionad seiceálacha `isinstance` nuair "
"is gá duit cód a scríobh atá ag brath ar fheidhmiúlacht réimse. Is féidir na "
"tréithe seo a úsáid in éineacht leis an múnla:ref: `Samhail. _meta API "
"<model-meta-field-api>`chun cuardach do chineálacha réimse ar leith a "
"chúngú. Ba chóir go gcuirfeadh réimsí samhail saincheaptha na bratacha"

msgid "Attributes for fields"
msgstr "Tréithe do réimsí"

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that indicates if the field was automatically created, such as "
"the ``OneToOneField`` used by model inheritance."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean a thugann le fios an cruthaíodh an réimse go huathoibríoch, "
"mar shampla an `Onetoonefield`` a úsáideann oidhreacht mhúnla."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that indicates if the field has a database column associated "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean a léiríonn an bhfuil colún bunachar sonraí a bhaineann leis "
"an réimse."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that indicates if a field is hidden and should not be returned "
"by :meth:`Options.get_fields() "
"<django.db.models.options.Options.get_fields>` by default. An example is the "
"reverse field for a :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` with a "
"``related_name`` that starts with ``'+'``."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.options.Options.get_fields>Bratach Boolean a léiríonn an "
"bhfuil réimse i bhfolach agus nár chóir é a thabhairt ar ais ag: meth: "
"`Options.get_fields () `de réir réamhshocraithe. Sampla is ea an réimse "
"droim le haghaidh a:class: `~django.db.models.foreignKey` le "
"``related_name`` a thosaíonn le ```+'``."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that indicates if a field contains references to one or more "
"other models for its functionality (e.g. ``ForeignKey``, "
"``ManyToManyField``, ``OneToOneField``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean a thugann le fios an bhfuil tagairtí do mhúnla amháin nó "
"níos mó eile i réimse maidir lena fheidhmiúlacht (m.sh. `ForeignKey``, "
"`ManyTomanyField``, `OnetooneField``, srl.)."

msgid ""
"Returns the model on which the field is defined. If a field is defined on a "
"superclass of a model, ``model`` will refer to the superclass, not the class "
"of the instance."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an tsamhail ar a bhfuil an réimse sainmhínithe ar ais. Má "
"shainmhínítear réimse ar sháraicme de mhúnla, tagróidh ``samhail ``don "
"sáraicme, ní do rang an cháis."

msgid "Attributes for fields with relations"
msgstr "Tréithe do réimsí le caidreamh"

msgid ""
"These attributes are used to query for the cardinality and other details of "
"a relation. These attribute are present on all fields; however, they will "
"only have boolean values (rather than ``None``) if the field is a relation "
"type (:attr:`Field.is_relation=True <Field.is_relation>`)."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear na tréithe seo chun ceist a dhéanamh ar chardánacht agus sonraí "
"eile gaol. <Field.is_relation>Tá na tréithe seo i láthair ar gach réimse; "
"áfach, ní bheidh ach luachanna boolean acu (seachas ``None ``) más cineál "
"caidrimh é an réimse (:attr: `field.is_relations = True `)."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that is ``True`` if the field has a many-to-many relation; "
"``False`` otherwise. The only field included with Django where this is "
"``True`` is ``ManyToManyField``."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean atá ``Fíor-`` má tá gaol go leor ag an réimse; ``Fréag`` ar "
"shlí eile. Is é ``ManyTomanyField`` an t-aon réimse atá san áireamh le "
"Django ina bhfuil sé seo ``True``."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that is ``True`` if the field has a many-to-one relation, such "
"as a ``ForeignKey``; ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean atá ``True`` má tá gaol go leor le duine ag an réimse, mar "
"shampla ``ForeignKey``; ``Fréag`` ar shlí eile."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that is ``True`` if the field has a one-to-many relation, such "
"as a ``GenericRelation`` or the reverse of a ``ForeignKey``; ``False`` "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean atá “Fíor” má tá gaol duine le go leor ag an réimse, mar "
"shampla ``GinearicRelation`` nó cúl ``ForeignKey``; ``Fréag`` ar shlí eile."

msgid ""
"Boolean flag that is ``True`` if the field has a one-to-one relation, such "
"as a ``OneToOneField``; ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Bratach Boolean atá ``True`` má tá gaol duine le duine ag an réimse, mar "
"shampla ``OneTooneField``; ``False`` eile."

msgid ""
"Points to the model the field relates to. For example, ``Author`` in "
"``ForeignKey(Author, on_delete=models.CASCADE)``. The ``related_model`` for "
"a ``GenericForeignKey`` is always ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Pointí leis an tsamhail a bhaineann an réimse leis. Mar shampla, ``Údar`` i "
"`ForeignKey (Author, on_delete=Models.Cascade) ``. Is é “None” i gcónaí an "
"`model_gaolmhar ``do `GenericForeignKey``."

msgid ""
"Model API reference. For introductory material, see :doc:`/topics/db/models`."
msgstr ""
"Tagairt API múnla. Maidir le hábhar tosaigh, féach:doc: `/topics/db/models`."

msgid "Model index reference"
msgstr "Tagairt innéacs múnla"

msgid ""
"Index classes ease creating database indexes. They can be added using "
"the :attr:`Meta.indexes <django.db.models.Options.indexes>` option. This "
"document explains the API references of :class:`Index` which includes the "
"`index options`_."
msgstr ""
"Éascaíonn ranganna innéacsanna bunachar sonraí a chruthú. "
"<django.db.models.Options.indexes>Is féidir iad a chur leis ag baint úsáide "
"as an rogha: attr: `Meta.Indexes `. Míníonn an doiciméad seo na tagairtí API "
"de:class: `Innéacs` lena n-áirítear na `roghanna innéacs`_."

msgid "Referencing built-in indexes"
msgstr "Tagairt a thabhairt do innéacsanna ionsuite"

msgid ""
"Indexes are defined in ``django.db.models.indexes``, but for convenience "
"they're imported into :mod:`django.db.models`. The standard convention is to "
"use ``from django.db import models`` and refer to the indexes as ``models."
"<IndexClass>``."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear innéacsanna in `django.db.models.indexes``, ach ar mhaithe le "
"háisiúlacht déantar iad a allmhairiú chuig: mod: `django.db.models`. Is é an "
"coinbhinsiún caighdeánach ná ``ó samhlacha allmhairiúcháin django.db ``a "
"úsáid agus tagairt a dhéanamh do na hinnéacsanna mar `samhlacha. "
"<IndexClass>``."

msgid "``Index`` options"
msgstr "Roghanna ``Innéacs ``"

msgid "Creates an index (B-Tree) in the database."
msgstr "Cruthaíonn innéacs (B-Tree) sa bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"Positional argument ``*expressions`` allows creating functional indexes on "
"expressions and database functions."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann argóint seasaimh ``*léirithe ``innéacsanna feidhmiúla a chruthú ar "
"nathanna agus ar fheidhmeanna bunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"creates an index on the lowercased value of the ``title`` field in "
"descending order and the ``pub_date`` field in the default ascending order."
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn innéacs ar luach íseal an réimse ``title`` in ord íslitheach agus "
"an réimse ``pub_date`` san ord ardaitheach réamhshocraithe."

msgid "Another example::"
msgstr "Sampla eile::"

msgid ""
"creates an index on the result of multiplying fields ``height`` and "
"``weight`` and the ``weight`` rounded to the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"cruthaíonn innéacs ar thoradh na réimsí iolraithe ``airde`` agus ``meách`` "
"agus an `meách`` cruinn go dtí an sláimhir is gaire."

msgid ":attr:`Index.name` is required when using ``*expressions``."
msgstr ":attr: Tá `Index.name` ag teastáil nuair a úsáidtear ``*sainráidí ``."

msgid "Restrictions on Oracle"
msgstr "Srianta ar Oracle"

msgid ""
"Oracle requires functions referenced in an index to be marked as "
"``DETERMINISTIC``. Django doesn't validate this but Oracle will error. This "
"means that functions such as :class:`Random() "
"<django.db.models.functions.Random>` aren't accepted."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn Oracle go ndéanfar feidhmeanna dá dtagraítear in innéacs a mharcáil "
"mar “DETERMINISTIC”. Ní bhailíochnaíonn Django é seo ach déanfaidh Oracle "
"earráid. Ciallaíonn sé seo nach nglactar le feidhmeanna mar: class: `Random "
"() <django.db.models.functions.Random>`."

msgid "Restrictions on PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Srianta ar PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL requires functions and operators referenced in an index to be "
"marked as ``IMMUTABLE``. Django doesn't validate this but PostgreSQL will "
"error. This means that functions such as :class:`Concat() "
"<django.db.models.functions.Concat>` aren't accepted."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn PostgreSQL go ndéanfar feidhmeanna agus oibreoirí dá dtagraítear in "
"innéacs a mharcálfar mar “IMMUTABLE”. Ní bhailíochnaíonn Django é seo ach "
"déanfaidh PostgreSQL earráid. Ciallaíonn sé seo nach nglactar le feidhmeanna "
"mar: class: `Concat () <django.db.models.functions.Concat>`."

msgid ""
"Functional indexes are ignored with MySQL < 8.0.13 and MariaDB as neither "
"supports them."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar innéacsanna feidhmiúla le MySQL <8.0.13 agus MariaDB "
"mar ní thacaíonn ceachtar acu leo."

msgid ""
"A list or tuple of the name of the fields on which the index is desired."
msgstr "Liosta nó tuple d'ainm na réimsí ar teastaíonn an t-innéacs orthu."

msgid ""
"By default, indexes are created with an ascending order for each column. To "
"define an index with a descending order for a column, add a hyphen before "
"the field's name."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, cruthaítear innéacsanna le ord ardaitheach do gach "
"colún. Chun innéacs a shainiú le hordú íslitheach do cholún, cuir hiphen "
"roimh ainm an réimse."

msgid ""
"For example ``Index(fields=['headline', '-pub_date'])`` would create SQL "
"with ``(headline, pub_date DESC)``."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla ``Index (fields= ['ceannteideal', '-pub_date']) ``chruthódh SQL "
"le`` (ceannteideal, pub_date DESC) ``."

msgid ""
"Index ordering isn't supported on MariaDB < 10.8. In that case, a descending "
"index is created as a normal index."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le hordú innéacs ar MariaDB <10.8. Sa chás sin, cruthaítear "
"innéacs íslitheach mar ghnáthinnéacs."

msgid ""
"The name of the index. If ``name`` isn't provided Django will auto-generate "
"a name. For compatibility with different databases, index names cannot be "
"longer than 30 characters and shouldn't start with a number (0-9) or "
"underscore (_)."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an innéacs. Mura gcuirtear ``ainm ``ar fáil, ginfidh Django ainm go "
"huathoibríoch. Maidir le comhoiriúnacht le bunachair sonraí éagsúla, ní "
"féidir ainmneacha innéacs a bheith níos faide ná 30 carachtar agus níor "
"cheart tosú le huimhir (0-9) nó béim (_)."

msgid "Partial indexes in abstract base classes"
msgstr "Innéacsanna páirteach i ranganna bonn teibí"

msgid ""
"You must always specify a unique name for an index. As such, you cannot "
"normally specify a partial index on an abstract base class, since "
"the :attr:`Meta.indexes <django.db.models.Options.indexes>` option is "
"inherited by subclasses, with exactly the same values for the attributes "
"(including ``name``) each time. To work around name collisions, part of the "
"name may contain ``'%(app_label)s'`` and ``'%(class)s'``, which are "
"replaced, respectively, by the lowercased app label and class name of the "
"concrete model. For example ``Index(fields=['title'], name='%(app_label)s_%"
"(class)s_title_index')``."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór duit ainm uathúil a shonrú i gcónaí le haghaidh innéacs. Mar sin, ní "
"féidir leat innéacs páirteach a shonrú de ghnáth ar rang bonn teibí, ós rud "
"é go ndéantar an ro <django.db.models.Options.indexes>gha: attr: "
"`Meta.Indexes `oidhreachta de réir fo-aicmí, leis na luachanna céanna go "
"díreach do na tréithe (lena n-áirítear ``ainm ``) gach uair. Chun oibriú "
"timpeall ar imbhuailtí ainmneacha, d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``'% (app_label) "
"s'`` agus ```% (class) s'``, ina gcuirtear lipéad aip íseal agus ainm aicme "
"an tsamhail choincréite in ionad, faoi seach, ina ionad. Mar shampla "
"``Innéacs (fields= ['title'], ainm = '% (app_label) s_% (class) "
"s_title_index') ``."

msgid ""
"The name of the :doc:`database tablespace </topics/db/tablespaces>` to use "
"for this index. For single field indexes, if ``db_tablespace`` isn't "
"provided, the index is created in the ``db_tablespace`` of the field."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an:doc: `spás tábla bunachar sonraí` le húsáid don innéacs seo. </"
"topics/db/tablespaces> Maidir le hinnéacsanna réimse aonair, mura gcuirtear "
"`db_tablespace`` ar fáil, cruthaítear an t-innéacs sa `db_tablespace`` sa "
"réimse."

msgid ""
"If :attr:`.Field.db_tablespace` isn't specified (or if the index uses "
"multiple fields), the index is created in tablespace specified in "
"the :attr:`~django.db.models.Options.db_tablespace` option inside the "
"model's ``class Meta``. If neither of those tablespaces are set, the index "
"is created in the same tablespace as the table."
msgstr ""
"Má shonraítear: Attr: `.field.db_TableSpace` (nó má úsáideann an t-innéacs "
"réimsí iolracha), cruthaítear an t-innéacs i spás tábla a shonraítear "
"in:attr: `~django.db.models.options.db_TableSpace` rogha `aicme Meta`` an "
"tsamhail. Mura socraítear ceachtar de na spásanna tábla sin, cruthaítear an "
"t-innéacs san spás tábla céanna leis an tábla."

msgid ""
"For a list of PostgreSQL-specific indexes, "
"see :mod:`django.contrib.postgres.indexes`."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh liosta de na hinnéacsanna sonracha PostgreSQL, féach:mod: "
"`django.contrib.postgres.indexes`."

msgid ""
"The names of the `PostgreSQL operator classes <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/indexes-opclass.html>`_ to use for this index. If you require a "
"custom operator class, you must provide one for each field in the index."
msgstr ""
"< https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/indexes-opclass.html>Ainmneacha na "
"`ranganna oibreora PostgreSQL `_ le húsáid don innéacs seo. Má theastaíonn "
"rang oibreora saincheaptha uait, ní mór duit ceann a sholáthar do gach "
"réimse san innéacs."

msgid ""
"For example, ``GinIndex(name='json_index', fields=['jsonfield'], "
"opclasses=['jsonb_path_ops'])`` creates a gin index on ``jsonfield`` using "
"``jsonb_path_ops``."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, ``gIndex (name='json_index', fields= ['jsonfield'], opclasses= "
"['jsonb_path_ops']) ``cruthaíonn innéacs gin ar ``jsonfield`` ag baint "
"úsáide as ``jsonb_path_ops``."

msgid ":attr:`Index.name` is required when using ``opclasses``."
msgstr ":attr: Tá `index.name` ag teastáil nuair a úsáidtear ``opclasses``."

msgid ""
"If the table is very large and your queries mostly target a subset of rows, "
"it may be useful to restrict an index to that subset. Specify a condition as "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.Q`. For example, ``condition=Q(pages__gt=400)`` "
"indexes records with more than 400 pages."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an tábla an-mhór agus má dhíríonn d'fhiosrúcháin ar fho-thacar "
"sraitheanna den chuid is mó, d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith úsáideach innéacs a "
"shrianadh don fho-thacar sin. Sonraigh coinníoll mar a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.q`. Mar shampla, innéacsaíonn ``Condition=Q "
"(pages__gt=400) ``taifid le níos mó ná 400 leathanach."

msgid ":attr:`Index.name` is required when using ``condition``."
msgstr ":attr: Tá `index.name` ag teastáil nuair a úsáidtear ``condition``."

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL requires functions referenced in the condition to be marked as "
"IMMUTABLE. Django doesn't validate this but PostgreSQL will error. This "
"means that functions such as :ref:`date-functions` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.functions.Concat` aren't accepted. If you "
"store dates in :class:`~django.db.models.DateTimeField`, comparison "
"to :class:`~datetime.datetime` objects may require the ``tzinfo`` argument "
"to be provided because otherwise the comparison could result in a mutable "
"function due to the casting Django does for :ref:`lookups <field-lookups>`."
msgstr ""
"Éilíonn PostgreSQL go ndéanfar feidhmeanna dá dtagraítear sa choinníoll a "
"mharcáil mar IMMUTABLE. Ní bhailíochnaíonn Django é seo ach déanfaidh "
"PostgreSQL earráid. Ciallaíonn sé seo nach nglactar le feidhmeanna mar: ref: "
"`date-functions` agus:class: `~django.db.models.functions.concat`. <field-"
"lookups>Má stóráil tú dátaí in:class: `~django.db.Models.DateTimeField`, "
"d'fhéadfadh go gcaithfear an argóint ``tzinfo`` a sholáthar mar shlí eile "
"d'fhéadfadh feidhm inathraithe a bheith mar thoradh ar an gcomparáid mar "
"gheall ar an réitigh a dhéanann Django le haghaidh: `lookups `."

msgid "Restrictions on SQLite"
msgstr "Srianta ar SQLite"

msgid ""
"SQLite `imposes restrictions <https://www.sqlite.org/partialindex.html>`_ on "
"how a partial index can be constructed."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann SQLite srianta ar an gcaoi ar féidir innéacs páirteach < https://"
"www.sqlite.org/partialindex.html> a thógáil."

msgid ""
"Oracle does not support partial indexes. Instead, partial indexes can be "
"emulated by using functional indexes together "
"with :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.Case` expressions."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn Oracle le hinnéacsanna páirteach. Ina áit sin, is féidir "
"innéacsanna páirteach a aithris trí innéacsanna feidhmiúla a úsáid in "
"éineacht le:class: `~django.db.Models.Expressions.case` abairtí."

msgid ""
"The ``condition`` argument is ignored with MySQL and MariaDB as neither "
"supports conditional indexes."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar an argóint ``coinníoll`` le MySQL agus MariaDB toisc "
"nach dtacaíonn ceachtar le hinnéacsanna coinníollacha."

msgid ""
"A list or tuple of the names of the fields to be included in the covering "
"index as non-key columns. This allows index-only scans to be used for "
"queries that select only included fields (:attr:`~Index.include`) and filter "
"only by indexed fields (:attr:`~Index.fields`)."
msgstr ""
"Liosta nó tuple d'ainmneacha na réimsí atá le cur san innéacs clúdaigh mar "
"cholúin neamh-eochair. Ligeann sé seo scananna innéacs amháin a úsáid le "
"haghaidh ceisteanna nach roghnaíonn ach réimsí san áireamh (:attr: "
"`~index.include`) agus ní scagann ach amháin de réir réimsí innéacsaithe "
"(:attr: `~index.fields`)."

msgid ""
"will allow filtering on ``headline``, also selecting ``pub_date``, while "
"fetching data only from the index."
msgstr ""
"ceadóidh sé scagadh ar ``ceannlíne ``, ag roghnú `pub_date`` freisin, agus "
"sonraí a thógáil ón innéacs amháin."

msgid ""
"Using ``include`` will produce a smaller index than using a multiple column "
"index but with the drawback that non-key columns can not be used for sorting "
"or filtering."
msgstr ""
"Beidh innéacs níos lú ag baint úsáide as ``include` ná innéacs iolcholún a "
"úsáid ach leis an míbhuntáiste nach féidir colúin neamh-eochracha a úsáid "
"chun sórtáil nó scagadh."

msgid "``include`` is ignored for databases besides PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Déantar neamhaird ar ``include`` do bhunachair sonraí seachas PostgreSQL."

msgid ":attr:`Index.name` is required when using ``include``."
msgstr ":attr: Tá `index.name` ag teastáil nuair a úsáidtear ``include``."

msgid ""
"See the PostgreSQL documentation for more details about `covering indexes`_."
msgstr ""
"Féach doiciméadú PostgreSQL le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí faoi `innéacsanna a "
"chlúdach `_."

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL supports covering B-Tree and :class:`GiST indexes "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GistIndex>`. PostgreSQL 14+ also supports "
"covering :class:`SP-GiST indexes "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.SpGistIndex>`."
msgstr ""
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.GistIndex>Tacaíonn PostgreSQL le clúdach B-"
"Tree agus:class: `Innéacsanna Gist `. "
"<django.contrib.postgres.indexes.SpGistIndex>Tacaíonn PostgreSQL 14+ le "
"clúdach freisin: class: `Innéacsanna SP-GIST `."

