"This document describes the details of the ``Model`` API. It builds on the "
"material presented in the :doc:`model </topics/db/models>` "
"and :doc:`database query </topics/db/queries>` guides, so you'll probably "
"want to read and understand those documents before reading this one."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an doiciméad seo cur síos ar shonraí an API ``Samhail ``. Tógann sé "
"ar an ábhar a chuirtear i láthair sna treoracha: doc: `model` agus:doc: "
"`ceisteanna bunachar sonraí` </topics/db/models>, mar sin is dócha go mbeidh "
"tú ag iarraidh na do</topics/db/queries> iciméid sin a léamh agus a "
"thuiscint sula léann tú an ceann seo."

msgid ""
"Throughout this reference we'll use the :ref:`example blog models <queryset-"
"model-example>` presented in the :doc:`database query guide </topics/db/"
"queries>`."
msgstr ""
"Le linn na tagartha seo úsáidfimid an:ref: `samplacha samplaí blag </topics/"
"db/queries> <queryset-model-example>`a chuirtear i láthair in:doc: `treoir "
"fiosrúcháin bunachar sonraithe'."

msgid "Creating objects"
msgstr "Cruthú rudaí"

msgid ""
"To create a new instance of a model, instantiate it like any other Python "
"class:"
msgstr ""
"Chun sampla nua de mhúnla a chruthú, cuir isteach é cosúil le haon rang "
