msgstr ""
"Úsáid: Class: `.UniqueConstraint` leis an rogha: attr: "
"`~Options.Constraints` ina ionad."

msgid ""
":class:`.UniqueConstraint` provides more functionality than "
"``unique_together``. ``unique_together`` may be deprecated in the future."
msgstr ""
":class: Soláthraíonn `.UniqueConstraint` níos mó feidhmiúlachta ná "
"``unique_together``. D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ``unique_together ``a dhíchur "
"amach anseo."

msgid "Sets of field names that, taken together, must be unique::"
msgstr ""
"Tacair ainmneacha réimse a chaithfidh, a thógtar le chéile, a bheith uathúil:"

msgid ""
"This is a list of lists that must be unique when considered together. It's "
"used in the Django admin and is enforced at the database level (i.e., the "
"appropriate ``UNIQUE`` statements are included in the ``CREATE TABLE`` "
"statement)."
msgstr ""
"Seo liosta de na liostaí a chaithfidh a bheith uathúil nuair a mheastar le "
"chéile. Úsáidtear é i riarachán Django agus cuirtear i bhfeidhm ar leibhéal "
"an bhunachar sonraí (ie, tá na ráitis chuí ``UNIQUE`` san áireamh sa ráiteas "
"``CREATE TABLE``)."

msgid ""
"For convenience, ``unique_together`` can be a single list when dealing with "
"a single set of fields::"
msgstr ""
"Ar mhaithe le háisiúlacht, is féidir le ``unique_together ``a bheith ina "
"liosta amháin agus tú ag déileáil le sraith amháin réimsí:"

msgid ""
"A :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField` cannot be included in "
"``unique_together``. (It's not clear what that would even mean!) If you need "
"to validate uniqueness related to "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField`, try using a signal or an "
"explicit :attr:`through <ManyToManyField.through>` model."
msgstr ""
"A: Aicme: `~Django.db.Models.ManyTomanyField` ní féidir a chur san áireamh i "
"``unique_together ``. (Níl sé soiléir cad a chiallódh sé sin fiú!) "
"<ManyToManyField.through>Más gá duit uathúlacht a bhaineann le a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.manyToManyField` a bhailíochtú, déan iarracht comhartha "
"nó samhail explicit:attr: `through `a úsáid."

msgid ""
"The ``ValidationError`` raised during model validation when the constraint "
"is violated has the ``unique_together`` error code."
msgstr ""
"Tá an cód earráide ``unique_together ``sa `ValidationError`` a ardaítear le "
"linn bailíochtaithe samhail nuair a sháraítear an srian."

msgid "``constraints``"
msgstr "``srianta ``"

msgid ""
"A list of :doc:`constraints </ref/models/constraints>` that you want to "
"define on the model::"
msgstr ""
"Liosta de:doc: `sriantaine` ar mhaith leat a shainiú </ref/models/"
"constraints> ar an tsamhail::"

msgid "A human-readable name for the object, singular::"
msgstr "Ainm inléite don duine don réad, uathúil:"

msgid ""
"If this isn't given, Django will use a munged version of the class name: "
"``CamelCase`` becomes ``camel case``."
msgstr ""
"Mura dtugtar é seo, úsáidfidh Django leagan de ainm an ranga: ``Camelcase`` "
"éiríonn ```cás camel``."

msgid "``verbose_name_plural``"
msgstr "``ainm_verbose_plural``"

msgid "The plural name for the object::"
msgstr "An t-ainm iolra don réad::"

