"If this isn't given, Django will use :attr:`~Options.verbose_name` + "
"``\"s\"``."
msgstr ""
"Mura dtugtar é seo, úsáidfidh Django: attr: `~options.verbose_name` + "
"``\"s\"``."

msgid "Read-only ``Meta`` attributes"
msgstr "Tréithe ``Meta`` atá le léamh amháin"

