"it efficiently in SQL."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach bhfuil sé seo mar an gcéanna le slisnú ó dheireadh "
"seicheamh i Python. Tabharfaidh an sampla thuas an mír deireanach ar ais ar "
"dtús, ansin an mír leathdheiridh agus mar sin de. Dá mbeadh seicheamh Python "
"againn agus dá bhféachfaimis ar ``seq [-5:] ``, feicfimid an cúigiú mír "
"deireanach ar dtús. Ní thacaíonn Django leis an modh rochtana sin (slisnú ón "
"deireadh), toisc nach féidir é a dhéanamh go héifeachtúil i SQL."

msgid ""
"Also, note that ``reverse()`` should generally only be called on a "
"``QuerySet`` which has a defined ordering (e.g., when querying against a "
