"since a ``QuerySet`` was evaluated, you can get updated results for the same "
"query by calling ``all()`` on a previously evaluated ``QuerySet``."
msgstr ""
"<when-querysets-are-evaluated>Nuair a bhíonn ``QuerySet``: ref: "
"`meastóireacht `, is gnách go ndéanann sé a thorthaí a chosc. Má d'fhéadfadh "
