msgid "And here's ``select_related`` lookup::"
msgstr "Agus seo cuardach ``select_related``:"

msgid "You can use ``select_related()`` with any queryset of objects::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat ``select_related () ``a úsáid le haon tacar ceisteanna rudaí:"

msgid ""
"The order of ``filter()`` and ``select_related()`` chaining isn't important. "
