msgstr ""
"Níl an t-ord a bhaineann le slabhraíocht ``filter () ``agus ``select_related "
"()`` tábhachtach. Tá na ceisteanna ceisteanna seo coibhéiseach::"

msgid ""
"You can follow foreign keys in a similar way to querying them. If you have "
"the following models::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat eochracha eachtracha a leanúint ar bhealach cosúil leo a "
"cheistiú. Má tá na samhlacha seo a leanas agat::"

msgid ""
"... then a call to "
"``Book.objects.select_related('author__hometown').get(id=4)`` will cache the "
"related ``Person`` *and* the related ``City``::"
msgstr ""
"... ansin glao chuig ``Book.Objects.select_related ('author__baile') .get "
"(id=4) ``taisceoidh an ``Person`` gaolmhar agus* an ``Cathair`` gaolmhar:"

msgid ""
"You can refer to any :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` "
"or :class:`~django.db.models.OneToOneField` relation in the list of fields "
"passed to ``select_related()``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat tagairt a dhéanamh d'aon ghaol:class: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignKey` nó:class: `~django.db.models.onetoonefield` "
"sa liosta réimsí a chuirtear chuig ``select_related () ``."

msgid ""
"You can also refer to the reverse direction of "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.OneToOneField` in the list of fields passed to "
"``select_related`` — that is, you can traverse "
"a :class:`~django.db.models.OneToOneField` back to the object on which the "
"field is defined. Instead of specifying the field name, use "
"the :attr:`related_name <django.db.models.ForeignKey.related_name>` for the "
"field on the related object."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat tagairt a dhéanamh freisin do threo droim a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.onetoonefield` sa liosta réimsí a chuirtear chuig "
"``select_related`` - is é sin, is féidir leat a:class: "
"`~django.db.models.onetoonefield` a thrasnú ar ais go dtí an réad ar a "
"sainmhínítear an réimse. In ionad ainm an réimse a shonrú, bain úsáid as "
"an:attr: `related_name <django.db.models.ForeignKey.related_name>`don réimse "
"ar an réad gaolmhar."

msgid ""
"There may be some situations where you wish to call ``select_related()`` "
"with a lot of related objects, or where you don't know all of the relations. "
"In these cases it is possible to call ``select_related()`` with no "
"arguments. This will follow all non-null foreign keys it can find - nullable "
"foreign keys must be specified. This is not recommended in most cases as it "
"is likely to make the underlying query more complex, and return more data, "
"than is actually needed."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh roinnt cásanna ann inar mian leat glaoch ar "
"``select_related () ``le go leor rudaí gaolmhara, nó nuair nach bhfuil a "
"fhios agat na caidrimh go léir. Sna cásanna seo is féidir glaoch ar "
"``select_related () ``gan aon argóintí. Leanfaidh sé seo gach eochracha "
"eachtracha neamh-neamh-niall is féidir leis a fháil - caithfear eochracha "
"eachtracha in-neamhnaithe a Ní mholtar é seo i bhformhór na gcásanna mar is "
"dócha go ndéanfaidh sé an ceist bhunúsach níos casta, agus níos mó sonraí a "
"thabhairt ar ais, ná mar a theastaíonn i ndáiríre."

msgid ""
"If you need to clear the list of related fields added by past calls of "
"``select_related`` on a ``QuerySet``, you can pass ``None`` as a parameter:"
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit an liosta réimsí gaolmhara a chuir leis na glaonna roimhe seo de "
"`select_related`` a ghlanadh ar ``QuerySet``, is féidir leat ``None`` a rith "
"mar pharaiméadar:"

msgid ""
"Chaining ``select_related`` calls works in a similar way to other methods - "
"that is that ``select_related('foo', 'bar')`` is equivalent to "
"``select_related('foo').select_related('bar')``."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn glaonna ``select_related`` a shlánú ar bhealach cosúil le modhanna "
"eile - is é sin go bhfuil ``select_related ('foo', 'bar') ``comhionann le "
"``select_related ('foo') .select_related ('bar')``."

msgid "``prefetch_related()``"
msgstr "``prefetch_related () ``"

msgid ""
"Returns a ``QuerySet`` that will automatically retrieve, in a single batch, "
"related objects for each of the specified lookups."
msgstr ""
"Tugann “QuerySet” ar ais a aisghabhann rudaí gaolmhara go huathoibríoch, i "
"mbaisc amháin, do gach ceann de na cuardaigh sonraithe."

msgid ""
"This has a similar purpose to ``select_related``, in that both are designed "
"to stop the deluge of database queries that is caused by accessing related "
"objects, but the strategy is quite different."
msgstr ""
"Tá cuspóir comhchosúil aige seo le `select_related`, sa mhéid go bhfuil an "
"dá cheann deartha chun stop a chur le tuilleadh ceisteanna bunachar sonraí "
"is cúis le rochtain a fháil ar rudaí gaolmhara, ach tá an straitéis an-"
"difriúil."

msgid ""
"``select_related`` works by creating an SQL join and including the fields of "
"the related object in the ``SELECT`` statement. For this reason, "
"``select_related`` gets the related objects in the same database query. "
"However, to avoid the much larger result set that would result from joining "
"across a 'many' relationship, ``select_related`` is limited to single-valued "
"relationships - foreign key and one-to-one."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn ``select_related`` trí chomhcheangal SQL a chruthú agus réimsí an "
"réada gaolmhara a áireamh sa ráiteas ``SELECT``. Ar an gcúis seo, faigheann "
"``select_related`` na rudaí gaolmhara san fhiosrúchán bunachar sonraí "
"céanna. Mar sin féin, chun an tacar torthaí i bhfad níos mó a bheadh as dul "
"isteach i rith caidreamh 'go leor' a sheachaint, tá ``select_related`` "
"teoranta do chaidrimh aonluach - eochair eachtrach agus duine le duine."

msgid ""
"``prefetch_related``, on the other hand, does a separate lookup for each "
"relationship, and does the 'joining' in Python. This allows it to prefetch "
"many-to-many, many-to-one, "
"and :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericRelation` objects "
"which cannot be done using ``select_related``, in addition to the foreign "
"key and one-to-one relationships that are supported by ``select_related``. "
"It also supports prefetching "
"of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey`, however, "
"the queryset for each ``ContentType`` must be provided in the ``querysets`` "
"parameter of :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.prefetch.GenericPrefetch`."
msgstr ""
"Ar an láimh eile, déanann ``prefetch_related`` cuardach ar leithligh do gach "
"caidreamh, agus déanann sé an 'ceangal' i Python. Ligeann sé seo dó rudaí go "
"leor, go leor, agus:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.Fields.GenericRelation` nach féidir a dhéanamh "
"ag baint úsáide as `select_related``, chomh maith leis na caidrimh eochair "
"eachtracha agus duine le duine a thacaíonn le `select_related``. Tacaíonn sé "
"freisin le réamhghabháil o:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.fields.GenericForeignKey`, áfach, ní mór an "
"tacar ceisteanna do gach `ContentType`` a sholáthar sa pharaiméadar "
"``querysets`` de:class: "
"`~django.contrib.contentTypes.prefetch.GenericPrefetch`."

