"Is í an fhadhb leis seo ná gach uair ``Pizza. Iarrann __str__ () "
"````self.toppings.all ()`` caithfidh sé an bunachar sonraí a cheistiú, mar "
"sin reáchtálfaidh ``Pizza.Objects.all () `ceist ar an tábla Toppings le "
"haghaidh **gach ear** sa Pizza ``QuerySet``."

msgid "We can reduce to just two queries using ``prefetch_related``:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir linn laghdú go dtí dhá cheist ag baint úsáide as "
"``prefetch_related``:"

msgid ""
"This implies a ``self.toppings.all()`` for each ``Pizza``; now each time "
"``self.toppings.all()`` is called, instead of having to go to the database "
"for the items, it will find them in a prefetched ``QuerySet`` cache that was "
"populated in a single query."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé seo le tuiscint go bhfuil `self.toppings.all () ``do gach "
"`Pizza``; anois gach uair a thugtar ``self.toppings.all ()``, in ionad dul "
"chuig an mbunachar sonraí do na míreanna, gheobhaidh sé iad i taisce "
"``QuerySet`` réamhfhaighte a rinneadh i gceist amháin."

msgid ""
"That is, all the relevant toppings will have been fetched in a single query, "
"and used to make ``QuerySet`` instances that have a pre-filled cache of the "
"relevant results; these are then used in the ``self.toppings.all()`` calls."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The additional queries in ``prefetch_related()`` are executed after the "
"``QuerySet`` has begun to be evaluated and the primary query has been "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"Déantar na ceisteanna breise i `prefetch_related () ``a fhorghníomhú tar éis "
"an ``QuerySet`` a mheas agus an cheist phríomhúil a fhorghníomhú."

msgid ""
"Note that there is no mechanism to prevent another database query from "
"altering the items in between the execution of the primary query and the "
"additional queries, which could produce an inconsistent result. For example, "
"if a ``Pizza`` is deleted after the primary query has executed, its toppings "
"will not be returned in the additional query, and it will seem like the "
"pizza has no toppings:"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach bhfuil aon mheicníocht ann chun ceist eile bunachar "
