msgid "The following are all legal:"
msgstr "Tá na nithe seo a leanas ar fad dlíthiúil:"

msgid ""
"This will prefetch all pizzas belonging to restaurants, and all toppings "
"belonging to those pizzas. This will result in a total of 3 database queries "
"- one for the restaurants, one for the pizzas, and one for the toppings."
msgstr ""
"Tabharfaidh sé seo gach píosa a bhaineann le bialanna, agus gach topping a "
"bhaineann leis na pizzí sin a réamh-aimsiú. Beidh 3 cheist bunachar sonraí "
"san iomlán mar thoradh air seo - ceann do na bialanna, ceann do na pizzes, "
"agus ceann do na toppings."

msgid ""
"This will fetch the best pizza and all the toppings for the best pizza for "
"each restaurant. This will be done in 3 database queries - one for the "
"restaurants, one for the 'best pizzas', and one for the toppings."
msgstr ""
"Tabharfaidh sé seo an pizza is fearr agus na toppings go léir don pizza is "
"fearr do gach bialann. Déanfar é seo i 3 cheist bunachar sonraí - ceann do "
"na bialanna, ceann do na 'pizzes is fearr ', agus ceann do na toppings."

msgid ""
"The ``best_pizza`` relationship could also be fetched using "
"``select_related`` to reduce the query count to 2:"
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfaí an caidreamh ``best_pizza ``a fháil freisin ag baint úsáide as "
"``select_related`` chun líon na fiosrúcháin a laghdú go 2:"

msgid ""
"Since the prefetch is executed after the main query (which includes the "
"joins needed by ``select_related``), it is able to detect that the "
"``best_pizza`` objects have already been fetched, and it will skip fetching "
"them again."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go ndéantar an réamhcheistiú a fhorghníomhú tar éis na "
"príomhiosrúcháin (lena n-áirítear na comhcheangail a theastaíonn ag "
"``select_related``), tá sé in ann a bhrath go bhfuil na rudaí `best_pizza "
"``faighte cheana féin, agus scipeoidh sé iad a fháil arís."

msgid ""
"Chaining ``prefetch_related`` calls will accumulate the lookups that are "
"prefetched. To clear any ``prefetch_related`` behavior, pass ``None`` as a "
"parameter:"
msgstr ""
"Carnóidh glaonna ``prefetch_related`` a shlánú na cuardaigh atá "
"réamhfhaighte. Chun aon iompar ``prefetch_related`` a ghlanadh, pas ``None`` "
"mar pharaiméadar:"

msgid ""
"One difference to note when using ``prefetch_related`` is that objects "
"created by a query can be shared between the different objects that they are "
"related to i.e. a single Python model instance can appear at more than one "
"point in the tree of objects that are returned. This will normally happen "
"with foreign key relationships. Typically this behavior will not be a "
"problem, and will in fact save both memory and CPU time."
msgstr ""
"Difríocht amháin le tabhairt faoi deara agus ``prefetch_related`` á úsáid ná "
"gur féidir rudaí a chruthaítear le ceist a roinnt idir na rudaí éagsúla a "
"bhfuil baint acu leo i.e. is féidir le samhail Python amháin a bheith le "
"feiceáil ag níos mó ná pointe amháin sa chrann na rudaí a chuirtear ar ais. "
"De ghnáth tarlóidh sé seo le príomhchaidrimh eachtracha. De ghnáth ní bheidh "
"an t-iompar seo ina fhadhb, agus sábhálfaidh sé am cuimhne agus LAP araon i "
"ndáiríre."

msgid ""
"While ``prefetch_related`` supports prefetching ``GenericForeignKey`` "
"relationships, the number of queries will depend on the data. Since a "
"``GenericForeignKey`` can reference data in multiple tables, one query per "
"table referenced is needed, rather than one query for all the items. There "
"could be additional queries on the ``ContentType`` table if the relevant "
"rows have not already been fetched."
msgstr ""
"Cé go dtacaíonn ``prefetch_related`` le caidrimh `GenericForeignKey` "
"réamhghabháilte, beidh líon na gceisteanna ag brath ar na sonraí. Ós rud é "
"gur féidir le `GenericForeignKey` sonraí a thagairt i dtáblaí iolracha, "
"teastaíonn ceist amháin in aghaidh an tábla dá dtagraítear, seachas ceist "
"amháin do na míreanna go léir. D'fhéadfadh ceisteanna breise a bheith ann ar "
"an tábla ``ContentType`` mura bhfuil na sraitheanna ábhartha faighte cheana "
"féin."

msgid ""
"``prefetch_related`` in most cases will be implemented using an SQL query "
"that uses the 'IN' operator. This means that for a large ``QuerySet`` a "
"large 'IN' clause could be generated, which, depending on the database, "
"might have performance problems of its own when it comes to parsing or "
"executing the SQL query. Always profile for your use case!"
msgstr ""
"Cuirfear ``prefetch_related`` i bhformhór na gcásanna i bhfeidhm ag baint "
"úsáide as ceist SQL a úsáideann an oibreoir 'IN'. Ciallaíonn sé seo go "
"bhféadfaí clásal mór 'IN' a ghiniúint do `QuerySet ``mór, a d'fhéadfadh "
"fadhbanna feidhmíochta féin a bheith aige, ag brath ar an mbunachar sonraí, "
"maidir le parsáil nó a fhorghníomhú an fhiosrúcháin SQL. Próifíl i gcónaí do "
"do chás úsáide!"

msgid ""
"If you use ``iterator()`` to run the query, ``prefetch_related()`` calls "
"will only be observed if a value for ``chunk_size`` is provided."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú ``iterator () ``chun an cheist a reáchtáil, ní bhreathnófar "
"glaonna ``prefetch_related ()`` ach amháin má chuirtear luach ar fáil do "
"`chunk_size``."

msgid ""
"You can use the :class:`~django.db.models.Prefetch` object to further "
