"other lookups:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir cuardaigh eile a chruthaítear le `to_attr`` saincheaptha a thrasnú "
"mar is gnách:"

msgid ""
"Using ``to_attr`` is recommended when filtering down the prefetch result as "
