"ceisteanna breise a chruthú a sheachaint; dá bhrí sin moltar argóintí "
"``prefetch_related` a ordú go cúramach i gcónaí."

msgid "``extra()``"
msgstr "``breise () ``"

msgid ""
"Sometimes, the Django query syntax by itself can't easily express a complex "
"``WHERE`` clause. For these edge cases, Django provides the ``extra()`` "
"``QuerySet`` modifier — a hook for injecting specific clauses into the SQL "
"generated by a ``QuerySet``."
msgstr ""
"Uaireanta, ní féidir le comhréiteach ceisteanna Django leis féin clásal "
"casta ``WHERE`` a chur in iúl go héasca. Maidir leis na cásanna imeall seo, "
"soláthraíonn Django an modhnóir ``extra () ```QuerySet` - crúca chun clásail "
"shonracha a instealladh isteach sa SQL a ghineann ``QuerySet`."

msgid "Use this method as a last resort"
msgstr "Úsáid an modh seo mar rogha dheireanach"

msgid ""
"This is an old API that we aim to deprecate at some point in the future. Use "
"it only if you cannot express your query using other queryset methods. If "
"you do need to use it, please `file a ticket <https://code.djangoproject.com/"
"newticket>`_ using the `QuerySet.extra keyword <https://"
"code.djangoproject.com/query?"
"status=assigned&status=new&keywords=~QuerySet.extra>`_ with your use case "
"(please check the list of existing tickets first) so that we can enhance the "
"QuerySet API to allow removing ``extra()``. We are no longer improving or "
"fixing bugs for this method."
msgstr ""
"Is sean-API é seo a bhfuil sé mar aidhm againn a dhíchur ag pointe éigin sa "
"todhchaí. Úsáid é ach amháin mura féidir leat do cheist a chur in iúl ag "
"baint úsáide as modhanna ceisteanna eile. Más gá duit é a úsáid, le do thoil "
"`comhdú ticéad`_ ag baint < https://code.djangoproject.com/newticket> úsáide "
"as an eochairfhocal `QuerySet.extra < https://code.djangoproject.com/query?"
"status=assigned&status=new&keywords=~QuerySet.extra>`_ le do chás úsáide "
"(seiceáil liosta na dticéad atá ann cheana ar dtús) ionas gur féidir linn an "
"API QuerySet a fheabhsú chun cead a bhaint ``extra () `. Nílimid ag feabhsú "
"nó ag socrú fabhtanna don mhodh seo a thuilleadh."

msgid "For example, this use of ``extra()``:"
msgstr "Mar shampla, an úsáid seo de ``extra () ``:"

msgid "is equivalent to:"
msgstr "atá coibhéiseach le:"

msgid ""
"The main benefit of using :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.RawSQL` is "
"that you can set ``output_field`` if needed. The main downside is that if "
"you refer to some table alias of the queryset in the raw SQL, then it is "
"possible that Django might change that alias (for example, when the queryset "
"is used as a subquery in yet another query)."
msgstr ""
"Is é an príomhbhuntáiste a bhaineann le húsáid:class: "
"`~django.db.models.expressions.rawsql` ná gur féidir leat `output_field`` a "
