msgid ""
"In some rare cases, you might wish to pass parameters to the SQL fragments "
"in ``extra(select=...)``. For this purpose, use the ``select_params`` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"I roinnt cásanna neamhchoitianta, b'fhéidir gur mhaith leat paraiméadair a "
"chur chuig na blúirí SQL i ``extra (roghnaigh =...) ``. Chun na críche seo, "
"bain úsáid as an paraiméadar ``select_params``."

msgid "This will work, for example::"
msgstr "Oibreoidh sé seo, mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"If you need to use a literal ``%s`` inside your select string, use the "
"sequence ``%%s``."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit ``%s`` litriúil a úsáid taobh istigh de do shreang roghnaithe, "
"bain úsáid as an seicheamh ``%%s``."

msgid "``where`` / ``tables``"
msgstr "```cá háit ``/``tábla``"

msgid ""
"You can define explicit SQL ``WHERE`` clauses — perhaps to perform non-"
"explicit joins — by using ``where``. You can manually add tables to the SQL "
"``FROM`` clause by using ``tables``."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat clásail ``WHERE`` SQL sainráite a shainiú - b'fhéidir chun "
"comhpháirteanna neamh-shoiléire a dhéanamh - trí ```a úsáid```. Is féidir "
"leat táblaí a chur de láimh leis an gclásal SQL ``FROM`` trí `táblaí ``a "
"úsáid."

msgid ""
"``where`` and ``tables`` both take a list of strings. All ``where`` "
"parameters are \"AND\"ed to any other search criteria."
msgstr ""
"Glacann ``````agus ``tábla`` liosta teaghráin araon. Tá na paraiméadair "
"````go léir “agus” déanta d'aon chritéir chuardaigh eile."

msgid "...translates (roughly) into the following SQL:"
msgstr "... aistríonn (go garbh) go dtí an SQL seo a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Be careful when using the ``tables`` parameter if you're specifying tables "
"that are already used in the query. When you add extra tables via the "
"``tables`` parameter, Django assumes you want that table included an extra "
"time, if it is already included. That creates a problem, since the table "
"name will then be given an alias. If a table appears multiple times in an "
"SQL statement, the second and subsequent occurrences must use aliases so the "
"database can tell them apart. If you're referring to the extra table you "
"added in the extra ``where`` parameter this is going to cause errors."
msgstr ""
"Bí cúramach agus an paraiméadar ``táblaí ``á úsáid agat má tá táblaí á "
"shonrú agat a úsáidtear cheana féin sa cheist. Nuair a chuireann tú táblaí "
"breise tríd an bparaiméadar ``táblaí ``, glacann Django leis gur mhaith leat "
"am breise a bheith san áireamh sa tábla sin, má tá sé san áireamh cheana "
"féin. Cruthaíonn sé sin fadhb, ós rud é go dtabharfar ainm an tábla ansin. "
"Má tá tábla le feiceáil arís agus arís i ráiteas SQL, ní mór don dara tarlú "
"agus ina dhiaidh sin ainmneacha a úsáid ionas gur féidir leis an mbunachar "
"sonraí iad a insint óna chéile. Má tá tú ag tagairt don tábla breise a chuir "
"tú sa pharaiméadar breise ``cén áit ``beidh earráidí mar thoradh air seo."

msgid ""
"Normally you'll only be adding extra tables that don't already appear in the "
"query. However, if the case outlined above does occur, there are a few "
"solutions. First, see if you can get by without including the extra table "
"and use the one already in the query. If that isn't possible, put your "
"``extra()`` call at the front of the queryset construction so that your "
"table is the first use of that table. Finally, if all else fails, look at "
"the query produced and rewrite your ``where`` addition to use the alias "
"given to your extra table. The alias will be the same each time you "
"construct the queryset in the same way, so you can rely upon the alias name "
"to not change."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth ní bheidh tú ag cur ach táblaí breise nach bhfuil le feiceáil sa "
"cheist cheana féin. Mar sin féin, má tharlaíonn an cás a leagtar amach "
"thuas, tá cúpla réiteach ann. Ar dtús, féach an féidir leat dul tríd gan an "
"tábla breise a áireamh agus bain úsáid as an gceann atá sa cheist cheana "
"féin. Mura féidir é sin a dhéanamh, cuir do ghlao ``breise () ``ag tosaigh "
"an tógála tacar fiosraithe ionas gurb é do thábla an chéad úsáid den tábla "
"sin. Faoi dheireadh, má theipeann ar gach rud eile, féach ar an bhfiosrú a "
"tháirgtear agus athscríobh do bhreise ``cá háit ``chun an alias a thugtar do "
"do thábla breise a úsáid. Beidh an t-ailias mar an gcéanna gach uair a "
"thógann tú an tacar fiosrúcháin ar an mbealach céanna, ionas gur féidir leat "
"brath ar an ainm alias gan athrú."

msgid "``order_by``"
msgstr "``ordó_by``"

msgid ""
"If you need to order the resulting queryset using some of the new fields or "
"tables you have included via ``extra()`` use the ``order_by`` parameter to "
"``extra()`` and pass in a sequence of strings. These strings should either "
"be model fields (as in the normal :meth:`order_by()` method on querysets), "
"of the form ``table_name.column_name`` or an alias for a column that you "
"specified in the ``select`` parameter to ``extra()``."
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit an tacar iarratais a ordú ag baint úsáide as cuid de na réimsí "
"nó na táblaí nua atá san áireamh agat trí ``extra () ``bain úsáid as an "
"paraiméadar ``order_by`` go `extra ()`` agus pas i seicheamh teaghráin. Ba "
"chóir go mbeadh na teaghráin seo ina réimsí samhail (mar atá sa modh "
"gnáth:meth: `order_by () `ar cheisteanna ceisteanna), den fhoirm "
"``table_name.column_name`` nó ainm do cholún a shonraigh tú sa pharaiméadar "
"``roghnaigh ``go `extra ()``."

msgid ""
"This would sort all the items for which ``is_recent`` is true to the front "
"of the result set (``True`` sorts before ``False`` in a descending ordering)."
msgstr ""
"Sórtálfadh sé seo na míreanna go léir a bhfuil ``is_recent`` díreach maidir "
"le tosaigh an tacar torthaí (``True`` sórtálacha roimh ``False`` in ordú "
"íslitheach)."

msgid ""
"This shows, by the way, that you can make multiple calls to ``extra()`` and "
"it will behave as you expect (adding new constraints each time)."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé seo, dála an scéil, gur féidir leat glaonna iolracha a "
"dhéanamh chuig ``extra () ``agus iompróidh sé mar a bhíonn ag súil leat "
"(srianta nua a chur leis gach uair)."

msgid "``params``"
msgstr "``Params``"

msgid ""
"The ``where`` parameter described above may use standard Python database "
"string placeholders — ``'%s'`` to indicate parameters the database engine "
"should automatically quote. The ``params`` argument is a list of any extra "
"parameters to be substituted."
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh an paraiméadar ```a thuairiscítear thuas sealbhóirí teaghrán "
"bunachar sonraí caighdeánach Python a úsáid - ```%s'`` chun paraiméadair a "
"léiriú ba chóir don inneall bunachar sonraí a lua go huath Is é an argóint "
"`params' ná liosta d'aon pharaiméadair bhreise atá le cur in ionad."

msgid ""
"Always use ``params`` instead of embedding values directly into ``where`` "
"because ``params`` will ensure values are quoted correctly according to your "
"particular backend. For example, quotes will be escaped correctly."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid `params`` i gcónaí in ionad luachanna a leabú go díreach isteach i "
"``cén áit ``toisc go gcinnteoidh `params`` luachanna i gceart de réir do "
"chúltaca áirithe. Mar shampla, éalófar luachana i gceart."

