msgstr "Droch::"

msgid "Good::"
msgstr "Go maith::"

msgid ""
"If you are performing queries on MySQL, note that MySQL's silent type "
"coercion may cause unexpected results when mixing types. If you query on a "
"string type column, but with an integer value, MySQL will coerce the types "
"of all values in the table to an integer before performing the comparison. "
"For example, if your table contains the values ``'abc'``, ``'def'`` and you "
"query for ``WHERE mycolumn=0``, both rows will match. To prevent this, "
"perform the correct typecasting before using the value in a query."
msgstr ""
"Má tá tú ag déanamh ceisteanna ar MySQL, tabhair faoi deara go bhféadfadh "
"foréigean cineál ciúin MySQL a bheith ina chúis le torthaí gan choinne agus "
"cineál Má fhiosraíonn tú ar cholún cineál sreangán, ach le luach sláimhir, "
"cuirfidh MySQL na cineálacha na luachanna go léir sa tábla a chur i gcomhar "
"sula ndéanann tú an comparáid. Mar shampla, má tá na luachanna ``'abc'``, "
"`def'``` i do thábla agus má fhiosraíonn tú ar ``WHERE mycolumn=0``, "
"meaitneoidh an dá shraith. Chun é seo a chosc, déan an clóscáil cheart sula "
"n-úsáidtear an luach i bhfiosrúchán."

msgid "``defer()``"
msgstr "```iarchur () ``"

msgid ""
"In some complex data-modeling situations, your models might contain a lot of "
"fields, some of which could contain a lot of data (for example, text "
"fields), or require expensive processing to convert them to Python objects. "
"If you are using the results of a queryset in some situation where you don't "
"know if you need those particular fields when you initially fetch the data, "
"you can tell Django not to retrieve them from the database."
msgstr ""
"I roinnt cásanna casta samhaltú sonraí, d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh go leor réimsí "
"i do mhúnlaí, a bhféadfadh go leor sonraí a bheith i gcuid acu (mar shampla, "
"réimsí téacs), nó próiseáil daor a bheith ag teastáil chun iad a thiontú go "
"rudaí Python. Má tá torthaí tacar fiosrúcháin á úsáid agat i gcás éigin nach "
"bhfuil a fhios agat an dteastaíonn na réimsí áirithe sin uait nuair a "
"fhaigheann tú na sonraí ar dtús, is féidir leat a rá le Django gan iad a "
"aisghabháil ón mbunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"This is done by passing the names of the fields to not load to ``defer()``::"
msgstr ""
"Déantar é seo trí ainmneacha na réimsí a chur ar aghaidh chun gan luchtú "
"chuig ``defer () ``:"

msgid ""
"A queryset that has deferred fields will still return model instances. Each "
"deferred field will be retrieved from the database if you access that field "
"(one at a time, not all the deferred fields at once)."
msgstr ""
"Tabharfaidh tacar fiosrúcháin a bhfuil réimsí iarchurtha aige cásanna "
"samhail ar ais fós. Aisghabfar gach réimse iarchurtha ón mbunachar sonraí má "
"rochtain agat ar an réimse sin (ceann ag an am, ní na réimsí iarchurtha go "
"léir ag an am céanna)."

msgid ""
"Deferred fields will not lazy-load like this from asynchronous code. "
"Instead, you will get a ``SynchronousOnlyOperation`` exception. If you are "
"writing asynchronous code, you should not try to access any fields that you "
"``defer()``."
msgstr ""
"Ní luchtálfaidh réimsí iarchurtha mar seo ó chód asincrónach. Ina áit sin, "
"gheobhaidh tú eisceacht ``SynchronousOnlyOperation``. Má tá cód asincrónach "
"á scríobh agat, níor cheart duit iarracht a dhéanamh rochtain a fháil ar aon "
"réimsí a dhéanann tú ``fiafraí () ``."

msgid ""
"You can make multiple calls to ``defer()``. Each call adds new fields to the "
"deferred set::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat glaonna iolracha a dhéanamh chuig ``fiafraigh () ``. Cuireann "
"gach glao réimsí nua leis an tacar iarchurtha:"

msgid ""
"The order in which fields are added to the deferred set does not matter. "
"Calling ``defer()`` with a field name that has already been deferred is "
"harmless (the field will still be deferred)."
msgstr ""
"Is cuma an t-ord ina gcuirtear réimsí leis an tacar iarchurtha. Tá sé "
"neamhdhíobhálach a ghlaoch ar ``déanamh () ``le hainm réimse atá curtha ar "
"iarchur cheana féin (cuirfear an réimse ar iarchur fós)."

msgid ""
"You can defer loading of fields in related models (if the related models are "
"loading via :meth:`select_related()`) by using the standard double-"
"underscore notation to separate related fields::"
msgstr ""
"Féadfaidh tú luchtú réimsí i samhlacha gaolmhara a chur siar (má tá na "
"samhlacha gaolmhara ag luchtú via:meth: `select_related () `) tríd an nótaí "
"caighdeánach béim dhúbailte a úsáid chun réimsí gaolmhara ar leithligh:"

msgid ""
"If you want to clear the set of deferred fields, pass ``None`` as a "
"parameter to ``defer()``::"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat an tacar réimsí iarchurtha a ghlanadh, cuir ``None`` mar "
"pharaiméadar chuig ``defer () ``:"

msgid ""
"Some fields in a model won't be deferred, even if you ask for them. You can "
"never defer the loading of the primary key. If you are "
"using :meth:`select_related()` to retrieve related models, you shouldn't "
"defer the loading of the field that connects from the primary model to the "
"related one, doing so will result in an error."
msgstr ""
"Ní iarchurfar roinnt réimsí i samhail, fiú má iarrann tú iad. Ní féidir leat "
"luchtú an phríomh-eochair a chur siar riamh. Má tá tú ag úsáid: meth: "
"`select_related () `chun samhlacha gaolmhara a aisghabháil, níor cheart duit "
"luchtú an réimse a nascann ón bpríomh-mhúnla leis an gceann gaolmhar a chur "
"siar, agus beidh earráid mar thoradh air sin."

msgid ""
"Similarly, calling ``defer()`` (or its counterpart :meth:`only()`) including "
"an argument from an aggregation (e.g. using the result "
"of :meth:`annotate()`) doesn't make sense: doing so will raise an exception. "
"The aggregated values will always be fetched into the resulting queryset."
msgstr ""
"Ar an gcaoi chéanna, ní bhíonn ciall ag glaoch ar ``defer () ``(nó a "
"chontrapháirt:meth: `only () `) lena n-áirítear argóint ó chomhiomlánú "
"(m.sh. ag úsáid toradh de:meth: `annotate ()`): ardóidh eisceacht ag déanamh "
"amhlaidh. Tabharfar na luachanna comhiomlánaithe isteach sa tacar "
"fiosrúcháin mar thoradh air i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"The ``defer()`` method (and its cousin, :meth:`only()`, below) are only for "
"advanced use-cases. They provide an optimization for when you have analyzed "
"your queries closely and understand *exactly* what information you need and "
"have measured that the difference between returning the fields you need and "
"the full set of fields for the model will be significant."
msgstr ""
"Níl an modh ``defer () ``(agus a chathrach, :meth: `only () `, thíos) ach le "
"haghaidh ardchásanna úsáide. Soláthraíonn siad barrfheabhsú nuair a dhéanann "
"tú anailís go dlúth ar do chuid ceisteanna agus tuigeann tú *go beacht* cén "
"fhaisnéis a theastaíonn uait agus a thomhas go mbeidh an difríocht idir na "
"réimsí a theastaíonn uait a thabhairt ar ais agus an tacar iomlán réimsí don "
"tsamhail suntasach."

msgid ""
"Even if you think you are in the advanced use-case situation, **only use** "
"``defer()`` **when you cannot, at queryset load time, determine if you will "
"need the extra fields or not**. If you are frequently loading and using a "
"particular subset of your data, the best choice you can make is to normalize "
"your models and put the non-loaded data into a separate model (and database "
"table). If the columns *must* stay in the one table for some reason, create "
"a model with ``Meta.managed = False`` (see the :attr:`managed attribute "
"<django.db.models.Options.managed>` documentation) containing just the "
"fields you normally need to load and use that where you might otherwise call "
"``defer()``. This makes your code more explicit to the reader, is slightly "
"faster and consumes a little less memory in the Python process."
msgstr ""
"Fiú má cheapann tú go bhfuil tú sa chás ardchás úsáide, ** húsáid ach ** "
"``fiafraigh () ``**nuair nach féidir leat, ag am luchtaithe ceisteanna "
"socraithe, a chinneadh an mbeidh na réimsí breise ag teastáil uait nó ní**. "
"Má tá fo-thacar áirithe de do shonraí á luchtú agus ag úsáid tú go minic, is "
"é an rogha is fearr is féidir leat a dhéanamh ná do mhúnlaí a normalú agus "
"na sonraí neamh-luchtaithe a chur i samhail ar leithligh (agus tábla "
"bunachar sonraí). Má chaithfidh na colúin ** fanacht sa tábla amháin ar "
"chúis éigin, cruthaigh samhail <django.db.models.Options.managed>le "
"`Meta.managed = False`` (féach an doiciméadach:attr: `treit bhainistithe `) "
"ina bhfuil ach na réimsí a chaithfidh tú a luchtú agus bain úsáid as sin ina "
"bhféadfá ``defer ()` a ghlaoch ar shlí eile. Déanann sé seo do chód níos "
"soiléire don léitheoir, tá sé beagán níos gasta agus ídíonn sé beagán níos "
"lú cuimhne sa phróiseas Python."

msgid ""
"For example, both of these models use the same underlying database table::"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, úsáideann an dá mhúnla seo an tábla bunachar sonraí céanna::"

msgid ""
"If many fields need to be duplicated in the unmanaged model, it may be best "
"to create an abstract model with the shared fields and then have the "
"unmanaged and managed models inherit from the abstract model."
msgstr ""
"Más gá go leor réimsí a dhúbailt sa tsamhail neamh-bhainistithe, b'fhéidir "
"gur fearr samhail teibí a chruthú leis na réimsí roinnte agus ansin na "
"samhlacha neamh-bhainistithe agus bainistithe a bheith oidhreachta ón "
"tsamhail teibí."

msgid ""
"When calling :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.save()` for instances with "
"deferred fields, only the loaded fields will be saved. "
"See :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.save()` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag glaoch: meth: `~django.db.models.model.save () `le haghaidh "
"cásanna le réimsí iarchurtha, ní shábhálfar ach na réimsí luchtaithe. Féach: "
"Meth: `~django.db.models.model.save () `le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí."

msgid "``only()``"
msgstr "```amháin () ``"

msgid ""
"The ``only()`` method is essentially the opposite of :meth:`defer`. Only the "
"fields passed into this method and that are *not* already specified as "
"deferred are loaded immediately when the queryset is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Go bunúsach is é an modh ``only () ``a mhalairt de:meth: `iarchur`. Ní "
"dhéantar ach na réimsí a chuirtear isteach sa mhodh seo agus nach nd* atá "
"sonraithe cheana féin mar iarchurtha a luchtú láithreach nuair a dhéantar an "
"tacar fiosrúcháin a mheas."

msgid ""
"If you have a model where almost all the fields need to be deferred, using "
"``only()`` to specify the complementary set of fields can result in simpler "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Má tá samhail agat ina gcaithfear beagnach na réimsí go léir a chur siar, "
"d'fhéadfadh cód níos simplí a bheith mar thoradh ar ``only () ``chun an "
"tacar chomhlántach réimsí a shonrú."

msgid ""
"Suppose you have a model with fields ``name``, ``age`` and ``biography``. "
"The following two querysets are the same, in terms of deferred fields::"
msgstr ""
"Cuir i gcás go bhfuil samhail agat le réimsí ``ainm ``, `aois`` agus "
"``beathaisnéis``. Tá an dá cheist seo a leanas mar an gcéanna, i dtéarmaí "
"réimsí iarchurtha:"

msgid ""
"Whenever you call ``only()`` it *replaces* the set of fields to load "
"immediately. The method's name is mnemonic: **only** those fields are loaded "
"immediately; the remainder are deferred. Thus, successive calls to "
"``only()`` result in only the final fields being considered::"
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a ghlaonn tú ar ``only () ``, ath* aith* an tacar réimsí le luchtú "
"láithreach. Is é ainm an mhodha mnemonic: **amháin** luchtaítear na réimsí "
"sin láithreach; cuirtear an chuid eile ar iarchur. Mar sin, ní bhreithnítear "
"ach na réimsí deiridh ar na réimsí deiridh mar thoradh ar ghlaonna i ndiaidh "
"a chéile ar ``only () `:"

msgid ""
"Since ``defer()`` acts incrementally (adding fields to the deferred list), "
"you can combine calls to ``only()`` and ``defer()`` and things will behave "
"logically::"
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go ngníomhaíonn ``diafraigh () ``go hincneamhach (réimsí a chur "
"leis an liosta iarchurtha), is féidir leat glaonna a chur le ``only ()`` "
"agus ``deafer () ``a chomhcheangal agus iompraíonn rudaí go loighciúil:"

msgid ""
"All of the cautions in the note for the :meth:`defer` documentation apply to "
"``only()`` as well. Use it cautiously and only after exhausting your other "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Baineann na rabhaidh go léir sa nóta maidir leis an doiciméadúisíocht: "
"“athchur” le ``only () `chomh maith. Úsáid é go cúramach agus ach amháin tar "
"éis do roghanna eile a ídiú."

msgid ""
"Using ``only()`` and omitting a field requested using :meth:`select_related` "
"is an error as well. On the other hand, invoking ``only()`` without any "
"arguments, will return every field (including annotations) fetched by the "
"queryset."
msgstr ""
"Is earráid é ``only () ``a úsáid agus réimse a iarrtar a fhágáil ag baint "
"úsáid:meth: `select_related` freisin. Ar an láimh eile, cuirfear glaoch ar "
"``only () ``gan aon argóintí, gach réimse (lena n-áirítear anótaí) a "
"gheobhaidh an tacar fiosrúcháin ar ais."

msgid ""
"As with ``defer()``, you cannot access the non-loaded fields from "
"asynchronous code and expect them to load. Instead, you will get a "
"``SynchronousOnlyOperation`` exception. Ensure that all fields you might "
"access are in your ``only()`` call."
msgstr ""
"Mar is amhlaidh le ``defer () ``, ní féidir leat rochtain a fháil ar na "
"réimsí neamh-luchtaithe ó chód asincrónach agus a bheith ag súil go "
"luchtálfaidh siad. Ina áit sin, gheobhaidh tú eisceacht "
"``SynchronousOnlyOperation``. Déan cinnte go bhfuil gach réimse a d'fhéadfá "
"rochtain a fháil i do ghlao ``only () ``."

msgid ""
"When using :meth:`defer` after ``only()`` the fields in :meth:`defer` will "
"override ``only()`` for fields that are listed in both."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a úsáidtear: meth: `iarchur` tar éis ``only () ``, cuirfidh na réimsí "
"in:meth: `iarchur ``only ()`` i gcás réimsí atá liostaithe sa dá cheann."

msgid "``using()``"
msgstr "```ag baint úsáide as () ``"

msgid ""
"This method is for controlling which database the ``QuerySet`` will be "
"evaluated against if you are using more than one database.  The only "
"argument this method takes is the alias of a database, as defined "
"in :setting:`DATABASES`."
msgstr ""
"Is é an modh seo chun rialú a dhéanamh ar an mbunachar sonraí a dhéanfar "
"meastóireacht ar an ``QuerySet` i gcoinne má tá níos mó ná bunachar sonraí "
"amháin á úsáid agat. Is é an t-aon argóint a ghlacann an modh seo ná ainm "
"bunachar sonraí, mar a shainmhínítear in:setting: `DATABASES`."

msgid "``select_for_update()``"
msgstr "``roghnaithe_for_nuashonraithe () ``"

msgid ""
"Returns a queryset that will lock rows until the end of the transaction, "
"generating a ``SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`` SQL statement on supported databases."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé tacar ceisteanna ar ais a ghlasálfaidh sraitheanna go dtí deireadh "
"an idirbheart, ag gint ``ROGHNAIGH... LE HAGHAIDH UPDATE`` Ráiteas SQL ar "
"bhunachair sonraí tacaithe."

msgid ""
"When the queryset is evaluated (``for entry in entries`` in this case), all "
"matched entries will be locked until the end of the transaction block, "
"meaning that other transactions will be prevented from changing or acquiring "
"locks on them."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a dhéantar an tacar fiosrúcháin a mheas (``le haghaidh iontrála in "
"iontrálacha ``sa chás seo), cuirfear gach iontráil comhoiriúnach faoi ghlas "
"go dtí deireadh an bhloc idirbheart, rud a chiallaíonn go gcuirfear cosc ar "
"idirbhearta eile glais a athrú nó a fháil orthu."

msgid ""
"Usually, if another transaction has already acquired a lock on one of the "
"selected rows, the query will block until the lock is released. If this is "
"not the behavior you want, call ``select_for_update(nowait=True)``. This "
"will make the call non-blocking. If a conflicting lock is already acquired "
"by another transaction, :exc:`~django.db.DatabaseError` will be raised when "
"the queryset is evaluated. You can also ignore locked rows by using "
"``select_for_update(skip_locked=True)`` instead. The ``nowait`` and "
"``skip_locked`` are mutually exclusive and attempts to call "
"``select_for_update()`` with both options enabled will result in "
"a :exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth, má tá glas faighte ag idirbheart eile cheana féin ar cheann de na "
"sraitheanna roghnaithe, cuirfidh an ceist bac go dtí go scaoilfear an glas. "
"Mura bhfuil sé seo an t-iompar atá uait, glaoigh ar ``select_for_update "
"(noWait=true) ``. Déanfaidh sé seo an glao gan bhlocáil. Má fhaightear glas "
"contrártha cheana féin le hidirbheart eile, ardófar :exc: "
"`~django.db.databaseError` nuair a dhéantar an tacar fiosrúcháin a mheas. Is "
"féidir leat neamhaird a dhéanamh freisin ar shraitheanna faoi ghlas trí "
"``select_for_update (skip_locked=True) ``a úsáid ina ionad. Tá na `nowait`` "
"agus ``skip_locked`` frithpháirteach agus beidh a: exc: `ValueError` mar "
"thoradh ar iarrachtaí glaoch ar ``select_for_update () ``agus an dá rogha "
"cumasaithe."

msgid ""
"By default, ``select_for_update()`` locks all rows that are selected by the "
"query. For example, rows of related objects specified "
"in :meth:`select_related` are locked in addition to rows of the queryset's "
"model. If this isn't desired, specify the related objects you want to lock "
"in ``select_for_update(of=(...))`` using the same fields syntax "
"as :meth:`select_related`. Use the value ``'self'`` to refer to the "
"queryset's model."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, glasaíonn ``select_for_update () ``gach sraitheanna "
"a roghnaíonn an cheist. Mar shampla, tá sraitheanna rudaí gaolmhara a "
"shonraítear in:meth: `select_related` faoi ghlas i dteannta sraitheanna de "
"mhúnla an tacar fiosrúcháin. Mura bhfuil sé seo ag teastáil, sonraigh na "
"rudaí gaolmhara a theastaíonn uait a ghlasáil in ``select_for_update (of= "
"(...)) ``ag baint úsáide as comhréir na réimsí céanna mar: meth: "
"`select_related`. Úsáid an luach ``'self'`` chun tagairt a dhéanamh do "
"mhúnla an tacar fiosrúcháin."

msgid "Lock parents models in ``select_for_update(of=(...))``"
msgstr "Glas samhlacha tuismitheoirí i ``select_for_update (de =( ... )) ``"

msgid ""
"If you want to lock parents models when using :ref:`multi-table inheritance "
"<multi-table-inheritance>`, you must specify parent link fields (by default "
"``<parent_model_name>_ptr``) in the ``of`` argument. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat samhlacha tuismitheoirí a ghlasáil agus tú ag úsáid:ref: "
"`oidhreacht il-tábla <multi-table-inheritance>`, ní mór duit réimsí nasc "
"tuismitheoirí a shonrú (de réir réamhshocraithe ``<parent_model_name>_ptr``) "
"san argóint ``of``. Mar shampla::"

msgid "Using ``select_for_update(of=(...))`` with specified fields"
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as ``select_for_update (of= (...)) ``le réimsí sonraithe"

msgid ""
"If you want to lock models and specify selected fields, e.g. "
"using :meth:`values`, you must select at least one field from each model in "
"the ``of`` argument. Models without selected fields will not be locked."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat samhlacha a ghlasáil agus réimsí roghnaithe a shonrú, m.sh. ag "
"baint úsáide as: meth: `luacha`, ní mór duit réimse amháin ar a laghad a "
"roghnú ó gach samhail san argóint ``of``. Ní ghlasálfar samhlacha gan réimsí "
"roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"On PostgreSQL only, you can pass ``no_key=True`` in order to acquire a "
"weaker lock, that still allows creating rows that merely reference locked "
"rows (through a foreign key, for example) while the lock is in place. The "
"PostgreSQL documentation has more details about `row-level lock modes "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-locking.html#LOCKING-"
"ROWS>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ar PostgreSQL amháin, is féidir leat ``no_key=true`` a rith d'fhonn glas "
"níos laige a fháil, a cheadaíonn sraitheanna a chruthú nach dtagraíonn ach "
"sraitheanna faoi ghlas (trí eochair eachtrach, mar shampla) agus an glas i "
"bhfeidhm. < https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-"
"locking.html#LOCKING-ROWS>Tá tuilleadh sonraí ag doiciméadú PostgreSQL faoi "
"`modhanna glasála leibhéal sraithe`_."

msgid "You can't use ``select_for_update()`` on nullable relations:"
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leat ``select_for_update () ``a úsáid ar chaidrimh neamhnaithe:"

msgid ""
"To avoid that restriction, you can exclude null objects if you don't care "
"about them:"
msgstr ""
"Chun an srian sin a sheachaint, is féidir leat rudaí neall a eisiamh mura "
"bhfuil cúram ort fúthu:"

msgid ""
"The ``postgresql``, ``oracle``, and ``mysql`` database backends support "
"``select_for_update()``. However, MariaDB only supports the ``nowait`` "
"argument, MariaDB 10.6+ also supports the ``skip_locked`` argument, and "
"MySQL supports the ``nowait``, ``skip_locked``, and ``of`` arguments. The "
"``no_key`` argument is only supported on PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn cúltaca bunachar sonraí ``postgresql``, ``oracle``, agus ``mysql`` "
"``select_for_update () ``. Mar sin féin, ní thacaíonn MariaDB ach leis an "
"argóint ``nowait ``, tacaíonn MariaDB 10.6+ leis an argóint ``skip_locked`` "
"freisin, agus tacaíonn MySQL leis na hargóintí ``nowait``, `skip_locked``, "
"agus ``of``. Ní thacaítear leis an argóint ``no_key`` ach ar PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"Passing ``nowait=True``, ``skip_locked=True``, ``no_key=True``, or ``of`` to "
"``select_for_update()`` using database backends that do not support these "
"options, such as MySQL, raises a :exc:`~django.db.NotSupportedError`. This "
"prevents code from unexpectedly blocking."
msgstr ""
"Ag dul ``noWait=True``, `skip_locked=true``, `no_key=true``, nó ``of`` go "
"``select_for_update () ``ag baint úsáide as cúltaca bunachar sonraí nach "
"dtacaíonn leis na roghanna seo, mar MySQL, ardaíonn a:exc: "
"`~django.db.notSupportedError`. Cuireann sé seo cosc ar chód ó bhlocáil gan "
"choinne."

msgid ""
"Evaluating a queryset with ``select_for_update()`` in autocommit mode on "
"backends which support ``SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`` is "
"a :exc:`~django.db.transaction.TransactionManagementError` error because the "
"rows are not locked in that case. If allowed, this would facilitate data "
"corruption and could easily be caused by calling code that expects to be run "
"in a transaction outside of one."
msgstr ""
"Meastóireacht a dhéanamh ar shraith ceisteanna le ``select_for_update () ``i "
"mód uathchomhcheangail ar chúltaca a thacaíonn le ``SELECT... LE HAGHAIDH "
"UPDATE`` is é:: exc: `~django.db.transaction.transactionManagementError` "
"earráid toisc nach bhfuil na sraitheanna faoi ghlas sa chás sin. Má "
"cheadaítear é, éascódh sé seo éilliú sonraí agus d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith ina "
"chúis go héasca trí chód glaonna atá ag súil go reáchtálfar in idirbheart "
"lasmuigh de cheann amháin."

msgid ""
"Using ``select_for_update()`` on backends which do not support ``SELECT ... "
"FOR UPDATE`` (such as SQLite) will have no effect. ``SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`` "
"will not be added to the query, and an error isn't raised if "
"``select_for_update()`` is used in autocommit mode."
msgstr ""
"Ag baint úsáide as ``select_for_update () ``ar chúltaca nach dtacaíonn le "
"``SELECT... LE HAGHAIDH NUASHONRÚ ``(mar shampla SQLite) ní bheidh aon "
"éifeacht ag. ``ROGHNAIGH... NÍ chuirfear FOR UPDATE`` leis an bhfiosrú, agus "
"ní ardaítear earráid má úsáidtear ``select_for_update () ``i mód autocommit."

msgid ""
"Although ``select_for_update()`` normally fails in autocommit mode, "
"since :class:`~django.test.TestCase` automatically wraps each test in a "
"transaction, calling ``select_for_update()`` in a ``TestCase`` even outside "
"an :func:`~django.db.transaction.atomic()` block will (perhaps unexpectedly) "
"pass without raising a ``TransactionManagementError``. To properly test "
"``select_for_update()`` you should "
"use :class:`~django.test.TransactionTestCase`."
msgstr ""
"Cé go dteipeann ``select_for_update () ``de ghnáth i mód autocommit, ós rud "
"é go ndéanfaidh: class: `~django.test.testcase` gach tástáil i idirbheart go "
"huathoibríoch, ag glaoch ``select_for_update () `i `testcase`` fiú taobh "
"amuigh an:func: `~django.db.transaction.atomic ()`.) pas gan "
"``TransactionManagementError`` a ardú. Chun ``select_for_update () ``a "
"thástáil i gceart ba cheart duit:class: `~django.test.transactionTestCase` a "
"úsáid."

msgid "Certain expressions may not be supported"
msgstr "Ní fhéadfar tacú le nathanna áirithe"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL doesn't support ``select_for_update()`` "
"with :class:`~django.db.models.expressions.Window` expressions."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn PostgreSQL le ``select_for_update () ``le nathanna: class: "
"`~django.db.Models.Expressions.Window`."

msgid "``raw()``"
msgstr "``amh () ``"

msgid ""
"Takes a raw SQL query, executes it, and returns a "
"``django.db.models.query.RawQuerySet`` instance. This ``RawQuerySet`` "
"instance can be iterated over just like a normal ``QuerySet`` to provide "
"object instances."
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé ceist amh SQL, cuireann sé i bhfeidhm é, agus filleann sé sampla "
"``Django.db.Models.Query.RawQuerySet ``. Is féidir an cás ``RawQuerySet`` "
"seo a athrú díreach cosúil le gnáth-``QuerySet`` chun cásanna réada a "
"sholáthar."

msgid "See the :doc:`/topics/db/sql` for more information."
msgstr "Féach an:doc: `/topics/db/sql` le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

msgid ""
"``raw()`` always triggers a new query and doesn't account for previous "
"filtering. As such, it should generally be called from the ``Manager`` or "
"from a fresh ``QuerySet`` instance."
msgstr ""
"Spreagann ``raw () ``ceist nua i gcónaí agus ní chuireann sé cuntas ar "
"scagadh roimhe seo. Mar sin, ba chóir é a ghlaoch go ginearálta ón "
"“Bainisteoir” nó ó shampla úr ``QuerySet`."

msgid "Operators that return new ``QuerySet``\\s"
msgstr "Oibreoirí a chuireann ar ais ``QuerySet``\\ s nua"

msgid "Combined querysets must use the same model."
msgstr "Ní mór do cheisteanna comhcheangailte an tsamhail chéanna a úsáid."

msgid "AND (``&``)"
msgstr "AGUS (``& ``)"

msgid ""
"Combines two ``QuerySet``\\s using the SQL ``AND`` operator in a manner "
"similar to chaining filters."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheanglaíonn dhá ``QuerySet`` ag baint úsáide as an oibreoir ``AND`` SQL "
"ar bhealach cosúil le scagairí slabhraithe."

msgid "The following are equivalent::"
msgstr "Tá na nithe seo a leanas coibhéiseach:"

msgid "SQL equivalent:"
msgstr "Coibhéis SQL:"

msgid "OR (``|``)"
msgstr "NÓ (``|``)"

msgid "Combines two ``QuerySet``\\s using the SQL ``OR`` operator."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheanglaíonn dhá ``QuerySet``\\ s ag baint úsáide as an oibreoir SQL "
"``OR``."

msgid ""
"``|`` is not a commutative operation, as different (though equivalent) "
"queries may be generated."
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríocht chomhlaitheach é `|``, toisc go bhféadfar ceisteanna difriúla "
"(cé go coibhéiseach) a ghiniúint."

msgid "XOR (``^``)"
msgstr "XOR (``^``)"

msgid ""
"Combines two ``QuerySet``\\s using the SQL ``XOR`` operator. A ``XOR`` "
"expression matches rows that are matched by an odd number of operands."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheanglaíonn dhá ``QuerySet``\\ s ag baint úsáide as an oibreoir SQL "
"``XOR``. Meaitseálann abairt ``XOR`` sraitheanna atá comhoiriúnach le líon "
"aige oibrandaí."

msgid ""
"``XOR`` is natively supported on MariaDB and MySQL. On other databases, ``x "
"^ y ^ ... ^ z`` is converted to an equivalent:"
msgstr ""
"Tugtar tacaíocht dúchasach le ``XOR`` ar MariaDB agus MySQL. Ar bhunachair "
"sonraí eile, déantar ``x ^ y ^... ^ z`` a thiontú go coibhéis:"

msgid "Methods that do not return ``QuerySet``\\s"
msgstr "Modhanna nach gcuireann ar ais ``QuerySet``\\ s"

msgid ""
"The following ``QuerySet`` methods evaluate the ``QuerySet`` and return "
"something *other than* a ``QuerySet``."
msgstr ""
"Déanann na modhanna ``QuerySet`` seo a leanas measúnú ar an ``QuerySet`` "
"agus cuireann siad rud éigin seachas ``QuerySet`` ar ais."

msgid ""
"These methods do not use a cache (see :ref:`caching-and-querysets`). Rather, "
"they query the database each time they're called."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáideann na modhanna seo taisce (féach:ref: `caching-and-querysets`). "
"Ina ionad sin, fiosraíonn siad an bunachar sonraí gach uair a ghlaofar orthu."

msgid ""
"Because these methods evaluate the QuerySet, they are blocking calls, and so "
"their main (synchronous) versions cannot be called from asynchronous code. "
"For this reason, each has a corresponding asynchronous version with an ``a`` "
"prefix - for example, rather than ``get(…)`` you can ``await aget(…)``."
msgstr ""
"Toisc go ndéanann na modhanna seo measúnú ar an QuerySet, tá siad ag blocáil "
"glaonna, agus mar sin ní féidir a bpríomhleaganacha (sioncronacha) a ghlaoch "
"ó chód asincrónach. Ar an gcúis seo, tá leagan asincrónach comhfhreagrach ag "
"gach ceann acu le réimír ``a`` - mar shampla, seachas ``get (...) ``is "
"féidir leat ``fanacht aget (...)``."

msgid ""
"There is usually no difference in behavior apart from their asynchronous "
"nature, but any differences are noted below next to each method."
msgstr ""
"De ghnáth ní bhíonn aon difríocht in iompar seachas a nádúr asincrónach, ach "
"tugtar faoi deara aon difríochtaí thíos in aice le gach modh."

