msgstr ""
"Má tá tú ag súil go bhfaighidh tacar ceisteanna sraith amháin ar ais cheana "
"féin, is féidir leat ``get () ``a úsáid gan aon argóintí chun an réad don "
"tsraith sin a thabhairt ar ais:"

msgid ""
"If ``get()`` doesn't find any object, it raises a :exc:`Model.DoesNotExist "
"<django.db.models.Model.DoesNotExist>` exception::"
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Model.DoesNotExist>Mura bhfaigheann ``get () ``aon rud, "
"ardaíonn sé: exc: `Model.doesNotExist `eisceacht::"

msgid ""
"If ``get()`` finds more than one object, it raises "
