msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leat glaoch ar ``update () ``ar a:class: `.QuerySet` a bhfuil "
"slisnas tógtha nó nach féidir é a scagadh a thuilleadh."

msgid "The ``update()`` method returns the number of affected rows:"
msgstr "Tugann an modh ``update () ``líon na sraitheanna atá buailte ar ais:"

msgid ""
"If you're just updating a record and don't need to do anything with the "
"model object, the most efficient approach is to call ``update()``, rather "
"than loading the model object into memory. For example, instead of doing "
"this::"
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil tú ach taifead a nuashonrú agus mura gá duit aon rud a dhéanamh "
