"() `, seachas an réad samhail a luchtú isteach i gcuimhne. Mar shampla, in "
"ionad seo a dhéanamh:"

msgid "...do this::"
msgstr "... déan seo:"

msgid ""
"Using ``update()`` also prevents a race condition wherein something might "
"change in your database in the short period of time between loading the "
"object and calling ``save()``."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann úsáid ``nuashonrú () ``cosc ar riocht rása ina bhféadfadh rud éigin "
