"in aghaidh an chineál réada."

msgid ""
"The ``delete()`` is applied instantly. You cannot call ``delete()`` on "
"a :class:`.QuerySet` that has had a slice taken or can otherwise no longer "
"be filtered."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an ``delete () ``i bhfeidhm láithreach. Ní féidir leat glaoch ar "
"``delete () ``ar a:class: `.QuerySet` a bhfuil slisnas tógtha air nó nach "
"féidir é a scagadh a thuilleadh."

msgid "For example, to delete all the entries in a particular blog:"
msgstr "Mar shampla, chun na hiontrálacha go léir i mblag áirithe a scriosadh:"

msgid ""
"By default, Django's :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` emulates the SQL "
"constraint ``ON DELETE CASCADE`` — in other words, any objects with foreign "
"keys pointing at the objects to be deleted will be deleted along with them. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, déanann django's:class: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignKey` aithris ar an srian SQL ``ON DELETE CASCADE`` "
"- i bhfocail eile, scriosfar aon rudaí le heochracha eachtracha atá ag díriú "
"ar na rudaí atá le scriosadh in éineacht leo. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"This cascade behavior is customizable via "
"the :attr:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey.on_delete` argument to "
"the :class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey`."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an t-iompar cascaire seo inoiriúnaithe tríd an argóint: attr: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignkey.on_delete` chuig an argóint: :class: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignKey`."

msgid ""
"The ``delete()`` method does a bulk delete and does not call any "
"``delete()`` methods on your models. It does, however, emit "
"the :data:`~django.db.models.signals.pre_delete` "
"and :data:`~django.db.models.signals.post_delete` signals for all deleted "
"objects (including cascaded deletions)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an modh ``delete () ``scriosadh mórchóir agus ní ghlaonn sé aon "
"mhodhanna ``delete ()`` ar do mhúnlaí. Astaíonn sé, áfach, na comharthaí: "
"data: `~django.db.models.signals.pre_delete` agus:data: "
"`~django.db.models.signals.post_delete` do gach rud scriosta (lena n-"
"áirítear scriosadh cascadaithe)."

msgid ""
"Django needs to fetch objects into memory to send signals and handle "
"cascades. However, if there are no cascades and no signals, then Django may "
"take a fast-path and delete objects without fetching into memory. For large "
"deletes this can result in significantly reduced memory usage. The amount of "
"executed queries can be reduced, too."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh Django rudaí a fháil isteach i gcuimhne chun comharthaí a sheoladh "
"agus cascades a láimhseáil. Mar sin féin, mura bhfuil aon cascades agus aon "
"chomharthaí ann, ansin féadfaidh Django cosán tapa a ghlacadh agus rudaí a "
"scriosadh gan a fháil isteach i gcuimhne. Maidir le scriosadh móra is féidir "
"úsáid cuimhne laghdaithe go suntasach mar thoradh air seo. Is féidir méid na "
"gceisteanna forghníomhaithe a laghdú freisin."

msgid ""
"ForeignKeys which are set to :attr:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey.on_delete` "
"``DO_NOTHING`` do not prevent taking the fast-path in deletion."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuireann ForeignKeys atá socraithe to:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.foreignkey.on_delete` `DO_NOTHING`` cosc ar an gcosán "
"tapa a ghlacadh le scriosadh."

msgid ""
"Note that the queries generated in object deletion is an implementation "
