"When using the SQLite backend and non-ASCII strings, bear in mind "
"the :ref:`database note <sqlite-string-matching>` about string comparisons."
msgstr ""
"<sqlite-string-matching>Agus na teaghráin cúltaca SQLite agus neamh-ASCII á "
