msgid "``force_escape``"
msgstr "``Force_escape``"

msgid ""
"Applies HTML escaping to a string (see the :tfilter:`escape` filter for "
"details). This filter is applied *immediately* and returns a new, escaped "
"string. This is useful in the rare cases where you need multiple escaping or "
"want to apply other filters to the escaped results. Normally, you want to "
"use the :tfilter:`escape` filter."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann éalú HTML i bhfeidhm chuig teaghrán (féach an scagair:tfilter: "
"`escape` le haghaidh sonraí). Cuirtear an scagaire seo i bhfeidhme* "
"láithreach* agus filleann sé sreang nua éalaithe ar ais. Tá sé seo úsáideach "
"sna cásanna annamh ina dteastaíonn éalú iolracha uait nó gur mhaith leat "
"scagairí eile a chur i bhfeidhm ar na torthaí éalaithe De ghnáth, ba mhaith "
"leat an scagaire: tfilter: `escape` a úsáid."

msgid ""
"For example, if you want to catch the ``<p>`` HTML elements created by "
"the :tfilter:`linebreaks` filter:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, más mian leat na heilimintí <p>HTML ```a chruthaigh an "
"scagair:tfilter: `linebreaks` a ghabháil:"

msgid "``get_digit``"
msgstr "``faigh_digit``"

msgid ""
"Given a whole number, returns the requested digit, where 1 is the right-most "
"digit, 2 is the second-right-most digit, etc. Returns the original value for "
"invalid input (if input or argument is not an integer, or if argument is "
"less than 1). Otherwise, output is always an integer."
msgstr ""
"Mar gheall ar uimhir iomlán, filleann sé an digit iarrtha, áit a bhfuil 1 an "
"dhigit is deise, 2 an dara digiteach is mó ar dheis, srl. Tugann sé an luach "
"bunaidh le haghaidh ionchur neamhbhailí (mura bhfuil ionchur nó argóint "
"sláimhir, nó má tá argóint níos lú ná 1). Seachas sin, is sláimhir é aschur "
"i gcónaí."

msgid "If ``value`` is ``123456789``, the output will be ``8``."
msgstr "Más é ```luach ``123456789``, is é ``8`` an t-aschur."

msgid "``iriencode``"
msgstr "``iriencode``"

msgid ""
"Converts an IRI (Internationalized Resource Identifier) to a string that is "
"suitable for including in a URL. This is necessary if you're trying to use "
"strings containing non-ASCII characters in a URL."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé IRI (Aitheantóir Acmhainní Idirnáisiúnta) go sreang atá "
"oiriúnach lena n-áireamh i URL. Tá sé seo riachtanach má tá tú ag iarraidh "
"teaghráin a úsáid ina bhfuil carachtair neamh-ASCII i URL."

msgid ""
"It's safe to use this filter on a string that has already gone through "
"the :tfilter:`urlencode` filter."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé sábháilte an scagaire seo a úsáid ar shreang atá imithe tríd an "
"scagaire: tfilter: `urlencode` cheana féin."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"?test=I ♥ Django\"``, the output will be ``\"?"
"test=I%20%E2%99%A5%20Django\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``? Test = I ♥ Django “``, beidh an t-aschur``”? Tástáil = "
"I% 20% E 2% 99% A 5% 20Django “``."

