"XSS attacks are mitigated by escaping the characters \"<\", \">\" and \"&\". "
"For example if ``value`` is ``{'hello': 'world</script>&amp;'}``, the output "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"Maolaítear ionsaithe XSS trí na carachtair “<”, “>” agus “&” a éalú. Mar "
"shampla má tá ``luach`` ``{'hello': 'domhan &'}``, is é an t-aschur:</script>"

msgid ""
"This is compatible with a strict Content Security Policy that prohibits in-"
"page script execution. It also maintains a clean separation between passive "
"data and executable code."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo comhoiriúnach le Polasaí Slándála Ábhar dian a chuireann cosc ar "
"fhorghníomhú script ar an Coinníonn sé scaradh glan freisin idir sonraí "
"éighníomhacha agus cód infheidhmithe."

msgid "``last``"
msgstr "``deireann``"

msgid "Returns the last item in a list."
msgstr "Tugann an mír deireanach ar liosta ar ais."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is the list ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']``, the output will be the "
"string ``\"d\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` an liosta ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']``, is é an t-aschur an "
"teaghrán ``\"d\"``."

msgid "``length``"
msgstr "``Fad ``"

msgid "Returns the length of the value. This works for both strings and lists."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais fad an luacha. Oibríonn sé seo le haghaidh teaghráin agus "
"liostaí araon."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']`` or ``\"abcd\"``, the output will be "
"``4``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']`` nó ``\"abcd\"``, is é ``4`` an "
"aschur."

msgid "The filter returns ``0`` for an undefined variable."
msgstr "Filleann an scagaire ``0`` le haghaidh athróg neamhshainithe."

msgid "``linebreaks``"
msgstr "``breiseanna líne``"

msgid ""
"Replaces line breaks in plain text with appropriate HTML; a single newline "
"becomes an HTML line break (``<br>``) and a new line followed by a blank "
"line becomes a paragraph break (``</p>``)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann HTML cuí in ionad sosanna líne i ngnáthtéacs; bíonn líne nua amháin "
"ina bhri</p> <br>seadh líne HTML (````) agus bíonn líne nua ina bhriseadh "
"mír ina líne bán ina dhiaidh sin (```)."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``Joel\\nis a slug``, the output will be ``<p>Joel<br>is a "
