"If ``value`` is ``Joel\\nis a slug``, the output will be ``Joel<br>is a "
"slug``."
msgstr ""
"<br>Más é ``luach`` ```Joel\\ n slug``, is é an t-aschur ```Joel is slug``."

msgid "``linenumbers``"
msgstr "``Uimhreacha líne``"

msgid "Displays text with line numbers."
msgstr "Taispeánann sé téacs le huimhreacha líne."

msgid "the output will be:"
msgstr "beidh an t-aschur:"

msgid "``ljust``"
msgstr "```fuaim``"

msgid "Left-aligns the value in a field of a given width."
msgstr "Ailíníonn clé an luach i réimse de leithead ar leith."

msgid "**Argument:** field size"
msgstr "**Argóint: ** méid réimse"

msgid "If ``value`` is ``Django``, the output will be ``\"Django    \"``."
msgstr "Más é ``luach`` ``Django``, is é ``\"Django “``an t-aschur."

msgid "``lower``"
msgstr "```níos ísle ``"

msgid "Converts a string into all lowercase."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé sreang go léir litreacha beaga."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``Totally LOVING this Album!``, the output will be ``totally "
"loving this album!``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``luach`` ```GRÁ go hiomlán ag an Albam seo! ``, beidh an t-aschur "
"``grámhar go hiomlán leis an albam seo! ``."

msgid "``make_list``"
msgstr "``liosta`` make_list``"

msgid ""
"Returns the value turned into a list. For a string, it's a list of "
"characters. For an integer, the argument is cast to a string before creating "
"a list."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé an luach a iompaigh ina liosta. Maidir le sreang, is liosta "
"carachtair é. Maidir le sláimhir, caitheann an argóint chuig teaghrán sula "
"gcruthaítear liosta."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is the string ``\"Joel\"``, the output would be the list "
"``['J', 'o', 'e', 'l']``. If ``value`` is ``123``, the output will be the "
