msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` an teaghrán ``\"Joel\"``, bheadh an t-aschur an liosta "
"``['J', 'o', 'e', 'l']``. Más é ```luach`` `123``, is é an t-aschur an "
"liosta ``['1', '2', '3']``."

msgid "``phone2numeric``"
msgstr "``fhóna2uimhriach``"

msgid ""
"Converts a phone number (possibly containing letters) to its numerical "
"equivalent."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé uimhir theileafóin (b'fhéidir ina bhfuil litreacha ann) go dtí "
"a choibhéis"

msgid ""
"The input doesn't have to be a valid phone number. This will happily convert "
"any string."
msgstr ""
"Ní gá go mbeadh an t-ionchur ina uimhir theileafóin bailí. Déanfaidh sé seo "
"aon sreang a thiontú go sona sásta."

msgid "If ``value`` is ``800-COLLECT``, the output will be ``800-2655328``."
msgstr "Más é ``luach ``800-COLLECT ``, is é `800-2655328`` an t-aschur."

msgid "``pluralize``"
msgstr "``iolraithe``"

msgid ""
"Returns a plural suffix if the value is not ``1``, ``'1'``, or an object of "
"length 1. By default, this suffix is ``'s'``."
msgstr ""
"Tugann iarmhír iolra ar ais mura bhfuil an luach ``1``, ``1'``, nó réad de "
"fhad 1. De réir réamhshocraithe, is é an iarmhír seo ``s'``."

msgid ""
"If ``num_messages`` is ``1``, the output will be ``You have 1 message.`` If "
"``num_messages`` is ``2``  the output will be ``You have 2 messages.``"
msgstr ""
"Más é ```num_messages`` ``1``, is é an aschur ``Tá 1 theachtaireacht agat. "
"``Má tá ``num_teachtaireachtaí ````2`` is é an aschur ``Tá 2 theachtaireacht "
"agat. ``"

msgid ""
"For words that require a suffix other than ``'s'``, you can provide an "
"alternate suffix as a parameter to the filter."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le focail a dteastaíonn iarmhír seachas ```s'``, is féidir leat "
"iarmhír malartach a sholáthar mar pharaiméadar don scagaire."

msgid ""
"For words that don't pluralize by simple suffix, you can specify both a "
"singular and plural suffix, separated by a comma."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le focail nach n-iolraíonn le iarmhír simplí, is féidir leat iarmhír "
"uaineach agus iolra a shonrú, scartha le camóg."

msgid "Use :ttag:`blocktranslate` to pluralize translated strings."
msgstr "Úsáid: ttag: `blocktranslate` chun teaghráin aistrithe a iolrú."

msgid "``pprint``"
msgstr "``pprint``"

msgid "A wrapper around :func:`pprint.pprint` -- for debugging, really."
msgstr ""
"Fillteán timpeall: func: `pprint.pprint` - le haghaidh dífhabhtú, i ndáiríre."

msgid "Returns a random item from the given list."
msgstr "Tugann mír randamach ar ais ón liosta a thugtar."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is the list ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']``, the output could be "
"``\"b\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` an liosta ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']``, d'fhéadfadh an t-aschur "
"a bheith ``\"b\"``."

msgid "``rjust``"
msgstr "``Rjust``"

msgid "Right-aligns the value in a field of a given width."
msgstr "Ailíníonn ar dheis an luach i réimse de leithead ar leith."

msgid "If ``value`` is ``Django``, the output will be ``\"    Django\"``."
msgstr "Más é ``luach`` ``Django``, is é ``Django\"` an t-aschur."

msgid "``safe``"
msgstr "``sábháilte``"

msgid ""
"Marks a string as not requiring further HTML escaping prior to output. When "
"autoescaping is off, this filter has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Marcálann sé teaghrán mar nach dteastaíonn tuilleadh HTML éalú roimh aschur. "
"Nuair a bhíonn autoescaping as, níl aon éifeacht ag an scagaire seo."

msgid ""
"If you are chaining filters, a filter applied after ``safe`` can make the "
"contents unsafe again. For example, the following code prints the variable "
"as is, unescaped:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá scagairí a shlánú agat, is féidir le scagaire a chuirtear i bhfeidhm "
"tar éis ``sábháilte`` an t-ábhar a dhéanamh neamhshábháilte Mar shampla, "
"priontáil an cód seo a leanas an t-athróg mar atá, gan éalú:"

msgid "``safeseq``"
msgstr "``sábháilteq``"

msgid ""
"Applies the :tfilter:`safe` filter to each element of a sequence. Useful in "
"conjunction with other filters that operate on sequences, such "
"as :tfilter:`join`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an scagaire: tfilter: `sábháil' i bhfeidhm ar gach eilimint de "
"seicheamh. Úsáideach i gcomhar le scagairí eile a oibríonn ar sheicheamh, "
"mar shampla:tfilter: `join`. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"You couldn't use the :tfilter:`safe` filter directly in this case, as it "
"would first convert the variable into a string, rather than working with the "
"individual elements of the sequence."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhéadfá an scagaire: tfilter: `safe` a úsáid go díreach sa chás seo, mar "
"thiontfadh sé an t-athróg i sreang ar dtús, seachas oibriú le heilimintí "
"aonair an seicheamh."

msgid "``slice``"
msgstr "``slise``"

msgid "Returns a slice of the list."
msgstr "Tugann sé slisnán den liosta ar ais."

msgid ""
"Uses the same syntax as Python's list slicing. See the `Python documentation "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#lists>`_ for an "
"introduction."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann sé an chomhréir céanna le slisnú liosta Python. < https://"
"docs.python.org/3/tutorial/introduction.html#lists>Féach an `doiciméadú "
"Python`_ le haghaidh réamhrá."

msgid ""
"If ``some_list`` is ``['a', 'b', 'c']``, the output will be ``['a', 'b']``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``some_list`` ``['a', 'b', 'c']``, is é ``['a', 'b']`` an aschur."

msgid "``slugify``"
msgstr "``slugify``"

msgid ""
"Converts to ASCII. Converts spaces to hyphens. Removes characters that "
"aren't alphanumerics, underscores, or hyphens. Converts to lowercase. Also "
"strips leading and trailing whitespace."
msgstr ""
"Tiontaíonn sé go ASCII. Athraíonn sé spásanna go hiphens. Baineann sé "
"carachtair nach alfaiméiricí, béim nó braithíní iad. Athraíonn sé go "
"litreacha beaga. Chomh maith leis sin stiallacha spás bán a threoraíonn agus "
"a leanann."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Joel is a slug\"``, the output will be ``\"joel-is-a-"
"slug\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ```\"Is slug é Joel\"``, is é an t-aschur ``\"joel-is-a-"
"slug\"``."

msgid "``stringformat``"
msgstr "``Formáid teaghrána``"

msgid ""
"Formats the variable according to the argument, a string formatting "
"specifier. This specifier uses the :ref:`old-string-formatting` syntax, with "
"the exception that the leading \"%\" is dropped."
msgstr ""
"Formálaíonn sé an t-athróg de réir an argóint, sonraitheoir formáidithe "
"sreangáin. Úsáideann an sonraitheoir seo an comhréire:ref: `old-string-"
"formatting`, ach amháin go dtioctar an “%” tosaigh."

msgid "If ``value`` is ``10``, the output will be ``1.000000E+01``."
msgstr "Más é ```luach`` ``10``, is é `1.000000E+01`` an t-aschur."

msgid "``striptags``"
msgstr "``striptags``"

msgid "Makes all possible efforts to strip all [X]HTML tags."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé gach iarracht is féidir chun gach clib HTML [X] a scriosadh."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"<b>Joel</b> <button>is</button> a <span>slug</span>\"``, "
"the output will be ``\"Joel is a slug\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``” Is slug é <b>Joel</b> “``, <button>is</button> é an t-"
"aschur ``<span>\"Is slug</span> é Joel\"``."

msgid "No safety guarantee"
msgstr "Gan aon ráthaíocht sábhá"

msgid ""
"Note that ``striptags`` doesn't give any guarantee about its output being "
"HTML safe, particularly with non valid HTML input. So **NEVER** apply the "
"``safe`` filter to a ``striptags`` output. If you are looking for something "
"more robust, consider using a third-party HTML sanitizing tool."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara nach dtugann `striptags` aon ráthaíocht faoi go bhfuil a "
"aschur sábháilte HTML, go háirithe le hionchur HTML neamhbhailí. Mar sin "
"**RIAM** cuir an scagaire ``sábháilte ``i bhfeidhm ar aschur ``striptags`. "
"Má tá tú ag lorg rud éigin níos láidre, smaoinigh ar uirlis sláintíochta "
"HTML tríú páirtí a úsáid."

msgid "Formats a time according to the given format."
msgstr "Formálaíonn sé am de réir an fhormáid a thugtar."

msgid ""
"Given format can be the predefined one :setting:`TIME_FORMAT`, or a custom "
"format, same as the :tfilter:`date` filter. Note that the predefined format "
"is locale-dependent."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le formáid thugtar a bheith mar an ceann réamhshainithe: setting: "
"`TIME_FORMAT`, nó formáid saincheaptha, mar an scagaire: tfilter: `dáta`. "
"Tabhair faoi deara go bhfuil an fhormáid réamhshainithe ag brath go háitiúil."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is equivalent to ``datetime.datetime.now()``, the output will "
"be the string ``\"01:23\"``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``lua`` comhionann le ``datetime.datetime.now () ``, is é an t-aschur "
"an teaghrán``” 01:23 “``."

msgid ""
"Note that you can backslash-escape a format string if you want to use the "
"\"raw\" value. In this example, both \"h\" and \"m\" are backslash-escaped, "
"because otherwise each is a format string that displays the hour and the "
"month, respectively:"
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara gur féidir leat teaghrán formáide a éalú ar ais más mian "
"leat an luach “amh” a úsáid. Sa sampla seo, tá “h” agus “m” araon éalaithe "
"le cúltaca, mar ar shlí eile is teaghrán formáide é gach ceann acu a "
"thaispeánann an uair agus an mhí, faoi seach:"

msgid "This would display as \"01h 23m\"."
msgstr "Taispeánfaí sé seo mar “01h 23m”."

msgid "Another example:"
msgstr "Sampla eile:"

msgid ""
"Assuming that :setting:`LANGUAGE_CODE` is, for example, ``\"de\"``, then for:"
msgstr ""
"Ag glacadh leis gur:setting: `LANGUAGE_CODE`, mar shampla, ``de\"``, ansin "
"le haghaidh:"

msgid ""
"the output will be the string ``\"01:23\"`` (The ``\"TIME_FORMAT\"`` format "
"specifier for the ``de`` locale as shipped with Django is ``\"H:i\"``)."
msgstr ""
"is é an t-aschur an teaghrán ``” 01:23 “`` (Is é an sonraitheoir formáide "
"``\"TIME_FORMAT” ``don áitiúil ``de`` mar a sheoltar le Django ná ``\"H: "
"i\"``)."

msgid ""
"The ``time`` filter will only accept parameters in the format string that "
"relate to the time of day, not the date. If you need to format a ``date`` "
"value, use the :tfilter:`date` filter instead (or along with :tfilter:`time` "
"if you need to render a full :py:class:`~datetime.datetime` value)."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlacfaidh an scagaire ``am ``ach le paraiméadair sa teaghrán formáide a "
"bhaineann leis an am den lá, ní leis an dáta. Más gá duit luach ``dáta ``a "
"fhormáidiú, bain úsáid as an scagair:tfilter: `dáta` ina ionad (nó in "
"éineacht le:tfilter: `time` más gá duit luach iomlán:py:class: "
"`~datetime.datetime` a rinneadh)."

msgid ""
"There is one exception the above rule: When passed a ``datetime`` value with "
"attached timezone information (a :ref:`time-zone-aware "
"<naive_vs_aware_datetimes>` ``datetime`` instance) the ``time`` filter will "
"accept the timezone-related :ref:`format specifiers <date-and-time-"
"formatting-specifiers>` ``'e'``, ``'O'`` , ``'T'`` and ``'Z'``."
msgstr ""
"<date-and-time-formatting-specifiers>Tá eisceacht amháin ann an riail thuas: "
"Nuair a rith luach ``datetime`` le faisnéis crios ama ceangailte (a:ref: "
"`time-chrione-aware ``datetime``<naive_vs_aware_datetimes>) glacfaidh an "
"scagaire ``time`` leis an scagaire ``time`` a bhaineann leis an crios "
"ama:ref: `sonraitheoirí formáid` ```````, ``````."

msgid ""
"When used without a format string, the ``TIME_FORMAT`` format specifier is "
"used:"
msgstr ""
"Nuair a úsáidtear é gan teaghrán formáide, úsáidtear an sonraitheoir "
"formáide ``TIME_FORMAT ``:"

msgid "is the same as:"
msgstr "tá sé mar an gcéanna le:"

msgid "``timesince``"
msgstr "```Time``"

msgid "Formats a date as the time since that date (e.g., \"4 days, 6 hours\")."
msgstr ""
"Déanann dáta a fhormáidiú mar an t-am ón dáta sin (m.sh., “4 lá, 6 uair an "
"chloig”)."

msgid ""
"Takes an optional argument that is a variable containing the date to use as "
"the comparison point (without the argument, the comparison point is *now*). "
"For example, if ``blog_date`` is a date instance representing midnight on 1 "
"June 2006, and ``comment_date`` is a date instance for 08:00 on 1 June 2006, "
"then the following would return \"8 hours\":"
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé argóint roghnach atá ina athróg ina bhfuil an dáta le húsáid mar "
"phointe comparáide (gan an argóint, is í*anois* an pointe comparáide). Mar "
"shampla, más cás dáta é ``blog_date`` a léiríonn meán oíche an 1 Meitheamh "
"2006, agus is sampla dáta é `comment_date`` le haghaidh 08:00 an 1 Meitheamh "
"2006, ansin fillfeadh an méid seo a leanas “8 n-uair an chloig” ar ais:"

msgid ""
"Comparing offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes will return an empty "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfear sreang folamh ar ais ar ais i gcomparáid idir amanna dáta nach n-"
"aithníonn agus na hamanna atá ar an eolas"

msgid ""
"Minutes is the smallest unit used, and \"0 minutes\" will be returned for "
"any date that is in the future relative to the comparison point."
msgstr ""
"Is é miontuairiscí an t-aonad is lú a úsáidtear, agus cuirfear “0 nóiméad” "
"ar ais d'aon dáta atá sa todhchaí i gcoibhneas leis an bpointe comparáide."

msgid "``timeuntil``"
msgstr "```timéireann``"

msgid ""
"Similar to ``timesince``, except that it measures the time from now until "
"the given date or datetime. For example, if today is 1 June 2006 and "
"``conference_date`` is a date instance holding 29 June 2006, then "
"``{{ conference_date|timeuntil }}`` will return \"4 weeks\"."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le ``timesince``, ach amháin go dtomhaiseann sé an t-am ó seo go dtí "
"an dáta nó an dáta-am ar leith. Mar shampla, más é an 1 Meitheamh 2006 inniu "
"agus má tá `conference_date`` ina scála dáta a bheidh ar siúl an 29 "
"Meitheamh 2006, ansin fillfidh ``{{conference_date|timetill}} `“4 "
"seachtaine”."

msgid ""
"Takes an optional argument that is a variable containing the date to use as "
"the comparison point (instead of *now*). If ``from_date`` contains 22 June "
"2006, then the following will return \"1 week\":"
msgstr ""
"Tógann sé argóint roghnach atá ina athróg ina bhfuil an dáta le húsáid mar "
"phointe comparáide (in ionad* anois*). Má tá 22 Meitheamh 2006 sa "
"``from_date``, ansin cuirfidh an méid seo a leanas ar ais “1 seachtain”:"

msgid ""
"Minutes is the smallest unit used, and \"0 minutes\" will be returned for "
"any date that is in the past relative to the comparison point."
msgstr ""
"Is é miontuairiscí an t-aonad is lú a úsáidtear, agus cuirfear “0 nóiméad” "
"ar ais d'aon dáta atá san am atá thart i gcoibhneas leis an bpointe "
"comparáide."

msgid ""
"Converts a string into titlecase by making words start with an uppercase "
"character and the remaining characters lowercase. This tag makes no effort "
"to keep \"trivial words\" in lowercase."
msgstr ""
"Déanann teaghrán a thiontú ina theitlicase trí fhocail a thosú le carachtar "
"uachtarchlóir agus na carachtair atá fágtha le litreacha beaga. Ní dhéanann "
"an chlib seo aon iarracht “focail thábhachtacha” a choinneáil i litreacha "
"beaga."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"my FIRST post\"``, the output will be ``\"My First "
"Post\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ```mo CHÉAD phost\"``, is é an t-aschur ``\"Mo Chéad Post” "
"``."

msgid "``truncatechars``"
msgstr "``truncatechars``"

msgid ""
"Truncates a string if it is longer than the specified number of characters. "
"Truncated strings will end with a translatable ellipsis character (\"…\")."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé teaghrán a ghearradh má tá sé níos faide ná an líon sonraithe "
"carachtair. Críochnóidh teaghráin ghearrtha le carachtar ellipsis "
"inaistrithe (“...”)."

msgid "**Argument:** Number of characters to truncate to"
msgstr "**Argóint: ** Líon na gcarachtar le gearradh"

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Joel is a slug\"``, the output will be ``\"Joel i…\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``\"Is slug é Joel\"``, is é an t-aschur ``\"Joel i... \"``."

msgid "``truncatechars_html``"
msgstr "``truncatechars_html``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :tfilter:`truncatechars`, except that it is aware of HTML tags. "
"Any tags that are opened in the string and not closed before the truncation "
"point are closed immediately after the truncation."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:tfilter: `truncatechars`, ach amháin go bhfuil sé ar an eolas faoi "
"chlibeanna HTML. Dúntar aon chlibeanna a osclaítear sa sreangán agus nach "
"bhfuil dúnta roimh an bpointe bearrtha díreach tar éis an chruinnithe."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"<p>Joel is a slug</p>\"``, the output will be "
"``\"<p>Joel i…</p>\"``."
msgstr ""
"<p>Más é ``luach`` ``” Is <p>slug é Joel “``, is é an</p> t-aschur ``” Joel "
"i... “``.</p>"

msgid "Newlines in the HTML content will be preserved."
msgstr "Caomhnófar línte nua san ábhar HTML."

msgid "Size of input string"
msgstr "Méid an teaghrán ionchuir"

msgid ""
"Processing large, potentially malformed HTML strings can be resource-"
"intensive and impact service performance. ``truncatechars_html`` limits "
"input to the first five million characters."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le teaghráin HTML móra a d'fhéadfadh a bheith mífhoirmithe a "
"phróiseáil a bheith dian ar acmhainní agus tionchar a imirt Teoraíonn "
"``truncatechars_html`` ionchur go dtí an chéad chúig mhilliún carachtar."

msgid "``truncatewords``"
msgstr "```truncatewords``"

msgid "Truncates a string after a certain number of words."
msgstr "Cuireann sé teaghrán tar éis líon áirithe focal."

msgid "**Argument:** Number of words to truncate after"
msgstr "**Argóint: ** Líon na bhfocal le gearradh ina dhiaidh sin"

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Joel is a slug\"``, the output will be ``\"Joel is …\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``\"Is slug é Joel\"``, is é an t-aschur ``\"Is é Joel... "
"\"``."

msgid "Newlines within the string will be removed."
msgstr "Bainfear línte nua laistigh den teaghrán."

msgid "``truncatewords_html``"
msgstr "``truncatewords_html``"

msgid ""
"Similar to :tfilter:`truncatewords`, except that it is aware of HTML tags. "
"Any tags that are opened in the string and not closed before the truncation "
"point, are closed immediately after the truncation."
msgstr ""
"Cosúil le:tfilter: `truncatewords`, ach amháin go bhfuil sé ar an eolas faoi "
"chlibeanna HTML. Dúntar aon chlibeanna a osclaítear sa sreangán agus nach "
"bhfuil dúnta roimh an bpointe bearrtha díreach tar éis an chruinnithe."

msgid ""
"This is less efficient than :tfilter:`truncatewords`, so should only be used "
"when it is being passed HTML text."
msgstr ""
"Níl sé seo chomh héifeachtach ná: tfilter: `truncatewords`, mar sin níor "
"cheart é a úsáid ach amháin nuair a bhíonn téacs HTML á rith."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"<p>Joel is a slug</p>\"``, the output will be "
"``\"<p>Joel is …</p>\"``."
msgstr ""
"<p>Más é ``luach`` ``” Is <p>slug é Joel “``, is é an</p> t-aschur ``” Is é "
"Joel... “``.</p>"

msgid ""
"Processing large, potentially malformed HTML strings can be resource-"
"intensive and impact service performance. ``truncatewords_html`` limits "
"input to the first five million characters."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le teaghráin HTML móra a d'fhéadfadh a bheith mífhoirmithe a "
"phróiseáil a bheith dian ar acmhainní agus tionchar a imirt Teoraíonn "
"``truncatewords_html`` ionchur go dtí an chéad chúig mhilliún carachtar."

msgid "``unordered_list``"
msgstr "``liosta_neamh-ordúnaí``"

msgid ""
"Recursively takes a self-nested list and returns an HTML unordered list -- "
"WITHOUT opening and closing ``<ul>`` tags."
msgstr ""
"<ul>Tógann sé liosta féin-neadaithe go réasúnta agus filleann sé liosta "
"neamh-ordaithe HTML ar ais - GAN clibeanna ``a oscailt agus a dhúnadh."

msgid ""
"The list is assumed to be in the proper format. For example, if ``var`` "
"contains ``['States', ['Kansas', ['Lawrence', 'Topeka'], 'Illinois']]``, "
"then ``{{ var|unordered_list }}`` would return:"
msgstr ""
"Glactar leis go bhfuil an liosta san fhormáid cheart. Mar shampla, má tá "
"``var`` `` ['Stáit', ['Kansas', ['Lawrence', 'Topeka'], 'Illinois']] `, "
"ansin ``{{var|unordered_list}}`` ar ais:"

msgid "``upper``"
msgstr "``uachtar``"

msgid "Converts a string into all uppercase."
msgstr "Athraíonn sé teaghrán i ngach uachchlár."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Joel is a slug\"``, the output will be ``\"JOEL IS A "
"SLUG\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``\"Is slóg é Joel\"``, is é an t-aschur ``\"JOEL IS A "
"SLUG\"``."

msgid "``urlencode``"
msgstr "``Urlencode ``"

msgid "Escapes a value for use in a URL."
msgstr "Éalaíonn sé luach le húsáid i URL."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"https://www.example.org/foo?a=b&c=d\"``, the output will "
"be ``\"https%3A//www.example.org/foo%3Fa%3Db%26c%3Dd\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``” https://www.example.org/foo?a=b&c=d “``, is é an aschur "
"``\"https%3A//www.example.org/foo%3FA%3DB%26C%3DD\"``."

msgid ""
"An optional argument containing the characters which should not be escaped "
"can be provided."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir argóint roghnach ina bhfuil na carachtair nár chóir iad a éalú a "
"sholáthar."

msgid ""
"If not provided, the '/' character is assumed safe. An empty string can be "
"provided when *all* characters should be escaped. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear ar fáil, glactar leis an carachtar '/' sábháilte. Is féidir "
"teaghrán folamh a sholáthar nuair ba chóir carachtair uach* a éalú. Mar "
"shampla:"

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"https://www.example.org/\"``, the output will be "
"``\"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.example.org%2F\"``."
msgstr ""
"Más é ``luach`` ``” https://www.example.org/ “``, is é an t-aschur ná "
"``\"https%3A%2F%2Fwww.example.org%2F\"``."

msgid "``urlize``"
msgstr "``Urlize``"

msgid "Converts URLs and email addresses in text into clickable links."
msgstr ""
"Tiontaíonn URLanna agus seoltaí ríomhphoist sa téacs ina naisc inchliceáilte."

msgid ""
"This template tag works on links prefixed with ``http://``, ``https://``, or "
"``www.``. For example, ``https://djangocon.eu`` will get converted but "
"``djangocon.eu`` won't."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn an chlib teimpléad seo ar naisc réamhshocraithe le ``http: //``, "
"`https: //``, nó ``www.``. Mar shampla, tiontófar ``https://djangocon.eu`` "
"ach ní dhéanfaidh ``djangocon.eu``."

msgid ""
"It also supports domain-only links ending in one of the original top level "
"domains (``.com``, ``.edu``, ``.gov``, ``.int``, ``.mil``, ``.net``, and "
"``.org``). For example, ``djangoproject.com`` gets converted."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn sé freisin le naisc fearainn amháin a chríochnaíonn i gceann de na "
"fearainn barrleibhéil bunaidh (`.com``, `.edu``, `.gov``, `.int ``, `.mil``, "
"`.net``, agus ``.org``). Mar shampla, déantar ``djangoproject.com`` a "
"thiontú."

msgid ""
"Links can have trailing punctuation (periods, commas, close-parens) and "
"leading punctuation (opening parens), and ``urlize`` will still do the right "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le poncóireacht (tréimhsí, camóga, dlúththuismitheoirí) agus "
"poncaíocht tosaigh (tuismitheoirí oscailte) a bheith ag naisc, agus "
"déanfaidh `urlize` an rud ceart fós."

msgid ""
"Links generated by ``urlize`` have a ``rel=\"nofollow\"`` attribute added to "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Tá tréith ``rel=\"nofollow\"`` curtha leis na naisc a ghineann ``urlize``."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Check out www.djangoproject.com\"``, the output will be "
"``\"Check out <a href=\"http://www.djangoproject.com\" "
"rel=\"nofollow\">www.djangoproject.com</a>\"``."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"http://www.djangoproject.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Más é ``luach`` "
"``\"Amharc ar www.djangoproject.com\"``, beidh an t-aschur ``\"Amharc ar "
"www.djangoproject.com “``.</a>"

msgid ""
"In addition to web links, ``urlize`` also converts email addresses into "
"``mailto:`` links. If ``value`` is ``\"Send questions to "
"foo@example.com\"``, the output will be ``\"Send questions to <a "
"href=\"mailto:foo@example.com\">foo@example.com</a>\"``."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith le naisc gréasáin, athraíonn ``urlize`` seoltaí ríomhphoist ina "
"naisc ``mailto: ``. <a href=\"mailto:foo@example.com\">Más é ``luach`` "
"``\"Seol ceisteanna chuig foo@example.com “``, is é an aschur ``\"Seol "
"ceisteanna chuig foo@example.com “``.</a>"

msgid ""
"The ``urlize`` filter also takes an optional parameter ``autoescape``. If "
"``autoescape`` is ``True``, the link text and URLs will be escaped using "
"Django's built-in :tfilter:`escape` filter. The default value for "
"``autoescape`` is ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Glacann an scagaire ``urlize`` paraiméadar roghnach ``autoescape`` freisin. "
"Má tá ``autoescape`` `True``, éalófar an téacs nasc agus URLanna ag baint "
"úsáide as scagaire ionsuite Django: tfilter: `escape`. Is é an luach "
"réamhshocraithe do ``autoescape`` ``True``."

msgid ""
"If ``urlize`` is applied to text that already contains HTML markup, or to "
"email addresses that contain single quotes (``'``), things won't work as "
"expected. Apply this filter only to plain text."
msgstr ""
"Má chuirtear `urlize`` i bhfeidhm ar théacs ina bhfuil marcáil HTML cheana "
"féin, nó ar sheoltaí ríomhphoist ina bhfuil luachana aonair (````), ní "
"oibreoidh rudaí mar a bhíothas ag súil leis. Cuir an scagaire seo i bhfeidhm "
"ach ar théacs simplí."

msgid "``urlizetrunc``"
msgstr "``urlizetrunc``"

msgid ""
"Converts URLs and email addresses into clickable links just like urlize_, "
"but truncates URLs longer than the given character limit."
msgstr ""
"Tiontaíonn sé URLanna agus seoltaí ríomhphoist ina naisc inchliceáilte "
"díreach cosúil le urlize_, ach cuireann sé URLanna níos faide ná an teorainn "
"charachtair ar leith."

msgid ""
"**Argument:** Number of characters that link text should be truncated to, "
"including the ellipsis that's added if truncation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"**Argóint: ** Ba chóir líon na gcarachtair a nascann téacs a ghearradh leo, "
"lena n-áirítear an ellipsis a chuirtear leis má tá gá le gearradh."

msgid ""
"If ``value`` is ``\"Check out www.djangoproject.com\"``, the output would be "
"``'Check out <a href=\"http://www.djangoproject.com\" "
"rel=\"nofollow\">www.djangoproj…</a>'``."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"http://www.djangoproject.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Más é ``luach`` "
"```\"Seiceáil ar www.djangoproject.com\"``, bheadh an t-aschur ná ``'Amharc "
"ar www.djangoproj... '``.</a>"

msgid "As with urlize_, this filter should only be applied to plain text."
msgstr ""
"Mar is amhlaidh le urlize_, níor cheart an scagaire seo a chur i bhfeidhm "
"ach ar théacs simplí."

msgid "``wordcount``"
msgstr "``comhaireamh focal ``"

msgid "Returns the number of words."
msgstr "Tugann sé líon na bhfocal ar ais."

msgid "If ``value`` is ``\"Joel is a slug\"``, the output will be ``4``."
msgstr "Más é ``luach`` ```\"Is slug é Joel\"``, is é ``4`` an t-aschur."

msgid "``wordwrap``"
msgstr "``wordwrap ``"

msgid "Wraps words at specified line length."
msgstr "Fillteann sé focail ag fad líne sonraithe."

msgid "**Argument:** number of characters at which to wrap the text"
msgstr "**Argóint: ** líon na gcarachtar chun an téacs a fhilleadh"

msgid "If ``value`` is ``Joel is a slug``, the output would be:"
msgstr "Más é ``luach`` ````Sluig é Joel ``, bheadh an t-aschur:"

