msgstr ""
"Mura gcuirtear ``luach`` ar fáil nó mura bhfuil sé folamh, taispeánfaidh an "
"méid thuas “``aon rud ``”."

msgid ":tfilter:`length`"
msgstr ":tfilter: `fad`"

msgid ""
"Returns the length of the value. This works for both strings and lists. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé ar ais fad an luacha. Oibríonn sé seo le haghaidh teaghráin agus "
