msgstr "Más é ``luach`` ``['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']``, is é ``4`` an t-aschur."

msgid ":tfilter:`filesizeformat`"
msgstr ":tfilter: `formáid comhaid"

msgid ""
"Formats the value like a \"human-readable\" file size (i.e. ``'13 KB'``, "
"``'4.1 MB'``, ``'102 bytes'``, etc.). For example:"
msgstr ""
"Formáidigh an luach cosúil le méid comhaid “inléite don duine” (ie ``'13 "
"KB'``, ``4.1 MB'``, ```102 bytes'``, srl.). Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Again, these are just a few examples; see the :ref:`built-in filter "
