msgid "Form submission"
msgstr "Foirm aighneacht"

msgid ""
"HTML form submission is a tricky area. There's no guarantee that the "
"submission will include encoding information, which means the framework "
"might have to guess at the encoding of submitted data."
msgstr ""
"Is réimse deacair é aighneacht foirme HTML. Níl aon ráthaíocht ann go mbeidh "
"faisnéis ionchódú san aighneacht, rud a chiallaíonn go bhféadfadh go mbeadh "
"ar an gcreat tuairim a dhéanamh ar ionchódú sonraí curtha isteach."

msgid ""
"Django adopts a \"lazy\" approach to decoding form data. The data in an "
"``HttpRequest`` object is only decoded when you access it. In fact, most of "
"the data is not decoded at all. Only the ``HttpRequest.GET`` and "
"``HttpRequest.POST`` data structures have any decoding applied to them. "
"Those two fields will return their members as Unicode data. All other "
"attributes and methods of ``HttpRequest`` return data exactly as it was "
"submitted by the client."
msgstr ""
"Glacann Django cur chuige “leisciúil” maidir le sonraí foirme a dhíchódú. Ní "
"dhíchódaítear na sonraí i réad `HttpRequest`` ach nuair a rochtaíonn tú air. "
"Déanta na fírinne, ní dhíchódaítear an chuid is mó de na sonraí ar chor ar "
"bith. Níl aon díchódú i bhfeidhm orthu ach na struchtúir sonraí "
"`HttpRequest.get`` agus ``HttpRequest.post ``. Tabharfaidh an dá réimse sin "
"a gcuid baill ar ais mar shonraí Unicode. Tugann gach tréithe agus modh eile "
"``HttpRequest`` sonraí ar ais go díreach mar a chuir an cliant isteach iad."

msgid ""
"By default, the :setting:`DEFAULT_CHARSET` setting is used as the assumed "
"encoding for form data. If you need to change this for a particular form, "
"you can set the ``encoding`` attribute on an ``HttpRequest`` instance. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, úsáidtear an socrú: setting: `DEFAULT_CHARSET` mar "
"an ionchódú glactha le haghaidh sonraí foirme. Más gá duit é seo a athrú le "
"haghaidh foirm áirithe, is féidir leat an tréith ``encoding`` a shocrú ar "
"shampla `HttpRequest``. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"You can even change the encoding after having accessed ``request.GET`` or "
"``request.POST``, and all subsequent accesses will use the new encoding."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an t-ionchódú a athrú fiú tar éis duit rochtain a fháil ar "
"``Request.get`` nó ``request.post``, agus úsáidfidh gach rochtain ina "
"dhiaidh sin an t-ionchódú nua."

msgid ""
"Most developers won't need to worry about changing form encoding, but this "
"is a useful feature for applications that talk to legacy systems whose "
"encoding you cannot control."
msgstr ""
"Ní chaithfidh mórchuid na bhforbróirí a bheith buartha faoi ionchódú foirme "
"a athrú, ach is gné úsáideach é seo d'iarratais a labhraíonn le córais "
"oidhreachta nach féidir leat a n-ionchódú a rialú."

msgid ""
"Django does not decode the data of file uploads, because that data is "
"normally treated as collections of bytes, rather than strings. Any automatic "
"decoding there would alter the meaning of the stream of bytes."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhíchódálann Django sonraí uaslódála comhad, toisc go ndéileálfar leis na "
"sonraí sin de ghnáth mar bhailiúcháin béite, seachas teaghráin. Athródh aon "
"díchódú uathoibríoch ann brí sruth na mbetaí."

